            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-romance-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Romance · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == romance}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Romance. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-romance; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPamalav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀with⠀inward⠀focal⠀narration:⠀a⠀particular⠀community⠀—⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀parish,⠀a⠀village⠀—⠀notices,⠀interprets,⠀and⠀sometimes⠀constrains⠀the⠀relationship⠀while⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀build⠀it⠀through⠀ordinary⠀proximity⠀and⠀practical⠀care.⠀Where⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀specifically⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀keep⠀that⠀context⠀distinct⠀instead⠀of⠀blending⠀a⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀background,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀scenery⠀or⠀temperament.\n\nGive⠀obligation⠀the⠀structural⠀weight⠀a⠀contest⠀of⠀arms⠀carries⠀in⠀another⠀telling.⠀A⠀favor⠀done⠀quietly,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀reputation⠀risked⠀in⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀promise⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀third⠀party⠀—⠀these⠀test⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀duty,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀renders⠀the⠀particular⠀cost⠀of⠀each⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis.⠀Let⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀decisions:⠀who⠀speaks⠀on⠀whose⠀behalf,⠀who⠀is⠀believed,⠀who⠀stays⠀when⠀leaving⠀would⠀be⠀excused.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀composed,⠀following⠀one⠀focal⠀mind⠀at⠀a⠀time⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀person.⠀That⠀access⠀shows⠀the⠀character⠀noticing⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀say,⠀weighing⠀what⠀loyalty⠀requires,⠀and⠀revising⠀an⠀earlier⠀judgment⠀about⠀someone's⠀motive.⠀The⠀community⠀does⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀knowledge:⠀a⠀neighbor⠀may⠀observe⠀an⠀action⠀and⠀draw⠀a⠀wrong⠀or⠀partly⠀right⠀conclusion,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀let⠀that⠀gap⠀stand,⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀interpretation⠀does⠀its⠀own⠀social⠀work.\n\nRun⠀scenes⠀through⠀meals,⠀work,⠀errands,⠀meetings,⠀and⠀seasonal⠀routines,⠀where⠀small⠀decisions⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀—⠀who⠀sits⠀where,⠀who⠀arrives⠀early,⠀who⠀leaves⠀with⠀whom⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀explanations⠀happen⠀inside⠀scenes⠀with⠀room⠀to⠀breathe⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀summary.⠀Inwardness⠀works⠀as⠀memory⠀and⠀attention⠀within⠀these⠀scenes:⠀a⠀recalled⠀promise,⠀a⠀noticed⠀change⠀in⠀someone's⠀manner,⠀a⠀feeling⠀recognized⠀only⠀after⠀acting⠀on⠀it.⠀Different⠀people⠀read⠀the⠀same⠀relationship⠀differently,⠀and⠀some⠀help⠀without⠀approving;⠀the⠀community⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀single⠀judgmental⠀chorus.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamalaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes:⠀concise⠀readable⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀dialogue⠀blocks,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀The⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀—⠀an⠀errand⠀quietly⠀completed⠀for⠀someone,⠀a⠀defense⠀mounted⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀of⠀colleagues,⠀silence⠀where⠀speech⠀was⠀expected⠀—⠀and⠀through⠀how⠀the⠀visible⠀exchange⠀changes⠀from⠀scene⠀to⠀scene.⠀Chemistry⠀comes⠀from⠀their⠀habits⠀of⠀attention,⠀not⠀from⠀generic⠀flirting⠀beats.\n\nLet⠀public⠀obligation⠀and⠀private⠀attachment⠀pull⠀against⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀concrete⠀on-screen⠀decisions.⠀A⠀character⠀accepts⠀an⠀assignment⠀that⠀separates⠀them⠀from⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀want,⠀defends⠀someone⠀at⠀a⠀visible⠀cost,⠀or⠀withholds⠀a⠀disclosure⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀speaking⠀would⠀help.⠀Show⠀the⠀decision⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀aftermath⠀in⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue;⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀that⠀loyalty⠀is⠀being⠀tested.⠀A⠀disagreement⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀exchange⠀neither⠀party⠀finishes,⠀and⠀repair⠀can⠀begin⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀act⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀speech.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀focal⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀voice-over,⠀not⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters,⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀actual⠀private⠀experience:⠀it⠀renders⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀withholds⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continues,⠀and⠀no⠀character⠀responds⠀to⠀it⠀or⠀gains⠀knowledge⠀from⠀it.\n\nGive⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀changing⠀relationships.⠀A⠀journey⠀is⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀short⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀montage⠀command;⠀an⠀explanation⠀emerges⠀through⠀an⠀exchange⠀in⠀which⠀one⠀person⠀revises⠀what⠀they⠀thought⠀they⠀knew.⠀Describe⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible,⠀not⠀what⠀a⠀lens⠀does.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them⠀—⠀a⠀cut⠀to⠀mark⠀elapsed⠀time,⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀to⠀introduce⠀a⠀person⠀before⠀they⠀enter⠀—⠀and⠀never⠀to⠀smuggle⠀in⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀alone⠀with⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀still⠀running.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamalax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀business⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀—⠀who⠀enters⠀when,⠀who⠀hands⠀over⠀an⠀object⠀and⠀how,⠀who⠀moves⠀to⠀leave⠀and⠀does⠀not,⠀who⠀remains⠀after⠀the⠀others⠀have⠀gone.⠀These⠀staged⠀choices⠀express⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀without⠀explanatory⠀speeches:⠀accepting⠀a⠀task⠀on⠀another's⠀behalf,⠀standing⠀when⠀sitting⠀would⠀pass⠀unnoticed,⠀surrendering⠀a⠀token⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀witnesses.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romance⠀develop⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀proximity⠀the⠀stage⠀can⠀show.⠀Two⠀people⠀who⠀keep⠀finding⠀reasons⠀to⠀share⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀disagreement⠀worked⠀out⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀care⠀delivered⠀as⠀practical⠀help⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration⠀—⠀each⠀beat⠀lands⠀because⠀the⠀blocking⠀and⠀the⠀objects⠀make⠀it⠀visible.⠀Entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀handle⠀travel⠀and⠀separation;⠀a⠀messenger,⠀a⠀summons,⠀or⠀a⠀marked⠀change⠀of⠀location⠀moves⠀the⠀story⠀without⠀a⠀narrated⠀journey.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀and⠀never⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀It⠀can⠀run⠀beside⠀the⠀script⠀while⠀the⠀staged⠀action⠀continues,⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀feels,⠀notices,⠀or⠀withholds;⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀responds⠀to⠀it.⠀Monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀remain⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀an⠀actual⠀audience⠀—⠀a⠀public⠀statement,⠀a⠀reflection⠀spoken⠀alone,⠀an⠀address⠀to⠀the⠀house⠀—⠀used⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀them,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.\n\nKeep⠀stage⠀directions⠀economical⠀and⠀free⠀of⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀An⠀explanation⠀can⠀emerge⠀through⠀dialogue⠀in⠀which⠀one⠀character⠀revises⠀what⠀they⠀thought⠀they⠀knew,⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carrying⠀what⠀the⠀words⠀avoid.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀alone⠀after⠀the⠀others⠀have⠀gone,⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀still⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamalay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind's⠀associative⠀movement.⠀Perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀together⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀emerges⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀recalls,⠀and⠀cannot⠀stop⠀returning⠀to.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀arrives⠀in⠀the⠀mind⠀as⠀accumulated⠀particulars⠀—⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀holding⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀passing,⠀the⠀exact⠀tone⠀of⠀a⠀refusal⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀described⠀object⠀of⠀affection.⠀A⠀sound,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀summons⠀can⠀pull⠀the⠀mind⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀into⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment⠀and⠀back.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀claims⠀on⠀this⠀character⠀alive⠀as⠀recurring⠀concerns⠀rather⠀than⠀one⠀announced⠀conflict.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀conversation⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀obligation,⠀from⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀to⠀a⠀decision⠀not⠀yet⠀made,⠀from⠀a⠀spoken⠀word⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀said⠀aloud.⠀Duty⠀and⠀attachment⠀surface⠀as⠀particular⠀decisions⠀remembered,⠀anticipated,⠀or⠀interrupted:⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀choosing⠀the⠀assignment⠀over⠀the⠀meeting,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀choice⠀felt⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀a⠀thought⠀broken⠀off⠀because⠀someone⠀enters.⠀Trust⠀and⠀vulnerability⠀grow⠀or⠀erode⠀through⠀these⠀returns,⠀not⠀through⠀reported⠀milestones.\n\nMaintain⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀Mark⠀a⠀move⠀into⠀memory⠀through⠀tense,⠀detail,⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene;⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀imagines⠀a⠀possible⠀future,⠀keep⠀it⠀recognizable⠀as⠀imagined.⠀The⠀technique⠀grants⠀no⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀excludes⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate;⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀world⠀remains⠀what⠀happened.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tension⠀to⠀resolve⠀or⠀the⠀feeling⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀named⠀state.⠀The⠀passage⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀mind⠀still⠀moving,⠀a⠀perception⠀interrupted⠀mid-association,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀word⠀that⠀remains⠀unspoken⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continues⠀without⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamalaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀matter.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀writes⠀long,⠀careful⠀messages⠀and⠀revises⠀before⠀sending;⠀another⠀answers⠀in⠀short⠀immediate⠀bursts;⠀a⠀third⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unread⠀through⠀a⠀working⠀day.⠀These⠀habits⠀carry⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀obligation,⠀and⠀care⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀them,⠀and⠀they⠀can⠀shift⠀between⠀channels⠀if⠀the⠀exchange⠀moves.\n\nUse⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀carry⠀meaning,⠀and⠀never⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀for⠀subtext.⠀A⠀delay⠀can⠀mean⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀rather⠀than⠀avoidance;⠀an⠀edit⠀can⠀soften⠀a⠀message⠀before⠀it⠀arrives;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀someone⠀saw⠀the⠀words⠀and⠀could⠀not⠀yet⠀answer.⠀Let⠀timing,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀competing⠀wants⠀do⠀their⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀both⠀from⠀private⠀thought.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀chose⠀to⠀type⠀and⠀not⠀transmit⠀—⠀not⠀automatically⠀their⠀live⠀mind.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀requires⠀private⠀experience,⠀set⠀it⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character;⠀another⠀character⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀them⠀receiving.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀messages.\n\nLet⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀surface⠀in⠀decisions⠀made⠀in⠀and⠀around⠀the⠀messages:⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀fulfills⠀a⠀duty⠀while⠀leaving⠀a⠀feeling⠀unexpressed,⠀a⠀channel⠀chosen⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀it,⠀a⠀name⠀typed⠀and⠀deleted.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀delay⠀with⠀no⠀reply⠀yet,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀private⠀material⠀that⠀never⠀reaches⠀the⠀other⠀person.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamalba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀concise,⠀legible⠀scenes:⠀brief⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀moment.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀private⠀reaction⠀sit⠀alongside⠀the⠀visible⠀exchange,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀is⠀noticed,⠀enjoyed,⠀misread,⠀or⠀withheld.⠀Another⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀private⠀content⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀it.\n\nUse⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀rather⠀than⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀can⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀—⠀the⠀flicker⠀before⠀a⠀careful⠀answer⠀—⠀but⠀feeling⠀and⠀hesitation⠀are⠀carried⠀by⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀says⠀and⠀does⠀across⠀scenes:⠀a⠀contradiction⠀between⠀an⠀earlier⠀claim⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀action,⠀a⠀favor⠀repeated⠀until⠀it⠀means⠀something.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance-route⠀mechanics,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀surface⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀accepts⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀separates⠀them⠀from⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀want,⠀speaks⠀carefully⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀others,⠀or⠀chooses⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀private⠀honesty⠀and⠀immediately⠀reads⠀its⠀effect.⠀Show⠀the⠀decision⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀narration,⠀and⠀give⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀changing⠀relationships⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀them⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀quick⠀exchanges.\n\nKeep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible:⠀a⠀new⠀location⠀or⠀a⠀passage⠀of⠀time⠀marked⠀by⠀a⠀brief⠀scene-setting⠀line.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀alone⠀with⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀still⠀running;⠀the⠀style⠀requires⠀no⠀confession,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀settled⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamalbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀between⠀the⠀characters,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally⠀in⠀this⠀installment,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀—⠀a⠀particular⠀promise,⠀an⠀earlier⠀disagreement,⠀a⠀duty⠀still⠀pressing⠀on⠀the⠀relationship⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀restating⠀the⠀whole⠀history.\n\nLet⠀the⠀pull⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀develop⠀cumulatively.⠀A⠀decision⠀in⠀one⠀installment⠀acquires⠀new⠀meaning⠀later⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀recalls⠀it,⠀acts⠀on⠀it,⠀or⠀sees⠀its⠀cost⠀play⠀out⠀in⠀someone⠀else's⠀changed⠀manner.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀changing⠀relationships⠀instead⠀of⠀quick⠀turns;⠀use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀forcing⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀knowledge,⠀standing,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀care,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀one⠀person⠀treats⠀another,⠀a⠀private⠀realization⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀become⠀speech,⠀or⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀interrupts⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀with⠀consequences⠀that⠀carry⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀reply.⠀The⠀style⠀creates⠀no⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation:⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀sits⠀alongside⠀the⠀installment's⠀visible⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀later⠀installments⠀can⠀remember⠀it⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀never⠀became⠀speech.⠀Close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀delayed⠀reply,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀between⠀the⠀characters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀charged⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase.⠀Choose⠀one⠀return⠀per⠀scene⠀that⠀once⠀carried⠀a⠀specific⠀feeling—relief,⠀teasing,⠀a⠀private⠀joke,⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀said⠀goodnight—and⠀let⠀it⠀now⠀arrive⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀charge.⠀Do⠀not⠀merely⠀label⠀the⠀change;⠀stage⠀the⠀moment⠀so⠀the⠀return⠀costs⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀something⠀visible⠀in⠀their⠀behavior.⠀They⠀may⠀reach⠀for⠀the⠀phrase⠀and⠀stop,⠀perform⠀the⠀routine⠀with⠀a⠀split-second⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀object⠀and⠀set⠀it⠀down⠀again⠀because⠀its⠀weight⠀has⠀altered.⠀Let⠀that⠀hesitation⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀not⠀to⠀feel.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀speech,⠀not⠀hover⠀above⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀need,⠀withholds⠀a⠀feeling,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀after⠀absence,⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀words⠀they⠀manage⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀next.⠀They⠀can⠀say⠀the⠀right⠀thing⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀tense,⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀come⠀out⠀sounding⠀like⠀an⠀accusation⠀when⠀they⠀meant⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀apology.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀exchange:⠀a⠀kind⠀action⠀can⠀be⠀performed⠀with⠀visible⠀resentment,⠀or⠀a⠀sincere⠀apology⠀can⠀hurt⠀more⠀because⠀it⠀arrives⠀too⠀late.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀painful⠀beat⠀into⠀reconciliation;⠀allow⠀partial⠀comfort,⠀awkward⠀silence,⠀and⠀the⠀knowledge⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀been⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀was⠀just⠀said.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀turbulence⠀inside⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀actual⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀outside⠀description⠀of⠀suffering.⠀Use⠀their⠀diction⠀and⠀attention⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀emotional⠀register:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀notices⠀practical⠀details⠀may⠀register⠀hurt⠀through⠀a⠀chipped⠀cup⠀or⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀while⠀a⠀more⠀self-conscious⠀character⠀may⠀narrate⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀wanted⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀managed.⠀Private⠀thought⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀pause⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀every⠀quiet⠀beat⠀into⠀a⠀metaphor.⠀The⠀relationship⠀remains⠀the⠀organizing⠀center:⠀each⠀turbulent⠀beat⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀why⠀continuing⠀together⠀is⠀difficult,⠀not⠀merely⠀supply⠀suffering⠀as⠀atmosphere.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀response⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀present-tense⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀couple's⠀ongoing⠀life.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀passage⠀in⠀one⠀concrete⠀action,⠀object,⠀or⠀exchange⠀that⠀advances⠀the⠀relationship:⠀making⠀room⠀on⠀a⠀bench,⠀remembering⠀which⠀tea⠀they⠀take,⠀hesitating⠀before⠀the⠀door,⠀answering⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀look.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution—tags,⠀action⠀beats,⠀or⠀paragraph⠀breaks—so⠀the⠀co-writer⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀speaking.⠀Keep⠀sentences⠀tight⠀enough⠀for⠀scannable⠀reading,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀strip⠀out⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀moment⠀particular.\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀shared⠀history⠀as⠀an⠀unannotated⠀callback.⠀When⠀the⠀relationship⠀already⠀has⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀place,⠀bring⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀current⠀response⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀characters⠀react⠀to⠀it⠀without⠀explaining⠀its⠀history.⠀If⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀repeats⠀an⠀old⠀phrase,⠀show⠀the⠀other's⠀immediate⠀physical⠀or⠀verbal⠀response—a⠀pause,⠀a⠀half-smile,⠀a⠀sudden⠀stillness—so⠀the⠀accumulated⠀meaning⠀is⠀felt,⠀not⠀summarized.⠀The⠀callback⠀may⠀land⠀as⠀comfort⠀or⠀as⠀friction,⠀depending⠀on⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀is.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀callback⠀into⠀every⠀response;⠀when⠀none⠀fits,⠀build⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀fresh,⠀specific⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀interval⠀active⠀up⠀to⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀Stop⠀during⠀speech,⠀motion,⠀thought,⠀composition,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup;⠀the⠀next⠀writer⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀that⠀same⠀beat⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀prompt.⠀Do⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀solely⠀to⠀hand⠀off⠀the⠀turn,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice.⠀If⠀a⠀question⠀arises⠀naturally⠀in⠀the⠀dialogue,⠀it⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered;⠀if⠀an⠀action⠀is⠀only⠀half⠀finished,⠀leave⠀it⠀there.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings.⠀A⠀participant⠀account⠀must⠀fit⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀rather⠀than⠀silently⠀becoming⠀first⠀person,⠀and⠀an⠀observing⠀narrator⠀must⠀not⠀claim⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀player⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀an⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative.⠀Ground⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀room,⠀doorway,⠀table,⠀courtyard,⠀street,⠀or⠀bus⠀route⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀couple's⠀shared⠀life,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀space⠀carry⠀feeling⠀before⠀any⠀summary⠀is⠀offered.⠀Show⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀changes⠀in⠀who⠀sits⠀where,⠀who⠀arrives⠀late,⠀who⠀clears⠀the⠀dishes,⠀or⠀who⠀stands⠀in⠀a⠀doorway⠀without⠀entering.⠀The⠀domestic⠀environment⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀backdrop;⠀it⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀read⠀each⠀other's⠀moods⠀and⠀where⠀the⠀practical⠀pressure⠀of⠀family⠀and⠀neighbors⠀reaches⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callbacks⠀as⠀the⠀emotional⠀spine⠀of⠀the⠀domestic⠀route.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀return⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀shifted⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀detail⠀around⠀it.⠀A⠀phrase⠀first⠀spoken⠀at⠀that⠀table⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀years⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀tone;⠀a⠀shared⠀errand⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀routine⠀of⠀avoidance;⠀a⠀small⠀object⠀moved⠀from⠀one⠀shelf⠀to⠀another⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀feels⠀at⠀home.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀callback's⠀history⠀every⠀time;⠀the⠀altered⠀handling⠀of⠀the⠀object,⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀the⠀routine,⠀or⠀the⠀different⠀look⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀eyes⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀accumulated⠀change⠀legible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀continuous⠀and⠀situated⠀rather⠀than⠀episodic⠀or⠀satirical.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrative⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀domestic⠀scenes—attention,⠀memory,⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀a⠀disagreement,⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀care—without⠀inserting⠀chapter-like⠀conclusions.⠀When⠀family⠀or⠀neighbors⠀matter,⠀let⠀their⠀pressure⠀arrive⠀through⠀concrete⠀speech⠀and⠀action:⠀a⠀parent's⠀question⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀remark,⠀an⠀elder's⠀silence⠀at⠀the⠀table.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀separate⠀explanatory⠀layer⠀about⠀social⠀expectation;⠀the⠀couple⠀must⠀experience⠀it⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀choices.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀domestic⠀route⠀shapes⠀attention⠀and⠀information⠀flow,⠀not⠀the⠀cast's⠀identity⠀or⠀the⠀story's⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀prose.⠀Cut⠀the⠀connective⠀tissue⠀between⠀beats:⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀significant⠀action⠀or⠀image⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀narrating⠀the⠀walk⠀between⠀them.⠀Use⠀forceful,⠀ordinary⠀words⠀and⠀let⠀physical⠀facts⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling.⠀A⠀cracked⠀phone⠀screen,⠀a⠀frayed⠀cuff,⠀a⠀sticky⠀door,⠀a⠀meal⠀eaten⠀standing⠀up,⠀a⠀shift⠀that⠀leaves⠀someone⠀too⠀tired⠀to⠀speak—these⠀details⠀should⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reader⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀couple's⠀practical⠀life,⠀not⠀floating⠀above⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callbacks⠀through⠀their⠀material⠀condition.⠀When⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀let⠀the⠀wear,⠀damage,⠀or⠀exhaustion⠀attached⠀to⠀it⠀tell⠀the⠀reader⠀how⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀same⠀cup⠀may⠀come⠀back⠀with⠀a⠀chip;⠀the⠀same⠀walk⠀may⠀be⠀cut⠀short⠀by⠀a⠀work⠀call;⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀may⠀hit⠀differently⠀after⠀a⠀rent⠀payment.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀noticing⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀thing⠀itself—a⠀new⠀crack,⠀a⠀slower⠀step,⠀a⠀different⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀speaker's⠀voice—so⠀the⠀accumulated⠀history⠀is⠀felt⠀without⠀a⠀flashback⠀or⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀memory.⠀A⠀callback⠀can⠀land⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀shock⠀of⠀recognition:⠀the⠀object⠀tells⠀them⠀something⠀they⠀had⠀not⠀let⠀themselves⠀name.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Keep⠀most⠀beats⠀tight⠀and⠀physical,⠀but⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀room⠀to⠀work⠀through⠀a⠀decision⠀under⠀pressure:⠀whether⠀to⠀stay,⠀whether⠀to⠀speak,⠀whether⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀routine⠀go.⠀The⠀longer⠀thought⠀should⠀stay⠀inside⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀situation,⠀tracking⠀their⠀options,⠀their⠀body's⠀signals,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀each⠀choice.⠀It⠀must⠀not⠀drift⠀into⠀lyricism,⠀abstract⠀emotion,⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀relationship's⠀meaning.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀person;⠀the⠀gritty⠀treatment⠀shapes⠀diction⠀and⠀emphasis,⠀not⠀the⠀cast's⠀identity⠀or⠀the⠀world's⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀a⠀text⠀message⠀sent⠀from⠀work,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀written⠀late⠀at⠀night,⠀a⠀letter⠀composed⠀but⠀never⠀delivered,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀The⠀situation⠀shapes⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀notices,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀say,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀out.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically;⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀arises⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀would⠀write⠀that⠀thing⠀at⠀that⠀moment.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callbacks⠀as⠀quoted⠀or⠀remembered⠀traces⠀across⠀the⠀documents.⠀When⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀reappears,⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀later⠀document's⠀purpose.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀quote⠀an⠀old⠀phrase⠀to⠀remind⠀the⠀recipient⠀of⠀a⠀promise;⠀a⠀journal⠀may⠀mention⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀to⠀ask⠀why⠀it⠀now⠀hurts;⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀callback⠀half-finished⠀because⠀the⠀sender⠀stops⠀typing.⠀Show⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀through⠀the⠀document's⠀language⠀and⠀incompleteness,⠀not⠀by⠀explaining⠀the⠀history.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀relationship's⠀arc⠀in⠀the⠀different⠀uses⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀serves⠀over⠀time.\n\nLet⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀omit⠀the⠀conversation⠀the⠀reader⠀most⠀wants;⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀correct⠀or⠀retell⠀an⠀earlier⠀account;⠀two⠀people⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀same⠀meeting⠀with⠀different⠀emphases.⠀These⠀differences⠀reveal⠀strain,⠀trust,⠀vulnerability,⠀and⠀the⠀choices⠀each⠀writer⠀is⠀making⠀about⠀what⠀to⠀preserve.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀after⠀each⠀record⠀to⠀reconcile⠀the⠀versions.⠀Keep⠀readable⠀continuity⠀through⠀the⠀dates,⠀places,⠀and⠀concrete⠀details⠀the⠀documents⠀share.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀actually⠀experienced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀chosen,⠀small⠀acts⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀couple.⠀Derive⠀each⠀caring⠀act⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀details⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀already⠀built:⠀the⠀drink⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀always⠀reaches⠀for,⠀the⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀bed⠀that⠀stays⠀warm,⠀the⠀route⠀home⠀with⠀the⠀light⠀they⠀like,⠀the⠀joke⠀that⠀still⠀works⠀after⠀many⠀repetitions.⠀Show⠀the⠀carer⠀noticing⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀needs⠀or⠀prefers,⠀then⠀acting⠀on⠀that⠀knowledge⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀moment—quiet,⠀practical,⠀perhaps⠀half-teasing.⠀Let⠀the⠀recipient⠀register⠀the⠀care⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀response:⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀brief⠀smile,⠀leaning⠀back⠀into⠀a⠀familiar⠀posture,⠀taking⠀the⠀offered⠀cup.⠀The⠀warmth⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀that⠀exchange,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀stated⠀summary⠀of⠀how⠀much⠀they⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callbacks⠀as⠀warm⠀anchors.⠀When⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀routine⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀accumulated⠀ease⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.⠀An⠀old⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀tease⠀that⠀still⠀makes⠀them⠀both⠀smile;⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀may⠀appear⠀at⠀a⠀restful⠀moment⠀and⠀require⠀no⠀explanation;⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀may⠀be⠀performed⠀with⠀the⠀relaxed⠀coordination⠀of⠀long⠀practice.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀callback's⠀history.⠀Show⠀its⠀effect⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀unguarded⠀reactions—the⠀way⠀they⠀fall⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀rhythm,⠀the⠀small⠀laugh,⠀the⠀comfortable⠀silence.⠀If⠀a⠀callback⠀feels⠀forced⠀or⠀out⠀of⠀place,⠀build⠀the⠀scene⠀instead⠀from⠀fresh⠀attention⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀doing⠀right⠀now.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀be⠀tired,⠀particular,⠀mildly⠀annoyed,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀bad⠀mood⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀cared⠀for⠀and⠀care⠀in⠀return.⠀A⠀small⠀friction⠀can⠀sit⠀inside⠀a⠀warm⠀scene⠀without⠀escalating:⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀sigh,⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀ignore⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀moment⠀may⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀rough⠀edge.⠀Established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀do⠀not⠀disappear,⠀but⠀this⠀treatment⠀spends⠀its⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀room⠀the⠀characters⠀make⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀within⠀those⠀problems.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀romance⠀with⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette;⠀the⠀comfort⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀why⠀their⠀relationship⠀is⠀worth⠀keeping.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose.⠀Open⠀each⠀significant⠀scene⠀with⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀in⠀its⠀social⠀situation:⠀a⠀family's⠀expectations,⠀a⠀workplace's⠀demands,⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀history,⠀a⠀public⠀event⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀couple⠀may⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions—between⠀rooms,⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present,⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀remembered—so⠀the⠀reader⠀moves⠀through⠀time⠀and⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀simply⠀receiving⠀the⠀next⠀reported⠀event.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀spoken⠀language:⠀sentences⠀should⠀build⠀on⠀each⠀other⠀with⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀connecting⠀the⠀particular⠀exchange⠀to⠀the⠀larger⠀social⠀world⠀that⠀surrounds⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀callbacks⠀as⠀the⠀emotional⠀anchor⠀beneath⠀the⠀formal⠀frame.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀return⠀at⠀different⠀points⠀in⠀the⠀narrative,⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀its⠀meaning⠀shifts⠀through⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀in⠀between.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀the⠀recurrence⠀briefly,⠀but⠀the⠀feeling⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀handling⠀of⠀it:⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀casually⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀chapter⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀years⠀later⠀with⠀different⠀breath,⠀a⠀routine⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀measure⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀couple⠀has⠀kept⠀or⠀lost.⠀Do⠀not⠀over-explain⠀the⠀callback's⠀history.⠀Its⠀new⠀weight⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀contrast⠀with⠀the⠀public⠀context—what⠀the⠀couple⠀now⠀cannot⠀say⠀in⠀company,⠀what⠀the⠀routine⠀now⠀costs⠀them,⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀now⠀stands⠀in⠀for.\n\nUse⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀relationship⠀at⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀every⠀frame.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀offers⠀a⠀judgment,⠀make⠀it⠀a⠀brief,⠀composed⠀observation⠀that⠀interprets⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀experience.⠀After⠀the⠀frame,⠀return⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀perception,⠀wants,⠀and⠀fears.⠀A⠀public⠀event⠀or⠀family⠀obligation⠀may⠀complicate⠀their⠀private⠀choices,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀story's⠀world—a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀work—not⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀explanatory⠀meditation.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀shapes⠀presentation⠀and⠀distance;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀supply⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀scene⠀of⠀telling⠀between⠀two⠀people⠀who⠀are⠀not⠀yet⠀fully⠀known⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀both:⠀a⠀wait,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀night⠀neither⠀wants⠀to⠀end,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀requires⠀explanation.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀chooses⠀the⠀tale⠀for⠀the⠀listener,⠀and⠀that⠀choice⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀disclosure.⠀Let⠀the⠀tale⠀carry⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀say⠀directly:⠀a⠀fear⠀about⠀being⠀left,⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀once⠀mattered,⠀a⠀hope⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀might⠀become.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀listener⠀active.⠀They⠀interrupt,⠀ask⠀the⠀wrong⠀question,⠀laugh⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀or⠀fall⠀silent⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀one.⠀Their⠀responses⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀learning⠀about⠀the⠀teller,⠀and⠀their⠀attention⠀or⠀distraction⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.⠀When⠀the⠀listener⠀asks⠀for⠀more,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀decide⠀whether⠀to⠀continue,⠀change⠀the⠀story,⠀or⠀stop.⠀The⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀finished⠀in⠀one⠀turn;⠀its⠀interruption⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀intimate⠀as⠀its⠀completion.\n\nUse⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀routine⠀from⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀inside⠀the⠀embedded⠀story.⠀A⠀cup⠀they⠀are⠀sharing,⠀a⠀train⠀announcement,⠀a⠀habit⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀has,⠀a⠀sentence⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀said⠀earlier.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀returns⠀in⠀the⠀tale,⠀connect⠀the⠀levels⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀catch⠀the⠀echo⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory⠀alter⠀it.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀not⠀notice⠀the⠀echo;⠀the⠀listener⠀may.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀two⠀versions⠀of⠀the⠀detail⠀leaning⠀toward⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀the⠀romance⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀echoed⠀detail⠀register⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀signal⠀between⠀this⠀pair⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀narrative⠀device.\n\nLet⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀telling.⠀They⠀can⠀prepare⠀food,⠀walk,⠀wait⠀for⠀someone,⠀or⠀sit⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀another⠀obligation⠀approaches.⠀The⠀telling⠀does⠀not⠀pause⠀their⠀lives.⠀A⠀phone⠀can⠀ring,⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀need⠀attention,⠀or⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀can⠀remember⠀something⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀listen.⠀The⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀stage⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀world;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀moment⠀inside⠀their⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀time.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀persuade,⠀heal,⠀or⠀resolve⠀the⠀relationship.⠀It⠀can⠀create⠀closeness,⠀but⠀it⠀can⠀also⠀reveal⠀a⠀difference⠀the⠀listener⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀how⠀to⠀answer.⠀The⠀teller's⠀version⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀generous,⠀or⠀self-serving.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀believe⠀it,⠀doubt⠀it,⠀or⠀understand⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀intend.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀both⠀people⠀are⠀changed⠀by⠀having⠀told⠀and⠀heard⠀it,⠀and⠀that⠀the⠀change⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀particular⠀pair⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀any⠀storyteller⠀and⠀any⠀audience.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀material⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀characters'⠀lives:⠀where⠀they⠀work,⠀how⠀they⠀travel,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀who⠀depends⠀on⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀waiting⠀to⠀become.⠀Let⠀these⠀conditions⠀create⠀the⠀timing⠀and⠀friction⠀of⠀the⠀romance.⠀Two⠀people⠀may⠀grow⠀close⠀because⠀a⠀shift⠀schedule⠀aligns,⠀a⠀lease⠀ends,⠀a⠀parent⠀needs⠀care,⠀or⠀a⠀training⠀program⠀keeps⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀in⠀town.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀retreat⠀from⠀these⠀conditions;⠀it⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀them.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀repeated⠀ordinary⠀contact.⠀Show⠀the⠀small⠀routines⠀that⠀make⠀two⠀people⠀familiar⠀to⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀shared⠀break,⠀a⠀particular⠀seat⠀on⠀the⠀bus,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀answering⠀the⠀phone,⠀a⠀task⠀one⠀always⠀helps⠀the⠀other⠀finish.⠀Let⠀one⠀of⠀these⠀routines⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀new⠀weight.⠀The⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀can⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀after⠀a⠀disappointment,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀stay.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change;⠀let⠀the⠀repetition⠀carry⠀it.⠀Surround⠀each⠀return⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀changed⠀circumstances⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀or⠀memory,⠀so⠀the⠀new⠀meaning⠀is⠀realized⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀asserted⠀in⠀narration.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀understanding⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀situation.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀specific.⠀Describe⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀weather,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀meal,⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes⠀to⠀get⠀somewhere.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀what⠀matters⠀to⠀them:⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀tiredness,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀question,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀left⠀open.⠀Interiority⠀should⠀include⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀and⠀unspoken⠀feeling⠀together.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀think⠀about⠀rent⠀and⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀touch⠀someone's⠀hand⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀moment.\n\nLet⠀obligations⠀compete⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀obligation⠀a⠀threat.⠀A⠀family⠀member's⠀illness,⠀a⠀job⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀missed,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀before⠀the⠀relationship⠀began⠀can⠀delay⠀or⠀complicate⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀other⠀person's⠀response⠀to⠀that⠀delay⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀romance:⠀they⠀may⠀wait,⠀help,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀set⠀a⠀limit.⠀Show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀those⠀choices⠀in⠀later⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀them⠀immediately.\n\nDo⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀tragic⠀or⠀redemptive⠀arc.⠀The⠀relationship⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀why⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀matter⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀material⠀circumstances⠀they⠀share,⠀how⠀those⠀circumstances⠀have⠀entered⠀their⠀perception⠀of⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀part⠀costs⠀them⠀something⠀concrete⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀already⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀romance⠀inside⠀an⠀environment⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀collide:⠀a⠀family⠀business,⠀a⠀religious⠀institution,⠀a⠀political⠀office,⠀a⠀building⠀with⠀rules⠀older⠀than⠀its⠀current⠀occupants,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀where⠀everyone⠀knows⠀who⠀someone's⠀parents⠀were.⠀Make⠀the⠀environment⠀concrete.⠀Describe⠀the⠀worn⠀furniture,⠀the⠀locked⠀rooms,⠀the⠀outdated⠀procedures,⠀the⠀way⠀light⠀falls⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀renovated⠀in⠀years.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀characters'⠀choices⠀feel⠀weighted⠀without⠀adding⠀supernatural⠀rules.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀moments⠀when⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀falls⠀away⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀Show⠀each⠀character⠀performing⠀for⠀others:⠀at⠀work,⠀at⠀family⠀gatherings,⠀in⠀public.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀where⠀the⠀performance⠀stops.⠀The⠀contrast⠀matters.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀tired⠀of⠀being⠀the⠀responsible⠀one;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀be⠀tired⠀of⠀being⠀the⠀one⠀nobody⠀takes⠀seriously.⠀They⠀recognize⠀something⠀in⠀each⠀other⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀seen⠀the⠀mask⠀and⠀the⠀face⠀behind⠀it.\n\nUse⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀environment.⠀A⠀key,⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀coat⠀hung⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀place,⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀in⠀official⠀meetings,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀closed⠀at⠀night.⠀Let⠀this⠀detail⠀return⠀in⠀private⠀scenes⠀with⠀new⠀meaning.⠀The⠀same⠀object⠀can⠀represent⠀obligation⠀in⠀one⠀moment⠀and⠀care⠀in⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀shift;⠀let⠀the⠀characters'⠀changing⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀environment⠀carry⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀object⠀as⠀it⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀institutional⠀setting,⠀then⠀show⠀it⠀again⠀in⠀the⠀private⠀room⠀or⠀intimate⠀exchange,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀carrying⠀two⠀different⠀registers⠀for⠀this⠀particular⠀pair.\n\nMake⠀the⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀protect⠀the⠀other⠀by⠀concealing⠀information;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀resent⠀that⠀protection.⠀One⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀institution⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀wants⠀to⠀stay⠀and⠀change⠀it.⠀These⠀differences⠀are⠀not⠀betrayals.⠀They⠀are⠀competing⠀wants⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀negotiated.⠀Show⠀the⠀negotiation⠀in⠀action⠀and⠀in⠀private⠀thought.⠀Let⠀each⠀character⠀have⠀reasons⠀that⠀make⠀sense⠀to⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀romance⠀vulnerable.⠀The⠀environment⠀can⠀threaten⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀exposure,⠀scandal,⠀or⠀the⠀demands⠀of⠀an⠀older⠀authority⠀figure.⠀But⠀the⠀threat⠀must⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀credible,⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀doom.⠀When⠀the⠀characters⠀choose⠀each⠀other,⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀choice⠀costs⠀them⠀in⠀their⠀public⠀lives.⠀When⠀they⠀hesitate,⠀show⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀losing.⠀The⠀ending⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀tragic⠀or⠀triumphant;⠀it⠀must⠀make⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀why⠀this⠀particular⠀pair⠀chose⠀to⠀trust⠀each⠀other⠀in⠀this⠀particular⠀place,⠀and⠀why⠀that⠀trust⠀has⠀a⠀price⠀the⠀institution⠀itself⠀helped⠀set.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀relationship⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀family⠀and⠀community⠀setting.⠀Show⠀who⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀house,⠀who⠀visits,⠀who⠀has⠀authority,⠀who⠀needs⠀care,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀expected⠀of⠀each⠀person.⠀The⠀romance⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀private⠀matter⠀that⠀happens⠀between⠀two⠀individuals⠀in⠀isolation;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀relationship⠀that⠀other⠀people⠀notice,⠀comment⠀on,⠀support,⠀or⠀resist.⠀Let⠀those⠀other⠀people⠀have⠀their⠀own⠀reasons⠀and⠀their⠀own⠀histories.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀shared⠀domestic⠀routines.⠀Show⠀the⠀couple⠀cooking⠀together,⠀waiting⠀for⠀someone,⠀managing⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀or⠀sitting⠀through⠀a⠀family⠀event.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀particular⠀dish,⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀a⠀walk⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀market,⠀a⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀uses⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀worried.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀returns⠀later,⠀place⠀it⠀inside⠀the⠀changed⠀household⠀circumstances⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀or⠀memory,⠀so⠀the⠀object⠀registers⠀the⠀shift⠀between⠀the⠀couple⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience⠀of⠀obligation⠀and⠀desire.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀love⠀someone⠀and⠀also⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀their⠀family⠀expects.⠀They⠀can⠀want⠀to⠀be⠀with⠀someone⠀and⠀also⠀worry⠀about⠀money,⠀a⠀parent's⠀health,⠀a⠀sibling's⠀future,⠀or⠀their⠀own⠀plans.⠀Show⠀these⠀competing⠀wants⠀in⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀in⠀conversation.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀family⠀a⠀simple⠀obstacle⠀or⠀a⠀simple⠀support;⠀let⠀the⠀relationship⠀with⠀family⠀be⠀as⠀complicated⠀as⠀the⠀romance⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀timing⠀and⠀practical⠀circumstances⠀create⠀the⠀complications.⠀A⠀job⠀in⠀another⠀city,⠀a⠀festival⠀that⠀brings⠀the⠀family⠀together,⠀a⠀wedding⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀planned,⠀a⠀relative⠀who⠀needs⠀help,⠀a⠀visa⠀or⠀application⠀that⠀is⠀delayed.⠀These⠀events⠀are⠀not⠀melodramatic⠀interruptions;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀ordinary⠀conditions⠀under⠀which⠀the⠀couple⠀must⠀decide⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀promise⠀each⠀other.⠀Show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀those⠀decisions⠀in⠀later⠀scenes.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀particular⠀language,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀The⠀romance⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀why⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀matter⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀social⠀world⠀they⠀inhabit,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀part⠀costs⠀them⠀something⠀concrete⠀that⠀the⠀household⠀and⠀community⠀have⠀shaped.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀ordinary⠀social⠀settings:⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀club,⠀a⠀family⠀home.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀meet⠀through⠀the⠀routines⠀of⠀those⠀settings⠀and⠀become⠀familiar⠀through⠀repeated⠀contact.⠀Show⠀the⠀small⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀two⠀people⠀aware⠀of⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀goes⠀on⠀longer⠀than⠀expected,⠀a⠀gesture⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀notices⠀and⠀remembers.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀memory.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀should⠀notice⠀specific⠀things⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person:⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀hold⠀a⠀pen,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀their⠀footsteps,⠀a⠀habit⠀they⠀have⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀nervous.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀return⠀in⠀later⠀scenes.⠀The⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀drink⠀they⠀always⠀order,⠀a⠀song⠀they⠀both⠀know,⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀pass⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀home.⠀When⠀the⠀detail⠀returns,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀or⠀memory⠀so⠀the⠀altered⠀meaning⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship's⠀development⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀motif.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience.⠀Show⠀what⠀they⠀think⠀and⠀feel⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀They⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀speak⠀and⠀hesitate.⠀They⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀something⠀and⠀only⠀realize⠀it⠀later.⠀They⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀tone⠀and⠀wonder⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Let⠀the⠀interiority⠀include⠀uncertainty,⠀hope,⠀and⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀together.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀perfectly⠀perceptive;⠀let⠀them⠀miss⠀things⠀and⠀learn⠀from⠀what⠀happens⠀next.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀disclosure⠀and⠀disagreement⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀care.⠀The⠀characters⠀should⠀not⠀always⠀agree.⠀They⠀may⠀argue⠀about⠀work,⠀about⠀a⠀decision,⠀about⠀something⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀did.⠀The⠀argument⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀who⠀they⠀are,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀misunderstanding.⠀Show⠀the⠀aftermath:⠀the⠀silence,⠀the⠀apology,⠀the⠀attempt⠀to⠀explain,⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀reaches⠀out.⠀Let⠀the⠀disagreement⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀ending⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀quiet⠀or⠀restrained⠀tone⠀on⠀every⠀scene.⠀The⠀characters⠀can⠀be⠀direct,⠀funny,⠀angry,⠀or⠀exuberant⠀according⠀to⠀who⠀they⠀are.⠀Seasonal⠀attention⠀is⠀available⠀but⠀not⠀mandatory.⠀The⠀romance⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀why⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀matter⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀texture⠀of⠀their⠀shared⠀daily⠀life⠀and⠀private⠀perception,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀part⠀costs⠀them⠀something⠀concrete⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀their⠀ordinary⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀city⠀or⠀neighborhood.⠀Show⠀the⠀streets,⠀the⠀buses,⠀the⠀markets,⠀the⠀apartments,⠀the⠀noise,⠀the⠀heat,⠀the⠀rain.⠀The⠀city⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀backdrop;⠀it⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀live⠀and⠀how⠀they⠀meet.⠀They⠀may⠀pass⠀the⠀same⠀corner⠀every⠀day,⠀hear⠀the⠀same⠀music⠀from⠀a⠀window,⠀or⠀take⠀the⠀same⠀route⠀home.⠀Let⠀the⠀urban⠀environment⠀shape⠀their⠀time⠀together⠀and⠀their⠀time⠀apart.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀private⠀perception⠀and⠀shared⠀routine.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀should⠀notice⠀the⠀city⠀differently⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀A⠀street⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀they⠀once⠀walked⠀together.⠀A⠀café⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀they⠀always⠀sit.⠀A⠀song⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀was⠀playing⠀when⠀something⠀changed.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀weight.⠀When⠀a⠀repeated⠀place,⠀song,⠀or⠀object⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀show⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀changed⠀perception⠀or⠀memory⠀of⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀city⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀relationship's⠀development⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀as⠀a⠀fixed⠀backdrop.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀life.⠀Show⠀what⠀they⠀think⠀and⠀feel⠀as⠀they⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀city.⠀They⠀can⠀be⠀walking⠀to⠀meet⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀and⠀thinking⠀about⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀say.⠀They⠀can⠀be⠀alone⠀in⠀their⠀apartment⠀and⠀remembering⠀a⠀conversation.⠀They⠀can⠀be⠀at⠀work⠀and⠀distracted⠀by⠀a⠀message.⠀Let⠀the⠀interiority⠀include⠀desire,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀practical⠀concerns⠀together.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀perfectly⠀self-aware;⠀let⠀them⠀discover⠀their⠀own⠀feelings⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀say.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀proximity⠀and⠀disclosure.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀live⠀near⠀each⠀other,⠀work⠀together,⠀or⠀share⠀a⠀circle⠀of⠀friends.⠀They⠀may⠀know⠀each⠀other⠀for⠀a⠀long⠀time⠀before⠀anything⠀changes.⠀The⠀change⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀small⠀moment:⠀a⠀look⠀that⠀lasts⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀is⠀too⠀personal,⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀that⠀means⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀should.⠀Show⠀the⠀aftermath⠀of⠀that⠀moment.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀grow⠀through⠀repeated⠀contact⠀and⠀through⠀the⠀risks⠀they⠀take⠀with⠀each⠀other.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀The⠀marvelous⠀is⠀not⠀active⠀in⠀this⠀route.⠀The⠀romance⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀remain⠀uncertain.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀why⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀matter⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀urban⠀world⠀they⠀move⠀through,⠀how⠀that⠀world⠀has⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀private⠀perception,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀part⠀costs⠀them⠀something⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀streets,⠀rooms,⠀and⠀routines⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀already⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaman::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀Show⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀lines.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀they⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀classroom⠀to⠀a⠀hallway,⠀from⠀a⠀train⠀platform⠀to⠀a⠀café,⠀from⠀a⠀kitchen⠀to⠀a⠀balcony,⠀make⠀the⠀transition⠀clear⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀sentence.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀long⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀setting.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀understand⠀the⠀situation⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue.\n\nUse⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀their⠀own⠀line.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reacts⠀privately,⠀give⠀that⠀reaction⠀its⠀own⠀short⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀who⠀they⠀are.⠀It⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀noticed⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀to⠀them.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀long;⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀contain⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀recognition,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀emotional⠀label.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship.⠀It⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀keychain,⠀a⠀drink,⠀a⠀seat⠀on⠀the⠀train,⠀a⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀says⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀nervous,⠀a⠀habit⠀the⠀other⠀one⠀starts⠀to⠀expect.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀detail⠀naturally.⠀When⠀it⠀returns⠀later,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀new⠀weight.⠀The⠀same⠀object⠀can⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀after⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀fight,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀summary;⠀let⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat⠀carry⠀it.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀proximity⠀and⠀disclosure.⠀The⠀characters⠀should⠀have⠀reasons⠀to⠀be⠀near⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀shared⠀class,⠀a⠀part-time⠀job,⠀a⠀club,⠀a⠀commute,⠀a⠀project.⠀Let⠀them⠀talk,⠀argue,⠀help⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀reveal⠀small⠀things⠀about⠀themselves.⠀The⠀disclosures⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀who⠀they⠀are.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀admit⠀a⠀fear,⠀a⠀family⠀problem,⠀a⠀dream⠀they⠀have⠀not⠀told⠀anyone.⠀The⠀other⠀character's⠀response⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀romance:⠀they⠀may⠀listen,⠀joke,⠀share⠀something⠀in⠀return,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀understand⠀and⠀have⠀to⠀try⠀again.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀fast⠀and⠀readable⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀scene⠀comic⠀or⠀every⠀character⠀witty.⠀The⠀humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀would⠀actually⠀joke.⠀The⠀serious⠀moments⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀would⠀actually⠀be⠀serious.⠀A⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀not⠀required.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀relationship⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀want⠀to⠀continue⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀their⠀particular⠀connection⠀and⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail's⠀new⠀meaning⠀concrete,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀forced⠀a⠀dramatic⠀cut.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nPlant⠀a⠀specific⠀image,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀sensory⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀romantic⠀pair's⠀attention⠀or⠀care⠀first⠀becomes⠀significant⠀to⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Let⠀that⠀material⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀early⠀disclosure⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Later,⠀when⠀a⠀disagreement,⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀proximity⠀has⠀happened,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀grammatical⠀position—the⠀original⠀cup⠀becomes⠀the⠀weight⠀in⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀phrase⠀someone⠀said⠀becomes⠀the⠀object⠀of⠀and⠀after⠀an⠀unspoken⠀sequel.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀be⠀triggered⠀by⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀not⠀by⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀that⠀it⠀is⠀returning.\n\nOrder⠀clauses⠀to⠀slow⠀around⠀vulnerability⠀and⠀still⠀move⠀quickly⠀through⠀practical⠀action.⠀Let⠀a⠀long⠀sentence⠀gather⠀a⠀perception,⠀then⠀break⠀the⠀rhythm⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀whose⠀contrast⠀gives⠀the⠀next⠀image⠀its⠀force.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀compares⠀two⠀things,⠀use⠀the⠀comparison⠀to⠀alter⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀or⠀about⠀what⠀is⠀possible⠀between⠀them;⠀the⠀figurative⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀perception⠀only,⠀while⠀dialogue⠀may⠀stay⠀entirely⠀plain.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀material⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀relationship's⠀shared⠀life⠀has⠀actually⠀charged⠀it⠀with⠀new⠀meaning.⠀If⠀the⠀image⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀been⠀altered⠀by⠀an⠀event⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀people,⠀keep⠀it⠀unused⠀until⠀one⠀occurs.⠀The⠀cadence⠀of⠀the⠀prose⠀follows⠀the⠀lovers'⠀internal⠀attention,⠀not⠀an⠀external⠀requirement⠀to⠀sound⠀solemn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nIntroduce⠀one⠀recurring⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀early⠀in⠀the⠀relationship,⠀preferably⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀pair's⠀care⠀or⠀a⠀disagreement⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀clear⠀emotional⠀charge.⠀Later,⠀when⠀a⠀present⠀relationship⠀moment⠀surfaces⠀the⠀same⠀material,⠀let⠀that⠀present⠀occasion⠀trigger⠀the⠀narrator's⠀recollection⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀version.⠀Place⠀the⠀memory⠀beside⠀the⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀passage:⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀true⠀then⠀both⠀remain⠀real,⠀with⠀no⠀line⠀announcing⠀that⠀time⠀has⠀passed.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recurring⠀material⠀show⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀people.⠀The⠀same⠀walk⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀taken⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀pace,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀spoken⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀inflection,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀errand⠀may⠀be⠀performed⠀without⠀the⠀hesitations⠀it⠀once⠀had.⠀Narrate⠀a⠀happy⠀present⠀directly;⠀do⠀not⠀undercut⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀mandatory⠀loss.⠀If⠀the⠀present⠀is⠀content,⠀let⠀the⠀earlier⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀material⠀surface⠀only⠀if⠀it⠀gives⠀that⠀contentment⠀a⠀new⠀dimension,⠀such⠀as⠀the⠀knowledge⠀of⠀how⠀it⠀became⠀possible.\n\nWhen⠀direct⠀reflection⠀is⠀used,⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀general⠀observation⠀about⠀time.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀permissions⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀state,⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀situated⠀oral⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀fixed⠀regional⠀route.⠀A⠀narrator⠀tells⠀the⠀story⠀of⠀the⠀pair's⠀relationship⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener—a⠀friend,⠀a⠀family⠀member,⠀a⠀guest,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀companion—whose⠀presence⠀governs⠀what⠀is⠀included⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀revised.⠀Establish⠀the⠀frame⠀briefly:⠀who⠀is⠀speaking,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀why⠀this⠀retelling⠀is⠀happening⠀now.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀ordering⠀of⠀remembered⠀moments,⠀never⠀through⠀an⠀omniscient⠀overview⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nMake⠀the⠀teller's⠀recollection⠀of⠀shared⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀or⠀phrases⠀the⠀recurring⠀material.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀specific⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀early⠀in⠀the⠀telling,⠀preferably⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀disclosure,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀learned⠀what⠀happened⠀next.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀admit⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀change⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀as⠀the⠀return⠀occurs.⠀Allow⠀the⠀listener's⠀questions⠀or⠀reactions⠀to⠀interrupt⠀and⠀redirect⠀the⠀account;⠀the⠀teller's⠀direct⠀address⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀clauses.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀particulars.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code⠀as⠀universal⠀requirements.⠀The⠀oral⠀delivery⠀can⠀include⠀repetition⠀and⠀direct⠀address,⠀but⠀dialogue⠀quoted⠀within⠀the⠀tale⠀remains⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀speakers.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀stop⠀at⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀moral⠀that⠀explains⠀the⠀couple⠀to⠀the⠀audience.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀specific⠀object,⠀habitual⠀action,⠀or⠀short⠀phrase⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀relationship,⠀and⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀pair's⠀attention⠀or⠀care⠀first⠀becomes⠀significant.⠀Choose⠀a⠀detail⠀small⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀exact:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀distance⠀at⠀which⠀a⠀phrase⠀is⠀said,⠀the⠀particular⠀sequence⠀of⠀a⠀routine.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀same⠀detail⠀later⠀after⠀a⠀disagreement⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀proximity.⠀Alter⠀one⠀physical⠀element⠀on⠀the⠀return—the⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀with⠀more⠀force,⠀the⠀phrase⠀said⠀from⠀across⠀the⠀room⠀instead⠀of⠀close—and⠀let⠀that⠀alteration⠀alone⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change.\n\nKeep⠀clauses⠀direct⠀and⠀the⠀range⠀of⠀details⠀narrow.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀must⠀recognize⠀what⠀the⠀returned⠀detail⠀now⠀means,⠀include⠀only⠀that⠀recognition⠀in⠀one⠀sentence,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀repeat⠀it.⠀Let⠀an⠀essential⠀inward⠀thought⠀run⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀When⠀a⠀disagreement⠀has⠀altered⠀a⠀routine,⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀must⠀show⠀enough⠀of⠀the⠀routine's⠀difference⠀for⠀the⠀inference⠀to⠀hold;⠀omission⠀leaves⠀the⠀change⠀inferable,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀cause.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀character's⠀speech⠀individual⠀and⠀plain.⠀The⠀minimalist⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration's⠀selection,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker's⠀sentences.⠀Use⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀when⠀it⠀serves⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀slow⠀into⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀emerges⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀narrated⠀callback.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀material⠀during⠀a⠀concrete⠀beat⠀of⠀attention,⠀care,⠀or⠀disclosure;⠀later,⠀let⠀it⠀reappear⠀within⠀the⠀ordinary⠀flow⠀of⠀a⠀subsequent⠀scene⠀without⠀any⠀transition⠀marking⠀it⠀as⠀significant.⠀The⠀accumulated⠀weight⠀should⠀be⠀enacted⠀by⠀the⠀narrator's⠀inner⠀experience⠀at⠀the⠀return—a⠀pause,⠀a⠀flicker⠀of⠀recognition,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀means—never⠀by⠀a⠀narrative⠀statement⠀that⠀the⠀detail⠀has⠀returned.\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀demands.⠀Some⠀beats⠀proceed⠀through⠀practical⠀action;⠀others⠀slow⠀around⠀disclosure⠀or⠀care.⠀Recollection⠀enters⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀prompts⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀recurring⠀material⠀may⠀alter⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transition⠀phrasing⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀summarizing⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register,⠀including⠀humor⠀or⠀tenderness⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀naturally⠀produce⠀them.⠀Ground⠀every⠀recurrence⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship:⠀a⠀habit⠀one⠀person⠀notices,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀their⠀private⠀language,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀shared⠀history.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀inside⠀the⠀selected⠀point⠀of⠀view's⠀knowledge.⠀Stop⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀its⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀governing⠀filter⠀for⠀every⠀scene.⠀Derive⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀material⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀this⠀pairing—what⠀draws⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀together,⠀what⠀they⠀give⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀what⠀complication⠀or⠀history⠀gives⠀their⠀connection⠀its⠀specific⠀shape.⠀Each⠀scene⠀must⠀contain⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀moment⠀of⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀or⠀care⠀that⠀makes⠀that⠀promise⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀interaction,⠀never⠀through⠀inserted⠀trope⠀recognition.\n\nBuild⠀a⠀private⠀callback⠀language⠀from⠀a⠀moment⠀already⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀story.⠀Choose⠀a⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀said⠀at⠀a⠀significant⠀beat,⠀an⠀object⠀tied⠀to⠀how⠀they⠀met⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀survived,⠀or⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀belongs⠀only⠀to⠀them.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀material⠀later⠀at⠀a⠀scene⠀point⠀that⠀needs⠀accumulated⠀weight—a⠀moment⠀of⠀comfort,⠀a⠀disagreement's⠀full⠀history,⠀or⠀a⠀discovery⠀that⠀revises⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment⠀meant.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀feel⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀characters'⠀shared⠀life,⠀not⠀announced⠀by⠀the⠀narration.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀relationship⠀produces⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery,⠀let⠀the⠀selected⠀emotion⠀occupy⠀the⠀scene's⠀central⠀beat⠀rather⠀than⠀appearing⠀as⠀a⠀brief⠀note.⠀The⠀payoff⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀premise⠀and⠀the⠀scenes⠀that⠀have⠀built⠀it,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀compulsory⠀confession⠀or⠀forced⠀resolution.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀state,⠀with⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀connection⠀remaining⠀at⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀attention.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀the⠀retelling⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀knows⠀of⠀the⠀two⠀people,⠀then⠀immediately⠀expand⠀into⠀a⠀particular⠀deed—the⠀first⠀care,⠀the⠀first⠀spoken⠀promise,⠀the⠀first⠀return—that⠀makes⠀that⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀The⠀romance's⠀attention,⠀disclosure,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀become⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀deeds:⠀who⠀stayed,⠀who⠀spoke⠀first,⠀who⠀kept⠀a⠀promise,⠀who⠀returned.⠀Relation⠀of⠀an⠀act⠀must⠀always⠀point⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀it.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀as⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀memory.⠀Take⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀early⠀concrete⠀deed⠀between⠀the⠀pair,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀has⠀given⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀same⠀phrase⠀should⠀now⠀mean⠀something⠀altered⠀because⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀words⠀imply—a⠀promise⠀kept⠀under⠀difficulty,⠀a⠀term⠀of⠀affection⠀that⠀survived⠀a⠀quarrel.⠀The⠀return⠀deepens⠀the⠀account;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀to⠀every⠀entrance;⠀a⠀shared⠀designation⠀arises⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀teller⠀introduces⠀an⠀elevated⠀declaration⠀about⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀pair,⠀have⠀that⠀person's⠀next⠀quoted⠀speech⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀answer⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀correct⠀the⠀teller's⠀version⠀of⠀what⠀happened.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀story,⠀but⠀private⠀care⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀familiar⠀inconvenience⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Stop⠀the⠀telling⠀at⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀state,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀the⠀couple⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Keep⠀the⠀developing⠀connection⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀spaces⠀the⠀couple⠀shares:⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀bus⠀route,⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀a⠀shop,⠀a⠀clinic.⠀Let⠀other⠀people⠀notice,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀quietly⠀accommodate⠀the⠀relationship,⠀but⠀keep⠀their⠀presence⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀couple's⠀ordinary⠀environment⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀chorus⠀explaining⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nBuild⠀attachment⠀through⠀Maeda-style⠀repeated⠀particulars⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀specific⠀life.⠀A⠀mug,⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀only⠀between⠀them,⠀a⠀task⠀one⠀always⠀does⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀song⠀heard⠀at⠀a⠀certain⠀hour,⠀a⠀route⠀walked⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀order.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀return⠀after⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀circumstances,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀alter⠀their⠀meaning⠀without⠀stopping⠀to⠀explain⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀mug⠀is⠀now⠀washed⠀by⠀someone⠀else,⠀show⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀is⠀noticed;⠀if⠀the⠀phrase⠀is⠀said⠀with⠀hesitation,⠀let⠀the⠀hesitation⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀shift,⠀not⠀announce⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀feeling⠀restrained⠀but⠀legible⠀through⠀small⠀adjustments.⠀A⠀chair⠀moved⠀closer,⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food⠀set⠀aside,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks⠀directly⠀about⠀love,⠀fear,⠀or⠀regret,⠀let⠀the⠀plainness⠀of⠀the⠀speech⠀carry⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀surrounding⠀scene⠀has⠀prepared⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀every⠀moment⠀into⠀confession.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀forgotten;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀new⠀habit⠀before⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀names⠀it.⠀Disagreement⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀competing⠀obligations⠀rather⠀than⠀misunderstanding⠀alone.⠀A⠀decision⠀to⠀stay,⠀to⠀wait,⠀to⠀move,⠀or⠀to⠀speak⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀life⠀the⠀two⠀have⠀built,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀romantic⠀reward.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀setting,⠀season,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀concise⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀readable⠀action⠀lines⠀for⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀focused⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear.\n\nLet⠀repeated⠀objects⠀and⠀routines⠀carry⠀the⠀Maeda-style⠀emotional⠀reframing.⠀Show⠀the⠀same⠀item⠀or⠀action⠀in⠀two⠀or⠀more⠀scenes:⠀a⠀jacket⠀hung⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀drink⠀prepared⠀a⠀certain⠀way,⠀a⠀message⠀checked⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀a⠀seat⠀left⠀empty.⠀In⠀the⠀first⠀scene,⠀the⠀action⠀is⠀unremarkable.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀occurs⠀under⠀changed⠀circumstances.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀Let⠀the⠀visible⠀repetition⠀plus⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀response⠀carry⠀the⠀shift.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀through⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀note⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue,⠀voice-over,⠀or⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Use⠀it⠀to⠀render⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀actually⠀feels⠀or⠀realizes⠀without⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀spoken⠀confession:⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀speaking,⠀a⠀memory⠀triggered⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀gesture,⠀a⠀wish⠀that⠀remains⠀unsaid,⠀or⠀a⠀realization⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀moved⠀on.⠀Keep⠀the⠀note⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀for⠀the⠀reader.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀reveal⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀ordinary⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀polished⠀banter.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀talk⠀about⠀work,⠀food,⠀family,⠀plans,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀while⠀the⠀emotional⠀content⠀sits⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀A⠀direct⠀statement⠀of⠀feeling⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀and⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.\n\nBuild⠀Maeda-style⠀attachment⠀through⠀repeatable⠀stage⠀business.⠀Use⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀the⠀couple⠀can⠀handle⠀more⠀than⠀once:⠀a⠀coat⠀taken⠀from⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open,⠀a⠀bag⠀lifted,⠀a⠀light⠀switched⠀on.⠀In⠀an⠀early⠀scene,⠀the⠀action⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀happens⠀under⠀changed⠀circumstances,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀how⠀it⠀is⠀performed⠀shows⠀the⠀shift:⠀the⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀carefully,⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀held⠀open⠀longer,⠀the⠀coat⠀is⠀handed⠀over⠀instead⠀of⠀taken.⠀Write⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀specifically⠀enough⠀for⠀an⠀actor⠀to⠀perform,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀emotion⠀in⠀the⠀direction.⠀Let⠀the⠀changed⠀handling⠀carry⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside.⠀Place⠀a⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀nonspoken⠀wrapper⠀so⠀it⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀story⠀without⠀being⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀that⠀private⠀material.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀show⠀attraction,⠀trust,⠀vulnerability,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀through⠀ordinary⠀exchanges.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀discuss⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀disagreement⠀while⠀the⠀emotional⠀content⠀sits⠀in⠀pauses,⠀movements,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀say.⠀A⠀direct⠀confession⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀timing⠀and⠀competing⠀obligations⠀create⠀complications:⠀one⠀character⠀must⠀leave,⠀another⠀arrives,⠀a⠀task⠀interrupts,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀earlier⠀now⠀conflicts⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀wish.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀entrance,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀together.⠀Follow⠀a⠀thought⠀as⠀it⠀jumps⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀sound⠀to⠀a⠀past⠀room⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀once⠀said⠀to⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation⠀in⠀the⠀body.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀movement⠀into⠀a⠀linear⠀report.\n\nLet⠀Maeda-style⠀callbacks⠀arise⠀as⠀returns⠀inside⠀the⠀mental⠀flow.⠀A⠀particular⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀routine,⠀or⠀relationship⠀can⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀associations.⠀The⠀first⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀casual:⠀a⠀smell⠀brings⠀back⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀word⠀recalls⠀a⠀habit,⠀a⠀gesture⠀reminds⠀the⠀character⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀task.⠀After⠀an⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀relationship,⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀returns⠀with⠀new⠀weight.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀it⠀more⠀often,⠀resist⠀it,⠀or⠀find⠀a⠀different⠀feeling⠀attached⠀to⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀shift⠀through⠀the⠀repetition⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀stopping⠀the⠀flow⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀emotion.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀as⠀they⠀occur⠀inside⠀the⠀mind.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀absence⠀before⠀naming⠀it,⠀remember⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀during⠀an⠀unrelated⠀task,⠀argue⠀with⠀a⠀remembered⠀sentence,⠀or⠀realize⠀that⠀a⠀plan⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀wish.⠀Let⠀disclosure⠀and⠀disagreement⠀appear⠀as⠀remembered⠀speech⠀or⠀as⠀present⠀scenes⠀that⠀interrupt⠀the⠀mental⠀flow.⠀Keep⠀the⠀private⠀words⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀character's⠀mind;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀associative⠀style.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀character's⠀syntax⠀and⠀attention.⠀Short⠀fragments⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀sudden⠀sensation;⠀longer⠀sentences⠀may⠀unwind⠀a⠀memory.⠀Let⠀interruptions⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀cut⠀a⠀recollection⠀short,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀mind⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀human-owned⠀thoughts⠀or⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀and⠀events⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀associations⠀illuminate⠀them⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀carried⠀by⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Assign⠀each⠀person⠀a⠀specific⠀digital⠀habit⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀consistent:⠀one⠀may⠀type⠀in⠀short⠀bursts,⠀another⠀may⠀edit⠀before⠀sending,⠀one⠀may⠀leave⠀messages⠀unread⠀for⠀hours,⠀another⠀may⠀reply⠀immediately.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀Maeda-style⠀callbacks⠀work⠀through⠀repeated⠀phrases⠀and⠀shared⠀references⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀particular⠀greeting,⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀question⠀one⠀always⠀asks,⠀a⠀photo⠀sent⠀at⠀a⠀certain⠀time,⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀ending⠀a⠀conversation⠀can⠀appear⠀more⠀than⠀once.⠀In⠀an⠀early⠀exchange,⠀the⠀repetition⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀couple's⠀ordinary⠀rhythm.⠀After⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀circumstances,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀or⠀habit⠀returns⠀with⠀new⠀weight:⠀the⠀greeting⠀is⠀sent⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀silence,⠀the⠀nickname⠀appears⠀with⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀usual⠀question⠀is⠀asked⠀by⠀someone⠀else,⠀the⠀photo⠀is⠀opened⠀but⠀not⠀answered.⠀Show⠀the⠀shift⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀timing,⠀wording,⠀or⠀response⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀clearly⠀separated.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀type⠀something⠀and⠀delete⠀it,⠀leave⠀a⠀draft⠀unsent,⠀or⠀think⠀something⠀that⠀never⠀reaches⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Place⠀that⠀private⠀material⠀clearly⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀sent.⠀Use⠀the⠀unsent⠀draft⠀or⠀private⠀thought⠀to⠀show⠀attraction,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀care⠀as⠀they⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀share⠀a⠀daily⠀update,⠀plan⠀a⠀meeting,⠀argue⠀about⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀message.⠀When⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀separate⠀it⠀clearly⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀direct⠀statement⠀of⠀feeling⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀exchange.⠀End⠀a⠀conversation⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀pause⠀without⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamamba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual⠀novel⠀presentation.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Use⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nLet⠀Maeda-style⠀callbacks⠀work⠀through⠀recurring⠀visual⠀anchors.⠀Use⠀a⠀background,⠀object,⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀that⠀can⠀reappear:⠀a⠀classroom⠀after⠀hours,⠀a⠀bench⠀by⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀particular⠀drink,⠀a⠀character's⠀usual⠀smile⠀or⠀lowered⠀gaze.⠀In⠀an⠀early⠀scene,⠀the⠀cue⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ordinary⠀setting⠀or⠀mood.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀the⠀same⠀cue⠀returns⠀under⠀changed⠀circumstances,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀registers⠀the⠀difference.⠀The⠀background⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀same⠀but⠀emptier,⠀the⠀object⠀may⠀be⠀handled⠀differently,⠀the⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀read⠀with⠀doubt⠀or⠀tenderness.⠀Show⠀the⠀shift⠀through⠀the⠀visual⠀repetition⠀plus⠀the⠀focal⠀response,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀spoken⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀show⠀attraction,⠀trust,⠀vulnerability,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hesitation,⠀remember⠀a⠀shared⠀moment,⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀realize⠀a⠀wish⠀after⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀moved⠀on.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inner⠀response⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀know⠀a⠀conclusion⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀followed⠀its⠀formation.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀reveal⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀ordinary⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀polished⠀banter.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀talk⠀about⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀plan,⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀disagreement⠀while⠀the⠀emotional⠀content⠀sits⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀A⠀direct⠀statement⠀of⠀feeling⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀changed⠀expression,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀moment⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀screen.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamambb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀each⠀installment,⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀in⠀the⠀relationship,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Let⠀progress⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀feelings,⠀decisions,⠀or⠀practical⠀circumstances,⠀not⠀just⠀dramatic⠀events.\n\nLet⠀Maeda-style⠀callbacks⠀act⠀as⠀the⠀serial's⠀connective⠀tissue.⠀When⠀an⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀routine,⠀or⠀relationship⠀detail⠀returns,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀earlier⠀particular⠀so⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀is⠀legible:⠀the⠀jacket⠀she⠀used⠀to⠀borrow,⠀the⠀phrase⠀he⠀said⠀before⠀leaving,⠀the⠀Sunday⠀call⠀that⠀stopped,⠀the⠀seat⠀they⠀always⠀took.⠀Then⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀lands⠀differently⠀now.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀scene.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀care,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀across⠀installments.⠀Let⠀timing⠀and⠀competing⠀obligations⠀create⠀complications⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath:⠀one⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀promise,⠀the⠀next⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀promise⠀colliding⠀with⠀a⠀work⠀shift,⠀a⠀family⠀need,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀doubt.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀around⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀direct⠀confession⠀or⠀decision⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀accumulated⠀history,⠀not⠀required⠀at⠀every⠀turn.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀installment's⠀close⠀natural⠀rather⠀than⠀forced.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀conversation,⠀a⠀pending⠀question,⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀routine,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀realization.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀same⠀thread⠀or⠀move⠀forward⠀in⠀time⠀while⠀preserving⠀what⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀create⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀and⠀relationship⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀system⠀the⠀characters⠀keep⠀trying⠀to⠀understand⠀and⠀work.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀explains⠀a⠀pattern⠀to⠀themselves⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person,⠀make⠀the⠀explanation⠀emotionally⠀costly:⠀it⠀may⠀name⠀what⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀has⠀been⠀avoiding,⠀reveal⠀that⠀a⠀kindness⠀was⠀also⠀a⠀withdrawal,⠀or⠀turn⠀a⠀small⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀into⠀evidence⠀of⠀something⠀neither⠀wants⠀to⠀admit.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀feeling;⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀feeling⠀harder⠀to⠀ignore.\n\nLet⠀a⠀character⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀relationship's⠀rules⠀in⠀concrete⠀ways.⠀Someone⠀may⠀know⠀exactly⠀which⠀question⠀will⠀make⠀the⠀other⠀stay,⠀which⠀apology⠀will⠀be⠀accepted⠀without⠀being⠀believed,⠀or⠀which⠀ordinary⠀task⠀will⠀let⠀them⠀be⠀near⠀without⠀speaking.⠀Show⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀follows,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀register⠀the⠀maneuver⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀is.⠀The⠀hurt⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀accuracy⠀of⠀the⠀move⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀from⠀the⠀intent⠀behind⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀reasoning⠀available:⠀the⠀apology⠀rehearsed⠀and⠀not⠀delivered,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀how⠀much⠀honesty⠀this⠀conversation⠀can⠀hold,⠀the⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀doing⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀so.⠀Let⠀strain⠀reach⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself—what⠀gets⠀over-explained,⠀what⠀is⠀dropped⠀mid-sentence,⠀which⠀topic⠀is⠀handled⠀with⠀too⠀much⠀care—and⠀render⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀borrowed⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.\n\nUse⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀as⠀shifts⠀in⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀plot⠀turns.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀warmth⠀can⠀reverse⠀into⠀the⠀realization⠀that⠀it⠀was⠀offered⠀out⠀of⠀guilt;⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀leave⠀can⠀reverse⠀into⠀the⠀discovery⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀already⠀made⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀for⠀that⠀leaving.⠀Ground⠀each⠀reversal⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀and⠀do,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀tender⠀moment⠀to⠀collapse.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stakes⠀ordinary⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀shared⠀lease,⠀a⠀weekly⠀call,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀under⠀pressure,⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀checking⠀in⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀test.⠀Let⠀practical⠀problems⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀The⠀characters⠀can⠀be⠀competent⠀at⠀understanding⠀their⠀situation⠀and⠀still⠀unable⠀to⠀make⠀it⠀hurt⠀less.\n\nAllow⠀comfort⠀to⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀while⠀knowing⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀repair⠀the⠀underlying⠀problem,⠀or⠀offer⠀care⠀while⠀aware⠀it⠀will⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀a⠀bid⠀for⠀forgiveness.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀exchange⠀without⠀one⠀canceling⠀the⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀repair;⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀strain⠀still⠀active⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀undecided.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀one⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Within⠀that⠀interval,⠀make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀immediate⠀mechanism⠀legible:⠀show⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀accomplish⠀with⠀a⠀question,⠀an⠀offer,⠀a⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀information,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀respond⠀to⠀that⠀maneuver⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀prompt.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀the⠀relationship's⠀rules,⠀explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀briefly⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀realize⠀that⠀agreeing⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀favor⠀will⠀establish⠀a⠀pattern,⠀or⠀that⠀changing⠀the⠀subject⠀will⠀let⠀them⠀keep⠀a⠀promise⠀without⠀discussing⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀explanation⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀preserve⠀the⠀scene's⠀momentum,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀so⠀the⠀other⠀player⠀can⠀read⠀the⠀move.\n\nMaintain⠀an⠀understandable⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀doorway⠀to⠀a⠀kitchen⠀to⠀a⠀phone⠀call,⠀make⠀the⠀transitions⠀concrete:⠀who⠀moved,⠀what⠀they⠀carried,⠀what⠀they⠀noticed.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀detail⠀carry⠀relationship⠀information—proximity,⠀avoidance,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀handled⠀differently.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀its⠀people⠀active⠀around⠀the⠀pair:⠀a⠀third⠀character⠀continues⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives,⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀the⠀weather⠀imposes⠀a⠀practical⠀condition.⠀Resolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person,⠀keeping⠀player⠀control⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀movement.⠀It⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀deciding,⠀while⠀a⠀conversation⠀is⠀still⠀moving,⠀or⠀while⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀is⠀unfinished;⠀the⠀continuation⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀unresolved⠀relationship⠀pressure⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step,⠀not⠀manufactured⠀as⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀The⠀next⠀player's⠀entry⠀point⠀is⠀the⠀live⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀prompt⠀to⠀solve⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀story⠀at⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀particular⠀households,⠀neighbors,⠀workplaces,⠀and⠀family⠀obligations⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀broad⠀social⠀panorama,⠀and⠀organize⠀scenes⠀around⠀the⠀visits,⠀shared⠀meals,⠀errands,⠀and⠀small⠀negotiations⠀of⠀daily⠀proximity⠀through⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀actually⠀meet.⠀Let⠀kitchens,⠀stairwells,⠀market⠀streets,⠀and⠀bus⠀stops⠀be⠀the⠀concrete⠀places⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀moves.\n\nTreat⠀social⠀expectation⠀and⠀family⠀obligation⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀system⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀explain,⠀exploit,⠀or⠀misunderstand.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀knows⠀that⠀accepting⠀an⠀invitation⠀will⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀a⠀commitment,⠀that⠀a⠀gift⠀creates⠀a⠀specific⠀debt,⠀or⠀that⠀silence⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀a⠀relative⠀protects⠀one⠀person⠀while⠀wounding⠀another,⠀make⠀that⠀knowledge⠀concrete⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀maneuver⠀and⠀its⠀result.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀recognize⠀the⠀move,⠀accept⠀it,⠀or⠀misread⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀misreading⠀should⠀have⠀consequences.\n\nLet⠀moral⠀instinct⠀and⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problems⠀interact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀be⠀honest⠀but⠀also⠀need⠀to⠀preserve⠀face⠀for⠀someone⠀else;⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀where⠀to⠀live⠀or⠀whom⠀to⠀tell⠀may⠀be⠀both⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀and⠀a⠀declaration⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀these⠀tensions⠀to⠀a⠀simple⠀conflict⠀between⠀modern⠀desire⠀and⠀traditional⠀duty—let⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀specific⠀community⠀define⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀may⠀register⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀while⠀staying⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀immediate⠀experience;⠀do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀generic⠀setting,⠀cast⠀identity,⠀or⠀stock⠀speech⠀onto⠀the⠀story.\n\nMaintain⠀an⠀understandable⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀in⠀attention⠀or⠀location.⠀A⠀conversation⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀kitchen⠀to⠀a⠀corridor⠀to⠀the⠀street⠀outside;⠀make⠀each⠀transition⠀concrete⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀movement⠀carry⠀relationship⠀information.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀obligation⠀still⠀unmet,⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀still⠀active,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀postponed,⠀without⠀dissipating⠀the⠀emotional⠀pressure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀concrete⠀physical⠀detail⠀and⠀material⠀wear.⠀A⠀shared⠀apartment⠀shows⠀its⠀history⠀in⠀a⠀cracked⠀tile,⠀a⠀chair⠀only⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀uses,⠀a⠀phone⠀charger⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀room.⠀Let⠀proximity⠀register⠀as⠀actual⠀distance⠀and⠀movement:⠀who⠀steps⠀back,⠀who⠀reaches⠀past,⠀who⠀sits⠀where.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀to⠀move⠀between⠀beats⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀the⠀relationship's⠀rules,⠀make⠀the⠀mechanism⠀visible⠀in⠀action⠀and⠀object.⠀Someone⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀key⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀to⠀test⠀whether⠀the⠀other⠀will⠀pick⠀it⠀up,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀question⠀meant.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀briefly⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀result.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀compression⠀erase⠀the⠀causal⠀link⠀between⠀understanding⠀and⠀action.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀ordinary⠀and⠀specific.⠀Money,⠀work⠀schedules,⠀a⠀broken⠀appliance,⠀a⠀long⠀commute,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat—these⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀pressure.⠀Let⠀a⠀practical⠀problem⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀without⠀inflating⠀it⠀into⠀melodrama.⠀The⠀characters⠀can⠀be⠀tired,⠀competent,⠀and⠀wrong⠀about⠀each⠀other.\n\nUse⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀can⠀hold⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀while⠀they⠀work⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀gesture⠀meant⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀about⠀to⠀do;⠀a⠀short⠀sentence⠀can⠀land⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀clipped⠀or⠀every⠀observation⠀hard-boiled.⠀Let⠀the⠀prose's⠀edge⠀come⠀from⠀precision⠀rather⠀than⠀uniform⠀toughness.\n\nGround⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀blunt⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀exhausted,⠀because⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀end⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀because⠀they⠀think⠀honesty⠀is⠀kinder;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀hear⠀it⠀as⠀attack⠀or⠀as⠀relief.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀situation⠀unresolved⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀still⠀being⠀weighed,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀repair.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires—a⠀letter,⠀a⠀text⠀thread,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀shared⠀calendar⠀entry,⠀a⠀receipt⠀with⠀a⠀line⠀added—and⠀do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀mechanically.⠀Let⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀form⠀carry⠀meaning:⠀it⠀says⠀how⠀formal⠀the⠀writer⠀intends⠀to⠀be,⠀how⠀much⠀delay⠀they⠀can⠀afford,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀to⠀keep⠀deniable.\n\nTreat⠀each⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀legible⠀system.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀something⠀they⠀know⠀will⠀be⠀read⠀twice,⠀omit⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀include,⠀or⠀send⠀a⠀message⠀at⠀a⠀time⠀chosen⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀specific⠀effect.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀the⠀maneuver,⠀let⠀the⠀document⠀show⠀that⠀understanding—what⠀it⠀is⠀for,⠀what⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀recipient⠀believe⠀or⠀feel,⠀what⠀it⠀lets⠀the⠀writer⠀avoid⠀saying—then⠀show⠀the⠀result⠀through⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀or⠀the⠀material⠀trace⠀of⠀its⠀reception:⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀answers⠀the⠀wrong⠀question,⠀an⠀entry⠀crossed⠀out⠀and⠀rewritten,⠀a⠀note⠀kept⠀when⠀it⠀should⠀have⠀been⠀thrown⠀away.\n\nLet⠀a⠀character⠀misjudge⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀can⠀do.⠀Someone⠀may⠀think⠀a⠀written⠀apology⠀will⠀close⠀a⠀matter⠀the⠀recipient⠀reads⠀as⠀another⠀evasion;⠀someone⠀may⠀keep⠀a⠀letter⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀the⠀writer⠀never⠀intended⠀to⠀make.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀or⠀reader⠀believes⠀is⠀relationship⠀complication,⠀not⠀an⠀error⠀to⠀be⠀corrected⠀at⠀once.⠀Treat⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀it⠀shows⠀the⠀choices⠀its⠀writer⠀made,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀entire⠀live⠀mind⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀composition.\n\nUse⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀to⠀reveal⠀events⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀calendar⠀entry⠀may⠀contradict⠀a⠀later⠀message;⠀a⠀draft⠀may⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀considered⠀saying⠀before⠀choosing⠀the⠀safer⠀version.⠀Keep⠀each⠀document⠀inside⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀could⠀know⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀situation⠀would⠀conceal—a⠀message⠀to⠀one⠀recipient⠀may⠀hide⠀what⠀a⠀note⠀to⠀another⠀reveals.⠀Let⠀the⠀sequence⠀and⠀the⠀concrete⠀differences⠀between⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀story;⠀do⠀not⠀step⠀outside⠀them⠀for⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship's⠀care⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀system⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀and⠀work.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀exactly⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀which⠀chair⠀they⠀prefer,⠀what⠀kind⠀of⠀quiet⠀they⠀need⠀after⠀a⠀hard⠀day,⠀or⠀which⠀small⠀task⠀will⠀make⠀a⠀difficult⠀morning⠀easier.⠀Show⠀the⠀knowledge⠀in⠀action:⠀the⠀character⠀uses⠀it⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀specific⠀choice,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀registers⠀the⠀care⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀is.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀the⠀rules⠀of⠀care,⠀keep⠀the⠀move⠀concrete⠀and⠀affectionate.⠀Someone⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀familiar⠀joke⠀to⠀ease⠀tension,⠀offer⠀a⠀distraction⠀they⠀know⠀will⠀be⠀accepted,⠀or⠀choose⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀that⠀lets⠀them⠀be⠀near⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀conversation.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀briefly⠀when⠀it⠀matters—what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀doing⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀believe⠀it⠀will⠀work—then⠀show⠀the⠀result.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀misread⠀it,⠀or⠀push⠀back⠀without⠀the⠀warmth⠀collapsing.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair.⠀The⠀characters⠀can⠀enjoy⠀each⠀other's⠀company⠀and⠀still⠀have⠀unfinished⠀disagreements⠀or⠀private⠀worries;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀turn⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀Personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀stay⠀intact:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀alone,⠀may⠀refuse⠀help,⠀or⠀may⠀offer⠀care⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀is⠀clumsy⠀but⠀real.\n\nUse⠀rapid⠀reversals⠀as⠀small⠀shifts⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀texture⠀rather⠀than⠀plot⠀turns.⠀A⠀comfortable⠀silence⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀practical⠀problem;⠀a⠀plan⠀for⠀the⠀evening⠀changes⠀because⠀of⠀work⠀or⠀weather;⠀the⠀characters⠀adjust,⠀accommodate,⠀and⠀continue,⠀the⠀warmth⠀surviving⠀the⠀change⠀without⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reconciliation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stakes⠀ordinary⠀and⠀specific:⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀shared⠀errand,⠀a⠀night⠀of⠀poor⠀sleep,⠀a⠀small⠀celebration.⠀The⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀these⠀repeated⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀attention⠀they⠀show.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀movement⠀ends—mid-task,⠀mid-conversation,⠀mid-evening—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement,⠀narration⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀open⠀with⠀enough⠀social⠀context⠀to⠀frame⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake—the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀a⠀prior⠀decision⠀that⠀still⠀conditions⠀how⠀these⠀people⠀can⠀speak⠀to⠀each⠀other—while⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀remain⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀the⠀relationship's⠀rules,⠀explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀within⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀aside.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀understand⠀that⠀attending⠀a⠀particular⠀gathering⠀will⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀a⠀declaration,⠀that⠀a⠀carefully⠀worded⠀question⠀will⠀force⠀an⠀answer⠀without⠀seeming⠀to⠀ask,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀shared⠀obligation⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀remain⠀in⠀contact.⠀Show⠀the⠀reasoning,⠀then⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀consequence,⠀so⠀the⠀explanation⠀reads⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀narration's⠀judgment⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀technical⠀interruption.\n\nMaintain⠀an⠀understandable⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀shifts.⠀If⠀the⠀action⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀dining⠀room⠀to⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀car,⠀make⠀the⠀transitions⠀deliberate⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀movement⠀carry⠀relationship⠀information:⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀walks⠀ahead,⠀who⠀holds⠀a⠀door.⠀The⠀slower⠀pace⠀does⠀not⠀blur⠀the⠀causal⠀chain;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀still⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀trace⠀what⠀each⠀character⠀did⠀and⠀why.\n\nUse⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀and⠀judgment⠀to⠀deepen⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀it.⠀A⠀family's⠀expectations,⠀a⠀community's⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀proper⠀may⠀shape⠀the⠀choices⠀available,⠀but⠀the⠀relationship⠀remains⠀particular:⠀these⠀two⠀people,⠀their⠀specific⠀history,⠀their⠀specific⠀ways⠀of⠀hurting⠀and⠀caring⠀for⠀each⠀other.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀performance⠀and⠀private⠀knowledge⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀it.\n\nLet⠀reversals⠀operate⠀within⠀the⠀longer⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀prose.⠀A⠀realization⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀how⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀looks,⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀the⠀character⠀finally⠀understands⠀differently,⠀revising⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding⠀of⠀what⠀came⠀before⠀without⠀a⠀dramatic⠀break⠀in⠀the⠀narration.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀unresolved,⠀the⠀social⠀pressure⠀still⠀active,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀decision⠀still⠀being⠀weighed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀present⠀occasion⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀relationship:⠀one⠀character⠀wants⠀time,⠀reassurance,⠀an⠀explanation,⠀a⠀favor,⠀or⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀stay,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀answers⠀with⠀a⠀story⠀because⠀the⠀direct⠀statement⠀would⠀cost⠀too⠀much⠀or⠀arrive⠀wrong.⠀Keep⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀alive⠀around⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupt,⠀challenge⠀a⠀detail,⠀supply⠀a⠀correction,⠀laugh⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀or⠀go⠀quiet,⠀so⠀the⠀narration⠀becomes⠀a⠀negotiation⠀between⠀two⠀particular⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀performance.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀as⠀romantic⠀action.⠀Where⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀permits,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀believes⠀the⠀listener⠀needs⠀to⠀hear⠀and⠀what⠀shame,⠀caution,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀holds⠀back;⠀where⠀access⠀stays⠀outside⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀let⠀the⠀omission⠀show⠀as⠀pattern⠀—⠀a⠀smoothness⠀where⠀an⠀account⠀should⠀catch.⠀The⠀embedded⠀tale⠀can⠀parallel,⠀contradict,⠀or⠀revise⠀the⠀outer⠀relationship,⠀but⠀anchor⠀the⠀connection⠀in⠀concrete⠀shared⠀material:⠀an⠀object⠀within⠀reach⠀during⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀listener⠀recognizes,⠀a⠀place⠀both⠀know,⠀a⠀promise⠀whose⠀timing⠀matters.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀tale⠀turns⠀on⠀how⠀a⠀rule,⠀bargain,⠀or⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀worked,⠀make⠀that⠀mechanism⠀clear⠀enough⠀that⠀its⠀consequence⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀afterward;⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀exploitation⠀inside⠀the⠀story⠀should⠀have⠀causes⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀pick⠀at.⠀Keep⠀physical⠀sequences⠀trackable⠀through⠀quick⠀shifts:⠀who⠀moves,⠀what⠀changes⠀hands,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀notices⠀before⠀speaking.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tale⠀work⠀as⠀disclosure⠀with⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀completed⠀confession.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀misread⠀it,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀sharper⠀question;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀realize⠀mid-sentence⠀what⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀given⠀away.⠀A⠀returning⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀can⠀gather⠀new⠀meaning⠀without⠀sealing⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Stop⠀wherever⠀the⠀telling⠀actually⠀reaches⠀—⠀mid-question,⠀mid-answer,⠀with⠀the⠀larger⠀matter⠀between⠀them⠀still⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀mode.⠀The⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀remember⠀and⠀live:⠀an⠀institutional⠀notice,⠀a⠀form⠀with⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀letter⠀kept⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀photograph⠀whose⠀caption⠀is⠀wrong,⠀a⠀public⠀account⠀of⠀an⠀event⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀survived.⠀When⠀a⠀document⠀matters,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀was⠀produced,⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀permits⠀or⠀denies;⠀let⠀it⠀enter⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀object⠀with⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀atmosphere.\n\nTie⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀set⠀a⠀remembered⠀evening⠀against⠀a⠀later⠀entry,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀omits⠀a⠀private⠀decision⠀no⠀one⠀thought⠀to⠀record,⠀and⠀feel⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀versions⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀event⠀—⠀the⠀rereading,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀speaking.⠀Let⠀records⠀create⠀specific⠀pressure:⠀a⠀mistaken⠀entry,⠀an⠀inherited⠀obligation,⠀a⠀housing⠀rule,⠀a⠀work⠀record⠀that⠀complicates⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀say⠀to⠀the⠀other.⠀Let⠀the⠀sentences⠀follow⠀the⠀teller's⠀temperament⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀official⠀register.\n\nMake⠀the⠀interaction⠀of⠀rule⠀and⠀resource⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀an⠀arrangement⠀—⠀a⠀filing⠀that⠀freezes⠀a⠀status,⠀an⠀access⠀right,⠀a⠀repayment⠀schedule⠀—⠀explain⠀its⠀operation⠀briefly,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀cost.⠀Asymmetric⠀knowledge⠀becomes⠀intimacy's⠀material:⠀one⠀understands⠀the⠀system,⠀the⠀other⠀understands⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀a⠀person,⠀and⠀their⠀disagreement⠀is⠀about⠀how⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀concrete⠀constraint,⠀not⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀more⠀sincere.\n\nLet⠀trust⠀grow⠀through⠀acts⠀of⠀comparison:⠀correcting⠀an⠀account,⠀revealing⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀cannot⠀show,⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀preserve.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀stays⠀particular⠀—⠀a⠀version⠀amended,⠀a⠀question⠀opened,⠀a⠀plan⠀quietly⠀revised⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀document⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀anything.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀mid-reading,⠀mid-argument,⠀or⠀mid-decision,⠀with⠀the⠀larger⠀question⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀encounter⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life:⠀an⠀inherited⠀obligation,⠀a⠀family⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀building⠀decaying⠀under⠀a⠀lease⠀nobody⠀can⠀break,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀weight⠀on⠀this⠀street.⠀Make⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀material⠀—⠀worn⠀surfaces,⠀rooms⠀where⠀public⠀faces⠀are⠀maintained,⠀smaller⠀spaces⠀where⠀someone⠀speaks⠀more⠀plainly⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀texture⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀touch,⠀promise,⠀or⠀refusal⠀is⠀experienced⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀receiving⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀rule,⠀debt,⠀expectation,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀restricts⠀a⠀choice,⠀lay⠀out⠀its⠀mechanism⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀might⠀be⠀exploited⠀or⠀misunderstood:⠀who⠀enforces⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀depends⠀on,⠀what⠀ignoring⠀it⠀would⠀cost.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀taken⠀and⠀its⠀price.⠀Split⠀the⠀knowledge⠀deliberately⠀—⠀one⠀character⠀understands⠀one⠀layer⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement,⠀the⠀other⠀a⠀different⠀layer⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀closeness⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀comparison⠀of⠀partial⠀views.\n\nTreat⠀social⠀masks⠀as⠀relationship⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀evidence⠀of⠀deceit.⠀A⠀character⠀performs⠀competence,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀indifference⠀in⠀public⠀and⠀lets⠀that⠀face⠀loosen⠀in⠀trusted⠀company;⠀the⠀private⠀moment⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressures,⠀not⠀scheduled⠀by⠀the⠀form.⠀Morally⠀complicated⠀desire⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀wariness⠀—⠀the⠀fear⠀of⠀becoming⠀another⠀inherited⠀burden⠀is⠀a⠀real⠀motive⠀—⠀and⠀neither⠀person⠀is⠀a⠀reward⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀owed.\n\nKeep⠀any⠀sudden⠀change⠀legible:⠀a⠀reversal⠀should⠀overturn⠀an⠀assumption⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀watched⠀operating,⠀then⠀settle⠀into⠀intimate,⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀Inherited⠀power⠀here⠀works⠀through⠀documents,⠀debts,⠀habit,⠀and⠀fear⠀—⠀not⠀imported⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀Give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀live⠀private⠀experience⠀throughout:⠀attention⠀snagging⠀on⠀a⠀detail,⠀the⠀calculation⠀before⠀a⠀disclosure.⠀Let⠀the⠀encounter⠀stop⠀where⠀it⠀actually⠀arrives⠀—⠀mid-negotiation,⠀mid-departure⠀—⠀without⠀delivering⠀a⠀verdict⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism:⠀the⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀operation⠀of⠀family,⠀work,⠀money,⠀housing,⠀and⠀community⠀expectation⠀in⠀these⠀characters'⠀lives.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies,⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀obligation⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀people⠀and⠀households⠀involved⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀or⠀an⠀imposed⠀pattern⠀of⠀code-switching.\n\nMake⠀each⠀obligation's⠀mechanism⠀legible.⠀When⠀an⠀expectation,⠀financial⠀arrangement,⠀work⠀schedule,⠀or⠀social⠀rule⠀limits⠀a⠀choice,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀works⠀—⠀who⠀enforces⠀it,⠀what⠀resource⠀it⠀depends⠀on,⠀what⠀happens⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀ignored⠀or⠀misread⠀—⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀exploit⠀a⠀gap,⠀mistake⠀another⠀person's⠀position,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀cooperation⠀changes⠀the⠀available⠀options,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀aftermath.\n\nLet⠀attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀travel⠀through⠀daily⠀life:⠀meals,⠀errands,⠀shared⠀work,⠀family⠀visits,⠀phone⠀calls,⠀small⠀decisions⠀about⠀money⠀and⠀time.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀attention⠀carries⠀the⠀feeling⠀—⠀noticing⠀how⠀someone⠀handles⠀a⠀difficult⠀relative,⠀replaying⠀a⠀remark⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀home,⠀hesitating⠀before⠀dialing⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀protect⠀someone's⠀time⠀can⠀mean⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀stated⠀confession.⠀Chemistry⠀comes⠀from⠀these⠀particular⠀temperaments⠀and⠀histories,⠀not⠀from⠀generic⠀flirtation.\n\nKeep⠀disagreement⠀concrete:⠀how⠀to⠀answer⠀an⠀obligation,⠀what⠀to⠀tell⠀a⠀relative,⠀whether⠀a⠀plan⠀is⠀worth⠀its⠀cost.⠀Relatives⠀and⠀elders⠀are⠀not⠀uniform⠀obstacles⠀—⠀some⠀help,⠀some⠀misunderstand,⠀some⠀change⠀their⠀minds.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀stays⠀specific:⠀a⠀revised⠀plan,⠀a⠀question⠀opened,⠀a⠀private⠀realization,⠀a⠀clearer⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀belonging⠀together⠀would⠀require.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀mid-errand,⠀mid-argument,⠀or⠀mid-decision;⠀no⠀settled⠀summary⠀beat⠀is⠀needed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀mode⠀of⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism:⠀the⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀particular⠀daily⠀situations⠀—⠀work,⠀errands,⠀meals,⠀seasonal⠀shifts,⠀family⠀contact,⠀shared⠀tasks⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀decisions⠀that⠀reveal⠀how⠀each⠀person⠀carries⠀pressure.⠀Follow⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning⠀and⠀attention⠀at⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀already⠀sets;⠀take⠀a⠀diary⠀form⠀or⠀first⠀person⠀only⠀if⠀that⠀narrator⠀works⠀that⠀way.⠀Seasonal⠀changes,⠀plain⠀argument,⠀and⠀open⠀feeling⠀are⠀available⠀as⠀this⠀character's⠀own⠀register⠀—⠀no⠀universal⠀hush⠀and⠀no⠀required⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀schedule,⠀workplace⠀rule,⠀family⠀expectation,⠀housing⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀financial⠀limit⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀pair,⠀show⠀the⠀mechanism⠀and⠀what⠀could⠀be⠀misunderstood⠀or⠀exploited.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀rule⠀as⠀negotiable⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀treats⠀it⠀as⠀fixed;⠀let⠀the⠀disagreement⠀be⠀about⠀that⠀concrete⠀situation,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀verdict⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀more⠀serious.\n\nLet⠀interiority⠀carry⠀the⠀romance:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀gesture,⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀hesitates⠀before⠀speaking,⠀weighs⠀what⠀a⠀disclosure⠀would⠀cost⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀might⠀buy.⠀Keep⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀closed⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀opens⠀it.⠀Use⠀omission⠀deliberately,⠀visible⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀own⠀choice⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀—⠀a⠀sentence⠀begun⠀and⠀not⠀finished⠀—⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀silence⠀into⠀a⠀repressed⠀confession.\n\nTrust⠀can⠀grow⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀corrected⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀protected⠀time⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀ladder⠀of⠀confessions.⠀Aftermath⠀stays⠀specific:⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀one⠀character⠀more⠀certain⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀more⠀cautious.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀edge⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀mid-reply,⠀mid-thought⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀larger⠀question⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction:⠀the⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀city⠀—⠀streets,⠀transit,⠀work⠀rhythms,⠀housing,⠀noise,⠀the⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀that⠀put⠀two⠀people⠀in⠀each⠀other's⠀path⠀or⠀keep⠀them⠀apart.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies.⠀Treat⠀the⠀marvelous⠀as⠀one⠀register⠀among⠀others,⠀not⠀a⠀default,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.\n\nMake⠀urban⠀pressures⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀commute,⠀rent,⠀a⠀job⠀schedule,⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀process,⠀or⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀arrangement⠀affects⠀the⠀characters,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀actually⠀works⠀and⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀might⠀exploit⠀or⠀misread⠀it.⠀One⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀shortcut,⠀a⠀contact,⠀or⠀a⠀rule;⠀the⠀other⠀knows⠀the⠀personal⠀cost.⠀Intimacy⠀develops⠀through⠀the⠀comparison⠀of⠀those⠀partial⠀views,⠀followed⠀by⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀concrete⠀consequence.\n\nStay⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀mind:⠀registering⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀fatigue,⠀remembering⠀a⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀meeting,⠀reasoning⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀invitation⠀would⠀mean⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀would⠀expose.⠀Keep⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀interior⠀unavailable⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀access.⠀Desire⠀can⠀be⠀immediate⠀or⠀slow,⠀but⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀histories⠀and⠀habits.⠀Let⠀a⠀shared⠀walk,⠀a⠀delayed⠀bus,⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀errand⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀without⠀the⠀city⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀metaphor⠀for⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nAftermath⠀remains⠀specific:⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀an⠀exposed⠀misunderstanding,⠀one⠀character⠀readier⠀to⠀risk⠀disclosure⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀turns⠀cautious.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀mid-walk,⠀mid-conversation,⠀or⠀mid-decision;⠀no⠀required⠀turn,⠀revelation,⠀or⠀closure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀problem⠀or⠀question⠀is⠀already⠀live.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀—⠀arrivals,⠀departures,⠀objects⠀passed⠀between⠀hands⠀—⠀and⠀break⠀paragraphs⠀readably⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀tracks⠀without⠀rereading.⠀Give⠀any⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀a⠀clear⠀first⠀presentation⠀when⠀it⠀starts⠀to⠀matter.\n\nMake⠀the⠀relationship's⠀practical⠀machinery⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀schedule,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀affects⠀the⠀pair,⠀explain⠀its⠀operation⠀briefly⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action:⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀a⠀gap,⠀misreads⠀a⠀condition,⠀or⠀finds⠀that⠀cooperation⠀changes⠀the⠀options.⠀Asymmetric⠀knowledge⠀is⠀fine;⠀their⠀disagreement⠀can⠀be⠀about⠀how⠀to⠀answer⠀the⠀constraint⠀rather⠀than⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀more⠀sincere.\n\nGive⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀line⠀or⠀action,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀register⠀its⠀effect⠀—⠀attention⠀shifting,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀private⠀recalculation⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀next.⠀Reactions⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀as⠀their⠀owner⠀actually⠀is;⠀no⠀beat⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀quip,⠀and⠀no⠀pause⠀a⠀hidden⠀confession.⠀Let⠀the⠀romance⠀develop⠀through⠀specific⠀gestures,⠀memories,⠀and⠀decisions⠀rather⠀than⠀generic⠀flirting.\n\nAftermath⠀can⠀be⠀immediate⠀and⠀concrete⠀—⠀a⠀plan⠀changed,⠀a⠀question⠀raised,⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀shared⠀—⠀or⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀inside⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀First⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀available⠀choices,⠀not⠀requirements.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBegin⠀each⠀passage⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀act⠀of⠀attention,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀or⠀care:⠀one⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀specific⠀thing⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀and⠀does⠀something⠀with⠀that⠀knowledge.⠀State⠀the⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀briefly⠀and⠀clearly—what⠀was⠀observed,⠀what⠀it⠀allowed,⠀what⠀choice⠀followed.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀expand⠀from⠀that⠀act⠀into⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀felt⠀understanding⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀relationship.⠀The⠀lyric⠀movement⠀should⠀grow⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀act's⠀actual⠀consequence,⠀not⠀replace⠀it.\n\nAnchor⠀images⠀and⠀recurring⠀sounds⠀in⠀material⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀supplies:⠀an⠀object⠀handled,⠀a⠀repeated⠀street⠀noise,⠀a⠀fabric⠀or⠀surface⠀touched,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀earlier.⠀When⠀a⠀comparison⠀extends,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀now⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀or⠀about⠀their⠀position⠀together.⠀Keep⠀the⠀causal⠀sequence⠀visible⠀beneath⠀the⠀rhythm:⠀the⠀act,⠀the⠀interpretation,⠀the⠀resulting⠀shift⠀in⠀proximity⠀or⠀trust.⠀If⠀the⠀lyric⠀expansion⠀slows⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀the⠀slowing⠀itself⠀should⠀register⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀risked⠀or⠀received.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀an⠀image⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀application.⠀The⠀remembered⠀object⠀or⠀sound⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀new⠀meaning⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀circumstance,⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀announcing⠀its⠀symbolism.⠀Keep⠀all⠀private⠀response⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀focal⠀character's⠀access;⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀interior⠀remains⠀unavailable⠀unless⠀the⠀narration⠀permits⠀it.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀causal⠀movement⠀reaches⠀a⠀pause—an⠀act⠀completed,⠀a⠀question⠀opened,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀understanding⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀available⠀but⠀not⠀yet⠀taken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀reflective⠀passage⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀relationship's⠀working⠀rules:⠀a⠀sentence⠀someone⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀now,⠀an⠀obligation⠀kept⠀or⠀dropped,⠀a⠀habit⠀one⠀person⠀no⠀longer⠀performs,⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀known⠀routine⠀used⠀to⠀occur.⠀Name⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀expectation⠀that⠀detail⠀once⠀served,⠀then⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀differs⠀from⠀that⠀operation.⠀The⠀reflection⠀unfolds⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀mechanism⠀used⠀to⠀accomplish⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀accomplishes⠀now.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀moving⠀beneath⠀the⠀memory.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀shifts⠀from⠀present⠀to⠀past,⠀let⠀a⠀sensory⠀cue⠀or⠀an⠀action⠀in⠀progress⠀carry⠀the⠀association:⠀a⠀chore⠀being⠀finished,⠀a⠀wait,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange.⠀The⠀present⠀moment⠀should⠀remain⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀push⠀against⠀the⠀memory.⠀Show⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀current⠀experience⠀and⠀remembered⠀possibility⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀contrast—the⠀same⠀street⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀routine,⠀a⠀phrase⠀now⠀used⠀differently,⠀a⠀task⠀once⠀shared⠀and⠀now⠀done⠀alone.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀loss.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀ordinary,⠀and⠀affection⠀can⠀still⠀work⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀reflection⠀works⠀by⠀noticing⠀which⠀changes⠀are⠀irreversible⠀and⠀which⠀routines⠀still⠀hold,⠀not⠀by⠀claiming⠀every⠀good⠀thing⠀is⠀already⠀gone.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀pause,⠀with⠀the⠀comparison⠀between⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀left⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀without⠀a⠀required⠀summary⠀or⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀framed-oral-storytelling⠀route.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀narrator,⠀teller,⠀or⠀memorial⠀voice⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀particular⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀story⠀being⠀told—someone⠀who⠀heard⠀it,⠀witnessed⠀part⠀of⠀it,⠀or⠀later⠀learned⠀what⠀had⠀been⠀hidden.⠀Establish⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two,⠀then⠀move⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀story⠀operate⠀on⠀its⠀own.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀teller's⠀later⠀knowledge⠀adds⠀an⠀echo,⠀corrects⠀a⠀public⠀version,⠀or⠀notes⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀known⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀framed⠀telling,⠀ground⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀social,⠀domestic,⠀or⠀urban⠀realism.⠀Each⠀scene⠀uses⠀a⠀concrete⠀situation—a⠀conversation,⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀household⠀task—and⠀makes⠀its⠀rules⠀legible:⠀what⠀the⠀family⠀or⠀community⠀expects,⠀what⠀resource⠀or⠀reputation⠀is⠀at⠀stake,⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀that⠀lets⠀them⠀act⠀effectively.⠀The⠀romantic⠀relationship⠀grows⠀through⠀these⠀interactions.⠀Attention⠀means⠀noticing⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀needs⠀under⠀the⠀current⠀constraint.⠀Disclosure⠀happens⠀under⠀practical⠀pressure,⠀and⠀care⠀often⠀takes⠀the⠀form⠀of⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀help⠀publicly⠀or⠀privately.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀frame's⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀private⠀access.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀was⠀later⠀known,⠀but⠀within⠀the⠀scene⠀one⠀character⠀cannot⠀hear⠀the⠀other's⠀hidden⠀thought.⠀Use⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀add⠀meaning⠀after⠀the⠀fact,⠀not⠀to⠀grant⠀omniscience⠀during⠀it.⠀End⠀the⠀framed⠀account⠀where⠀the⠀tale's⠀listeners⠀or⠀the⠀recorder⠀would⠀naturally⠀pause,⠀leaving⠀the⠀relationship⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀change.⠀The⠀form⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀love,⠀but⠀the⠀present⠀interactions⠀must⠀themselves⠀do⠀the⠀romantic⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romantic⠀situation⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details.⠀Each⠀scene⠀selects⠀one⠀concrete⠀thing—an⠀object,⠀a⠀movement,⠀a⠀phrase—and⠀uses⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀observation,⠀inference,⠀and⠀choice⠀meet.⠀The⠀chosen⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀infer⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀or⠀the⠀relationship.⠀State⠀the⠀observation⠀and⠀the⠀resulting⠀choice⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Do⠀not⠀accumulate⠀adjectives⠀or⠀repeat⠀the⠀emotional⠀import⠀in⠀a⠀following⠀sentence;⠀the⠀inference⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀weight.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀causal⠀sequence⠀with⠀the⠀fewest⠀words⠀that⠀remain⠀precise.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀attention⠀or⠀care,⠀give⠀the⠀observation⠀that⠀allowed⠀it⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀followed.⠀Omit⠀explanations⠀the⠀action⠀already⠀supplies.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀misunderstands⠀another's⠀behavior,⠀make⠀the⠀wrong⠀inference⠀visible⠀as⠀an⠀inference:⠀include⠀enough⠀of⠀the⠀observed⠀detail⠀to⠀show⠀why⠀the⠀mistake⠀was⠀plausible,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀detail⠀correct⠀or⠀complicate⠀it⠀without⠀a⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀an⠀essential⠀inward⠀connection⠀be⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀necessary,⠀but⠀no⠀longer.⠀A⠀single⠀extended⠀thought⠀works⠀when⠀it⠀supplies⠀information⠀the⠀action⠀alone⠀cannot⠀carry—what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀fears,⠀hopes,⠀or⠀remembers⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀choice⠀significant.⠀Omit⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀inference⠀already⠀provide;⠀do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀interaction⠀reaches⠀its⠀causal⠀pause,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀left⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀its⠀ordinary⠀and⠀consequential⠀interactions.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀external⠀movement⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀observation⠀or⠀memory,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀as⠀the⠀container.⠀A⠀recollection⠀enters⠀because⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀it⠀up,⠀and⠀it⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀or⠀a⠀decision.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀scene,⠀keep⠀the⠀interaction's⠀causal⠀logic⠀clear.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀pays⠀attention⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀reveals⠀care,⠀the⠀chosen⠀memory⠀or⠀observation⠀is⠀a⠀recorded⠀interest;⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀reaction⠀then⠀becomes⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀what⠀that⠀attention⠀meant.⠀When⠀a⠀disclosure⠀places⠀the⠀relationship⠀under⠀pressure,⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀stakes⠀each⠀person⠀is⠀weighing—what⠀they⠀could⠀lose,⠀what⠀they⠀might⠀misunderstand,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀protect—before⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀The⠀romance⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀each⠀beat⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀sentiment;⠀it⠀requires⠀that⠀attention⠀and⠀decision⠀have⠀real⠀consequences⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow.\n\nContemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀voice,⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀practical⠀clarity,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀rhythm.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure,⠀irritation,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀humor⠀to⠀coexist.⠀Do⠀not⠀wrap⠀every⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀summary.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀interaction⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀next⠀move⠀still⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀situation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nWork⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀Each⠀scene⠀selects⠀a⠀moment⠀where⠀the⠀couple's⠀history⠀becomes⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀present:⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀a⠀callback⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀argument,⠀a⠀private⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀ritual.⠀Treat⠀that⠀history⠀as⠀a⠀mechanism⠀the⠀couple⠀has⠀built.⠀Identify⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀understanding⠀it⠀once⠀served,⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀use⠀or⠀refusal⠀accomplishes—whether⠀it⠀eases⠀a⠀disagreement,⠀exposes⠀a⠀remaining⠀fear,⠀or⠀lets⠀one⠀person⠀ask⠀for⠀something⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀ask⠀before.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀interactions⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀recognizable⠀trope⠀labels.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀needs⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀callback⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀consequences,⠀not⠀simply⠀repeat.⠀When⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀reappears,⠀the⠀circumstances⠀have⠀shifted⠀enough⠀that⠀its⠀emotional⠀meaning⠀changes⠀for⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀character.⠀Show⠀that⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀response,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀callback's⠀significance.\n\nMaintain⠀each⠀character's⠀individual⠀voice⠀and⠀private⠀access.⠀The⠀shared⠀language⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀couple,⠀but⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀thinks⠀while⠀using⠀or⠀refusing⠀it⠀may⠀differ.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀interiority⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀other's⠀hidden.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀interaction⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀pause,⠀with⠀the⠀particular⠀consequence⠀the⠀scene⠀was⠀building⠀left⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀The⠀intimacy⠀comes⠀from⠀how⠀well⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀each⠀other's⠀specific⠀rules,⠀not⠀from⠀generic⠀declarations.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀remembered⠀acts.⠀Use⠀a⠀deliberate⠀opening⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀time⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀teller's⠀voice,⠀and⠀introduce⠀each⠀significant⠀turn⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀done:⠀who⠀spoke,⠀who⠀waited,⠀who⠀chose,⠀who⠀broke⠀a⠀pattern.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀deed⠀unfold⠀in⠀concrete⠀action.⠀The⠀declaration⠀names⠀the⠀act;⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀and⠀what⠀knowledge⠀allowed⠀it.\n\nGround⠀each⠀remembered⠀act⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀needs,⠀and⠀practical⠀choices.⠀If⠀one⠀character⠀returns⠀a⠀possession,⠀waits⠀past⠀a⠀known⠀hour,⠀or⠀refuses⠀a⠀request,⠀show⠀the⠀expectation⠀or⠀resource⠀at⠀stake,⠀the⠀observation⠀that⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀act,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀relationship.⠀The⠀romance⠀grows⠀through⠀attention,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀care,⠀not⠀through⠀ceremonial⠀declarations⠀alone.⠀The⠀saga's⠀retelling⠀voice⠀can⠀note⠀that⠀this⠀was⠀remembered,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀must⠀show⠀the⠀relationship⠀working.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀action⠀answers⠀or⠀reverses⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀first⠀meeting⠀may⠀return⠀at⠀a⠀decision⠀point,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀through⠀the⠀events⠀between,⠀not⠀simply⠀echo.⠀Keep⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀scope⠀honest:⠀do⠀not⠀inflate⠀a⠀private⠀kindness⠀into⠀a⠀battle⠀or⠀declare⠀the⠀couple⠀legendary.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀pause⠀to⠀mark⠀consequence,⠀leaving⠀the⠀relationship⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀change.⠀The⠀romance⠀is⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀oral⠀record,⠀not⠀a⠀subplot⠀borrowed⠀from⠀martial⠀epic.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀restrained⠀third-person⠀social-realist⠀mode.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀grow⠀through⠀practical,⠀observable⠀interactions⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration:⠀who⠀offers⠀to⠀carry⠀what,⠀who⠀remembers⠀a⠀preference,⠀who⠀waits⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀who⠀changes⠀a⠀plan.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀stays⠀close⠀but⠀not⠀confessional,⠀observing⠀gesture,⠀tone,⠀and⠀hesitation⠀while⠀keeping⠀clear⠀what⠀each⠀character⠀can⠀and⠀cannot⠀know⠀about⠀the⠀other.\n\nApply⠀Kamachi's⠀clarity⠀by⠀making⠀every⠀relevant⠀practical⠀mechanism⠀legible.⠀When⠀a⠀schedule⠀conflict,⠀a⠀broken⠀bicycle,⠀a⠀shared⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀bus⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀workplace⠀procedure⠀shapes⠀the⠀encounter,⠀briefly⠀explain⠀its⠀rule⠀and⠀use:⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀shift⠀runs,⠀why⠀the⠀part⠀fails,⠀what⠀the⠀competing⠀obligations⠀require.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀consequence.⠀A⠀reversal⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀misread⠀timetable⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀runs⠀out,⠀not⠀from⠀arbitrary⠀secrecy.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀even⠀when⠀feelings⠀make⠀the⠀characters⠀uncertain.\n\nReserve⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀barrier⠀to⠀intimacy.⠀Say⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀complete⠀thought;⠀let⠀a⠀sentence⠀be⠀short,⠀a⠀response⠀delayed,⠀an⠀offer⠀declined⠀for⠀a⠀stated⠀practical⠀reason⠀that⠀is⠀true⠀but⠀incomplete.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀pause⠀or⠀polite⠀refusal⠀to⠀signal⠀hidden⠀passion.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀the⠀inner⠀state⠀through⠀the⠀prose,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀only⠀infer,⠀guess,⠀or⠀miss⠀it.⠀A⠀private⠀realization⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀knowledge⠀in⠀the⠀beloved.\n\nDevelop⠀conflict⠀through⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀ordinary⠀systems:⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀family,⠀a⠀budget⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stretch,⠀a⠀disputed⠀shift,⠀an⠀apartment⠀repair⠀that⠀exposes⠀different⠀habits.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀disagreement⠀into⠀romantic⠀crisis.⠀Show⠀the⠀specific⠀mechanism⠀of⠀the⠀problem,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀characters⠀negotiate⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀emotional⠀skill⠀and⠀blindness⠀they⠀actually⠀possess.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀proper⠀screenplay⠀form:⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀time⠀or⠀place⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀readable⠀and⠀physical:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀they⠀carry,⠀how⠀they⠀stand,⠀what⠀object⠀they⠀notice.⠀Do⠀not⠀include⠀camera⠀directions⠀such⠀as⠀PAN⠀or⠀CLOSE⠀ON;⠀let⠀the⠀scene's⠀staging⠀and⠀editing⠀rhythm⠀follow⠀from⠀written⠀locations⠀and⠀events.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi's⠀habit⠀of⠀legible⠀systems⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀scene⠀clear⠀practical⠀conditions.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀late,⠀identify⠀the⠀bus⠀route⠀and⠀its⠀delay;⠀if⠀a⠀plan⠀fails,⠀show⠀which⠀physical⠀step⠀went⠀wrong;⠀if⠀a⠀resource⠀limits⠀the⠀evening,⠀make⠀the⠀limit⠀visible.⠀Explain⠀such⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀actions⠀and⠀brief⠀attributed⠀context,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀character⠀narrating⠀an⠀instruction⠀manual.⠀Then⠀play⠀the⠀consequence:⠀a⠀missed⠀connection,⠀a⠀saved⠀seat,⠀a⠀repaired⠀window,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀jacket.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀repeated,⠀small,⠀visible⠀choices.⠀The⠀script⠀should⠀show⠀one⠀person⠀replying⠀faster,⠀walking⠀a⠀different⠀route,⠀remembering⠀to⠀bring⠀an⠀extra⠀cup,⠀or⠀waiting⠀after⠀everyone⠀else⠀has⠀left.⠀Keep⠀each⠀action⠀causally⠀connected⠀to⠀a⠀prior⠀fact⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀or⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀generic⠀gazing⠀or⠀slow-motion⠀smiles⠀to⠀create⠀chemistry.\n\nRepresent⠀private⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀set⠀apart⠀from⠀the⠀dialogue.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀spoken,⠀not⠀voice-over,⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀reasoning,⠀worry,⠀or⠀attraction⠀appears⠀there⠀while⠀the⠀public⠀script⠀continues.⠀A⠀note⠀may⠀accompany⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀decision.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀note⠀into⠀a⠀romantic⠀confession.⠀When⠀a⠀feeling⠀is⠀too⠀large⠀to⠀say,⠀let⠀the⠀note⠀carry⠀the⠀actual⠀thought⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀something⠀smaller,⠀or⠀nothing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀stage⠀directions⠀for⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀movement,⠀props,⠀and⠀pauses.⠀Keep⠀stage⠀directions⠀economical⠀and⠀performable:⠀no⠀film⠀edits,⠀no⠀internal⠀states⠀written⠀as⠀visible⠀fact⠀another⠀actor⠀could⠀not⠀perceive.⠀Let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀staging⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀relationship.\n\nBring⠀Kamachi's⠀tactical⠀clarity⠀to⠀the⠀stage⠀by⠀making⠀every⠀relevant⠀practical⠀system⠀physically⠀present.⠀If⠀a⠀key⠀is⠀missing,⠀show⠀who⠀has⠀pockets⠀and⠀who⠀searched⠀where;⠀if⠀a⠀shift⠀roster⠀causes⠀conflict,⠀let⠀the⠀roster⠀be⠀onstage⠀or⠀be⠀referenced⠀as⠀a⠀known⠀object;⠀if⠀a⠀repair⠀requires⠀tools,⠀stage⠀the⠀tools⠀and⠀the⠀blocked⠀action.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀action⠀requires:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀state⠀the⠀bus⠀runs⠀hourly,⠀then⠀the⠀consequence⠀can⠀be⠀staged⠀as⠀waiting⠀or⠀leaving.⠀Reversals⠀arise⠀from⠀someone⠀misunderstanding⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀shared⠀key,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀bicycle,⠀not⠀from⠀invisible⠀forces.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀repeated⠀slight,⠀observable⠀choices:⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀waits⠀near⠀the⠀exit,⠀who⠀offers⠀their⠀own⠀umbrella,⠀who⠀remembers⠀tea⠀is⠀gone⠀and⠀brings⠀a⠀new⠀box,⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀leave⠀when⠀their⠀cue⠀suggests⠀they⠀should.⠀These⠀choices⠀should⠀be⠀staged⠀and⠀worded⠀so⠀an⠀audience⠀can⠀register⠀them.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀obstacles⠀expose⠀care⠀without⠀transforming⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀confession.\n\nRepresent⠀private⠀interiority⠀outside⠀the⠀playable⠀text,⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀aside,⠀monologue,⠀or⠀whispered⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀might⠀hear.⠀Place⠀it⠀where⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀needs⠀additional⠀interior⠀context:⠀a⠀beat⠀before⠀a⠀line,⠀during⠀a⠀held⠀pause,⠀behind⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀stay⠀or⠀go.⠀The⠀private⠀note⠀carries⠀the⠀actual⠀unspoken⠀thought,⠀feeling,⠀or⠀reasoning.⠀Do⠀not⠀tell⠀the⠀actor⠀to⠀display⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀expression⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀openly⠀show⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀follow⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀speech,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀returning⠀concern.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀bend⠀with⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement,⠀but⠀external⠀events⠀must⠀remain⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀same⠀interior⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀characters;⠀their⠀actions⠀and⠀words⠀are⠀observed,⠀not⠀read.\n\nLet⠀Kamachi's⠀legible⠀systems⠀appear⠀as⠀the⠀mind's⠀practical⠀furniture.⠀A⠀remembered⠀bus⠀schedule,⠀a⠀budget⠀calculation,⠀the⠀opening⠀hours⠀of⠀a⠀shop,⠀the⠀rule⠀for⠀whose⠀turn⠀it⠀is⠀to⠀buy⠀milk,⠀the⠀exact⠀reason⠀last⠀week's⠀plan⠀failed—these⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀repeated,⠀concrete⠀mental⠀items.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀thinking⠀character⠀articulate⠀its⠀steps⠀internally⠀or⠀recall⠀witnessing⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀association.⠀A⠀reversal⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀remembered⠀fact⠀snapping⠀into⠀place,⠀a⠀stored⠀warning⠀suddenly⠀recognized,⠀not⠀deliberate⠀cleverness.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀association⠀and⠀return.⠀The⠀beloved⠀appears⠀through⠀a⠀detail:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀their⠀key,⠀a⠀text⠀message⠀opened⠀twice,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀they⠀close⠀a⠀cabinet,⠀the⠀phrase⠀they⠀used⠀that⠀keeps⠀repeating.⠀Let⠀the⠀consciousness⠀compare,⠀imagine,⠀regret,⠀postpone⠀speaking,⠀or⠀rehearse⠀what⠀might⠀be⠀said.⠀Revealed⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀unacknowledged⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀while⠀fully⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀private⠀prose.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀important⠀realization⠀to⠀change⠀an⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat.\n\nKeep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader.⠀Identify⠀place⠀and⠀time⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀has⠀moved⠀to⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀hypothetical.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀cues⠀as⠀anchors.⠀The⠀style⠀may⠀proceed⠀by⠀interruption⠀and⠀recurrence,⠀but⠀the⠀fictional⠀events⠀must⠀retain⠀their⠀causal⠀order;⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀cannot⠀become⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable,⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Keep⠀each⠀person's⠀texting⠀habits⠀distinct:⠀one⠀uses⠀full⠀sentences,⠀one⠀sends⠀fragments;⠀one⠀edits⠀a⠀word,⠀one⠀lets⠀a⠀typo⠀stand;⠀one⠀replies⠀immediately,⠀one⠀takes⠀hours.⠀These⠀habits⠀are⠀observable⠀digital⠀behavior,⠀not⠀always⠀a⠀direct⠀emotional⠀thermometer.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀messaging⠀interface⠀as⠀Kamachi⠀treats⠀a⠀practical⠀system.⠀Explain⠀the⠀relevant⠀rule⠀through⠀the⠀interface⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀matters:⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀means⠀the⠀message⠀was⠀opened⠀at⠀a⠀specific⠀time;⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀means⠀the⠀sender⠀typed⠀and⠀stopped;⠀a⠀delay⠀can⠀be⠀explained⠀by⠀work,⠀travel,⠀or⠀simply⠀not⠀checking.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀consequence.⠀A⠀reversal⠀can⠀be⠀an⠀edited⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀meaning,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀a⠀joke⠀has⠀soured,⠀a⠀reply⠀sent⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀draft⠀left⠀above⠀the⠀compose⠀field.⠀Never⠀invent⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀subtext.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀patterns⠀and⠀accumulated⠀references.⠀Messages⠀recall⠀shared⠀places,⠀remembered⠀preferences,⠀small⠀in-jokes,⠀questions⠀that⠀show⠀attention.⠀A⠀relationship⠀changes⠀when⠀one⠀person⠀begins⠀to⠀answer⠀faster,⠀asks⠀a⠀follow-up⠀instead⠀of⠀leaving⠀a⠀message⠀on⠀read,⠀sends⠀a⠀photo⠀of⠀something⠀noticed⠀earlier,⠀or⠀uses⠀a⠀phrase⠀learned⠀from⠀the⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀equate⠀frequency⠀with⠀love⠀or⠀silence⠀with⠀rejection;⠀each⠀character's⠀real⠀circumstances⠀should⠀explain⠀the⠀pattern.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀distinct⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀and⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀as⠀such,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀unsent.⠀Other⠀private⠀experience—fear,⠀hope,⠀second-guessing,⠀bodily⠀reaction—appears⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀passage,⠀not⠀inside⠀the⠀chat⠀log.⠀The⠀recipient⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀sent.⠀The⠀reader⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀other⠀character,⠀but⠀not⠀through⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀visual-novel⠀prose.⠀Begin⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀concise⠀setting:⠀place,⠀time,⠀relevant⠀background⠀objects.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly.⠀Use⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene,⠀alternating⠀speech,⠀reaction,⠀and⠀small⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀graphical⠀state⠀labels;⠀the⠀style⠀here⠀is⠀presentation,⠀not⠀game⠀logic.\n\nBring⠀Kamachi's⠀mechanical⠀clarity⠀through⠀concrete⠀environmental⠀details.⠀If⠀the⠀timetable⠀matters,⠀mention⠀the⠀posted⠀hours⠀or⠀the⠀watch⠀face;⠀if⠀a⠀missed⠀call⠀changes⠀the⠀evening,⠀show⠀the⠀phone⠀screen⠀and⠀its⠀notification⠀rule;⠀if⠀a⠀place⠀closes,⠀show⠀the⠀shutter⠀coming⠀down⠀or⠀the⠀employee⠀checking⠀the⠀clock.⠀Narrate⠀the⠀rule⠀briefly⠀as⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀understands⠀it:⠀the⠀last⠀bus⠀leaves⠀at⠀eleven,⠀the⠀café⠀stops⠀serving⠀at⠀eight,⠀the⠀spare⠀key⠀is⠀under⠀the⠀mat.⠀Then⠀play⠀the⠀consequence⠀without⠀drifting⠀into⠀abstract⠀explanation.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀repeated,⠀particular⠀observations⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀makes.⠀Notice⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀arrivals,⠀the⠀order⠀they⠀keep,⠀the⠀thing⠀they⠀carry⠀in⠀bad⠀weather,⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀say⠀a⠀name.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀interpret⠀these⠀details⠀with⠀the⠀information⠀actually⠀available:⠀a⠀smile⠀can⠀be⠀warm,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀a⠀feeling;⠀a⠀remembered⠀preference⠀is⠀stronger⠀evidence⠀only⠀when⠀linked⠀to⠀prior⠀action.⠀Keep⠀discoveries⠀contingent;⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀resolution.\n\nRepresent⠀inner⠀response⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀as⠀private⠀prose.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀unspoken⠀reaction,⠀not⠀a⠀spoken⠀line⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀displayed⠀expression.⠀It⠀can⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀small⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀hesitation.⠀The⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀feeling⠀is⠀too⠀large⠀to⠀express,⠀let⠀the⠀inner⠀beat⠀carry⠀the⠀full⠀thought⠀while⠀the⠀spoken⠀line⠀is⠀smaller,⠀clipped,⠀or⠀absent.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamanbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀installment⠀prose⠀with⠀clear⠀re-entry.⠀Begin⠀each⠀update⠀with⠀just⠀enough⠀recoverable⠀context:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀practical⠀situation⠀is⠀underway,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀Use⠀a⠀short⠀reminder⠀of⠀a⠀relevant⠀mechanism⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀will⠀be⠀tested⠀or⠀noticed⠀in⠀the⠀new⠀installment.\n\nLet⠀Kamachi's⠀legibility⠀shape⠀recurring⠀systems.⠀If⠀a⠀shared⠀calendar,⠀shift⠀rota,⠀renovation⠀task,⠀loan⠀plan,⠀or⠀household⠀budget⠀affects⠀the⠀relationship,⠀state⠀its⠀operative⠀rule⠀briefly⠀at⠀its⠀first⠀touch⠀in⠀an⠀update:⠀who⠀pays⠀this⠀week,⠀when⠀the⠀plumber⠀arrives,⠀which⠀room⠀cannot⠀be⠀used,⠀how⠀much⠀remains⠀owed.⠀Then⠀show⠀a⠀character⠀acting⠀on⠀that⠀rule,⠀misreading⠀it,⠀or⠀using⠀it⠀to⠀create⠀an⠀opportunity.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cause-and-effect⠀chain⠀reviewable⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀later⠀update⠀can⠀recall⠀a⠀system's⠀earlier⠀clause⠀exactly,⠀allowing⠀a⠀reversal⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀new⠀rule.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀gradual,⠀traceable⠀changes.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀notice⠀and⠀repeat:⠀a⠀phrase,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀habit,⠀a⠀promise⠀from⠀a⠀previous⠀installment.⠀Make⠀relationship⠀progress⠀concrete—someone⠀clears⠀a⠀schedule,⠀learns⠀a⠀preference,⠀chooses⠀to⠀wait,⠀admits⠀a⠀small⠀fear—rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀increased⠀closeness.⠀Allow⠀disagreement⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀to⠀persist.⠀A⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀confessed⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀update.\n\nClose⠀an⠀installment⠀on⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action.⠀It⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀errand,⠀a⠀text⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀door⠀about⠀to⠀open,⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀simply⠀noticing⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀huge⠀reversal⠀every⠀time.⠀The⠀serial⠀continuation⠀is⠀what⠀sustains⠀interest;⠀the⠀next⠀update⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀mid-scene,⠀later⠀the⠀same⠀evening,⠀or⠀a⠀few⠀days⠀afterward,⠀with⠀the⠀prior⠀consequences⠀carried⠀forward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀lets⠀the⠀other⠀see.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀need,⠀withholds⠀a⠀wound,⠀apologizes,⠀or⠀returns⠀after⠀absence,⠀the⠀admission⠀lands⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀room:⠀a⠀hand⠀stops⠀before⠀touching,⠀a⠀remembered⠀scent⠀attaches⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀hour,⠀a⠀beautiful⠀object⠀now⠀reads⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀already⠀broken.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀sharpens⠀the⠀hurt⠀instead⠀of⠀softening⠀it.⠀A⠀carefully⠀kept⠀room,⠀a⠀gift,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀clothing,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀divided⠀attachment⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀as⠀a⠀symbol.\n\nEmotional⠀turbulence⠀lives⠀in⠀remembered⠀places⠀and⠀sensory⠀detail.⠀A⠀character⠀recalls⠀the⠀same⠀location⠀at⠀two⠀different⠀moments⠀and⠀feels⠀the⠀difference⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀change:⠀cooler⠀air,⠀a⠀different⠀quality⠀of⠀light,⠀an⠀object⠀moved⠀or⠀missing.⠀That⠀concrete⠀shift⠀shows⠀how⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀altered⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Memory⠀is⠀intimate⠀but⠀not⠀reliable⠀comfort;⠀one⠀person's⠀treasured⠀recollection⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀other's⠀proof⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀never⠀fully⠀shared.\n\nStrain⠀alters⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀A⠀difficult⠀exchange⠀may⠀leave⠀one⠀character⠀rehearsing⠀a⠀single⠀phrase⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀proceeds⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀or⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀meeting⠀quieter,⠀more⠀formal,⠀more⠀careful.⠀Not⠀every⠀argument⠀moves⠀toward⠀confession⠀or⠀collapse.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀arrive⠀partially,⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀alongside⠀continued⠀pain:⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀care⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀underlying⠀hurt,⠀and⠀a⠀sincere⠀apology⠀may⠀not⠀restore⠀what⠀it⠀acknowledges.\n\nMatch⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective.⠀A⠀restrained⠀narrator⠀registers⠀turbulence⠀through⠀small⠀physical⠀details⠀and⠀delayed⠀reactions;⠀a⠀more⠀exposed⠀narrator⠀moves⠀between⠀sensory⠀memory⠀and⠀self-accusation.⠀Private⠀thought⠀reveals⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀feels⠀and⠀knows,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀anguish.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀gain⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀interiority⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀between⠀the⠀active⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀speaker⠀or⠀speakers.⠀Keep⠀paragraphs⠀readable⠀and⠀focused:⠀one⠀paragraph⠀establishes⠀a⠀physical⠀detail⠀or⠀remembered⠀sensation,⠀the⠀next⠀carries⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀registers⠀the⠀active⠀character's⠀reaction.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀clearly,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀bury⠀dialogue⠀inside⠀long⠀descriptive⠀passages.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀works⠀through⠀small⠀concrete⠀details—a⠀texture,⠀a⠀temperature,⠀a⠀familiar⠀smell,⠀the⠀way⠀light⠀falls⠀across⠀a⠀table—rather⠀than⠀through⠀extended⠀lyrical⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀slow⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nThe⠀relationship⠀is⠀the⠀organizing⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Attraction,⠀uncertainty,⠀jealousy,⠀care,⠀or⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀place⠀surfaces⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀avoids,⠀or⠀returns⠀to.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀feels⠀present⠀but⠀not⠀decorative:⠀a⠀beautiful⠀room,⠀garment,⠀or⠀object⠀carries⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀reminder⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀claim.⠀The⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attends⠀to⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀responds,⠀not⠀through⠀announced⠀narration.\n\nThe⠀other⠀character⠀remains⠀active⠀and⠀specific.⠀They⠀answer,⠀deflect,⠀misunderstand,⠀offer⠀care,⠀or⠀pursue⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀concern.⠀Their⠀behavior⠀follows⠀from⠀who⠀they⠀are⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀scripted⠀need⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point:⠀after⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀exchange,⠀a⠀gesture⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unasked,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀reaction⠀the⠀active⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀voiced.⠀The⠀scene⠀continues⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀forced⠀choice,⠀a⠀sudden⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route⠀from⠀the⠀Chinese⠀literary⠀traditions⠀profile.⠀The⠀romance⠀lives⠀in⠀particular⠀interiors,⠀streets,⠀households,⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀rhythms⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀abstract⠀emotional⠀space.⠀A⠀room's⠀arrangement,⠀the⠀sound⠀from⠀a⠀courtyard⠀or⠀market,⠀the⠀hour⠀a⠀shop⠀closes,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀family⠀meal⠀is⠀served⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀obligation,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀private⠀feeling.⠀The⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀stay⠀distinct:⠀write⠀the⠀specific⠀manners,⠀objects,⠀and⠀social⠀pressures⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplied,⠀not⠀a⠀generalized⠀inventory⠀of⠀lanterns,⠀tea,⠀or⠀ancestral⠀halls.\n\nAttachment⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀domestic⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀attention.⠀A⠀character⠀notices⠀that⠀someone's⠀sleeve⠀is⠀damp⠀from⠀the⠀walk⠀over,⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀dish⠀has⠀been⠀prepared⠀without⠀being⠀requested,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀route⠀now⠀avoids⠀a⠀certain⠀doorway.⠀These⠀details⠀register⠀care,⠀jealousy,⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀belonging⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀as⠀decorative⠀local⠀color.⠀Beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀operates⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀world:⠀an⠀elegant⠀room⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀place⠀of⠀surveillance,⠀a⠀fine⠀gift⠀arrives⠀with⠀an⠀obligation⠀attached,⠀a⠀remembered⠀street⠀now⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else.\n\nDisclosure⠀and⠀disagreement⠀develop⠀inside⠀the⠀social⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀What⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀courtyard⠀differs⠀from⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀room,⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀awareness⠀of⠀that⠀difference⠀shapes⠀the⠀conversation.⠀Timing⠀and⠀obligation⠀create⠀complications⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath:⠀a⠀delayed⠀meeting,⠀a⠀family⠀demand,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀observation,⠀or⠀a⠀seasonal⠀change⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀risk.⠀The⠀domestic⠀route⠀does⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀relationship⠀into⠀a⠀household⠀vignette;⠀the⠀romance⠀remains⠀the⠀organizing⠀thread,⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀gives⠀its⠀choices⠀specific⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀hard⠀physical⠀particulars.⠀Use⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀diction:⠀a⠀cracked⠀cup,⠀a⠀stain⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀wash⠀out,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀wet⠀coat,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀the⠀soreness⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀walk.⠀Material⠀wear⠀carries⠀emotional⠀wear.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀thing⠀shows⠀its⠀cost—a⠀fine⠀dress⠀mended⠀badly,⠀a⠀gift⠀kept⠀in⠀damaged⠀wrapping,⠀a⠀room⠀elegant⠀at⠀the⠀front⠀and⠀shabby⠀behind⠀the⠀door.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀symbolism;⠀let⠀the⠀object⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀do⠀its⠀work.\n\nCompress⠀transitions⠀and⠀change⠀rhythm⠀with⠀pressure.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀from⠀one⠀concrete⠀beat⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀tense,⠀then⠀hold⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀room.⠀A⠀character⠀registers⠀a⠀lover's⠀arrival⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀small⠀physical⠀facts:⠀footsteps,⠀the⠀click⠀of⠀a⠀latch,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀or⠀smoke,⠀a⠀hand⠀cold⠀against⠀the⠀wrist.⠀Jealousy⠀and⠀divided⠀attachment⠀surface⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀avoids,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀longing.\n\nPhysical⠀stakes⠀stay⠀present⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀romance⠀into⠀survival⠀horror.⠀A⠀difficult⠀conversation⠀happens⠀while⠀someone⠀works,⠀eats,⠀mends,⠀or⠀waits⠀for⠀transport.⠀The⠀body⠀remains⠀involved:⠀a⠀dry⠀throat,⠀a⠀held⠀breath,⠀a⠀flinch,⠀a⠀deliberate⠀refusal⠀to⠀look.⠀Care⠀is⠀practical⠀and⠀imperfect—a⠀meal⠀left⠀covered,⠀a⠀coat⠀offered,⠀a⠀wound⠀cleaned⠀without⠀tenderness.⠀The⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀these⠀acts⠀and⠀their⠀aftermath,⠀not⠀through⠀generic⠀flirting⠀or⠀presumed⠀attraction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀A⠀letter⠀is⠀written⠀to⠀the⠀beloved,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀is⠀private,⠀a⠀note⠀accompanies⠀a⠀returned⠀gift,⠀a⠀household⠀record⠀or⠀receipt⠀preserves⠀an⠀encounter⠀its⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀intend⠀to⠀confess.⠀The⠀form⠀shapes⠀what⠀is⠀said:⠀a⠀letter⠀performs⠀composure⠀while⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀admits⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀performance;⠀a⠀practical⠀note⠀reveals⠀care⠀through⠀its⠀precision;⠀a⠀draft⠀never⠀sent⠀contains⠀the⠀sentence⠀the⠀writer⠀could⠀not⠀risk.\n\nLi⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀operates⠀inside⠀the⠀document's⠀frame.⠀A⠀remembered⠀room,⠀a⠀particular⠀scent,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀fabric,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀rain⠀against⠀a⠀window,⠀or⠀the⠀exact⠀hour⠀of⠀a⠀meeting⠀carries⠀attachment⠀and⠀loss.⠀The⠀document's⠀author⠀lingers⠀on⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail⠀as⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀avoiding⠀or⠀approaching⠀what⠀happened.⠀Beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀records:⠀an⠀elegant⠀object⠀now⠀associated⠀with⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀beautiful⠀place⠀remembered⠀as⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀a⠀wound,⠀a⠀gift⠀described⠀with⠀painful⠀exactness.\n\nGaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀do⠀narrative⠀work.⠀One⠀document⠀omits⠀what⠀another⠀reveals;⠀a⠀later⠀letter⠀corrects⠀or⠀contradicts⠀an⠀earlier⠀account;⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀line⠀remains⠀partially⠀legible.⠀The⠀reader⠀follows⠀the⠀relationship⠀across⠀entries⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀mechanically⠀through⠀every⠀available⠀format;⠀use⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀requires.⠀Date⠀or⠀situate⠀entries⠀where⠀the⠀material⠀permits,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀carry⠀the⠀story's⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀aftermath.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nShow⠀affection⠀through⠀chosen,⠀specific⠀care.⠀A⠀character⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀tea,⠀leaves⠀a⠀particular⠀window⠀open,⠀saves⠀the⠀best⠀piece⠀of⠀fruit,⠀or⠀walks⠀on⠀the⠀shadier⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀street.⠀These⠀details⠀are⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved,⠀not⠀generic⠀romantic⠀gestures.⠀The⠀comfort⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀attention:⠀a⠀familiar⠀preference⠀honored⠀without⠀being⠀announced,⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀task⠀done⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀requested,⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀returned⠀to⠀because⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀them⠀together.\n\nLi⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀makes⠀ease⠀tangible.⠀Warmth⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀step,⠀the⠀particular⠀light⠀of⠀an⠀afternoon⠀room.⠀Beauty⠀is⠀present⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀cost⠀in⠀this⠀register:⠀a⠀lovely⠀object⠀is⠀simply⠀enjoyed,⠀a⠀well-kept⠀room⠀feels⠀like⠀safety,⠀a⠀fine⠀meal⠀is⠀shared⠀without⠀hidden⠀obligation.⠀Not⠀every⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀conceals⠀a⠀wound;⠀some⠀pleasures⠀remain⠀what⠀they⠀are.\n\nPersonality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀stay⠀intact.⠀Affection⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable,⠀and⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀accepts⠀care⠀while⠀keeping⠀a⠀private⠀worry,⠀teases⠀or⠀disagrees⠀during⠀an⠀otherwise⠀tender⠀scene,⠀or⠀needs⠀quiet⠀rather⠀than⠀conversation.⠀The⠀romance⠀remains⠀the⠀organizing⠀thread:⠀the⠀scene⠀develops⠀this⠀particular⠀relationship⠀through⠀proximity,⠀memory,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀domestic⠀vignette⠀with⠀interchangeable⠀participants.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀deliberate,⠀sustained⠀novel⠀prose.⠀Use⠀broader⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀scene⠀with⠀controlled⠀transitions,⠀allowing⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀frame⠀private⠀feeling⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective⠀permits.⠀Narration⠀stays⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language:⠀the⠀prose⠀observes,⠀compares,⠀or⠀reflects⠀without⠀becoming⠀arch⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate.⠀A⠀scene⠀opens⠀with⠀the⠀public⠀face⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀occasion⠀and⠀then⠀moves⠀inward⠀to⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀withholds.\n\nLi⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀operates⠀at⠀narrative⠀distance.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀is⠀rendered⠀with⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀to⠀feel⠀intimate—the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀wooden⠀table,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀stone,⠀the⠀particular⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀door⠀closes—but⠀the⠀narrator⠀holds⠀that⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀larger⠀frame:⠀what⠀the⠀place⠀meant⠀once,⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀now,⠀who⠀else⠀has⠀passed⠀through⠀it.⠀Beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀develops⠀through⠀this⠀framing⠀rather⠀than⠀announcement:⠀an⠀elegant⠀room⠀carries⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀an⠀arrangement⠀that⠀was⠀never⠀freely⠀chosen;⠀a⠀fine⠀object⠀is⠀described⠀with⠀the⠀exactness⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀knows⠀what⠀it⠀cost⠀to⠀keep.\n\nThe⠀relationship⠀develops⠀through⠀timing,⠀obligation,⠀and⠀competing⠀wants,⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath.⠀A⠀meeting⠀is⠀delayed⠀by⠀social⠀expectation,⠀a⠀disclosure⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀setting,⠀and⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀is⠀understood⠀only⠀later.⠀The⠀narrator⠀compares⠀a⠀public⠀gesture⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀contrasts⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀details⠀reveal.⠀Not⠀every⠀paragraph⠀resolves⠀an⠀emotional⠀beat;⠀the⠀prose⠀sustains⠀attention⠀across⠀a⠀scene,⠀building⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀accumulated⠀observation⠀and⠀reflection⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀immediate⠀reactions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀a⠀scene⠀or⠀sequence⠀in⠀which⠀one⠀lover⠀tells⠀a⠀story⠀to⠀another—or⠀to⠀an⠀intimate⠀audience⠀that⠀includes⠀the⠀beloved—under⠀a⠀specific⠀occasion:⠀a⠀request,⠀an⠀argument,⠀a⠀long⠀night,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀explanation⠀has⠀become⠀necessary.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀courtship,⠀confession,⠀persuasion,⠀or⠀rivalry.⠀It⠀advances⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀reveal,⠀embellish,⠀delay,⠀omit,⠀or⠀repeat,⠀and⠀through⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀claims,⠀resists,⠀or⠀reinterprets⠀the⠀material.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀teller's⠀desire⠀and⠀hesitation⠀rather⠀than⠀neutral⠀chronology.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀narrated⠀world⠀sensually⠀and⠀emotionally⠀precise:⠀the⠀remembered⠀room's⠀light,⠀a⠀garment's⠀texture,⠀a⠀street's⠀smell,⠀the⠀exact⠀pressure⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀touch.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀carry⠀a⠀cost—the⠀tale⠀can⠀be⠀alluring⠀enough⠀to⠀draw⠀the⠀listener⠀closer⠀while⠀exposing⠀the⠀teller's⠀vulnerability,⠀jealousy,⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀past⠀longing.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀should⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀characters⠀and⠀stakes,⠀but⠀its⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀teller:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀lingers⠀over,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀say⠀directly,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀hopes⠀the⠀listener⠀will⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀account.\n\nCreate⠀meaningful⠀recurrence⠀across⠀the⠀two⠀levels.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀place⠀named⠀inside⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀returns⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀frame,⠀sometimes⠀exactly⠀and⠀sometimes⠀transformed.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀shift⠀meaning⠀for⠀the⠀listener⠀or⠀the⠀teller:⠀a⠀beloved's⠀habit⠀becomes⠀evidence⠀of⠀love⠀or⠀caution;⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise⠀becomes⠀a⠀claim⠀or⠀an⠀accusation;⠀a⠀shared⠀danger⠀becomes⠀a⠀bond⠀or⠀a⠀warning.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀recurrence⠀a⠀truth-indicator.⠀A⠀vivid⠀retelling⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀that⠀events⠀happened⠀as⠀described;⠀it⠀proves⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe⠀or⠀feel.\n\nDelay⠀one⠀central⠀revelation⠀until⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀prepared⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀hear⠀it,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀wait⠀be⠀an⠀active⠀interval⠀of⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀supply⠀memories,⠀refuse⠀a⠀comparison,⠀or⠀begin⠀a⠀counter-story.⠀Show⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀listening:⠀a⠀face⠀that⠀changes,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀stills,⠀a⠀breath⠀held,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀is⠀too⠀careful.⠀The⠀outer⠀lovers'⠀shared⠀past⠀may⠀contradict⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀tale.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀arrives,⠀it⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀relationship's⠀temperature⠀or⠀stakes⠀without⠀ending⠀the⠀romance⠀by⠀formula.\n\nLet⠀the⠀telling⠀do⠀work⠀in⠀the⠀present:⠀persuade,⠀seduce,⠀stall,⠀confess,⠀wound,⠀or⠀offer⠀an⠀explanation⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀gift⠀or⠀a⠀demand.⠀The⠀listener's⠀response⠀is⠀a⠀choice,⠀not⠀an⠀award.⠀Either⠀partner⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀teller,⠀and⠀roles⠀may⠀shift⠀in⠀later⠀replies;⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀listens⠀now⠀may⠀tell⠀next,⠀and⠀the⠀second⠀account⠀may⠀confirm,⠀correct,⠀or⠀rival⠀the⠀first.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀told⠀story⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀relationship⠀have⠀changed⠀one⠀another,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀open⠀to⠀the⠀characters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀romance⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀social-developmental⠀realist⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀German-language⠀tradition.⠀Show⠀love⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀work,⠀money,⠀housing,⠀family⠀obligations,⠀education,⠀health,⠀and⠀the⠀slow⠀accumulation⠀of⠀shared⠀or⠀divergent⠀years.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀attraction⠀as⠀an⠀escape⠀from⠀social⠀reality;⠀make⠀social⠀reality⠀the⠀medium⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀lovers⠀know,⠀misunderstand,⠀and⠀choose⠀each⠀other.\n\nUse⠀precise⠀period⠀and⠀institutional⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀pressures⠀concrete.⠀Name⠀the⠀jobs,⠀income,⠀schedules,⠀rents,⠀inheritances,⠀apprenticeships,⠀union⠀meetings,⠀school⠀reforms,⠀or⠀migration⠀paths⠀that⠀determine⠀how⠀often⠀the⠀lovers⠀meet⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀promise.⠀A⠀missed⠀connection⠀can⠀be⠀caused⠀by⠀an⠀ordinary⠀obligation⠀rather⠀than⠀fate.⠀Let⠀private⠀feeling⠀surface⠀through⠀these⠀practical⠀arrangements:⠀a⠀hand⠀brushing⠀during⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀letter⠀written⠀on⠀workplace⠀paper,⠀a⠀saved⠀sum⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀plan,⠀a⠀family⠀dinner⠀that⠀forces⠀a⠀choice.\n\nApply⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀to⠀the⠀remembered⠀textures⠀of⠀ordinary⠀places:⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀rented⠀room⠀before⠀winter,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀commute,⠀the⠀exact⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀Sunday⠀coat,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀work⠀bag.⠀Beauty⠀should⠀be⠀sharpened⠀by⠀cost.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀render⠀a⠀modest⠀object⠀or⠀shared⠀moment⠀sensually⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀glamorous;⠀the⠀glamour,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀should⠀complicate⠀rather⠀than⠀hide⠀the⠀lovers'⠀jealousy,⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀former⠀attachment.\n\nLet⠀developmental⠀time⠀govern⠀the⠀relationship's⠀turning⠀points⠀rather⠀than⠀sudden⠀reversals.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀several⠀years,⠀or⠀compress⠀a⠀long⠀development⠀into⠀selected⠀scenes⠀that⠀show⠀education,⠀employment,⠀marriage,⠀illness,⠀separation,⠀or⠀reconciliation.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀lovers⠀change⠀socially⠀and⠀personally:⠀one⠀becomes⠀more⠀confident⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀becomes⠀more⠀cautious;⠀a⠀new⠀flat⠀alters⠀their⠀intimacy;⠀a⠀child⠀or⠀dependent⠀old⠀person⠀changes⠀their⠀loyalties.⠀Each⠀change⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀plausible⠀practical⠀cause⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀aftermath.\n\nWrite⠀interiority⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀account.⠀When⠀one⠀lover⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀other⠀across⠀a⠀table⠀or⠀a⠀workplace,⠀supply⠀the⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀and⠀economic⠀calculation⠀that⠀coexist⠀with⠀desire.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀the⠀consequences⠀of⠀a⠀position,⠀a⠀lease,⠀a⠀mother's⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀two-year⠀plan⠀while⠀still⠀registering⠀the⠀beloved's⠀face⠀and⠀voice.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀of⠀realism:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀closely⠀follow⠀one⠀or⠀both⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts⠀while⠀still⠀reporting⠀the⠀external⠀world.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀speech⠀for⠀drama;⠀a⠀restrained⠀sentence⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀made⠀or⠀deferred⠀commitment,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀characters'⠀past⠀decisions⠀and⠀current⠀conditions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀a⠀romance⠀set⠀in⠀a⠀present-day⠀urban⠀environment⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀modern⠀life⠀grind⠀against⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀lovers⠀meet⠀or⠀continue⠀within⠀a⠀network⠀of⠀inherited⠀privileges,⠀debts,⠀family⠀claims,⠀institutional⠀power,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀memory.⠀Make⠀the⠀setting⠀materially⠀specific:⠀a⠀converted⠀factory⠀with⠀failing⠀heating,⠀a⠀basement⠀archive,⠀a⠀club⠀under⠀a⠀flyover,⠀a⠀clinic⠀in⠀a⠀neglected⠀building,⠀a⠀flat⠀above⠀a⠀business⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀hands⠀for⠀generations.⠀Let⠀these⠀places⠀carry⠀history⠀and⠀pressure.\n\nUse⠀social⠀masks⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀condition⠀of⠀intimacy.⠀Both⠀characters⠀may⠀perform⠀roles⠀for⠀employers,⠀relatives,⠀creditors,⠀or⠀the⠀street,⠀and⠀these⠀performances⠀do⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀false—only⠀partial.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀through⠀moments⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀where⠀one⠀mask⠀is⠀lowered⠀or⠀shifted:⠀a⠀practiced⠀charm⠀breaks⠀into⠀exhaustion,⠀a⠀patient⠀listener⠀stops⠀pretending,⠀a⠀caretaker⠀admits⠀fear.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀exposure⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀sensory⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀calculation:⠀a⠀hand⠀ungloved⠀in⠀a⠀damp⠀stairwell⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀thinks⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀now⠀knows,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rust⠀and⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀look⠀untouched,⠀the⠀exact⠀tiredness⠀in⠀a⠀voice⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀performing⠀all⠀day.⠀Beauty⠀remains⠀possible⠀but⠀never⠀free.\n\nMake⠀power⠀relationships⠀and⠀old⠀authority⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀atmospheric.⠀A⠀family⠀may⠀own⠀the⠀building⠀where⠀one⠀lover⠀works;⠀a⠀former⠀institution⠀may⠀have⠀shaped⠀both⠀their⠀educations;⠀a⠀bond⠀or⠀obligation⠀may⠀make⠀one⠀person⠀useful⠀to⠀the⠀other;⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀legend⠀may⠀have⠀practical⠀consequences⠀for⠀whom⠀they⠀can⠀trust.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀mechanics,⠀blood-bonds,⠀clans,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀The⠀'old⠀authority'⠀is⠀the⠀ordinary⠀historical⠀and⠀institutional⠀force⠀of⠀wealth,⠀debt,⠀reputation,⠀patronage,⠀or⠀a⠀specific⠀local⠀past.⠀Even⠀when⠀gothic⠀imagery⠀suggests⠀otherwise,⠀keep⠀the⠀world's⠀rules⠀realistic.\n\nLet⠀desire⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated⠀without⠀deciding⠀the⠀lover's⠀worth.⠀Jealousy,⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀secrecy,⠀and⠀the⠀temptation⠀to⠀use⠀the⠀other's⠀power⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀genuine⠀care.⠀Write⠀both⠀private⠀and⠀spoken⠀content⠀distinctly:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀nothing⠀about⠀a⠀threat⠀while⠀thinking⠀through⠀the⠀choice⠀the⠀beloved⠀would⠀face⠀if⠀told.⠀Allow⠀disagreement⠀and⠀rupture,⠀but⠀also⠀allow⠀protection,⠀honesty,⠀and⠀repair.⠀No⠀automatic⠀betrayal⠀or⠀trap.\n\nStage⠀the⠀lovers'⠀attempts⠀to⠀move⠀within⠀or⠀against⠀the⠀structures⠀they⠀cannot⠀escape.⠀A⠀shared⠀attempt⠀to⠀leave⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀job,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀plot⠀may⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀change⠀shape.⠀Show⠀the⠀practical⠀steps⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀of⠀each⠀move.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀response⠀boundary⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀have⠀just⠀made⠀a⠀move⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀with⠀uncertain⠀consequences.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀kiss,⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀fight,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀escape.⠀Leave⠀the⠀relationship's⠀next⠀choice⠀in⠀their⠀hands,⠀with⠀enough⠀material⠀detail⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀for⠀that⠀choice⠀to⠀matter.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀modern⠀urban⠀or⠀diasporic⠀fiction⠀route⠀of⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Set⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀named⠀city⠀or⠀migration⠀path—keep⠀the⠀specific⠀place,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀current⠀story.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀Indian⠀family,⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀or⠀festival.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them,⠀treat⠀them⠀as⠀particular⠀conditions⠀for⠀the⠀lovers'⠀choices,⠀not⠀as⠀scenery.\n\nGive⠀the⠀city⠀or⠀diaspora⠀setting⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀place.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀to⠀map⠀the⠀routes⠀the⠀lovers⠀share:⠀a⠀particular⠀bus⠀line,⠀market,⠀railway⠀platform,⠀stairwell,⠀wedding⠀hall,⠀office⠀block,⠀temple⠀or⠀church⠀or⠀shrine,⠀late-night⠀food⠀stall,⠀apartment⠀with⠀a⠀broken⠀lift.⠀Attach⠀private⠀meanings⠀to⠀these⠀places⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀symbolic⠀monuments.⠀The⠀smell⠀of⠀hot⠀oil⠀in⠀the⠀stairwell⠀can⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀quarrel;⠀the⠀remembered⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀in⠀a⠀crowd⠀can⠀return⠀during⠀a⠀later⠀decision.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀coexist⠀with⠀cost:⠀a⠀beautiful⠀sari,⠀a⠀clean⠀room,⠀a⠀polished⠀nameplate,⠀or⠀a⠀well-kept⠀family⠀reputation⠀may⠀be⠀maintained⠀at⠀someone's⠀expense.\n\nUse⠀contemporary⠀urban⠀and⠀social⠀pressure⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀for⠀the⠀relationship's⠀complications.⠀Work⠀schedules,⠀rent,⠀commuting⠀distance,⠀visa⠀status,⠀family⠀expectations,⠀language⠀differences,⠀marriage⠀pressure,⠀housing,⠀and⠀the⠀scrutiny⠀of⠀neighbors⠀can⠀delay,⠀shape,⠀or⠀test⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀lovers⠀may⠀belong⠀to⠀different⠀communities,⠀classes,⠀regions,⠀religions,⠀or⠀castes⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀specifies⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀introduce⠀such⠀differences⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀conflict.⠀Show⠀how⠀each⠀character⠀balances⠀private⠀want⠀and⠀collective⠀duty,⠀with⠀both⠀genuine⠀difference⠀and⠀genuine⠀accommodation.\n\nLet⠀interiority⠀be⠀precise⠀and⠀socially⠀situated.⠀In⠀a⠀crowded⠀flat⠀or⠀during⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀one⠀lover⠀may⠀think⠀at⠀length⠀while⠀smiling⠀or⠀serving⠀tea.⠀Convey⠀overlooked⠀desire,⠀jealousy,⠀fear⠀of⠀exposure,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀happiness⠀without⠀making⠀public⠀speech⠀the⠀only⠀channel.⠀The⠀thought's⠀content⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀social⠀situation:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀calculating,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀remembers⠀about⠀the⠀person⠀across⠀the⠀room.⠀Speeches⠀may⠀be⠀coded⠀or⠀direct⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀company.⠀Use⠀the⠀names,⠀endearments,⠀and⠀forms⠀of⠀address⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀setting;⠀if⠀code-switching⠀is⠀used,⠀keep⠀it⠀natural⠀to⠀the⠀speaker⠀and⠀intelligible.\n\nDo⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀tradition⠀versus⠀modernity.⠀Let⠀both⠀characters⠀act⠀from⠀mixed⠀motives:⠀loyalty,⠀ambition,⠀lust,⠀compassion,⠀pride,⠀and⠀practical⠀calculation.⠀Their⠀choices⠀can⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀or⠀shift⠀over⠀time.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀realization⠀has⠀just⠀altered⠀the⠀relationship's⠀course,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀open.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀urban⠀detail⠀and⠀remembered-place⠀intimacy⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀extend⠀this⠀specific⠀bond.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀romance⠀in⠀the⠀Japanese⠀social/psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Use⠀continuous⠀realist⠀narration⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀lovers⠀through⠀ordinary⠀obligations—work,⠀family,⠀neighborhood,⠀health,⠀money,⠀and⠀social⠀expectation—while⠀making⠀the⠀private⠀pressure⠀of⠀attraction⠀unmistakable.⠀Do⠀not⠀fall⠀back⠀on⠀a⠀diary⠀layout,⠀fantastic⠀tale,⠀or⠀theatrical⠀set-piece⠀unless⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀already⠀requires⠀it.\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀reader's⠀attention⠀through⠀seasonal⠀and⠀material⠀markers⠀rather⠀than⠀plotting⠀everything⠀as⠀drama.⠀A⠀particular⠀season⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀stage⠀of⠀the⠀relationship:⠀the⠀first⠀meeting⠀during⠀school⠀entrance,⠀a⠀confession⠀under⠀winter⠀rain,⠀a⠀missed⠀festival⠀in⠀early⠀autumn,⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀at⠀year-end.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀as⠀its⠀meaning⠀changes.⠀Use⠀the⠀sensory⠀exactness⠀of⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀profile⠀to⠀render⠀those⠀moments:⠀the⠀cold⠀on⠀a⠀train⠀platform,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀formal⠀coat,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀tatami⠀in⠀a⠀summer⠀empty⠀room,⠀the⠀glaze⠀on⠀a⠀bowl⠀given⠀by⠀someone's⠀mother.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀places⠀change⠀meaning⠀over⠀time.⠀Beauty⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀price;⠀a⠀beautiful⠀room⠀or⠀gesture⠀may⠀serve⠀a⠀demand,⠀and⠀a⠀beautiful⠀person⠀may⠀also⠀be⠀jealous,⠀divided,⠀or⠀exhausted.\n\nConvey⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀public⠀behavior⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀social⠀condition.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀indirect⠀forms⠀while⠀their⠀minds⠀run⠀in⠀long,⠀precise⠀sequences.⠀When⠀private⠀and⠀spoken⠀content⠀align,⠀show⠀why;⠀when⠀they⠀deceptively⠀differ,⠀supply⠀a⠀concrete⠀reason:⠀protecting⠀someone's⠀face,⠀avoiding⠀a⠀debt,⠀postponing⠀a⠀necessary⠀break,⠀preserving⠀a⠀fragile⠀peace.⠀Use⠀a⠀close⠀third-person⠀perspective⠀on⠀one⠀or⠀both⠀lovers⠀as⠀consistency⠀permits.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀observe⠀social⠀reality⠀and⠀record⠀interiority⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀thought⠀a⠀dramatic⠀announcement.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀and⠀silence⠀carry⠀weight.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀say⠀the⠀decisive⠀thing⠀for⠀months;⠀the⠀delay⠀itself⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀small⠀attentive⠀acts,⠀missed⠀chances,⠀gifts⠀not⠀given,⠀or⠀conversations⠀that⠀turn⠀away⠀at⠀the⠀last⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀equate⠀reticence⠀with⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Allow⠀explicit⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀the⠀characters⠀require⠀them;⠀a⠀restrained⠀lover⠀may⠀still⠀touch,⠀argue,⠀or⠀confess⠀in⠀a⠀crisis.\n\nUse⠀the⠀obligations⠀of⠀family,⠀work,⠀and⠀social⠀standing⠀as⠀the⠀romance's⠀actual⠀complications,⠀not⠀as⠀background.⠀One⠀lover's⠀transfer,⠀inheritance⠀dispute,⠀care⠀duty,⠀or⠀marriage⠀introduction⠀can⠀split⠀time⠀and⠀loyalty.⠀The⠀relationship⠀advances⠀through⠀moments⠀of⠀practical⠀care—shared⠀meals,⠀errands,⠀prepared⠀clothes,⠀decisions⠀about⠀housing—not⠀only⠀through⠀emotional⠀declarations.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀seasonal⠀or⠀practical⠀change⠀has⠀just⠀made⠀the⠀couple's⠀next⠀choice⠀urgent⠀or⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀contingent⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀actually⠀done⠀and⠀felt,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀predetermined⠀happy⠀or⠀unhappy⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route⠀of⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting's⠀particular⠀country,⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀throughout,⠀using⠀the⠀names,⠀foods,⠀customs,⠀and⠀rhythms⠀already⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀the⠀supernatural⠀into⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀it;⠀if⠀the⠀story's⠀canon⠀permits⠀the⠀marvelous,⠀that⠀remains⠀a⠀world⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀stylistic⠀addition.\n\nMove⠀the⠀narration⠀fluidly⠀between⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀and⠀remembered⠀moments⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀place:⠀a⠀square⠀that⠀was⠀first⠀a⠀meeting⠀spot⠀and⠀later⠀the⠀site⠀of⠀a⠀quarrel;⠀a⠀balcony,⠀bus⠀stop,⠀beach,⠀kitchen,⠀market,⠀or⠀hospital⠀corridor⠀whose⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness⠀to⠀make⠀these⠀places⠀sensorially⠀specific:⠀the⠀exact⠀heat,⠀dust,⠀jasmine,⠀fried⠀food,⠀rain,⠀music,⠀and⠀worn⠀stone.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀beauty⠀carry⠀cost—a⠀beautiful⠀old⠀house⠀may⠀sit⠀beside⠀a⠀family⠀debt;⠀a⠀beautiful⠀dress⠀may⠀hide⠀a⠀bruise⠀or⠀a⠀lie;⠀a⠀beautiful⠀person⠀may⠀love⠀deeply⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀divided⠀or⠀jealous.\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀economic⠀conditions⠀as⠀the⠀pressure⠀source⠀for⠀love.⠀Migration,⠀currency⠀collapse,⠀work⠀permits,⠀unemployment,⠀family⠀illness,⠀neighborhood⠀violence,⠀inherited⠀property,⠀or⠀political⠀memory⠀can⠀determine⠀when⠀the⠀lovers⠀meet,⠀how⠀long⠀they⠀can⠀stay,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀risk.⠀Make⠀these⠀pressures⠀concrete⠀and⠀dated;⠀do⠀not⠀reduce⠀them⠀to⠀'poverty'⠀or⠀'political⠀tension'⠀in⠀general.⠀The⠀same⠀conditions⠀should⠀produce⠀different⠀responses⠀in⠀each⠀character⠀based⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀history⠀and⠀resources.\n\nLet⠀interiority⠀drive⠀the⠀romantic⠀development.⠀Spend⠀sustained⠀time⠀inside⠀one⠀or⠀both⠀lovers'⠀minds,⠀showing⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀indecision.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀through⠀a⠀whole⠀history⠀during⠀a⠀single⠀song⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀walk.⠀Render⠀that⠀private⠀movement⠀in⠀full;⠀do⠀not⠀demand⠀that⠀every⠀internal⠀realization⠀cause⠀a⠀visible⠀action⠀immediately.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀speaks,⠀the⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀warm,⠀blunt,⠀formal,⠀or⠀playful⠀according⠀to⠀this⠀person⠀and⠀this⠀relationship—never⠀a⠀uniformly⠀witty⠀chorus.\n\nTrack⠀the⠀relationship⠀across⠀time⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀outcome.⠀Use⠀selected⠀scenes⠀or⠀stretches⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀lovers⠀staying,⠀separating,⠀hurting,⠀caring,⠀and⠀returning⠀or⠀not⠀returning.⠀The⠀'intimate'⠀route⠀means⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀tiny⠀changes⠀in⠀gesture,⠀address,⠀and⠀expectation;⠀a⠀shift⠀from *usted* to *tú*,⠀a⠀name⠀replaced⠀by *mi⠀amor*,⠀a⠀seat⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared⠀or⠀skipped.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀boundary⠀after⠀a⠀decisive⠀or⠀suspended⠀movement,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀choice⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀hands⠀and⠀the⠀city⠀still⠀alive⠀beneath⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀a⠀romance⠀in⠀clipped,⠀visually⠀presentable⠀beats⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀core⠀interpersonal⠀work⠀of⠀the⠀genre.⠀Enter⠀each⠀scene⠀near⠀the⠀thing⠀that⠀matters:⠀an⠀arranged⠀meeting,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀surprise,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀assistance.⠀Give⠀the⠀reader⠀the⠀space,⠀time,⠀and⠀visible⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀few⠀lines,⠀then⠀move⠀between⠀speech,⠀action,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀with⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀clear⠀transitions.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensory⠀richness⠀in⠀concentrated⠀form.⠀Instead⠀of⠀long⠀descriptive⠀passages,⠀pick⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀telling⠀sensory⠀details⠀per⠀beat:⠀the⠀way⠀rain⠀darkens⠀a⠀uniform⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀exact⠀brush⠀of⠀fingers⠀passing⠀a⠀phone,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀coffee⠀on⠀someone's⠀breath,⠀the⠀worn⠀fabric⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀for⠀years.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀carry⠀remembered-place⠀intimacy⠀and⠀beauty⠀with⠀cost.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀object⠀or⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀expensive,⠀inherited,⠀painful,⠀or⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀third⠀person;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀style's⠀brightness⠀scrub⠀away⠀jealousy,⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀old⠀longing.\n\nGive⠀each⠀important⠀turn⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat.⠀After⠀a⠀confession,⠀refusal,⠀touch,⠀insult,⠀gift,⠀or⠀discovery,⠀pause⠀for⠀the⠀affected⠀character's⠀private⠀response.⠀This⠀can⠀be⠀two⠀lines⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph:⠀a⠀skipped⠀breath,⠀a⠀detailed⠀memory,⠀a⠀calculation,⠀a⠀flare⠀of⠀hope⠀or⠀distrust.⠀The⠀private⠀response⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀character⠀and⠀this⠀moment,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀fluster.⠀Do⠀not⠀always⠀escalate⠀to⠀a⠀visible⠀gesture.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think, *So⠀that's⠀why⠀she⠀kept⠀the⠀ticket,* and⠀then⠀say⠀something⠀ordinary.⠀Vary⠀the⠀responses;⠀not⠀every⠀reaction⠀is⠀comedic,⠀flustered,⠀or⠀cool.⠀Use⠀third⠀or⠀first⠀person⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀requires;⠀neither⠀is⠀a⠀light-novel⠀requirement.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀characters⠀change⠀rooms,⠀trains,⠀floors,⠀or⠀streets,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀transition⠀or⠀beat⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀never⠀loses⠀track.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀dialogue⠀run⠀without⠀a⠀body⠀in⠀a⠀place:⠀even⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀should⠀anchor⠀the⠀speaker⠀to⠀a⠀balcony,⠀locker,⠀desk,⠀or⠀empty⠀classroom.\n\nStage⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀concrete⠀exchanges⠀and⠀small⠀obligations.⠀The⠀lovers⠀can⠀show⠀care⠀through⠀a⠀saved⠀snack,⠀an⠀umbrella,⠀a⠀homework⠀note,⠀a⠀shift⠀covered,⠀a⠀careful⠀silence⠀in⠀a⠀loud⠀group.⠀Let⠀these⠀acts⠀be⠀noticed,⠀misread,⠀or⠀returned,⠀based⠀on⠀the⠀people,⠀not⠀on⠀genre⠀convention.⠀Build⠀tension⠀from⠀timing,⠀external⠀obligations,⠀and⠀uncertainty;⠀allow⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀pause⠀or⠀end⠀badly⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀improve.⠀End⠀each⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀boundary⠀after⠀a⠀gesture,⠀line,⠀or⠀realization⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀emotional⠀state,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀completed⠀date.⠀The⠀next⠀choice⠀remains⠀with⠀the⠀characters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀sentence⠀enact⠀the⠀relationship's⠀pressure⠀instead⠀of⠀naming⠀it.⠀When⠀attraction⠀and⠀unease⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀moment,⠀arrange⠀the⠀clauses⠀so⠀a⠀lovely⠀detail⠀arrives⠀just⠀before⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀troubling⠀one,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀order⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀next:⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀then⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀it⠀was⠀bought⠀for.⠀Lengthen⠀syntax⠀while⠀attention⠀lingers⠀on⠀someone;⠀shorten⠀it⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀braces⠀or⠀withdraws.⠀Sound⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀work⠀—⠀a⠀repeated⠀vowel⠀or⠀consonant⠀across⠀a⠀few⠀lines⠀can⠀make⠀two⠀separate⠀moments⠀answer⠀each⠀other⠀—⠀provided⠀every⠀image⠀stays⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀this⠀narrator's⠀own⠀associations.\n\nGive⠀the⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀specific⠀texture⠀rather⠀than⠀accumulated⠀adjectives.⠀Record⠀the⠀exact⠀temperature,⠀weight,⠀or⠀residue⠀of⠀a⠀thing,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀beloved's⠀response⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀reads⠀the⠀attraction.⠀Beauty⠀may⠀draw⠀a⠀character⠀closer⠀and,⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀hour,⠀make⠀that⠀character⠀guarded,⠀envious,⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀reach.⠀Keep⠀knowledge⠀honest:⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀know⠀its⠀own⠀wanting⠀in⠀full,⠀but⠀an⠀elegant⠀appearance⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀feeling,⠀and⠀a⠀withheld⠀answer⠀is⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀indifference.\n\nDevelop⠀attachment⠀through⠀remembered⠀places⠀and⠀repeated⠀encounters⠀while⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀keeps⠀moving;⠀a⠀memory⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀conversation⠀or⠀color⠀a⠀touch,⠀and⠀the⠀exchange⠀continues⠀through⠀it.⠀When⠀an⠀image⠀returns,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀—⠀the⠀doorway⠀that⠀promised⠀closeness⠀later⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀closeness⠀cost.⠀Let⠀plain⠀statements⠀break⠀the⠀lyrical⠀current⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀exactly⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀reaches⠀a⠀fact⠀too⠀sharp⠀for⠀ornament,⠀and⠀keep⠀other⠀characters⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Inward⠀attention⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀music,⠀not⠀an⠀intermission:⠀render⠀the⠀unspoken⠀desire,⠀recalculation,⠀or⠀dread⠀as⠀it⠀happens,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀differ⠀from⠀speech⠀for⠀this⠀character's⠀own⠀reason.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀close⠀while⠀attention⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀motion⠀—⠀mid-gesture,⠀mid-approach,⠀mid-doubt⠀—⠀with⠀feeling⠀alive⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized⠀into⠀a⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBuild⠀each⠀romantic⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀happened:⠀a⠀habit⠀no⠀longer⠀shared,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀now⠀means⠀another,⠀a⠀place⠀entered⠀again⠀under⠀different⠀conditions.⠀Lead⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀association⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀—⠀the⠀cup⠀still⠀set⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀place,⠀the⠀coat⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀scent⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀announcement.⠀The⠀scene⠀continues⠀into⠀speech,⠀touch,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀so⠀memory⠀colors⠀the⠀living⠀exchange⠀instead⠀of⠀replacing⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀reflective⠀voice⠀to⠀examine⠀what⠀this⠀attachment⠀cost,⠀not⠀to⠀decorate⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀recall⠀how⠀someone⠀looked⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀what⠀the⠀room⠀smelled⠀like,⠀what⠀was⠀promised⠀and⠀not⠀kept,⠀and⠀each⠀such⠀detail⠀should⠀expose⠀one⠀specific⠀relationship⠀—⠀its⠀jealousy,⠀its⠀divided⠀loyalty,⠀its⠀private⠀tenderness.⠀Sensual⠀precision⠀does⠀the⠀remembering:⠀the⠀exact⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀hand,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀something⠀was⠀decided.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stays⠀real;⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀still⠀lands,⠀an⠀hour⠀of⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀simply⠀good,⠀with⠀no⠀undercut⠀required.\n\nHold⠀the⠀line⠀between⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀understood⠀now.⠀A⠀later⠀realization⠀may⠀color⠀a⠀memory⠀—⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀coming⠀—⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀back⠀as⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive;⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀know⠀remains⠀someone⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀know.⠀Render⠀the⠀current⠀reflection⠀as⠀live⠀experience,⠀accompanying⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀it⠀changes⠀any⠀visible⠀action.⠀End⠀where⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀recollection⠀coexist:⠀a⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀resumed⠀or⠀withheld,⠀an⠀attachment⠀continuing⠀in⠀altered⠀form.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀any⠀scene⠀to⠀close⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀telling:⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀recounts⠀this⠀romance⠀to⠀an⠀audience⠀whose⠀presence⠀surfaces⠀in⠀brief⠀address,⠀interruption,⠀or⠀anticipation.⠀Establish⠀the⠀frame⠀once,⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀strokes⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀happens,⠀who⠀listens,⠀what⠀occasion⠀holds⠀them⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀govern⠀information⠀flow:⠀the⠀teller⠀decides⠀what⠀to⠀relate⠀now,⠀what⠀to⠀defer,⠀and⠀what⠀to⠀admit⠀not⠀knowing.⠀Where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀names⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀keep⠀that⠀tradition's⠀storytelling⠀conventions⠀and⠀courtesies⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀flavor;⠀the⠀method⠀requires⠀no⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀particular⠀honor⠀code.\n\nInside⠀the⠀frame,⠀render⠀scenes⠀in⠀continuous⠀narrative⠀prose⠀with⠀the⠀teller's⠀idiom⠀audible⠀in⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀lingered⠀over,⠀what⠀is⠀hurried⠀past.⠀Let⠀the⠀romance⠀develop⠀through⠀remembered⠀places,⠀repeated⠀meetings,⠀gifts,⠀songs,⠀and⠀household⠀objects⠀whose⠀significance⠀lands⠀only⠀on⠀a⠀later⠀recurrence.⠀Give⠀the⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀exact⠀sensory⠀weight:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀cloth,⠀the⠀coolness⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀in⠀a⠀warm⠀room,⠀the⠀scent⠀that⠀survives⠀in⠀a⠀closed⠀house.⠀That⠀precision⠀shows⠀how⠀glamour⠀draws⠀the⠀lovers⠀together⠀and⠀complicates⠀them;⠀jealousy⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀may⠀first⠀be⠀reported⠀as⠀a⠀known⠀consequence,⠀then⠀dramatized⠀so⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀particular⠀misunderstanding,⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀injury⠀underneath.\n\nBound⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀honestly.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀listeners⠀and⠀may⠀withhold⠀a⠀motive,⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀the⠀outcome⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀meeting⠀until⠀a⠀recurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀force,⠀but⠀the⠀telling⠀should⠀not⠀claim⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀of⠀the⠀lovers;⠀render⠀their⠀interior⠀experience⠀only⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀privately⠀felt⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling's⠀texture.⠀A⠀deferred⠀revelation⠀should⠀stay⠀inferable⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀arrives⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀detail⠀without⠀erasing⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀any⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀telling⠀—⠀mid-tale,⠀mid-address,⠀before⠀a⠀promised⠀consequence⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀developing⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀next⠀sentence⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀few⠀details⠀and⠀place⠀each⠀one⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀something.⠀A⠀single⠀sensory⠀fact⠀—⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀sound⠀a⠀particular⠀door⠀makes,⠀a⠀garment⠀mended⠀twice⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀place⠀—⠀carries⠀more⠀pressure⠀than⠀a⠀described⠀room.⠀Put⠀the⠀detail⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀understanding⠀shifts⠀or⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀act,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀its⠀significance⠀after⠀stating⠀it;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Omission⠀leaves⠀something⠀inferable;⠀it⠀never⠀deletes⠀causality.\n\nKeep⠀clauses⠀direct⠀and⠀movement⠀economical,⠀but⠀give⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀the⠀length⠀it⠀needs.⠀Attraction,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀divided⠀loyalty⠀may⠀occupy⠀one⠀observation⠀or⠀one⠀inward⠀sentence;⠀if⠀the⠀motive⠀needs⠀more⠀room⠀to⠀be⠀understood,⠀take⠀the⠀room⠀rather⠀than⠀performing⠀fragments.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀works⠀here⠀through⠀selection:⠀the⠀expensive⠀surface⠀matters⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀one⠀exact⠀thing⠀noticed⠀about⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀catch,⠀a⠀residue,⠀a⠀wrong⠀weight⠀—⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀prose⠀walks⠀around⠀it⠀admiring.\n\nLet⠀speech⠀and⠀action⠀do⠀their⠀own⠀work⠀beside⠀private⠀feeling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows,⠀answer⠀a⠀charged⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀state⠀the⠀thing⠀plainly⠀and⠀completely;⠀tie⠀any⠀gap⠀between⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀to⠀that⠀character's⠀own⠀reason.⠀The⠀unspoken⠀attachment,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀cost⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀said.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀stop⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange⠀—⠀mid-look,⠀mid-errand,⠀one⠀line⠀hanging⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀motion⠀and⠀no⠀summary⠀of⠀its⠀meaning⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀plain⠀transitions⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀oriented⠀—⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀at⠀a⠀turn⠀of⠀the⠀encounter,⠀a⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀past⠀held⠀to⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀the⠀thought⠀—⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Let⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀tense⠀exchange⠀tightens⠀into⠀shorter⠀beats;⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀opens⠀into⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀of⠀sensory⠀recollection.⠀Contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting⠀or⠀understated⠀emotion.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀particular⠀occasions⠀and⠀their⠀aftermath.⠀Attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀care⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀these⠀characters⠀actually⠀do⠀and⠀say,⠀and⠀the⠀chemistry⠀stays⠀specific⠀to⠀them⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀Carry⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀happens⠀to⠀notice:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bracelet⠀on⠀a⠀wrist⠀that⠀has⠀gone⠀still,⠀rain⠀smell⠀in⠀a⠀coat⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀rearranged⠀by⠀two⠀centimeters.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀have⠀a⠀cost⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀attractive⠀surface⠀into⠀a⠀warning;⠀jealousy⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀may⠀complicate⠀a⠀scene⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀remain⠀capable⠀of⠀genuine⠀pleasure,⠀cooperation,⠀and⠀help.\n\nKeep⠀interiority⠀authorized⠀and⠀causal.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀and⠀desire⠀as⠀it⠀occurs,⠀including⠀thought⠀that⠀never⠀becomes⠀speech,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀enter⠀another⠀character's⠀hidden⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀is⠀not⠀written⠀back⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀turn⠀ends⠀—⠀mid-conversation,⠀mid-task,⠀or⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀—⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀next⠀movement⠀open⠀and⠀no⠀lesson,⠀reversal,⠀or⠀completed⠀emotional⠀verdict⠀required⠀at⠀the⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scenes⠀you⠀select⠀and⠀the⠀moments⠀you⠀return⠀to.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀slow⠀development,⠀pick⠀encounters⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀distance⠀changing;⠀if⠀established⠀love,⠀show⠀the⠀habits,⠀shorthand,⠀and⠀private⠀language⠀that⠀belong⠀only⠀to⠀these⠀two;⠀if⠀repair,⠀let⠀a⠀remembered⠀injury⠀surface⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀gesture,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀joke⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀lands.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise,⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀particular⠀promise⠀determine⠀which⠀scene⠀is⠀worth⠀writing;⠀do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀to⠀fill⠀space.\n\nBuild⠀callbacks⠀from⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀history.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀place⠀returns⠀with⠀new⠀weight⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀did⠀or⠀said⠀with⠀it⠀before,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀should⠀visibly⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀exchange.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀needs⠀where⠀it⠀belongs⠀—⠀a⠀slow-burn⠀premise⠀can⠀spend⠀a⠀whole⠀reply⠀on⠀one⠀almost-touch;⠀an⠀established⠀pairing⠀can⠀cut⠀quickly⠀to⠀the⠀argument⠀underneath⠀the⠀tenderness.⠀Preserve⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision:⠀the⠀exact⠀detail⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀a⠀room⠀feel⠀known,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀that⠀detail⠀carries.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀may⠀draw⠀one⠀character⠀closer⠀while⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀other⠀guarded.\n\nLet⠀consequences⠀fulfill⠀the⠀premise⠀without⠀fixing⠀an⠀outcome.⠀A⠀confession⠀may⠀change⠀everything⠀or⠀only⠀one⠀dinner;⠀a⠀quarrel⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀debt⠀unpaid;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀may⠀restore⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀damaged.⠀Keep⠀interiority⠀character-specific⠀and⠀authorized:⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀run⠀ahead⠀of⠀speech,⠀trail⠀it,⠀or⠀match⠀it⠀exactly,⠀for⠀that⠀character's⠀own⠀reason.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀promise⠀is⠀still⠀developing,⠀the⠀next⠀scene's⠀possibility⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀announced;⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-beat⠀instead⠀of⠀at⠀a⠀completed⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀this⠀romance⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀acts⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀remembered:⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀gift,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀journey⠀undertaken,⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀or⠀broken.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀and⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀occasion⠀in⠀compact⠀declarations⠀—⠀who⠀they⠀were⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀was⠀given,⠀what⠀was⠀refused⠀—⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀received⠀story⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀designation⠀grow⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀rather⠀than⠀ornament,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀public⠀voice⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀flattening⠀the⠀lovers.⠀When⠀the⠀account⠀enters⠀a⠀scene,⠀render⠀their⠀speech⠀and⠀perception⠀directly,⠀and⠀give⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀its⠀place⠀there:⠀the⠀exact⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀gift,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀room,⠀the⠀cost⠀hidden⠀inside⠀a⠀beautiful⠀surface.⠀Jealousy⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀may⠀be⠀related⠀first⠀as⠀known⠀consequence⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀carried⠀all⠀along⠀—⠀and⠀then⠀dramatized⠀so⠀its⠀particular⠀cause⠀becomes⠀visible.⠀A⠀lover⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀how⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀told,⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀hold⠀a⠀private⠀detail⠀the⠀chronicle⠀never⠀recorded,⠀wherever⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀permits⠀that⠀interiority.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀later⠀claimed,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀claim⠀every⠀hidden⠀thought⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀allows⠀it;⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀public⠀memory⠀and⠀private⠀experience⠀can⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀Keep⠀one⠀source⠀tradition's⠀conventions⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀assembling⠀a⠀generic⠀epic⠀—⠀no⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀another⠀act⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀mid-journey⠀or⠀mid-quarrel,⠀before⠀the⠀promise's⠀consequence⠀is⠀known,⠀with⠀no⠀final⠀verdict⠀imposed⠀on⠀the⠀lovers'⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀inside⠀Scandinavian⠀social-domestic⠀realism⠀with⠀an⠀inward⠀psychological⠀register:⠀kitchens⠀and⠀laundry⠀rooms,⠀workplace⠀corridors,⠀a⠀family⠀summer⠀place,⠀a⠀train⠀compartment,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀ceremonies⠀of⠀a⠀settled⠀community.⠀Stay⠀on⠀this⠀realist⠀route⠀throughout;⠀do⠀not⠀drift⠀toward⠀folktale,⠀crime⠀procedure,⠀or⠀comic⠀satire⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀itself⠀supplies⠀such⠀material.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀land⠀on⠀ordinary⠀surfaces⠀rather⠀than⠀opulence:⠀the⠀grain⠀of⠀a⠀wooden⠀tabletop⠀under⠀a⠀fingertip,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀wet⠀wool⠀coat⠀on⠀its⠀hook,⠀rain⠀smell⠀rising⠀off⠀concrete⠀outside⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀radiator⠀ticking⠀while⠀someone⠀decides⠀whether⠀to⠀speak.⠀Beauty⠀in⠀this⠀world⠀costs⠀something.⠀A⠀lovely⠀apartment⠀can⠀isolate⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀inside⠀it;⠀an⠀admired⠀face⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀small⠀neglect⠀feel⠀unforgivable;⠀the⠀most⠀attractive⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀where⠀the⠀truth⠀is⠀hardest⠀to⠀start.⠀Tie⠀each⠀sharpened⠀surface⠀to⠀the⠀pair's⠀own⠀history—the⠀counter⠀where⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀once⠀waited⠀out⠀a⠀phone⠀call,⠀the⠀coat⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀another⠀winter—so⠀glamour⠀is⠀memory⠀made⠀physical,⠀never⠀decoration.\n\nMove⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀practical⠀care⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀passion.⠀Show⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀the⠀other's⠀daily⠀habits,⠀who⠀registers⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀voice⠀or⠀posture⠀before⠀anything⠀is⠀said,⠀who⠀drives,⠀who⠀stays,⠀who⠀calls⠀first⠀after⠀a⠀silence.⠀Let⠀speech⠀run⠀a⠀few⠀steps⠀behind⠀feeling,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀carry⠀the⠀desire.⠀A⠀disclosure⠀can⠀arrive⠀undramatically,⠀over⠀dishes⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀platform,⠀and⠀still⠀change⠀what⠀is⠀possible;⠀a⠀disagreement⠀can⠀stay⠀unresolved⠀across⠀several⠀scenes⠀without⠀ending⠀anything.⠀Decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀emerge⠀from⠀repeated⠀small⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀one⠀grand⠀confession.\n\nHold⠀one⠀focal⠀consciousness⠀in⠀the⠀narration.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀visible⠀prose,⠀plainly⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters,⠀and⠀present⠀observation⠀stays⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀remembered⠀event.⠀Let⠀remembered⠀places⠀anchor⠀the⠀stakes—a⠀school⠀corridor,⠀a⠀bench⠀by⠀the⠀water,⠀a⠀hospital⠀waiting⠀area—returning⠀as⠀their⠀meaning⠀shifts,⠀without⠀converting⠀whole⠀scenes⠀into⠀flashback.\n\nUse⠀the⠀country,⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies;⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀contexts⠀keep⠀distinct⠀particulars⠀and⠀are⠀not⠀interchangeable⠀scenery,⠀and⠀forced⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀or⠀bleak⠀isolation⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀default⠀temperament.⠀Quiet⠀intervals⠀may⠀be⠀lingered⠀in⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀or⠀a⠀failure.⠀Close⠀wherever⠀the⠀current⠀beat⠀naturally⠀ends—an⠀act⠀of⠀care,⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment,