ter⠀a⠀pause,⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀ordinary⠀business;⠀whatever⠀the⠀last⠀beat⠀is,⠀it⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀happened⠀and⠀leaves⠀room⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀to⠀respond.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀player-control⠀settings.⠀If⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀belongs⠀to⠀one⠀character,⠀show⠀only⠀what⠀that⠀character⠀can⠀observe⠀or⠀infer;⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀narration⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀encounters⠀on⠀the⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route:⠀each⠀episode⠀has⠀its⠀own⠀small⠀completeness—an⠀occasion,⠀a⠀change,⠀a⠀residue—while⠀recurring⠀places,⠀objects,⠀phrases,⠀and⠀obligations⠀link⠀the⠀parts⠀into⠀one⠀history.⠀An⠀episode⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀question,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀still⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀something⠀concrete⠀to⠀carry⠀forward:⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀a⠀new⠀debt,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀or⠀broken,⠀a⠀name⠀now⠀used⠀differently.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀plain⠀and⠀measured,⠀observing⠀social⠀behavior⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀accepts⠀an⠀unfair⠀arrangement⠀as⠀normal,⠀record⠀the⠀acceptance;⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀episode⠀shows⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀say⠀about⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀irony.⠀A⠀family⠀may⠀praise⠀a⠀daughter's⠀obedience⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀her⠀setting⠀aside⠀her⠀own⠀letter⠀unanswered.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀own⠀knowledge—what⠀they⠀admit⠀to⠀having⠀wanted,⠀what⠀they⠀understood⠀only⠀later—may⠀enter⠀plainly,⠀without⠀commentary,⠀wherever⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀that⠀interiority.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀repetition⠀with⠀varied⠀meaning.⠀A⠀meeting⠀at⠀a⠀market⠀stall,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀book,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀duty⠀returns⠀with⠀different⠀weight⠀as⠀circumstances⠀change.⠀Attraction⠀may⠀be⠀expressed⠀as⠀practical⠀care,⠀shared⠀work,⠀or⠀the⠀courage⠀to⠀speak⠀once⠀against⠀an⠀expectation;⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀a⠀disagreement,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀gets⠀its⠀own⠀episode⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀compressed⠀into⠀summary.⠀Some⠀recurrences⠀deepen⠀the⠀attachment;⠀sometimes⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀shows⠀how⠀little⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀that⠀sameness⠀is⠀the⠀point.⠀Use⠀the⠀return⠀of⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀as⠀a⠀link⠀between⠀episodes,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀signal⠀that⠀a⠀turning⠀point⠀must⠀follow.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀The⠀episodic⠀method⠀works⠀in⠀a⠀modern⠀neighborhood⠀or⠀a⠀rural⠀town⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀in⠀an⠀older⠀setting;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀dynastic⠀world⠀or⠀a⠀cast⠀of⠀scholars⠀and⠀officials⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀places⠀them⠀there.\n\nThe⠀romance⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀marriage⠀or⠀separation.⠀What⠀the⠀accumulated⠀episodes⠀should⠀make⠀legible⠀is⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀come⠀to⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀world⠀permits⠀or⠀refuses⠀them,⠀one⠀episode⠀at⠀a⠀time.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard,⠀concrete⠀sentences.⠀Name⠀the⠀worn⠀handle,⠀the⠀cracked⠀step,⠀the⠀cold⠀rice,⠀the⠀coat⠀too⠀thin⠀for⠀the⠀weather,⠀and⠀let⠀material⠀conditions⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀pressure:⠀two⠀people⠀may⠀care⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀while⠀neither⠀can⠀afford⠀the⠀time⠀or⠀safety⠀to⠀say⠀so.⠀Do⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀physical⠀world⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀romance⠀comfortable,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀mistake⠀hardness⠀for⠀numbness—the⠀characters⠀feel⠀the⠀cold⠀and⠀the⠀shortage⠀because⠀both⠀are⠀specified.\n\nCut⠀transitions⠀to⠀the⠀bone.⠀Move⠀from⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀to⠀a⠀quarrel⠀to⠀a⠀silent⠀walk⠀without⠀connective⠀padding,⠀relying⠀on⠀placed⠀detail⠀and⠀rhythm⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀still⠀follow⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history.⠀When⠀a⠀feeling⠀needs⠀room,⠀slow⠀the⠀beat⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀run,⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀reasoning—what⠀they⠀are⠀calculating,⠀what⠀they⠀refuse⠀to⠀calculate—then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀shorter⠀line.⠀Vary⠀sentence⠀length⠀deliberately;⠀one⠀long⠀sentence⠀after⠀clipped⠀ones⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀moment⠀care⠀becomes⠀undeniable.\n\nLet⠀terse⠀dialogue⠀reveal⠀position⠀through⠀refusal.⠀A⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀future⠀is⠀answered⠀with⠀the⠀rent;⠀care⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀broken⠀clasp⠀repaired⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀notices⠀the⠀repair⠀and⠀understands⠀it⠀without⠀a⠀spoken⠀explanation.⠀Rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀speaker⠀and⠀their⠀exhaustion,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀uniform⠀narration.\n\nShow⠀social⠀damage⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts:⠀a⠀boss's⠀demand,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀comment,⠀a⠀family⠀debt,⠀a⠀public⠀humiliation⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀believes⠀they⠀are⠀allowed⠀to⠀want.⠀Record⠀these⠀events⠀plainly,⠀without⠀converting⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀demonstration.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀real⠀and⠀unromanticized—a⠀shared⠀cigarette,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀sore⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀meal⠀left⠀warm,⠀a⠀lie⠀told⠀to⠀protect⠀the⠀other's⠀job.⠀The⠀story⠀need⠀not⠀promise⠀comfort⠀or⠀rescue;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀care⠀is⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀circumstances.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires—a⠀sent⠀letter,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀with⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀receipt⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀book,⠀a⠀formal⠀request,⠀a⠀brief⠀reply,⠀a⠀ledger⠀line—rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀mechanically⠀through⠀formats.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀be⠀sent,⠀withheld,⠀returned,⠀or⠀found⠀years⠀later;⠀where⠀it⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀sequence⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀reveal⠀its⠀writer's⠀position⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀records⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀leaves⠀out.⠀One⠀writes⠀only⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀while⠀the⠀care⠀taken⠀with⠀the⠀wording⠀shows⠀the⠀rest;⠀another⠀drafts⠀a⠀long⠀confession⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀send⠀it.⠀Treat⠀the⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀its⠀revisions⠀and⠀abandoned⠀openings⠀show⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀could⠀not⠀deliver,⠀not⠀a⠀transcript⠀of⠀their⠀live⠀mind⠀at⠀every⠀moment.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀surrounding⠀documents⠀show⠀carries⠀the⠀irony⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀narrator.\n\nPut⠀social⠀conditions⠀inside⠀the⠀paperwork.⠀A⠀family⠀letter⠀pressures⠀a⠀daughter⠀toward⠀a⠀match;⠀a⠀landlord's⠀notice⠀interrupts⠀a⠀courtship;⠀a⠀work⠀record⠀explains⠀a⠀missed⠀meeting;⠀a⠀bill⠀explains⠀a⠀decision.⠀These⠀appear⠀as⠀ordinary⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀correspondence,⠀not⠀as⠀inserted⠀lectures—the⠀institution⠀shows⠀itself⠀in⠀what⠀gets⠀written⠀down⠀and⠀kept.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀sequence⠀readable⠀across⠀gaps.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀relationship's⠀development⠀even⠀when⠀accounts⠀conflict⠀or⠀events⠀go⠀unrecorded⠀between⠀entries.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀but⠀the⠀correction⠀comes⠀from⠀a⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀write—a⠀question⠀asked,⠀an⠀account⠀settled,⠀an⠀apology⠀finally⠀composed—not⠀from⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀after⠀the⠀records.\n\nThe⠀accumulated⠀documents—remembered⠀details,⠀practical⠀care,⠀apologies,⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together—make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀file⠀closed⠀with⠀a⠀reunion⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀letter;⠀the⠀last⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀minor,⠀recent,⠀or⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀warmth⠀through⠀concrete,⠀ordinary⠀care⠀particular⠀to⠀these⠀people:⠀one⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀saves⠀the⠀best⠀portion⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀walks⠀the⠀longer⠀route⠀to⠀see⠀them⠀home,⠀mends⠀a⠀torn⠀sleeve⠀unasked.⠀Choose⠀gestures⠀that⠀fit⠀the⠀established⠀history—an⠀established⠀pair's⠀shorthand⠀differs⠀from⠀a⠀slow⠀beginning's⠀careful⠀testing—and⠀let⠀the⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repair⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀comfort⠀inside⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀circumstances.⠀They⠀may⠀be⠀tired,⠀short⠀of⠀money,⠀or⠀bound⠀by⠀family⠀expectations,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀holds⠀room⠀for⠀ease:⠀a⠀quiet⠀evening,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke,⠀a⠀familiar⠀song,⠀a⠀bowl⠀held⠀in⠀both⠀hands.⠀The⠀difficulties⠀remain⠀real;⠀the⠀care⠀coexists⠀with⠀them⠀rather⠀than⠀dissolving⠀them.\n\nAllow⠀manageable⠀friction.⠀One⠀person⠀is⠀particular⠀about⠀how⠀things⠀are⠀done,⠀needs⠀time⠀alone,⠀or⠀disagrees⠀about⠀a⠀small⠀matter;⠀the⠀other⠀respects⠀the⠀difference,⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀holds.⠀Under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀render⠀the⠀small⠀pleasures⠀privately⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀outwardly—the⠀relief⠀of⠀the⠀longer⠀route,⠀the⠀quiet⠀satisfaction⠀of⠀the⠀mended⠀sleeve—so⠀ease⠀is⠀felt,⠀not⠀merely⠀reported.\n\nUse⠀plain,⠀observant⠀narration:⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀shoulders⠀relax,⠀rain⠀on⠀the⠀roof,⠀steam⠀rising⠀from⠀a⠀cup.⠀Do⠀not⠀overdecorate;⠀clean⠀language⠀keeps⠀the⠀comfort⠀from⠀turning⠀sentimental.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene⠀organized⠀around⠀attraction,⠀trust,⠀and⠀chosen⠀connection—decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀made⠀in⠀small⠀forms—rather⠀than⠀letting⠀the⠀warm⠀treatment⠀quietly⠀replace⠀the⠀romance⠀with⠀an⠀unrelated⠀domestic⠀vignette.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀bond⠀through⠀repeated⠀attention⠀and⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀grand⠀declaration.⠀Whether⠀the⠀starting⠀point⠀is⠀established⠀love,⠀a⠀slow⠀beginning,⠀or⠀the⠀day⠀after⠀a⠀quarrel,⠀the⠀warmth⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀particular⠀history⠀these⠀two⠀share,⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀larger⠀problems⠀may⠀simply⠀wait⠀outside⠀the⠀door⠀for⠀an⠀evening.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀scenes⠀with⠀enough⠀social⠀context⠀to⠀situate⠀the⠀characters—the⠀expectations⠀of⠀their⠀families,⠀the⠀demands⠀of⠀their⠀work,⠀the⠀reputation⠀they⠀maintain,⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀the⠀place—and⠀let⠀that⠀context⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀and⠀done⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀narration⠀into⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Let⠀paragraphs⠀develop:⠀an⠀occasion⠀is⠀established,⠀an⠀exchange⠀carries⠀it⠀forward,⠀a⠀closing⠀beat⠀leaves⠀its⠀residue⠀for⠀later⠀scenes.\n\nUse⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀set⠀private⠀feeling⠀against⠀public⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀performs⠀the⠀correct⠀greeting⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀records⠀the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀it,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀gift⠀accepted⠀with⠀both⠀hands,⠀the⠀conversation⠀about⠀weather⠀that⠀carries⠀an⠀unspoken⠀question.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀feeling;⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀observance⠀and⠀private⠀attention⠀does⠀the⠀work.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀interiority,⠀place⠀it⠀inside⠀this⠀frame⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience,⠀not⠀as⠀annotation.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀scenes⠀that⠀accumulate⠀social⠀and⠀emotional⠀consequence.⠀A⠀formal⠀visit,⠀a⠀family⠀meal,⠀a⠀public⠀celebration,⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀interrupted⠀by⠀obligation⠀each⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀believe⠀is⠀possible,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath⠀appears⠀later:⠀a⠀letter⠀written⠀more⠀carefully,⠀a⠀route⠀changed⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀with⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀in⠀mind.⠀Trust⠀and⠀disclosure⠀grow⠀by⠀measured⠀degrees⠀or⠀falter⠀in⠀one⠀measured⠀scene,⠀as⠀these⠀people⠀and⠀their⠀history⠀require.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀clean⠀and⠀unsentimental.⠀The⠀formality⠀lies⠀in⠀the⠀architecture—how⠀scenes⠀open,⠀develop,⠀and⠀close,⠀how⠀social⠀framing⠀is⠀sustained—not⠀in⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀stay⠀ordinary;⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀life⠀organize⠀passages⠀where⠀relevant.\n\nThe⠀romance⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀in⠀marriage,⠀separation,⠀or⠀confession.⠀The⠀novel⠀form⠀can⠀hold⠀uncertainty;⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀legible⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀relationship⠀develops⠀within⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀these⠀people⠀inhabit⠀and⠀the⠀choices⠀they⠀make⠀inside⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nTreat⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀act⠀between⠀two⠀people⠀negotiating⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀relationship⠀means⠀now.⠀One⠀tells⠀an⠀account⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀—⠀alone,⠀before⠀a⠀small⠀group⠀that⠀includes⠀the⠀other,⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀mediator⠀whose⠀response⠀will⠀reach⠀the⠀other.⠀Before⠀the⠀tale⠀begins,⠀establish⠀the⠀occasion⠀and⠀the⠀stake:⠀why⠀this⠀telling⠀happens⠀now,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀it⠀to⠀accomplish,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀reason⠀to⠀doubt.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀itself⠀an⠀approach;⠀it⠀can⠀persuade,⠀reassure,⠀wound,⠀delay,⠀or⠀test,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀fail⠀at⠀its⠀stated⠀purpose⠀while⠀accomplishing⠀something⠀else.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀carry⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀said⠀directly.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects,⠀orders,⠀and⠀omits⠀remembered⠀details,⠀and⠀those⠀choices⠀disclose⠀an⠀attitude:⠀fondness⠀understated,⠀blame⠀diverted,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀presented⠀as⠀ordinary⠀obligation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller⠀from⠀full⠀self-awareness.⠀Under⠀the⠀listener's⠀interruptions,⠀allow⠀revision,⠀omission,⠀defensiveness.⠀Let⠀one⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀location⠀return⠀across⠀the⠀tale⠀so⠀it⠀accrues⠀meaning,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀register⠀the⠀pattern⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀not⠀stated⠀—⠀in⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀repeated⠀probe,⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀private⠀beat⠀of⠀attention⠀between⠀exchanges.\n\nMake⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀both⠀treat⠀as⠀normal.⠀Family⠀obligation,⠀money,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀habitual⠀courtesy⠀appear⠀as⠀small⠀concrete⠀acts⠀—⠀a⠀loan⠀repaid⠀reluctantly,⠀a⠀relative⠀asked⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept⠀to⠀avoid⠀embarrassment⠀—⠀without⠀stepping⠀outside⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀explain⠀them.⠀Where⠀the⠀material⠀allows,⠀show⠀one⠀episode⠀from⠀both⠀positions:⠀the⠀teller⠀calls⠀it⠀ordinary;⠀the⠀pauses⠀and⠀word⠀choices⠀let⠀the⠀listener,⠀and⠀the⠀reader,⠀hear⠀that⠀it⠀was⠀not.\n\nDo⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀attraction.⠀Let⠀it⠀surface⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀refuses⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀pass,⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀returns⠀to⠀something⠀the⠀listener⠀once⠀said,⠀or⠀when⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀offers⠀food,⠀company,⠀or⠀a⠀chance⠀to⠀stop⠀talking.⠀Where⠀the⠀material⠀supports⠀it,⠀timing⠀and⠀disclosure⠀can⠀work⠀against⠀the⠀teller's⠀aim:⠀an⠀account⠀meant⠀to⠀justify⠀an⠀absence⠀reveals⠀a⠀neglect;⠀a⠀story⠀offered⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀patience⠀shows⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀being⠀ignored.\n\nStop⠀wherever⠀the⠀telling's⠀own⠀edge⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-account,⠀mid-interruption,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀want⠀to⠀answer.⠀The⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀need⠀not⠀achieve⠀its⠀intended⠀effect,⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.⠀No⠀nightly⠀deadline,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀royal⠀frame,⠀or⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀levels⠀belongs⠀here.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀and⠀particular:⠀it⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀a⠀person⠀choosing⠀what⠀to⠀say,⠀with⠀the⠀small⠀hypocrisies⠀and⠀loyalties⠀audible⠀underneath.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism.⠀Make⠀the⠀relationship⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀with⠀space,⠀money,⠀time,⠀work,⠀and⠀other⠀people:⠀one⠀arrives⠀late⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀shift,⠀another⠀prepares⠀a⠀room,⠀someone⠀offers⠀to⠀carry⠀a⠀burden⠀or⠀quietly⠀arranges⠀for⠀its⠀cost⠀to⠀be⠀shared.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀attraction⠀early.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀register⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀tensions⠀around⠀them,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀learns⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀values⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀manage⠀to⠀give⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀avoid⠀giving.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrating⠀voice⠀outside⠀the⠀couple's⠀private⠀vocabulary.⠀It⠀can⠀observe⠀a⠀face,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀possession,⠀a⠀repeated⠀habit,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀close⠀briefly⠀on⠀one⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀reaction⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀noticed,⠀weighed,⠀and⠀not⠀said⠀—⠀without⠀claiming⠀a⠀complete⠀account⠀of⠀either⠀mind.⠀The⠀irony⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀asks⠀for⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀does:⠀render⠀a⠀formal⠀greeting⠀precisely,⠀then⠀note⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀visit,⠀or⠀the⠀room⠀left⠀uncleaned⠀because⠀no⠀guest⠀was⠀expected⠀to⠀stay.⠀No⠀lecture⠀on⠀class⠀or⠀the⠀family⠀system;⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀a⠀postponement,⠀or⠀an⠀accepted⠀obligation⠀carries⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀to⠀show⠀development.⠀Return⠀to⠀earlier⠀versions⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀under⠀relationship⠀pressure:⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀closed,⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀money⠀is⠀returned,⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀someone⠀says⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀only⠀done.⠀Let⠀one⠀character's⠀expectations⠀about⠀marriage,⠀care,⠀or⠀privacy⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀the⠀other's⠀circumstances,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀how⠀trust⠀or⠀vulnerability⠀has⠀shifted⠀without⠀any⠀repetition⠀being⠀labeled⠀romantic.⠀A⠀slightly⠀formal⠀reflective⠀sentence⠀can⠀assess⠀a⠀situation⠀without⠀naming⠀the⠀feeling⠀—⠀he⠀had⠀learned⠀that⠀her⠀silence⠀meant⠀she⠀was⠀not⠀yet⠀willing⠀to⠀be⠀interrupted.⠀That⠀is⠀observation⠀belonging⠀to⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀watches⠀two⠀people⠀and⠀understands⠀their⠀conditions,⠀not⠀an⠀inner⠀monologue.\n\nMove⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀decisions⠀rather⠀than⠀confessions:⠀staying⠀longer⠀than⠀planned,⠀withholding⠀an⠀insult,⠀accepting⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀obligation⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀sake,⠀stopping⠀the⠀pretense⠀that⠀a⠀promise⠀is⠀merely⠀practical.⠀Give⠀each⠀choice⠀material⠀consequence⠀—⠀a⠀lost⠀hour⠀of⠀sleep,⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀displeasure,⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀becomes⠀a⠀regular⠀practice.⠀Keep⠀the⠀syntax⠀plain⠀but⠀not⠀transparent,⠀free⠀of⠀bureaucratic⠀severity⠀or⠀pastiche⠀translated⠀word⠀order.⠀You⠀may⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀the⠀intimate⠀have⠀become⠀hard⠀to⠀separate,⠀or⠀earlier,⠀mid-arrangement;⠀the⠀surrounding⠀conditions⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀resolved⠀for⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀be⠀complete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀present⠀where⠀an⠀older⠀authority⠀still⠀operates⠀through⠀buildings,⠀jobs,⠀family⠀claims,⠀debts,⠀and⠀habits⠀of⠀deference.⠀Make⠀that⠀authority⠀concrete⠀in⠀urban⠀material⠀detail:⠀a⠀narrow⠀entrance⠀only⠀some⠀people⠀use,⠀an⠀apartment⠀whose⠀old⠀fixtures⠀were⠀never⠀repaired,⠀a⠀schedule⠀shaped⠀by⠀someone⠀else's⠀expectations.⠀Do⠀not⠀name⠀the⠀system;⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀and⠀restriction.⠀The⠀irony⠀emerges⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀calls⠀these⠀arrangements⠀normal⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀registers⠀their⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀the⠀attraction⠀develop⠀across⠀different⠀positions⠀in⠀this⠀structure⠀—⠀one⠀has⠀access⠀the⠀other⠀lacks,⠀or⠀one⠀is⠀regarded⠀as⠀a⠀protector⠀while⠀actually⠀being⠀constrained.⠀Whether⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀new,⠀long⠀established,⠀or⠀under⠀repair,⠀let⠀the⠀hierarchy⠀press⠀into⠀it:⠀a⠀meeting⠀that⠀would⠀be⠀easy⠀between⠀equals⠀requires⠀managing⠀visibility,⠀excuses,⠀the⠀risk⠀of⠀being⠀seen⠀together.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀private⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀—⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀can⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀brief⠀suspension⠀of⠀public⠀roles⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀neutral⠀backdrop⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀itself⠀decides⠀nothing.⠀A⠀dark⠀stairwell⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀anyone⠀honest;⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀does⠀not⠀determine⠀anyone's⠀feelings.⠀The⠀setting⠀changes⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀encounter,⠀not⠀the⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀attraction.\n\nShow⠀masks⠀falling⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀fall⠀miraculous.⠀A⠀character⠀stops⠀performing⠀deference,⠀admits⠀an⠀obligation⠀was⠀not⠀freely⠀chosen,⠀or⠀laughs⠀at⠀a⠀custom⠀never⠀before⠀permitted⠀to⠀mock;⠀the⠀narration⠀treats⠀this⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀social⠀risk.⠀The⠀other's⠀response⠀is⠀a⠀test⠀that⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀rescue:⠀one⠀can⠀recognize⠀the⠀confession⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀public⠀arrangement⠀intact.⠀Avoid⠀sentimental⠀redemption⠀—⠀the⠀intimacy⠀may⠀be⠀genuine⠀and⠀change⠀nothing⠀outside⠀the⠀room.⠀What⠀it⠀changes⠀is⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀and⠀about⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀asked⠀of⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀desire⠀concrete⠀and⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀Affection⠀can⠀entangle⠀with⠀gratitude,⠀resentment,⠀convenience,⠀the⠀need⠀for⠀a⠀safe⠀place;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀the⠀other⠀precisely⠀because⠀that⠀person⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀mask⠀fall.⠀Do⠀not⠀declare⠀this⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀and⠀brief⠀private⠀reactions⠀observe⠀the⠀small⠀choices⠀—⠀waiting⠀in⠀a⠀hallway,⠀leaving⠀a⠀spare⠀key,⠀risking⠀a⠀reprimand⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀call⠀—⠀each⠀kept⠀in⠀its⠀owner's⠀register.⠀Give⠀the⠀encounter⠀room⠀to⠀be⠀enjoyed;⠀unease⠀is⠀texture,⠀not⠀a⠀sentence⠀imposed⠀on⠀every⠀meeting.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀business⠀naturally⠀pauses⠀—⠀mid-conversation,⠀mid-departure,⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀after⠀a⠀mask⠀slips⠀—⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀public⠀outcome⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀plan⠀before⠀ending.⠀No⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀faction⠀politics,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀bond⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀treatment;⠀the⠀horror⠀is⠀inherited⠀and⠀social,⠀and⠀the⠀romance⠀is⠀one⠀place⠀where⠀its⠀claims⠀become⠀impossible⠀to⠀ignore.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Place⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀the⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀supplies⠀—⠀or,⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀none,⠀fix⠀a⠀concrete⠀one⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀daily⠀arrangements⠀visible⠀throughout.⠀Let⠀practical⠀family⠀and⠀work⠀demands⠀shape⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀two⠀can⠀have:⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀festival,⠀a⠀relative's⠀visit,⠀a⠀journey,⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀keep⠀an⠀arrangement⠀private.⠀Do⠀not⠀present⠀the⠀family⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀oppressive⠀block;⠀give⠀different⠀members⠀different⠀degrees⠀of⠀tolerance,⠀expectation,⠀and⠀influence,⠀each⠀revealed⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀without⠀comment⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀question.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀social⠀rules⠀through⠀plain⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation.⠀A⠀character⠀accepts⠀that⠀an⠀engagement,⠀a⠀visit,⠀or⠀a⠀financial⠀obligation⠀comes⠀first;⠀show⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀concrete⠀detail⠀—⠀a⠀meal⠀set⠀aside⠀and⠀reheated,⠀a⠀phone⠀call⠀timed⠀for⠀privacy,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀entered⠀because⠀someone⠀is⠀sleeping.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀might⠀want,⠀including⠀a⠀brief⠀nonspoken⠀reaction⠀kept⠀in⠀that⠀character's⠀own⠀idiom,⠀without⠀entering⠀a⠀full⠀private⠀monologue.⠀Irony⠀appears⠀when⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀should⠀be⠀romantic⠀must⠀be⠀justified⠀as⠀social⠀duty.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀attraction⠀through⠀small⠀choices⠀and⠀adjustments⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration.⠀One⠀learns⠀the⠀other's⠀habits⠀—⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀free,⠀what⠀food⠀they⠀share,⠀which⠀topics⠀they⠀avoid,⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀silence⠀means.⠀Trust⠀appears⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀defies⠀a⠀minor⠀expectation⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀sake⠀or⠀shields⠀them⠀from⠀a⠀larger⠀consequence,⠀and⠀each⠀such⠀choice⠀carries⠀a⠀visible⠀cost:⠀a⠀parent's⠀disappointment,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀remark,⠀the⠀loss⠀of⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀day.⠀Let⠀the⠀pair⠀also⠀simply⠀enjoy⠀each⠀other⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀permits;⠀pressure⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀in⠀every⠀beat.\n\nLet⠀conflict⠀arise⠀from⠀practical⠀difference⠀rather⠀than⠀manufactured⠀misunderstanding:⠀one⠀wants⠀the⠀relationship⠀known,⠀the⠀other⠀must⠀wait⠀because⠀of⠀study,⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀dependent⠀relative;⠀the⠀pressure⠀accumulates⠀through⠀repeated⠀small⠀incidents.⠀The⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀small⠀as⠀a⠀relative's⠀casual⠀assumption⠀about⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀house,⠀or⠀a⠀rule⠀about⠀being⠀seen⠀together⠀that⠀everyone⠀treats⠀as⠀ordinary.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀and⠀community⠀concrete⠀—⠀food,⠀clothing,⠀means⠀of⠀travel,⠀names⠀of⠀ordinary⠀spaces⠀—⠀without⠀inserting⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀every⠀word⠀or⠀explain⠀every⠀custom;⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀carry⠀them.⠀You⠀may⠀stop⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀stay,⠀to⠀wait,⠀to⠀tell⠀a⠀specific⠀truth,⠀or⠀to⠀accept⠀that⠀the⠀public⠀arrangement⠀cannot⠀yet⠀change;⠀you⠀may⠀equally⠀stop⠀inside⠀an⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀task.⠀The⠀social⠀and⠀the⠀personal⠀remain⠀entangled,⠀and⠀no⠀fixed⠀outcome⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Set⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀everyday⠀site⠀—⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀hospital⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀meet⠀on⠀a⠀regular⠀schedule.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀both⠀characters⠀without⠀taking⠀over⠀their⠀complete⠀minds:⠀it⠀can⠀render⠀what⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀avoids⠀saying,⠀and⠀privately⠀concludes⠀in⠀short⠀beats,⠀but⠀not⠀as⠀continuous⠀stream-of-consciousness.⠀Private⠀thought,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀is⠀specific⠀and⠀brief⠀—⠀a⠀judgment,⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀time,⠀a⠀decision⠀not⠀to⠀speak.\n\nConvey⠀feeling⠀through⠀observed⠀alteration.⠀One⠀starts⠀arriving⠀earlier,⠀changes⠀a⠀route,⠀brings⠀an⠀extra⠀portion,⠀retires⠀a⠀habitual⠀joke,⠀chooses⠀silence⠀to⠀protect⠀something.⠀Treat⠀these⠀as⠀concrete⠀events⠀with⠀social⠀consequences:⠀a⠀senior⠀colleague⠀notices⠀the⠀extra⠀attention⠀and⠀says⠀something⠀ordinary⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀expectation;⠀a⠀neighbor⠀observes⠀the⠀visits⠀without⠀comment.⠀The⠀institution⠀—⠀hierarchy,⠀family⠀expectation,⠀school⠀rules⠀—⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀mild⠀speech⠀and⠀routine⠀behavior,⠀never⠀through⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀seasonal⠀or⠀temporal⠀detail⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀marks⠀change:⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀daylight,⠀a⠀festival,⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀term⠀can⠀signal⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀moved⠀between⠀stages,⠀integrated⠀into⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀deployed⠀as⠀scenery.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focus⠀on⠀specific⠀acts⠀—⠀a⠀borrowed⠀umbrella,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀keys⠀returned⠀later⠀than⠀promised.\n\nThe⠀attraction⠀may⠀be⠀immediate⠀or⠀slow,⠀but⠀obligations⠀test⠀it:⠀a⠀prior⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀family⠀responsibility,⠀the⠀social⠀cost⠀of⠀being⠀seen⠀together.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀this⠀into⠀constant⠀suffering.⠀Show⠀the⠀pair⠀simply⠀enjoying⠀each⠀other's⠀company,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀competing⠀demand⠀cut⠀the⠀moment⠀short.⠀The⠀irony⠀lands⠀when⠀an⠀accepted⠀duty⠀quietly⠀overrides⠀a⠀private⠀wish⠀and⠀neither⠀says⠀so:⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀loss⠀in⠀the⠀clean⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀timed⠀departure⠀or⠀an⠀unopened⠀message,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀one-line⠀private⠀reaction⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀leaving.\n\nSome⠀scenes⠀can⠀be⠀direct⠀and⠀warm,⠀others⠀restrained;⠀no⠀uniform⠀quietness⠀is⠀required.⠀A⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point⠀is⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀attention⠀rests⠀—⠀mid-shift,⠀after⠀a⠀departure,⠀on⠀a⠀choice⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀social⠀pattern,⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀pattern⠀continuing⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀its⠀cost.⠀Resolution⠀is⠀not⠀owed⠀to⠀the⠀form.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀urban⠀fiction.⠀Root⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀language,⠀neighborhood,⠀and⠀social⠀history⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀or⠀implies.⠀Treat⠀the⠀city⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀meeting⠀points,⠀routes,⠀and⠀small⠀public⠀spaces⠀full⠀of⠀observers⠀—⠀a⠀bus⠀stop,⠀a⠀café,⠀a⠀plaza,⠀a⠀corner⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀do⠀not⠀yet⠀know⠀what⠀to⠀say.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀both⠀characters⠀to⠀register⠀individual⠀pressure⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀feeling;⠀the⠀irony⠀emerges⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀treats⠀a⠀demand⠀of⠀reputation,⠀family,⠀or⠀work⠀as⠀self-evident⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀makes⠀its⠀cost⠀concrete.\n\nLet⠀disclosure⠀work⠀as⠀an⠀uneven⠀process.⠀Fix⠀which⠀character⠀is⠀more⠀willing⠀to⠀speak⠀about⠀a⠀past⠀relationship,⠀a⠀failure,⠀an⠀expectation;⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀listen,⠀deflect,⠀or⠀return⠀later⠀to⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀went⠀unanswered.⠀Do⠀not⠀reward⠀every⠀confession⠀with⠀closeness⠀—⠀a⠀personal⠀history⠀can⠀make⠀someone⠀less⠀desirable,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀familiar⠀habit⠀look⠀different.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀when⠀the⠀characters⠀withstand⠀that⠀change:⠀one⠀keeps⠀calling,⠀the⠀other⠀stops⠀inventing⠀excuses,⠀both⠀sit⠀through⠀a⠀disagreement⠀without⠀leaving.\n\nSelect⠀urban⠀details⠀that⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀encounter.⠀A⠀neighbor,⠀a⠀shop⠀owner,⠀a⠀group⠀of⠀acquaintances⠀can⠀say⠀small⠀things⠀that⠀expose⠀unspoken⠀local⠀rules⠀—⠀a⠀joke⠀about⠀a⠀man⠀waiting,⠀a⠀question⠀addressed⠀to⠀someone's⠀mother,⠀a⠀seat⠀automatically⠀saved.⠀Deliver⠀this⠀pressure⠀through⠀dialogue⠀and⠀indirect⠀report⠀so⠀it⠀stays⠀ordinary;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀normal⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀place,⠀not⠀a⠀melodrama⠀of⠀persecution.⠀The⠀couple's⠀intimacy⠀consists⠀in⠀creating⠀a⠀temporary⠀space⠀apart⠀from⠀that⠀texture,⠀not⠀in⠀the⠀city⠀disappearing.\n\nUse⠀interiority⠀without⠀inflating⠀it.⠀While⠀walking⠀to⠀meet⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀encounter⠀and⠀compare⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀—⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀tone,⠀a⠀new⠀habit,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀clothing⠀—⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀can⠀contradict⠀spoken⠀words:⠀saying⠀'it⠀was⠀nothing'⠀while⠀retaining⠀the⠀exact⠀moment.⠀Short⠀focalized⠀passages⠀of⠀observation⠀and⠀memory⠀are⠀enough;⠀no⠀stream-of-consciousness⠀is⠀required.⠀Keep⠀any⠀marvelous⠀material⠀out⠀of⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀it:⠀the⠀romance⠀is⠀grounded⠀in⠀particular⠀bodies,⠀timetables,⠀and⠀histories,⠀and⠀its⠀meaning⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀continue⠀or⠀to⠀stop,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrative⠀law⠀that⠀reunites⠀lovers.\n\nStop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀attention⠀pauses⠀—⠀mid-walk,⠀mid-question,⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀become⠀contested,⠀or⠀simply⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀an⠀evening.⠀A⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀may⠀have⠀become⠀visible,⠀or⠀not⠀yet;⠀neither⠀state⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀meeting,⠀errand,⠀or⠀shift⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀already⠀share⠀a⠀partial⠀connection⠀—⠀they⠀work⠀together,⠀live⠀in⠀nearby⠀rooms,⠀attend⠀the⠀same⠀class,⠀help⠀the⠀same⠀relative.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀space⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀task⠀that⠀brings⠀them⠀together;⠀no⠀exposition⠀dump.⠀Keep⠀every⠀spatial⠀change⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀establish⠀the⠀room,⠀street,⠀desk,⠀hallway,⠀or⠀doorway⠀before⠀moving⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀one.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀short⠀reaction⠀beats⠀placed⠀after⠀actions⠀and⠀dialogue.⠀One⠀hesitates⠀before⠀speaking;⠀the⠀other⠀notices⠀the⠀hesitation⠀and⠀adjusts.⠀A⠀promised⠀favor⠀produces⠀relief⠀or⠀suspicion.⠀A⠀casual⠀remark⠀reveals⠀what⠀someone⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal,⠀and⠀the⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀single⠀private⠀line⠀that⠀exposes⠀the⠀rule⠀— *she⠀always⠀waits⠀because⠀in⠀her⠀house⠀waiting⠀is⠀polite* —⠀with⠀no⠀lecture⠀attached.⠀These⠀beats⠀are⠀the⠀main⠀channel⠀of⠀the⠀irony:⠀the⠀pair⠀keeps⠀obeying⠀small⠀expectations,⠀and⠀their⠀private⠀reactions⠀show⠀the⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀each⠀reaction⠀specific⠀to⠀its⠀owner:⠀one⠀becomes⠀hurried,⠀another⠀quiet,⠀one⠀laughs⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment.\n\nBreak⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Do⠀not⠀bury⠀a⠀mental⠀reaction⠀inside⠀unrelated⠀movement;⠀if⠀a⠀feeling⠀changes⠀the⠀scene,⠀give⠀it⠀its⠀own⠀short⠀paragraph⠀after⠀the⠀line⠀that⠀caused⠀it.⠀Dialogue⠀and⠀narration⠀can⠀alternate⠀quickly,⠀but⠀the⠀staging⠀stays⠀clear⠀—⠀where⠀the⠀speakers⠀are,⠀what⠀their⠀hands⠀and⠀eyes⠀are⠀doing,⠀when⠀one⠀leaves⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀closes⠀a⠀door.\n\nLet⠀attraction⠀emerge⠀through⠀repeated⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀confession:⠀remembering⠀a⠀preference,⠀bringing⠀the⠀right⠀object,⠀staying⠀longer⠀than⠀planned.⠀These⠀acts⠀are⠀not⠀guaranteed⠀to⠀be⠀read⠀correctly;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀file⠀them⠀as⠀routine,⠀and⠀that⠀misreading⠀is⠀itself⠀material.⠀Small⠀ordinary⠀complications⠀are⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀wants⠀one⠀—⠀a⠀late⠀message,⠀a⠀public⠀remark⠀that⠀forces⠀the⠀pair⠀to⠀name⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀together,⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀misassigned⠀—⠀but⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀required⠀in⠀every⠀reply,⠀and⠀when⠀used⠀they⠀should⠀reveal⠀an⠀existing⠀social⠀pressure⠀rather⠀than⠀manufacture⠀the⠀plot.\n\nStop⠀wherever⠀the⠀beat⠀lands⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀mid-sentence,⠀mid-walk⠀—⠀when⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀become⠀legible,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀simply⠀reaches⠀its⠀edge.⠀A⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀not⠀required,⠀and⠀neither⠀is⠀a⠀solution;⠀the⠀pace⠀needs⠀only⠀clean,⠀fast-readable⠀prose⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀unspoken⠀feeling⠀immediate⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀stakes⠀particular.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀sustained⠀attention.⠀Build⠀each⠀paragraph⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀actually⠀perceives⠀—⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀a⠀pause,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀hand⠀moves⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀sound⠀a⠀door⠀makes⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀syntax⠀group⠀a⠀gesture⠀with⠀its⠀ordinary⠀surroundings⠀so⠀the⠀feeling⠀arrives⠀as⠀precision⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀across⠀several⠀clauses,⠀but⠀only⠀while⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀perceiver⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀a⠀private⠀concern⠀present;⠀once⠀that⠀work⠀is⠀done,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀object⠀itself.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀sound⠀or⠀rhythm⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀echo⠀makes⠀its⠀second⠀occurrence⠀weightier.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history⠀in⠀recurring⠀images⠀drawn⠀from⠀these⠀two⠀people's⠀shared⠀material:⠀a⠀particular⠀seat,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀thing,⠀a⠀route⠀walked⠀together,⠀a⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀local⠀origin.⠀When⠀an⠀image⠀returns,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀new⠀information⠀—⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀since⠀its⠀last⠀appearance,⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀noticed⠀now,⠀what⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀has⠀decided⠀not⠀to⠀say.⠀Recurrence⠀is⠀how⠀this⠀narration⠀remembers;⠀it⠀should⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀characters'⠀attention⠀has⠀accumulated,⠀not⠀adorn⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀same⠀rule⠀governs⠀affection's⠀opposite:⠀a⠀repeated⠀irritation,⠀rendered⠀exactly,⠀can⠀hold⠀as⠀much⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀endearment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀figurative⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀and⠀out⠀of⠀most⠀mouths.⠀Let⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀speak⠀plainly,⠀practically,⠀even⠀bluntly,⠀while⠀the⠀prose⠀around⠀their⠀words⠀holds⠀the⠀associative⠀texture⠀their⠀speech⠀refuses.⠀When⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀surfaces⠀—⠀a⠀duty⠀invoked⠀as⠀fact,⠀a⠀courtesy⠀performed⠀at⠀someone's⠀expense,⠀a⠀slight⠀no⠀one⠀present⠀thought⠀to⠀name⠀—⠀break⠀the⠀rhythm⠀deliberately:⠀one⠀flat⠀declarative⠀sentence,⠀placed⠀where⠀the⠀music⠀has⠀been⠀carrying⠀the⠀reader,⠀exposes⠀the⠀pressure⠀they⠀live⠀under⠀more⠀exactly⠀than⠀commentary⠀would.⠀Let⠀timing⠀and⠀obligation⠀enter⠀as⠀felt⠀material⠀—⠀the⠀hour⠀that⠀ends⠀the⠀visit,⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀interrupts⠀a⠀confidence⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀advance⠀as⠀specific⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀warmth.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀that⠀already⠀contains⠀some⠀of⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Open⠀by⠀fixing⠀one⠀small⠀irreversible⠀detail⠀—⠀the⠀seat⠀that⠀stays⠀empty,⠀the⠀phrase⠀now⠀said⠀differently,⠀the⠀task⠀done⠀with⠀quiet⠀finality,⠀the⠀object⠀put⠀away⠀for⠀good⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀reflection⠀move⠀outward⠀from⠀that⠀anchor⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀narration⠀goes⠀back⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀record⠀what⠀was⠀normal⠀then,⠀in⠀that⠀time's⠀own⠀terms.⠀The⠀comparison⠀between⠀then⠀and⠀now⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀lives:⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief,⠀a⠀courtesy⠀that⠀was⠀demanded,⠀a⠀humiliation⠀everyone⠀present⠀accepted⠀as⠀ordinary⠀—⠀including⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀Let⠀remembering⠀expose⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀earlier⠀acceptance;⠀what⠀they⠀took⠀for⠀granted⠀then⠀becomes⠀visible⠀precisely⠀because⠀something⠀has⠀changed⠀since.⠀Keep⠀later⠀knowledge⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀scene's⠀presentation.⠀The⠀past⠀moment⠀contains⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀available⠀then,⠀and⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀tellings⠀is⠀the⠀reader's⠀evidence.\n\nTie⠀every⠀recollection⠀to⠀present⠀experience.⠀A⠀remembered⠀touch,⠀promise,⠀or⠀silence⠀rises⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀—⠀washing,⠀walking,⠀waiting⠀for⠀someone⠀—⠀and⠀stays⠀attributable⠀to⠀this⠀character's⠀attention⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Unfinished⠀attachment⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀weeping;⠀the⠀most⠀damaging⠀fact⠀may⠀be⠀listed⠀in⠀a⠀flat⠀tone,⠀as⠀something⠀everyone⠀in⠀that⠀world⠀accepts.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀pleasure⠀inside⠀the⠀reflection:⠀warmth,⠀appetite,⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀still⠀works.⠀Show⠀what⠀attracted⠀them,⠀what⠀timing⠀and⠀obligation⠀prevented,⠀and⠀how⠀that⠀history⠀persists⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀looks⠀now.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀feed⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀simply⠀mark⠀the⠀looking.⠀Close⠀on⠀a⠀precise⠀image⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀continuation⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀announcement⠀that⠀nothing⠀lasts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nRelate⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀a⠀situated⠀storyteller⠀working⠀in⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism:⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀a⠀relative,⠀or⠀an⠀acquaintance⠀of⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀two,⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀on⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀—⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀question⠀someone⠀asked,⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀ran⠀long.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀stake.⠀The⠀teller⠀repeats⠀what⠀they⠀saw⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀eyes,⠀what⠀they⠀heard⠀from⠀others,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀believes,⠀and⠀their⠀phrasing⠀reveals⠀their⠀position:⠀whom⠀they⠀defer⠀to,⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal,⠀what⠀they⠀would⠀never⠀say⠀outright.⠀Limited⠀access⠀is⠀the⠀form's⠀honesty⠀—⠀they⠀were⠀not⠀present⠀for⠀everything,⠀and⠀they⠀say⠀so,⠀or⠀quietly⠀fill⠀the⠀gap⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀street⠀says.\n\nDeliver⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀witnessed⠀events⠀and⠀returned⠀details:⠀who⠀came⠀to⠀the⠀house⠀and⠀when,⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀in⠀the⠀courtyard⠀or⠀the⠀shop,⠀which⠀invitation⠀was⠀misjudged⠀and⠀what⠀small⠀humiliation⠀followed,⠀how⠀family⠀obligation⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀opinion⠀delayed⠀one⠀step⠀and⠀forced⠀another.⠀Keep⠀quoted⠀characters⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers⠀—⠀the⠀plain⠀speaker⠀stays⠀plain,⠀the⠀formal⠀one⠀formal⠀—⠀even⠀inside⠀the⠀teller's⠀cadence.⠀The⠀pair's⠀attraction⠀and⠀vulnerability⠀appear⠀in⠀concrete⠀behavior:⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀a⠀defense⠀offered⠀before⠀it⠀was⠀needed.⠀The⠀teller⠀never⠀pronounces⠀that⠀they⠀loved⠀one⠀another;⠀the⠀listener⠀watches⠀the⠀evidence⠀accumulate⠀toward⠀the⠀conclusion⠀the⠀teller⠀avoids⠀stating.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀mark⠀this⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀worth⠀retelling.⠀A⠀phrase⠀first⠀heard⠀at⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀particular⠀gesture⠀returns⠀at⠀intervals,⠀its⠀meaning⠀slightly⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀since.⠀Draw⠀on⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀honor⠀code⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀established.⠀End⠀the⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀scene⠀the⠀community⠀would⠀remember⠀—⠀a⠀choice⠀made,⠀a⠀privacy⠀granted,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀stop⠀short⠀of⠀final⠀judgment,⠀so⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀see⠀how⠀ordinary⠀custom⠀shaped⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀allowed⠀themselves⠀to⠀say.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀from⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀For⠀each⠀scene⠀select⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀facts⠀that⠀carry⠀both⠀private⠀meaning⠀and⠀social⠀pressure:⠀the⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀side⠀of⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀coat⠀held⠀a⠀moment⠀too⠀long,⠀the⠀door⠀closed⠀after⠀a⠀particular⠀visitor,⠀the⠀portion⠀saved⠀without⠀comment.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀return⠀across⠀scenes,⠀but⠀never⠀explain⠀the⠀same⠀inference⠀twice;⠀the⠀second⠀appearance⠀works⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀was⠀left⠀unexplained.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀then⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀unsentimental.⠀Attraction⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀attention⠀and⠀practical⠀accommodation⠀—⠀remembering⠀a⠀preference,⠀anticipating⠀an⠀objection⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀voiced,⠀adjusting⠀a⠀routine⠀—⠀not⠀in⠀decorative⠀language⠀or⠀repeated⠀endearments.⠀Where⠀the⠀perspective⠀allows,⠀state⠀desire⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀plainly,⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀terms,⠀and⠀let⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀run⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀make⠀sense;⠀economy⠀is⠀selection,⠀not⠀a⠀fragment⠀quota.⠀A⠀disclosure⠀can⠀be⠀one⠀sentence⠀said⠀in⠀a⠀doorway,⠀followed⠀by⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀resumed.⠀Irony⠀surfaces⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀the⠀required⠀courtesy⠀—⠀to⠀a⠀parent,⠀an⠀employer,⠀a⠀guest⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀the⠀private⠀refusal⠀of⠀its⠀meaning,⠀and⠀the⠀conversation's⠀actual⠀wording⠀exposes⠀what⠀everyone⠀present⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal⠀about⠀duty,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀work.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀to⠀make⠀causality⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀absent.⠀Cut⠀the⠀summary⠀that⠀announces⠀two⠀people⠀have⠀grown⠀close;⠀show⠀one⠀remembering⠀the⠀other's⠀habit,⠀or⠀waiting⠀without⠀being⠀asked⠀to⠀wait.⠀A⠀changed⠀routine⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀commitment⠀without⠀announcement.⠀What⠀remains⠀must⠀still⠀show⠀why⠀the⠀gesture⠀matters⠀and⠀what⠀follows⠀from⠀it;⠀compression⠀that⠀destroys⠀the⠀chain⠀of⠀cause⠀and⠀effect⠀has⠀cut⠀the⠀wrong⠀thing.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀speaker's⠀individual⠀voice⠀—⠀one⠀plain,⠀another⠀formal⠀or⠀evasive.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀image⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task;⠀the⠀episode⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀the⠀relationship⠀resolves,⠀provided⠀the⠀last⠀retained⠀detail⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀interaction.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀stays⠀inside⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀and⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀moment⠀that⠀establishes⠀the⠀current⠀distance⠀or⠀intimacy⠀between⠀the⠀two:⠀who⠀arrives,⠀who⠀is⠀already⠀there,⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀first⠀and⠀what⠀goes⠀unanswered.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀from⠀a⠀spoken⠀line⠀to⠀an⠀observation⠀to⠀a⠀memory⠀and⠀back⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery;⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀can⠀shift⠀the⠀attention,⠀and⠀a⠀returning⠀object⠀or⠀name⠀can⠀mark⠀that⠀shift⠀inside⠀a⠀single⠀one.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀daily⠀material.⠀Attention⠀appears⠀as⠀someone⠀remembering⠀an⠀obligation,⠀noticing⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀posture,⠀waiting⠀after⠀an⠀argument,⠀doing⠀what⠀was⠀asked⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀not.⠀Disclosure⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀theatrical:⠀a⠀short⠀exchange⠀about⠀work⠀or⠀family⠀can⠀reveal⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀considers⠀normal⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀fear.⠀When⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀occurs⠀—⠀a⠀parent's⠀expectation⠀stated⠀as⠀fact,⠀a⠀courtesy⠀that⠀costs⠀someone⠀their⠀evening⠀—⠀show⠀its⠀effect⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀subsequent⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀commentary⠀sentence.⠀Let⠀competing⠀obligations⠀produce⠀consequences⠀that⠀persist⠀beyond⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀promise⠀kept,⠀the⠀invitation⠀declined,⠀the⠀resentment⠀that⠀surfaces⠀later⠀as⠀flatness⠀in⠀a⠀reply.\n\nLet⠀the⠀prose⠀adjust⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀event.⠀A⠀tense⠀disagreement⠀may⠀tighten⠀into⠀shorter⠀sentences⠀and⠀direct⠀observation;⠀a⠀reflective⠀interval⠀may⠀open⠀into⠀a⠀longer⠀paragraph⠀that⠀stays⠀anchored⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀room.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective⠀—⠀if⠀the⠀telling⠀is⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀limited,⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀stays⠀outside⠀it⠀and⠀appears⠀only⠀as⠀behavior⠀to⠀be⠀read.⠀Preserve⠀individual⠀speech:⠀one⠀voice⠀plain,⠀another⠀formal,⠀another⠀evasive.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀wit,⠀banter,⠀or⠀a⠀confession⠀as⠀a⠀scene's⠀payoff.⠀The⠀relationship⠀may⠀advance⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀clear⠀decision,⠀or⠀it⠀may⠀wait.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀business⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀real⠀and⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nBuild⠀every⠀scene⠀around⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀selection⠀rather⠀than⠀statement.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀established⠀love,⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀shorthand:⠀a⠀phrase⠀reused⠀with⠀slight⠀variation,⠀the⠀habitual⠀gesture,⠀the⠀errand⠀run⠀without⠀being⠀told,⠀the⠀argument⠀conducted⠀in⠀half-sentences⠀because⠀both⠀know⠀the⠀other⠀half.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀slow⠀discovery,⠀show⠀the⠀moments⠀when⠀they⠀begin⠀to⠀interpret⠀one⠀another⠀—⠀a⠀correct⠀guess,⠀a⠀misreading⠀that⠀costs⠀something⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀misreadings⠀genuinely⠀possible.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀repair,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀breach⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀work.⠀Use⠀no⠀material⠀beyond⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise;⠀the⠀payoff⠀comes⠀from⠀fulfilling⠀this⠀promise,⠀not⠀from⠀assembling⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nEarn⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀through⠀repeated⠀moments⠀whose⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed.⠀A⠀specific⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀line⠀returns⠀when⠀the⠀return⠀does⠀work:⠀the⠀joke⠀that⠀now⠀falls⠀flat,⠀the⠀resting⠀place⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀an⠀argument⠀site,⠀the⠀name⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀weight⠀spoken⠀in⠀public⠀than⠀in⠀private.⠀A⠀callback⠀must⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀—⠀change⠀what⠀someone⠀does,⠀asks,⠀or⠀refuses⠀—⠀not⠀replay⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀for⠀reminder's⠀sake.⠀Let⠀those⠀returns⠀expose⠀the⠀ground⠀the⠀couple⠀stands⠀on:⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀the⠀expected⠀courtesy⠀and⠀privately⠀admits⠀what⠀it⠀cost;⠀a⠀shared⠀errand⠀produces⠀an⠀ordinary⠀humiliation⠀that⠀reveals⠀how⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀is⠀seen⠀in⠀the⠀community,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀answers⠀that.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀clean⠀and⠀unsentimental.⠀Affection⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀attention,⠀accommodation,⠀or⠀restrained⠀possessiveness;⠀jealousy⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀fear⠀or⠀a⠀specific⠀refusal,⠀not⠀automatic⠀drama;⠀comfort⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀act⠀that⠀fits⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀gesture.⠀Where⠀a⠀character⠀withholds⠀something,⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀or⠀miss⠀it⠀entirely,⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀access.⠀No⠀one⠀in⠀the⠀cast⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀perpetually⠀witty⠀or⠀armed⠀with⠀polished⠀banter.⠀Consequences⠀stay⠀local⠀and⠀uncertain:⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀agreement,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀taking⠀on⠀new⠀meaning,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀question,⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀trajectory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀has⠀been,⠀or⠀will⠀be,⠀retold.⠀Open⠀deliberately:⠀name⠀the⠀two⠀parties⠀and⠀the⠀matter⠀at⠀hand⠀in⠀the⠀chronicler's⠀compact⠀manner,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀remembered⠀deeds⠀—⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀one⠀spoke⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀at⠀market,⠀the⠀day⠀one⠀waited⠀through⠀the⠀storm,⠀the⠀dispute⠀carried⠀out⠀before⠀the⠀household.⠀Fix⠀such⠀acts⠀with⠀short⠀declarations,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀record⠀incomplete:⠀what⠀the⠀witnesses⠀did⠀not⠀see,⠀which⠀version⠀differs,⠀what⠀nobody⠀thought⠀to⠀ask.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀both⠀affection⠀and⠀social⠀consequence.⠀A⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀gift⠀returned,⠀a⠀name⠀raised⠀in⠀a⠀quarrel⠀comes⠀back⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀shows⠀who⠀remembers⠀it⠀and⠀why⠀they⠀repeat⠀it.⠀Keep⠀private⠀desire⠀under⠀the⠀account's⠀limited⠀access.⠀If⠀the⠀perspective⠀authorizes⠀entry⠀into⠀a⠀mind,⠀use⠀it⠀sparingly⠀and⠀consistently;⠀otherwise⠀report⠀what⠀witnesses⠀could⠀see⠀—⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀work⠀taken⠀up⠀unasked,⠀an⠀order⠀given⠀in⠀a⠀certain⠀tone⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀accumulation⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀what⠀was⠀never⠀said⠀aloud.\n\nDo⠀not⠀convert⠀family⠀obligation⠀or⠀labor⠀into⠀mock⠀heroism.⠀The⠀oral⠀manner⠀elevates⠀remembered⠀acts⠀while⠀the⠀underlying⠀realities⠀stay⠀ordinary:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀duty,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀humiliation⠀everyone⠀present⠀accepted.⠀Let⠀the⠀community⠀preserve⠀its⠀own⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀romance,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀object⠀to⠀that⠀version⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀practical⠀speech;⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀End⠀with⠀an⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀memory⠀—⠀a⠀promise⠀kept,⠀a⠀boundary⠀refused,⠀work⠀resumed⠀—⠀without⠀declaring⠀the⠀couple⠀heroic.⠀The⠀retelling⠀itself⠀may⠀remain⠀the⠀account's⠀only⠀certainty.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀love⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀domestic⠀social-realist⠀scene⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀household⠀is⠀both⠀an⠀intimate⠀setting⠀and⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀social⠀rules⠀are⠀enforced⠀through⠀ordinary⠀practice.⠀Choose⠀one⠀concrete⠀task⠀already⠀underway—a⠀meal⠀being⠀prepared,⠀a⠀room⠀being⠀cleaned,⠀a⠀window⠀being⠀repaired,⠀a⠀child⠀being⠀put⠀to⠀bed—and⠀keep⠀the⠀two⠀characters⠀occupied⠀with⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀whole⠀scene.⠀The⠀task⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀symbol;⠀it⠀is⠀work⠀with⠀a⠀real⠀sequence,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀each⠀person⠀performs⠀it⠀reveals⠀their⠀history,⠀habits,⠀and⠀expectations.\n\nDescribe⠀the⠀physical⠀surroundings⠀sparingly⠀and⠀exactly.⠀Let⠀a⠀chipped⠀cup,⠀a⠀damp⠀coat,⠀a⠀lamp⠀moved⠀from⠀one⠀table⠀to⠀another⠀carry⠀evidence⠀of⠀care,⠀neglect,⠀or⠀obligation.⠀A⠀detail⠀should⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀course⠀of⠀the⠀task,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀stops⠀to⠀display⠀it.⠀The⠀same⠀object⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀meaning:⠀the⠀cup⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀set⠀aside⠀is⠀the⠀cup⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀quietly⠀washes⠀and⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀shelf.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀of⠀one⠀lover.⠀Let⠀that⠀person⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀accepts⠀without⠀comment:⠀a⠀mother's⠀remark,⠀a⠀boss's⠀demand,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀glance,⠀a⠀household⠀rule⠀about⠀who⠀sits⠀first⠀or⠀who⠀clears⠀the⠀table.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀or⠀resist⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀way.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀social⠀position⠀behind⠀these⠀normal⠀things.⠀The⠀unsentimental⠀observation⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀rule⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀behavior:⠀who⠀is⠀served⠀first,⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀rest,⠀whose⠀name⠀is⠀used⠀when⠀a⠀visitor⠀arrives.\n\nLet⠀emotion⠀appear⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀sensation,⠀not⠀through⠀declarations.⠀A⠀hand⠀paused⠀over⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀twice,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀means⠀relief⠀or⠀disappointment.⠀Attraction⠀is⠀embodied⠀in⠀attention:⠀remembering⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀tea,⠀noticing⠀the⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀cuff,⠀choosing⠀to⠀stand⠀closer⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀sees.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀disagree⠀over⠀something⠀practical—the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀repair,⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀the⠀work,⠀whether⠀to⠀accept⠀help—and⠀reveal⠀their⠀deeper⠀fears⠀through⠀that⠀disagreement.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀disagreement⠀with⠀a⠀speech⠀about⠀feelings.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀rooted⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀social⠀context⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀contract.⠀The⠀institution—work,⠀family,⠀housing,⠀marriage,⠀religion,⠀money—appears⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀practice⠀within⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀abstract⠀force.⠀Expose⠀its⠀damage⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀humiliation⠀or⠀accepted⠀belief:⠀who⠀is⠀served⠀first,⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀rest,⠀whose⠀name⠀is⠀used.⠀The⠀relationship⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀rebellion.⠀It⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀two⠀people⠀see⠀each⠀other⠀clearly⠀for⠀an⠀hour.\n\nDo⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀ending.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀tenderness⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀an⠀unspoken⠀compromise,⠀a⠀postponed⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀defeat.⠀But⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀hopeless.⠀Let⠀one⠀concrete⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀be⠀fully⠀realized,⠀even⠀if⠀it⠀changes⠀nothing⠀outside⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀affection⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀on⠀the⠀page,⠀not⠀assumed⠀because⠀the⠀genre⠀is⠀romance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀short,⠀observable⠀scenes⠀with⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀sparse⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀flow⠀within⠀a⠀continuous⠀block.⠀Keep⠀the⠀camera⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀prose.⠀Write⠀what⠀a⠀viewer⠀could⠀see⠀or⠀hear:⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀coat⠀handed⠀over,⠀a⠀step⠀backward,⠀a⠀door⠀held⠀open⠀a⠀second⠀too⠀long.\n\nLet⠀the⠀physical⠀world⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.⠀A⠀workroom,⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀bus⠀stop,⠀a⠀shared⠀bench—each⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀social⠀setting⠀with⠀rules⠀about⠀who⠀may⠀sit,⠀speak,⠀or⠀leave.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀observation⠀works⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀Show⠀one⠀person⠀noticing⠀the⠀other's⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀care:⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀save⠀the⠀better⠀portion,⠀turn⠀to⠀hide⠀a⠀smile,⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀task⠀they⠀were⠀not⠀asked⠀to⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀class,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀desire⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀as⠀speech,⠀not⠀as⠀exposition.⠀People⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something,⠀refuse,⠀postpone,⠀or⠀misdirect.⠀Let⠀disagreement⠀reveal⠀a⠀deeper⠀fear⠀through⠀a⠀practical⠀argument—about⠀money,⠀timing,⠀a⠀relative,⠀a⠀job.⠀The⠀two⠀characters⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀themselves:⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀curt,⠀one⠀evasive,⠀one⠀quietly⠀persistent.⠀A⠀pause⠀is⠀a⠀stage⠀direction,⠀not⠀a⠀camera⠀instruction.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀selectively⠀to⠀manage⠀time⠀and⠀information.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀when⠀someone⠀looks⠀away,⠀begins⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀leaves;⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀place⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀already⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀cut⠀to⠀an⠀insert⠀of⠀a⠀symbolic⠀object⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀legible.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀revelation:⠀a⠀slammed⠀door,⠀a⠀kettle⠀boiling⠀over,⠀a⠀familiar⠀footstep.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀attributed⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀voice-over⠀or⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀the⠀note⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀inward⠀experience⠀matters⠀causally⠀or⠀emotionally,⠀and⠀never⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀hear⠀or⠀know⠀it.⠀The⠀note⠀is⠀for⠀composition,⠀not⠀for⠀the⠀screen.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀dramatic⠀beat⠀into⠀every⠀scene.⠀The⠀romance⠀can⠀advance⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀silence,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange.⠀A⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀on⠀a⠀look,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀action.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship's⠀uncertainty⠀stay⠀open⠀while⠀the⠀concrete⠀moment⠀remains⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Set⠀the⠀two⠀characters⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀shared⠀space⠀where⠀their⠀history⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀are⠀visible:⠀a⠀rented⠀room,⠀a⠀workplace⠀corridor,⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀station⠀platform.⠀Use⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking⠀to⠀show⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀move,⠀sit,⠀touch,⠀or⠀leave.⠀A⠀chair⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀coat⠀hung⠀on⠀the⠀wrong⠀peg,⠀a⠀step⠀toward⠀the⠀door⠀and⠀back—these⠀are⠀enough.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀frontal⠀but⠀not⠀confessional.⠀The⠀characters⠀speak⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀about⠀immediate⠀matters:⠀a⠀returned⠀letter,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀umbrella,⠀a⠀train⠀time,⠀a⠀sick⠀relative.⠀Their⠀sentences⠀may⠀be⠀short,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀inappropriately⠀practical.⠀Let⠀one⠀person⠀notice⠀the⠀other's⠀small⠀kindness⠀without⠀naming⠀it⠀as⠀kindness.⠀For⠀example,⠀one⠀offers⠀the⠀better⠀cup,⠀straightens⠀a⠀collar,⠀or⠀finishes⠀an⠀unwanted⠀chore.⠀The⠀other⠀accepts⠀it⠀or⠀refuses⠀it,⠀and⠀that⠀act⠀becomes⠀the⠀whole⠀emotional⠀exchange.\n\nUse⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀expose⠀social⠀rules⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations.⠀A⠀visitor⠀must⠀stand⠀because⠀a⠀senior⠀person⠀is⠀present.⠀A⠀package⠀is⠀handed⠀over⠀with⠀both⠀hands.⠀A⠀clock⠀is⠀looked⠀at,⠀but⠀no⠀one⠀dares⠀leave.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀lives⠀in⠀these⠀visible⠀acceptances.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀explanatory⠀speeches.⠀The⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀behavior⠀of⠀people⠀inside⠀it.\n\nIf⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀necessary,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose:⠀a⠀warning⠀to⠀the⠀audience,⠀a⠀performed⠀statement,⠀a⠀rehearsal⠀of⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀later⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀dump⠀inner⠀life.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material,⠀clearly⠀attributed,⠀outside⠀the⠀staged⠀action.\n\nLet⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀emotion.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀filled⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀repeated⠀gesture—folding⠀a⠀paper,⠀wiping⠀a⠀glass,⠀turning⠀a⠀ring.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀stand⠀too⠀close,⠀then⠀move⠀apart⠀when⠀someone⠀enters.⠀The⠀scene⠀ends⠀on⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀remains⠀readable:⠀a⠀door⠀closed,⠀a⠀light⠀turned⠀out,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀hesitation.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀kiss.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀advance⠀or⠀retreat⠀through⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀stay,⠀to⠀speak,⠀or⠀to⠀perform⠀a⠀small⠀shared⠀task.⠀Because⠀the⠀stage⠀makes⠀every⠀touch⠀visible,⠀use⠀that⠀visibility⠀as⠀the⠀point:⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀allow⠀themselves⠀to⠀do⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀wait⠀to⠀do⠀until⠀they⠀believe⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀watching,⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀romance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀one⠀character's⠀mind⠀as⠀it⠀moves⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀Let⠀perception⠀start⠀the⠀movement:⠀the⠀sight⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hand,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀on⠀the⠀lap.⠀From⠀there,⠀the⠀mind⠀can⠀leap⠀to⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀sentence⠀someone⠀said,⠀a⠀worry⠀about⠀money,⠀or⠀the⠀physical⠀sensation⠀of⠀wanting⠀to⠀speak⠀and⠀not⠀speaking.⠀Keep⠀the⠀associations⠀plausible⠀for⠀this⠀particular⠀person's⠀history⠀and⠀habits.\n\nUse⠀the⠀mental⠀flow⠀to⠀expose⠀social⠀position⠀without⠀editorializing.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀rule—'We⠀don't⠀sit⠀here'—or⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀a⠀parent⠀used.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀an⠀intrusive⠀image:⠀a⠀cup⠀taken⠀away,⠀a⠀name⠀mispronounced.⠀The⠀mind⠀accepts⠀these⠀as⠀normal,⠀and⠀that⠀acceptance⠀is⠀the⠀critique.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph⠀outside⠀the⠀flow.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romance⠀appear⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀interruption.⠀The⠀narrator⠀notices⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀freckle,⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀breathe⠀when⠀asleep,⠀the⠀exact⠀word⠀they⠀said⠀last⠀Tuesday.⠀Feeling⠀interrupts⠀a⠀practical⠀thought:⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀errands⠀stops⠀at⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀laugh.⠀Desire⠀may⠀be⠀physical⠀rather⠀than⠀spoken—a⠀dry⠀mouth,⠀a⠀too-fast⠀heartbeat,⠀the⠀impulse⠀to⠀touch⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀also⠀resist⠀feeling,⠀turning⠀to⠀work⠀or⠀irritation⠀to⠀avoid⠀admitting⠀what⠀it⠀wants.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀detail—the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀kettle,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀foot⠀tapping—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀relives⠀a⠀past⠀event,⠀mark⠀the⠀shift⠀clearly,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀anchor⠀when⠀the⠀association⠀ends.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀imagines⠀a⠀touch⠀or⠀a⠀conversation,⠀make⠀the⠀imagined⠀quality⠀explicit;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀fantasy⠀replace⠀the⠀story.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀narrative⠀uniformly⠀fragmented.⠀Some⠀thoughts⠀are⠀long⠀and⠀reasoned;⠀some⠀are⠀sudden⠀images.⠀Paragraph⠀breaks⠀can⠀mark⠀shifts⠀in⠀association.⠀The⠀style⠀allows⠀incomplete⠀sentences⠀and⠀repeated⠀words,⠀but⠀the⠀whole⠀passage⠀must⠀still⠀reveal⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀world.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀mind⠀pauses,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀plot⠀beat⠀concludes.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀deciding,⠀still⠀afraid,⠀or⠀suddenly⠀certain⠀about⠀something⠀small—a⠀train⠀time,⠀a⠀promise,⠀an⠀apology⠀not⠀yet⠀given.⠀One⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀thought⠀or⠀feeling⠀can⠀be⠀enough.⠀The⠀romance⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀noticed⠀details,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Start⠀with⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀matters⠀that⠀two⠀people⠀need⠀to⠀settle:⠀a⠀shared⠀bill,⠀an⠀address,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀object,⠀a⠀visit⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀message⠀exchange⠀become⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀who⠀asks,⠀who⠀answers,⠀who⠀delays,⠀and⠀who⠀types⠀and⠀then⠀says⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀format⠀itself⠀carries⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony:⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted⠀is⠀not⠀always⠀what⠀is⠀meant.\n\nUse⠀timestamps,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀deletions,⠀and⠀attachments⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀information.⠀A⠀long⠀delay⠀after⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀may⠀mean⠀hesitation,⠀not⠀just⠀being⠀busy.⠀A⠀read⠀receipt⠀without⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀answer⠀in⠀itself.⠀An⠀edited⠀message⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀softened⠀or⠀sharpened⠀word.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀technical⠀events—fake⠀error⠀messages,⠀glitches,⠀or⠀hacking—merely⠀to⠀create⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀each⠀character's⠀typing⠀habits⠀reveal⠀their⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀emotional⠀state.⠀One⠀may⠀always⠀use⠀full⠀sentences⠀and⠀formal⠀address;⠀another⠀may⠀reply⠀in⠀fragments⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀punctuation⠀mark.⠀One⠀may⠀apologize⠀repeatedly;⠀another⠀may⠀never⠀apologize.⠀These⠀habits⠀are⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀transcript.⠀They⠀are⠀not⠀explained⠀by⠀the⠀narrator.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀transcript⠀a⠀transcript.⠀Messages⠀are⠀public⠀to⠀the⠀two⠀participants.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀thinks⠀before⠀typing⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted.⠀Show⠀that⠀gap⠀through⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀a⠀draft⠀and⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀if⠀the⠀draft⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record,⠀but⠀never⠀imply⠀that⠀the⠀recipient⠀can⠀see⠀a⠀draft.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀private⠀experience,⠀place⠀it⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀contextual⠀passage⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀Mark⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀unsent,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀transmitted⠀message.⠀The⠀context⠀is⠀for⠀the⠀reader,⠀not⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀character.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀chat⠀become⠀the⠀only⠀action.⠀Off-screen⠀life⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀tone,⠀a⠀delayed⠀response,⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀from⠀a⠀hospital⠀or⠀a⠀train.⠀Use⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀sparingly⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀setting:⠀who⠀is⠀at⠀work,⠀who⠀is⠀with⠀family,⠀who⠀cannot⠀type⠀freely.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀disagreement⠀occurs,⠀let⠀it⠀happen⠀in⠀the⠀transcript⠀through⠀practical⠀language:⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀lend⠀money,⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀a⠀parent,⠀a⠀broken⠀plan.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀misunderstand⠀each⠀other⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀medium,⠀but⠀their⠀characters⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀reason,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀device.⠀One⠀may⠀read⠀irony⠀where⠀none⠀was⠀intended;⠀another⠀may⠀miss⠀a⠀clear⠀request.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀a⠀message⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀still⠀knows⠀what⠀is⠀unresolved:⠀one⠀person⠀is⠀typing,⠀one⠀person⠀has⠀put⠀the⠀phone⠀down,⠀one⠀person⠀has⠀sent⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀opened.⠀The⠀romance⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀small,⠀observable⠀differences⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀sent⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀felt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
