            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-romance-07",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Romance · 07/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == romance}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Romance. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 7 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-romance; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPamaxak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realist⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀developing⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀household,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀workplace⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀world⠀supplies⠀it—an⠀apartment⠀block,⠀a⠀family⠀shop,⠀a⠀school⠀staff⠀room,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀kitchen—and⠀let⠀obligations⠀give⠀the⠀romance⠀its⠀daily⠀shape.⠀Write⠀the⠀household's⠀routines⠀as⠀the⠀evidence⠀through⠀which⠀the⠀characters⠀learn⠀each⠀other's⠀loyalties.⠀Who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀waits⠀for⠀the⠀bus,⠀what⠀the⠀hallway⠀sounds⠀like⠀at⠀six⠀in⠀the⠀morning,⠀which⠀shelf⠀holds⠀the⠀jar⠀of⠀tea:⠀these⠀details⠀should⠀carry⠀character⠀history⠀and⠀create⠀opportunities⠀for⠀ordinary⠀care.⠀A⠀character⠀reveals⠀what⠀she⠀values⠀by⠀what⠀she⠀protects,⠀what⠀she⠀postpones,⠀and⠀what⠀she⠀remembers⠀to⠀do⠀for⠀someone⠀else.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀should⠀register⠀these⠀details⠀as⠀knowledge:⠀she⠀notices⠀that⠀he⠀always⠀checks⠀on⠀the⠀old⠀neighbor⠀before⠀leaving,⠀that⠀he⠀keeps⠀a⠀particular⠀shelf⠀clear⠀for⠀his⠀sister's⠀things,⠀that⠀he⠀will⠀not⠀answer⠀a⠀call⠀during⠀his⠀mother's⠀evening⠀tea.\n\nMake⠀family⠀and⠀community⠀pressure⠀specific⠀and⠀real⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀authority⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀moral⠀lesson.⠀People⠀may⠀disagree⠀about⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀job,⠀a⠀move,⠀or⠀a⠀promise,⠀and⠀those⠀disagreements⠀expose⠀different⠀loyalties.⠀Write⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀belonging⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀claim⠀on⠀time⠀and⠀attention:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀delay⠀a⠀meeting⠀to⠀help⠀a⠀relative,⠀keep⠀a⠀message⠀private⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀rumor,⠀or⠀refuse⠀an⠀invitation⠀because⠀it⠀would⠀be⠀reported.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀also⠀grow⠀in⠀private⠀spaces⠀carved⠀from⠀that⠀world—a⠀roof⠀at⠀dusk,⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀before⠀everyone⠀wakes,⠀a⠀bench⠀on⠀the⠀way⠀home—where⠀attention⠀and⠀trust⠀can⠀deepen.⠀Write⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀public⠀household⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀interval:⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say⠀only⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀is⠀listening,⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀about⠀each⠀other⠀when⠀the⠀obligations⠀recede.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀what⠀Stephen⠀King⠀describes⠀as⠀a⠀person's⠀history.⠀Characters⠀may⠀switch⠀between⠀languages⠀or⠀registers⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀them;⠀keep⠀the⠀switch⠀meaningful⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀respectful⠀formula⠀with⠀an⠀elder⠀and⠀a⠀blunt⠀phrase⠀with⠀the⠀person⠀she⠀trusts;⠀the⠀switch⠀should⠀reveal⠀what⠀she⠀can⠀risk⠀in⠀each⠀relationship.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀direct⠀speech⠀to⠀reveal⠀how⠀each⠀person⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀speak:⠀respectful⠀formulas,⠀joking,⠀bluntness,⠀hesitation.⠀Let⠀private⠀thought⠀accompany⠀or⠀follow⠀speech:⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀really⠀wanted⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀look⠀recalled,⠀what⠀she⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀its⠀history.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀repeated⠀proximity,⠀small⠀disclosures,⠀and⠀decisions⠀that⠀have⠀real⠀consequences.⠀A⠀missed⠀visit,⠀an⠀overheard⠀remark,⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀despite⠀inconvenience,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀anger⠀that⠀later⠀changes⠀someone's⠀understanding—all⠀should⠀leave⠀an⠀aftermath.⠀Write⠀the⠀aftermath⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀encounter:⠀the⠀missed⠀visit⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀meeting⠀more⠀careful,⠀the⠀overheard⠀remark⠀makes⠀one⠀character⠀watch⠀what⠀she⠀says,⠀the⠀kept⠀promise⠀becomes⠀a⠀private⠀debt⠀neither⠀names.⠀Avoid⠀melodramatic⠀family⠀collisions⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀climax.⠀End⠀a⠀response⠀after⠀a⠀meaningful⠀relational⠀beat:⠀an⠀agreement⠀reached,⠀a⠀lie⠀discovered,⠀a⠀hand⠀held⠀out⠀of⠀view,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀tell⠀the⠀truth⠀tomorrow.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaxal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀psychological⠀realist⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀everyday⠀situations⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀involved—a⠀work⠀placement,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀committee,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀care⠀obligation,⠀a⠀train⠀ride,⠀a⠀hobby—and⠀let⠀inward⠀reflection⠀deepen⠀rather⠀than⠀replace⠀outward⠀event.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀remembers.⠀Use⠀direct⠀physical⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀Stephen⠀King⠀manner:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀station⠀at⠀night,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀checking⠀a⠀watch.⠀Do⠀not⠀substitute⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀seasonal⠀scenery⠀for⠀feeling.⠀Write⠀the⠀inward⠀turn⠀as⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀a⠀gesture⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀conversation,⠀and⠀that⠀memory⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀now⠀or⠀what⠀she⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀say⠀next.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀feed⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀pause⠀it.\n\nLet⠀attention⠀be⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀romantic⠀development.⠀A⠀character⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀always⠀carries⠀the⠀same⠀bag,⠀that⠀she⠀moves⠀a⠀chair⠀before⠀sitting,⠀that⠀he⠀reads⠀the⠀same⠀page⠀twice;⠀these⠀observations⠀become⠀knowledge⠀and⠀then⠀care.⠀Write⠀the⠀accumulation:⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀the⠀detail⠀is⠀only⠀a⠀detail,⠀the⠀second⠀time⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀pattern,⠀the⠀third⠀time⠀it⠀is⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀on—offering⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀bag,⠀saving⠀the⠀chair,⠀asking⠀what⠀page⠀he⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to.⠀Memory⠀should⠀work⠀concretely:⠀an⠀earlier⠀conversation⠀returns⠀during⠀a⠀later⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀explained⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀changes⠀meaning⠀in⠀the⠀next.⠀Allow⠀disagreement⠀without⠀melodrama—about⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀plan,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀responsibility—and⠀show⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀risks⠀by⠀speaking.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀particular⠀people,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀voice;⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀terse⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀explains⠀too⠀much,⠀and⠀their⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀for⠀a⠀reason:⠀embarrassment,⠀hope,⠀a⠀desire⠀not⠀to⠀burden⠀the⠀other.\n\nGround⠀obligations⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀world.⠀Family⠀expectations,⠀work⠀schedules,⠀financial⠀limits,⠀or⠀community⠀duties⠀can⠀delay⠀or⠀complicate⠀romance⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀faceless⠀system.⠀Write⠀the⠀conflict⠀as⠀a⠀test⠀of⠀competing⠀cares:⠀an⠀evening⠀cut⠀short⠀because⠀a⠀parent⠀needs⠀help,⠀a⠀promise⠀postponed⠀because⠀a⠀shift⠀changed,⠀a⠀help⠀offered⠀that⠀costs⠀dignity.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀choice⠀costs,⠀not⠀merely⠀that⠀the⠀obligation⠀exists.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀progress⠀through⠀small⠀decisions—walking⠀someone⠀to⠀the⠀station,⠀answering⠀a⠀message⠀at⠀night,⠀saying⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀unsaid—rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀and⠀readable,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀becomes⠀reflective.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness;⠀anger,⠀laughter,⠀impatience,⠀and⠀direct⠀argument⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀have⠀them.⠀End⠀after⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀has⠀registered⠀a⠀real⠀shift⠀in⠀understanding⠀or⠀proximity:⠀a⠀walk⠀that⠀continues⠀past⠀the⠀usual⠀corner,⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀means⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀words,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀hanging⠀because⠀the⠀speaker⠀was⠀not⠀ready.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀seasonal⠀image⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀aphorism.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaxam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Stephen⠀King⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀city⠀or⠀town⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀world⠀gives⠀it—markets,⠀buses,⠀a⠀repair⠀shop,⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀crowded⠀apartment,⠀a⠀late⠀café,⠀a⠀long⠀walk⠀home—and⠀write⠀the⠀city⠀as⠀a⠀system⠀of⠀routes,⠀witnesses,⠀and⠀reputations⠀the⠀characters⠀must⠀navigate.⠀Which⠀streets⠀are⠀safe⠀shortcuts,⠀where⠀you⠀wait⠀to⠀avoid⠀someone,⠀what⠀the⠀corner⠀seller⠀remembers⠀about⠀your⠀family:⠀these⠀details⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀risk.⠀A⠀route⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀route;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀choice⠀about⠀who⠀might⠀see⠀them⠀together.⠀A⠀witness⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀bystander;⠀it⠀is⠀someone⠀who⠀might⠀report,⠀remember,⠀or⠀protect.⠀Concrete⠀Stephen⠀King⠀observation⠀keeps⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀quotidian⠀rather⠀than⠀stylized;⠀the⠀romance⠀grows⠀through⠀shared⠀routes,⠀messages,⠀errands,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀negotiations⠀of⠀daily⠀proximity.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀and⠀reputation⠀enter⠀without⠀becoming⠀magical.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀for⠀something⠀his⠀father⠀did,⠀for⠀a⠀debt,⠀for⠀a⠀job,⠀for⠀leaving⠀and⠀returning;⠀another⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀to⠀leave⠀the⠀city⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀after⠀an⠀accident.⠀Write⠀these⠀histories⠀as⠀present⠀claims⠀on⠀choice:⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀together,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀hidden⠀from⠀a⠀landlord⠀or⠀a⠀cousin,⠀what⠀silence⠀protects.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀events,⠀prophecy,⠀or⠀marvelous⠀causality.⠀Psychological⠀interiority⠀should⠀be⠀concrete—rehearsing⠀a⠀sentence,⠀remembering⠀a⠀touch,⠀fearing⠀a⠀particular⠀phone⠀call—and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀encounter:⠀the⠀memory⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀now,⠀what⠀she⠀says,⠀or⠀what⠀she⠀decides⠀to⠀postpone.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀with⠀local⠀rhythms,⠀shorten⠀phrases,⠀interrupt,⠀repeat⠀themselves,⠀joke⠀harshly,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀explain.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀Latin⠀American⠀speech⠀pattern⠀or⠀make⠀everyone⠀bilingual⠀or⠀code-switching.⠀Private⠀thought⠀can⠀differ⠀from⠀speech⠀for⠀a⠀human⠀reason:⠀pride,⠀fear⠀of⠀gossip,⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀feels,⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀protect⠀someone⠀else.⠀Show⠀both⠀speech⠀and⠀silence⠀as⠀relationship⠀work:⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀other⠀close,⠀what⠀she⠀withholds⠀to⠀keep⠀him⠀safe,⠀what⠀he⠀risks⠀by⠀speaking⠀plainly.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀repeated⠀encounters⠀and⠀small⠀disclosures.⠀A⠀ride⠀offered⠀during⠀rain,⠀a⠀meal⠀shared⠀after⠀work,⠀a⠀joke⠀understood⠀only⠀by⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them,⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀money⠀or⠀family⠀that⠀later⠀becomes⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀trust.⠀Let⠀consequences⠀accumulate:⠀a⠀missed⠀meeting⠀changes⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀rumor⠀makes⠀the⠀next⠀encounter⠀harder,⠀a⠀favor⠀creates⠀an⠀obligation⠀neither⠀names.⠀Write⠀the⠀aftermath⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀city's⠀meaning⠀for⠀them:⠀the⠀route⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀take⠀now⠀feels⠀exposed,⠀the⠀café⠀where⠀they⠀laughed⠀now⠀feels⠀watched,⠀the⠀favor⠀becomes⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀meet⠀again.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀dramatic⠀family⠀crisis⠀or⠀a⠀magical⠀reconciliation.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀beat⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀moved—someone⠀walks⠀the⠀other⠀home⠀for⠀the⠀first⠀time,⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀finally⠀asked,⠀a⠀hand⠀is⠀ta