not⠀need⠀to⠀conclude⠀with⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀fast⠀but⠀not⠀rushed:⠀each⠀beat⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀feel⠀its⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀spatial⠀change.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀sustained⠀perceptual⠀and⠀social⠀account.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices:⠀the⠀delay⠀outside⠀a⠀locked⠀office,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀someone⠀rearranges⠀borrowed⠀objects,⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀a⠀shared⠀itinerary⠀turns⠀from⠀obligation⠀into⠀anticipation.⠀Build⠀sentences⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀practical⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀intimacy⠀without⠀being⠀decorated.⠀Use⠀recurring⠀images⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀changing⠀attachment.⠀A⠀coat⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀kettle⠀that⠀gets⠀filled⠀before⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀arrives,⠀the⠀wrong⠀key⠀carried⠀from⠀habit:⠀let⠀each⠀recurrence⠀sharpen⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀establish⠀mood.⠀Keep⠀the⠀comedy⠀in⠀the⠀fabric⠀of⠀institutions⠀and⠀social⠀arrangements:⠀an⠀office⠀protocol⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀private⠀question⠀public,⠀a⠀housing⠀committee⠀that⠀treats⠀courtship⠀as⠀a⠀scheduling⠀problem,⠀a⠀messaging⠀app⠀meant⠀for⠀logistics⠀collecting⠀increasingly⠀unlogistical⠀content.⠀The⠀lyric⠀movement⠀should⠀not⠀erase⠀that⠀comedy.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀rise⠀toward⠀tenderness,⠀then⠀come⠀down⠀on⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀photocopier⠀or⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀municipal⠀cleaning⠀fluid,⠀and⠀the⠀result⠀is⠀honest⠀rather⠀than⠀deflating.\n\nMake⠀the⠀narrator's⠀associations⠀noticeable⠀and⠀grounded.⠀Choose⠀recurring⠀sounds—footsteps⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀stair,⠀the⠀chime⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀workspace⠀door,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀said—and⠀let⠀them⠀develop⠀across⠀scenes.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀open⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀something⠀the⠀narrator⠀comprehends:⠀attraction⠀as⠀an⠀undelivered⠀parcel⠀entering⠀the⠀wrong⠀department,⠀trust⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀spreadsheet⠀slowly⠀becoming⠀a⠀shared⠀day.⠀Do⠀not⠀permit⠀the⠀figurative⠀language⠀to⠀replace⠀the⠀actual⠀people.⠀Every⠀image⠀should⠀remain⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀memory.⠀Let⠀plain⠀statements⠀provide⠀contrast:⠀after⠀an⠀extended⠀image,⠀a⠀sentence⠀like⠀\"They⠀did⠀not⠀speak⠀until⠀the⠀lift⠀arrived\"⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀another⠀figure.⠀Where⠀the⠀lyric⠀form⠀invites⠀introspection,⠀anchor⠀it⠀in⠀work,⠀errands,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀machinery⠀around⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Both⠀participants⠀remain⠀specific⠀social⠀types,⠀not⠀archetypes⠀of⠀love.⠀One⠀may⠀be⠀fluent⠀in⠀the⠀poetry⠀of⠀shift⠀scheduling⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀treats⠀a⠀shared⠀lunch⠀as⠀the⠀only⠀true⠀rhythm;⠀let⠀that⠀difference⠀produce⠀both⠀friction⠀and⠀closeness.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀considered⠀choices.⠀Do⠀not⠀allow⠀the⠀lyric⠀register⠀to⠀blur⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀stakes.⠀A⠀missed⠀meeting⠀remains⠀an⠀event⠀with⠀consequences;⠀a⠀difficult⠀conversation⠀retains⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀its⠀timing⠀and⠀audience.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀pause⠀on⠀the⠀look⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀door⠀handle,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀exchange⠀that⠀follows.⠀Shape⠀syntax⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀a⠀fixed⠀disposition:⠀a⠀practical⠀character⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀one⠀exact⠀detail⠀while⠀a⠀meditative⠀character⠀may⠀compress⠀a⠀long⠀feeling⠀into⠀a⠀short⠀clause.⠀Let⠀love,⠀when⠀it⠀becomes⠀legible,⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀ordinary⠀responsibility—a⠀shared⠀routine⠀now⠀held⠀in⠀mind⠀as⠀something⠀chosen,⠀a⠀recurring⠀image⠀now⠀understood⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀care.⠀When⠀that⠀change⠀arrives,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀register⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀returns⠀to,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀announcement⠀of⠀tenderness.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀reflective⠀accounting⠀of⠀small⠀changes,⠀unfinished⠀attachments,⠀and⠀the⠀accumulated⠀weight⠀of⠀ordinary⠀obligations.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀remember⠀specific⠀occasions—a⠀missed⠀lunch,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀habitual⠀solution⠀to⠀a⠀recurring⠀problem,⠀a⠀past⠀promise⠀now⠀interpreted⠀differently—and⠀let⠀those⠀memories⠀revise⠀the⠀present⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Use⠀Pratchett's⠀attention⠀to⠀official⠀explanations⠀vs.⠀practical⠀reality⠀to⠀sharpen⠀the⠀melancholy:⠀a⠀workplace⠀memo,⠀a⠀housing⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀sign⠀may⠀say⠀one⠀thing⠀about⠀a⠀departure⠀or⠀an⠀absence⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀recalls⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.⠀Keep⠀that⠀gap⠀comic⠀in⠀its⠀particulars,⠀because⠀the⠀comedy⠀makes⠀the⠀loss⠀precise.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀tone⠀settle⠀into⠀permanent⠀sadness.⠀A⠀remembered⠀joke⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀funny,⠀an⠀old⠀embarrassment⠀still⠀earns⠀a⠀dry⠀parenthesis,⠀and⠀a⠀present⠀cup⠀of⠀tea⠀can⠀be⠀exactly⠀that,⠀good⠀and⠀ordinary.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀experience⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀A⠀current⠀routine⠀can⠀echo⠀a⠀former⠀one,⠀but⠀the⠀echo⠀should⠀alter⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀flatten⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀now⠀and⠀then⠀through⠀a⠀held⠀object,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀route⠀across⠀a⠀building.⠀Let⠀each⠀detail⠀carry⠀its⠀own⠀association.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀exact⠀rhythm⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀task;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀exit⠀and⠀never⠀notice⠀the⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀style⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀asymmetry⠀legible⠀without⠀forcing⠀either⠀character's⠀gloss⠀on⠀the⠀other.⠀Use⠀direct⠀reflection⠀sparingly,⠀as⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀draws⠀a⠀considered⠀conclusion,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀action.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀available:⠀a⠀well-run⠀meeting,⠀a⠀bit⠀of⠀rain,⠀a⠀successful⠀repair,⠀a⠀familiar⠀argument⠀resolved⠀better⠀than⠀expected.⠀The⠀reflective⠀mode⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romantic⠀arc⠀develop⠀through⠀memory⠀and⠀consequence.⠀Use⠀unattributed⠀remembered⠀speech⠀where⠀appropriate,⠀but⠀keep⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀inserted⠀retroactively⠀as⠀earlier⠀knowledge.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀told⠀from⠀a⠀retrospective⠀distance,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀distinguish⠀what⠀was⠀known⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀understood⠀now.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀may⠀be⠀strongest⠀where⠀an⠀attachment⠀was⠀never⠀finished:⠀a⠀declaration⠀unspoken,⠀a⠀shared⠀plan⠀allowed⠀to⠀lapse,⠀an⠀offer⠀made⠀too⠀late.⠀But⠀the⠀treatment⠀should⠀leave⠀open⠀that⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀can⠀still⠀produce⠀an⠀answer,⠀a⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀chosen⠀attachment.⠀Avoid⠀compulsory⠀loss.⠀Where⠀the⠀style⠀invites⠀a⠀lingering⠀sentence,⠀Pratchett's⠀deadpan⠀wit⠀should⠀sometimes⠀interrupt⠀the⠀brooding:⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀tenderness⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀administrative⠀cost⠀of⠀that⠀tenderness—a⠀lost⠀key,⠀an⠀unpaid⠀invoice,⠀a⠀form⠀filed⠀under⠀the⠀wrong⠀name—will⠀keep⠀the⠀feeling⠀honest⠀and⠀concrete.⠀Close⠀on⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀one:⠀the⠀same⠀chair⠀now⠀empty,⠀the⠀same⠀route⠀now⠀walked⠀alone,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀now⠀used⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Let⠀that⠀detail⠀make⠀the⠀present⠀condition⠀legible⠀without⠀summing⠀it⠀up.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀narrative⠀form.⠀Choose⠀one⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀audience,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀romance⠀unfold⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀account⠀of⠀particular⠀courtships,⠀households,⠀workplaces,⠀and⠀remembered⠀events.⠀The⠀frame⠀itself⠀should⠀do⠀practical⠀work:⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀journey,⠀an⠀argument⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀favor⠀owed.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀claim⠀authority⠀over⠀some⠀incidents⠀and⠀admit⠀ignorance⠀about⠀others,⠀distinguishing⠀personal⠀participation⠀from⠀reported⠀events.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀needs⠀shape⠀the⠀telling—what⠀they⠀ask⠀after,⠀what⠀they⠀dispute,⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀repeated—without⠀turning⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀a⠀mere⠀public⠀inquiry.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀situated⠀account,⠀not⠀the⠀narrator's⠀confessional.⠀Where⠀the⠀teller⠀speaks⠀of⠀another⠀person's⠀inner⠀life,⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀attributed⠀as⠀inference,⠀memory,⠀or⠀hearsay;⠀otherwise,⠀only⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀interiority⠀may⠀be⠀shown.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀moralizing⠀container.⠀A⠀story⠀may⠀be⠀told⠀to⠀pass⠀an⠀evening,⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀match⠀legible,⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀interruptions⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀real⠀social⠀traffic⠀rather⠀than⠀prompts⠀for⠀another⠀nested⠀tale.\n\nRetain⠀Pratchett's⠀eye⠀for⠀how⠀institutions⠀and⠀people⠀actually⠀behave.⠀The⠀accounted⠀world⠀may⠀include⠀councils,⠀market⠀regulations,⠀family⠀negotiations,⠀prayer⠀schedules,⠀delivery⠀routes,⠀and⠀forms⠀of⠀authority⠀that⠀speak⠀one⠀language⠀while⠀practice⠀follows⠀another.⠀The⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀particular⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀practical⠀reality:⠀an⠀elder⠀explains⠀why⠀a⠀marriage⠀is⠀impossible⠀while⠀everybody⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀knows⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀dispute⠀about⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀property;⠀a⠀clerk⠀describes⠀a⠀delivery⠀delay⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀remembers⠀who⠀profited⠀from⠀that⠀delay.⠀Let⠀the⠀humor⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀One⠀speaker⠀may⠀use⠀proverbial⠀speech⠀to⠀avoid⠀answering;⠀another⠀may⠀find⠀the⠀proverb⠀funny⠀and⠀say⠀so.⠀The⠀style⠀must⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀fantasy⠀bureaucracy,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀social⠀machinery⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀setting⠀shapes⠀courtship⠀and⠀belonging.⠀Neither⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀nor⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code⠀is⠀a⠀universal⠀requirement.⠀The⠀world⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀supplied;⠀the⠀method⠀is⠀framed⠀oral⠀retelling.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀framed⠀accounts.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀arrange⠀scenes⠀not⠀always⠀chronologically:⠀a⠀later⠀public⠀event⠀may⠀be⠀recalled⠀first,⠀then⠀its⠀private⠀cause.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀inside⠀the⠀oral⠀telling—a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀marriage⠀contract,⠀a⠀particular⠀route⠀to⠀a⠀shared⠀place—so⠀the⠀audience⠀and⠀reader⠀learn⠀to⠀recognize⠀the⠀relationship's⠀changing⠀meaning.⠀Disclosure⠀and⠀disagreement⠀should⠀happen⠀within⠀the⠀diegetic⠀tale,⠀but⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀also⠀notice⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀not⠀emphasized,⠀creating⠀a⠀layered⠀inference⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀puzzle⠀box.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀include⠀brief⠀embedded⠀stories⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀frame,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀multiply⠀cycles⠀merely⠀to⠀show⠀virtuosity;⠀each⠀inserted⠀account⠀must⠀materially⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀central⠀relationship⠀is⠀understood.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀can⠀coexist:⠀a⠀public⠀performance⠀of⠀respect⠀may⠀be⠀both⠀genuine⠀and⠀funny,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀kindness⠀may⠀remain⠀hidden⠀inside⠀someone⠀else's⠀retelling.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀ends:⠀not⠀necessarily⠀with⠀closure⠀for⠀the⠀central⠀romance,⠀but⠀with⠀the⠀audience's⠀present⠀condition,⠀a⠀completed⠀session,⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀account⠀available.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀surface⠀at⠀that⠀close—a⠀reason⠀for⠀telling⠀it⠀now,⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀still⠀will⠀not⠀settle,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀begun⠀to⠀answer⠀for⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details.⠀Let⠀each⠀detail⠀earn⠀its⠀place⠀by⠀changing⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀situation.⠀A⠀single⠀gesture—lifting⠀a⠀stack⠀of⠀files⠀off⠀someone⠀else's⠀tray,⠀leaving⠀the⠀last⠀chair⠀by⠀the⠀radiator,⠀remembering⠀how⠀a⠀colleague⠀takes⠀their⠀tea—can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀analysis.⠀Keep⠀sentences⠀direct.⠀When⠀a⠀comic⠀correction⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀stay⠀concrete:⠀the⠀form⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀signature,⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀already⠀signed⠀elsewhere;⠀the⠀sign⠀says⠀\"No⠀personal⠀calls,\"⠀and⠀the⠀lover's⠀call⠀comes⠀through⠀the⠀office⠀line⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀only⠀line⠀whose⠀number⠀hasn't⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀generalize⠀the⠀joke⠀into⠀a⠀statement⠀about⠀all⠀institutions.⠀Let⠀the⠀particular⠀instance⠀do⠀the⠀work.\n\nKeep⠀inward⠀connection⠀selective.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀may⠀move⠀quickly⠀from⠀a⠀spoken⠀line⠀to⠀a⠀thought⠀or⠀a⠀memory,⠀but⠀include⠀only⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀what⠀follows.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀take⠀a⠀sentence⠀or⠀two;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀truncated⠀to⠀look⠀spare.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable,⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀show⠀the⠀pause⠀or⠀the⠀changed⠀subject;⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀the⠀restraint⠀without⠀a⠀private⠀paragraph⠀explaining⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀individual⠀voices.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀clipped,⠀practical⠀speech⠀while⠀another⠀fills⠀the⠀permitted⠀space⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀surprising⠀clause.⠀Minimalist⠀prose⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀of⠀broken⠀syntax.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀but⠀keep⠀natural⠀transitions⠀where⠀a⠀scene⠀needs⠀them.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romance⠀develop⠀through⠀repeated,⠀precise⠀observations⠀across⠀scenes.⠀Because⠀the⠀style⠀withholds⠀abundant⠀commentary,⠀rely⠀on⠀recurrence:⠀the⠀same⠀door,⠀the⠀same⠀chair,⠀the⠀same⠀unread⠀notice⠀on⠀the⠀board,⠀seen⠀at⠀a⠀later⠀moment⠀with⠀different⠀attention.⠀A⠀recurring⠀physical⠀detail⠀should⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀attachment,⠀not⠀merely⠀establish⠀continuity.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀can⠀sit⠀in⠀adjacent⠀sentences⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀calling⠀attention⠀to⠀either.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀apologize⠀for⠀lateness⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀notices⠀that⠀the⠀apology⠀includes⠀the⠀exact⠀number⠀of⠀minutes,⠀which⠀is⠀both⠀funny⠀and⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀care.⠀The⠀narrative⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀that⠀it⠀is⠀both.⠀Keep⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀visible⠀through⠀actions⠀and⠀limited⠀private⠀thought:⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀take⠀someone⠀else's⠀shift,⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀twice,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀under⠀a⠀keyboard.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀let⠀withdrawal⠀or⠀jealousy⠀be⠀plain.⠀If⠀a⠀feeling⠀is⠀present,⠀state⠀it⠀or⠀show⠀its⠀observable⠀consequence;⠀do⠀not⠀decorate⠀it⠀into⠀abstraction.⠀When⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀as⠀one⠀withheld⠀or⠀repeated⠀detail—the⠀note⠀finally⠀removed⠀from⠀the⠀board,⠀the⠀chair⠀finally⠀left⠀empty,⠀the⠀question⠀finally⠀not⠀asked⠀again—and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀on⠀without⠀commentary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀requires,⠀without⠀marking⠀every⠀transition⠀with⠀a⠀summary.⠀Open⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀practical⠀situation—a⠀delayed⠀meeting,⠀a⠀shared⠀errand,⠀a⠀workplace⠀negotiation—and⠀let⠀the⠀romantic⠀significance⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀ordinary⠀dealings.⠀Keep⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀oriented:⠀a⠀new⠀speaker,⠀a⠀new⠀physical⠀action,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀scene⠀to⠀recollection,⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present.⠀Use⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀attention⠀to⠀make⠀institutional⠀behavior⠀concrete.⠀A⠀timetable⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀a⠀schedule;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀means⠀by⠀which⠀one⠀person⠀protects⠀an⠀afternoon.⠀An⠀official⠀explanation⠀may⠀be⠀corrected⠀by⠀a⠀private⠀glance⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀actually⠀happened.⠀Let⠀the⠀correction⠀be⠀particular,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀joke⠀about⠀the⠀system.⠀Different⠀characters⠀retain⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority:⠀one⠀treats⠀a⠀memo⠀as⠀a⠀fact,⠀another⠀as⠀an⠀opening⠀in⠀a⠀longer⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀third⠀as⠀evidence⠀that⠀nobody⠀read⠀the⠀previous⠀memo.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀to⠀set⠀register⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀Modern⠀literary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀understated⠀emotion⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀every⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀dry⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀dry,⠀expansive⠀where⠀attention⠀lingers,⠀and⠀quick⠀where⠀practical⠀time⠀moves.⠀Use⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience:⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀small⠀hopes,⠀remembered⠀conversations,⠀and⠀physical⠀awareness⠀belong⠀in⠀the⠀narrative⠀where⠀they⠀affect⠀the⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀viewpoint⠀permits⠀it.⠀Interiority⠀may⠀align⠀with⠀speech⠀or⠀diverge⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason:⠀embarrassment,⠀caution,⠀utility,⠀or⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀saying⠀less⠀than⠀one⠀sees.⠀Subtext⠀may⠀remain⠀subtext;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀implication,⠀miss⠀it,⠀or⠀respond⠀at⠀more⠀than⠀one⠀level.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀the⠀realization⠀as⠀it⠀arrives,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀earlier⠀motive.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romance⠀develop⠀through⠀timing,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀considered⠀choices.⠀Attraction⠀may⠀begin⠀quickly⠀or⠀slowly;⠀the⠀style⠀supports⠀either⠀by⠀keeping⠀attention⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀across⠀scenes.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀wit-based⠀banter⠀rhythm.⠀Some⠀characters⠀are⠀funny,⠀some⠀are⠀plain,⠀some⠀use⠀irony⠀to⠀avoid⠀exposure,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀let⠀that⠀difference⠀shape⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀comedy⠀and⠀tenderness⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀chapter⠀without⠀the⠀text⠀announcing⠀a⠀shift.⠀A⠀practical⠀kindness—covering⠀a⠀shift,⠀finding⠀a⠀vital⠀document,⠀remembering⠀an⠀allergy—can⠀be⠀the⠀entire⠀romantic⠀beat.⠀Meaningful⠀aftermath⠀matters:⠀after⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀quarrel,⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀show⠀its⠀consequence⠀in⠀changed⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀just⠀mood.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀ends,⠀with⠀the⠀situation⠀still⠀live,⠀the⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀or⠀the⠀immediate⠀business⠀resumed.⠀Let⠀that⠀open⠀condition⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀weight:⠀a⠀schedule⠀still⠀unresolved,⠀a⠀document⠀still⠀unsigned,⠀a⠀phrase⠀still⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀from⠀whichever⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀is⠀actually⠀supplied:⠀a⠀fake⠀arrangement⠀that⠀turns⠀real,⠀an⠀enemies-to-lovers⠀office⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀second⠀chance⠀after⠀an⠀institutional⠀failure,⠀a⠀marriage⠀of⠀convenience,⠀a⠀secret⠀friendship⠀that⠀becomes⠀public.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀fanfiction-inspired.⠀Let⠀the⠀premise⠀dictate⠀which⠀scenes⠀are⠀worth⠀writing.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀legible⠀through⠀private⠀language,⠀repeated⠀gestures,⠀and⠀the⠀consequences⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀promise.⠀A⠀callback⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀meaning:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀used⠀once⠀as⠀a⠀joke,⠀later⠀as⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀help;⠀the⠀same⠀chair⠀where⠀they⠀first⠀argued,⠀later⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀admits⠀they⠀stayed.⠀Give⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀room⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀a⠀quiet⠀admission,⠀let⠀the⠀admission⠀be⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown⠀through⠀an⠀action⠀with⠀enough⠀time⠀for⠀its⠀effect.⠀If⠀it⠀needs⠀jealousy⠀or⠀comfort,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀situation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀beat⠀list.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀as⠀the⠀ground⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.⠀The⠀world⠀around⠀them⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀civic⠀committee,⠀a⠀residence⠀hall,⠀a⠀small-town⠀business,⠀or⠀another⠀institution⠀that⠀speaks⠀an⠀official⠀language⠀while⠀the⠀characters⠀conduct⠀their⠀private⠀negotiation⠀in⠀practical⠀speech.⠀The⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular:⠀a⠀rule⠀against⠀personal⠀calls⠀that⠀gets⠀bent⠀for⠀a⠀stranger⠀but⠀not⠀for⠀the⠀person⠀one⠀actually⠀loves;⠀a⠀formal⠀complaint⠀that⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀love⠀letter⠀once⠀the⠀recipients⠀are⠀named;⠀a⠀shared⠀nemesis⠀who⠀is⠀also⠀the⠀only⠀person⠀keeping⠀track⠀of⠀their⠀scheduled⠀meetings.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀differ⠀in⠀their⠀relationship⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀One⠀treats⠀the⠀premise⠀as⠀a⠀contract⠀and⠀grows⠀uneasy⠀when⠀the⠀clauses⠀slip;⠀the⠀other⠀treats⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀fiction⠀and⠀grows⠀uneasy⠀when⠀it⠀suddenly⠀feels⠀true.⠀Both⠀responses⠀are⠀valid,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀either⠀into⠀the⠀sole⠀truth.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀scene-centered⠀with⠀clear⠀turns⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀interiority,⠀but⠀fanfiction⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀head-hopping,⠀baby-animal⠀comparisons,⠀or⠀wink-at-the-reader⠀summaries.⠀Use⠀the⠀selected⠀viewpoint⠀consistently.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀develop⠀through⠀the⠀fanfiction⠀promise:⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀private⠀language,⠀and⠀payoff.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀charged⠀pause,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀scene⠀must⠀deliver⠀a⠀reversed⠀expectation⠀or⠀a⠀confession.⠀Give⠀small⠀pleasures⠀their⠀full⠀weight:⠀an⠀offered⠀cup⠀of⠀tea⠀that⠀one⠀character⠀recognizes⠀as⠀a⠀peace⠀offering,⠀a⠀shared⠀glance⠀at⠀a⠀ridiculous⠀sign,⠀a⠀stolen⠀hour⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀elided⠀as⠀background.⠀Where⠀the⠀premise⠀supplies⠀rivalry⠀or⠀annoyance,⠀keep⠀the⠀edge⠀specific.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀genuinely⠀believe⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀an⠀easier⠀life;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀genuinely⠀believe⠀the⠀first⠀enjoys⠀authority.⠀Let⠀those⠀beliefs⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀corrected⠀by⠀narration.⠀Where⠀the⠀premise⠀supplies⠀domestic⠀warmth,⠀let⠀the⠀comfort⠀stay⠀earned:⠀the⠀story⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀making⠀a⠀private⠀space⠀in⠀a⠀busy⠀world.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀beat⠀is⠀finished,⠀leaving⠀the⠀larger⠀premise⠀still⠀in⠀motion.⠀Let⠀that⠀motion⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀callback⠀or⠀private⠀gesture⠀that⠀now⠀holds⠀the⠀premise's⠀current⠀stakes:⠀the⠀contract⠀clause⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀finally⠀reads,⠀the⠀old⠀joke⠀repeated⠀without⠀its⠀old⠀distance,⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀left⠀ready⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀decided⠀to⠀stay.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀a⠀sense⠀of⠀retelling.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀scene:⠀not⠀necessarily⠀with⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀formula,⠀but⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀pair⠀or⠀the⠀pledge⠀that⠀matters⠀here.⠀For⠀example,⠀\"No⠀one⠀else⠀thought⠀the⠀missing⠀key⠀worth⠀remembering,⠀but⠀those⠀two⠀did,\"⠀or⠀\"They⠀were⠀not⠀suited,⠀and⠀because⠀they⠀were⠀not⠀suited⠀they⠀learned⠀each⠀other's⠀methods.\"⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀this⠀relationship⠀is⠀told:⠀who⠀waited,⠀who⠀returned,⠀who⠀repaired⠀what,⠀who⠀spoke⠀before⠀the⠀committee,⠀who⠀refused⠀a⠀transfer.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀speech,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀heroic⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Let⠀later⠀occurrences⠀give⠀the⠀repetition⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀saga⠀voice⠀may⠀name⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀keep⠀that⠀claim⠀modest.⠀The⠀relationship⠀remains⠀ordinary⠀people⠀in⠀a⠀working⠀world;⠀a⠀shared⠀lunch⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀feast,⠀and⠀a⠀missed⠀meeting⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀doom.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀comic⠀attention⠀to⠀keep⠀distance⠀between⠀chronicle⠀and⠀private⠀life.⠀The⠀public⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀wrong⠀in⠀some⠀particular:⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀so-and-so⠀was⠀the⠀patient⠀one,⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀recollection⠀shows⠀who⠀actually⠀did⠀the⠀waiting.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀be⠀funny⠀and⠀revealing⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀institution⠀into⠀a⠀parody.⠀A⠀council's⠀decision,⠀a⠀register,⠀a⠀shift⠀list,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀notice⠀can⠀serve⠀as⠀the⠀saga's⠀poetic⠀matter:⠀the⠀clerk⠀recorded⠀their⠀names⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀order,⠀and⠀for⠀years⠀that⠀order⠀was⠀quoted⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀who⠀loved⠀first.⠀A⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀particular⠀fact,⠀not⠀just⠀score⠀a⠀general⠀point.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀A⠀first-person⠀chronicle⠀may⠀know⠀its⠀own⠀private⠀thought⠀but⠀must⠀infer⠀another's;⠀a⠀community⠀account⠀must⠀be⠀shown⠀as⠀report,⠀memory,⠀or⠀dispute⠀when⠀it⠀reaches⠀another⠀mind.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀elevated⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀formal⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern⠀about⠀lunch.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀saga;⠀it⠀is⠀how⠀the⠀chronicle⠀stays⠀honest.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀acts⠀to⠀consequences⠀and⠀to⠀remembrance.⠀A⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀recorded,⠀broken,⠀renewed,⠀or⠀reinterpreted.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀oaths⠀or⠀gifts⠀compulsory;⠀let⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀determine⠀what⠀role⠀they⠀play.⠀If⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀household⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀favor⠀becomes⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀celebrate⠀it.⠀The⠀style⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀compact⠀phrase⠀at⠀moments⠀of⠀decision:⠀\"She⠀kept⠀the⠀key,\"⠀or⠀\"He⠀did⠀not⠀say⠀the⠀name,\"⠀returning⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀ends—business⠀resumed,⠀a⠀question⠀deferred,⠀or⠀the⠀pair⠀still⠀going⠀somewhere—while⠀leaving⠀what⠀the⠀saga⠀will⠀say⠀of⠀them⠀open.⠀Close⠀on⠀a⠀modest⠀deed⠀or⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question⠀that⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered:⠀the⠀key⠀still⠀on⠀its⠀hook,⠀the⠀register⠀still⠀uncorrected,⠀the⠀pair⠀still⠀walking⠀toward⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀thing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀Danish⠀social⠀realism⠀grounded⠀in⠀a⠀housing⠀association.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀association's⠀actual⠀procedures:⠀the⠀key⠀register,⠀the⠀maintenance⠀fund,⠀the⠀general⠀meeting,⠀the⠀noticeboard,⠀the⠀shared⠀laundry⠀booking⠀sheet,⠀the⠀caretaker's⠀inspection⠀round.⠀Make⠀these⠀systems⠀definite⠀in⠀their⠀Danish⠀form—the⠀meeting⠀opens⠀with⠀the⠀chair's⠀agenda,⠀the⠀maintenance⠀request⠀goes⠀through⠀the⠀online⠀portal,⠀the⠀key⠀is⠀signed⠀out⠀with⠀a⠀name⠀and⠀flat⠀number,⠀the⠀minutes⠀record⠀decisions⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀bureaucratic⠀style.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀nationality;⠀carry⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀details⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀building⠀is⠀run.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀precision⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀procedure⠀and⠀practical⠀care.⠀A⠀resident⠀follows⠀the⠀laundry⠀schedule⠀exactly⠀while⠀another⠀is⠀ill;⠀the⠀chair⠀enforces⠀the⠀noticeboard⠀rule⠀and⠀misses⠀that⠀a⠀neighbour⠀needed⠀the⠀information;⠀a⠀maintenance⠀request⠀is⠀rejected⠀on⠀a⠀technicality⠀that⠀the⠀caretaker⠀quietly⠀works⠀around.⠀Let⠀the⠀comic⠀correction⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀the⠀two⠀leads—one⠀knows⠀which⠀key⠀sticks,⠀the⠀other⠀remembers⠀who⠀always⠀forgets⠀the⠀booking,⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀re-files⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀other⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀pigeonhole.⠀Keep⠀everyone⠀in⠀register:⠀some⠀argue⠀through⠀procedure⠀because⠀that⠀is⠀their⠀role,⠀some⠀find⠀the⠀easier⠀practical⠀route,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀speaks⠀only⠀in⠀polished⠀epigrams.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romance⠀grow⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀care⠀accumulating⠀inside⠀these⠀ordinary⠀routines.⠀The⠀repeated⠀anchors⠀are⠀the⠀shared⠀courtyard,⠀the⠀basement⠀storage⠀room,⠀the⠀laundry⠀room⠀key,⠀the⠀general⠀meeting⠀agenda,⠀the⠀noticeboard,⠀the⠀caretaker's⠀log.⠀When⠀one⠀character⠀notices⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀needed⠀before⠀it⠀was⠀requested—a⠀flat⠀number⠀remembered,⠀a⠀booking⠀made,⠀a⠀form⠀collected—give⠀that⠀observation⠀causal⠀weight⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀When⠀the⠀association's⠀system⠀undervalues⠀the⠀act,⠀let⠀the⠀choice⠀still⠀matter⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀principals.⠀Disagreement⠀arises⠀from⠀real⠀competing⠀obligations:⠀a⠀maintenance⠀deadline⠀versus⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀help,⠀a⠀public⠀role⠀versus⠀a⠀private⠀preference,⠀a⠀rule⠀meant⠀to⠀help⠀becoming⠀an⠀obstacle.⠀The⠀romance⠀proceeds⠀by⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together,⠀not⠀by⠀sudden⠀confessions,⠀and⠀neither⠀partner⠀is⠀a⠀reward⠀for⠀completed⠀bureaucracy.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀It⠀must⠀include⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀that⠀accompanies⠀practical⠀action:⠀hesitation⠀before⠀the⠀meeting,⠀re-reading⠀the⠀missed⠀notice,⠀recognition⠀during⠀a⠀shared⠀chore,⠀the⠀private⠀relief⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀already⠀dealt⠀with⠀the⠀form.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀that⠀interiority⠀contains⠀unless⠀their⠀observations⠀are⠀earned⠀by⠀what⠀actually⠀happens.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀a⠀routine,⠀after⠀an⠀unsettled⠀request,⠀or⠀at⠀a⠀quiet⠀interval⠀where⠀something⠀new⠀becomes⠀available⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀leads.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀legible⠀screenplay⠀unit:⠀a⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀for⠀visible⠀movement⠀and⠀objects,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names.⠀Let⠀the⠀romance⠀grow⠀through⠀observable⠀institutional⠀and⠀domestic⠀transactions—signing⠀in,⠀fetching⠀a⠀file,⠀repairing⠀an⠀item,⠀taking⠀minutes,⠀dividing⠀family⠀duties,⠀answering⠀a⠀phone⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀hour.⠀Do⠀not⠀decorate⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands⠀or⠀expressive⠀punctuation⠀in⠀action⠀lines.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀comedy⠀structurally.⠀Show⠀an⠀organization⠀or⠀household⠀operating⠀by⠀rules⠀that⠀miss⠀the⠀human⠀point:⠀a⠀form⠀returned⠀for⠀a⠀missing⠀tick,⠀a⠀staff⠀kitchen⠀locked⠀because⠀of⠀policy,⠀a⠀visit⠀rescheduled⠀by⠀an⠀automated⠀message.⠀The⠀practical⠀correction⠀should⠀reveal⠀something⠀specific⠀about⠀the⠀two⠀leads—he⠀remembers⠀how⠀she⠀takes⠀her⠀coffee,⠀she⠀understands⠀that⠀his⠀official⠀tone⠀means⠀trouble,⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀rebooks⠀an⠀appointment⠀without⠀being⠀asked.⠀Keep⠀the⠀banter⠀calibrated;⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀uses⠀his⠀or⠀her⠀wit⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀register,⠀and⠀moments⠀of⠀direct⠀care⠀can⠀be⠀simple⠀sentences.\n\nPreserve⠀interiority⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀when⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Use⠀an⠀action⠀line⠀beginning⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀name⠀in⠀capitals⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀colon,⠀then⠀the⠀private⠀note:⠀for⠀example,⠀\"MIRA:⠀She⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀that⠀she⠀has⠀already⠀seen⠀the⠀form⠀on⠀his⠀desk.\"⠀The⠀note⠀must⠀remain⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀cast⠀member⠀could⠀overhear⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀a⠀feeling⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀read⠀that⠀note.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀continuing⠀action⠀or⠀speech⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀allows.⠀The⠀couple⠀need⠀not⠀finish⠀the⠀errand,⠀resolve⠀the⠀organizational⠀error,⠀or⠀announce⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀status⠀before⠀the⠀screenplay⠀stops.⠀The⠀last⠀lines⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀unanswered⠀look,⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction⠀completed,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀speaks⠀again.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nMake⠀the⠀stage⠀a⠀working⠀shared⠀space:⠀an⠀office,⠀community⠀hall,⠀kitchen,⠀station⠀waiting⠀room,⠀or⠀similar⠀location⠀with⠀ordinary⠀objects.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀props,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀practical⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀staged.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀through⠀proximity,⠀small⠀attentions,⠀and⠀the⠀friction⠀of⠀people⠀trying⠀to⠀share⠀a⠀space⠀or⠀solve⠀an⠀organizational⠀problem⠀while⠀managing⠀what⠀they⠀feel.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀comedy⠀drive⠀the⠀stage⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀enters⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀form,⠀exits⠀to⠀avoid⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀conversation,⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀coat⠀another⠀character⠀needs,⠀or⠀pauses⠀before⠀placing⠀a⠀file⠀on⠀the⠀only⠀vacant⠀chair.⠀The⠀comic⠀correction⠀may⠀be⠀physical:⠀one⠀chair⠀moved,⠀one⠀item⠀found,⠀one⠀meeting⠀cancelled.⠀Characters⠀should⠀have⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority—some⠀speak⠀in⠀careful⠀official⠀phrases,⠀some⠀leap⠀to⠀mockery,⠀others⠀barely⠀speak⠀under⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀a⠀polished⠀wit.\n\nTreat⠀any⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀as⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀automatic⠀destination⠀for⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀private⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀bracketed⠀nonspoken⠀stage⠀note⠀beginning⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀name:⠀for⠀example,⠀\"[MIRA,⠀private:⠀she⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀that⠀she⠀has⠀already⠀seen⠀the⠀form⠀on⠀his⠀desk.]\"⠀The⠀note⠀is⠀authoring⠀material,⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀stage⠀direction⠀for⠀the⠀actor⠀to⠀perform.⠀The⠀other⠀cast⠀member⠀sees⠀only⠀the⠀pause⠀and⠀the⠀coat.⠀Keep⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge⠀separate.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀when⠀the⠀stage⠀action⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀arrive⠀at⠀a⠀declaration⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀task.⠀An⠀entrance⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀sentence⠀may⠀be⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀simply⠀remain⠀alone⠀with⠀the⠀newly⠀understood⠀object.⠀Avoid⠀requiring⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀all⠀relevant⠀characters⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀symmetrical⠀arrangement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀one⠀clearly⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀that⠀mind's⠀associations,⠀while⠀keeping⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀a⠀remembered⠀meeting⠀from⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀now⠀remembered.⠀The⠀romance⠀lives⠀inside⠀this⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person:⠀remembered⠀attention,⠀anticipated⠀care,⠀a⠀missed⠀reply⠀reconsidered,⠀a⠀small⠀bodily⠀reaction⠀before⠀speech.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀detail⠀as⠀the⠀associative⠀material,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀observations⠀shared⠀by⠀everyone.⠀The⠀mind⠀works⠀in⠀an⠀institution⠀and⠀files⠀away⠀its⠀particulars—the⠀form,⠀the⠀nameplate,⠀the⠀staff⠀rota,⠀the⠀municipal⠀notice—and⠀from⠀those⠀objects⠀moves⠀to⠀an⠀obligation,⠀an⠀embarrassment,⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀bent⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀forgot⠀one.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀mind's⠀private⠀explanation⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀permits⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀infer.⠀The⠀character⠀sorts⠀life⠀into⠀committee⠀language⠀and⠀finds⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀persistently⠀misfiled:⠀a⠀kindness⠀entered⠀under⠀\"miscellaneous,\"⠀a⠀shared⠀lunch⠀remembered⠀as⠀an⠀agenda⠀item,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀direct⠀care⠀reclassified⠀as⠀procedure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀humor⠀particular⠀to⠀that⠀mind's⠀relationship⠀with⠀language⠀and⠀systems;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀loved⠀one⠀a⠀convenient⠀mirror⠀of⠀perfect⠀understanding.\n\nKeep⠀access⠀limited.⠀The⠀stream⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀entry⠀to⠀other⠀minds⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.⠀If⠀another⠀character⠀speaks,⠀report⠀the⠀speech⠀as⠀an⠀external⠀event⠀within⠀the⠀flow;⠀if⠀that⠀person's⠀feelings⠀are⠀imagined,⠀mark⠀that⠀imagining⠀as⠀such.⠀The⠀romantic⠀development⠀remains⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀history,⠀attention,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀universal⠀chemistry⠀that⠀arrives⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀becomes⠀lyrical.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀mental⠀movement⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention.⠀The⠀mind⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀relationship,⠀complete⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀polished⠀confession.⠀It⠀may⠀remain⠀inside⠀a⠀recurring⠀worry,⠀a⠀memory⠀taking⠀new⠀shape,⠀or⠀the⠀bodily⠀awareness⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀room.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Include⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀actually⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship—a⠀message⠀read⠀immediately,⠀a⠀long⠀gap⠀caused⠀by⠀work,⠀an⠀edited⠀line⠀softening⠀a⠀refusal.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀messaging⠀habits⠀be⠀distinct:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀complete⠀sentences⠀with⠀institutional⠀phrasing,⠀one⠀uses⠀clipped⠀practical⠀fragments,⠀one⠀performs⠀cheerfulness⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀way.⠀The⠀humor⠀and⠀feeling⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀those⠀habits⠀make⠀possible,⠀not⠀from⠀every⠀character⠀being⠀equally⠀witty.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀attention⠀as⠀a⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀exchanges.⠀Messages⠀may⠀concern⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀shared⠀obligation,⠀a⠀committee⠀chain,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀request⠀that⠀opens⠀into⠀personal⠀attention.⠀The⠀difference⠀between⠀official⠀explanations⠀and⠀practical⠀reality⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀formal⠀sign-off⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀genuinely⠀useful⠀offer,⠀or⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀reminder⠀that⠀nonetheless⠀renews⠀intimacy.⠀Preserve⠀that⠀difference⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀relationship⠀a⠀workplace⠀comedy⠀of⠀errors.\n\nDistinguish⠀carefully⠀between⠀sent⠀text,⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀private⠀thought,⠀and⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀composed,⠀corrected,⠀and⠀left⠀unsent.⠀Present⠀required⠀private⠀interiority⠀as⠀a⠀labeled⠀block⠀beginning⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀name⠀in⠀capitals⠀followed⠀by⠀\"PRIVATE\":⠀for⠀example,⠀\"MIRA⠀PRIVATE:⠀She⠀has⠀typed⠀the⠀apology⠀twice⠀and⠀deleted⠀it⠀both⠀times.\"⠀The⠀block⠀is⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀and⠀closed⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀recipient⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀actually⠀sent⠀and⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀available⠀to⠀them,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen⠀in⠀that⠀private⠀block.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀exchange:⠀an⠀unanswered⠀message,⠀a⠀deliberate⠀delay,⠀a⠀practical⠀confirmation,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀safe⠀to⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀reunion,⠀or⠀resolution⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀The⠀romance⠀continues⠀through⠀attention,⠀disclosure,⠀and⠀care⠀distributed⠀across⠀the⠀actual⠀messages,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀final⠀line⠀that⠀turns⠀silence⠀into⠀proof.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamayba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀concise⠀illustrated⠀scenes:⠀a⠀short⠀scene-setting⠀line,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀a⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀placed⠀for⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀illustrated⠀beat.⠀Background⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀social⠀situation—an⠀empty⠀staff⠀room,⠀a⠀queue⠀outside⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀table⠀at⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀a⠀canteen—and⠀expression⠀cues⠀suggest⠀a⠀reaction⠀without⠀sealing⠀the⠀truth⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀or⠀intends.⠀A⠀frown⠀can⠀be⠀suspicion,⠀tiredness,⠀or⠀recollection;⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀let⠀action⠀and⠀speech⠀supply⠀the⠀meaning.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀different⠀ways⠀of⠀handling⠀roles,⠀rules,⠀and⠀small⠀institutional⠀duties.⠀One⠀person⠀handles⠀authority⠀with⠀careful⠀courtesy,⠀another⠀turns⠀it⠀into⠀mock⠀solemnity,⠀a⠀third⠀avoids⠀official⠀language⠀altogether.⠀The⠀correction⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀dry⠀observation⠀about⠀the⠀queue,⠀a⠀practical⠀fix⠀for⠀a⠀form,⠀or⠀an⠀unexpected⠀kindness⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀two⠀leads⠀see⠀each⠀other.⠀Keep⠀that⠀correction⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀punchline⠀aimed⠀at⠀everyone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romance⠀proceed⠀without⠀activating⠀game-like⠀romance⠀routes⠀or⠀menus.⠀The⠀two⠀principals⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀each⠀other,⠀meet⠀through⠀practical⠀necessity,⠀or⠀repair⠀an⠀earlier⠀relationship;⠀attraction⠀develops⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀disclosure,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀Use⠀focal⠀narration⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀remembers.⠀Required⠀private⠀thought⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀short⠀silent⠀focal⠀line⠀placed⠀after⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀speech⠀or⠀reaction⠀beat:⠀for⠀example,⠀\"She⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀that⠀she⠀has⠀already⠀seen⠀the⠀form⠀on⠀his⠀desk.\"⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀that⠀line⠀contains⠀until⠀behavior⠀or⠀speech⠀communicates⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀scene⠀boundary⠀that⠀is⠀narratively⠀enough:⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀private⠀realization,⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀clear⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀answer⠀need⠀not⠀complete⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀branching⠀choice.⠀The⠀visual-novel⠀style⠀is⠀scene-oriented⠀fiction,⠀not⠀a⠀completed⠀game⠀engine.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nTreat⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀an⠀ongoing⠀serial⠀through-line.⠀Open⠀each⠀response⠀inside⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀already⠀underway—the⠀shift,⠀the⠀meeting,⠀the⠀household⠀repair,⠀the⠀form⠀still⠀waiting—and⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter.⠀Let⠀the⠀local⠀change⠀be⠀a⠀completed⠀chore,⠀a⠀partial⠀disclosure,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀message,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀notices⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀that⠀must⠀resolve⠀a⠀quarrel,⠀confession,⠀or⠀misunderstanding.\n\nUse⠀Pratchett's⠀institutional⠀realism⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀framework.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀shifts,⠀meetings,⠀household⠀maintenance,⠀forms,⠀lectures,⠀local⠀services,⠀or⠀shared⠀responsibilities.⠀Across⠀installments,⠀keep⠀the⠀practical⠀details⠀legible:⠀a⠀key⠀returned⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀must⠀be⠀missing⠀later⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀accounts⠀for⠀the⠀change;⠀a⠀promise⠀quoted⠀in⠀one⠀chapter⠀cannot⠀silently⠀become⠀a⠀different⠀promise.⠀New⠀information⠀may⠀qualify⠀an⠀earlier⠀explanation,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀earlier⠀event.⠀The⠀comedy⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀rules⠀and⠀human⠀care—a⠀regulation⠀followed⠀too⠀literally,⠀a⠀small⠀exception⠀made⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀official⠀reason,⠀an⠀apology⠀tied⠀to⠀paperwork—and⠀from⠀how⠀those⠀corrections⠀expose⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀actually⠀remembers⠀about⠀the⠀other.\n\nLet⠀romance⠀develop⠀through⠀selected⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀repetitive⠀confessions.⠀Between⠀installments,⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular:⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀the⠀cancelled⠀meeting,⠀the⠀sentence⠀from⠀the⠀previous⠀reply⠀that⠀one⠀character⠀still⠀hears,⠀the⠀object⠀they⠀both⠀remember.⠀Use⠀memory,⠀attention,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀with⠀aftermath⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀character⠀contract.⠀Required⠀interiority⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀nonspoken⠀prose,⠀but⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀it⠀contains⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀itself⠀communicates⠀it.\n\nOccasional⠀hooks⠀are⠀earned,⠀not⠀mandatory.⠀A⠀partial⠀sentence⠀at⠀a⠀chapter⠀boundary⠀can⠀deepen⠀interest,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀emergency⠀or⠀a⠀betrayal⠀solely⠀to⠀keep⠀readers.⠀The⠀serial⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules;⠀it⠀simply⠀organizes⠀the⠀romance⠀into⠀continuing⠀fictional⠀time.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀close⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀pushed⠀forward⠀by⠀a⠀question⠀one⠀character⠀cannot⠀leave⠀alone.⠀Use⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀rational⠀candor:⠀the⠀asking⠀voice⠀wants⠀a⠀clear⠀answer,⠀not⠀a⠀soothing⠀one,⠀and⠀it⠀violates⠀the⠀polite⠀rule⠀that⠀preserves⠀everyone's⠀comfort.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀this⠀honesty—a⠀withheld⠀apology,⠀an⠀admission⠀of⠀need,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀return⠀to⠀someone⠀difficult.⠀Let⠀that⠀strain⠀affect⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀behavior,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀narrative⠀mood.\n\nEach⠀scene⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀assumes⠀about⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Interiority⠀is⠀visible,⠀not⠀hidden:⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀prose.⠀They⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀say⠀another,⠀with⠀the⠀reason⠀made⠀particular—embarrassment,⠀a⠀wish⠀not⠀to⠀wound,⠀or⠀the⠀risk⠀of⠀being⠀answered.⠀No⠀fixed⠀ratio⠀between⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀is⠀required;⠀anger⠀may⠀shorten⠀thought,⠀a⠀calm⠀moment⠀may⠀extend⠀it.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀disagreement⠀and⠀disclosure,⠀not⠀through⠀generic⠀flirting⠀or⠀presumed⠀attraction.⠀Let⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀truth⠀land⠀in⠀ordinary⠀language.⠀The⠀aftermath⠀matters:⠀changed⠀plans,⠀a⠀long⠀silence,⠀a⠀partial⠀comfort,⠀a⠀practical⠀care⠀performed⠀despite⠀hurt.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀collapse.⠀Keep⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction;⠀the⠀author's⠀candor⠀can⠀be⠀bitter,⠀funny,⠀or⠀calm,⠀but⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀voice,⠀not⠀to⠀all⠀characters⠀equally.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀emotionally⠀turbulent,⠀not⠀a⠀tragedy⠀machine;⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀moment⠀without⠀canceling⠀each⠀other.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀must⠀be⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀give⠀all⠀characters⠀the⠀same⠀candor⠀or⠀wit.⠀Use⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀directness⠀selectively:⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀question⠀that⠀presses⠀past⠀social⠀approval,⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀responds⠀with⠀a⠀plausible,⠀personal⠀reaction—deflection,⠀a⠀partial⠀answer,⠀or⠀an⠀honest⠀admission.⠀The⠀question⠀exposes⠀something⠀real⠀about⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀hope,⠀a⠀resentment,⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀stay⠀close.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀coherent.⠀Narration⠀may⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint's⠀perspective,⠀but⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀remain⠀separate:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀something⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀include⠀a⠀hidden⠀block⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀Advance⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀disclosure⠀or⠀disagreement;⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀ends,⠀leave⠀the⠀continuation⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀just⠀happened—an⠀unanswered⠀concern,⠀a⠀practical⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀feeling—not⠀a⠀manufactured⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀next⠀response⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀continue⠀directly⠀from⠀the⠀last⠀exchange.\n\nAttraction⠀is⠀not⠀automatic.⠀Show⠀why⠀these⠀particular⠀people⠀care⠀or⠀hesitate⠀through⠀specific⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀or⠀small⠀practical⠀action.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀include⠀warmth,⠀awkwardness,⠀or⠀tension.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀mystery⠀clues,⠀visual-novel⠀branching,⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀banter⠀quota.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀if⠀a⠀narrator⠀or⠀player⠀character⠀is⠀involved,⠀their⠀perspective⠀and⠀agency⠀remain⠀in⠀force.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀for⠀the⠀romance.⠀Structure⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀linked⠀scenes,⠀each⠀organized⠀around⠀a⠀social⠀or⠀practical⠀occasion—a⠀meal,⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀market⠀trip,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀work⠀matter—where⠀the⠀couple's⠀attraction,⠀trust,⠀or⠀disagreement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do.\n\nIn⠀each⠀episode,⠀let⠀one⠀character⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀question⠀can⠀be⠀ordinary:⠀why⠀must⠀we⠀wait,⠀who⠀decided⠀this,⠀what⠀would⠀happen⠀if⠀we⠀didn't.⠀Through⠀reasoned⠀argument⠀or⠀direct⠀candor,⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀convention⠀that⠀presses⠀on⠀the⠀couple.⠀The⠀rule⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀state⠀policy;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀expectation,⠀a⠀workplace⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀assumption.⠀The⠀relationship⠀advances⠀when⠀the⠀pair⠀makes⠀a⠀choice⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀in⠀light⠀of⠀that⠀exposure.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀details⠀of⠀daily⠀life⠀and⠀social⠀context⠀without⠀inventing⠀national⠀speech⠀patterns⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀setting.⠀Each⠀episode⠀should⠀include⠀enough⠀interiority⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀or⠀hesitance.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀be⠀close⠀and⠀direct,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀speaks⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀candor.⠀Maintain⠀the⠀selected⠀author's⠀intellectual⠀independence⠀without⠀turning⠀all⠀characters⠀into⠀philosophers.⠀The⠀final⠀episode⠀can⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀unresolved;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀choices⠀across⠀scenes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀concrete,⠀high-contrast⠀prose.⠀Sentences⠀are⠀short⠀and⠀forceful,⠀but⠀not⠀uniformly⠀so:⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀room.⠀Material⠀details⠀carry⠀weight—a⠀worn⠀coat,⠀a⠀cracked⠀cup,⠀rain⠀on⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀room's⠀stale⠀air—but⠀they⠀serve⠀the⠀emotional⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀descriptive⠀inventory.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀cut⠀through⠀sentimentality.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀say⠀\"I⠀need⠀you\"⠀or⠀\"I⠀don't⠀trust⠀you\"⠀plainly,⠀even⠀roughly.⠀The⠀narrator⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀to⠀its⠀uncomfortable⠀answer,⠀revealing⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀assumption⠀that⠀governs⠀the⠀couple.⠀Emotional⠀exposure⠀has⠀the⠀same⠀compression⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀blow;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀impact⠀of⠀an⠀admission,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀returned⠀touch.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀disagreement,⠀disclosure,⠀and⠀care.⠀Attraction⠀is⠀not⠀assumed;⠀show⠀why⠀these⠀people⠀matter⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀through⠀specific⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀or⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀practical⠀care⠀performed⠀despite⠀fatigue⠀or⠀anger.⠀Use⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀fast⠀exchange,⠀then⠀a⠀paused⠀thought,⠀then⠀a⠀quiet⠀gesture.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀harsh,⠀but⠀warmth⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀small,⠀concrete⠀way—a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀horror⠀or⠀melodrama;⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀are⠀the⠀actual⠀risk.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀letters,⠀notes,⠀or⠀brief⠀written⠀messages⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀letter⠀to⠀the⠀beloved⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀diary⠀entry,⠀and⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatic⠀live⠀thought.⠀The⠀document's⠀omissions⠀and⠀hesitations⠀follow⠀from⠀its⠀writer's⠀situation⠀and⠀the⠀risk⠀of⠀being⠀read.\n\nLet⠀each⠀writer's⠀candor⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀voice.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀press⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀exposing⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀couple⠀apart⠀or⠀makes⠀them⠀hide.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀use⠀black⠀humor,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀voice⠀is⠀equally⠀sharp;⠀the⠀other⠀party's⠀reply⠀may⠀be⠀warmer,⠀evasive,⠀or⠀angry.⠀Gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀carry⠀meaning:⠀a⠀long⠀silence,⠀a⠀missing⠀page,⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀line,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀sent.\n\nAdvance⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀sequence.⠀Each⠀document⠀should⠀reveal⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀a⠀disagreement,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀What⠀one⠀writer⠀conceals⠀in⠀a⠀letter⠀can⠀become⠀visible⠀later⠀through⠀a⠀conflicted⠀account⠀or⠀a⠀material⠀trace.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀the⠀gap.⠀Interiority⠀remains⠀within⠀the⠀documents⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀chooses⠀to⠀record,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀inserted⠀hidden⠀block.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀genre's⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀without⠀inventing⠀explicit⠀content⠀unrelated⠀to⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀scenes⠀that⠀pay⠀attention⠀to⠀chosen⠀kindness,⠀familiar⠀preferences,⠀practical⠀care,⠀ease,⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures.⠀The⠀couple's⠀affection⠀is⠀sincere⠀and⠀particular:⠀one⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀tea,⠀brings⠀the⠀right⠀kind⠀of⠀fruit,⠀leaves⠀a⠀note⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀or⠀saves⠀a⠀seat.⠀Show⠀the⠀shared⠀enjoyment⠀of⠀a⠀quiet⠀meal,⠀a⠀walk,⠀or⠀a⠀tired⠀evening⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.\n\nKeep⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀present⠀but⠀gentle.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀point⠀out⠀an⠀absurd⠀rule⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀smile,⠀not⠀to⠀wound⠀but⠀to⠀clarify.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀notice⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀expectation⠀in⠀a⠀light,⠀specific⠀way.⠀Each⠀character⠀retains⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀There⠀can⠀be⠀mild⠀friction—a⠀disagreement⠀about⠀a⠀plan,⠀a⠀brief⠀annoyance—resolved⠀or⠀accepted⠀without⠀escalating⠀into⠀conflict.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀these⠀accumulated⠀small⠀attentions⠀and⠀a⠀few⠀clear⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀The⠀genre⠀is⠀still⠀romance:⠀attraction⠀is⠀not⠀generic,⠀and⠀the⠀couple's⠀particular⠀history⠀matters.⠀Avoid⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀mere⠀domestic⠀vignette;⠀the⠀comfort⠀serves⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀checklist⠀of⠀cozy⠀items.⠀The⠀style⠀may⠀include⠀gentle⠀humor,⠀but⠀no⠀character⠀is⠀required⠀to⠀be⠀witty.⠀Interiority⠀is⠀visible:⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀pleasure⠀or⠀hesitation⠀naturally⠀within⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraphs.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀have⠀enough⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀a⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment;⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀allows⠀it,⠀include⠀the⠀public⠀world's⠀rules⠀and⠀assumptions⠀around⠀the⠀couple—family⠀expectations,⠀reputation,⠀money,⠀or⠀custom—without⠀making⠀the⠀setting⠀automatically⠀aristocratic.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀rational⠀candor⠀puncture⠀solemn⠀assumptions⠀about⠀love.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀formal⠀social⠀occasion—a⠀call,⠀a⠀dinner,⠀a⠀ceremony—then⠀move⠀inward⠀to⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀or⠀private⠀realization⠀that⠀the⠀public⠀ritual⠀cannot⠀answer.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language;⠀dialogue⠀remains⠀attributed⠀and⠀natural,⠀but⠀the⠀surrounding⠀sentences⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀elaborate.⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀intellectual⠀independence⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀scrutiny⠀of⠀a⠀convention,⠀not⠀in⠀every⠀character's⠀speech.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀disagreement,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀Public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀can⠀organize⠀a⠀scene:⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀in⠀company⠀versus⠀what⠀is⠀thought⠀or⠀said⠀later⠀in⠀private.⠀Interiority⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀sustained⠀narration;⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀and⠀feeling⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀flow.⠀The⠀novelistic⠀architecture⠀serves⠀the⠀romance,⠀not⠀a⠀detached⠀essay⠀about⠀love.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀each⠀section⠀as⠀a⠀telling⠀addressed⠀to⠀a⠀listener⠀whose⠀continued⠀attention⠀is⠀a⠀live⠀practical⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀relationship:⠀reassurance,⠀warning,⠀delay,⠀persuasion,⠀or⠀repair.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀lovers,⠀a⠀close⠀observer,⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀addressing⠀a⠀specific⠀companion,⠀but⠀the⠀listener's⠀shifting⠀judgments⠀must⠀be⠀staged⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀merely⠀announced.\n\nCompose⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀as⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀the⠀outer⠀relationship.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recounts⠀a⠀past⠀promise,⠀quarrel,⠀or⠀arrangement,⠀give⠀the⠀tale⠀a⠀specific⠀claim⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀accept:⠀\"that⠀is⠀why⠀I⠀waited,\"⠀\"that⠀is⠀what⠀I⠀should⠀have⠀refused,\"⠀\"that⠀is⠀the⠀part⠀you⠀still⠀do⠀not⠀see.\"⠀After⠀the⠀tale,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀claim⠀itself.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀resist⠀it,⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀tale⠀was⠀designed⠀to⠀avoid.⠀The⠀disclosure⠀may⠀change⠀the⠀listener's⠀willingness⠀to⠀trust,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀uncertainty.\n\nPut⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀into⠀the⠀listener's⠀response⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀the⠀teller's⠀account.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀offers⠀a⠀convenient⠀phrase,⠀a⠀flattering⠀version,⠀or⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀choice⠀seem⠀inevitable,⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀probe⠀its⠀practical⠀absurdity:⠀the⠀office⠀regulation⠀treated⠀as⠀fate,⠀the⠀family⠀maxim⠀repeated⠀as⠀proof,⠀the⠀romantic⠀formula⠀that⠀covers⠀a⠀smaller,⠀more⠀interesting⠀motive.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀defend⠀the⠀phrase,⠀revise⠀it,⠀or⠀expose⠀its⠀cost⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀blunt⠀sentence.⠀The⠀tone⠀may⠀be⠀dry,⠀comic,⠀or⠀blunt,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀voices⠀of⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀universal⠀satire.\n\nMake⠀repeated⠀phrases⠀or⠀objects⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels.⠀A⠀phrase⠀first⠀heard⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀implication;⠀an⠀object⠀described⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀lie.⠀The⠀repetition⠀should⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀connect⠀the⠀levels,⠀not⠀guarantee⠀the⠀truth⠀of⠀either.\n\nLet⠀attraction⠀and⠀vulnerability⠀be⠀experienced,⠀not⠀merely⠀reported.⠀In⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀wants⠀from⠀the⠀teller⠀through⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention,⠀hesitation,⠀and⠀questions;⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀afraid⠀to⠀lose⠀through⠀the⠀tale's⠀selection⠀and⠀omissions.⠀In⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀disclosure⠀or⠀silence.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀through⠀these⠀exchanges:⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀reason,⠀a⠀suspicion⠀voiced⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀pressure⠀and⠀later⠀retold⠀as⠀love.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible.⠀Before⠀shifting⠀into⠀a⠀tale,⠀establish⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀now;⠀after⠀returning,⠀let⠀the⠀outer⠀characters⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀just⠀heard.⠀End⠀a⠀section⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀altered⠀the⠀outer⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀way:⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀knows⠀something⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀question,⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀given⠀up⠀a⠀flattering⠀version,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀has⠀acquired⠀a⠀new⠀meaning⠀between⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀modernist-absurdist⠀construction⠀as⠀the⠀formal⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀treats⠀the⠀ordinary⠀machinery⠀of⠀a⠀relationship—schedules,⠀applications,⠀family⠀expectations,⠀shared⠀expenses,⠀the⠀phrase⠀\"we⠀should⠀talk\"—as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀rules⠀whose⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀becomes⠀visible⠀only⠀when⠀someone⠀tries⠀to⠀apply⠀them⠀to⠀actual⠀feeling.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀set⠀in⠀any⠀contemporary⠀location;⠀the⠀method,⠀not⠀the⠀scenery,⠀carries⠀the⠀tradition.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀stay⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀national⠀blueprint.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀participant,⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀spare,⠀ironic,⠀and⠀full⠀of⠀small⠀observed⠀details;⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀a⠀commentator,⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀assemble⠀lists,⠀official⠀language,⠀and⠀remembered⠀fragments⠀into⠀a⠀defamiliarizing⠀montage.⠀Avoid⠀imposing⠀clipped⠀sentences⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀jargon⠀on⠀a⠀voice⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀use⠀them.⠀The⠀absurdity⠀should⠀be⠀precise,⠀not⠀decorative.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀couple's⠀intimate⠀experience⠀and⠀the⠀external⠀forms⠀they⠀must⠀navigate.⠀A⠀registration⠀form⠀reduces⠀a⠀long⠀negotiation⠀to⠀a⠀checkbox;⠀a⠀friend's⠀well-meant⠀advice⠀turns⠀a⠀private⠀doubt⠀into⠀a⠀slogan;⠀a⠀workplace⠀policy⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀lovers⠀may⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀In⠀each⠀scene,⠀juxtapose⠀the⠀form's⠀language⠀with⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀observation⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀moment:⠀the⠀checkbox⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀argument,⠀the⠀slogan⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀policy⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀sentence⠀one⠀lover⠀cannot⠀say⠀aloud.⠀Let⠀each⠀character⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀mismatch⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀speech⠀or⠀action.⠀One⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀rule⠀as⠀protection,⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀expose⠀its⠀error⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀patient⠀sentence.⠀Neither⠀reaction⠀must⠀win;⠀the⠀point⠀is⠀that⠀both⠀are⠀made⠀newly⠀legible⠀by⠀the⠀apparatus.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀to⠀puncture⠀the⠀romantic⠀tradition⠀itself.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀a⠀solemn⠀phrase—\"forever,\"⠀\"the⠀right⠀time,\"⠀\"it⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀be\"—let⠀the⠀narrator⠀examine⠀what⠀the⠀phrase⠀is⠀doing⠀in⠀that⠀moment.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀genuine⠀attempt⠀at⠀closeness,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀avoiding⠀a⠀harder⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀borrowed⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀film.⠀The⠀examination⠀should⠀advance⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀end⠀it:⠀after⠀the⠀puncturing,⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀say⠀something⠀smaller⠀and⠀truer.\n\nRepresent⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀response⠀to⠀the⠀absurdity,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary.⠀In⠀one⠀scene,⠀a⠀lover⠀may⠀rehearse⠀a⠀protest⠀while⠀pretending⠀to⠀read⠀a⠀contract;⠀in⠀another,⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀word⠀\"commitment\"⠀has⠀started⠀to⠀sound⠀like⠀a⠀gate.⠀The⠀private⠀reasoning⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀each⠀person's⠀history,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀competing⠀wants,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀eventual⠀choice—whether⠀to⠀stay,⠀leave,⠀wait,⠀or⠀refuse⠀the⠀form—causally⠀legible.\n\nEnd⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀but⠀with⠀a⠀structural⠀consequence.⠀After⠀the⠀defamiliarizing⠀exchange,⠀the⠀relationship⠀should⠀be⠀in⠀a⠀detectably⠀different⠀condition:⠀a⠀promise⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀revised,⠀a⠀silence⠀may⠀have⠀become⠀audible,⠀or⠀a⠀rule⠀may⠀have⠀been⠀abandoned.⠀This⠀consequence,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀climax,⠀closes⠀the⠀section.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀romance⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀modern⠀institution⠀or⠀environment⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀persists⠀in⠀material⠀ways:⠀a⠀family⠀firm,⠀a⠀municipal⠀office,⠀a⠀rented⠀building⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀history,⠀a⠀workplace⠀where⠀seniority⠀behaves⠀like⠀lineage.⠀Use⠀urban⠀detail—the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀security⠀light⠀flickers,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀file⠀folder,⠀the⠀noise⠀from⠀the⠀street—to⠀make⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀tangible⠀without⠀importing⠀supernatural⠀rules.\n\nGive⠀each⠀lover⠀a⠀public⠀mask⠀that⠀works⠀in⠀this⠀setting.⠀One⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀competent⠀official,⠀the⠀dutiful⠀heir,⠀the⠀patient⠀service⠀worker,⠀the⠀unreadable⠀neighbor;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀use⠀charm,⠀silence,⠀or⠀competence⠀as⠀a⠀shield.⠀Stage⠀the⠀mask's⠀necessity⠀in⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀public⠀performance⠀is⠀interrupted⠀or⠀observed:⠀a⠀superior⠀enters,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀repeats⠀an⠀old⠀expectation,⠀a⠀colleague⠀invokes⠀the⠀rule⠀the⠀mask⠀was⠀built⠀to⠀satisfy.⠀In⠀trusted⠀company,⠀allow⠀one⠀mask⠀to⠀fall⠀away⠀enough⠀to⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀wants⠀or⠀fears,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀unmasking⠀total⠀or⠀permanent.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀through⠀these⠀partial⠀exposures⠀and⠀the⠀risks⠀they⠀carry.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀irreverent⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀inherited⠀rules.⠀A⠀lover⠀may⠀trace⠀the⠀origin⠀of⠀a⠀policy⠀and⠀find⠀it⠀was⠀a⠀former⠀manager's⠀superstition;⠀a⠀ritual⠀of⠀respect⠀may⠀turn⠀out⠀to⠀protect⠀an⠀old⠀debt;⠀a⠀family⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀with⠀such⠀authority⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀has⠀tested⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀expose⠀these⠀mechanisms⠀with⠀precise⠀black⠀humor,⠀but⠀the⠀exposure⠀must⠀have⠀actual⠀consequences⠀for⠀the⠀couple:⠀it⠀may⠀free⠀them⠀from⠀a⠀limit,⠀explain⠀an⠀old⠀resentment,⠀or⠀make⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀realize⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀been⠀enduring.\n\nMake⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀not⠀just⠀decorate⠀it.⠀A⠀conversation⠀in⠀a⠀cold⠀corridor⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀characters⠀speak⠀differently⠀than⠀one⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀room;⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀a⠀watching⠀superior⠀may⠀force⠀a⠀coded⠀exchange;⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀worn⠀furniture⠀may⠀remind⠀one⠀lover⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise.⠀Render⠀the⠀atmospheric⠀constraint⠀through⠀sensory⠀detail⠀that⠀alters⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say⠀or⠀do:⠀the⠀cold⠀makes⠀a⠀confession⠀shorter,⠀the⠀watching⠀superior⠀turns⠀a⠀question⠀into⠀a⠀code,⠀the⠀worn⠀furniture⠀interrupts⠀a⠀gesture.⠀The⠀intimacy⠀is⠀political⠀in⠀the⠀sense⠀that⠀the⠀setting's⠀hierarchies⠀and⠀permissions⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀safe⠀to⠀say⠀and⠀do,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀a⠀particular⠀relationship,⠀not⠀an⠀allegory.\n\nDevelop⠀attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀through⠀morally⠀complicated⠀choices.⠀The⠀lovers⠀may⠀be⠀complicit⠀in⠀the⠀setting's⠀compromises,⠀may⠀protect⠀different⠀interests,⠀or⠀may⠀disagree⠀about⠀how⠀much⠀to⠀expose.⠀These⠀disagreements⠀should⠀be⠀meaningful⠀and⠀not⠀automatically⠀resolved⠀by⠀love.⠀The⠀romance⠀genre⠀requires⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀matters;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀that⠀the⠀couple⠀be⠀innocent⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀institution⠀be⠀defeated.\n\nLet⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀real⠀duration.⠀A⠀lover⠀may⠀wait⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀listen⠀to⠀a⠀distant⠀argument,⠀reread⠀an⠀old⠀note,⠀or⠀rehearse⠀what⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀the⠀waiting⠀itself⠀can⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀exchange.⠀The⠀attention⠀and⠀hesitation⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀romance,⠀not⠀padding⠀before⠀a⠀plot⠀event.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀outer⠀relationship⠀has⠀been⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀recognition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀a⠀teller⠀who⠀is⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀who⠀uses⠀stories⠀to⠀bargain,⠀comfort,⠀warn,⠀explain,⠀or⠀delay⠀within⠀a⠀particular⠀relationship.⠀The⠀outer⠀frame⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀obligation;⠀its⠀purpose⠀is⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀real⠀audience⠀and⠀a⠀real⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀introduce⠀a⠀palace⠀or⠀a⠀supernatural⠀bargain.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀stories⠀carry⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀the⠀outer⠀romance.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀recounts⠀an⠀ancestor's⠀marriage,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀scandal,⠀a⠀religious⠀story,⠀or⠀a⠀local⠀proverb,⠀the⠀listener⠀should⠀hear⠀a⠀specific⠀claim:⠀why⠀a⠀promise⠀matters,⠀why⠀a⠀family⠀will⠀not⠀accept⠀a⠀choice,⠀why⠀a⠀secret⠀has⠀been⠀kept.⠀After⠀the⠀tale,⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀argument,⠀not⠀merely⠀to⠀the⠀plot.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀accept⠀it,⠀resist⠀it,⠀laugh⠀at⠀it,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀tale⠀was⠀designed⠀to⠀avoid.⠀The⠀response⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀happens⠀next⠀between⠀the⠀lovers.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀beneath⠀the⠀inherited⠀proverbs⠀and⠀rules.⠀A⠀suitor⠀may⠀be⠀praised⠀as⠀\"well⠀settled\"⠀without⠀anyone⠀asking⠀how;⠀a⠀family⠀may⠀treat⠀an⠀astrological⠀objection⠀as⠀decisive⠀while⠀ignoring⠀the⠀economic⠀pressure⠀behind⠀it;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀recite⠀an⠀old⠀story⠀to⠀avoid⠀saying⠀what⠀she⠀actually⠀feels.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀listener⠀follow⠀one⠀such⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀showing⠀the⠀material⠀conditions—rent,⠀land,⠀education,⠀employment,⠀migration—that⠀the⠀proverb⠀obscures.⠀The⠀tone⠀should⠀be⠀particular,⠀dry,⠀and⠀often⠀comic,⠀but⠀not⠀uniformly⠀cynical.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀community,⠀region,⠀and⠀language⠀specific⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀generic⠀national⠀temperament.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀set⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀state,⠀city,⠀or⠀linguistic⠀community,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀obligations,⠀food,⠀transport,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀memory.⠀If⠀no⠀such⠀details⠀are⠀supplied,⠀keep⠀the⠀community⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀institutions:⠀a⠀housing⠀society,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀religious⠀or⠀caste⠀association,⠀a⠀diaspora⠀network.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀uniform⠀family⠀structure⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀supply⠀them.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀attention⠀and⠀memory.⠀In⠀the⠀outer⠀frame,⠀stage⠀what⠀the⠀lovers⠀notice⠀about⠀each⠀other's⠀hands,⠀food,⠀speech,⠀silences,⠀and⠀work;⠀how⠀one⠀remembers⠀an⠀earlier⠀meeting⠀differently⠀from⠀the⠀other;⠀how⠀a⠀shared⠀story⠀from⠀childhood⠀has⠀changed⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀relationship⠀should⠀develop⠀through⠀these⠀specifically⠀observed⠀and⠀remembered⠀details,⠀not⠀through⠀generic⠀flirtation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀teller.⠀It⠀may⠀reveal⠀an⠀old⠀fear,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀broken⠀engagement,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀made⠀under⠀pressure.⠀The⠀revelation⠀should⠀not⠀guarantee⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀trust;⠀instead,⠀it⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀practical⠀basis⠀of⠀the⠀relationship.⠀End⠀when⠀that⠀alteration⠀is⠀felt⠀by⠀both⠀outer⠀characters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀an⠀accumulative⠀account⠀in⠀the⠀voice⠀of⠀the⠀lover⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀who⠀is⠀keeping⠀the⠀record:⠀dated⠀entries,⠀remembered⠀exchanges,⠀observations,⠀lists,⠀short⠀reflections,⠀and⠀occasional⠀longer⠀arguments.⠀The⠀form⠀may⠀be⠀presented⠀directly⠀as⠀a⠀journal⠀or⠀suggested⠀by⠀the⠀prose's⠀pace⠀and⠀selectivity;⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀plot⠀summary.\n\nLet⠀each⠀entry⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀moment⠀in⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀quarrel,⠀an⠀official⠀form,⠀a⠀family⠀visit,⠀a⠀night⠀of⠀bad⠀sleep.⠀In⠀the⠀entry,⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀observed⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀question⠀about⠀it.⠀A⠀lover⠀says⠀\"it's⠀fine\"⠀and⠀the⠀diarist⠀asks⠀what⠀that⠀word⠀is⠀doing;⠀a⠀parent⠀repeats⠀an⠀old⠀proverb⠀and⠀the⠀diarist⠀traces⠀where⠀it⠀came⠀from;⠀a⠀promise⠀is⠀made⠀and⠀the⠀diarist⠀notices⠀the⠀conditions⠀attached.⠀This⠀is⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀made⠀intimate⠀and⠀personal,⠀not⠀a⠀detached⠀essay.\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀form⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀develops⠀through⠀repetition⠀and⠀revision.⠀An⠀early⠀entry⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀impression;⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀quote⠀that⠀earlier⠀sentence⠀and⠀respond⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀new⠀information.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀has⠀changed⠀its⠀meaning,⠀or⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀reading⠀of⠀a⠀gesture.⠀This⠀recurrence⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀follow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀changing⠀mind⠀without⠀a⠀compulsory⠀narrative⠀arc.⠀The⠀romance⠀develops⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀becomes⠀more⠀precise⠀and⠀less⠀assured.\n\nMake⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀social⠀formula⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀a⠀central⠀subject.⠀In⠀each⠀entry,⠀juxtapose⠀what⠀people⠀are⠀supposed⠀to⠀say⠀about⠀marriage,⠀work,⠀family,⠀or⠀love⠀with⠀what⠀actually⠀happened⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀hour.⠀A⠀congratulatory⠀message⠀arrives⠀at⠀the⠀worst⠀possible⠀time;⠀a⠀formal⠀greeting⠀covers⠀a⠀long⠀silence;⠀a⠀well-meant⠀rule⠀makes⠀the⠀lovers⠀unable⠀to⠀speak⠀privately.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀candor⠀punctures⠀the⠀formula⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀satirist.\n\nPreserve⠀narrative⠀distance⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀lovers,⠀the⠀diary⠀is⠀partial,⠀self-interested,⠀and⠀sometimes⠀wrong;⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀an⠀observer,⠀the⠀record⠀may⠀compare⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀with⠀what⠀was⠀omitted,⠀but⠀cannot⠀know⠀the⠀hidden⠀mind⠀of⠀another⠀person.⠀Use⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀only⠀where⠀access⠀permits;⠀the⠀diary⠀itself⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀fictional⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀experience,⠀but⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀selected⠀presentation⠀of⠀that⠀experience.\n\nEnd⠀an⠀entry⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀conclusion⠀but⠀with⠀a⠀sharper⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀state⠀of⠀attention.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀stop⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀understood⠀something⠀new⠀enough⠀to⠀alter⠀the⠀next⠀day's⠀action:⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀ask,⠀to⠀wait,⠀to⠀apologize,⠀or⠀to⠀stop⠀pretending.⠀This⠀alteration,⠀not⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀resolution,⠀is⠀the⠀section's⠀natural⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nSelect⠀the⠀social⠀realism⠀or⠀chronicle/testimony⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀lovers'⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀conditions:⠀how⠀they⠀meet⠀through⠀work,⠀migration,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀local⠀politics,⠀or⠀daily⠀survival;⠀how⠀their⠀time⠀together⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀bus⠀schedules,⠀shifts,⠀rent,⠀remittances,⠀paperwork,⠀and⠀the⠀watchful⠀judgments⠀of⠀neighbors⠀and⠀relatives.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀have⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀chronicle—specific⠀places,⠀prices,⠀journeys,⠀overheard⠀conversations—without⠀becoming⠀a⠀report.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀to⠀uncover⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀rules⠀governing⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀landlord's⠀requirement,⠀an⠀employer's⠀demand,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation,⠀a⠀state⠀form,⠀or⠀a⠀local⠀custom⠀may⠀appear⠀neutral⠀until⠀the⠀narrator⠀traces⠀its⠀cost.⠀One⠀lover⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀seemingly⠀romantic⠀gesture⠀was⠀actually⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀legal⠀problem;⠀another⠀may⠀realize⠀that⠀a⠀family⠀objection⠀is⠀really⠀about⠀money,⠀not⠀tradition.⠀Expose⠀these⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀reasoning⠀and⠀black⠀humor,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀omniscient⠀lecture.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀meanings⠀of⠀proximity,⠀separation,⠀and⠀return.⠀If⠀the⠀couple⠀must⠀be⠀apart⠀for⠀work⠀or⠀migration,⠀stage⠀how⠀they⠀maintain⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀maintain⠀trust⠀through⠀particular⠀calls,⠀messages,⠀money,⠀and⠀remembered⠀details.⠀If⠀they⠀are⠀together,⠀render⠀the⠀practical⠀negotiations⠀as⠀concrete⠀scenes:⠀who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀apologizes,⠀who⠀risks⠀disapproval.⠀The⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀these⠀conditions,⠀not⠀from⠀abstract⠀passion.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀without⠀inventing⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀specifies⠀a⠀country,⠀city,⠀or⠀linguistic⠀community,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀rhythms,⠀foods,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀public⠀spaces.⠀If⠀no⠀setting⠀is⠀supplied,⠀make⠀the⠀community⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀institutions:⠀a⠀market,⠀a⠀church,⠀a⠀neighborhood,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀diaspora⠀network.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀a⠀uniform⠀political⠀allegory;⠀the⠀mundane⠀conditions⠀are⠀enough.\n\nRepresent⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀private⠀response⠀to⠀these⠀conditions.⠀A⠀lover⠀may⠀rehearse⠀a⠀speech⠀while⠀standing⠀in⠀a⠀queue,⠀count⠀the⠀hours⠀until⠀a⠀bus⠀arrives,⠀remember⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀seems⠀funny,⠀or⠀calculate⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀sacrificed⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀These⠀private⠀thoughts⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀history,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀competing⠀wants,⠀and⠀they⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀eventual⠀choice—to⠀stay,⠀leave,⠀wait,⠀confront,⠀or⠀compromise—causally⠀legible.\n\nEnd⠀with⠀a⠀documented⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀moral.⠀After⠀a⠀conflict⠀or⠀a⠀hard⠀conversation,⠀the⠀chronicle⠀should⠀record⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀couple's⠀arrangements:⠀a⠀promise⠀broken⠀or⠀kept,⠀a⠀ticket⠀bought,⠀a⠀form⠀surrendered,⠀a⠀silence⠀begun.⠀This⠀consequence⠀closes⠀the⠀section.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀visually⠀clean,⠀fast-readable⠀scenes.⠀Open⠀each⠀section⠀by⠀placing⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀location—a⠀corridor,⠀a⠀shop,⠀a⠀station⠀platform,⠀a⠀kitchen—and⠀move⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀space⠀with⠀clear⠀cues:⠀they⠀step⠀outside,⠀the⠀door⠀closes,⠀the⠀light⠀changes⠀from⠀fluorescent⠀to⠀streetlamp.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀dialogue,⠀action,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀beat⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀there⠀is⠀no⠀compulsory⠀comedic⠀tone⠀or⠀young⠀cast.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀argument⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀relationship's⠀development.⠀Let⠀one⠀character⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀would⠀prefer⠀to⠀skip:⠀why⠀did⠀you⠀say⠀it⠀was⠀fine?⠀what⠀does⠀\"the⠀right⠀time\"⠀mean?⠀do⠀you⠀actually⠀want⠀this,⠀or⠀are⠀you⠀just⠀obeying⠀the⠀form?⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀practical⠀absurdity—a⠀rule,⠀a⠀slogan,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation,⠀a⠀workplace⠀policy—that⠀has⠀been⠀standing⠀in⠀for⠀honest⠀feeling.⠀After⠀the⠀question,⠀stage⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀immediate⠀reaction⠀in⠀two⠀beats:⠀a⠀visible⠀gesture⠀in⠀the⠀face,⠀hands,⠀voice,⠀or⠀posture,⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀accompanies⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀neat⠀answer;⠀the⠀exposure⠀itself⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀lovers⠀can⠀say⠀next.\n\nMake⠀attraction⠀and⠀vulnerability⠀visible⠀through⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀Notice⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀his⠀hands⠀when⠀he⠀is⠀nervous,⠀how⠀she⠀turns⠀away⠀when⠀she⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀admit⠀something,⠀what⠀object⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀touches⠀without⠀realizing.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀be⠀selective⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀person,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀list⠀of⠀romantic⠀signals.⠀Use⠀the⠀light⠀novel's⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀record⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀accompanies⠀a⠀visible⠀gesture,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀both⠀the⠀outward⠀movement⠀and⠀its⠀inward⠀meaning.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀such⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀abstract⠀introspection.⠀Keep⠀any⠀actual⠀shift⠀in⠀a⠀promise,⠀silence,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀boundary⠀concrete;⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀also⠀remain⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀practical⠀situation⠀without⠀changing⠀it.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀quiet,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀scene's⠀setting⠀or⠀dialogue.⠀Timing⠀and⠀competing⠀wants⠀matter:⠀one⠀lover⠀may⠀have⠀to⠀leave⠀for⠀work,⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀be⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀reply,⠀and⠀these⠀external⠀pressures⠀shape⠀the⠀pace⠀of⠀disclosure.\n\nLet⠀the⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀voices.⠀The⠀narrator⠀or⠀characters⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀romantic⠀phrase⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀job⠀application,⠀that⠀a⠀congratulatory⠀phrase⠀was⠀copied⠀from⠀a⠀brochure,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀\"emergency\"⠀is⠀actually⠀someone's⠀forgotten⠀birthday.⠀This⠀humor⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀lovers⠀witty⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀way;⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀blunt,⠀the⠀other⠀evasive,⠀the⠀narrator⠀dry.⠀The⠀puncturing⠀should⠀never⠀come⠀from⠀nowhere⠀or⠀mock⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself;⠀it⠀should⠀clear⠀away⠀the⠀false⠀solemnity⠀so⠀a⠀smaller,⠀truer⠀thing⠀can⠀be⠀said.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀scene⠀when⠀the⠀visual⠀and⠀private⠀exchange⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀natural⠀pause:⠀a⠀decision⠀announced,⠀a⠀confession⠀heard,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀hanging.⠀The⠀pause⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀next⠀scene's⠀starting⠀place—the⠀door,⠀the⠀message,⠀the⠀ticket,⠀the⠀word—without⠀requiring⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀begin⠀immediately.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀developing⠀relationship⠀through⠀precise⠀outward⠀details⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀candid⠀reasoning,⠀then⠀let⠀lyrical⠀syntax⠀extend⠀what⠀those⠀details⠀make⠀present.⠀Choose⠀an⠀image⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene—a⠀sound,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀practical⠀object—and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀each⠀paragraph⠀with⠀new⠀figures.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀build⠀an⠀experience⠀across⠀sentences:⠀vary⠀long⠀clauses⠀with⠀abrupt⠀plain⠀statements⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀realization⠀lands⠀as⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀rhythm,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀moral⠀announcement.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀directness⠀to⠀interrupt⠀lyrical⠀flow⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀demands⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀challenge⠀an⠀elegant⠀metaphor,⠀answer⠀a⠀private⠀observation⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀or⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀behavior⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀image⠀being⠀built.⠀This⠀does⠀not⠀banish⠀lyricism;⠀it⠀keeps⠀the⠀imagery⠀answerable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀actually⠀do⠀and⠀say.⠀The⠀same⠀recurring⠀image⠀can⠀accrue⠀tension,⠀reassurance,⠀or⠀disappointment⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀events,⠀letting⠀the⠀reader⠀track⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀feelings.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀register⠀uneven⠀in⠀a⠀deliberate⠀way:⠀formal⠀or⠀musical⠀sentences⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀moments⠀of⠀attention,⠀while⠀dialogue⠀and⠀physical⠀action⠀remain⠀plain⠀and⠀immediate.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register.⠀Let⠀attraction⠀and⠀vulnerability⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀notices⠀and⠀chooses⠀to⠀remember,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀prose⠀enact⠀the⠀thought's⠀movement—its⠀question,⠀its⠀lingering⠀on⠀a⠀detail,⠀its⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀prompted⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀love⠀or⠀trust;⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀decision⠀that⠀sustain⠀them⠀in⠀this⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀call⠀up⠀a⠀specific⠀remembered⠀occasion—an⠀errand,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀decision⠀left⠀unresolved—and⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀examine⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀of⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀simply⠀mourn.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀lucid,⠀rational⠀voice⠀to⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀actually⠀establishes,⠀what⠀it⠀obscures,⠀and⠀what⠀present⠀behavior⠀contradicts⠀it.⠀A⠀detail⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀association⠀without⠀being⠀explained,⠀but⠀when⠀reflection⠀turns⠀explicit⠀it⠀should⠀advance⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀repeat⠀a⠀vague⠀sense⠀of⠀loss.\n\nKeep⠀present⠀pleasures⠀available.⠀The⠀relationship⠀can⠀be⠀tense,⠀tender,⠀funny,⠀or⠀ordinary⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀where⠀loss⠀presses⠀in.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change:⠀the⠀person⠀now⠀answers⠀more⠀quickly,⠀the⠀old⠀teasing⠀has⠀a⠀new⠀edge,⠀a⠀habit⠀has⠀disappeared,⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀has⠀altered.⠀These⠀changes⠀matter⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀specific,⠀not⠀because⠀every⠀sentence⠀must⠀announce⠀impermanence.⠀Show⠀how⠀attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀survive⠀contact⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀gone,⠀sometimes⠀by⠀changing⠀their⠀terms.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀author's⠀candor⠀against⠀solemnity.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀sentimentalize⠀the⠀past,⠀mock⠀an⠀easy⠀nostalgia,⠀or⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise⠀was⠀less⠀clear⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Candor⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀cynicism;⠀a⠀plain⠀admission⠀of⠀longing⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀a⠀sharp⠀correction⠀of⠀a⠀false⠀memory.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀once⠀more,⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it,⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀understanding.⠀The⠀ending⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀its⠀present⠀complexity,⠀not⠀convert⠀all⠀loss⠀into⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀grief.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nFrame⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀being⠀told⠀to⠀someone⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀setting:⠀a⠀late⠀conversation,⠀a⠀family⠀occasion,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀meal.⠀The⠀teller's⠀interruptions⠀and⠀asides⠀matter.⠀Use⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀lucid,⠀irreverent⠀voice⠀inside⠀that⠀frame:⠀the⠀teller⠀questions⠀a⠀received⠀version⠀of⠀events,⠀punctures⠀a⠀self-serving⠀explanation,⠀or⠀notes⠀a⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀in⠀what⠀everyone⠀else⠀accepts.⠀This⠀keeps⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀from⠀becoming⠀decorative⠀high⠀style.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀frame,⠀let⠀the⠀narrative⠀select⠀and⠀reveal⠀details⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀purposes.⠀A⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀early⠀meeting⠀may⠀be⠀retold⠀more⠀than⠀once⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis⠀as⠀later⠀information⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀listening⠀audience⠀react,⠀ask⠀questions,⠀or⠀correct⠀the⠀teller.⠀These⠀reactions⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀new⠀layer⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀relationship⠀without⠀making⠀any⠀character⠀a⠀passive⠀receiver.⠀Avoid⠀universal⠀mysticism⠀or⠀antique⠀decor;⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀objects⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀return⠀to⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀delayed.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀of⠀vulnerability,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀postpone⠀a⠀confession⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀company⠀makes⠀it⠀difficult.⠀Use⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀social⠀details—who⠀washed⠀the⠀cups,⠀who⠀knew⠀a⠀secret⠀first,⠀who⠀was⠀absent—as⠀evidence⠀of⠀love,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀estrangement.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀itself⠀alive:⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀telling⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀container.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀where⠀a⠀final⠀disclosed⠀detail⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀listener⠀understands⠀the⠀teller.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀state:⠀a⠀placed⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀failure⠀to⠀ask,⠀a⠀changed⠀pattern⠀of⠀movement.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀rational⠀amusement⠀or⠀correction⠀appear⠀in⠀plain⠀language,⠀not⠀in⠀figurative⠀decoration.⠀Each⠀sentence⠀should⠀make⠀only⠀the⠀explanation⠀necessary⠀for⠀the⠀present⠀inference;⠀if⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀that⠀a⠀gesture⠀means⠀care⠀or⠀withdrawal⠀from⠀what⠀precedes⠀it,⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀inward⠀gloss.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀author's⠀voice⠀as⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀selecting⠀and⠀judging:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀impractical,⠀that⠀a⠀social⠀courtesy⠀conceals⠀a⠀power⠀move,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀character's⠀stated⠀reason⠀omits⠀the⠀real⠀cause.⠀This⠀observation⠀can⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀concrete,⠀delivered⠀in⠀a⠀flat⠀tone.⠀Let⠀the⠀romance⠀live⠀in⠀these⠀small⠀assessments—one⠀person⠀notices⠀exactly⠀what⠀another⠀did⠀not⠀say,⠀and⠀the⠀omission⠀becomes⠀the⠀event⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀reported⠀emotion.⠀Preserve⠀dialogue⠀separately;⠀no⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀talk⠀in⠀maxims.\n\nOmit⠀the⠀redundant⠀explanation⠀but⠀never⠀the⠀causality.⠀If⠀a⠀hurt⠀is⠀shown⠀by⠀an⠀action,⠀do⠀not⠀immediately⠀say⠀the⠀character⠀felt⠀hurt.⠀If⠀a⠀character's⠀thought⠀is⠀essential,⠀give⠀it⠀enough⠀length⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀spare.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀fact,⠀movement,⠀or⠀exchange⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀development⠀inferable.⠀Shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota;⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀stays⠀inside⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀until⠀a⠀perception,⠀remark,⠀or⠀memory⠀naturally⠀opens⠀a⠀transition.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀be⠀plain,⠀exact,⠀and⠀intellectually⠀mobile:⠀it⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀character's⠀sentence⠀to⠀what⠀that⠀sentence⠀is⠀really⠀designed⠀to⠀achieve,⠀then⠀back⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀physical⠀action.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀separate⠀levels⠀of⠀attention—dialogue,⠀recalled⠀fact,⠀private⠀reflection—without⠀announcing⠀each⠀shift.\n\nDevelop⠀romance⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀continuous⠀prose.⠀Attraction⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀particular⠀detail⠀noticed⠀more⠀than⠀once,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀is⠀followed⠀past⠀its⠀polite⠀answer,⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀care,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀disagreement⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀both⠀people⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀summarize⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀an⠀accomplished⠀fact;⠀instead⠀show⠀the⠀decisions⠀and⠀hesitations⠀that⠀constitute⠀it.⠀The⠀author's⠀irreverence⠀should⠀puncture⠀social⠀falsehood⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀interaction⠀adversarial:⠀candor⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀tenderness,⠀and⠀intellectual⠀precision⠀can⠀exist⠀inside⠀intimate⠀affection.\n\nKeep⠀inner⠀experience⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀authorized⠀perspective.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀access⠀a⠀character's⠀thoughts,⠀render⠀them⠀as⠀actual⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀sensation⠀flowing⠀from⠀the⠀scene.⠀Another⠀character⠀remains⠀opaque⠀except⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀observes.⠀Maintain⠀forward⠀movement⠀without⠀installing⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply:⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀conclude⠀with⠀an⠀unresolved⠀question⠀or⠀a⠀further⠀practical⠀step.⠀Contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀or⠀realism⠀as⠀world⠀physics.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀let⠀every⠀scene⠀choice⠀serve⠀it.⠀A⠀private⠀reference,⠀a⠀repeated⠀domestic⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀phrase⠀used⠀only⠀between⠀these⠀two⠀people,⠀or⠀a⠀callback⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment⠀carries⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀particular⠀to⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀use⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀premise⠀has⠀already⠀established.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀given⠀people.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀voice⠀inside⠀the⠀intimacy.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀puncture⠀the⠀other's⠀self-dramatizing⠀account,⠀notice⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀household⠀rule,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀sentimental⠀gesture⠀with⠀a⠀precise⠀correction—and⠀this⠀need⠀not⠀reduce⠀warmth.⠀Candor⠀and⠀affection⠀can⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀including⠀questions⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀couple⠀owes⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀a⠀past⠀promise⠀still⠀requires,⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀familiar⠀pattern⠀has⠀become⠀strained.⠀Humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀particular⠀characters,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀quippy⠀register⠀for⠀everyone.\n\nStructure⠀scenes⠀around⠀moments⠀of⠀return.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀early⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀reappears⠀with⠀new⠀weight;⠀a⠀small⠀detail⠀one⠀person⠀remembers⠀becomes⠀evidence⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀neglect;⠀a⠀recurring⠀disagreement⠀finally⠀changes⠀its⠀terms.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀consequence⠀or⠀a⠀modified⠀understanding⠀that⠀fulfills⠀the⠀scene's⠀promise⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Private⠀interiority⠀remains⠀available⠀only⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀and⠀a⠀callback⠀should⠀derive⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀an⠀inserted⠀genre⠀checklist.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate,⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀who⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀are⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀memory:⠀not⠀a⠀grand⠀epithet,⠀but⠀a⠀phrase⠀tied⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀act⠀or⠀habit.⠀Then⠀tell⠀the⠀current⠀episode⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀came⠀to⠀mean.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀without⠀ornament:⠀a⠀line⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀its⠀application.⠀The⠀account⠀should⠀feel⠀retold,⠀as⠀though⠀a⠀teller⠀has⠀chosen⠀these⠀details⠀because⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀pair's⠀remembered⠀history.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀voice⠀interrupt⠀or⠀correct⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀one⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀leaves⠀out⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀fact,⠀that⠀a⠀solemn⠀formula⠀misrepresents⠀a⠀practical⠀motive,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀community's⠀remembered⠀account⠀simplifies⠀a⠀private⠀decision.⠀This⠀candor⠀keeps⠀the⠀saga⠀from⠀becoming⠀hagiography.⠀The⠀romance⠀can⠀be⠀public⠀in⠀its⠀deeds⠀but⠀private⠀in⠀its⠀causes;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀pair⠀was⠀seen⠀to⠀do⠀from⠀why⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀did⠀it,⠀then⠀follow⠀that⠀why⠀past⠀the⠀accepted⠀answer.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale.⠀A⠀household⠀task,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀quarrel,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀piece⠀of⠀work⠀can⠀be⠀treated⠀as⠀consequential⠀without⠀becoming⠀mock⠀combat⠀or⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective;⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀narrate⠀hidden⠀thoughts⠀beyond⠀the⠀contract.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀concluded,⠀resumed,⠀or⠀left⠀open,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀final⠀recurrence⠀suggest⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀the⠀couple⠀legend.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀from⠀a⠀composed,⠀retrospective⠀intimate⠀narrator⠀who⠀was⠀directly⠀involved⠀in⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀they⠀knew⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀now.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀ordinary⠀location:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀workplace⠀task,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀queue.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀of⠀that⠀setting—the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀chair,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀ticket,⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀shift⠀ends,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀sticks—carry⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀as⠀decorative⠀backdrop.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀essayistic⠀route⠀as⠀a⠀method⠀of⠀revisiting,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀tone.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀a⠀particular⠀moment,⠀have⠀them⠀examine⠀why⠀it⠀persisted:⠀what⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀disproved,⠀what⠀it⠀left⠀unasked,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀altered⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀test⠀a⠀prior⠀assumption⠀against⠀the⠀concrete⠀record⠀of⠀the⠀scene—the⠀other⠀person⠀did⠀not⠀merely⠀seem⠀tired;⠀they⠀had⠀already⠀read⠀the⠀letter⠀now⠀lying⠀under⠀the⠀plate.⠀This⠀is⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀retrospective⠀work,⠀not⠀knowledge⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀shared⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀operate⠀through⠀that⠀retrospective⠀examination.⠀The⠀narrator⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer:⠀why⠀this⠀person⠀mattered,⠀what⠀the⠀arrangement⠀actually⠀owed,⠀why⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀expectation⠀was⠀obeyed.⠀When⠀an⠀institution⠀or⠀convention⠀becomes⠀absurd,⠀show⠀its⠀practical⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀couple—a⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀reprinted,⠀a⠀family⠀visit⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀performed,⠀a⠀work⠀schedule⠀that⠀decides⠀when⠀tenderness⠀is⠀possible—rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀to⠀lecture.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀voice⠀and⠀may⠀be⠀directed⠀at⠀their⠀own⠀earlier⠀solemnity⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀at⠀the⠀rule.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀small⠀observable⠀particulars:⠀who⠀remembered⠀a⠀preference,⠀who⠀noticed⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀mood,⠀who⠀initiated⠀contact⠀or⠀withdrew,⠀who⠀made⠀room⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀space.⠀Let⠀timing⠀and⠀obligations⠀create⠀friction⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath.⠀After⠀a⠀missed⠀bus,⠀a⠀work⠀commitment,⠀a⠀relative's⠀visit,⠀or⠀a⠀disagreement⠀about⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀to⠀others,⠀show⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀scene⠀registering⠀the⠀effect:⠀a⠀cup⠀washed⠀differently,⠀a⠀route⠀changed,⠀a⠀question⠀not⠀repeated.⠀Do⠀not⠀skip⠀to⠀reconciliation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀current⠀and⠀granular.⠀Name⠀the⠀specific⠀neighbors,⠀colleagues,⠀schedules,⠀prices,⠀and⠀weather⠀that⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀couple.⠀When⠀a⠀tradition⠀or⠀institutional⠀custom⠀appears,⠀keep⠀its⠀local⠀reality⠀distinct:⠀if⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀let⠀that⠀distinction⠀appear⠀in⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀holiday⠀practice,⠀a⠀housing⠀rule,⠀a⠀workplace⠀convention,⠀or⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀address.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀defaults,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀region⠀to⠀a⠀vague⠀Nordic⠀atmosphere.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀the⠀narrator's⠀later⠀understanding⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀private⠀mind.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀now⠀interpret⠀an⠀action⠀differently,⠀but⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀thought⠀or⠀felt⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀A⠀feeling⠀enters⠀the⠀relationship⠀only⠀through⠀action,⠀speech,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀together.⠀If⠀unspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀matters,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀understanding.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀retrospective⠀examination⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause:⠀a⠀memory⠀has⠀been⠀tested,⠀a⠀prior⠀assumption⠀has⠀shifted,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀tension⠀has⠀acquired⠀its⠀felt⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀romantic⠀payoff.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀scenes⠀in⠀screenplay⠀format:⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀readable⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀with⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀on⠀screen—actions,⠀objects,⠀glances,⠀pauses,⠀tone,⠀and⠀spoken⠀words.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀omniscient⠀commentary.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀matters,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀The⠀note⠀is⠀authoring⠀material⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀or⠀production,⠀not⠀dialogue.⠀Write⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀content⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀idiom,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀she⠀is⠀not⠀tired⠀but⠀unwilling⠀to⠀continue⠀the⠀conversation,⠀or⠀that⠀he⠀recognizes⠀the⠀coat⠀on⠀the⠀chair⠀and⠀decides⠀not⠀to⠀mention⠀it.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀content⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀externally⠀expressed.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀practical⠀social⠀friction.⠀Place⠀characters⠀in⠀concrete⠀situations⠀where⠀timing,⠀obligations,⠀or⠀competing⠀wants⠀collide:⠀a⠀work⠀deadline,⠀a⠀family⠀visit,⠀a⠀cancelled⠀plan,⠀a⠀financial⠀limit.⠀Show⠀attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀through⠀small⠀observable⠀choices:⠀who⠀offers⠀a⠀jacket,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀notices⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀who⠀changes⠀a⠀topic⠀to⠀protect⠀the⠀other.⠀Let⠀disagreements⠀arise⠀from⠀specific⠀pressures,⠀not⠀generic⠀bickering.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀mode⠀of⠀inquiry⠀as⠀visible⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀asks⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀that⠀punctures⠀a⠀social⠀pretense;⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀convention⠀is⠀shown⠀to⠀be⠀absurd⠀when⠀it⠀produces⠀an⠀inconvenient⠀or⠀ridiculous⠀outcome.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀characters:⠀one⠀may⠀be⠀blunt,⠀another⠀evasive,⠀another⠀wry.⠀Keep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀argumentative⠀and⠀nimble—characters⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀politeness—without⠀making⠀every⠀line⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀juxtapose⠀two⠀characters'⠀separate⠀arrangements;⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀interrupt⠀an⠀intimate⠀pause;⠀a⠀voice-over⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀character's⠀earlier⠀stated⠀intention.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands;⠀instead,⠀describe⠀what⠀is⠀visibly⠀happening⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀implies⠀the⠀visual.\n\nLet⠀aftermath⠀register⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀ordinary⠀scene.⠀After⠀a⠀conflict,⠀show⠀someone⠀leaving⠀early,⠀cooking⠀differently,⠀returning⠀an⠀item,⠀or⠀sitting⠀down⠀without⠀speaking.⠀The⠀consequence⠀remains⠀visible⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.⠀Preserve⠀distinct⠀character⠀agency:⠀each⠀person⠀initiates,⠀refuses,⠀helps,⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀the⠀reward⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀growth.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀legible,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀a⠀disclosure,⠀a⠀changed⠀habit,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀tension.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀emotional⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀romantic⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀performed⠀on⠀a⠀stage.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀Because⠀speech⠀is⠀the⠀primary⠀public⠀medium,⠀private⠀feeling⠀must⠀be⠀converted⠀into⠀staged⠀evidence:⠀who⠀stands⠀close,⠀who⠀turns⠀away,⠀who⠀touches⠀a⠀shared⠀object,⠀who⠀adjusts⠀a⠀chair⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀who⠀stays⠀silent⠀when⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀asked.\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀a⠀proposed⠀feeling⠀testable.⠀An⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀whether⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀present⠀when⠀another⠀speaks,⠀whether⠀a⠀message⠀is⠀passed,⠀whether⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀ignored.⠀Keep⠀the⠀couple⠀occupied⠀with⠀practical⠀work—preparing⠀a⠀meal,⠀sorting⠀documents,⠀moving⠀furniture—rather⠀than⠀posed⠀around⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀matters⠀and⠀no⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀authorized,⠀preserve⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀Write⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀content⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀idiom,⠀clearly⠀marked⠀as⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀and⠀not⠀performed⠀as⠀speech.⠀This⠀material⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀or⠀production,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀If⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀separately⠀authorized,⠀use⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀clearly⠀indicate⠀when⠀an⠀aside⠀is⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀others.\n\nDevelop⠀romance⠀through⠀practical⠀social⠀friction.⠀Place⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀institutional⠀setting:⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀waiting⠀room.⠀Use⠀props⠀that⠀carry⠀obligation—a⠀kettle,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀phone,⠀a⠀gift.⠀Timing⠀and⠀competing⠀wants⠀create⠀complications:⠀one⠀character⠀must⠀leave⠀for⠀work⠀before⠀the⠀other⠀can⠀finish⠀a⠀sentence;⠀a⠀visitor⠀interrupts⠀an⠀intimate⠀pause;⠀a⠀shared⠀schedule⠀forces⠀a⠀choice.⠀Show⠀trust⠀and⠀vulnerability⠀through⠀simple⠀actions:⠀one⠀character⠀lets⠀the⠀other⠀handle⠀a⠀fragile⠀object,⠀one⠀waits⠀for⠀an⠀answer⠀instead⠀of⠀pressing,⠀one⠀confesses⠀a⠀small⠀fault⠀while⠀doing⠀a⠀chore.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀mode⠀of⠀inquiry⠀as⠀dialogue⠀and⠀staging.⠀A⠀character⠀asks⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀that⠀punctures⠀a⠀social⠀pretense.⠀A⠀rule⠀or⠀institutional⠀convention⠀becomes⠀absurd⠀through⠀its⠀physical⠀effect:⠀too⠀many⠀chairs,⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀filled⠀before⠀emotional⠀matters.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀characters,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀dialogue⠀argumentative⠀and⠀nimble;⠀characters⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀polite⠀limits⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀line⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.\n\nLet⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀create⠀aftermath.⠀When⠀one⠀character⠀leaves⠀after⠀an⠀unresolved⠀disagreement,⠀the⠀remaining⠀characters'⠀physical⠀response—sitting⠀down,⠀picking⠀up⠀a⠀letter,⠀moving⠀to⠀the⠀window—registers⠀the⠀effect.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀arrangement⠀of⠀objects⠀to⠀signal⠀that⠀time⠀has⠀passed.⠀Preserve⠀character⠀agency:⠀each⠀person⠀initiates,⠀refuses,⠀helps,⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀the⠀reward⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀growth.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀current⠀state⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀legible,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀a⠀small⠀change,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀tension,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀final⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀the⠀immediate,⠀flowing⠀perspective⠀of⠀a⠀single⠀authorized⠀mind⠀involved⠀in⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀associatively⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀linear⠀report:⠀current⠀perception⠀triggers⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀memory⠀triggers⠀a⠀private⠀word⠀or⠀phrase,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀pulls⠀toward⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀an⠀interruption⠀shifts⠀the⠀thought.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀to⠀follow⠀those⠀shifts,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀that⠀events⠀remain⠀distinguishable⠀from⠀recollections⠀or⠀fantasies.\n\nBraid⠀the⠀genre⠀through⠀this⠀mental⠀movement.⠀Attention,⠀memory,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀care,⠀and⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀lived⠀experience⠀inside⠀the⠀mind:⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀remembered⠀exact⠀words⠀from⠀an⠀argument,⠀the⠀sudden⠀awareness⠀of⠀a⠀deadline,⠀the⠀private⠀decision⠀to⠀tell⠀or⠀not⠀tell.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀relationship⠀persists⠀across⠀time⠀by⠀letting⠀past⠀moments⠀resurface⠀under⠀present⠀triggers.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀summary;⠀render⠀the⠀particular⠀thoughts⠀and⠀sensations⠀that⠀compose⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀mode⠀of⠀inquiry⠀inside⠀the⠀flow.⠀As⠀the⠀mind⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer,⠀let⠀it⠀land⠀on⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule:⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀signed⠀before⠀a⠀visit,⠀an⠀institution's⠀demand⠀that⠀interrupts⠀a⠀private⠀moment,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀met.⠀The⠀tone⠀may⠀be⠀candid⠀and⠀blackly⠀humorous,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀owned⠀by⠀this⠀particular⠀focal⠀mind,⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀intellectual⠀independence.⠀Avoid⠀generic⠀cynicism⠀or⠀uniform⠀jokes.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀and⠀spoken⠀material⠀distinct⠀within⠀the⠀flow.⠀The⠀stream⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience,⠀so⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀using⠀the⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀wrapper⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.⠀If⠀someone⠀speaks,⠀mark⠀the⠀speech⠀as⠀external⠀and⠀present.⠀The⠀stream⠀may⠀include⠀recollected⠀dialogue⠀as⠀an⠀internal⠀echo,⠀but⠀make⠀clear⠀whose⠀words⠀are⠀being⠀remembered.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀reflect⠀on⠀what⠀someone⠀else⠀said⠀without⠀granting⠀knowledge⠀of⠀that⠀other⠀person's⠀private⠀mind,⠀unless⠀such⠀access⠀is⠀authorized⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration⠀rest⠀on⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀details:⠀a⠀kettle,⠀a⠀bus⠀ticket,⠀a⠀cracked⠀cup,⠀a⠀shared⠀shelf.⠀These⠀details⠀anchor⠀the⠀associations⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀style⠀its⠀material⠀ground.⠀A⠀recurring⠀detail—a⠀particular⠀meal,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀room—can⠀become⠀a⠀node⠀that⠀gathers⠀new⠀significance⠀as⠀the⠀relationship⠀changes,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀association⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀object.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀flow⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀caesura:⠀a⠀momentary⠀quiet⠀in⠀the⠀mind,⠀a⠀physical⠀pause,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀question⠀settled⠀into⠀its⠀felt⠀weight.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀scene⠀unfinished;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀resolution.⠀The⠀stream⠀should⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀clinical⠀case⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀primarily⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀exchange⠀of⠀sender-attributed⠀messages,⠀with⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shaping⠀their⠀contribution.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀brief⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀reply⠀can⠀signal⠀hesitation;⠀an⠀edited⠀message⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀second⠀thought;⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀without⠀a⠀response⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀specific⠀event⠀with⠀consequences.\n\nDistinguish⠀sharply⠀between⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀exchange⠀and⠀can⠀be⠀acted⠀upon.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact:⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀draft⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀that⠀artifact,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transmitted⠀exchange,⠀without⠀treating⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀transmitted⠀text⠀and⠀must⠀be⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Write⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀content⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀idiom⠀as⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀she⠀is⠀not⠀angry⠀but⠀unwilling⠀to⠀answer⠀yet,⠀or⠀that⠀he⠀recognizes⠀the⠀delay⠀and⠀decides⠀to⠀wait.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀see⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀unless⠀a⠀platform⠀action⠀or⠀later⠀message⠀makes⠀it⠀available.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀chooses⠀to⠀send,⠀omit,⠀delay,⠀or⠀edit.⠀Subtle⠀digital⠀cues⠀carry⠀emotional⠀weight:⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀arrives⠀too⠀quickly⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀silence,⠀a⠀switch⠀from⠀formal⠀to⠀informal⠀address,⠀a⠀repeated⠀typo⠀left⠀uncorrected,⠀a⠀photo⠀sent⠀with⠀a⠀caption⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀mood.⠀Let⠀attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀the⠀exchange—who⠀initiates,⠀who⠀ends⠀threads,⠀who⠀asks⠀a⠀follow-up⠀question,⠀who⠀shares⠀a⠀small⠀frustration.⠀Do⠀not⠀rely⠀on⠀physical⠀description;⠀instead,⠀use⠀text⠀tone,⠀timing,⠀and⠀content.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀mode⠀of⠀inquiry⠀through⠀individual⠀texting⠀voices.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀that⠀punctures⠀a⠀social⠀pretense⠀or⠀exposes⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule:⠀why⠀must⠀the⠀form⠀be⠀printed⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀already⠀filed⠀online?⠀Another⠀may⠀use⠀dry,⠀precise⠀humor.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀remain⠀owned⠀by⠀particular⠀voices,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone⠀across⠀all⠀senders.⠀Keep⠀the⠀messages⠀argumentative⠀and⠀nimble⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀warrants⠀it,⠀but⠀avoid⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀witty.\n\nLet⠀interface⠀events⠀create⠀practical⠀complications.⠀A⠀failed⠀send,⠀a⠀wrong⠀attachment,⠀a⠀scheduled⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀at⠀an⠀awkward⠀time,⠀or⠀a⠀group⠀chat⠀accidentally⠀used⠀can⠀create⠀friction⠀with⠀meaningful⠀aftermath.⠀Use⠀these⠀events⠀sparingly⠀and⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀advance⠀the⠀relationship;⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀glitch⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀event,⠀show⠀the⠀next⠀messages⠀registering⠀the⠀effect:⠀an⠀apology⠀sent⠀hours⠀later,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀subject,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀unanswered.\n\nMaintain⠀character⠀agency.⠀Each⠀person⠀initiates,⠀delays,⠀refuses,⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀one⠀character⠀the⠀reward⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀growth.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀mid-thread⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀note;⠀a⠀request⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀and⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀span⠀turns.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀message.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀visual-novel⠀rhythm:⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀that⠀fits⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Begin⠀each⠀significant⠀beat⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀or⠀a⠀notable⠀background⠀cue—a⠀shifted⠀chair,⠀a⠀half-finished⠀cup,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀Use⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀scenes⠀where⠀expressions⠀and⠀arrangements⠀are⠀interpreted⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character.⠀A⠀smile⠀can⠀attract⠀hope⠀or⠀unease;⠀a⠀turned⠀back⠀can⠀read⠀as⠀coldness⠀or⠀fatigue.⠀When⠀a⠀feeling⠀or⠀claim⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀test⠀it⠀against⠀the⠀concrete⠀arrangement:⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀says⠀they⠀could⠀not⠀visit,⠀but⠀their⠀coat⠀is⠀on⠀the⠀chair;⠀a⠀promised⠀call⠀does⠀not⠀arrive,⠀but⠀the⠀phone⠀shows⠀a⠀recent⠀outgoing⠀call⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀The⠀focal⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀these⠀mismatches⠀and⠀follow⠀the⠀question⠀rationally,⠀but⠀the⠀conclusion⠀remains⠀private⠀unless⠀spoken⠀or⠀acted⠀upon.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀mode⠀of⠀inquiry⠀inside⠀dialogue⠀and⠀focal⠀thought.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀ask⠀direct,⠀precise⠀questions⠀that⠀puncture⠀social⠀pretense.⠀Expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀expectation⠀through⠀concrete⠀details:⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀household⠀chore,⠀a⠀family⠀demand.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀characters,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀argumentative⠀and⠀nimble;⠀characters⠀may⠀challenge⠀each⠀other's⠀premises⠀for⠀actual⠀reasons,⠀not⠀performative⠀wit.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Use⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀a⠀clearly⠀marked⠀inner⠀response⠀to⠀render⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀Write⠀the⠀actual⠀private⠀content⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀idiom,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀focal⠀note⠀that⠀she⠀is⠀not⠀tired⠀but⠀unwilling⠀to⠀continue,⠀or⠀that⠀he⠀recognizes⠀the⠀coat⠀and⠀decides⠀not⠀to⠀mention⠀it.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀content⠀unless⠀it⠀is⠀externally⠀expressed.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀multiple⠀minds⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it;⠀if⠀not,⠀keep⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀single⠀and⠀consistent.\n\nLet⠀scene⠀changes⠀be⠀legible.⠀A⠀new⠀scene⠀begins⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀location⠀and⠀any⠀relevant⠀visual⠀anchor;⠀an⠀object⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene⠀may⠀reappear⠀with⠀changed⠀significance.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀visual⠀novel;⠀these⠀require⠀separate⠀authorization.⠀If⠀a⠀choice-like⠀moment⠀appears,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀character⠀decision⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀menu.\n\nLet⠀aftermath⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀scene's⠀arrangement—someone⠀has⠀moved⠀a⠀cup,⠀cleared⠀a⠀table,⠀left⠀a⠀note.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀composed⠀image⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀registers⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀romantic⠀resolution;⠀the⠀relationship⠀can⠀remain⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPamazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀continuing⠀romance⠀story,⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀the⠀start,⠀briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀from⠀earlier⠀installments:⠀the⠀promise⠀someone⠀made,⠀the⠀object⠀left⠀behind,⠀the⠀question⠀left⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history;⠀bring⠀back⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀understood.\n\nUse⠀serial⠀duration⠀to⠀develop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀small,⠀exact⠀observations⠀that⠀recur.⠀A⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀again—a⠀cracked⠀mug,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀work⠀schedule,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀uses—and⠀the⠀recurrence⠀reveals⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀attention⠀or⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀an⠀earlier⠀event⠀acquire⠀new⠀significance:⠀what⠀seemed⠀like⠀a⠀casual⠀comment⠀is⠀shown,⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀disclosure⠀or⠀action,⠀to⠀have⠀been⠀a⠀deliberate⠀choice.⠀Do⠀not⠀alter⠀an⠀established⠀fact⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀a⠀twist;⠀instead,⠀show⠀how⠀new⠀information⠀qualifies⠀an⠀old⠀interpretation.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀mode⠀of⠀inquiry⠀as⠀a⠀serial⠀through-line.⠀The⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀follows⠀a⠀question⠀beyond⠀its⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer⠀across⠀installments:⠀why⠀must⠀the⠀housing⠀form⠀be⠀printed⠀when⠀the⠀office⠀already⠀has⠀the⠀digital⠀copy?⠀Why⠀does⠀the⠀family⠀expect⠀this⠀visit⠀every⠀month?⠀Let⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀institution⠀recur⠀with⠀different⠀consequences—a⠀queue,⠀a⠀deadline,⠀a⠀social⠀obligation.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀remain⠀owned⠀by⠀particular⠀voices,⠀not⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀argumentative⠀but⠀not⠀uniformly⠀witty.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀romance.⠀Work,⠀chores,⠀errands,⠀and⠀other⠀relationships⠀occupy⠀time⠀and⠀create⠀friction:⠀a⠀shift⠀change⠀prevents⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀request⠀interrupts⠀a⠀private⠀talk,⠀a⠀financial⠀concern⠀changes⠀a⠀plan.⠀Show⠀the⠀couple's⠀practical⠀negotiation⠀through⠀actions:⠀who⠀makes⠀tea,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀covers⠀a⠀task.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀installment⠀center⠀on⠀a⠀romantic⠀crisis;⠀allow⠀intervals⠀of⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀life.\n\nLet⠀progress⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀earned⠀when⠀it⠀occurs.⠀A⠀relationship⠀may⠀advance⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀disclosure,⠀an⠀adjusted⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀together,⠀but⠀the⠀change⠀can⠀be⠀quiet⠀and⠀can⠀span⠀multiple⠀installments.⠀A⠀request⠀can⠀remain⠀unanswered⠀and⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀span⠀turns.⠀End⠀an⠀installment⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀its⠀local⠀change⠀legible:⠀a⠀question⠀has⠀been⠀asked,⠀an⠀arrangement⠀has⠀shifted,⠀a⠀small⠀care⠀has⠀been⠀shown,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀tension⠀has⠀been⠀left⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reunion,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.\n\nPreserve⠀character⠀agency⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Each⠀person⠀initiates,⠀refuses,⠀helps,⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀for⠀their⠀own⠀reasons.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀one⠀character⠀the⠀reward⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀growth.⠀If⠀an⠀internal⠀experience⠀matters,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀presentation;⠀the⠀serial⠀format⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀grant⠀omniscient⠀access.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀brief⠀sensory⠀anchors⠀that⠀acquire⠀private⠀weight:⠀a⠀sleeve⠀pulled⠀back,⠀a⠀half-finished⠀glass,⠀a⠀window⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀particular⠀texture⠀the⠀narrator⠀avoids⠀touching.⠀Let⠀each⠀recurrence⠀mean⠀more⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀the⠀interval.⠀Do⠀not⠀catalogue⠀every⠀hurt;⠀choose⠀the⠀physical⠀detail⠀that⠀concentrates⠀the⠀feeling⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀on⠀while⠀the⠀emotion⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀romantic⠀strain⠀enters⠀dialogue,⠀make⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange⠀carry⠀interruption,⠀hesitation,⠀apology,⠀accusation,⠀or⠀avoidance.⠀Have⠀the⠀wording⠀reflect⠀the⠀cost⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀the⠀narrator⠀tedious:⠀a⠀sentence⠀may⠀break⠀off,⠀a⠀question⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀too⠀quietly,⠀a⠀kind⠀remark⠀may⠀arrive⠀after⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀wounds⠀the⠀hearer.⠀Let⠀it⠀be⠀clear⠀why⠀a⠀particular⠀vulnerability⠀is⠀difficult⠀for⠀this⠀lover.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reader⠀aware⠀of⠀the⠀unspoken⠀content⠀through⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀thought,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀connection⠀between⠀every⠀detail⠀and⠀every⠀feeling.\n\nAllow⠀comfort⠀to⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward⠀when⠀it⠀appears.⠀A⠀gesture,⠀an⠀admission,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀silence⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀existing⠀hurt.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀warmth⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀two⠀people,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀sit⠀next⠀to⠀pain⠀without⠀erasing⠀it.⠀The⠀outcome⠀remains⠀contingent⠀on⠀the⠀scene;⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀relationship⠀fail⠀or⠀to⠀engineer⠀a⠀final⠀reconciliation.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀own⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀anguish.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀room⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀story:⠀enough⠀immediate⠀setting⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀selected⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀belong⠀only⠀to⠀this⠀couple's⠀history.⠀A⠀remembered⠀object,⠀a⠀habit,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀routine⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀current⠀interaction⠀feel⠀connected⠀to⠀earlier⠀turns⠀without⠀a⠀long⠀flashback.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀person⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀settings;⠀if⠀a⠀participant⠀owns⠀a⠀character,⠀do⠀not⠀give⠀their⠀character⠀thoughts⠀they⠀have⠀not⠀authorized.\n\nAttribute⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀clearly.⠀Use⠀a⠀short⠀action⠀or⠀reaction⠀beat⠀before,⠀between,⠀or⠀after⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀romantic⠀exchange⠀lands,⠀but⠀don't⠀let⠀description⠀displace⠀the⠀conversation.⠀When⠀one⠀character⠀risks⠀an⠀admission⠀or⠀withholds⠀something,⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀notice⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀own⠀observations⠀and⠀knowledge⠀permit.⠀A⠀hesitation⠀can⠀be⠀written⠀as⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀turned⠀face,⠀a⠀misdirected⠀question,⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀unfilled⠀silence.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀new⠀feeling⠀or⠀acknowledgment.⠀That⠀may⠀be⠀mid-conversation,⠀after⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀while⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀still⠀deciding⠀how⠀to⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀menu-style⠀decision.⠀The⠀next⠀player⠀can⠀continue⠀from⠀the⠀live⠀situation:⠀a⠀hand⠀not⠀yet⠀taken,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀air,⠀a⠀door⠀still⠀open,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀comfort⠀that⠀may⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀accepted.⠀Keep⠀the⠀continuation⠀natural⠀to⠀the⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀recurring⠀details⠀accumulate⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀explain⠀their⠀full⠀history⠀every⠀time.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route⠀for⠀this⠀combination.⠀Place⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀customs,⠀residences,⠀work,⠀meals,⠀and⠀family⠀rhythms.⠀Let⠀courtship⠀or⠀attachment⠀unfold⠀through⠀practical⠀visits,⠀shared⠀tasks,⠀public⠀propriety,⠀and⠀private⠀understatement.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀generic⠀Chinese⠀setting⠀onto⠀the⠀story;⠀draw⠀only⠀on⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀facts⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀language⠀and⠀period⠀distinct.\n\nRender⠀feeling⠀through⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀method:⠀a⠀particular⠀street⠀sound,⠀an⠀item⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀sudden⠀quiet⠀in⠀the⠀house,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀sleeve⠀or⠀collar⠀repeats⠀a⠀memory.⠀Let⠀those⠀brief⠀details⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀cannot⠀say⠀openly,⠀especially⠀when⠀family⠀observation⠀or⠀social⠀expectation⠀limits⠀speech.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀show⠀longing,⠀disappointment,⠀or⠀growing⠀trust⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.\n\nGive⠀the⠀romance⠀room⠀for⠀timing⠀and⠀obligation.⠀A⠀delayed⠀meeting,⠀an⠀arranged⠀introduction,⠀a⠀family⠀duty,⠀or⠀an⠀uncertain⠀response⠀can⠀create⠀friction⠀and⠀aftereffects.⠀Make⠀each⠀character's⠀decision⠀about⠀belonging⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀generic:⠀what⠀they⠀risk,⠀what⠀they⠀postpone,⠀or⠀what⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀they⠀accept.⠀Allow⠀attraction⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀accumulated⠀proximity⠀and⠀attention,⠀not⠀through⠀universal⠀flirtation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀social⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀intimate⠀romance⠀into⠀a⠀full⠀social⠀panorama.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀short,⠀forceful⠀sentences⠀and⠀concrete⠀transitions⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀romance.⠀Pick⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀shows⠀physical⠀reality:⠀a⠀cracked⠀basin,⠀a⠀coat⠀too⠀thin⠀for⠀the⠀weather,⠀a⠀bruise⠀on⠀a⠀wrist,⠀a⠀stair⠀that⠀groans⠀under⠀someone⠀waiting,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀closed⠀room.⠀Let⠀the⠀detail⠀stand⠀for⠀more⠀without⠀a⠀soft⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀each⠀image⠀hard⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀feels⠀the⠀surface⠀before⠀the⠀emotion.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀lovers⠀speak,⠀let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀be⠀blunt⠀but⠀particular⠀to⠀them.⠀Pressure⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀admission⠀arrive⠀in⠀clipped⠀words⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀offer⠀that⠀means⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀says.⠀Show⠀strain⠀through⠀repeated⠀physical⠀actions:⠀a⠀hand⠀opening⠀and⠀closing,⠀a⠀meal⠀left⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀walk⠀retraced.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀reason⠀through⠀something⠀difficult,⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀stretch⠀of⠀thought,⠀but⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀place⠀instead⠀of⠀drifting⠀into⠀generalized⠀reflection.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relationship's⠀material⠀stakes⠀present⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀a⠀crime⠀or⠀disaster⠀story.⠀The⠀uncertainty⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀divided⠀by⠀work⠀or⠀family,⠀a⠀secret⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀shared⠀space⠀feels⠀like,⠀a⠀choice⠀about⠀leaving.⠀Let⠀each⠀turn⠀affect⠀the⠀next⠀meeting⠀or⠀conversation.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀exist,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀specific⠀physical⠀care:⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat,⠀a⠀doorway⠀blocked⠀from⠀wind,⠀a⠀cup⠀held⠀until⠀it⠀cools.⠀Do⠀not⠀inflate⠀every⠀pause⠀into⠀danger;⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀compressed⠀pressure,⠀not⠀mandatory⠀catastrophe.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀authored⠀documents.⠀Each⠀entry⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀composition.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀mechanically⠀through⠀every⠀possible⠀form;⠀choose⠀the⠀document⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀calls⠀for:⠀a⠀reply,⠀an⠀unsent⠀letter,⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀with⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry⠀after⠀a⠀visit,⠀a⠀brief⠀household⠀record.⠀Let⠀gaps⠀between⠀entries⠀and⠀the⠀material⠀signs⠀of⠀delay,⠀revision,⠀or⠀delivery⠀convey⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀words⠀themselves.\n\nIn⠀each⠀document,⠀use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀method.⠀Have⠀the⠀writer⠀record⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀fix⠀the⠀moment:⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀ink⠀ran,⠀a⠀damp⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀particular⠀window,⠀a⠀sound⠀overheard⠀while⠀writing.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀the⠀writer⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀What⠀is⠀omitted⠀should⠀be⠀as⠀legible⠀as⠀what⠀is⠀included:⠀a⠀name⠀not⠀used,⠀a⠀question⠀not⠀answered,⠀an⠀apology⠀crossed⠀out,⠀a⠀memory⠀reduced⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀image.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀romance⠀particular.⠀Show⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀chooses⠀to⠀mention⠀to⠀this⠀recipient.⠀A⠀formal⠀letter⠀may⠀hide⠀more;⠀a⠀private⠀memo⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀mistaken⠀assumption.⠀Conflicting⠀accounts⠀can⠀show⠀how⠀two⠀people⠀understood⠀the⠀same⠀meeting⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀after⠀each⠀record;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀correct,⠀complete,⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀previous⠀one.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀writer's⠀reason⠀for⠀composing,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relationship's⠀outcome⠀unfold⠀through⠀the⠀documents⠀rather⠀than⠀outside⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀moments⠀of⠀chosen⠀care⠀and⠀familiar⠀preference.⠀Use⠀a⠀few⠀precise⠀sensory⠀details⠀for⠀each⠀passage:⠀a⠀drink⠀made⠀just⠀as⠀they⠀like⠀it,⠀a⠀cushion⠀placed⠀where⠀they⠀sit,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀the⠀roof⠀while⠀they⠀share⠀late⠀food,⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀a⠀sleeve⠀is⠀smoothed.⠀Let⠀the⠀warmth⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀praise⠀or⠀reassurance.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene⠀active⠀with⠀conversation⠀and⠀small⠀movement,⠀not⠀a⠀static⠀list⠀of⠀nice⠀things.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀show⠀love⠀by⠀remembering⠀a⠀preference,⠀adjusting⠀a⠀routine,⠀or⠀waiting⠀a⠀little⠀longer⠀without⠀naming⠀the⠀feeling.⠀If⠀a⠀comfortable⠀silence⠀falls,⠀let⠀it⠀belong⠀to⠀these⠀two⠀people.⠀Preserve⠀personality:⠀one⠀may⠀fuss⠀over⠀food,⠀another⠀may⠀prefer⠀to⠀sit⠀close⠀without⠀speaking,⠀another⠀may⠀joke⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀only⠀the⠀other⠀understands.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀strip⠀away⠀established⠀friction⠀from⠀the⠀world.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relationship's⠀shape⠀clear.⠀Use⠀attention⠀and⠀proximity⠀to⠀develop⠀trust,⠀and⠀let⠀mild⠀disagreement⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀annoyance⠀pass⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀crisis.⠀When⠀a⠀larger⠀problem⠀exists⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀allow⠀the⠀comfort⠀to⠀be⠀genuine⠀but⠀partial:⠀a⠀warm⠀room⠀doesn't⠀erase⠀a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀a⠀family⠀concern,⠀or⠀a⠀lingering⠀uncertainty.⠀The⠀style⠀provides⠀room⠀to⠀enjoy⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀small⠀pleasures,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀every⠀scene⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀cozy⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀composed,⠀deliberate⠀paragraphs.⠀Let⠀longer⠀narrative⠀passages⠀set⠀the⠀social⠀frame:⠀a⠀family⠀gathering,⠀a⠀shared⠀workplace,⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀custom,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀change,⠀a⠀public⠀occasion⠀that⠀brings⠀the⠀lovers⠀together⠀or⠀forces⠀them⠀apart.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀language⠀from⠀everyday⠀speech;⠀the⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀formal⠀without⠀becoming⠀archaic⠀or⠀aristocratic,⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀facts⠀rather⠀than⠀imported⠀assumptions.\n\nInside⠀that⠀frame,⠀use⠀Kawabata's⠀brief⠀sensory⠀method⠀for⠀private⠀moments.⠀A⠀touch⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀as⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀remembered⠀meeting⠀as⠀one⠀image⠀recalled⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀paragraph,⠀a⠀long-anticipated⠀conversation⠀as⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀with⠀particular⠀light.⠀Let⠀these⠀compressed⠀impressions⠀carry⠀the⠀feelings⠀that⠀the⠀formal⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀spell⠀out.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀select⠀detail⠀across⠀scenes⠀so⠀it⠀accumulates⠀meaning⠀through⠀changed⠀circumstances.\n\nShow⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀timing,⠀obligation,⠀and⠀social⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀can⠀observe⠀them.⠀A⠀delayed⠀visit,⠀a⠀public⠀courtesy⠀that⠀conceals⠀private⠀uncertainty,⠀a⠀family⠀duty⠀that⠀limits⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀rumor⠀that⠀affects⠀reputation—these⠀can⠀create⠀real⠀complications⠀and⠀aftereffects.⠀Keep⠀the⠀lovers⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀universal.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀or⠀interpret,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀social⠀commentary⠀replace⠀the⠀actual⠀romantic⠀development.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀others⠀know,⠀and⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narration's⠀permitted⠀access.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀telling:⠀two⠀people⠀alone⠀after⠀a⠀shared⠀event,⠀on⠀a⠀night⠀neither⠀wants⠀to⠀end,⠀or⠀beside⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀has⠀stalled.⠀One⠀of⠀them⠀offers⠀a⠀story,⠀and⠀the⠀offering⠀is⠀the⠀romance's⠀present⠀tense.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀purpose⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀not⠀name—to⠀stay⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀to⠀be⠀understood,⠀to⠀delay⠀a⠀parting—and⠀let⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀carry⠀the⠀outer⠀scene:⠀the⠀interruptions,⠀the⠀posture⠀that⠀changes,⠀the⠀cup⠀refilled⠀or⠀not,⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀questions⠀stop.\n\nCompress⠀every⠀embedded⠀account⠀through⠀a⠀selective⠀eye.⠀Build⠀the⠀tale⠀from⠀a⠀few⠀chosen⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀chronicle—one⠀or⠀two⠀images⠀that⠀outlast⠀it,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀bird⠀turning⠀above⠀a⠀station⠀at⠀dusk,⠀rain⠀smell⠀in⠀a⠀wool⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀near⠀a⠀table's⠀edge.⠀The⠀teller⠀leaves⠀out⠀an⠀explanation,⠀an⠀apology,⠀or⠀a⠀name,⠀and⠀the⠀omission⠀is⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀come⠀back⠀to⠀an⠀image⠀later,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀puzzle⠀to⠀solve⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀move⠀closer⠀or⠀ask⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀expect.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible.⠀Mark⠀each⠀passage⠀between⠀tale⠀and⠀room⠀with⠀a⠀simple⠀physical⠀anchor—the⠀kettle,⠀the⠀lamp,⠀the⠀listener's⠀breath—and⠀let⠀recurrence⠀do⠀the⠀delayed⠀work:⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀past⠀resurfaces⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀recognition⠀of⠀it⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀reads.⠀A⠀question⠀can⠀be⠀answered⠀only⠀partially⠀before⠀the⠀telling⠀continues.⠀The⠀tale⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀confession;⠀the⠀romance⠀advances⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀say⠀sideways⠀and⠀can⠀receive⠀it⠀that⠀way.\n\nAcross⠀the⠀hearing,⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀stop⠀being⠀an⠀audience—contradicting⠀an⠀assumed⠀ending,⠀correcting⠀a⠀small⠀fact⠀that⠀shows⠀how⠀closely⠀they⠀have⠀listened,⠀resting⠀a⠀hand⠀over⠀the⠀teller's—when⠀the⠀particular⠀characters⠀give⠀that⠀moment.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀at⠀its⠀edge,⠀or⠀back⠀in⠀the⠀room;⠀wherever⠀it⠀stops,⠀keep⠀both⠀levels⠀and⠀the⠀two⠀people's⠀current⠀closeness⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀courts,⠀djinn,⠀bargains,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀nested⠀accounts:⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀is⠀emotional,⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀persuades⠀or⠀delays⠀rather⠀than⠀steering⠀the⠀listener⠀toward⠀a⠀predetermined⠀result.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀contemporary⠀intimate⠀German-language⠀fiction:⠀continuous⠀limited⠀narration,⠀first⠀or⠀third⠀person,⠀moving⠀through⠀workplaces,⠀rented⠀rooms,⠀trams,⠀and⠀family⠀kitchens.⠀Keep⠀the⠀syntax⠀plain⠀and⠀give⠀each⠀sentence⠀one⠀exact⠀observation.⠀Feeling⠀resides⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀narration⠀stays⠀there,⠀not⠀in⠀declared⠀introspection.⠀Treat⠀concrete⠀times,⠀addresses,⠀and⠀obligations⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀realism⠀rather⠀than⠀decoration—a⠀shift⠀beginning⠀at⠀six,⠀a⠀connection⠀missed⠀by⠀four⠀minutes—so⠀that⠀precision⠀becomes⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀prose⠀attends⠀to⠀the⠀life.\n\nGive⠀the⠀relationship⠀a⠀carrier⠀object⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀life:⠀residue⠀in⠀a⠀cup⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀left,⠀a⠀tram⠀ticket⠀folded⠀in⠀a⠀coat⠀pocket,⠀the⠀corrected⠀line⠀of⠀a⠀contract⠀read⠀together⠀once.⠀Return⠀to⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀emotional⠀pressure⠀changes,⠀and⠀never⠀state⠀what⠀it⠀means;⠀the⠀characters'⠀continued⠀attention⠀is⠀the⠀meaning.\n\nLet⠀practical⠀constraints⠀shape⠀timing⠀and⠀distance⠀by⠀entering⠀private⠀reasoning.⠀Work⠀shifts,⠀parental⠀expectations,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀dinner,⠀the⠀last⠀train⠀home⠀become⠀material⠀for⠀deliberation:⠀a⠀character⠀weighs⠀speaking⠀while⠀drying⠀a⠀dish⠀and⠀sets⠀it⠀aside⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀turns⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀phone,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀follows⠀the⠀weighing⠀through⠀the⠀immediate⠀sensory⠀field⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀hesitation.⠀Choosing⠀not⠀to⠀speak⠀is⠀as⠀available⠀as⠀choosing⠀to⠀speak.\n\nBuild⠀trust⠀through⠀small⠀disclosures⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀registers.⠀An⠀offhand⠀mention⠀of⠀a⠀failed⠀exam⠀or⠀a⠀parent's⠀illness⠀is⠀remembered⠀two⠀days⠀later⠀as⠀the⠀right⠀bread⠀bought⠀without⠀comment.⠀Not⠀every⠀disclosure⠀is⠀a⠀turning⠀point.⠀Attraction⠀grows⠀through⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀retains⠀a⠀colleague's⠀name,⠀the⠀hour⠀of⠀a⠀recurring⠀headache,⠀why⠀one⠀song⠀is⠀hard⠀to⠀hear.⠀Perception⠀of⠀the⠀other's⠀body⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀room—a⠀wrist,⠀the⠀creak⠀of⠀a⠀chair—can⠀stand⠀without⠀declaration;⠀take⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀per⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀stand.⠀Anger,⠀embarrassment,⠀sudden⠀warmth,⠀and⠀plain⠀admission⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀bearers⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀gives⠀them⠀reason;⠀silence,⠀where⠀it⠀appears,⠀is⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀temperament.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀contemporary⠀and⠀specific.⠀No⠀historical⠀set⠀dressing,⠀bureaucratic⠀caricature,⠀or⠀mandatory⠀multilingual⠀inventory.⠀Where⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀a⠀region⠀or⠀family⠀language,⠀let⠀it⠀shape⠀names,⠀food,⠀and⠀habits⠀as⠀fact;⠀where⠀it⠀does⠀not,⠀keep⠀the⠀life⠀concrete⠀and⠀unmarked.⠀The⠀result⠀should⠀read⠀as⠀one⠀specific⠀present,⠀not⠀a⠀national⠀mood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀a⠀present-day⠀city⠀where⠀inherited⠀authority⠀is⠀materially⠀alive—in⠀particular⠀buildings,⠀family⠀names,⠀institutions,⠀debts—while⠀the⠀lovers⠀live⠀inside⠀its⠀costs.⠀One⠀may⠀work⠀under⠀surveillance,⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀patron,⠀or⠀carry⠀a⠀shame⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀past;⠀the⠀other⠀reads⠀the⠀arrangement's⠀price⠀in⠀a⠀snapped⠀phone,⠀a⠀bruise⠀hidden⠀by⠀a⠀cuff,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀must⠀stay⠀shut.⠀Establish⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀building,⠀the⠀job,⠀or⠀the⠀access⠀before⠀small⠀objects⠀begin⠀to⠀carry⠀structural⠀fear.\n\nMake⠀the⠀moments⠀of⠀private⠀softness⠀the⠀brightest⠀sensory⠀events,⠀chosen⠀sparingly:⠀a⠀touch⠀on⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀rain⠀smell⠀in⠀a⠀wool⠀collar,⠀two⠀hands⠀around⠀one⠀paper⠀cup.⠀Notice⠀decay⠀precisely—the⠀broken⠀lift,⠀the⠀courtyard⠀cold—because⠀it⠀sets⠀off⠀the⠀possibility⠀of⠀care,⠀not⠀for⠀atmosphere's⠀own⠀sake.⠀Let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀returning⠀images⠀become⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀markers,⠀charged⠀with⠀both⠀the⠀public⠀danger⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀promise.\n\nRender⠀masks⠀as⠀social⠀and⠀intimate⠀rather⠀than⠀magical.⠀A⠀character⠀speaks⠀in⠀the⠀practiced⠀tone⠀of⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀family,⠀or⠀an⠀allegiance,⠀and⠀lets⠀it⠀drop⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀room⠀or⠀voice;⠀show⠀the⠀drop⠀through⠀the⠀body—a⠀shoulder⠀lowering,⠀a⠀sentence⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀hand⠀suddenly⠀still.⠀Characters⠀are⠀revealed⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀stop⠀performing,⠀not⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀announce.⠀Keep⠀access⠀clear:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀disclose⠀one⠀character's⠀fear⠀or⠀tenderness⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀misreads⠀the⠀behavior,⠀and⠀the⠀misreading⠀itself⠀becomes⠀material⠀for⠀the⠀romance.\n\nLet⠀inherited⠀power⠀act⠀on⠀timing⠀and⠀risk.⠀An⠀old⠀name⠀may⠀forbid⠀the⠀match,⠀a⠀debt⠀may⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀privilege⠀may⠀let⠀one⠀character⠀protect⠀the⠀other⠀only⠀by⠀returning⠀somewhere⠀they⠀promised⠀to⠀leave.⠀A⠀quarrel⠀about⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer⠀or⠀an⠀intercepted⠀message⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀larger⠀fear⠀because⠀ownership⠀was⠀established⠀earlier.⠀Keep⠀the⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated:⠀one⠀lover⠀may⠀benefit⠀from⠀the⠀arrangement⠀both⠀distrust,⠀another⠀may⠀protect⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀hurt⠀them,⠀and⠀these⠀complications⠀bear⠀on⠀trust⠀and⠀attraction⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀postponing⠀an⠀ending.⠀Disagreement⠀about⠀running,⠀staying,⠀or⠀changing⠀the⠀terms⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀characters.\n\nImport⠀nothing⠀supernatural—no⠀vampires,⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀gothic⠀is⠀old⠀authority⠀decaying⠀into⠀the⠀present;⠀the⠀punk⠀is⠀the⠀intimate⠀refusal⠀to⠀be⠀cleanly⠀owned.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀in⠀limited⠀third⠀person,⠀placed⠀in⠀the⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀the⠀story⠀actually⠀supplies.⠀Household,⠀workplace,⠀school,⠀and⠀extended⠀family⠀are⠀materially⠀present—rooms⠀the⠀characters⠀move⠀through,⠀not⠀a⠀symbolic⠀cage—and⠀the⠀narration⠀stays⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀lover's⠀perception⠀inside⠀them.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀given⠀by⠀the⠀story;⠀where⠀none⠀is⠀fixed,⠀keep⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀concrete⠀but⠀unmarked⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀location⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family.\n\nChoose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀ordinary⠀objects⠀as⠀carriers,⠀taken⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀own⠀kitchen,⠀terrace,⠀bus⠀route,⠀or⠀desk.⠀Return⠀to⠀an⠀object⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀distance⠀or⠀the⠀desire⠀has⠀changed;⠀the⠀repetition⠀gathers⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀reluctance⠀to⠀speak,⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling.⠀The⠀reader⠀notices⠀the⠀character⠀noticing.\n\nLet⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀obligations⠀create⠀the⠀real⠀complications⠀by⠀entering⠀deliberation⠀naturally:⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀an⠀elder,⠀a⠀course⠀to⠀finish,⠀a⠀neighborhood's⠀opinion,⠀a⠀festival⠀that⠀puts⠀two⠀households⠀in⠀one⠀courtyard.⠀A⠀character⠀at⠀a⠀bus⠀stop⠀calculates⠀how⠀late⠀they⠀can⠀be⠀without⠀causing⠀questions;⠀another⠀buys⠀two⠀tickets⠀and⠀cannot⠀find⠀the⠀moment⠀to⠀offer⠀the⠀second.⠀Small⠀practical⠀matters⠀carry⠀large⠀emotional⠀risk⠀because⠀that⠀social⠀world⠀is⠀real⠀to⠀both⠀of⠀them.\n\nBuild⠀trust⠀through⠀remembered⠀particulars⠀and⠀acts⠀within⠀the⠀characters'⠀means.⠀One⠀remembers⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀tea,⠀which⠀route⠀they⠀fear,⠀which⠀relative⠀cannot⠀be⠀refused;⠀one⠀covers⠀a⠀mistake⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀others,⠀waits⠀ten⠀minutes⠀without⠀saying⠀so,⠀or⠀speaks⠀sharply⠀in⠀order⠀to⠀protect⠀someone.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀one⠀lover's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀sees⠀only⠀the⠀outward⠀act,⠀and⠀one⠀may⠀miss⠀a⠀signal⠀the⠀reader⠀receives—neither⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀perfectly⠀perceptive.\n\nLet⠀indirect⠀speech⠀do⠀romantic⠀work⠀where⠀caution⠀is⠀the⠀character's⠀own:⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀bus⠀schedule⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀asking⠀whether⠀the⠀other⠀will⠀be⠀there⠀tomorrow,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀second⠀question⠀through⠀the⠀first.⠀When⠀plain⠀speech⠀comes,⠀let⠀immediate⠀pressure⠀earn⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀or⠀any⠀single⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene;⠀both⠀the⠀restraint⠀and⠀the⠀tenderness⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀world⠀these⠀two⠀actually⠀live⠀in.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀first-person⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany—dated⠀entries,⠀fragments,⠀notes⠀taken⠀toward⠀remembering.⠀The⠀narrator⠀writes⠀after⠀the⠀fact⠀but⠀keeps⠀each⠀entry⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀original⠀moments:⠀the⠀walk⠀home,⠀the⠀shared⠀umbrella,⠀the⠀unanswered⠀message,⠀slippers⠀in⠀a⠀narrow⠀corridor.⠀Entries⠀stay⠀short,⠀built⠀on⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀images,⠀with⠀attention⠀moving⠀between⠀the⠀remembered⠀moment⠀and⠀the⠀self⠀now⠀writing.\n\nTrack⠀attachment⠀through⠀what⠀gets⠀recorded.⠀An⠀early⠀entry⠀notes⠀only⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀scarf⠀or⠀how⠀someone⠀held⠀a⠀door;⠀later,⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀returns—stained,⠀borrowed,⠀gone⠀missing—and⠀the⠀narrator⠀writes⠀one⠀sentence⠀too⠀many⠀about⠀it.⠀Repetition⠀across⠀entries⠀marks⠀the⠀change.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀means;⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀the⠀narrator⠀noticing⠀more.\n\nLet⠀the⠀diary's⠀gaps⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀An⠀argument⠀is⠀skipped⠀and⠀the⠀untouched⠀tea⠀recorded⠀instead;⠀an⠀entry⠀begins⠀with⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀bare⠀name.⠀The⠀page⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀a⠀purpose,⠀so⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀minimize,⠀stop⠀mid-sentence,⠀or⠀write⠀around⠀what⠀is⠀too⠀new⠀to⠀trust,⠀while⠀the⠀real⠀attraction⠀stays⠀traceable⠀beneath⠀the⠀wording.⠀The⠀form⠀is⠀confessional⠀without⠀being⠀exhaustive—one⠀person's⠀chosen⠀way⠀of⠀holding⠀onto⠀another.\n\nRecord⠀care⠀as⠀small⠀decisions⠀and⠀unremarked⠀kindnesses:⠀waiting⠀ten⠀extra⠀minutes⠀at⠀the⠀station,⠀buying⠀the⠀second⠀glove,⠀staying⠀awake⠀until⠀the⠀other's⠀light⠀goes⠀out;⠀tea⠀refilled⠀without⠀asking,⠀a⠀pencil⠀returned⠀already⠀sharpened,⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀paragraph⠀about⠀the⠀weather⠀as⠀if⠀not⠀dwelling.⠀Retrospective⠀discovery⠀is⠀available⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene⠀has⠀actually⠀been⠀written:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀reread⠀an⠀old⠀entry⠀and⠀recognize⠀a⠀feeling⠀that⠀was⠀present⠀then,⠀but⠀may⠀not⠀assign⠀the⠀entry⠀a⠀motive⠀the⠀original⠀moment⠀did⠀not⠀hold.\n\nSeason,⠀station,⠀meal,⠀and⠀family⠀obligation⠀may⠀appear⠀because⠀the⠀narrator's⠀world⠀includes⠀them,⠀without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀landscape.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀temperament⠀is⠀their⠀own—anxious,⠀funny,⠀angry,⠀giddy,⠀or⠀plainly⠀direct—and⠀an⠀entry⠀may⠀stop⠀anywhere⠀the⠀day's⠀attention⠀stops.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀intimate⠀urban⠀psychological⠀fiction:⠀limited⠀third⠀person,⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀character's⠀perception,⠀moving⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀city⠀of⠀particular⠀streets,⠀buses,⠀markets,⠀balconies,⠀and⠀late-night⠀stalls.⠀The⠀city⠀is⠀materially⠀present—heat,⠀noise,⠀waiting—and⠀it⠀amplifies⠀both⠀solitude⠀and⠀the⠀wish⠀not⠀to⠀be⠀alone.⠀Use⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀story⠀supplies;⠀where⠀none⠀is⠀fixed,⠀keep⠀the⠀city⠀concrete⠀but⠀unnamed⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀stereotype.\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀both⠀the⠀city⠀and⠀the⠀relationship:⠀a⠀bead⠀of⠀sweat⠀at⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀temple,⠀gasoline⠀and⠀jasmine⠀from⠀a⠀rooftop,⠀the⠀shadow⠀of⠀a⠀security⠀gate⠀across⠀a⠀wrist.⠀Return⠀to⠀an⠀image⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀emotional⠀pressure⠀has⠀changed,⠀so⠀its⠀recurrence⠀marks⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀feeling⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀city⠀to⠀stay⠀clear⠀and⠀precise⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀linger.\n\nDevelop⠀closeness⠀through⠀shared⠀urban⠀routine—the⠀same⠀bus,⠀the⠀same⠀coffee⠀cart,⠀talk⠀in⠀the⠀pauses⠀the⠀city's⠀noise⠀opens—and⠀through⠀remembered⠀particulars:⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀the⠀other⠀pronounces⠀one⠀word,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀checking⠀a⠀phone⠀before⠀crossing,⠀what⠀they⠀hum⠀when⠀tired.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀tenderness⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀registers⠀only⠀a⠀glance⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀held⠀too⠀long.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀do⠀romantic⠀work.⠀A⠀character⠀changes⠀route,⠀waits⠀until⠀the⠀other⠀arrives,⠀or⠀switches⠀off⠀the⠀radio⠀mid-song⠀without⠀saying⠀why,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀through⠀the⠀image⠀placed⠀just⠀before.⠀Enter⠀private⠀reasoning⠀where⠀the⠀perspective⠀permits—the⠀calculation⠀of⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀too⠀soon⠀to⠀suggest⠀a⠀walk,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀refusal,⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unanswered⠀until⠀morning.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀better⠀at⠀acting⠀than⠀speaking⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀misread⠀the⠀act;⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀equally⠀articulate.\n\nAdd⠀nothing⠀magical⠀or⠀marvelous⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀it;⠀selecting⠀this⠀tradition⠀grants⠀no⠀supernatural⠀facts.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀national⠀landscape,⠀dialect,⠀or⠀political⠀crisis⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀romance⠀comes⠀from⠀two⠀people's⠀attention⠀and⠀choices⠀inside⠀one⠀concrete,⠀ordinary,⠀psychologically⠀charged⠀life.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀cleanly:⠀locate⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀details—a⠀rooftop⠀after⠀class,⠀a⠀convenience⠀store⠀doorway,⠀an⠀empty⠀train⠀car—and⠀keep⠀every⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀readably⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀hands,⠀eyes,⠀and⠀feet⠀are⠀doing.⠀Give⠀any⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀one⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀it⠀first⠀matters.\n\nMake⠀the⠀reaction⠀beats⠀carry⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀chosen⠀image:⠀a⠀loose⠀thread⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀coat,⠀light⠀along⠀a⠀jaw,⠀a⠀can⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀carefully.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling⠀inside⠀the⠀beat;⠀show⠀the⠀pause,⠀the⠀half-finished⠀sentence,⠀the⠀attention⠀that⠀snags⠀on⠀something⠀unrelated.⠀If⠀the⠀image⠀returns⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀return⠀it⠀changed—the⠀thread⠀tied,⠀the⠀jaw⠀turned⠀away,⠀the⠀can⠀picked⠀up—and⠀only⠀once⠀the⠀feeling⠀has⠀actually⠀shifted,⠀so⠀recurrence⠀marks⠀development⠀instead⠀of⠀decorating⠀it.\n\nUse⠀private⠀response⠀as⠀the⠀instrument⠀of⠀omission.⠀A⠀character⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀floor,⠀adjusts⠀a⠀bag⠀strap,⠀or⠀says⠀the⠀opposite⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀feel;⠀then⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀one⠀private⠀sensory⠀fact—the⠀railing's⠀cold,⠀the⠀phone's⠀weight⠀in⠀a⠀pocket,⠀a⠀heartbeat⠀against⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀vending⠀machine—placed⠀briefly⠀after⠀the⠀line⠀or⠀action⠀it⠀answers.⠀The⠀other⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀why⠀the⠀sentence⠀stopped;⠀the⠀reader⠀should.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀romance⠀through⠀small⠀attended⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀ones:⠀walking⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀station,⠀sharing⠀headphones,⠀remembering⠀which⠀drink⠀the⠀other⠀wanted,⠀waiting⠀without⠀saying⠀they⠀waited,⠀offering⠀a⠀cold⠀can⠀with⠀the⠀label⠀turned⠀the⠀right⠀way,⠀taking⠀the⠀outside⠀of⠀the⠀pavement.⠀The⠀care⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀gesture⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀performing⠀it⠀says⠀nothing.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀belong⠀to⠀its⠀owners—awkward,⠀direct,⠀funny,⠀or⠀angry⠀as⠀the⠀particular⠀character⠀is—and⠀allow⠀a⠀serious⠀confession⠀to⠀be⠀delivered⠀as⠀plainly⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement.⠀No⠀young⠀cast,⠀comedy,⠀or⠀first-person⠀voice⠀is⠀required,⠀only⠀clarity⠀about⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀in⠀the⠀moment.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀turn⠀ends:⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀close⠀mid-exchange⠀or⠀settle⠀on⠀one⠀attended⠀detail,⠀with⠀no⠀forced⠀cliffhanger⠀and⠀no⠀obligation⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nCompose⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀chosen⠀sensory⠀points⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀inventory.⠀A⠀sleeve's⠀movement,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀between⠀them,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour:⠀give⠀these⠀the⠀stress⠀of⠀the⠀sentence⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀surrounding⠀action⠀stay⠀plain.⠀Return⠀to⠀an⠀image⠀across⠀the⠀story⠀at⠀changed⠀moments—the⠀same⠀cup⠀chipped⠀now,⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀offered⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀person—and⠀let⠀what⠀has⠀altered⠀or⠀persisted⠀show⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀stand,⠀without⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀interprets⠀the⠀symbol⠀for⠀the⠀reader.\n\nCarry⠀feeling⠀through⠀rhythm⠀and⠀placement.⠀Let⠀one⠀associative⠀sentence⠀move⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀across⠀a⠀held⠀silence⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀then⠀break⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀short⠀declarative⠀that⠀reports⠀something⠀ordinary⠀and⠀undeniable.⠀What⠀is⠀withheld⠀is⠀material:⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀glance⠀not⠀given⠀are⠀events⠀in⠀this⠀prose,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀should⠀live⠀beside⠀them⠀rather⠀than⠀explain⠀them.⠀If⠀an⠀image⠀gathers⠀meaning—a⠀red⠀bowl,⠀a⠀lamp⠀kept⠀burning—move⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀toward⠀something⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀failed⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀connection⠀unspoken.\n\nKeep⠀inward⠀experience⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀summarized⠀away.⠀The⠀focal⠀lover's⠀attention,⠀half-formed⠀thought,⠀and⠀bodily⠀response⠀belong⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀in⠀the⠀prose's⠀own⠀register;⠀what⠀the⠀style⠀omits⠀is⠀the⠀explanatory⠀bridge,⠀not⠀the⠀experience⠀itself.⠀Private⠀thought⠀and⠀spoken⠀dialogue⠀may⠀differ⠀for⠀this⠀person's⠀reasons—habit,⠀embarrassment,⠀the⠀wish⠀not⠀to⠀press—and⠀they⠀may⠀also⠀coincide.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀be⠀sparse,⠀but⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀pair:⠀their⠀reuses⠀of⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀joke⠀with⠀a⠀history,⠀a⠀reference⠀only⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀hold.⠀Attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀develop⠀through⠀who⠀notices⠀what,⠀who⠀waits⠀for⠀whom,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀does⠀with⠀the⠀other's⠀attention.\n\nShape⠀paragraphs⠀by⠀emotional⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀fixed⠀alternation:⠀a⠀long⠀paragraph⠀may⠀gather⠀several⠀small⠀perceptions,⠀and⠀a⠀single-line⠀paragraph⠀may⠀hold⠀the⠀admission⠀or⠀the⠀refusal.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀relationship's⠀live⠀uncertainty⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀perception⠀unresolved—mid-exchange,⠀mid-thought,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀decision⠀whose⠀consequence⠀has⠀not⠀arrived—rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀scene⠀before⠀the⠀reply⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀each⠀scene⠀hold⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀and⠀an⠀awareness⠀of⠀how⠀it⠀echoes⠀or⠀differs⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀Enter⠀memory⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀thing—a⠀chair's⠀position,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀used⠀to⠀say,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀coat⠀hangs—and⠀return⠀from⠀the⠀recollection⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀now⠀present,⠀so⠀that⠀reflection⠀deepens⠀the⠀current⠀exchange⠀instead⠀of⠀replacing⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀past:⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀morning,⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀of⠀a⠀promise,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀closes⠀that⠀way.\n\nPresent⠀irreversible⠀small⠀changes⠀without⠀stating⠀their⠀meaning.⠀A⠀habit⠀no⠀longer⠀shared,⠀a⠀nickname⠀once⠀automatic⠀and⠀now⠀hesitant,⠀a⠀route⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀take⠀together⠀carry⠀change⠀better⠀than⠀a⠀meditation⠀on⠀time.⠀Let⠀familiar⠀objects⠀mean⠀something⠀different⠀because⠀the⠀relationship⠀has⠀moved—closer,⠀apart,⠀or⠀under⠀repair—and⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀new⠀meaning⠀privately⠀while⠀the⠀spoken⠀conversation⠀continues⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀practical⠀subject.⠀Whether⠀the⠀bond⠀is⠀established,⠀newly⠀beginning,⠀or⠀being⠀repaired,⠀memory⠀should⠀complicate⠀and⠀clarify⠀present⠀feeling,⠀not⠀freeze⠀it.\n\nAllow⠀direct⠀reflection⠀where⠀this⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀reflect,⠀in⠀the⠀length⠀the⠀moment⠀needs,⠀and⠀let⠀other⠀passages⠀carry⠀the⠀association⠀entirely⠀inside⠀a⠀detail.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remains⠀available:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀good,⠀and⠀a⠀hand⠀resting⠀nearby⠀can⠀simply⠀be⠀warm.⠀Keep⠀the⠀romantic⠀bond⠀the⠀focus—a⠀quarrel⠀that⠀turned⠀out⠀to⠀matter,⠀a⠀meeting⠀before⠀they⠀knew⠀each⠀other—so⠀long⠀as⠀recollection⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀renewed⠀attention,⠀or⠀a⠀live⠀uncertainty;⠀do⠀not⠀close⠀scenes⠀by⠀announcing⠀that⠀the⠀moment⠀is⠀already⠀passing,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀reflection⠀turn⠀into⠀constant⠀sadness.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀situated⠀telling:⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀lovers⠀recounts⠀episodes⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener,⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀reason,⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀present-time⠀frame.⠀Establish⠀the⠀frame⠀physically⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀paragraph—a⠀room⠀at⠀an⠀hour,⠀a⠀reason⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀begun⠀tonight,⠀an⠀interruption⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said—and⠀let⠀the⠀listener's⠀small⠀responses⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀pauses⠀set⠀the⠀emotional⠀register⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀frame's⠀meaning.⠀The⠀teller's⠀own⠀present⠀experience⠀belongs⠀on⠀the⠀page—the⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀lighten⠀an⠀episode,⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀stops⠀on⠀the⠀arm⠀of⠀a⠀chair—so⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀lived⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀device.⠀Keep⠀to⠀the⠀language,⠀tradition,⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀story's⠀setting;⠀do⠀not⠀ornament⠀the⠀telling⠀with⠀borrowed⠀customs,⠀proverb-speech,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀solemnity⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀authorize.\n\nShape⠀the⠀told⠀sections⠀by⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection.⠀They⠀omit,⠀they⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀detail,⠀they⠀use⠀the⠀phrasing⠀of⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀objective⠀summary;⠀a⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀may⠀be⠀held⠀back,⠀a⠀remembered⠀slight⠀retold⠀with⠀new⠀awareness.⠀Because⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀later⠀events,⠀that⠀knowledge⠀may⠀shadow⠀an⠀episode⠀without⠀overwriting⠀the⠀earlier⠀self's⠀limited⠀understanding—convey⠀what⠀the⠀younger⠀one⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀know⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀lingers⠀on,⠀not⠀through⠀correction.⠀Inside⠀each⠀episode,⠀hold⠀to⠀Kawabata's⠀economy:⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀impressions—the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀market⠀stall,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀shutter—carry⠀more⠀than⠀description,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀alternates⠀casual⠀surface⠀with⠀disclosure.\n\nGround⠀the⠀episodes⠀in⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀realism:⠀households,⠀work,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀rooms⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀came⠀near⠀each⠀other,⠀hurt⠀or⠀comforted⠀each⠀other,⠀and⠀decided⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀about⠀it.⠀Romance⠀stays⠀the⠀center;⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀local⠀customs.⠀Where⠀the⠀telling⠀turns⠀reflective,⠀let⠀it⠀happen⠀inside⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀voice⠀and⠀history.⠀End⠀while⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀progress—a⠀question⠀asked,⠀a⠀listener's⠀answer⠀beginning,⠀the⠀teller⠀arriving⠀at⠀an⠀episode⠀they⠀had⠀avoided—leaving⠀episodes⠀unresolved⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀free⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nKeep⠀each⠀scene⠀to⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀and⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀chosen⠀because⠀they⠀carry⠀relationship⠀information:⠀the⠀way⠀he⠀turns⠀a⠀cup,⠀how⠀she⠀folds⠀a⠀receipt,⠀the⠀precise⠀interval⠀before⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀answers.⠀A⠀generic⠀\"he⠀looked⠀at⠀her\"⠀does⠀no⠀work;⠀if⠀a⠀detail⠀would⠀not⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀about⠀these⠀two,⠀cut⠀it.⠀Report⠀action⠀in⠀plain⠀declaratives⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀space⠀between⠀statements⠀stay⠀inferable⠀from⠀the⠀two⠀people's⠀history⠀rather⠀than⠀explained.\n\nDo⠀not⠀translate⠀every⠀gesture⠀into⠀meaning.⠀\"He⠀set⠀the⠀plate⠀on⠀the⠀table\"⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀whole⠀beat⠀if⠀a⠀previous⠀exchange⠀established⠀whose⠀dish⠀that⠀was⠀or⠀what⠀that⠀small⠀order⠀meant.⠀When⠀interior⠀statement⠀is⠀needed,⠀state⠀it⠀precisely⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀run⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀needs:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think,⠀\"If⠀she⠀says⠀it⠀was⠀fine,⠀she⠀will⠀stop⠀speaking,\"⠀rather⠀than⠀receiving⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀fear⠀attached⠀to⠀it.⠀Private⠀experience⠀belongs⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀in⠀this⠀spare⠀register—one⠀clean⠀thought,⠀one⠀sensation,⠀the⠀motive⠀that⠀connects⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀a⠀choice—while⠀the⠀connections⠀between⠀omitted⠀things⠀are⠀left⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀close.\n\nHandle⠀the⠀relationship's⠀turns⠀in⠀concrete,⠀spare⠀sentences:⠀an⠀admission⠀can⠀be⠀one⠀line,⠀a⠀refusal⠀a⠀single⠀physical⠀action.⠀If⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀exists,⠀show⠀its⠀trace⠀in⠀behavior—a⠀question⠀answered⠀two⠀beats⠀late,⠀a⠀name⠀avoided—and⠀leave⠀the⠀misreading⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph.⠀Trust⠀the⠀couple's⠀particular⠀language,⠀remembered⠀objects,⠀and⠀changed⠀routines⠀to⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀Avoid⠀performed⠀fragments⠀repeated⠀to⠀signal⠀brevity;⠀a⠀precise⠀long⠀sentence⠀serves⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀short⠀ones⠀arranged⠀for⠀effect.⠀Stop⠀after⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀an⠀exact⠀inner⠀realization,⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀line⠀that⠀explains⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀just⠀showed,⠀and⠀without⠀needing⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀reach⠀agreement⠀first.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained,⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀experience,⠀using⠀ordinary⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Within⠀that⠀continuous⠀flow,⠀practice⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity:⠀for⠀each⠀passage⠀choose⠀the⠀one⠀visual⠀or⠀tactile⠀element⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀moment,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀brief⠀clause⠀inside⠀a⠀longer⠀movement,⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀rest⠀of⠀the⠀room⠀unnarrated.⠀A⠀long⠀paragraph⠀may⠀contain⠀a⠀single⠀vivid⠀point.\n\nConvey⠀emotion⠀partly⠀by⠀omission,⠀shown⠀as⠀small⠀replacements⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀repeated⠀rhetorical⠀tic⠀of⠀naming⠀what⠀did⠀not⠀happen:⠀a⠀hand⠀raised⠀and⠀lowered,⠀a⠀message⠀drafted⠀and⠀left⠀unsent,⠀a⠀sentence⠀changed⠀at⠀its⠀last⠀word.⠀Give⠀inner⠀experience⠀its⠀natural⠀scope—the⠀narrator⠀may⠀set⠀out⠀a⠀desire,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀the⠀reasoning⠀behind⠀a⠀decision⠀across⠀several⠀sentences,⠀since⠀this⠀prose⠀permits⠀reflective⠀interiority—while⠀resisting⠀the⠀comprehensive⠀emotional⠀summary⠀that⠀catalogs⠀everything⠀a⠀character⠀feels.⠀What⠀is⠀selected⠀stands⠀for⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀itemized.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relationship⠀the⠀organizing⠀subject:⠀attention,⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀care,⠀and⠀the⠀decisions⠀about⠀belonging⠀together⠀that⠀this⠀particular⠀pair⠀actually⠀faces.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀occupy⠀a⠀whole⠀run⠀of⠀paragraphs;⠀perception⠀and⠀silence⠀matter⠀equally,⠀and⠀neither⠀party⠀is⠀a⠀guaranteed⠀reward⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀attention.⠀Vary⠀the⠀pace⠀deliberately—a⠀short⠀plain⠀paragraph⠀after⠀a⠀dense⠀exchange⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀nearness—and⠀let⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀routine,⠀such⠀as⠀remembering⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀used⠀to⠀pour⠀tea,⠀register⠀inside⠀the⠀sentence⠀without⠀being⠀flagged⠀as⠀symbolic.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀active⠀scene,⠀which⠀may⠀arrive⠀mid-conversation⠀or⠀mid-thought;⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀duration⠀governs⠀the⠀stop,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀complete⠀an⠀emotional⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nGround⠀every⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀you⠀choose⠀to⠀show:⠀the⠀moments⠀that⠀exist⠀only⠀because⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀have⠀this⠀history.⠀If⠀they⠀are⠀meeting⠀again⠀after⠀years,⠀learning⠀to⠀trust,⠀or⠀long⠀settled⠀into⠀a⠀domestic⠀routine,⠀select⠀the⠀beats⠀that⠀reveal⠀it—one⠀pair⠀of⠀hands⠀reaching⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀a⠀half-said⠀private⠀phrase,⠀an⠀old⠀tension⠀returning⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀room.⠀Prefer⠀a⠀small,⠀repeatable⠀marker⠀over⠀an⠀internal⠀label:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀gesture⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀always⠀notices.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀marker⠀more⠀than⠀once⠀across⠀the⠀story,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀risk⠀rather⠀than⠀simple⠀repetition.\n\nGive⠀the⠀strong⠀beats⠀their⠀room.⠀A⠀confession,⠀a⠀stab⠀of⠀jealousy,⠀a⠀comfort⠀offered⠀at⠀a⠀bad⠀hour,⠀or⠀a⠀discovery⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀undercut⠀for⠀fear⠀of⠀sentiment;⠀let⠀it⠀occupy⠀its⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀restrained⠀in⠀Kawabata's⠀manner:⠀instead⠀of⠀\"she⠀felt⠀a⠀wave⠀of⠀tenderness,\"⠀show⠀the⠀tenderness⠀in⠀one⠀exact⠀action⠀and⠀one⠀omitted⠀alternative—what⠀she⠀almost⠀said,⠀what⠀she⠀did⠀instead.⠀Keep⠀the⠀characters'⠀private⠀experience⠀on⠀the⠀page—attention,⠀dread,⠀relief,⠀the⠀reasoning⠀beneath⠀a⠀joke—while⠀restraint⠀applies⠀to⠀how⠀much⠀of⠀it⠀is⠀announced,⠀not⠀to⠀whether⠀it⠀exists.⠀The⠀reader's⠀payoff⠀comes⠀from⠀return⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀from⠀repeated⠀interior⠀declaration.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀sound⠀like⠀this⠀couple,⠀including⠀their⠀private⠀shorthand,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀speaker⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀pithy.\n\nOrder⠀the⠀scenes⠀to⠀fulfill⠀this⠀premise's⠀particular⠀promise.⠀If⠀distance⠀belongs⠀to⠀it,⠀show⠀one⠀specific⠀interval⠀of⠀distance⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀nearness⠀that⠀answers⠀it;⠀if⠀a⠀secret⠀belongs⠀to⠀it,⠀let⠀its⠀weight⠀appear⠀in⠀small⠀avoidances⠀before⠀the⠀revelation⠀and⠀in⠀changed⠀behavior⠀after.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀emotionally⠀legible⠀beat—a⠀held⠀look,⠀a⠀choice,⠀the⠀marker⠀returning⠀transformed—without⠀a⠀mandatory⠀cliffhanger⠀and⠀without⠀forcing⠀full⠀resolution.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀premise⠀actually⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀additional⠀tropes,⠀rival⠀pairings,⠀or⠀familiar⠀beats⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀has⠀not⠀established.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀relationship⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀deeds⠀that⠀someone⠀remembers:⠀the⠀community,⠀the⠀teller,⠀or⠀the⠀lovers⠀themselves.⠀Open⠀deliberately—\"It⠀is⠀said⠀that⠀when⠀she⠀first⠀came⠀to⠀his⠀door,⠀she⠀had...\"—then⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀compact⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀of⠀that⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀designation⠀for⠀one⠀of⠀the⠀lovers⠀grow⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀act—the⠀one⠀who⠀waited,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀mended⠀the⠀quarrel,⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀spoke⠀too⠀late—and⠀repeat⠀the⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Structure⠀recurrence⠀around⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself:⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀small⠀gift,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀refusal⠀is⠀remembered⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀changed⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀people,⠀and⠀its⠀consequence⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀remembered⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀its⠀importance.\n\nBalance⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀public⠀tone⠀with⠀Kawabata's⠀intimate⠀selection.⠀Inside⠀a⠀remembered⠀act,⠀hold⠀one⠀physical⠀point—the⠀exact⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀footstep,⠀a⠀coat's⠀wet⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀lamp⠀left⠀burning—and⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀the⠀public⠀account⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀lover's⠀private⠀experience:⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀a⠀deed⠀proved⠀to⠀neighbors⠀or⠀kin,⠀while⠀the⠀fear,⠀hope,⠀or⠀hesitation⠀the⠀person⠀actually⠀felt⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀or⠀the⠀focal⠀perspective's⠀own⠀channel,⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀but⠀not⠀announced⠀to⠀the⠀community.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀steadfast⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀person⠀felt⠀no⠀fear.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀elevated⠀telling⠀with⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀contrast⠀be⠀human⠀rather⠀than⠀comic⠀mockery:⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀a⠀well-told⠀incident⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀grand⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀supper.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀tradition⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀in⠀conventions⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀not⠀established.⠀End⠀while⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀still⠀being⠀told,⠀or⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed⠀whose⠀significance⠀remains⠀open⠀to⠀its⠀listener.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀socially⠀realist⠀domestic⠀and⠀working-life⠀scenes⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀Scandinavian⠀setting⠀already⠀established⠀by⠀the⠀story.⠀Show⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀in⠀shared⠀spaces:⠀how⠀they⠀prepare⠀food,⠀handle⠀routine⠀obligations,⠀arrange⠀transport,⠀deal⠀with⠀weather,⠀and⠀respond⠀to⠀practical⠀interruptions.⠀Let⠀the⠀selected⠀physical⠀detail⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀A⠀mug⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀shelf,⠀a⠀coat⠀put⠀over⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀a⠀chair,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀closing⠀a⠀door⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀proximity⠀or⠀care⠀while⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀attention⠀by⠀giving⠀each⠀scene⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀images⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀catalogue⠀the⠀room.⠀Choose⠀one⠀object,⠀one⠀movement,⠀or⠀one⠀observation⠀that⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀would⠀notice⠀because⠀of⠀attraction,⠀anxiety,⠀memory,⠀or⠀hope,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀revise⠀its⠀significance.⠀A⠀borrowed⠀scarf⠀returned⠀clean⠀can⠀first⠀seem⠀like⠀politeness⠀and⠀later⠀like⠀an⠀excuse⠀to⠀stay⠀a⠀little⠀longer,⠀without⠀the⠀character⠀announcing⠀either⠀interpretation.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀as⠀ordinary⠀story⠀prose⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀hand⠀moved⠀toward⠀the⠀same⠀plate⠀and⠀then⠀drew⠀back,⠀and⠀may⠀privately⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀speak⠀of⠀it.⠀That⠀omission⠀is⠀the⠀emotional⠀event.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀follow-up⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀resolution⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀reply;⠀the⠀moment⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀two⠀people⠀simply⠀continuing⠀to⠀clear⠀the⠀table⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀room.\n\nLet⠀social⠀context⠀create⠀friction⠀through⠀actual⠀obligations:⠀a⠀work⠀schedule,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation,⠀a⠀housing⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀a⠀previous⠀commitment.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀obstacles⠀to⠀be⠀defeated⠀by⠀confession;⠀they⠀shape⠀when⠀and⠀how⠀people⠀can⠀be⠀together.⠀Show⠀the⠀limits⠀through⠀ordinary⠀management⠀rather⠀than⠀melodrama.⠀A⠀cancelled⠀plan⠀can⠀produce⠀quiet⠀relief⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀disappointment,⠀and⠀the⠀relief⠀itself⠀can⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀learn⠀about⠀their⠀own⠀wishes.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀reserved⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀rule⠀for⠀every⠀character.⠀Some⠀characters⠀will⠀say⠀more⠀and⠀some⠀less,⠀depending⠀on⠀their⠀habits⠀and⠀the⠀situation.⠀Allow⠀silence⠀to⠀mean⠀attention,⠀fatigue,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀comfort,⠀not⠀only⠀concealed⠀passion.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀practical⠀task,⠀a⠀shared⠀look,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀open⠀without⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀forced⠀romantic⠀payoff.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀romance⠀scenes⠀as⠀visible,⠀audible⠀interactions⠀in⠀a⠀plausible⠀physical⠀setting.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀concrete:⠀who⠀moves,⠀what⠀they⠀handle,⠀how⠀they⠀stand,⠀and⠀what⠀sound⠀or⠀change⠀of⠀light⠀accompanies⠀the⠀moment.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pad⠀them⠀with⠀atmospheric⠀adjectives.⠀The⠀relationship⠀emerges⠀from⠀repeated⠀small⠀actions:⠀a⠀glass⠀set⠀down⠀carefully,⠀a⠀coat⠀taken⠀from⠀someone's⠀hand,⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀earlier⠀than⠀expected,⠀a⠀lamp⠀turned⠀off⠀after⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀leaves.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀meaningful⠀detail⠀per⠀action⠀block⠀rather⠀than⠀itemizing⠀the⠀environment.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀kept⠀holding⠀the⠀phone⠀after⠀the⠀call⠀ended,⠀that⠀they⠀turned⠀a⠀receipt⠀over⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀or⠀that⠀they⠀stepped⠀back⠀from⠀the⠀counter⠀without⠀speaking.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀then⠀continues⠀around⠀that⠀gesture.⠀Let⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀dialogue⠀be⠀written⠀as⠀silence⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀contained⠀action,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀voice-over⠀explanation.⠀If⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀someone⠀open⠀a⠀drawer,⠀look⠀at⠀a⠀folded⠀note,⠀and⠀close⠀the⠀drawer⠀without⠀comment,⠀that⠀unspoken⠀recognition⠀does⠀the⠀emotional⠀work.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀following⠀the⠀source⠀module's⠀wrapper⠀format.⠀This⠀note⠀remains⠀hidden⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀and⠀from⠀ordinary⠀display⠀when⠀the⠀wrapper⠀is⠀configured,⠀but⠀it⠀gives⠀the⠀composing⠀model⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning.⠀Do⠀not⠀put⠀that⠀private⠀content⠀into⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀separately⠀permits⠀it.\n\nAttribute⠀dialogue⠀to⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀make⠀each⠀line⠀behave⠀like⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀say⠀in⠀the⠀given⠀moment.⠀Avoid⠀explanatory⠀exchanges⠀that⠀summarize⠀their⠀own⠀meaning.⠀A⠀line⠀may⠀be⠀indirect,⠀practical,⠀or⠀abrupt:⠀\"You⠀can⠀leave⠀that⠀here\"⠀can⠀mean⠀stay⠀a⠀little⠀longer,⠀but⠀the⠀script⠀should⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀character⠀saying⠀so.⠀Let⠀subsequent⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀confirm⠀the⠀implication⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unresolved.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them:⠀a⠀kettle⠀clicking⠀off⠀in⠀another⠀room,⠀heavy⠀rain⠀beginning⠀against⠀the⠀window,⠀a⠀text⠀notification⠀from⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀is⠀not⠀present.⠀These⠀details⠀can⠀prompt⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀attention⠀without⠀becoming⠀symbols.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀domestic⠀task,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀persist.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀for⠀a⠀live⠀stage:⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀economical⠀blocking⠀that⠀an⠀actor⠀and⠀director⠀can⠀realize.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀characters⠀move⠀around⠀the⠀shared⠀space⠀and⠀touch⠀ordinary⠀objects.⠀Show⠀care⠀through⠀action:⠀one⠀character⠀pours⠀tea⠀before⠀the⠀other⠀asks,⠀folds⠀a⠀newspaper⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀moves⠀a⠀chair⠀closer,⠀or⠀takes⠀a⠀coat⠀from⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀a⠀chair⠀and⠀hangs⠀it⠀up.⠀These⠀stage⠀actions⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀commented⠀on⠀by⠀the⠀characters.\n\nUse⠀pauses⠀and⠀silences⠀as⠀stage⠀directions⠀with⠀clear⠀physical⠀context.⠀A⠀beat⠀while⠀one⠀character⠀looks⠀at⠀the⠀other's⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀cup⠀tells⠀the⠀audience⠀something⠀private⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀monologue.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀economic⠀and⠀particular⠀to⠀each⠀character.⠀One⠀may⠀speak⠀around⠀the⠀subject,⠀another⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀direct⠀question⠀and⠀then⠀retreat.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀reticent;⠀a⠀practical⠀offer,⠀a⠀mild⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀request⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.\n\nIf⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀experience⠀for⠀a⠀character,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀inside⠀the⠀selected⠀hidden⠀wrapper,⠀clearly⠀attributed.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀read⠀aloud⠀and⠀not⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀that⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀an⠀aside,⠀a⠀soliloquy,⠀or⠀a⠀telephone⠀voice.⠀A⠀monologue⠀may⠀exist⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for⠀it,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀the⠀required⠀hidden⠀interiority.\n\nLet⠀the⠀stage⠀setting⠀itself⠀remain⠀selective.⠀Set⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀furniture⠀and⠀objects⠀the⠀action⠀needs:⠀a⠀table,⠀two⠀chairs,⠀a⠀counter,⠀a⠀coat⠀hook,⠀a⠀kettle.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀directions⠀with⠀atmospheric⠀adjectives.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀remembers⠀something,⠀the⠀memory⠀can⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀handling⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrated⠀flashback⠀produced⠀on⠀stage.\n\nDevelop⠀attraction⠀and⠀trust⠀through⠀repeated⠀scenes⠀of⠀ordinary⠀domestic⠀or⠀working⠀life.⠀A⠀first⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀two⠀people⠀sharing⠀a⠀meal⠀and⠀failing⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀meant;⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀repeating⠀a⠀small⠀domestic⠀action⠀learned⠀from⠀the⠀other.⠀These⠀repetitions⠀create⠀the⠀romantic⠀development⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession.⠀The⠀play⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀exchange⠀that⠀is⠀complete⠀in⠀itself⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀relationship⠀remains⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀focal⠀character's⠀moving⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀private⠀words⠀braid⠀together⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀experiences⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀what⠀this⠀person⠀notices⠀and⠀avoids⠀noticing.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀present⠀scene⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀imagined⠀scene.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀conversation⠀can⠀return⠀uninvited;⠀a⠀particular⠀smell⠀can⠀pull⠀the⠀character⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀room⠀years⠀ago;⠀a⠀sudden⠀pain⠀in⠀the⠀chest⠀can⠀be⠀physical⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀named.\n\nBecause⠀Kawabata's⠀attention⠀is⠀selective,⠀do⠀not⠀include⠀the⠀full⠀stream⠀of⠀every⠀possible⠀perception.⠀At⠀any⠀moment⠀choose⠀only⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀impressions⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀this⠀character's⠀feeling:⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀through⠀thin⠀porcelain,⠀the⠀worn⠀patch⠀on⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀voice⠀drops⠀before⠀asking⠀a⠀question.⠀Let⠀the⠀image⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀without⠀translating⠀it⠀into⠀an⠀explanatory⠀sentence.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀thinks⠀'she⠀always⠀touched⠀the⠀rim⠀before⠀drinking,'⠀the⠀detail⠀alone⠀can⠀imply⠀familiarity⠀and⠀loss;⠀the⠀text⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀say⠀why⠀it⠀hurts.\n\nAssociative⠀movement⠀means⠀the⠀next⠀thought⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀previous⠀image,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀or⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation.⠀A⠀train⠀announcement⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀voice⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀nearly⠀missed⠀the⠀train;⠀a⠀folded⠀napkin⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀another⠀table.⠀These⠀leaps⠀should⠀remain⠀plausible⠀for⠀this⠀particular⠀mind.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀thought⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀beloved;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀preoccupied⠀with⠀work,⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀bodily⠀need,⠀or⠀an⠀irritation⠀that⠀has⠀nothing⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Love⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀constant⠀foreground,⠀but⠀a⠀recurring⠀undertone⠀that⠀changes⠀shape.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀contract.⠀If⠀only⠀one⠀perspective⠀is⠀authorized,⠀do⠀not⠀enter⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀mind.⠀If⠀multiple⠀focal⠀characters⠀are⠀permitted,⠀signal⠀the⠀shift⠀clearly⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀mind's⠀associations⠀distinct.⠀Private⠀words⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀fragments,⠀questions,⠀or⠀counterarguments.⠀They⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀narrator.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀inner⠀life⠀into⠀guessable⠀dialogue;⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀infer,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀interpret.\n\nThe⠀relationship⠀can⠀develop⠀through⠀changed⠀mental⠀emphasis⠀rather⠀than⠀external⠀drama.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀become⠀less⠀frequent,⠀a⠀certain⠀phrase⠀may⠀lose⠀its⠀charge,⠀a⠀new⠀physical⠀habit⠀may⠀replace⠀an⠀old⠀one.⠀That⠀shift⠀is⠀a⠀meaningful⠀romantic⠀development⠀even⠀without⠀a⠀described⠀encounter.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀mental⠀movement⠀reaches⠀a⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀natural⠀break;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀climax,⠀confession,⠀or⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀romantic⠀development⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages,⠀with⠀the⠀conversation's⠀pacing⠀and⠀ordinary⠀digital⠀details⠀doing⠀emotional⠀work.⠀Let⠀each⠀character⠀have⠀distinct⠀texting⠀habits:⠀one⠀writes⠀complete⠀sentences⠀and⠀waits⠀a⠀long⠀time⠀between⠀replies;⠀another⠀sends⠀short⠀fragments⠀quickly;⠀one⠀never⠀uses⠀punctuation;⠀one⠀ends⠀with⠀a⠀period⠀when⠀annoyed.⠀These⠀habits⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀characterization,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀code.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀mean⠀work,⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀dead⠀battery,⠀or⠀deliberate⠀space-making;⠀do⠀not⠀automatically⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀manipulation.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀message⠀left⠀on⠀\"read\"⠀without⠀an⠀immediate⠀reply⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀noisy⠀exchange,⠀but⠀the⠀writer⠀should⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀pause⠀significant.⠀Show⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀choose⠀to⠀type⠀and⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀type.⠀The⠀phrase⠀\"Are⠀you⠀home?\"⠀followed⠀by⠀no⠀other⠀message⠀can⠀be⠀care,⠀worry,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀need;⠀the⠀next⠀message⠀or⠀the⠀recipient's⠀private⠀reaction⠀will⠀shape⠀which⠀possibility⠀the⠀reader⠀experiences.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀nonspoken⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separate⠀from⠀sent⠀messages.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀private⠀live⠀thought.⠀Write⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀produces,⠀with⠀an⠀interface⠀cue⠀showing⠀it⠀was⠀never⠀sent.⠀Write⠀private⠀thought⠀using⠀the⠀selected⠀hidden⠀wrapper⠀or⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀may⠀hide⠀the⠀private⠀feeling⠀completely:⠀the⠀character⠀types⠀\"That's⠀fine,\"⠀then⠀privately⠀notes⠀that⠀the⠀kitchen⠀is⠀dark,⠀and⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself⠀remains⠀plain.\n\nInclude⠀necessary⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀only⠀when⠀required⠀for⠀orientation⠀or⠀private⠀experience,⠀and⠀separate⠀it⠀clearly⠀from⠀the⠀message⠀text.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀such⠀as⠀unsent⠀auto-deletions⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀contract⠀includes⠀them.⠀A⠀channel⠀change⠀or⠀group⠀conversation⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀if⠀it⠀advances⠀the⠀story,⠀but⠀the⠀core⠀romance⠀should⠀not⠀depend⠀on⠀screenshots,⠀emojis,⠀or⠀bots.\n\nLet⠀the⠀romantic⠀movement⠀emerge⠀through⠀text⠀patterns⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀emotional⠀declaration.⠀An⠀apology⠀can⠀be⠀rewritten⠀and⠀then⠀sent⠀as⠀a⠀simple⠀\"okay.\"⠀A⠀question⠀asked⠀at⠀2⠀a.m.⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀the⠀next⠀morning⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀errand.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀private⠀shorthand,⠀and⠀its⠀later⠀absence⠀can⠀be⠀felt⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Close⠀the⠀reply⠀after⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀relationship⠀issue⠀is⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀romance⠀in⠀successive⠀illustrated-scene⠀moments⠀with⠀concise⠀setting,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction.⠀Keep⠀the⠀presentation⠀linear⠀unless⠀another⠀feature⠀explicitly⠀authorizes⠀branching;⠀this⠀style⠀alone⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀player⠀choices⠀or⠀romance⠀routes.⠀The⠀reader⠀follows⠀one⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience⠀of⠀each⠀scene,⠀and⠀the⠀visual⠀cues⠀remain⠀purposeful⠀references⠀for⠀imagined⠀backgrounds⠀or⠀expression⠀changes⠀rather⠀than⠀executable⠀engine⠀labels.\n\nLet⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀shape⠀the⠀scene-setting.⠀In⠀each⠀location,⠀choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀details⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀would⠀notice⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀relationship:⠀the⠀steam⠀rising⠀from⠀two⠀cups,⠀the⠀way⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀coat⠀has⠀fallen⠀off⠀the⠀back⠀of⠀the⠀chair,⠀the⠀quiet⠀movement⠀of⠀a⠀curtain.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀entire⠀room.⠀Let⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀change⠀meaning⠀across⠀scenes.⠀A⠀window⠀left⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀scene⠀might⠀later⠀accompany⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀absence;⠀the⠀text⠀can⠀simply⠀note⠀the⠀window⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀shift.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀that⠀is⠀readable⠀and⠀individually⠀voiced.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀rhythm,⠀directness,⠀and⠀evasions.⠀A⠀line⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀emotional⠀meaning.⠀\"The⠀bus⠀is⠀late⠀again\"⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀apology.⠀Focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response,⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀chosen⠀contract,⠀may⠀sit⠀between⠀dialogue⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀or⠀withholds.⠀That⠀private⠀response⠀is⠀not⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀speaker.\n\nTreat⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀a⠀shorthand⠀for⠀the⠀illustrated⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀An⠀illustration⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀neutral⠀expression⠀while⠀the⠀text⠀discloses⠀private⠀tenderness;⠀the⠀two⠀can⠀coexist.⠀Do⠀not⠀instruct⠀the⠀image⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀reader's⠀understanding.⠀Repetition⠀of⠀a⠀scene⠀background⠀can⠀acquire⠀new⠀significance⠀from⠀later⠀knowledge,⠀as⠀when⠀a⠀place⠀first⠀appears⠀ordinary⠀and⠀later⠀becomes⠀associated⠀with⠀a⠀hurtful⠀remark⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀kindness.\n\nDevelop⠀trust⠀and⠀chosen⠀connection⠀through⠀attention,⠀memory,⠀and⠀small⠀disclosures⠀rather⠀than⠀plot-driven⠀confessions.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀two⠀characters⠀separating⠀for⠀the⠀evening,⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀completed,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence.⠀Leave⠀space⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀an⠀obligatory⠀emotional⠀beat.⠀The⠀romantic⠀development⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀changing⠀weight⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀gives⠀to⠀familiar⠀sights⠀and⠀words.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPambabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Romance⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀romance⠀as⠀a⠀continuing⠀serial⠀story⠀with⠀clear⠀installment-scale⠀developments.⠀Each⠀reply⠀should⠀advance⠀a⠀particular⠀moment⠀of⠀proximity,⠀disclosure,⠀disagreement,⠀or⠀care,⠀while⠀leaving⠀enough⠀open⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀installment.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀chapter⠀to⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀confession;⠀a⠀quiet⠀shift⠀in⠀understanding⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀satisfying⠀close.\n\nUse⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀details⠀per⠀installment,⠀chosen⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention.⠀Let⠀one⠀object⠀or⠀sensory⠀impression⠀carry⠀the⠀installment's⠀emotional⠀movement:⠀a⠀pill⠀bottle⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀coffee⠀from⠀an⠀open⠀doorway,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀too⠀quietly⠀to⠀answer.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀and⠀alter⠀its⠀meaning:⠀the⠀pill⠀bottle⠀was⠀for⠀a⠀parent's⠀illness,⠀not⠀neglect;⠀the⠀coffee⠀was⠀meant⠀for⠀someone⠀else;⠀the⠀name⠀was⠀not⠀a⠀dismissal⠀but⠀an⠀old⠀habit.⠀The⠀recovered⠀detail⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀contradict⠀the⠀earlier⠀fact⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀suddenly⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀through-line⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀narrative.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀a⠀new⠀installment,⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀from⠀the⠀past:⠀the⠀shared⠀habit,⠀the⠀unfinished⠀conversation,⠀the⠀person's⠀schedule,⠀the⠀place⠀they⠀were⠀supposed⠀to⠀meet.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀Use⠀the⠀recovered⠀detail⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀reader⠀returning⠀after⠀a⠀break⠀can⠀re-enter⠀without⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀summary.⠀A⠀simple⠀phrase⠀such⠀as⠀\"She⠀still⠀left⠀the⠀porch⠀light⠀on⠀whenever⠀he⠀drove⠀late\"⠀reestablishes⠀care⠀and⠀routine⠀at⠀once.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀develop⠀over⠀time⠀through⠀small⠀recursions:⠀a⠀phrase⠀is⠀used⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀tone,⠀a⠀gesture⠀is⠀repeated⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning,⠀an⠀absence⠀is⠀felt⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀discussed.⠀These⠀repetitions⠀are⠀the⠀serial's⠀emotional⠀continuity.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀installment⠀introduce⠀a⠀fresh⠀obstacle⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀misunderstanding.⠀Progress⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀practical⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀even⠀when⠀no⠀external⠀event⠀occurs.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀between⠀significant⠀scenes.⠀A⠀skipped⠀interval⠀may⠀still⠀contain⠀relevant⠀changes:⠀someone⠀took⠀a⠀new⠀shift,⠀repaired⠀a⠀broken⠀step,⠀or⠀stopped⠀calling⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour.⠀Do⠀not⠀omit⠀those⠀changes⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀falsely⠀presents⠀the⠀unchanged⠀past.⠀Close⠀each⠀installment⠀after⠀a⠀local⠀development⠀is⠀felt,⠀whether⠀the⠀larger⠀relationship⠀is⠀resolved⠀or⠀not.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
