marvels⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀permits⠀them.⠀The⠀García⠀Márquez⠀profile⠀shapes⠀the⠀narration:⠀long⠀sentences⠀gather⠀detail⠀across⠀time⠀while⠀remaining⠀bound⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀house,⠀job,⠀or⠀street.⠀Keep⠀the⠀movement⠀between⠀personal⠀life,⠀family⠀memory,⠀public⠀events,⠀rumor,⠀and⠀recurring⠀language.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀everyday⠀practice⠀and⠀social⠀memory—new⠀work⠀shifts,⠀changed⠀public⠀transit,⠀a⠀different⠀way⠀of⠀buying⠀food,⠀a⠀rumor⠀about⠀a⠀clinic,⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀now⠀policed.⠀Let⠀characters⠀encounter⠀these⠀consequences⠀through⠀their⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀technical⠀exposition;⠀instead,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀does⠀to⠀a⠀family's⠀routine⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀city's⠀visible⠀life.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀setting⠀is⠀already⠀Latin⠀American,⠀keep⠀its⠀specific⠀national⠀or⠀local⠀detail⠀sharp;⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀plaza⠀or⠀invent⠀the⠀economy⠀and⠀religion⠀of⠀an⠀unspecified⠀country.\n\nBuild⠀intimacy⠀through⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀attention.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀worry,⠀or⠀hope,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀also⠀see⠀how⠀the⠀changed⠀city⠀surrounds⠀that⠀life:⠀neighbors,⠀merchants,⠀a⠀passed⠀bus,⠀a⠀repaired⠀window,⠀a⠀public⠀notice.⠀When⠀interiority⠀is⠀authorized,⠀render⠀thought⠀and⠀feeling⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀tied⠀to⠀concrete⠀causes.⠀A⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀merely⠀feel⠀uneasy⠀about⠀the⠀new⠀technology;⠀she⠀may⠀recall⠀how⠀her⠀brother's⠀body⠀changed⠀after⠀a⠀treatment,⠀wonder⠀whether⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀story⠀is⠀accurate,⠀or⠀calculate⠀what⠀a⠀delay⠀will⠀cost.⠀Family⠀memory⠀and⠀rumor⠀act⠀as⠀social⠀texture:⠀an⠀aunt's⠀claim⠀passed⠀through⠀three⠀kitchens⠀may⠀alter⠀how⠀the⠀protagonist⠀reads⠀a⠀public⠀announcement.⠀Recurring⠀language,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀street⠀name⠀everyone⠀shortens⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀corporate⠀notice,⠀ties⠀private⠀life⠀to⠀the⠀city's⠀transformation.⠀Let⠀intimate⠀desire⠀or⠀fear⠀shape⠀decisions⠀while⠀keeping⠀other⠀characters⠀as⠀active⠀people,⠀not⠀instruments.\n\nMove⠀toward⠀a⠀moment⠀where⠀