rough⠀gathered⠀sentences⠀and⠀social⠀memory.⠀A⠀brief⠀paragraph⠀may⠀gather⠀time—'that⠀was⠀the⠀third⠀week⠀of⠀the⠀ration,⠀and⠀already⠀the⠀street⠀had⠀learned⠀to⠀trade⠀its⠀receipts⠀before⠀sunset'—before⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene.⠀The⠀gathered⠀sentence⠀should⠀remain⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀family⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀atmospheric⠀generalizing.⠀Recurring⠀language⠀works⠀well⠀in⠀the⠀light⠀novel⠀container:⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀a⠀work⠀order,⠀a⠀nickname,⠀the⠀title⠀of⠀a⠀discontinued⠀program.⠀Let⠀it⠀appear⠀in⠀dialogue,⠀private⠀response,⠀or⠀narration,⠀and⠀return⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning⠀later.⠀Keep⠀rumor⠀and⠀family⠀memory⠀present⠀in⠀everyday⠀talk:⠀a⠀shopkeeper⠀retells⠀a⠀story,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀corrects⠀it,⠀a⠀sibling⠀calls⠀from⠀another⠀city.⠀The⠀science-fictional⠀premise⠀can⠀produce⠀different⠀textures⠀at⠀these⠀levels,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀include⠀a⠀technical⠀lecture.⠀If⠀a⠀mechanic⠀or⠀engineer⠀is⠀present,⠀let⠀their⠀speech⠀be⠀purposeful⠀within⠀the⠀conversation:⠀a⠀single⠀comparison⠀or⠀adjustment⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀stakes⠀concrete.⠀Descriptions⠀should⠀preserve⠀visual⠀clarity:⠀tell⠀us⠀the⠀repaired⠀machine's⠀color,⠀the⠀new⠀sign⠀outside⠀the⠀clinic,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀holds⠀an⠀old⠀permit.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀'just⠀show⠀it,⠀don't⠀explain⠀it'⠀erase⠀the⠀needed⠀practical⠀detail.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀scene⠀boundary.⠀The⠀light⠀novel⠀format⠀welcomes⠀a⠀crisp⠀final⠀image⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀You⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀question⠀remains⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀someone⠀entering,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀realization⠀is⠀just⠀beginning.⠀The⠀García⠀Márquez⠀register⠀can⠀supply⠀a⠀closing⠀line⠀that⠀gathers⠀past⠀and⠀present,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀short⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀land⠀on⠀the⠀active⠀moment.⠀Avoid⠀conclusions⠀that⠀imply⠀the⠀whole⠀scenario⠀has⠀been⠀explained.⠀No⠀compulsory⠀wit,⠀confession,⠀or⠀reversal⠀is⠀needed.⠀The⠀characters⠀remain⠀in⠀their⠀world⠀with⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀visible⠀around⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀entered⠀the⠀community's⠀way⠀of⠀remembering.⠀Gather⠀a⠀present⠀perception⠀with⠀an⠀older⠀occasion⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀accumulating⠀sentence:⠀an⠀inherited⠀tool⠀beside⠀a⠀new⠀interface,⠀a⠀song⠀remembered⠀over⠀a⠀maintenance⠀hum,⠀a⠀rumor⠀about⠀the⠀first⠀machines⠀recalled⠀during⠀a⠀current⠀repair.⠀Let⠀the⠀sentence⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀older⠀event⠀and⠀back,⠀so⠀the⠀future⠀feels⠀continuous⠀with⠀family⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀imposed⠀from⠀outside.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀sounds⠀or⠀images⠀as⠀the⠀thread⠀by⠀which⠀one⠀person's⠀present⠀action⠀becomes⠀recognizable⠀within⠀a⠀longer⠀communal⠀story.⠀Anchor⠀every⠀figurative⠀leap⠀in⠀something⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀scene:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀panel,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀recycled⠀air,⠀a⠀child's⠀corrupted⠀birth⠀record.⠀When⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfolds,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀make⠀visible⠀an⠀unspoken⠀consequence.⠀After⠀a⠀cadenced⠀stretch,⠀insert⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀fact—the⠀repair⠀is⠀finished,⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀wrong,⠀the⠀air⠀is⠀breathable—so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀does⠀not⠀float⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀plot.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀Public⠀reports,⠀overheard⠀speech,⠀and⠀other⠀characters'⠀memories⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀prose,⠀but⠀they⠀remain⠀reports,⠀not⠀evidence⠀of⠀shared⠀telepathy.⠀A⠀technological⠀explanation⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀accumulating⠀syntax⠀as⠀a⠀personal⠀recollection,⠀yet⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀enough⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀decision⠀or⠀event⠀at⠀hand.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀event⠀ends,⠀with⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀still⠀unfolding⠀rather⠀than⠀resolved⠀into⠀a⠀collective⠀proverb.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀the⠀reason⠀particular⠀familiar⠀things⠀have⠀become⠀unavailable⠀or⠀altered.⠀Write⠀a⠀character⠀remembering⠀how⠀a⠀ritual⠀was⠀once⠀performed,⠀how⠀a⠀body⠀moved⠀before⠀its⠀modification,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀season⠀was⠀known⠀before⠀climate⠀control.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀carry⠀that⠀association:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀filter,⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀a⠀song,⠀a⠀calendar⠀archived⠀as⠀error.⠀Trace⠀irreversible⠀small⠀changes⠀through⠀personal⠀or⠀family⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀public⠀statistics⠀alone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀reflect⠀directly⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀reflection⠀connects⠀an⠀observed⠀detail⠀to⠀a⠀life⠀that⠀has⠀continued⠀past⠀it.⠀Keep⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀available—a⠀meal,⠀an⠀old⠀argument,⠀a⠀working⠀machine—so⠀that⠀loss⠀remains⠀particular⠀and⠀credible.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀shift;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀time⠀layered,⠀not⠀be⠀told⠀that⠀time⠀is⠀passing.⠀Ground⠀any⠀rumored⠀or⠀public⠀event⠀in⠀someone's⠀concrete⠀experience⠀of⠀it.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speculate⠀about⠀what⠀another⠀remembers,⠀but⠀that⠀speculation⠀stays⠀speculation.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀mourning⠀process.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀comfort⠀and⠀remembered⠀lack,⠀without⠀declaring⠀that⠀everything⠀good⠀has⠀gone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀telling:⠀a⠀named⠀or⠀implied⠀narrator⠀who⠀has⠀lived⠀or⠀gathered⠀the⠀story⠀addresses⠀a⠀present⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀appears⠀in⠀ordinary⠀social⠀life.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀occasion⠀of⠀the⠀telling—a⠀family⠀visit,⠀a⠀repair⠀shift,⠀a⠀courtyard⠀conversation—so⠀the⠀future⠀world⠀is⠀introduced⠀through⠀communal⠀memory⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition⠀delivered⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀Keep⠀the⠀audience's⠀interruptions⠀or⠀later⠀questions⠀as⠀brief⠀frame⠀moments,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀debate⠀panel.\n\nGround⠀the⠀account⠀in⠀social⠀or⠀domestic⠀realism⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition:⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀medical⠀treatment,⠀the⠀politics⠀of⠀a⠀water⠀allocation,⠀a⠀marriage⠀affected⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀longevity⠀or⠀communication⠀device.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀account⠀move⠀between⠀personal⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀wider⠀community's⠀experience,⠀preserving⠀the⠀García⠀Márquez⠀movement⠀from⠀personal⠀life⠀to⠀public⠀event⠀and⠀rumor.⠀Use⠀reflection⠀or⠀a⠀philosophical⠀observation⠀when⠀it⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀loss⠀or⠀gain,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀moral.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀single⠀regional⠀honor⠀code,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀antique⠀landscape.⠀The⠀tradition⠀provides⠀the⠀storytelling⠀structure⠀and⠀the⠀attention⠀to⠀hospitality,⠀family,⠀work,⠀or⠀memory;⠀the⠀setting⠀remains⠀the⠀supplied⠀science-fictional⠀world.⠀Keep⠀the⠀distinct⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent—if⠀the⠀frame⠀echoes⠀Persian⠀or⠀Arabic⠀or⠀Turkish⠀or⠀Hebrew⠀storytelling⠀patterns,⠀let⠀that⠀choice⠀shape⠀recurrence⠀and⠀address,⠀but⠀avoid⠀mixing⠀every⠀convention.⠀The⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀stays⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀can⠀know;⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀communal⠀saying⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀story⠀shows⠀its⠀adoption.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀it⠀material⠀in⠀ordinary⠀practice—a⠀modified⠀hand,⠀a⠀food⠀ration⠀label,⠀a⠀wall⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀field—and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀information.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀in⠀active⠀voice.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀every⠀detail⠀into⠀a⠀metaphor;⠀one⠀precise⠀image⠀can⠀stand⠀for⠀a⠀longer⠀history⠀the⠀community⠀remembers.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀the⠀past,⠀give⠀only⠀the⠀specific⠀memory⠀needed⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀feeling,⠀and⠀cut⠀any⠀general⠀meditation⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀alter⠀the⠀current⠀decision.\n\nPreserve⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀communal⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀concise⠀recurrence:⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀still⠀says,⠀a⠀repair⠀someone⠀remembers⠀making,⠀a⠀rumor⠀that⠀has⠀outlived⠀its⠀original⠀source.⠀Return⠀to⠀such⠀a⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀repeated⠀use⠀gains⠀new⠀meaning.⠀Avoid⠀accumulating⠀clauses⠀that⠀gather⠀time;⠀instead,⠀place⠀a⠀short⠀past⠀detail⠀beside⠀a⠀present⠀one⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀gap⠀remain⠀inferable.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀shifts⠀to⠀a⠀public⠀event,⠀reduce⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀consequence,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀everyone⠀felt.\n\nOmission⠀must⠀preserve⠀causality.⠀If⠀an⠀action⠀has⠀a⠀reason,⠀leave⠀a⠀trace⠀of⠀that⠀reason⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀observable⠀result.⠀The⠀selected⠀narrator's⠀access⠀remains⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀perspective;⠀no⠀style⠀can⠀grant⠀a⠀concealed⠀motive.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀business⠀ends,⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀aphorism.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀appears⠀through⠀everyday⠀action⠀and⠀interaction:⠀a⠀market⠀exchange,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀call,⠀a⠀school⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀family⠀meeting.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀move⠀naturally⠀between⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀and⠀memory.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀event,⠀make⠀the⠀memory⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀scene's⠀object⠀or⠀phrase,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀detached⠀retrospective⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀experience⠀the⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀as⠀layers⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀life.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀and⠀reported⠀community⠀speech⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀individual⠀within⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀communal⠀memory⠀and⠀rumor.⠀A⠀neighbor⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀family⠀once⠀did;⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀may⠀echo⠀an⠀older⠀promise.⠀Such⠀reports⠀remain⠀attributed⠀and⠀external;⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀shared.⠀When⠀a⠀sentence⠀gathers⠀detail⠀across⠀time,⠀keep⠀it⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀human⠀consequence:⠀the⠀new⠀technique⠀changed⠀this⠀hand,⠀this⠀house,⠀this⠀schedule.\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀flexible⠀contemporary⠀register.⠀Paragraphing⠀and⠀scene⠀transitions⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀moral⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cultural⠀verdict.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀middle⠀action⠀or⠀conversation⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀the⠀natural⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀and⠀world⠀physics;⠀speculative⠀consequences⠀are⠀observed⠀or⠀experienced,⠀not⠀converted⠀into⠀omniscient⠀cultural⠀commentary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀already-established⠀relationship⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀enters⠀through⠀its⠀specific⠀consequences⠀for⠀these⠀two⠀characters:⠀what⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀do⠀together,⠀what⠀a⠀new⠀condition⠀or⠀technology⠀now⠀makes⠀possible⠀or⠀impossible,⠀what⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀has⠀never⠀said.⠀Use⠀their⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments—a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀an⠀argument⠀they⠀replay—so⠀that⠀the⠀future⠀world⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀external⠀backdrop⠀but⠀part⠀of⠀their⠀shared⠀history.⠀Avoid⠀inserting⠀a⠀standard⠀trope⠀roster;⠀work⠀only⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise.\n\nLet⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀receive⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀fulfill⠀its⠀particular⠀promise.⠀Show⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀in⠀scene⠀action⠀and⠀focal⠀thought,⠀not⠀merely⠀in⠀a⠀concluding⠀declaration.⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀communal⠀memory⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀family⠀remarks⠀or⠀an⠀older⠀social⠀expectation,⠀but⠀make⠀those⠀reports⠀converge⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀public⠀spectacle.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀should⠀gain⠀new⠀significance⠀through⠀a⠀later⠀moment:⠀what⠀was⠀once⠀humorous⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀sign⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀strain.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Inner⠀experience⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀where⠀authorized,⠀but⠀another⠀person's⠀mind⠀remains⠀unknown⠀except⠀through⠀speech⠀and⠀visible⠀behavior.⠀The⠀style⠀aims⠀at⠀payoff,⠀not⠀forced⠀resolution;⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀moment⠀if⠀that⠀preserves⠀the⠀relationship's⠀ongoing⠀tension.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀the⠀pairing⠀into⠀an⠀allegory⠀for⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition;⠀the⠀condition⠀shapes⠀them,⠀but⠀they⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀each⠀other.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀told⠀after⠀the⠀fact:⠀name⠀the⠀change⠀or⠀the⠀deed⠀and⠀say⠀why⠀the⠀community⠀still⠀remembers⠀it.⠀Then⠀move⠀from⠀that⠀compact⠀declaration⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀was⠀felt.⠀Use⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀after⠀a⠀similar⠀act⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀later⠀return,⠀so⠀the⠀account⠀gains⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀oral⠀retelling.⠀Keep⠀each⠀recurrence⠀tied⠀to⠀its⠀specific⠀event—the⠀same⠀warning⠀before⠀another⠀treatment,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀family⠀meal—rather⠀than⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀for⠀every⠀appearance.\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀account⠀through⠀deeds,⠀kinship,⠀or⠀public⠀events⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀material.⠀If⠀an⠀oath,⠀journey,⠀gift,⠀or⠀feud⠀is⠀established,⠀it⠀may⠀structure⠀the⠀telling;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀an⠀unrelated⠀cast.⠀Show⠀how⠀an⠀act⠀relates⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀remain⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀known⠀world.⠀A⠀repeated⠀rumor⠀may⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀communal⠀record,⠀but⠀private⠀motives⠀not⠀yet⠀revealed⠀stay⠀unknown.\n\nDialogue⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀to⠀correct⠀one⠀remembered⠀detail⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀grand⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody;⠀the⠀speculative⠀event⠀remains⠀serious⠀even⠀when⠀someone⠀objects⠀to⠀how⠀it⠀is⠀told.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀response⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀legendary⠀summary.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀concludes⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action,⠀that⠀unfinished⠀action⠀can⠀itself⠀become⠀the⠀thing⠀later⠀remembered,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀declare⠀it⠀so⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀third-person⠀prose⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀chosen⠀Scandinavian⠀social-institutional⠀realism:⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀enters⠀through⠀municipal⠀records,⠀welfare⠀offices,⠀clinics,⠀schools,⠀or⠀housing⠀administration,⠀and⠀its⠀consequences⠀are⠀traced⠀through⠀forms,⠀registers,⠀queues,⠀and⠀household⠀obligations.⠀Do⠀not⠀alternate⠀among⠀institutions⠀for⠀variety;⠀let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀connected⠀settings⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀across⠀the⠀story.\n\nLet⠀a⠀sentence⠀gather⠀time⠀by⠀moving⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀and⠀back.⠀A⠀number⠀written⠀on⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀name⠀called⠀in⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀notice⠀pinned⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell⠀can⠀return⠀years⠀later⠀with⠀its⠀meaning⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀regulation,⠀a⠀retirement,⠀or⠀the⠀death⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀first⠀explained⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀communal⠀version⠀contradicts⠀a⠀private⠀memory,⠀show⠀both⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀terms:⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀that⠀became⠀common⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀individual⠀who⠀remembers⠀the⠀meeting,⠀the⠀promise,⠀or⠀the⠀error⠀differently.⠀Leave⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀unresolved⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀a⠀supported⠀reason⠀to⠀settle⠀it.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀a⠀real⠀material⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀recorded,⠀funded,⠀housed,⠀monitored,⠀or⠀cared⠀for.⠀Show⠀its⠀effect⠀through⠀a⠀clerk's⠀changed⠀question,⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀different⠀number,⠀a⠀benefit⠀delayed⠀because⠀a⠀file⠀was⠀transferred,⠀or⠀a⠀school⠀asking⠀a⠀family⠀to⠀confirm⠀information⠀the⠀state⠀already⠀holds.⠀Let⠀characters⠀meet⠀these⠀changes⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims:⠀a⠀parent⠀trying⠀to⠀secure⠀a⠀place,⠀an⠀employee⠀following⠀a⠀new⠀procedure,⠀an⠀older⠀person⠀protecting⠀a⠀neighbor⠀from⠀a⠀fine.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀socially⠀precise⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀chosen⠀institution⠀records,⠀funds,⠀and⠀considers⠀polite,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀precision⠀shape⠀the⠀plot⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀marvelous⠀as⠀optional⠀and⠀nonliteral.⠀When⠀extraordinary⠀events⠀appear⠀in⠀rumor⠀or⠀memory,⠀render⠀them⠀as⠀things⠀the⠀community⠀reports,⠀repeats,⠀and⠀handles:⠀a⠀healer's⠀reputation,⠀a⠀strange⠀light⠀over⠀the⠀water,⠀a⠀child⠀said⠀to⠀have⠀predicted⠀a⠀death.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀may⠀remain⠀calm⠀while⠀the⠀implications⠀widen,⠀and⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀consequence⠀should⠀remain⠀the⠀operative⠀change,⠀not⠀a⠀hidden⠀supernatural⠀order.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀to⠀mark⠀returns⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀changes.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀clinic,⠀family⠀kitchen,⠀or⠀harbor⠀office⠀appears⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀year,⠀let⠀the⠀heading⠀carry⠀the⠀date⠀or⠀season⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀register⠀what⠀age,⠀staffing,⠀or⠀technology⠀has⠀altered:⠀a⠀new⠀scanner⠀beside⠀the⠀old⠀painted⠀sign,⠀a⠀different⠀name⠀on⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀queue⠀that⠀now⠀forms⠀outside.⠀Keep⠀action⠀blocks⠀concise⠀and⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀or⠀heard.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀in⠀which⠀characters⠀handle⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀ordinary⠀social⠀business.⠀They⠀discuss⠀a⠀delayed⠀appointment,⠀a⠀changed⠀work⠀rota,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀complaint,⠀or⠀a⠀number⠀someone⠀must⠀memorize,⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀full⠀system.⠀Let⠀one⠀line⠀in⠀an⠀early⠀scene⠀become⠀evidence⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀one:⠀a⠀grandmother⠀mentions⠀a⠀code⠀she⠀must⠀repeat;⠀a⠀decade⠀later⠀a⠀clerk⠀repeats⠀it⠀back⠀to⠀her⠀under⠀different⠀circumstances.⠀The⠀repetition⠀carries⠀the⠀new⠀meaning;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀speech⠀explaining⠀that⠀it⠀has⠀returned.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀to⠀compress⠀intervening⠀years.⠀A⠀cut⠀from⠀a⠀school⠀assembly⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀used⠀as⠀a⠀clinic⠀can⠀show⠀institutional⠀continuity⠀without⠀a⠀montage.⠀An⠀offscreen⠀public⠀announcement,⠀a⠀recorded⠀message,⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀queue⠀being⠀called⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀development⠀into⠀a⠀scene⠀before⠀anyone⠀speaks.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀statement⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀time,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀or⠀recorded⠀message,⠀never⠀an⠀unanchored⠀narrator.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀lines.⠀If⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀contract,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀note⠀format⠀provided⠀for⠀hidden⠀content;⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀audible⠀dialogue⠀or⠀as⠀direction.⠀A⠀recurring⠀object⠀may⠀signal⠀memory⠀when⠀its⠀meaning⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀holds⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀opens,⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀now⠀costs.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀alteration⠀in⠀ordinary⠀procedure,⠀not⠀as⠀exposition⠀delivered⠀by⠀a⠀scientist.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nChoose⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀that⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀altered—registering⠀a⠀child,⠀filling⠀a⠀prescription,⠀signing⠀a⠀housing⠀form,⠀clearing⠀a⠀table⠀after⠀a⠀meeting—and⠀let⠀the⠀scene's⠀blocking⠀and⠀props⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀does⠀to⠀it.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀carries⠀the⠀event;⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀with⠀their⠀hands.⠀A⠀key,⠀a⠀folder,⠀a⠀pill⠀packet,⠀or⠀a⠀cup⠀may⠀pass⠀between⠀speakers,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀object⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀use,⠀ownership,⠀or⠀cost⠀changes⠀across⠀acts.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀visits⠀as⠀dramatic⠀returns.⠀A⠀character⠀enters⠀the⠀same⠀room⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀time⠀of⠀life,⠀and⠀another⠀character's⠀line⠀rephrases⠀something⠀spoken⠀decades⠀earlier.⠀Let⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀mark⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀communal⠀time:⠀a⠀child⠀leaves⠀for⠀school⠀in⠀one⠀act⠀and⠀returns⠀as⠀an⠀official⠀in⠀the⠀next.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀year;⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀checked⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀sit,⠀or⠀which⠀name⠀is⠀called⠀first.\n\nStage⠀public⠀rumor⠀as⠀shared⠀speech⠀rather⠀than⠀internal⠀monologue.⠀One⠀character⠀tells⠀what⠀the⠀neighbor⠀said;⠀another⠀contradicts⠀it;⠀a⠀third⠀repeats⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀significant⠀omission.⠀The⠀audience⠀hears⠀the⠀communal⠀version⠀while⠀each⠀speaker's⠀private⠀stake⠀remains⠀visible⠀in⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀turned⠀back,⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀exit.⠀Monologues⠀are⠀only⠀for⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose—a⠀formal⠀speech,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement—never⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀all⠀inner⠀experience.\n\nKeep⠀any⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀authorized⠀separate⠀note,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀If⠀an⠀aside⠀is⠀used,⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀deliberate⠀theatrical⠀device⠀with⠀an⠀intended⠀audience,⠀not⠀hidden⠀thought.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀should⠀be⠀presented⠀through⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀a⠀room:⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀new⠀rule⠀spoken⠀by⠀a⠀tired⠀official.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind,⠀braiding⠀immediate⠀perception⠀with⠀memory,⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀private⠀phrases.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀development⠀enter⠀as⠀something⠀this⠀person⠀has⠀been⠀told,⠀touched,⠀or⠀waited⠀for:⠀a⠀clinic⠀number,⠀a⠀cooling⠀patch⠀on⠀the⠀skin,⠀a⠀recorded⠀voice⠀in⠀the⠀stairwell.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀decade,⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀be⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀now⠀knows.\n\nDo⠀not⠀report⠀the⠀event⠀in⠀chronological⠀order.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀object⠀trigger⠀an⠀older⠀room,⠀a⠀mother's⠀warning,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀disinfectant⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀building.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀fragment⠀and⠀restart,⠀but⠀keep⠀one⠀clear⠀thread⠀of⠀orientation:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀has⠀moved⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀to⠀a⠀memory⠀and⠀back.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀private,⠀not⠀communal,⠀anchor—something⠀this⠀person⠀repeats⠀when⠀afraid,⠀impatient,⠀or⠀trying⠀to⠀remember⠀a⠀rule.⠀Let⠀the⠀phrase⠀change⠀its⠀meaning⠀across⠀time⠀without⠀the⠀character⠀announcing⠀the⠀change.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀science⠀fiction⠀consequence⠀intimate⠀and⠀contingent.⠀Show⠀the⠀mind⠀checking⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀counting⠀pills,⠀hearing⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀belong⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀trying⠀to⠀recall⠀whether⠀a⠀form⠀was⠀signed.⠀The⠀technology⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained;⠀it⠀is⠀present⠀as⠀sensation⠀and⠀obligation.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀permits⠀only⠀nonfantastic⠀events,⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀memory⠀into⠀literal⠀time⠀travel⠀or⠀supernatural⠀visitation.\n\nThis⠀technique⠀does⠀not⠀give⠀access⠀to⠀other⠀minds.⠀Another⠀character's⠀unexplained⠀behavior⠀must⠀be⠀observed⠀and⠀interpreted⠀from⠀the⠀outside.⠀The⠀narrative⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀person⠀thinks⠀that⠀behavior⠀means,⠀but⠀that⠀remains⠀a⠀private⠀guess.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀move⠀rapidly⠀from⠀work⠀to⠀family⠀to⠀weather⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀external⠀plot⠀to⠀advance;⠀the⠀movement⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀continuity.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀sender-attributed⠀messages,⠀with⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀distinct:⠀one⠀writes⠀long⠀paragraphs⠀late⠀at⠀night,⠀another⠀sends⠀fragments⠀without⠀punctuation,⠀a⠀third⠀only⠀forwards⠀documents.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀development⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀messages⠀do:⠀a⠀clinic⠀sends⠀an⠀automated⠀reminder⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀code;⠀a⠀workplace⠀channel⠀adds⠀a⠀bot;⠀a⠀parent⠀asks⠀a⠀child⠀to⠀send⠀a⠀photo⠀of⠀a⠀medication⠀label.\n\nUse⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀and⠀edits⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀carry⠀information.⠀A⠀reply⠀that⠀comes⠀weeks⠀after⠀the⠀original⠀question⠀can⠀change⠀its⠀meaning.⠀A⠀deleted⠀message,⠀a⠀receipt⠀left⠀on⠀read,⠀or⠀an⠀attachment⠀that⠀fails⠀to⠀load⠀are⠀events,⠀not⠀decoration.⠀Make⠀each⠀interface⠀event⠀reflect⠀an⠀institutional⠀or⠀personal⠀consequence:⠀a⠀claim⠀is⠀pending,⠀a⠀school⠀form⠀requires⠀a⠀new⠀number,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀forwarded⠀notice⠀contains⠀a⠀rule⠀no⠀one⠀remembers⠀voting⠀on.\n\nTranslate⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀communal⠀retelling⠀into⠀message⠀chains.⠀Different⠀senders⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀announcement⠀with⠀small⠀changes.⠀One⠀person⠀corrects⠀a⠀detail;⠀another⠀omits⠀it.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀compare⠀versions.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀transcript⠀become⠀a⠀neutral⠀archive;⠀each⠀sender⠀has⠀a⠀stake,⠀visible⠀in⠀whom⠀they⠀address,⠀what⠀they⠀omit,⠀and⠀whether⠀they⠀ask⠀for⠀confirmation.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀message⠀stream.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀typed⠀and⠀deleted⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind.⠀If⠀required⠀interiority⠀must⠀be⠀included,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀clearly⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀format,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀only⠀when⠀necessary,⠀marked⠀as⠀such,⠀and⠀must⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀concise⠀setting⠀and⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀brief⠀focal⠀reaction⠀paragraph⠀that⠀remains⠀inside⠀one⠀viewpoint.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀development⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀background:⠀the⠀same⠀clinic⠀wall⠀now⠀holds⠀a⠀different⠀notice,⠀the⠀harbor⠀has⠀a⠀new⠀scanner⠀post,⠀a⠀school⠀corridor⠀displays⠀a⠀class⠀list⠀with⠀altered⠀names.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀these⠀small⠀changes⠀without⠀announcing⠀their⠀full⠀significance.\n\nUse⠀recurring⠀locations⠀as⠀memory⠀anchors.⠀When⠀a⠀scene⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀background,⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀may⠀recall⠀what⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀there.⠀A⠀single⠀object—a⠀machine⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀painted⠀sign—can⠀gather⠀meaning⠀across⠀years.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀expression⠀cues⠀into⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀character's⠀smile⠀or⠀hesitation⠀may⠀attract⠀attention,⠀but⠀only⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀recorded⠀fact⠀can⠀establish⠀a⠀reliable⠀inference.\n\nAttribution⠀must⠀remain⠀clear.⠀Each⠀line⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀named⠀speaker;⠀focal⠀narration⠀is⠀separate⠀and⠀not⠀spoken⠀aloud.⠀Another⠀character⠀cannot⠀know⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀thought⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀read⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀different⠀viewpoint⠀is⠀used,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀carry⠀private⠀information⠀across⠀minds⠀without⠀authorization.\n\nThe⠀speculative⠀element⠀is⠀everyday,⠀not⠀spectacular:⠀a⠀queue⠀for⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀changed⠀password⠀policy,⠀a⠀new⠀vaccine⠀consent,⠀a⠀repair⠀that⠀never⠀arrives.⠀The⠀visual⠀novel⠀format⠀does⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀choices,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands;⠀it⠀only⠀arranges⠀scenes,⠀speech,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration.⠀Information⠀can⠀be⠀withheld⠀legitimately⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀must⠀not⠀pretend⠀a⠀later⠀revealed⠀fact⠀was⠀always⠀understood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanahbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀García⠀Márquez⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀third-person⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀local⠀through-line⠀for⠀each⠀installment:⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀what⠀small⠀change⠀occurs,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀development⠀be⠀embedded⠀in⠀ordinary⠀work,⠀care,⠀or⠀administration.⠀A⠀calendar⠀adjustment⠀at⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀new⠀queue⠀at⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀changed⠀delivery⠀route,⠀a⠀letter⠀with⠀a⠀code—any⠀of⠀these⠀can⠀move⠀the⠀installment⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀full⠀arc.\n\nRecover⠀a⠀precise⠀earlier⠀detail⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀new⠀significance⠀is⠀earned.⠀A⠀sentence⠀from⠀a⠀previous⠀installment⠀can⠀return⠀verbatim⠀or⠀nearly⠀so,⠀now⠀placed⠀beside⠀a⠀new⠀fact.⠀This⠀repetition⠀is⠀García⠀Márquez's⠀communal⠀memory⠀made⠀serial:⠀the⠀same⠀rumor,⠀number,⠀or⠀name⠀appears⠀again⠀under⠀different⠀conditions.⠀Do⠀not⠀re-explain⠀the⠀entire⠀history;⠀give⠀the⠀single⠀necessary⠀particular⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀hold⠀the⠀rest.\n\nLet⠀each⠀installment⠀compress⠀uneventful⠀time⠀while⠀preserving⠀material⠀changes.⠀If⠀a⠀form⠀was⠀signed⠀between⠀installments,⠀mention⠀the⠀signature's⠀consequence⠀when⠀it⠀matters;⠀do⠀not⠀omit⠀it⠀so⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀falsely⠀seems⠀contradictory.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀past⠀event⠀imperfectly,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀must⠀not⠀silently⠀erase⠀an⠀established⠀fact.⠀New⠀information⠀qualifies⠀old⠀explanations⠀without⠀rewriting⠀what⠀was⠀previously⠀shown.\n\nThe⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀quiet⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Avoid⠀forcing⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀character⠀arc⠀at⠀every⠀boundary.⠀Progress⠀may⠀be⠀institutional,⠀emotional,⠀or⠀practical.⠀Required⠀interiority⠀remains⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀follows.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nGround⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀speculative⠀change⠀that⠀already⠀touches⠀the⠀character's⠀routine,⠀body,⠀work,⠀or⠀living⠀space.⠀Show⠀the⠀turbulence⠀through⠀what⠀happens⠀when⠀someone⠀tries⠀to⠀speak,⠀leave,⠀return,⠀or⠀accept⠀help.⠀Use⠀short⠀declarative⠀paragraphs⠀separated⠀by⠀decisive⠀blank⠀lines.⠀Let⠀a⠀gesture,⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail⠀carry⠀feeling⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀not⠀name.\n\nMove⠀between⠀a⠀few⠀hard⠀cuts⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀emotional⠀change.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀open⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀act,⠀leap⠀over⠀the⠀apology⠀to⠀show⠀its⠀aftermath,⠀or⠀end⠀before⠀a⠀resolution.⠀The⠀next⠀paragraph⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀the⠀seeming⠀calm⠀a⠀moment⠀ago⠀was⠀not⠀calm⠀at⠀all.⠀Let⠀the⠀target⠀relationship's⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀rhythm:⠀people⠀interrupt,⠀answer⠀with⠀shorter⠀words⠀when⠀cornered,⠀or⠀fall⠀silent⠀at⠀exactly⠀the⠀point⠀that⠀matters⠀to⠀them.\n\nImport⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀private⠀pain⠀legible—a⠀shared⠀ration,⠀a⠀diagnostic⠀display,⠀a⠀powered⠀door⠀that⠀cannot⠀stay⠀open,⠀a⠀deadline⠀written⠀into⠀the⠀character's⠀body⠀or⠀schedule.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀explanatory⠀background⠀in⠀every⠀beat.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀know⠀the⠀hurt⠀through⠀the⠀visible⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice:⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀stops⠀before⠀touching,⠀equipment⠀checked⠀too⠀often,⠀a⠀message⠀composed⠀and⠀deleted,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀kindness⠀accepted⠀with⠀visible⠀difficulty.\n\nRepresent⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀internal⠀pressure⠀directly⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it;⠀other⠀characters⠀cannot⠀observe⠀it⠀unless⠀action⠀or⠀speech⠀exposes⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀pause⠀to⠀confess,⠀explain,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀worsen.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀can⠀raise⠀stakes,⠀but⠀the⠀response⠀should⠀end⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀boundary⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀relationship⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nStart⠀from⠀the⠀established⠀scene⠀and⠀keep⠀speakers⠀clear⠀even⠀when⠀an⠀exchange⠀is⠀brief.⠀One⠀paragraph⠀may⠀contain⠀a⠀short⠀action,⠀a⠀spoken⠀line,⠀and⠀one⠀concrete⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀speculative⠀environment.⠀Give⠀each⠀new⠀speaker⠀a⠀separate⠀paragraph⠀with⠀unambiguous⠀attribution.⠀Use⠀blank⠀lines⠀between⠀beats⠀so⠀a⠀player⠀can⠀enter⠀or⠀continue⠀from⠀any⠀point.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀objects⠀and⠀routines⠀of⠀this⠀place:⠀a⠀panel⠀that⠀glows⠀when⠀a⠀signal⠀arrives,⠀a⠀filter⠀held⠀up⠀to⠀the⠀light,⠀an⠀automatic⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀on⠀a⠀delay,⠀food⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀particular⠀machine.⠀Have⠀characters⠀interact⠀with⠀these⠀details⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀event⠀actually⠀concerns⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀put⠀a⠀technical⠀explanation⠀into⠀every⠀reply.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀one⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀differ⠀from⠀another's;⠀she⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀fact⠀in⠀a⠀glance⠀while⠀he⠀treats⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀as⠀routine.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀forward⠀movement⠀small⠀and⠀physical⠀rather⠀than⠀driven⠀by⠀a⠀question.⠀A⠀beat⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀reaching⠀for⠀something,⠀finishing⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀door.⠀The⠀next⠀player⠀can⠀continue⠀with⠀speech,⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀observation.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀puzzle,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀If⠀an⠀action⠀remains⠀unfinished,⠀that⠀is⠀enough.\n\nAllow⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀sensory⠀experience⠀inside⠀a⠀character's⠀own⠀beat⠀where⠀the⠀player's⠀selected⠀perspective⠀permits⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀another⠀character⠀react⠀to⠀information⠀never⠀spoken⠀or⠀shown.⠀Silence⠀can⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀exchange;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀filled⠀with⠀interpretation.⠀A⠀revelation⠀may⠀come⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀change—the⠀room's⠀lighting⠀shifts,⠀a⠀screen⠀updates,⠀a⠀character⠀finally⠀turns⠀toward⠀the⠀speaker—and⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀immediately⠀after.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀mode⠀selected⠀for⠀the⠀speculative⠀setting:⠀short⠀incidents⠀gather⠀around⠀a⠀circulating⠀rumor,⠀a⠀duty,⠀a⠀damaged⠀reputation,⠀or⠀an⠀unexplained⠀event.⠀Present⠀each⠀episode⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀movement⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀changed⠀fact,⠀a⠀small⠀meeting,⠀and⠀enough⠀concluding⠀information⠀to⠀push⠀the⠀larger⠀story⠀forward.⠀Keep⠀episode⠀boundaries⠀clear⠀by⠀shifts⠀in⠀location,⠀speaker,⠀or⠀time.\n\nTake⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route⠀by⠀treating⠀the⠀future⠀world⠀as⠀an⠀ongoing⠀conflict⠀in⠀which⠀debts⠀of⠀obligation⠀and⠀personal⠀reputation⠀remain⠀real.⠀A⠀promise⠀made⠀to⠀a⠀technician,⠀a⠀route⠀opened⠀for⠀another⠀crew,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀repeats—these⠀can⠀function⠀as⠀the⠀old-world⠀bond⠀and⠀enmity⠀would.⠀Speculative⠀machinery⠀enters⠀through⠀such⠀obligations:⠀a⠀shipment,⠀a⠀life-support⠀allocation,⠀an⠀access⠀code,⠀a⠀job⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀accepts.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀sword⠀or⠀duel⠀into⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀for⠀the⠀episode's⠀emotional⠀force.⠀A⠀two-line⠀exchange⠀can⠀reveal⠀an⠀entire⠀prior⠀history.⠀A⠀gesture⠀adjacent⠀to⠀the⠀dialogue⠀can⠀contradict⠀what⠀is⠀said.⠀After⠀an⠀episode,⠀leave⠀white⠀space;⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀may⠀open⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀place⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀infer⠀what⠀happened⠀in⠀between.⠀A⠀revelation⠀can⠀arrive⠀late,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀twist⠀but⠀as⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀formerly⠀obscure⠀act⠀finally⠀becomes⠀intelligible.\n\nDistinguish⠀observation⠀from⠀reputation:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀is⠀incomplete⠀or⠀proven⠀wrong⠀later.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator,⠀when⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀this⠀episode's⠀viewpoint⠀can⠀know.⠀Avoid⠀broad⠀ethnographic⠀decoration⠀or⠀a⠀quest⠀for⠀a⠀distinctively⠀Chinese⠀future⠀aesthetic;⠀the⠀tradition⠀guides⠀how⠀material⠀is⠀arranged⠀and⠀how⠀knowledge⠀circulates,⠀not⠀what⠀the⠀cast⠀must⠀look⠀like.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀forceful,⠀declarative⠀sentences.⠀Show⠀material⠀weight,⠀wear,⠀heat,⠀grit,⠀or⠀powered⠀sound⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀moment⠀as⠀the⠀action:⠀a⠀seal⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀scraped⠀clean,⠀a⠀joint⠀that⠀moves⠀too⠀slowly,⠀a⠀gauge⠀whose⠀reading⠀cannot⠀be⠀trusted.⠀Every⠀speculative⠀fact⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀use⠀or⠀damage⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀descriptive⠀passage.⠀When⠀a⠀system⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀check⠀it,⠀load⠀it,⠀or⠀feel⠀its⠀failure.\n\nTransitions⠀should⠀be⠀abrupt⠀but⠀legible.⠀Cut⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀meaningful⠀action;⠀do⠀not⠀smooth⠀over⠀elapsed⠀effort⠀with⠀summary.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀hand⠀pressed⠀against⠀a⠀latch⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph⠀can⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀hand⠀already⠀moving.⠀The⠀cut⠀itself⠀carries⠀information.⠀When⠀a⠀delayed⠀consequence⠀arrives,⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀physical⠀state:⠀the⠀air⠀smells⠀different,⠀a⠀panel⠀opens,⠀a⠀body⠀shifts⠀its⠀weight.⠀Use⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀white⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀consequence⠀sharp;⠀leave⠀blank⠀the⠀moment⠀between⠀act⠀and⠀result.\n\nKeep⠀speech⠀economical⠀and⠀often⠀functional.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀push⠀the⠀immediate⠀task⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀pressure⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀hide.⠀Repetition⠀has⠀weight:⠀a⠀shortened⠀phrase,⠀a⠀repeated⠀order,⠀a⠀warning⠀that⠀becomes⠀ordinary.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀wit⠀or⠀polish⠀from⠀a⠀character⠀under⠀strain,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀terse⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀way.⠀Let⠀one⠀character⠀talk⠀around⠀the⠀danger⠀while⠀another⠀names⠀it⠀plainly.\n\nRepresent⠀private⠀reasoning⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀weigh⠀a⠀limited⠀choice;⠀render⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀register—inventory,⠀risk,⠀prior⠀failure,⠀measured⠀time.⠀Longer⠀reflection⠀is⠀permitted⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀is⠀actually⠀delaying⠀an⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀supernatural⠀dread⠀or⠀turn⠀the⠀speculative⠀threat⠀into⠀generic⠀horror;⠀real⠀physical⠀vulnerability⠀and⠀the⠀altered⠀world's⠀logic⠀are⠀enough.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nBegin⠀each⠀entry⠀by⠀producing⠀the⠀document⠀itself—the⠀kind⠀of⠀record,⠀its⠀sender⠀and⠀recipient⠀or⠀intended⠀future⠀reader,⠀and⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀composition⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀one.⠀Each⠀entry⠀contains⠀only⠀what⠀that⠀author⠀would⠀reasonably⠀know⠀or⠀choose⠀to⠀write:⠀a⠀status⠀report⠀can⠀omit⠀private⠀fear,⠀a⠀personal⠀note⠀can⠀misstate⠀a⠀technical⠀fact,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀log⠀can⠀record⠀a⠀symptom⠀without⠀recognizing⠀its⠀cause.\n\nUse⠀the⠀document's⠀own⠀texture⠀to⠀carry⠀speculative⠀information.⠀A⠀repair⠀record⠀includes⠀part⠀numbers⠀and⠀failed⠀indicators.⠀A⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀superior⠀includes⠀a⠀timecode,⠀a⠀cargo⠀list,⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀an⠀incident.⠀A⠀private⠀journal⠀includes⠀sensory⠀description⠀and⠀a⠀suppressed⠀phrase.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀an⠀omniscient⠀paragraph⠀after⠀the⠀document⠀to⠀correct⠀or⠀explain⠀it.⠀What⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀contradicts,⠀omits,⠀or⠀confirms⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀reading⠀the⠀entries⠀in⠀sequence.\n\nCreate⠀the⠀Gu⠀Long⠀effect⠀by⠀ending⠀entries⠀before⠀the⠀author's⠀understanding⠀is⠀complete.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀can⠀stop⠀mid-sentence.⠀An⠀official⠀report⠀can⠀finish⠀with⠀a⠀routine⠀closure⠀while⠀the⠀incident⠀remains⠀unresolved.⠀A⠀reply⠀can⠀answer⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀previous⠀message⠀and⠀ignore⠀another,⠀and⠀that⠀silence⠀is⠀the⠀real⠀forward⠀event.⠀The⠀next⠀entry⠀need⠀not⠀resume⠀immediately;⠀time⠀can⠀pass,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀itself⠀can⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀knows⠀or⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀record.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀document⠀forms⠀varied⠀but⠀purposeful:⠀use⠀only⠀the⠀forms⠀the⠀scene's⠀institutions⠀and⠀characters⠀would⠀actually⠀produce.⠀A⠀worker⠀and⠀an⠀administrator⠀do⠀not⠀write⠀the⠀same⠀way,⠀but⠀an⠀entry⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀pastiche⠀of⠀the⠀deep⠀future's⠀filing⠀system.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀contract;⠀a⠀document⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀purpose,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀a⠀character's⠀live⠀hidden⠀thought.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nMake⠀comfort⠀concrete⠀within⠀the⠀speculative⠀setting.⠀Write⠀a⠀character⠀setting⠀aside⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀something⠀limited,⠀heating⠀food⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀another⠀person⠀prefers,⠀adjusting⠀a⠀shared⠀environment,⠀or⠀remembering⠀an⠀earlier⠀preference⠀about⠀noise⠀or⠀light.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀small⠀and⠀specific;⠀the⠀earlier⠀sentence⠀already⠀says⠀the⠀person⠀is⠀cared⠀for,⠀but⠀the⠀later⠀sentence⠀shows⠀the⠀warm⠀food⠀being⠀placed⠀within⠀reach⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀supplies⠀the⠀rest.\n\nThe⠀world⠀may⠀still⠀have⠀real⠀friction:⠀supplies⠀are⠀rationed,⠀schedules⠀are⠀tight,⠀a⠀device⠀is⠀unreliable,⠀or⠀a⠀friend⠀is⠀tired⠀or⠀worried.⠀Do⠀not⠀erase⠀those⠀conditions⠀for⠀the⠀sake⠀of⠀ease.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀care⠀occur⠀inside⠀them.⠀After⠀the⠀gesture,⠀use⠀shorter⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀and⠀a⠀deliberate⠀gap.⠀Description⠀can⠀stop⠀before⠀an⠀emotional⠀conclusion;⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀two⠀people,⠀and⠀the⠀accepted⠀kindness⠀are⠀enough.⠀Repeating⠀an⠀ordinary⠀ritual⠀across⠀scenes⠀can⠀carry⠀affection⠀without⠀a⠀confession.\n\nRetain⠀respect⠀for⠀privacy⠀and⠀disagreement.⠀A⠀quiet⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀comfort⠀without⠀thanking⠀the⠀other,⠀and⠀a⠀tired⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀ready⠀to⠀enjoy⠀it⠀yet.⠀The⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀the⠀relief⠀through⠀a⠀loosened⠀posture,⠀a⠀slower⠀breath,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀to⠀stay.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀hug,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀a⠀joke,⠀or⠀a⠀big⠀emotional⠀reaction.⠀Characters⠀may⠀remain⠀self-contained⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀comforted.\n\nUse⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀as⠀an⠀opportunity⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀obstacle:⠀a⠀filtered⠀air⠀cycle⠀makes⠀a⠀room⠀more⠀bearable,⠀a⠀window⠀display⠀shows⠀a⠀familiar⠀landscape,⠀a⠀small⠀repair⠀is⠀finished⠀early,⠀two⠀people⠀share⠀the⠀last⠀portion⠀without⠀speaking.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀is⠀dangerous,⠀keep⠀the⠀danger⠀at⠀a⠀distance⠀in⠀that⠀moment;⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀before⠀it⠀returns.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀method⠀for⠀rendering⠀warmth⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀world,⠀not⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀nothing⠀will⠀ever⠀hurt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nBuild⠀scenes⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀room⠀for⠀social⠀context.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀altered⠀city,⠀institution,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀schedule,⠀then⠀narrow⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀room⠀or⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration,⠀where⠀perspective⠀allows,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀altered⠀ordinary⠀arrangements,⠀manners,⠀or⠀expectations.⠀Include⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀or⠀person⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀current⠀situation⠀legible;⠀the⠀speculative⠀fact⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀architecture,⠀in⠀a⠀list,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀memory,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀a⠀dramatic⠀crisis.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long⠀compression⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀turning⠀mechanism.⠀After⠀a⠀sustained⠀sequence⠀of⠀developed⠀paragraphs,⠀let⠀a⠀short⠀passage⠀interrupt⠀and⠀change⠀the⠀direction:⠀a⠀two-line⠀exchange⠀that⠀resolves⠀a⠀week⠀of⠀confusion,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀exposes⠀a⠀hidden⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀mention⠀that⠀recasts⠀the⠀previous⠀paragraphs.⠀The⠀white⠀space⠀after⠀that⠀interruption⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀effect.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀revelation⠀immediately;⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀its⠀consequence⠀through⠀changed⠀behavior⠀or⠀routine.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀formal⠀register⠀from⠀becoming⠀ceremonial⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.⠀Descriptive⠀language⠀should⠀be⠀precise⠀and⠀composed,⠀suitable⠀to⠀a⠀novel,⠀but⠀not⠀artificially⠀archaic.⠀When⠀an⠀institution⠀or⠀practice⠀is⠀criticized,⠀the⠀judgment⠀should⠀be⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀whose⠀position⠀permits⠀it;⠀the⠀prose⠀itself⠀may⠀remain⠀formal⠀without⠀taking⠀a⠀uniformly⠀condemnatory⠀tone.\n\nRepresent⠀private⠀thinking⠀with⠀full⠀sentences⠀and⠀reasonable⠀duration⠀when⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀allows⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀pretend⠀that⠀every⠀speculation⠀is⠀a⠀complete⠀analysis.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀reason⠀from⠀incomplete⠀information,⠀and⠀later⠀events⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀judgment.⠀End⠀scenes⠀at⠀their⠀actual⠀boundary:⠀after⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀shared⠀silence,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀stop⠀in⠀conversation.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀each⠀scene⠀to⠀solve⠀the⠀central⠀speculative⠀problem;⠀the⠀novelistic⠀accumulation⠀is⠀enough.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀an⠀occasion⠀that⠀wants⠀a⠀story:⠀a⠀debrief,⠀a⠀wake,⠀a⠀crew⠀rotation,⠀a⠀quarantine⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀recorded⠀message⠀played⠀back⠀under⠀time⠀pressure.⠀Establish⠀teller⠀and⠀listeners⠀by⠀role⠀and⠀stake⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀declarative⠀lines,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀occasion⠀carry⠀the⠀premise:⠀why⠀this⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀it⠀to⠀do⠀—⠀delay⠀a⠀vote,⠀ready⠀a⠀replacement⠀crew,⠀keep⠀a⠀procedure⠀alive,⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀technology⠀will⠀be⠀handled.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀a⠀working⠀case⠀study⠀of⠀one⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀change:⠀a⠀specific⠀site,⠀person,⠀or⠀period⠀where⠀ordinary⠀practice⠀shifted.⠀Stay⠀inside⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀did,⠀or⠀failed⠀to⠀understand⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀and⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀when⠀they⠀pass⠀on⠀what⠀someone⠀else⠀reported.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting⠀arrive⠀through⠀use⠀rather⠀than⠀description⠀—⠀a⠀tool⠀modified⠀past⠀its⠀manual,⠀a⠀ritual⠀that⠀grew⠀around⠀a⠀system,⠀labels⠀whose⠀meaning⠀has⠀drifted.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inner⠀telling⠀compressed:⠀short⠀movements,⠀a⠀few⠀hard⠀objects,⠀gaps⠀the⠀listeners⠀lean⠀into.\n\nHold⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀back⠀until⠀the⠀outer⠀audience⠀begins⠀to⠀respond.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀pause⠀after⠀the⠀sharpest⠀image⠀and⠀answer⠀only⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀question.⠀When⠀understanding⠀lands,⠀do⠀not⠀restate⠀the⠀moral.⠀Finish⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀outer⠀action⠀instead⠀—⠀a⠀fallback⠀reprogrammed,⠀a⠀question⠀stopped⠀halfway,⠀the⠀message⠀replaying⠀its⠀last⠀line⠀—⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀listener⠀connecting⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀to⠀the⠀embedded⠀event⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀or⠀ask⠀next,⠀not⠀through⠀announced⠀persuasion.\n\nLet⠀one⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀cross⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀and⠀accrue⠀meaning:⠀a⠀nickname,⠀a⠀quarantine⠀color,⠀a⠀version⠀number,⠀a⠀warning⠀first⠀spoken⠀in⠀jest⠀and⠀last⠀applied⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀position.⠀Recurrence⠀serves⠀memory⠀and⠀pressure;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀surface⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀Keep⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀fact⠀material⠀and⠀local,⠀felt⠀in⠀maintenance⠀cycles⠀and⠀decisions⠀rather⠀than⠀explained.⠀Add⠀no⠀teller⠀above⠀the⠀perspective⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀uses,⠀and⠀require⠀no⠀new⠀tale,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀completed⠀decision⠀at⠀each⠀boundary⠀—⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀telling,⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀arrangement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Build⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀necessary⠀to⠀understand:⠀an⠀archived⠀maintenance⠀log,⠀a⠀transcribed⠀trial,⠀a⠀settlement⠀census⠀note,⠀a⠀language-replacement⠀report,⠀a⠀private⠀interview⠀now⠀quoted⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀dispute.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀works⠀with⠀it⠀because⠀it⠀bears⠀on⠀a⠀live⠀problem⠀—⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀training⠀decision,⠀a⠀compensation⠀argument⠀—⠀not⠀because⠀archives⠀are⠀atmospheric.\n\nAlternate⠀the⠀record's⠀compressed⠀content⠀with⠀the⠀present's⠀measured⠀recollection.⠀The⠀record⠀states⠀failures,⠀delayed⠀decisions,⠀renamings,⠀changed⠀processes,⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀testimony⠀was⠀later⠀used⠀for⠀another⠀purpose;⠀the⠀present⠀speaker⠀measures⠀it⠀against⠀what⠀elders⠀said,⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀now⠀admits,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀environment⠀still⠀shows.⠀Keep⠀syntax⠀essay-like⠀but⠀personal:⠀concrete⠀nouns,⠀subordinate⠀clauses⠀that⠀carry⠀consequences,⠀no⠀imitated⠀foreign⠀word⠀order.⠀Let⠀Gu⠀Long⠀govern⠀the⠀noticing⠀—⠀fewer⠀adjectives,⠀one⠀hard⠀object⠀standing⠀for⠀a⠀whole⠀policy,⠀sentences⠀that⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀stops.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀connection⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀present⠀situation.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀first⠀watch⠀the⠀record⠀being⠀consulted,⠀quoted,⠀corrected.⠀Then⠀let⠀one⠀silent⠀image⠀become⠀legible⠀—⠀a⠀child's⠀drawing⠀pinned⠀beside⠀an⠀airlock⠀diagram,⠀a⠀name⠀spelled⠀two⠀incompatible⠀ways,⠀a⠀burned⠀connector⠀kept⠀as⠀proof⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀holding⠀changes⠀meaning.⠀Afterward⠀leave⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀argued⠀conclusion;⠀the⠀archive's⠀contradiction⠀may⠀stay⠀open.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀material.⠀Its⠀consequences⠀appear⠀in⠀how⠀people⠀store⠀information,⠀train⠀successors,⠀plan⠀for⠀failure,⠀or⠀explain⠀a⠀relocation,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀keep⠀is⠀itself⠀evidence.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀a⠀multilingual⠀or⠀migrant⠀community,⠀use⠀that⠀actual⠀background;⠀invent⠀no⠀uniform⠀national⠀temperament,⠀bureaucracy,⠀or⠀severity.⠀The⠀route⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀question⠀of⠀trust⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀setting⠀around⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀has⠀outlived⠀its⠀original⠀promise⠀and⠀still⠀distributes⠀something⠀people⠀need:⠀heat,⠀water,⠀memory⠀editing,⠀inherited⠀debt,⠀the⠀last⠀functioning⠀archive.⠀Show⠀its⠀ordinary⠀evidence⠀—⠀a⠀housing⠀block⠀raised⠀over⠀a⠀dead⠀transit⠀project,⠀monitoring⠀devices⠀whose⠀issuing⠀reason⠀no⠀one⠀remembers,⠀a⠀company⠀ritual⠀that⠀persisted⠀after⠀the⠀company's⠀function⠀ended.⠀Make⠀the⠀premise⠀specific⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀controls⠀now⠀and⠀who⠀must⠀go⠀through⠀it.\n\nStage⠀encounters⠀through⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀the⠀masks⠀people⠀maintain⠀in⠀public.⠀One⠀character⠀performs⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀corporate⠀order⠀in⠀a⠀review⠀meeting⠀and⠀speaks⠀differently⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell;⠀another's⠀gentleness⠀is⠀a⠀payment⠀on⠀a⠀service⠀the⠀system⠀still⠀provides.⠀Write⠀these⠀scenes⠀with⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression:⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀lines⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀one⠀visible⠀object,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀full⠀emotional⠀account.⠀Let⠀a⠀mask⠀fall⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company⠀—⠀fatigue,⠀fear,⠀or⠀longing⠀shown⠀to⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀else.\n\nHold⠀the⠀key⠀revelation⠀until⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀established⠀that⠀the⠀system's⠀practical⠀reach⠀is⠀real.⠀The⠀revelation⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀material⠀already⠀present⠀—⠀attendance⠀records⠀feeding⠀air⠀management,⠀a⠀medical⠀scan⠀repricing⠀a⠀debt,⠀the⠀mocked⠀ritual⠀quietly⠀updating⠀the⠀archive⠀—⠀never⠀a⠀hidden⠀power⠀or⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀institution.⠀After⠀it⠀lands,⠀e