nce⠀may⠀resolve⠀into⠀an⠀interface⠀echo,⠀a⠀data⠀bleed,⠀a⠀biotech⠀marker,⠀a⠀phased⠀transmission⠀repeating⠀old⠀maintenance⠀orders,⠀a⠀registry⠀that⠀keeps⠀counting⠀absent⠀people⠀—⠀the⠀fantastic⠀feel⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀teller's⠀limited⠀frame,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀ontological⠀force.⠀Close⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀movement:⠀the⠀character⠀touches⠀the⠀socket,⠀leaves⠀the⠀paper⠀folded,⠀silences⠀the⠀tower,⠀or⠀repeats⠀the⠀child's⠀sentence⠀back.\n\nLet⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀teller⠀the⠀story⠀supplies:⠀a⠀diary-like⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀one⠀reflective⠀sentence;⠀a⠀third-person⠀tale⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀object⠀set⠀down.⠀Require⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness,⠀no⠀mandatory⠀seasonal⠀reference,⠀no⠀spirit⠀logic⠀standing⠀in⠀for⠀cause.⠀Science⠀fiction⠀supplies⠀the⠀mechanism;⠀this⠀route⠀supplies⠀condensation⠀and⠀formal⠀composure;⠀the⠀final⠀image⠀is⠀the⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social-realism⠀and⠀chronicle⠀route.⠀Follow⠀a⠀small⠀network⠀of⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀the⠀story⠀already⠀supplies,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast.⠀Let⠀institutions⠀arrive⠀through⠀specific⠀people:⠀the⠀woman⠀verifying⠀energy⠀credits⠀at⠀the⠀market⠀gate,⠀the⠀driver⠀who⠀knows⠀which⠀road⠀the⠀patrol⠀avoids,⠀the⠀young⠀translator⠀helping⠀older⠀neighbors⠀read⠀the⠀new⠀water-contract⠀interface.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀chronicle⠀from⠀small⠀focal⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀historical⠀summary,⠀each⠀advancing⠀one⠀practical⠀consequence:⠀a⠀delayed⠀shipment,⠀a⠀changed⠀voting⠀restriction,⠀a⠀public⠀screen⠀now⠀listing⠀inheritance⠀status,⠀an⠀archive⠀clinic⠀replacing⠀the⠀local⠀record⠀office.⠀Shape⠀the⠀exchanges⠀with⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀compression⠀—⠀a⠀few⠀lines⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀then⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀report⠀did⠀not⠀say.⠀The⠀system⠀reaches⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀its⠀uneven⠀effects⠀on⠀these⠀lives,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀design⠀lecture.\n\nHold⠀back⠀one⠀detail⠀that⠀revalues⠀the⠀chronicle:⠀the⠀driver's⠀route⠀riding⠀on⠀a⠀debt⠀registered⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀archive,⠀the⠀market⠀gate⠀collecting⠀more⠀than⠀energy⠀data,⠀the⠀translator⠀having⠀once⠀worked⠀on⠀the⠀interface⠀that⠀now⠀refuses⠀her⠀mother⠀service.⠀Reveal⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀—⠀a⠀ticket⠀handed⠀over,⠀a⠀name⠀checked⠀twice,⠀a⠀screen⠀switched⠀off.⠀The⠀consequence⠀must⠀remain⠀materially⠀possible⠀under⠀the⠀supplied⠀science-fictional⠀world;⠀add⠀no⠀marvelous⠀fact⠀where⠀that⠀world⠀excludes⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀language⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀generically⠀regional:⠀use⠀the⠀actual⠀names⠀and⠀phrases⠀the⠀story⠀supplies,⠀and⠀where⠀it⠀supplies⠀none,⠀keep⠀the⠀narration⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀language⠀without⠀manufacturing⠀a⠀regional⠀voice.⠀Testimony⠀from⠀people⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀never⠀met⠀may⠀enter⠀as⠀reported⠀material,⠀marked⠀against⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀observation.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀quiet⠀change⠀—⠀a⠀queue⠀reformatted,⠀a⠀light⠀left⠀on⠀over⠀the⠀archive⠀desk,⠀someone⠀walking⠀away⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀card⠀—⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀recognition⠀unspoken.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaian::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀In⠀the⠀first⠀paragraph⠀place⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀environment⠀where⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀already⠀active:⠀a⠀transfer⠀station⠀with⠀a⠀flickering⠀air-quality⠀board,⠀a⠀training⠀sim⠀showing⠀outdated⠀labels,⠀a⠀permit⠀queue⠀now⠀requiring⠀scan⠀signatures,⠀a⠀dorm⠀corridor⠀lit⠀by⠀repurposed⠀farm⠀lights.⠀Give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀present⠀aim⠀or⠀obstacle,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀technology's⠀history⠀stay⠀untold⠀until⠀a⠀decision⠀needs⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀clear⠀markers⠀—⠀past⠀the⠀sealed⠀door,⠀the⠀corridor⠀turning⠀twice⠀before⠀the⠀ticket⠀hall,⠀a⠀wall⠀terminal⠀tapped⠀without⠀looking⠀up⠀—⠀and⠀break⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀into⠀readable⠀units.⠀After⠀a⠀spoken⠀line,⠀a⠀brief⠀paragraph⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀doubts,⠀or⠀withholds.⠀Present⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name⠀or⠀mechanic⠀plainly⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀it⠀matters,⠀and⠀spend⠀the⠀container's⠀strong⠀visual⠀staging⠀on⠀the⠀consequence⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative⠀gloss.\n\nLet⠀Gu⠀Long⠀control⠀the⠀information⠀flow.⠀The⠀system⠀reaches⠀the⠀reader⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀at⠀a⠀time;⠀exchanges⠀run⠀question,⠀short⠀answer,⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀gesture,⠀silence.⠀Place⠀the⠀delayed⠀recognition⠀where⠀it⠀revalues⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀why⠀the⠀board⠀flickers,⠀what⠀the⠀outdated⠀labels⠀mean,⠀whose⠀signature⠀the⠀queue⠀is⠀waiting⠀for⠀—⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀final⠀image⠀or⠀line,⠀with⠀no⠀appended⠀scientific⠀explanation⠀and⠀no⠀summary⠀of⠀feelings.\n\nReaction⠀beats⠀belong⠀to⠀their⠀owner⠀and⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny;⠀comedy⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀duty,⠀and⠀first⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀requirements.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀image⠀of⠀changed⠀understanding⠀without⠀forcing⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀business⠀around⠀them⠀continues.⠀Keep⠀the⠀premise⠀a⠀definite⠀altered⠀practice⠀—⠀heredity,⠀identity,⠀resource⠀access,⠀public⠀memory,⠀machine⠀debt⠀—⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀school⠀setting,⠀combat⠀system,⠀or⠀power⠀hierarchy⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀already⠀contain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaiao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unsaid.⠀A⠀concrete⠀changed⠀practice,⠀object,⠀or⠀consequence⠀returns⠀at⠀intervals:⠀first⠀as⠀background,⠀then⠀as⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀cannot⠀stop⠀noticing,⠀then⠀as⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀reveals⠀its⠀own⠀cost.⠀Vary⠀the⠀syntax⠀of⠀each⠀return⠀so⠀the⠀repeated⠀image⠀accumulates⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀refrain.\n\nUse⠀the⠀lyric⠀register⠀at⠀points⠀of⠀consequence,⠀not⠀as⠀continuous⠀atmosphere.⠀When⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀becomes⠀present⠀to⠀a⠀character,⠀slow⠀the⠀sentence⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfold⠀far⠀enough⠀to⠀alter⠀what⠀they⠀understand.⠀The⠀comparison⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀maintenance⠀drone's⠀persistent⠀small⠀correction,⠀a⠀worn⠀interface,⠀a⠀rhythm⠀of⠀work⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀require⠀a⠀human⠀hand.⠀Plain⠀sentences⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀give⠀the⠀comparison⠀its⠀contrast.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀distant⠀or⠀disciplined,⠀keep⠀the⠀figurative⠀language⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀revealing⠀fact⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀or⠀action⠀occupy⠀the⠀foreground.⠀The⠀stillness⠀of⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀be⠀broken⠀by⠀a⠀declaration⠀that⠀reorganizes⠀the⠀premise,⠀but⠀the⠀declaration⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀explained.⠀Leave⠀the⠀gap⠀for⠀the⠀reader;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀decline⠀to⠀explain⠀it⠀as⠀well.⠀What⠀they⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀about⠀the⠀speculative⠀state⠀is⠀itself⠀evidence⠀of⠀how⠀normal⠀it⠀has⠀become.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recurrence⠀of⠀vocabulary⠀work⠀like⠀a⠀structural⠀image.⠀A⠀word⠀from⠀the⠀opening⠀of⠀the⠀scene—ordinary⠀in⠀that⠀moment—can⠀return⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀newly⠀inferred⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀the⠀word⠀concrete⠀and⠀belonging⠀to⠀the⠀world:⠀a⠀schedule,⠀a⠀container,⠀a⠀signal,⠀a⠀repair.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀alliteration⠀or⠀sound-patterning⠀onto⠀every⠀clause.⠀The⠀lyric⠀method⠀is⠀rhythmic⠀selection⠀and⠀recurrence,⠀not⠀ornament.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀recognition,⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀still⠀unfinished.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀now⠀sees⠀the⠀changed⠀world⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀and⠀feels⠀the⠀cost⠀the⠀narration⠀has⠀declined⠀to⠀state.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
