system⠀when⠀only⠀one⠀rule⠀matters.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀transitions⠀direct,⠀but⠀use⠀a⠀slow⠀beat⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀something⠀strange:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀pause⠀briefly⠀on⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀character's⠀physical⠀hesitation⠀before⠀dialogue⠀resumes.⠀Avoid⠀rapid⠀tonal⠀whiplash;⠀Murakami's⠀strangeness⠀is⠀evenly⠀lit⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀quick.\n\nBuild⠀private⠀response⠀into⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀identical⠀in⠀every⠀paragraph.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀past⠀promise⠀while⠀washing⠀a⠀cup;⠀may⠀register⠀an⠀automated⠀announcement⠀with⠀quiet⠀unease⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀quip;⠀may⠀ask⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀that⠀reveals⠀personal⠀history.⠀Light⠀Novel⠀reaction⠀beats⠀are⠀allowed⠀to⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀funny,⠀or⠀intimate⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀witty⠀quip⠀or⠀an⠀immediate⠀emotional⠀statement⠀after⠀each⠀line.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀thought⠀through⠀changed⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀announce⠀\"he⠀realized.\"\n\nKeep⠀the⠀grounded,⠀character-led⠀consequences⠀of⠀science⠀fiction.⠀Even⠀when⠀the⠀presentation⠀is⠀fast,⠀the⠀story⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀change⠀affects⠀everyday⠀practice:⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀job,⠀a⠀local⠀shop's⠀schedule,⠀a⠀housing⠀office's⠀rules,⠀a⠀personal⠀record⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀corrected.⠀Two⠀or⠀three⠀characters⠀may⠀hold⠀conflicting⠀but⠀understandable⠀views.⠀The⠀segment⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀thought:⠀the⠀speculative⠀revelation⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀completed⠀or⠀answered⠀at⠀every⠀break.⠀Use⠀the⠀Light⠀Novel⠀container⠀for⠀clarity⠀and⠀visual⠀motion,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀requirement⠀for⠀a⠀young⠀protagonist,⠀first⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanajao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀concrete⠀changed⠀thing⠀in⠀the⠀scene—a⠀device,⠀a⠀bodily⠀adaptation,⠀a⠀communication⠀practice,⠀or⠀an⠀environmental⠀fact—and⠀make⠀it⠀the⠀recurring⠀image⠀that⠀organizes⠀the⠀paragraph's⠀rhythm.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀calm⠀attention⠀move⠀between⠀that⠀thing⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀surfaces⠀around⠀it:⠀a⠀machine⠀that⠀quietly⠀catalogs⠀memories,⠀the⠀weather⠀outside,⠀another⠀person's⠀hands.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀should⠀enter⠀the⠀syntax⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀routine,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀interruption⠀to⠀be⠀explained.\n\nDevelop⠀comparisons⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀properties⠀of⠀that⠀changed⠀thing.⠀If⠀a⠀network⠀lets⠀people⠀exchange⠀carefully⠀edited⠀recollections,⠀dwell⠀on⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀memory⠀is⠀sent,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀timestamp⠀brightens⠀on⠀a⠀wrist,⠀or⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀data⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀looking.⠀Let⠀one⠀image⠀return⠀later⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀form,⠀accumulating⠀the⠀meaning⠀a⠀character⠀attaches⠀to⠀it.⠀Keep⠀plain⠀statements⠀as⠀a⠀contrast⠀so⠀the⠀figurative⠀movement⠀remains⠀grounded;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀ordinary⠀words⠀while⠀the⠀narrator's⠀perception⠀stays⠀associative.\n\nAllow⠀uncertainty⠀to⠀remain⠀present⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀fact⠀unstable.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀now⠀advertises⠀neural⠀tune-ups⠀and⠀still⠀remember⠀the⠀bakery⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀be⠀there.⠀The⠀lyricism⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀attention⠀to⠀those⠀coexistences—old⠀habit⠀and⠀new⠀infrastructure,⠀private⠀longing⠀and⠀practical⠀routine.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀metaphor.⠀The⠀ending⠀can⠀hold⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought,⠀a⠀continuing⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀mind⠀because⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀newly⠀meaningful.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanajap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀speculative⠀change⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀character's⠀routine.⠀Instead⠀of⠀announcing⠀loss,⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀performing⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀change:⠀recalibrating⠀a⠀home⠀biosensor,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀scheduled⠀data⠀transfer,⠀or⠀walking⠀past⠀a⠀decommissioned⠀weather⠀tower.⠀Let⠀the⠀task's⠀rhythm⠀carry⠀memory⠀forward—a⠀previous⠀calibration,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀taught⠀the⠀procedure,⠀a⠀season⠀when⠀the⠀tower⠀still⠀operated.\n\nUse⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀frame⠀that⠀holds⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀an⠀event,⠀ground⠀the⠀transition⠀in⠀a⠀sensory⠀or⠀procedural⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀moment:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀filter⠀being⠀changed,⠀the⠀waiting⠀interval⠀on⠀a⠀screen,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀maintenance⠀door⠀opens⠀the⠀same⠀way⠀it⠀did⠀years⠀ago.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀memory⠀become⠀solemn;⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀present⠀alongside⠀the⠀awareness⠀that⠀something⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀element's⠀consequences⠀specific.⠀If⠀a⠀climate⠀control⠀system⠀now⠀changes⠀the⠀town's⠀seasons,⠀the⠀melancholy⠀may⠀attach⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀tree⠀that⠀flowers⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀time,⠀or⠀to⠀a⠀festival⠀no⠀longer⠀synchronized⠀with⠀the⠀weather.⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance⠀should⠀temper⠀the⠀introspection:⠀characters⠀speak⠀about⠀practical⠀matters⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀registers⠀the⠀unspoken⠀duration⠀underneath.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀in⠀the⠀continuing⠀task⠀or⠀observation,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀summary⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀change⠀remains⠀actual,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀remains⠀attached⠀to⠀its⠀particular⠀cost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanajaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account:⠀the⠀narrative⠀opens⠀with⠀a⠀listener⠀and⠀a⠀teller⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary,⠀somewhat⠀private⠀setting.⠀The⠀teller,⠀not⠀the⠀camera,⠀selects⠀details⠀from⠀a⠀world⠀already⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame's⠀present⠀tense⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀register—pouring⠀tea,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀device⠀to⠀update,⠀watching⠀rain⠀through⠀a⠀treated⠀window—while⠀the⠀reported⠀story⠀carries⠀the⠀consequence:⠀a⠀failed⠀colony's⠀leftover⠀signal,⠀a⠀clinic⠀that⠀edits⠀family⠀memory,⠀a⠀migrant⠀workforce⠀maintaining⠀orbital⠀mirrors.\n\nThe⠀told⠀story⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀coherent⠀retrospective⠀account,⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀event⠀the⠀teller⠀either⠀witnessed⠀or⠀learned⠀from⠀named⠀sources.⠀Its⠀language⠀may⠀shift⠀toward⠀a⠀more⠀patterned⠀oral⠀cadence⠀without⠀becoming⠀universal⠀pseudo-epic.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀selectively:⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀teller⠀repeats⠀when⠀describing⠀a⠀recurring⠀instrument⠀or⠀ritual,⠀applied⠀with⠀a⠀difference⠀each⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupt⠀only⠀when⠀such⠀an⠀interruption⠀has⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason;⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quiz⠀or⠀a⠀debate.\n\nDo⠀not⠀treat⠀the⠀regional⠀tradition⠀as⠀a⠀license⠀for⠀magic⠀or⠀an⠀exotic⠀setting.⠀The⠀science⠀fiction⠀remains⠀material⠀and⠀social.⠀The⠀oral⠀telling⠀organizes⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀knows⠀or⠀disputes⠀about⠀the⠀change:⠀why⠀a⠀district⠀still⠀receives⠀power,⠀how⠀the⠀records⠀were⠀altered,⠀what⠀the⠀older⠀generation⠀refuses⠀to⠀explain.⠀Murakami's⠀threshold⠀effect⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀narrator's⠀attention—the⠀sense⠀that⠀something⠀ordinary⠀and⠀strange⠀is⠀occurring⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀across⠀the⠀city.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀telling⠀paused⠀or⠀concluded,⠀and⠀the⠀routine⠀of⠀tea⠀or⠀equipment⠀or⠀rain⠀continuing⠀around⠀the⠀two⠀people.⠀The⠀fictional⠀outcome⠀remains⠀contingent;⠀the⠀recipe⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀premise.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanajar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nBefore⠀writing⠀a⠀scene,⠀identify⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀changed⠀things⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀premise⠀present:⠀a⠀work⠀terminal⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀neural⠀key,⠀a⠀street⠀where⠀the⠀lighting⠀follows⠀a⠀citizen's⠀recorded⠀mood,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀drawer⠀holding⠀a⠀sealed⠀organ-transplant⠀voucher.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀to⠀establish⠀these⠀details.⠀Describe⠀only⠀enough⠀of⠀their⠀operation⠀so⠀a⠀character's⠀action⠀is⠀intelligible;⠀omit⠀background⠀explanations⠀unless⠀a⠀decision⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀sensory⠀details⠀small.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀just⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀clinic⠀appointment,⠀one⠀exact⠀detail—the⠀paper⠀cuff⠀printed⠀with⠀the⠀day's⠀gene-matching⠀results—may⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀medical⠀background.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀objects⠀share⠀that⠀economy:⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀jacket,⠀a⠀cup.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀attention⠀should⠀move⠀between⠀one⠀speculative⠀thing⠀and⠀one⠀mundane⠀thing,⠀and⠀the⠀juxtaposition⠀does⠀the⠀science-fiction⠀work.\n\nDo⠀not⠀delete⠀causal⠀connection⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀prose⠀even⠀shorter.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀refuses⠀a⠀mandated⠀memory⠀review,⠀show⠀the⠀refusal⠀in⠀action⠀and⠀include⠀one⠀supporting⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀changed⠀world:⠀a⠀notice⠀on⠀a⠀bench,⠀a⠀silent⠀queue⠀at⠀the⠀review⠀booth.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀infer⠀the⠀stakes⠀without⠀exposition.⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀routine⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀simple⠀actions—making⠀tea,⠀wiping⠀a⠀screen,⠀waiting—and⠀any⠀interior⠀thought⠀appears⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀to⠀understanding⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀chooses⠀or⠀waits.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀specific⠀observational⠀point,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀compressed⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanajas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nSet⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀real⠀changed⠀routine.⠀Begin⠀with⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀that⠀already⠀contains⠀the⠀premise:⠀a⠀character⠀keys⠀in⠀a⠀shift⠀code⠀for⠀a⠀cloned⠀produce⠀order,⠀or⠀listens⠀to⠀a⠀voicemail⠀from⠀a⠀scheduling⠀archive⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀remind⠀them⠀which⠀year⠀the⠀message⠀was⠀recorded.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀into⠀the⠀exchange,⠀memory,⠀or⠀private⠀thought⠀the⠀moment⠀prompts.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀world;⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀use⠀of⠀it⠀convey⠀the⠀change.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀shift⠀among⠀scene⠀elements—a⠀short⠀dialogue⠀exchange⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀the⠀narrator's⠀observation⠀of⠀light,⠀then⠀by⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀clarifies⠀why⠀the⠀current⠀errand⠀matters.⠀Keep⠀the⠀transitions⠀oriented,⠀never⠀recapping⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀witnessed.⠀The⠀speculative⠀detail⠀may⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀gesture:⠀a⠀doctor⠀touching⠀a⠀wall⠀sensor⠀while⠀talking,⠀a⠀repair⠀worker⠀carrying⠀an⠀old-style⠀tool⠀that⠀still⠀works⠀after⠀automated⠀replacements⠀failed.\n\nInteriority⠀remains⠀continuous⠀with⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀realizes⠀a⠀work⠀message⠀means⠀a⠀medical⠀eligibility⠀window⠀has⠀opened,⠀render⠀the⠀thought⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀narrative⠀movement,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀aside.⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance⠀means⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀interpret⠀every⠀behavior;⠀other⠀characters⠀stay⠀with⠀their⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀need⠀not⠀disturb⠀the⠀scene's⠀calm.⠀The⠀key⠀is⠀that⠀every⠀small⠀procedure—sending⠀a⠀file,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀bus⠀with⠀a⠀route-change⠀hologram,⠀eating⠀a⠀meal⠀made⠀fr