aracters⠀reveal⠀themselves⠀in⠀long⠀exchanges⠀whose⠀sentences⠀are⠀balanced⠀and⠀indirect.⠀A⠀refusal⠀may⠀be⠀phrased⠀as⠀concern⠀for⠀a⠀relative;⠀an⠀accusation⠀may⠀be⠀tucked⠀inside⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀an⠀unpaid⠀share.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀record⠀these⠀maneuvers⠀with⠀mild⠀irony,⠀but⠀each⠀character⠀must⠀retain⠀a⠀specific⠀inner⠀logic.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀thinks,⠀use⠀free⠀indirect⠀discourse⠀that⠀shifts⠀smoothly⠀between⠀external⠀scene⠀and⠀internal⠀reaction,⠀always⠀traceable⠀to⠀that⠀person's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀situation.\n\nLet⠀speculative⠀elements⠀enter⠀through⠀social⠀practice⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀A⠀changed⠀law⠀of⠀inheritance,⠀a⠀public⠀registry,⠀a⠀medical⠀procedure⠀with⠀class⠀consequences,⠀a⠀household's⠀reliance⠀on⠀a⠀service⠀entity—these⠀appear⠀as⠀matters⠀of⠀reputation,⠀means,⠀and⠀family⠀expectation.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀stately⠀and⠀reflective,⠀but⠀never⠀merely⠀decorative.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀turn⠀in⠀conversation⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀balance⠀has⠀been⠀made⠀clear,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀resolution⠀of⠀the⠀larger⠀speculative⠀question.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀conditions⠀and⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀boundaries.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanakah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀present⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀world:⠀a⠀named⠀occasion,⠀a⠀specific⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀immediate⠀pressure—a⠀debt,⠀a⠀postponed⠀decision,⠀a⠀rumor,⠀or⠀an⠀offer⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀been⠀accepted.⠀Let⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀render⠀one⠀everyday⠀practice,⠀institution,⠀body,⠀means⠀of⠀communication,⠀kind⠀of⠀work,⠀or⠀possible⠀future⠀already⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀premise,⠀so⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀recognize⠀their⠀own⠀circumstances⠀from⠀an⠀angle.⠀The⠀teller⠀shapes⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀persuade,⠀entertain,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀or⠀solicit⠀an⠀offer,⠀and⠀that⠀aim⠀controls⠀what⠀is⠀included,⠀repeated,⠀or⠀left⠀out.⠀Write⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀performance⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀interruptions⠀and⠀resumptions,⠀not⠀as⠀neutral⠀report.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀attention⠀for⠀the⠀outer⠀exchange.⠀Notice⠀each⠀listener's⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀tale:⠀money,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀reputation,⠀a⠀possible⠀proposal⠀of⠀practical⠀cooperation,⠀or⠀the⠀hope⠀of⠀being⠀contradicted.⠀Courtesy⠀and⠀omission⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much⠀weight⠀as⠀direct⠀speech.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀narrator⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀listener,⠀never⠀to⠀an⠀unmarked⠀universal⠀voice;⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀judged,⠀keep⠀the⠀judgment⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀observer's⠀assumptions.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀be⠀touching⠀or⠀exemplary⠀without⠀proving⠀its⠀own⠀truth.⠀Let⠀a⠀listener⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀teller's⠀access,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀knowledge,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀tension⠀social⠀interpretation⠀rather⠀than⠀evidence⠀to⠀close;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀investigation.\n\nMake⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀Open⠀and⠀close⠀the⠀inset⠀tale⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀words,⠀and⠀then⠀resume⠀the⠀frame⠀through⠀the⠀audience's⠀immediate⠀response:⠀a⠀changed⠀silence,⠀a⠀redirected⠀obligation,⠀an⠀attempt⠀to⠀seize⠀the⠀tale⠀for⠀another⠀purpose.⠀Recurring⠀phrases,⠀objects,⠀or⠀named⠀institutions⠀are⠀opportunities⠀for⠀revision:⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀sounded⠀generous⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀can⠀register⠀as⠀defensive⠀when⠀repeated⠀at⠀the⠀frame,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀treated⠀as⠀novelty⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀practical⠀threat⠀once⠀a⠀listener⠀applies⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀present.⠀Resolve⠀the⠀tale⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀outer⠀story⠀reopens⠀with⠀altered⠀mutual⠀understanding,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀moral⠀pronounced⠀once⠀and⠀then⠀closed.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀during⠀a⠀listening⠀silence,⠀an⠀interrupted⠀account,⠀a⠀newly⠀perceived⠀implication,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀offer⠀while⠀the⠀speculative⠀stakes⠀remain⠀live.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanakai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀social⠀and⠀developmental⠀realism⠀as⠀the⠀German-language⠀route.⠀Use⠀a⠀continuous⠀third-person⠀narration⠀that⠀follows⠀a⠀small⠀social⠀circle⠀over⠀an⠀observable⠀interval,⠀tracing⠀how⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀alters⠀habits,⠀occupations,⠀costs,⠀and⠀relationships.⠀The⠀premise⠀should⠀already⠀inhabit⠀an⠀institution—an⠀office,⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀guarantee—by⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀scene⠀opens,⠀so⠀dialogue⠀can⠀expose⠀local⠀adjustment,⠀resistance,⠀or⠀accidental⠀advantage⠀as⠀facts⠀of⠀work⠀and⠀property⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀spectacular⠀intrusion.\n\nApply⠀Austen's⠀social⠀scrutiny⠀within⠀this⠀realism.⠀Pay⠀specific⠀attention⠀to⠀money,⠀offers,⠀omissions,⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀believe⠀their⠀own⠀position⠀allows⠀them⠀to⠀say.⠀Let⠀a⠀courteous⠀acceptance⠀covertly⠀acknowledge⠀a⠀cost,⠀or⠀an⠀offer⠀of⠀help⠀reveal⠀a⠀claim⠀of⠀authority.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀must⠀remain⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀character⠀or⠀narrator:⠀if⠀the⠀narration⠀says⠀someone⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀situation,⠀render⠀that⠀thought⠀as⠀that⠀person's⠀plausible⠀reasoning,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀detached⠀maxim.⠀Keep⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀under⠀the⠀control⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀continuous⠀third-person⠀teller;⠀do⠀not⠀mimic⠀a⠀translated⠀sentence⠀or⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀voice.⠀The⠀pause⠀of⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀workplace⠀errand,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀visit⠀is⠀enough⠀for⠀a⠀social⠀exchange⠀to⠀carry⠀several⠀readings.\n\nMake⠀the⠀developmental⠀arc⠀visible⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀concrete⠀sites⠀and⠀phrases.⠀A⠀room⠀that⠀seemed⠀sufficient⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀story⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀described⠀in⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀change;⠀a⠀phrase⠀one⠀character⠀repeats⠀about⠀adaptability⠀may⠀shift⠀from⠀comfort⠀to⠀reproach;⠀a⠀repeated⠀errand⠀or⠀meeting⠀may⠀reveal⠀a⠀cost⠀that⠀had⠀been⠀absorbed⠀silently.⠀Keep⠀knowledge⠀uneven:⠀each⠀household⠀or⠀colleague⠀may⠀understand⠀a⠀different⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀new⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀is⠀obliged⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀system.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀during⠀continuing⠀social⠀interchange⠀with⠀the⠀material⠀stakes⠀still⠀unresolved;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀explanatory⠀turn.⠀Keep⠀the⠀tone⠀precise⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀solemn⠀or⠀satirical.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanakaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀each⠀encounter⠀around⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀arrangement⠀and⠀a⠀new⠀speculative⠀practice.⠀Let⠀a⠀surviving⠀privilege,⠀inherited⠀technology,⠀legacy⠀contract,⠀or⠀old⠀social⠀rank⠀impose⠀itself⠀through⠀the⠀maintenance,⠀pricing,⠀access,⠀or⠀failure⠀of⠀ordinary⠀systems:⠀transit,⠀power,⠀data,⠀credit,⠀or⠀local⠀services⠀now⠀carry⠀the⠀remembered⠀authority.⠀Make⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀a⠀mechanism⠀of⠀authority⠀whose⠀daily⠀cost⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀specific⠀rooms,⠀lifts,⠀stairwells,⠀or⠀lobbies;⠀show⠀whose⠀practical⠀lives⠀it⠀touches,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀system⠀from⠀a⠀distance.\n\nKeep⠀Austen's⠀social⠀masking⠀in⠀force⠀under⠀this⠀pressure.⠀Characters⠀observe⠀manners,⠀cost,⠀dependence,⠀and⠀reputation⠀as⠀tools⠀for⠀negotiating⠀with⠀the⠀old⠀order,⠀and⠀polite⠀deference⠀as⠀often⠀a⠀demand⠀as⠀a⠀submission.⠀An⠀offer⠀of⠀protection⠀may⠀impose⠀an⠀obligation;⠀a⠀courteous⠀acceptance⠀may⠀disclose⠀a⠀threat.⠀In⠀trusted⠀company,⠀allow⠀a⠀mask⠀to⠀fall⠀through⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀or⠀an⠀unguarded⠀look,⠀but⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀character⠀would⠀permit⠀it.⠀Give⠀the⠀narrator⠀a⠀controlled⠀free⠀indirect⠀view;⠀every⠀judgment⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀observer.⠀Desires⠀are⠀real⠀and⠀often⠀morally⠀mixed—loyalty,⠀convenience,⠀resentment,⠀attraction,⠀ambition—without⠀every⠀intimacy⠀becoming⠀a⠀manipulative⠀plot.\n\nLet⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀an⠀event⠀is⠀experienced⠀rather⠀than⠀supply⠀explanations.⠀A⠀decaying⠀building⠀can⠀embody⠀the⠀old⠀system⠀when⠀its⠀public⠀services⠀still⠀work⠀under⠀special⠀rules;⠀a⠀private,⠀well-kept⠀room⠀can⠀show⠀how⠀one⠀person⠀benefits⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀decay.⠀History⠀and⠀present⠀need⠀not⠀agree:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀maintain⠀an⠀old⠀form⠀while⠀using⠀a⠀new⠀speculative⠀capacity⠀for⠀self-protection.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀realized⠀implication,⠀a⠀refused⠀audience,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀character⠀absorbs⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀deal;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀external⠀pursuit⠀to⠀pause⠀and⠀produce⠀a⠀resolution.⠀Avoid⠀importing⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀supernatural⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀inherited⠀power.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanakak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Convey⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀a⠀tale,⠀anecdote,⠀or⠀precedented⠀episode⠀that⠀one⠀character⠀recounts⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀audience;⠀allow⠀a⠀second,⠀shorter⠀account⠀to⠀correct,⠀interrupt,⠀or⠀challenge⠀the⠀first,⠀and⠀have⠀the⠀audience⠀compare⠀the⠀two⠀before⠀the⠀frame⠀resumes.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀appear⠀inside⠀the⠀told⠀world⠀as⠀custom,⠀device,⠀obligation,⠀change⠀of⠀body,⠀labor,⠀or⠀governance,⠀and⠀should⠀then⠀echo⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀frame.⠀Let⠀the⠀telling⠀happen⠀at⠀a⠀social⠀occasion—a⠀visit,⠀meal,⠀journey,⠀gathering,⠀or⠀negotiation—where⠀the⠀audience⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀listen.\n\nApply⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀story.⠀People⠀care⠀about⠀family,⠀property,⠀reputation,⠀offers⠀of⠀help,⠀and⠀the⠀burden⠀of⠀obligation.⠀A⠀tale⠀can⠀support⠀a⠀claim,⠀soften⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀warn⠀a⠀child;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀selectively⠀silent⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀understood.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners⠀weigh⠀the⠀teller's⠀interest⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀accepting⠀the⠀story's⠀lesson,⠀so⠀a⠀polite⠀reception⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀negotiation⠀rather⠀than⠀applause.⠀Use⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀owner,⠀normally⠀the⠀present⠀focal⠀character,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀inset⠀tale⠀is⠀long.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀characters⠀uniformly⠀polished⠀or⠀their⠀motives⠀uniformly⠀generous.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀explicit.⠀Mark⠀the⠀tale's⠀opening⠀and⠀return⠀so⠀readers⠀always⠀know⠀which⠀world⠀is⠀present.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀ornament⠀to⠀legal⠀or⠀economic⠀consequence⠀when⠀someone⠀repeats⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀story.⠀Allow⠀the⠀named⠀community,⠀region,⠀or⠀language⠀actually⠀supplied⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀tale's⠀genre⠀and⠀occasion;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀religion,⠀caste,⠀code-switching,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀joint⠀family.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀oral⠀without⠀being⠀archaic.⠀Continue⠀through⠀the⠀audience's⠀immediate⠀response,⠀the⠀teller's⠀management⠀of⠀that⠀response,⠀or⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀another⠀account;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀neat⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀explanation⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanakal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Present⠀the⠀story⠀chiefly⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀dated⠀or⠀titled⠀recollections,⠀notes,⠀and⠀reflective⠀passages—a⠀composed⠀private⠀record⠀rather⠀than⠀live⠀first-person⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀instant.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀enter⠀through⠀recorded⠀work,⠀household⠀practice,⠀bodily⠀change,⠀news,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀social⠀expectation;⠀if⠀the⠀diarist⠀explains⠀a⠀local⠀practice,⠀make⠀the⠀explanation⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record's⠀present⠀effort⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀of⠀it,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀technical⠀aside.⠀Later⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀entry,⠀this⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀they⠀had⠀not⠀been⠀able⠀to⠀say⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀Let⠀the⠀record⠀move⠀among⠀observation,⠀remembered⠀conversation,⠀and⠀later⠀judgment.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀scrutiny⠀inside⠀the⠀diarist's⠀style.⠀The⠀writer⠀notices⠀money,⠀service,⠀omission,⠀family⠀pressure,⠀and⠀what⠀courtesy⠀allowed⠀or⠀concealed.⠀A⠀recorded⠀conversation⠀may⠀carry⠀several⠀meanings⠀precisely⠀because⠀the⠀diarist⠀recognizes⠀its⠀social⠀form.⠀Keep⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀diarist:⠀even⠀private⠀resentment,⠀hope,⠀or⠀self-approval⠀should⠀read⠀as⠀that⠀person's⠀actual⠀thought,⠀not⠀as⠀narrator⠀commentary.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀wholly⠀transparent⠀mind;⠀the⠀person⠀chooses⠀what⠀to⠀record⠀and⠀often⠀revises⠀its⠀meaning⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀passage.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀distinct⠀form⠀across⠀the⠀scene.⠀Mark⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀day⠀or⠀topic⠀when⠀the⠀diary⠀returns;⠀let⠀the⠀present⠀event⠀be⠀reflected⠀on,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀witnessed⠀as⠀it⠀happens.⠀Short,⠀plain⠀statements⠀and⠀direct⠀feeling⠀are⠀available,⠀as⠀are⠀seasonal⠀or⠀material⠀details⠀when⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀warrants⠀them;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀seasonal⠀inventory,⠀quietness,⠀or⠀unvarying⠀restraint.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀can⠀be⠀felt⠀in⠀a⠀repeated⠀motif—a⠀changed⠀route,⠀a⠀formal⠀greeting,⠀a⠀price—that⠀the⠀diarist⠀begins⠀by⠀noting⠀and⠀later⠀interprets⠀differently.⠀End⠀while⠀the⠀record⠀continues⠀through⠀reflection,⠀rereading,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀observation;⠀no⠀external⠀task⠀or⠀resolved⠀insight⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanakam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Present⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀situated⠀accounts:⠀select⠀a⠀primary⠀account⠀suited⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀community—a⠀neighbor's⠀report,⠀an⠀official⠀record,⠀a⠀family⠀memory,⠀a⠀worker's⠀complaint,⠀or⠀a⠀formal⠀petition—and⠀bring⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀second⠀account⠀whose⠀timing,⠀blame,⠀or⠀stated⠀cause⠀does⠀not⠀align⠀with⠀the⠀first.⠀Let⠀each⠀account⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀and⠀occasion,⠀so⠀the⠀disagreement⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀puzzle⠀to⠀solve.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀to⠀work,⠀water,⠀land,⠀credit,⠀transport,⠀health,⠀communication,⠀or⠀legal⠀status—experienced⠀unevenly⠀across⠀the⠀community.⠀Keep⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀region,⠀and⠀history⠀precise⠀when⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀realism⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀it,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀whole⠀community⠀one⠀voice.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀attention⠀within⠀testimonial⠀prose.⠀People⠀negotiate⠀offers,⠀obligations,⠀family⠀reputation,⠀and⠀especially⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said⠀to⠀whom.⠀A⠀courteous⠀letter⠀may⠀conceal⠀a⠀threat;⠀a⠀refusal⠀may⠀protect⠀a⠀dependent;⠀a⠀public⠀claim⠀may⠀test⠀whether⠀anyone⠀will⠀support⠀it.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀should⠀remain⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀focal⠀character⠀even⠀when⠀other⠀voices⠀are⠀quoted.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀weighs⠀a⠀speaker,⠀let⠀the⠀private⠀reading⠀notice⠀what⠀that⠀speaker⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀about⠀money,⠀blame,⠀or⠀obligation;⠀do⠀not⠀allow⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀flatten⠀the⠀judgment⠀into⠀moral⠀commentary⠀for⠀the⠀reader.\n\nHandle⠀perspective⠀and⠀time⠀explicitly.⠀When⠀a⠀chronicle⠀passage⠀reports⠀an⠀event⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀witness,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀report,⠀memory,⠀or⠀written⠀record;⠀later⠀knowledge⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀retrofitted⠀into⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀Use⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀between⠀records⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀speculative⠀system⠀intelligible⠀from⠀below:⠀one⠀character⠀knows⠀the⠀r