ons⠀the⠀world⠀actually⠀names⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀them⠀into⠀one⠀regional⠀flavor.\n\nManage⠀information⠀as⠀the⠀storyteller⠀chooses,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀event⠀strictly⠀happened:⠀a⠀decision⠀may⠀be⠀withheld⠀until⠀the⠀next⠀gathering⠀if⠀that⠀delay⠀is⠀the⠀teller's⠀art.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀erase⠀interiority⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀makes⠀available;⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀thought⠀on⠀a⠀remembered⠀evening.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀episode⠀or⠀after⠀the⠀teller⠀promises⠀another⠀part,⠀and⠀never⠀by⠀announcing⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀now⠀become⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanalar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀speculative⠀world,⠀each⠀one⠀revealing⠀a⠀changed⠀practice:⠀a⠀heat⠀seam⠀on⠀a⠀uniform⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀cleared⠀berth⠀where⠀a⠀certain⠀craft⠀used⠀to⠀dock,⠀a⠀ration⠀token⠀placed⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀slot,⠀a⠀window⠀left⠀open⠀against⠀atmospheric⠀sensor⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀whole⠀system⠀at⠀once.⠀Let⠀one⠀precise⠀fact⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀larger⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀sentence⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀arrangement⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀characters.\n\nWrite⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Prefer⠀the⠀short⠀sentence,⠀but⠀let⠀a⠀thought⠀run⠀longer⠀when⠀the⠀connection⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀the⠀length;⠀shortness⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota,⠀and⠀one⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Omit⠀transition⠀phrases⠀and⠀redundant⠀indicators⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes:⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀an⠀answer⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀difficulty⠀without⠀a⠀following⠀sentence⠀explaining⠀that⠀it⠀did.⠀Let⠀decisions⠀stay⠀intelligible⠀through⠀action,⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀and⠀exact⠀perception,⠀and⠀leave⠀omissions⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀deleting⠀causality.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀concern⠀with⠀loyalty⠀and⠀reputation⠀into⠀the⠀room⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀paragraphs⠀are⠀brief.⠀Make⠀them⠀public⠀facts:⠀a⠀sealed⠀order,⠀an⠀unasked-for⠀escort,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀mark⠀on⠀a⠀dispatch,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀before⠀witnesses.⠀Private⠀attachment⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced;⠀it⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀practical⠀choice⠀of⠀whom⠀to⠀inform⠀or⠀whose⠀task⠀is⠀taken⠀over.⠀Treat⠀restraint⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀refusal⠀to⠀use⠀a⠀technique,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀omission⠀visible:⠀the⠀hand⠀does⠀not⠀press⠀the⠀command⠀plate;⠀the⠀second⠀breather⠀stays⠀sealed.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀to⠀manage⠀pace⠀and⠀disclosure.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀answer⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀may⠀turn⠀evidence⠀into⠀a⠀decision.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀witty⠀or⠀combative;⠀keep⠀each⠀voice⠀individual⠀without⠀expanding⠀a⠀line⠀into⠀a⠀block⠀of⠀characterization.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀statement⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀step;⠀a⠀climactic⠀gesture⠀or⠀reflection⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanalas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀scene⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀point⠀of⠀view.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀appear⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀ordinary⠀practice:⠀a⠀travel⠀clearance,⠀a⠀new⠀way⠀of⠀sending⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀changed⠀procedure⠀at⠀a⠀port⠀or⠀training⠀site,⠀a⠀difference⠀in⠀how⠀an⠀injury⠀is⠀treated.⠀The⠀characters⠀encounter⠀these⠀consequences⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Explain⠀only⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀makes⠀the⠀present⠀decision⠀or⠀experience⠀intelligible,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀without⠀labeling⠀the⠀shifts.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.\n\nKeep⠀allegiance⠀and⠀public⠀consequence⠀inside⠀the⠀contemporary⠀register.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀weigh⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀against⠀a⠀new⠀order,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀former⠀ally⠀now⠀serves⠀another⠀institution.⠀Give⠀such⠀moments⠀room—a⠀journey⠀or⠀a⠀negotiation⠀can⠀develop⠀across⠀pages—but⠀avoid⠀formal⠀speeches⠀and⠀solemn⠀pronouncement.⠀Treat⠀loyalty⠀as⠀a⠀practical,⠀social,⠀and⠀emotional⠀matter⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀theme⠀to⠀be⠀stated.⠀Let⠀reputation⠀arise⠀through⠀how⠀others⠀behave,⠀through⠀an⠀official⠀record,⠀or⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀has⠀chosen⠀before,⠀particular⠀to⠀this⠀story⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀admiring⠀aside.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀as⠀ordinary⠀communication,⠀not⠀a⠀screen⠀for⠀information.⠀Speakers⠀may⠀give⠀incomplete⠀accounts,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀ask⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀point-of-view⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀answer⠀at⠀once;⠀their⠀voices⠀remain⠀individual.⠀Report⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀understands,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀assign⠀private⠀thoughts⠀to⠀others.⠀Perception⠀and⠀reflection⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.\n\nEnd⠀after⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀or⠀a⠀settled⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀conclude⠀while⠀an⠀action⠀is⠀still⠀underway⠀or⠀while⠀a⠀decision⠀has⠀only⠀begun⠀to⠀gather⠀its⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀into⠀every⠀reply.⠀Let⠀the⠀premise⠀keep⠀mattering⠀in⠀ordinary⠀ways:⠀it⠀may⠀alter⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀trusted,⠀how⠀far⠀a⠀message⠀reaches,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀is⠀for.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanalat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀around⠀the⠀established⠀or⠀developing⠀relationship⠀the⠀premise⠀supplies.⠀If⠀they⠀are⠀rivals,⠀let⠀the⠀speculative⠀invention⠀sharpen⠀both⠀the⠀competition⠀and⠀the⠀forced⠀cooperation.⠀If⠀they⠀are⠀friends⠀or⠀partners,⠀let⠀a⠀changed⠀order⠀test⠀what⠀one⠀may⠀still⠀do⠀for⠀the⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀the⠀actual⠀premise⠀determines⠀which⠀repeated⠀moments,⠀private⠀phrases,⠀and⠀withheld⠀truths⠀become⠀meaningful.⠀The⠀relationship⠀is⠀the⠀through-line⠀and⠀the⠀organizing⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀subplot⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀mission.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀touch⠀the⠀practical⠀space⠀between⠀them:⠀a⠀restricted⠀frequency⠀they⠀alone⠀can⠀hear,⠀a⠀sealed⠀route⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀can⠀still⠀authorize,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀under⠀new⠀ration⠀rules,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀its⠀sender⠀has⠀changed⠀allegiance.⠀The⠀technology⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained⠀at⠀length;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀the⠀new⠀constraint⠀or⠀permission⠀they⠀must⠀navigate⠀together.⠀Keep⠀the⠀attention⠀to⠀loyalty⠀and⠀reputation⠀inside⠀that⠀intimacy.⠀One⠀may⠀hold⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀that⠀prevents⠀a⠀private⠀welcome;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀answer⠀to⠀a⠀teacher⠀or⠀an⠀order⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀yet⠀want⠀to⠀repeat.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀callbacks⠀that⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀history:⠀a⠀phrase⠀said⠀once⠀during⠀a⠀repair,⠀the⠀habit⠀of⠀leaving⠀the⠀second⠀cup,⠀a⠀nickname⠀given⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀witnesses.⠀Let⠀the⠀later⠀recurrence⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀retrospective⠀summary,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀callback⠀into⠀every⠀scene.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀the⠀premise⠀warrants.⠀Reveal⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience—desire,⠀dread,⠀resolution,⠀relief—without⠀turning⠀each⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀confession.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relationship's⠀actual⠀obligations⠀and⠀tensions.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀speak⠀or⠀act⠀contrary⠀to⠀private⠀feeling⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀specific⠀to⠀them:⠀pride,⠀protection,⠀duty,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀a⠀misread⠀attention.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀shared⠀moment⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀larger⠀dispute,⠀or⠀after⠀a⠀departure⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀uncertain.⠀A⠀confession,⠀a⠀kiss,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀measure⠀of⠀mutual⠀understanding⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀in⠀any⠀particular⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanalau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nWrite⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀one⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀told⠀before⠀and⠀will⠀be⠀told⠀again.⠀Open⠀deliberately:⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration,⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀statement⠀of⠀what⠀was⠀remembered.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀opening—a⠀person⠀known⠀for⠀one⠀act⠀who⠀later⠀does⠀another,⠀an⠀oath⠀fulfilled⠀under⠀private⠀cost,⠀a⠀journey⠀whose⠀stages⠀are⠀named.⠀The⠀narration⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀teller⠀who⠀relates⠀deeds⠀and⠀their⠀consequences.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀expansive⠀social⠀movement⠀inside⠀the⠀saga⠀register.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀an⠀encounter⠀to⠀a⠀few⠀blows;⠀give⠀a⠀confrontation⠀its⠀causal⠀stages—departure,⠀travel,⠀negotiation,⠀preparation,⠀restraint,⠀aftermath.⠀Explain⠀a⠀technique⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀body⠀when⠀its⠀operation⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀decision⠀being⠀made,⠀keeping⠀the⠀explanation⠀a⠀practical⠀matter⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Keep⠀public⠀reputation⠀and⠀private⠀attachment⠀distinct:⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀a⠀community⠀calls⠀someone⠀while⠀the⠀inward⠀cost⠀remains⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀a⠀recurrent⠀fact⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀world:⠀the⠀first⠀time⠀a⠀gate⠀opened⠀without⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀season⠀the⠀transmissions⠀stopped,⠀the⠀year⠀a⠀newly⠀modified⠀body⠀left⠀training⠀and⠀returned⠀with⠀an⠀altered⠀sign.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀where⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application;⠀a⠀designation⠀recurs⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀uses⠀it,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration⠀on⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Let⠀oaths,⠀kinship,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀or⠀feuds⠀organize⠀events⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀established⠀them,⠀without⠀treating⠀them⠀as⠀required⠀ornaments.⠀The⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀is⠀the⠀teller's⠀own:⠀omit⠀or⠀delay⠀information⠀when⠀the⠀retelling's⠀art⠀justifies⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀hide⠀interiority⠀the⠀selected⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀permits.\n\nEnd⠀with⠀an⠀action⠀concluded,⠀a⠀consequence⠀beginning,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀repeated⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀telling;⠀do⠀not⠀declare⠀the⠀deed⠀already⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀remains⠀a⠀material⠀condition⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀moral⠀emblem:⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀promised,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀refused,⠀and⠀which⠀acts⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanalav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀continuous,⠀socially⠀situated⠀prose⠀on⠀the⠀social-realist⠀route:⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀enters⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀institution⠀or⠀household⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀technology⠀survey.⠀Pick⠀one⠀frame⠀—⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀municipal⠀service,⠀a⠀family⠀carrying⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀committee⠀dividing⠀a⠀disputed⠀resource⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀change⠀alter⠀its⠀habits:⠀how⠀a⠀shift⠀is⠀scheduled,⠀what⠀a⠀form⠀now⠀asks,⠀who⠀is⠀admitted,⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀can⠀still⠀do⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀working⠀day.⠀Show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀practiced⠀detail⠀—⠀commuting,⠀eating,⠀record-keeping,⠀visiting⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀meet⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀work⠀they⠀already⠀have,⠀so⠀that⠀any⠀explanation⠀makes⠀a⠀particular⠀decision⠀or⠀experience⠀intelligible⠀instead⠀of⠀standing⠀as⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nGive⠀that⠀frame⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀generous⠀movement.⠀An⠀encounter⠀can⠀include⠀the⠀journey⠀there,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀long⠀explanation⠀offered⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀needs⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀aftermath;⠀do⠀not⠀compress⠀scenes⠀to⠀their⠀decisive⠀blow.⠀Let⠀reputation⠀arrive⠀before⠀a⠀person⠀does,⠀let⠀restraint⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀chosen⠀non-action⠀with⠀visible⠀social⠀cost,⠀and⠀let⠀alliances⠀shift⠀through⠀kept⠀and⠀refused⠀promises⠀rather⠀than⠀declared⠀factions.⠀When⠀someone⠀acts,⠀the⠀action⠀expresses⠀a⠀value⠀and⠀touches⠀a⠀shared⠀history,⠀whether⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀office,⠀a⠀research⠀station,⠀or⠀a⠀kitchen.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀clear⠀focal⠀mind⠀within⠀the⠀social⠀setting.⠀The⠀institution⠀will⠀have⠀its⠀own⠀interpretation⠀of⠀the⠀change⠀—⠀classifications,⠀reassurances,⠀quiet⠀omissions⠀—⠀and⠀the⠀story⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀that⠀account⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀knows⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀practice.⠀A⠀calm⠀domestic⠀scene⠀carries⠀full⠀weight⠀when⠀the⠀consequence⠀is⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nUse⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀language⠀actually⠀supplied;⠀keep⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀and⠀Swedish⠀contexts⠀distinct⠀where⠀the⠀material⠀distinguishes⠀them,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Stop⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀shifted⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanalaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀screen⠀format:⠀scene⠀headings⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀readable⠀action⠀lines,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀dialogue.⠀Keep⠀the⠀page⠀to⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events;⠀use⠀a⠀cut,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀it,⠀and⠀keep⠀camera⠀commands⠀out.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀behave.⠀A⠀changed⠀work⠀practice,⠀an⠀institutional⠀procedure,⠀a⠀bodily⠀adaptation,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀communication⠀habit⠀appears⠀as⠀something⠀people⠀do⠀—⠀a⠀new⠀sign-in⠀ritual,⠀a⠀proced