            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-science_fiction-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Science Fiction · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == science_fiction}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Science Fiction. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-science_fiction; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPanamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀scene⠀selection.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀bond⠀at⠀work:⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀schedule,⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀used⠀during⠀a⠀medical⠀adjustment,⠀a⠀comfort⠀offered⠀after⠀a⠀communication⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀rivalry⠀sharpened⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀institutional⠀rule.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀specific⠀pressure⠀that⠀tests⠀or⠀fulfills⠀the⠀relationship's⠀promise.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀and⠀characters.\n\nBuild⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀as⠀Maeda-style⠀callbacks.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀small⠀ritual⠀may⠀appear⠀first⠀as⠀ordinary⠀shared⠀life⠀and⠀return⠀later⠀with⠀new⠀emotional⠀weight.⠀The⠀payoff⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀expectation.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀should⠀receive⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters'⠀private⠀thoughts⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀when⠀concealment,⠀embarrassment,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀gives⠀them⠀reason⠀to⠀differ.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀consequence⠀consequential⠀without⠀overriding⠀the⠀relationship.⠀A⠀new⠀body⠀modification,⠀work⠀obligation,⠀communication⠀delay,⠀or⠀environmental⠀change⠀may⠀alter⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀meet,⠀speak,⠀or⠀care⠀for⠀one⠀another.⠀Show⠀that⠀alteration⠀through⠀their⠀shared⠀routines⠀and⠀private⠀language.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀comfort⠀still⠀being⠀offered.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀deeds⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀remember⠀one⠀another.⠀A⠀shared⠀undertaking,⠀a⠀repeated⠀kindness,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀adaptation⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀condition⠀can⠀earn⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Use⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀for⠀recurrence:⠀who⠀maintained⠀the⠀equipment,⠀who⠀learned⠀the⠀new⠀procedure,⠀who⠀kept⠀a⠀routine⠀after⠀others⠀stopped,⠀and⠀who⠀still⠀tells⠀the⠀story⠀differently.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale.⠀An⠀errand⠀remains⠀an⠀errand⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀remembered⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀assigned⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀A⠀routine⠀first⠀mentioned⠀as⠀ordinary⠀work⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀the⠀thing⠀someone⠀continued⠀after⠀a⠀departure⠀or⠀a⠀system⠀failure.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account;⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀that⠀helping⠀is⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀automatic.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀local⠀story,⠀but⠀household⠀work⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀familiar⠀inconvenience⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀the⠀institutional⠀and⠀domestic⠀infrastructure⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀Scandinavian⠀welfare⠀state.⠀Use⠀forms,⠀schedules,⠀allowances,⠀waiting⠀rooms,⠀municipal⠀notices,⠀school⠀procedures,⠀and⠀workplace⠀rules⠀as⠀the⠀visible⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀larger⠀science-fictional⠀system⠀in⠀exposition.⠀Let⠀characters⠀handle⠀the⠀practical⠀consequences⠀of⠀the⠀changed⠀world⠀through⠀these⠀documentary⠀procedures:⠀a⠀parent⠀files⠀a⠀revised⠀claim⠀after⠀a⠀child's⠀new⠀condition⠀is⠀registered,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀sensor⠀placement⠀on⠀a⠀shared⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀worker⠀checks⠀a⠀maintenance⠀ledger⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀covers⠀a⠀routine⠀task.\n\nGround⠀emotional⠀reframing⠀in⠀Jun⠀Maeda's⠀repeated⠀routines⠀and⠀objects.⠀A⠀phrase⠀read⠀on⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀calendar,⠀a⠀bus⠀stop,⠀a⠀particular⠀queue,⠀or⠀an⠀allowance⠀notification⠀can⠀appear⠀early⠀without⠀emphasis.⠀Later,⠀when⠀an⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀detail,⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀returning⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀new⠀understanding.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀quiet:⠀the⠀same⠀form⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀implication,⠀the⠀same⠀calendar⠀mark⠀now⠀refers⠀to⠀a⠀canceled⠀appointment,⠀the⠀same⠀queue⠀now⠀includes⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀previously⠀absent.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tearful⠀breakdown⠀or⠀a⠀miraculous⠀repair.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀appropriate⠀scenes,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continues⠀around⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.\n\nNarrate⠀from⠀a⠀single⠀socially⠀situated⠀focal⠀character⠀whose⠀observations,⠀memories,⠀and⠀private⠀reasoning⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀interiority⠀reflective⠀but⠀bounded:⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀infer,⠀and⠀keep⠀other⠀people's⠀minds⠀inaccessible⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀otherwise.⠀Use⠀the⠀local⠀particulars⠀of⠀the⠀chosen⠀country⠀and⠀period.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀include⠀its⠀exact⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀administrative⠀names,⠀housing⠀practices,⠀and⠀seasonal⠀routines⠀rather⠀than⠀generic⠀Nordic⠀snow⠀or⠀isolation.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀relabel⠀all⠀Nordic⠀traditions⠀as⠀Scandinavian.\n\nLet⠀science-fictional⠀explanation⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀institutional⠀decision⠀or⠀personal⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀explains⠀a⠀technical⠀condition⠀while⠀filling⠀in⠀a⠀school⠀health⠀questionnaire,⠀argues⠀with⠀a⠀clerk⠀about⠀a⠀ration⠀code,⠀or⠀reads⠀a⠀municipal⠀notice⠀aloud⠀to⠀a⠀neighbor.⠀Explanation⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀stakes.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀sustained⠀by⠀the⠀intersection⠀of⠀domestic⠀life⠀and⠀bureaucratic⠀consequence,⠀not⠀by⠀exposition⠀breaks⠀or⠀set-piece⠀wonders.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀form⠀with⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Make⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀appear⠀through⠀ordinary,⠀repeatable⠀visual⠀actions.⠀Early⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀handle⠀a⠀specific⠀object⠀during⠀a⠀routine⠀activity:⠀checking⠀a⠀filter,⠀setting⠀out⠀a⠀ration⠀tin,⠀updating⠀a⠀paper⠀calendar.⠀Write⠀the⠀object⠀into⠀an⠀action⠀line⠀without⠀emphasis.⠀Later,⠀after⠀an⠀event⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀household's⠀circumstances,⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀in⠀a⠀changed⠀condition⠀during⠀a⠀routine⠀activity:⠀the⠀filter⠀is⠀now⠀taped,⠀the⠀ration⠀tin⠀is⠀empty,⠀the⠀calendar⠀page⠀is⠀turned⠀to⠀a⠀marked⠀date.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀records⠀the⠀contrast;⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀it.⠀This⠀visual⠀recurrence⠀is⠀the⠀primary⠀Maeda⠀reframing⠀mechanism.\n\nFor⠀verbal⠀callbacks,⠀use⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀question⠀that⠀occurs⠀naturally⠀in⠀a⠀repeated⠀household⠀situation.⠀A⠀parent⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀same⠀question⠀each⠀morning⠀about⠀the⠀day's⠀schedule,⠀a⠀child⠀may⠀give⠀the⠀same⠀one-word⠀answer⠀about⠀school.⠀Let⠀the⠀phrase⠀return⠀later⠀in⠀an⠀altered⠀context:⠀the⠀question⠀is⠀now⠀about⠀a⠀clinic⠀appointment,⠀the⠀same⠀answer⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different.⠀Do⠀not⠀underline⠀the⠀callback⠀with⠀on-the-nose⠀dialogue⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀say⠀it.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀habit,⠀not⠀a⠀rhetorical⠀device.\n\nRestrict⠀voice-over⠀to⠀a⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀remembrance⠀when⠀the⠀scene's⠀visual⠀action⠀alone⠀cannot⠀carry⠀the⠀needed⠀interior⠀weight.⠀Write⠀it⠀as⠀(V.O.)⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀extremely⠀brief,⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀on⠀screen.⠀Voice-over⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀home⠀for⠀private⠀feeling;⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀most⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀experience⠀beyond⠀what⠀voice-over⠀allows,⠀provide⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue:⠀label⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀it⠀audible⠀or⠀visible⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀spoken⠀lines⠀solely⠀because⠀the⠀format⠀is⠀visual.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀needs⠀them:⠀a⠀changed⠀location,⠀a⠀time⠀jump,⠀or⠀a⠀deliberate⠀contrast.⠀A⠀cut⠀from⠀a⠀morning⠀chore⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀chore⠀under⠀different⠀conditions⠀is⠀a⠀useful⠀way⠀to⠀show⠀consequences.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀may⠀suggest⠀a⠀world⠀event,⠀but⠀focus⠀stays⠀on⠀the⠀people⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀camera⠀commands⠀beyond⠀what⠀readability⠀requires.\n\nLet⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀world⠀affect⠀daily⠀practice⠀through⠀specific⠀objects⠀and⠀routines:⠀a⠀new⠀form⠀on⠀the⠀counter,⠀a⠀strange⠀but⠀routine⠀appliance,⠀a⠀yard⠀sign⠀about⠀water⠀credits.⠀Accumulate⠀these⠀details⠀across⠀ordinary⠀scenes⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀later⠀visual⠀reframing⠀feels⠀earned⠀rather⠀than⠀imposed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanamax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nBuild⠀the⠀play⠀around⠀repeated⠀physical⠀business⠀with⠀ordinary⠀stage⠀objects.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀daily⠀prop⠀early⠀in⠀an⠀everyday⠀action:⠀a⠀cup⠀wiped⠀while⠀waiting,⠀a⠀form⠀folded⠀into⠀a⠀pocket,⠀a⠀filter⠀checked⠀at⠀a⠀meal.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀on⠀it;⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀continue.⠀Later,⠀after⠀an⠀event⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀household's⠀situation,⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀being⠀handled⠀during⠀a⠀parallel⠀action:⠀the⠀cup⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀wiped,⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀unfolded⠀and⠀contradicted,⠀the⠀filter⠀is⠀disconnected.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀record⠀the⠀difference;⠀no⠀character⠀announces⠀the⠀contrast.⠀The⠀second⠀handling⠀acquires⠀weight⠀through⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀happened,⠀and⠀this⠀repeated-prop⠀method⠀is⠀how⠀Maeda's⠀emotional⠀reframing⠀becomes⠀actable.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀visible⠀through⠀concrete⠀routine⠀business⠀and⠀stage⠀props.⠀Characters⠀scan⠀a⠀health⠀chip⠀before⠀a⠀visit,⠀adjust⠀a⠀ration⠀counter,⠀display⠀a⠀municipal⠀notice,⠀or⠀calibrate⠀a⠀small⠀appliance.⠀These⠀tasks⠀should⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀blocking,⠀not⠀explanatory⠀speeches.⠀If⠀a⠀procedure⠀has⠀changed,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀action:⠀a⠀scan⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀passes,⠀a⠀counter⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀reset,⠀a⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀no⠀longer⠀reads.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀infer⠀the⠀world's⠀new⠀rule⠀from⠀the⠀altered⠀routine.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀economically⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀refusal⠀to⠀answer⠀can⠀occur⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀continues⠀a⠀chore.⠀A⠀tender⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀staged⠀as⠀sharing⠀a⠀task.⠀Avoid⠀film-camera⠀instructions;⠀do⠀not⠀call⠀for⠀close-ups⠀or⠀cuts.⠀If⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀use⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀heading⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀stage⠀direction⠀describing⠀the⠀move.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀have⠀a⠀specific⠀dramatic⠀purpose:⠀a⠀character⠀alone⠀with⠀a⠀memento⠀speaks⠀a⠀few⠀private⠀words,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀directly⠀addresses⠀the⠀audience⠀to⠀reveal⠀a⠀decision.⠀Such⠀moments⠀should⠀be⠀rare.⠀They⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀private⠀thought⠀generally,⠀and⠀an⠀aside⠀is⠀not⠀heard⠀by⠀the⠀other⠀characters.\n\nIf⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀play⠀script,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue:⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀insure⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀never⠀hear⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀a⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀as⠀a⠀spoken⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue.⠀The⠀play⠀must⠀remain⠀actable⠀under⠀ordinary⠀stage⠀conditions,⠀with⠀repeated⠀daily⠀rituals⠀and⠀objects⠀carrying⠀both⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀and⠀its⠀emotional⠀consequences.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanamay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\n