embers.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀whether⠀they⠀lie.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀changes⠀legibly,⠀as⠀a⠀brief⠀heading⠀or⠀italic⠀line.⠀A⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀scene⠀is⠀a⠀visual-novel⠀callback:⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀location⠀with⠀small⠀changed⠀details⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices.⠀Let⠀the⠀new⠀situation⠀be⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀asserted.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀including⠀whose⠀interiority⠀is⠀available⠀and⠀how⠀private⠀experience⠀is⠀presented.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanambb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀in⠀each⠀installment.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀to⠀reorient⠀a⠀returning⠀reader⠀without⠀a⠀full⠀recap:⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀mid-task,⠀tending⠀a⠀chore,⠀answering⠀a⠀familiar⠀question,⠀or⠀noticing⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀place.⠀Let⠀the⠀current⠀local⠀situation⠀carry⠀the⠀section.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀previous⠀installment⠀unless⠀the⠀current⠀event⠀needs⠀a⠀specific⠀past⠀fact,⠀and⠀even⠀then⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀relevant⠀particular.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀into⠀ordinary⠀recurring⠀routines⠀that⠀can⠀vary⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀new⠀water-credit⠀threshold,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀queue⠀position,⠀a⠀school⠀requirement,⠀or⠀a⠀neighborhood⠀sensor⠀update⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀action.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀needs⠀that⠀earlier⠀fact,⠀bring⠀it⠀back⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀the⠀character⠀encounters⠀again:⠀the⠀same⠀queue⠀now⠀shorter,⠀the⠀same⠀sensor⠀now⠀covered,⠀the⠀same⠀school⠀notice⠀now⠀replaced.⠀The⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀shows⠀the⠀world⠀moving⠀without⠀exposition⠀dumps.\n\nUse⠀repeated⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀and⠀phrases⠀as⠀cross-installment⠀callbacks⠀in⠀the⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀pattern.⠀Early⠀in⠀the⠀story,⠀establish⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀in⠀a⠀daily⠀context:⠀a⠀cup⠀used⠀each⠀morning,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀family⠀meals,⠀a⠀tool⠀kept⠀by⠀the⠀door.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀installment,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀return⠀during⠀an⠀ordinary⠀moment⠀after⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed.⠀The⠀cup⠀may⠀be⠀empty⠀or⠀left⠀behind,⠀the⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀repeated⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀say⠀it⠀before,⠀the⠀tool⠀may⠀be⠀gone.⠀The⠀focal⠀narration⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀through⠀the⠀recurrence;⠀no⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀announce⠀the⠀callback.⠀The⠀return⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀situation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀reminder.\n\nProgress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀chore,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀an⠀acknowledgment,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀moment.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter.⠀A⠀recurring⠀detail⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀maintain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀serial's⠀prose⠀where⠀the⠀contract⠀allows:⠀a⠀focal⠀thought⠀can⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀present⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀returned⠀memory⠀without⠀driving⠀an⠀immediate⠀visible⠀decision.\n\nLet⠀humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀appropriate⠀people⠀and⠀scenes,⠀and⠀avoid⠀forcing⠀an⠀emotional⠀revelation⠀each⠀installment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focus⠀on⠀people⠀living⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀world,⠀with⠀the⠀installment⠀structure⠀accumulating⠀their⠀daily⠀reality⠀rather⠀than⠀rushing⠀toward⠀a⠀forced⠀turning⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀the⠀emotional⠀relationship⠀as⠀a⠀technical⠀interface⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀an⠀intimate⠀one.⠀In⠀this⠀story,⠀a⠀speculative⠀emotional⠀subsystem—such⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀empathy⠀channel,⠀a⠀gesture⠀translator,⠀or⠀a⠀monitored⠀sincerity⠀protocol—makes⠀private⠀feeling⠀operationally⠀legible.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀wants⠀care⠀must⠀expose⠀something⠀the⠀system⠀can⠀read,⠀and⠀the⠀system⠀will⠀turn⠀that⠀disclosure⠀into⠀a⠀consequence:⠀sustained⠀contact,⠀increased⠀obligation,⠀restricted⠀access,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀record.⠀Write⠀the⠀mechanic⠀plainly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀emotional⠀choice⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀practical⠀move.\n\nLet⠀the⠀character⠀misread⠀the⠀interface⠀when⠀that⠀drives⠀the⠀scene.⠀They⠀may⠀believe⠀a⠀confession⠀will⠀unlock⠀relief,⠀but⠀the⠀channel⠀only⠀registers⠀need⠀within⠀a⠀shared⠀bandwidth⠀and⠀drains⠀them⠀when⠀they⠀perform⠀reassurance.⠀They⠀may⠀withhold⠀a⠀true⠀apology⠀because⠀the⠀protocol⠀would⠀redistribute⠀blame,⠀then⠀discover⠀that⠀silence⠀defaults⠀the⠀system⠀to⠀factual⠀correction⠀rather⠀than⠀forgiveness.⠀Show⠀the⠀exact⠀cause-and-effect⠀step—what⠀was⠀sent,⠀what⠀was⠀verified,⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀returned—before⠀the⠀character⠀reacts,⠀so⠀the⠀turbulence⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀interaction,⠀not⠀from⠀decorative⠀tech.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi-style⠀reversals⠀inside⠀the⠀emotional⠀system.⠀A⠀protective⠀omission⠀can⠀become⠀a⠀technical⠀defect⠀when⠀the⠀interface⠀flags⠀an⠀unsent⠀message⠀as⠀a⠀data⠀gap.⠀A⠀carefully⠀phrased⠀need⠀can⠀be⠀parsed⠀as⠀a⠀formal⠀request⠀with⠀consequences⠀the⠀speaker⠀never⠀intended.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀partial⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀because⠀the⠀channel⠀confirms⠀sincerity⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀hurt⠀unresolved.⠀Keep⠀each⠀reversal⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀mechanic,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀immediately⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀say,⠀ask⠀for,⠀or⠀expect⠀next.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀changed⠀behavior⠀and⠀concrete⠀actions⠀rather⠀than⠀repeated⠀suffering⠀words.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀refuse⠀a⠀second⠀contact⠀window,⠀delete⠀a⠀recorded⠀need,⠀or⠀spend⠀resources⠀on⠀a⠀workaround⠀that⠀lets⠀them⠀speak⠀selectively.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀damage⠀can⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀interaction:⠀one⠀line⠀may⠀carry⠀both⠀a⠀genuine⠀apology⠀and⠀an⠀exposure⠀the⠀character⠀resents.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀full⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀tragic⠀ending;⠀the⠀final⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀holding⠀an⠀unresolved⠀loyalty⠀while⠀a⠀practical⠀sci-fi⠀task⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Write⠀private⠀thought⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀viewpoint⠀contract⠀allow⠀it,⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀thought⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀calculation⠀about⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀not⠀a⠀public⠀declaration⠀of⠀pain.⠀The⠀angsty⠀treatment⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀precise,⠀system-aware⠀price⠀of⠀emotional⠀exposure,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀word⠀list⠀or⠀an⠀automatic⠀spiral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nGive⠀every⠀beat⠀a⠀scannable⠀decision⠀point.⠀The⠀shared⠀interval⠀should⠀revolve⠀around⠀a⠀concrete⠀interaction⠀with⠀the⠀speculative⠀system—a⠀data⠀upload,⠀a⠀sensor⠀scan,⠀a⠀clearance⠀request,⠀a⠀resource⠀transfer—that⠀the⠀player⠀or⠀an⠀NPC⠀initiates⠀and⠀that⠀produces⠀an⠀immediate,⠀legible⠀outcome.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀labels⠀or⠀dialogue⠀tags.⠀An⠀NPC⠀should⠀react⠀to⠀that⠀outcome⠀by⠀changing⠀their⠀practical⠀position:⠀they⠀may⠀offer⠀information,⠀alter⠀access,⠀warn⠀against⠀a⠀second⠀attempt,⠀or⠀begin⠀a⠀repair.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀even⠀when⠀a⠀reversal⠀arrives.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀interaction⠀as⠀a⠀Kamachi-style⠀mechanism⠀with⠀a⠀visible⠀rule.⠀Before⠀the⠀outcome⠀lands,⠀include⠀enough⠀intervening⠀detail:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀selected,⠀sent,⠀bypassed,⠀or⠀misread,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀system⠀returned.⠀Failure⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀refusal;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀response—a⠀rejected⠀key,⠀a⠀missing⠀field,⠀a⠀rule⠀loop,⠀a⠀resource⠀cost—that⠀gives⠀the⠀next⠀speaker⠀something⠀concrete⠀to⠀address.⠀An⠀NPC⠀can⠀correct⠀a⠀wrong⠀assumption⠀immediately,⠀and⠀that⠀correction⠀changes⠀the⠀options⠀without⠀requiring⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀an⠀encyclopedia⠀paragraph.\n\nUse⠀the⠀roleplay⠀form⠀to⠀keep⠀private⠀knowledge⠀bounded.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀centers⠀the⠀player's⠀viewpoint,⠀do⠀not⠀narrate⠀another⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀or⠀emotion⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀explicitly⠀grants⠀it.⠀Show⠀NPC⠀interiority⠀through⠀visible⠀action,⠀speech,⠀and⠀system⠀reactions:⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀approving⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀message⠀typed⠀and⠀deleted,⠀a⠀check⠀performed⠀twice.⠀This⠀preserves⠀the⠀scannable⠀dialogue⠀flow⠀while⠀respecting⠀the⠀selected⠀character⠀control.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀interaction.⠀The⠀last⠀paragraph⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀NPC⠀acting⠀on⠀the⠀result,⠀the⠀player's⠀next⠀available⠀move,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀visible⠀cost,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀demand⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀should⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀goals;⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀try⠀to⠀do,⠀what⠀fails,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀learn⠀from⠀the⠀failure,⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀static⠀exposition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀mode,⠀and⠀choose⠀the⠀satirical-social⠀realism⠀route.⠀In⠀each⠀short,⠀linked⠀episode,⠀confront⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀order:⠀a⠀quota,⠀a⠀repair⠀protocol,⠀a⠀legal⠀requirement,⠀a⠀new⠀body⠀standard,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀obligation.⠀Use⠀direct⠀speech⠀and⠀action⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀episode;⠀narrator⠀comment⠀should⠀stay⠀brief⠀and⠀serve⠀social⠀observation.⠀Let⠀the⠀satire⠀grow⠀from⠀precise,⠀observed⠀detail—who⠀must⠀wait,⠀who⠀can⠀skip⠀the⠀queue,⠀what⠀paperwork⠀is⠀accepted,⠀what⠀dangerous⠀shortcut⠀has⠀become⠀normal—rather⠀than⠀from⠀broad⠀denunciation.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀order⠀concrete⠀as⠀an⠀everyday⠀administrative⠀interface.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀city's⠀maintenance⠀system⠀may⠀be⠀self-optimizing,⠀learning⠀from⠀resident⠀complaints⠀but⠀also⠀from⠀their⠀neglect,⠀so⠀a⠀district's⠀silence⠀becomes⠀a⠀data⠀point⠀that⠀lowers⠀its⠀repair⠀priority.⠀The⠀mechanism⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀metaphor;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀legible⠀system⠀with⠀a⠀real⠀consequence.⠀Show⠀the⠀rule⠀being⠀used:⠀the⠀character⠀files⠀a⠀report,⠀submits⠀a⠀request,⠀or⠀bypasses⠀a⠀check,⠀and⠀the⠀interface⠀returns⠀a⠀specific⠀result—a⠀reassignment,⠀a⠀fine,⠀a⠀service⠀window,⠀or⠀a⠀warning.⠀The⠀satire⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀mismatch⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀interface⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀residents⠀actually⠀live,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀uniformly⠀corrupt⠀cast.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi's⠀tactical⠀clarity⠀to⠀drive⠀each⠀episode's⠀reversal.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀tries⠀to⠀exploit⠀the⠀system,⠀explain⠀the⠀relevant⠀cause⠀and⠀effect:⠀the⠀false⠀address⠀they⠀entered,⠀the⠀repair⠀category⠀they⠀mislabeled,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀whose⠀complaint⠀they⠀borrowed.⠀The⠀reversal⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀secondary⠀clause,⠀another⠀person's⠀calculation,⠀or⠀the⠀physical⠀limits⠀of⠀the⠀device.⠀Carry⠀actual⠀changes⠀in⠀position⠀or⠀understanding⠀into⠀later⠀episodes—what⠀is⠀known⠀about⠀an⠀official,⠀request,⠀or⠀resource—without⠀requiring⠀one⠀to⠀occur⠀before⠀each⠀episode⠀can⠀end.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger;⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀can⠀begin⠀from⠀this⠀new⠀condition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀grounded⠀in⠀local,⠀practical⠀observation.⠀Describe⠀the⠀queue,⠀the⠀form,⠀the⠀repair⠀crew's⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀superior's⠀habit⠀of⠀quoting⠀policy.⠀Avoid⠀importing⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀dynasty⠀or⠀region,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀that⠀avoidance⠀as⠀an⠀excuse⠀for⠀a⠀generic⠀setting;⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀should⠀remain⠀distinct⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀satire⠀to⠀feel⠀lived.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequences⠀should⠀be⠀material:⠀bodies,⠀work,⠀money,⠀medicine,⠀access⠀to⠀communication,⠀housing,⠀or⠀movement.⠀The⠀episode⠀need⠀not⠀include⠀technical⠀exposition,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀show⠀the⠀system⠀operating⠀through⠀everyday⠀practice,⠀with⠀the⠀brevity⠀and⠀force⠀of⠀vernacular⠀storytelling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nUse⠀the⠀compressed,⠀hard-edged⠀prose⠀mode⠀by⠀treating⠀every⠀physical⠀object⠀as⠀a⠀causal⠀participant.⠀A⠀room⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀dirty;⠀the⠀floor⠀is⠀sticky⠀with⠀leaked⠀coolant,⠀and⠀that⠀stickiness⠀changes⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀stand⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀carry.⠀A⠀device⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀broken;⠀it⠀is⠀cracked,⠀burned,⠀missing⠀a⠀pressure⠀seal,⠀or⠀jammed,⠀and⠀the⠀specific⠀damage⠀determines⠀the⠀next⠀possible⠀action.⠀Write⠀transitions⠀as⠀step-to-step⠀movement:⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀from⠀one⠀failure⠀to⠀the⠀next,⠀from⠀one⠀decision⠀to⠀its⠀result.⠀Cut⠀narration⠀down⠀to⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀active⠀verbs;⠀avoid⠀a⠀general⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀decay.\n\nUse⠀a⠀rolling⠀'action–damage–response'⠀cycle⠀for⠀each⠀reversal.⠀First,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀action:⠀the⠀character⠀pulls⠀a⠀cable,⠀keys⠀a⠀control⠀panel,⠀swings⠀a⠀bar,⠀or⠀patches⠀a⠀leak⠀with⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀scrap.⠀Second,⠀show⠀the⠀exact⠀damage⠀or⠀system⠀response:⠀a⠀fitting⠀shears,⠀a⠀warning⠀chime⠀repeats⠀three⠀times,⠀a⠀panel⠀refuses⠀to⠀latch,⠀or⠀a⠀gauge⠀drops⠀below⠀the⠀line.⠀Third,⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph⠀or⠀the⠀next.⠀This⠀cycle⠀keeps⠀Kamachi's⠀tactical⠀clarity⠀inside⠀the⠀gritty⠀style,⠀so⠀each⠀reversal⠀is⠀legible⠀instead⠀of⠀shocking.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀its⠀whole⠀chain—counting⠀resources,⠀reading⠀damage,⠀or⠀choosing⠀between⠀two⠀bad⠀moves—switch⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀rhythm⠀and⠀keep⠀each⠀link⠀explicit.⠀The⠀high⠀pressure⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀demands,⠀such⠀as⠀failing⠀air,⠀locked⠀doors,⠀dangerous⠀cargo,⠀or⠀public⠀order,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀tonal⠀instruction⠀to⠀be⠀desperate.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker:⠀the⠀tired⠀supervisor,⠀the⠀crowd-control⠀officer,⠀the⠀smuggler,⠀or⠀the⠀child⠀who⠀has⠀learned⠀a⠀mechanic's⠀vocabulary.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀machinery⠀have⠀operational⠀weight.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀rely⠀on⠀a⠀diagnostic⠀readout,⠀a⠀transplant⠀protocol,⠀an⠀automated⠀enforcement⠀system,⠀or⠀a⠀power⠀grid⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do⠀next.⠀The⠀story⠀can⠀be⠀intimate,⠀bureaucratic,⠀or⠀violent;⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀element⠀remains⠀active⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀uses,⠀misreads,⠀or⠀works⠀around⠀it.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀habitat's⠀lock⠀sequence⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀pressure⠀check⠀before⠀the⠀outer⠀door⠀can⠀open,⠀so⠀a⠀cracked⠀external⠀seal⠀becomes⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀obstacle⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀background⠀detail.⠀The⠀tight⠀phrasing⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀sequence:⠀they⠀try⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀seal⠀fails⠀the⠀check,⠀they⠀must⠀move⠀to⠀the⠀overflow⠀hatch⠀or⠀repair⠀the⠀seal⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀hand.⠀Do⠀not⠀slow⠀a⠀physical⠀emergency⠀with⠀unnecessary⠀technical⠀exposition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀formats⠀for⠀variety.⠀Select⠀the⠀document⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀repair⠀log,⠀a⠀quarantine⠀notice,⠀a⠀resignation⠀letter,⠀a⠀supply⠀request,⠀a⠀forensic⠀report,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀journal.⠀A⠀document⠀contains⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀would⠀record⠀and⠀conceals⠀what⠀they⠀would⠀not⠀know⠀or⠀would⠀deliberately⠀omit.⠀Its⠀knowledge⠀is⠀partial,⠀and⠀its⠀gaps⠀are⠀active⠀evidence.\n\nTreat⠀each⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀causal⠀move⠀in⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀system.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀secure⠀resources,⠀shift⠀blame,⠀warn⠀a⠀colleague,⠀or⠀create⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀protects⠀the⠀writer⠀later.⠀A⠀log⠀entry⠀explains⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀is⠀using⠀it,⠀but⠀fails⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀step⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀misunderstands⠀it.⠀Let⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀complete,⠀contradict,⠀or⠀revise⠀the⠀earlier⠀account,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀revision⠀practical:⠀a⠀first⠀request⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀second⠀notice⠀may⠀close⠀it,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀authorize⠀a⠀workaround.⠀Show⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀the⠀document⠀trail⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator.\n\nUse⠀the⠀gaps⠀and⠀conflicts⠀between⠀records⠀to⠀reveal⠀the⠀speculative⠀order.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀clearance⠀request⠀may⠀cite⠀a⠀safety⠀protocol⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀maintenance⠀log⠀shows⠀was⠀bypassed;⠀the⠀bypass⠀may⠀generate⠀a⠀violation⠀notice;⠀the⠀violation⠀notice⠀may⠀cause⠀a⠀ration⠀reallocation⠀or⠀an⠀eviction.⠀The⠀reader⠀reconstructs⠀what⠀happened⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀documents⠀each⠀choose⠀to⠀say.⠀Material⠀details—dates,⠀signatures,⠀serial⠀numbers,⠀missing⠀pages,⠀repeated⠀corrections—should⠀carry⠀the⠀evidence⠀path.⠀When⠀one⠀writer⠀lies,⠀let⠀the⠀lie⠀be⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀contradiction⠀with⠀another⠀document,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀editorial⠀comment.\n\nLet⠀a⠀document⠀function⠀as⠀a⠀tactical⠀instrument⠀inside⠀the⠀story.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀submit⠀a⠀false⠀diagnosis⠀to⠀buy⠀time,⠀file⠀a⠀correction⠀to⠀shift⠀blame,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀sign⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀would⠀authorize⠀risky⠀treatment.⠀The⠀science-fictional⠀machinery⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀these⠀actions:⠀the⠀form's⠀fields,⠀the⠀required⠀signature,⠀the⠀automatic⠀escalation,⠀the⠀system's⠀response.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀a⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀hidden⠀diary⠀of⠀a⠀character's⠀complete⠀live⠀private⠀thought;⠀include⠀only⠀what⠀this⠀author⠀would⠀set⠀down⠀for⠀this⠀recipient.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀includes⠀a⠀framing⠀voice,⠀keep⠀document⠀voices⠀distinct⠀within⠀that⠀frame,⠀whether⠀they⠀are⠀first-person⠀records⠀or⠀third-person⠀summaries.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀dispute;⠀the⠀next⠀document,⠀if⠀there⠀is⠀one,⠀will⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀last⠀exchange.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀comfort⠀be⠀a⠀deliberate⠀operation,⠀not⠀a⠀closed⠀domestic⠀bubble.⠀Show⠀a⠀character⠀using⠀the⠀setting's⠀own⠀tools⠀and⠀constraints⠀to⠀create⠀small⠀wellbeing:⠀they⠀reroute⠀a⠀heat⠀line⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀less⠀critical⠀zone,⠀spend⠀a⠀ration⠀token⠀on⠀the⠀exact⠀flavor⠀someone⠀likes,⠀patch⠀a⠀crack⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀sleeping⠀unit,⠀or⠀time⠀a⠀delivery⠀to⠀arrive⠀during⠀a⠀rest⠀shift.⠀The⠀speculative⠀system⠀remains⠀active:⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀what⠀the⠀resource⠀costs,⠀what⠀rule⠀they⠀are⠀skirting,⠀and⠀what⠀will⠀happen⠀later.⠀The⠀care⠀is⠀a⠀tactical⠀move⠀that⠀gains⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀without⠀pretending⠀the⠀larger⠀difficulty⠀is⠀gone.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi's⠀clarity⠀in⠀the⠀comfort⠀sequence.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀mechanism—stoking⠀a⠀generator,⠀rerouting⠀power,⠀syncing⠀a⠀diary,⠀timing⠀a⠀delivery—explain⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀in⠀plain⠀terms.⠀Show⠀the⠀step,⠀then⠀the⠀result:⠀they⠀set⠀the⠀ration⠀package⠀to⠀thaw,⠀and⠀by⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀arrives⠀the⠀meal⠀is⠀ready;⠀they⠀patch⠀a⠀small⠀leak,⠀and⠀the⠀room⠀holds⠀heat⠀for⠀the⠀night.⠀A⠀minor⠀practical⠀victory⠀should⠀feel⠀earned⠀by⠀legible⠀cause⠀and⠀effect,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀vague⠀feeling⠀of⠀coziness.\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀moment⠀feel⠀safe:⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀drink,⠀a⠀shared⠀blanket,⠀a⠀familiar⠀name⠀spoken⠀softly.⠀Keep⠀affection⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀an⠀apology,⠀and⠀allow⠀a⠀little⠀friction.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀tired,⠀embarrassed,⠀or⠀mildly⠀annoyed;⠀the⠀caretaker⠀may⠀choose⠀the⠀wrong⠀station⠀on⠀the⠀audio⠀line⠀and⠀correct⠀it⠀without⠀drama.⠀A⠀gesture⠀can⠀be⠀imperfect⠀alongside⠀the⠀successful⠀one.\n\nThe⠀comfort⠀should⠀have⠀an⠀in-story⠀source,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀comforted⠀by⠀another⠀person's⠀steady⠀hand⠀during⠀a⠀system⠀alarm;⠀that⠀calmness⠀is⠀an⠀action⠀with⠀conditions,⠀not⠀a⠀magical⠀removal⠀of⠀the⠀alarm.⠀A⠀shared⠀private⠀joke⠀can⠀reference⠀a⠀mechanism⠀both⠀characters⠀know,⠀giving⠀the⠀warmth⠀a⠀distinct⠀setting.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀shared⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀while⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀characters⠀to⠀become⠀agreeable⠀or⠀resolve⠀every⠀disagreement;⠀the⠀fluff⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀inside⠀the⠀system,⠀not⠀from⠀flattening⠀the⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀composed,⠀novelistic⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraphs.⠀Do⠀not⠀break⠀every⠀action⠀into⠀a⠀one-sentence⠀punch.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀breathe⠀through⠀the⠀arrangement⠀of⠀rooms,⠀the⠀habits⠀of⠀an⠀institution,⠀or⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀decision.⠀Choose⠀a⠀narrator⠀with⠀enough⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀events⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀viewpoint⠀contract⠀permits.⠀Keep⠀spoken⠀language⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀register.⠀Ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀relevant,⠀but⠀these⠀are⠀formal⠀tools⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀requirement⠀to⠀adopt⠀archaic⠀or⠀aristocratic⠀diction.\n\nDeliver⠀Kamachi's⠀causal⠀clarity⠀through⠀an⠀institutional⠀pivot⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sudden⠀jab.⠀When⠀a⠀reversal⠀arrives,⠀show⠀the⠀prior⠀step⠀that⠀caused⠀it—a⠀regulation⠀cited,⠀a⠀supply⠀exhausted,⠀a⠀door⠀jammed,⠀a⠀message⠀misfiled—but⠀first⠀let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀establish⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀step.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀property⠀registry⠀update⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀a⠀file⠀change;⠀it⠀reorders⠀whose⠀claim⠀a⠀relative⠀can⠀make,⠀what⠀notice⠀must⠀be⠀served,⠀and⠀what⠀room⠀may⠀be⠀entered.⠀Then⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀the⠀mechanism:⠀they⠀file⠀a⠀correction,⠀refuse⠀a⠀signature,⠀or⠀exploit⠀a⠀grace⠀period,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph⠀shows⠀the⠀institutional⠀result.⠀The⠀action⠀remains⠀physically⠀intelligible⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀is⠀reflective.\n\nUse⠀a⠀controlled⠀three-movement⠀pattern⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀permits⠀it:⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀public⠀or⠀institutional⠀condition,⠀move⠀inward⠀to⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀practical⠀need⠀and⠀reasoning,⠀then⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀precise⠀operational⠀move⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀situation.⠀This⠀pattern⠀prevents⠀the⠀formal⠀breadth⠀from⠀diffusing⠀the⠀tactical⠀line.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀affect⠀daily⠀life⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms—a⠀new⠀medical⠀procedure⠀that⠀alters⠀inheritance,⠀a⠀generated⠀forecast⠀that⠀changes⠀local⠀agriculture,⠀a⠀legal⠀status⠀that⠀reorders⠀access⠀to⠀travel⠀and⠀work—and⠀these⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀aims:⠀securing⠀a⠀permit,⠀visiting⠀a⠀detained⠀relative,⠀recovering⠀a⠀debt,⠀auditing⠀an⠀installation.\n\nMaintain⠀actual⠀private⠀thought⠀where⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀contract⠀allows⠀it,⠀and⠀make⠀it⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀sustained⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀separate⠀confessional⠀voice.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀compare⠀public⠀expectation⠀with⠀private⠀consequence,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀supply⠀omniscient⠀moral⠀summary⠀unless⠀authorized.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀public⠀question⠀open⠀while⠀a⠀private⠀scene⠀closes⠀with⠀restraint.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀composed⠀movement⠀between⠀social⠀context⠀and⠀tactical⠀action,⠀not⠀from⠀setting⠀or⠀ornament.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀a⠀present⠀occasion⠀where⠀someone⠀needs⠀a⠀decision,⠀permission,⠀warning,⠀or⠀explanation⠀from⠀a⠀listener.⠀Make⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat:⠀a⠀service⠀has⠀stopped⠀working,⠀a⠀body⠀or⠀crop⠀responds⠀differently,⠀a⠀policy⠀now⠀enforces⠀something⠀previously⠀impossible,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀has⠀misunderstood⠀a⠀new⠀rule.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀visible⠀in⠀that⠀occasion,⠀each⠀with⠀distinct⠀authority,⠀memory,⠀and⠀practical⠀interest.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller⠀deliver⠀an⠀embedded⠀account⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀operational.⠀The⠀story⠀inside⠀should⠀show⠀a⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀limitation,⠀or⠀interaction⠀through⠀a⠀person⠀trying⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it:⠀someone⠀exploits⠀a⠀recycling⠀loop,⠀misreads⠀a⠀diagnostic,⠀bargains⠀with⠀a⠀maintenance⠀protocol,⠀or⠀navigates⠀a⠀rule⠀written⠀for⠀an⠀older⠀technology.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀person⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀must⠀exploit,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀adapt⠀to⠀it,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀lecture⠀inserted⠀before⠀the⠀action.⠀Use⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis⠀to⠀manage⠀information:⠀they⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀cost,⠀stress⠀a⠀hope,⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀changes⠀meaning⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀later⠀compares⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀outer⠀facts.\n\nLet⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀pay⠀off⠀the⠀nested⠀account.⠀After⠀the⠀story,⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀act,⠀refuse,⠀correct,⠀or⠀reinterpret⠀something⠀from⠀the⠀told⠀mechanism.⠀The⠀embedded⠀material⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence,⠀the⠀teller's⠀motive,⠀or⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀official⠀explanation⠀and⠀lived⠀experience.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀system⠀detail⠀across⠀the⠀levels,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀why⠀the⠀telling⠀occurred⠀at⠀this⠀moment⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀possible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀causally⠀legible;⠀permit⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀people⠀and⠀outcomes,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀mechanism⠀coherent.⠀Use⠀the⠀oral⠀frame⠀to⠀create⠀audience⠀pressure⠀and⠀delayed⠀understanding⠀without⠀adding⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger⠀between⠀nested⠀accounts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀comparison⠀among⠀accounts,⠀records,⠀practical⠀reports,⠀and⠀living⠀memory⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀entered⠀a⠀society,⠀institution,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀body.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀calibrated⠀to⠀each⠀source:⠀a⠀compiled⠀report,⠀witness⠀statement,⠀public⠀notice,⠀diary⠀extract,⠀or⠀remembered⠀conversation⠀carries⠀its⠀own⠀authority⠀and⠀gaps.⠀No⠀single⠀record⠀gives⠀the⠀whole⠀system.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀profile's⠀legible⠀rules⠀and⠀resources⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀way⠀records⠀interact.⠀A⠀maintenance⠀regulation,⠀supply⠀limit,⠀diagnostic⠀standard,⠀or⠀official⠀promise⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀period⠀can⠀still⠀shape⠀present⠀action.⠀Let⠀characters⠀encounter⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀rule⠀as⠀written⠀and⠀the⠀rule⠀as⠀practiced.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀someone⠀needs⠀to⠀exploit,⠀follow,⠀challenge,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀account⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀speaker⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀or⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀record.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀an⠀institution-⠀and⠀body-level⠀change.⠀Move⠀between⠀the⠀large⠀change⠀and⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀problem—a⠀worker's⠀route,⠀a⠀dependent's⠀medicine,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀missing⠀form,⠀a⠀family's⠀housing—without⠀turning⠀every⠀difficulty⠀into⠀a⠀state⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀stereotype.⠀Let⠀the⠀selected⠀source⠀language⠀and⠀distance⠀influence⠀syntax:⠀reports⠀may⠀remain⠀plain⠀and⠀modal,⠀remembered⠀speech⠀may⠀run⠀longer,⠀a⠀later⠀recollection⠀may⠀compare⠀earlier⠀hope⠀with⠀current⠀fact.⠀Keep⠀a⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀across⠀sources⠀and⠀shifts.⠀Permit⠀documents⠀to⠀conflict⠀and⠀testimony⠀to⠀remain⠀incomplete;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀follow⠀what⠀the⠀records⠀jointly⠀establish⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀remaining⠀uncertainty⠀matters.⠀Use⠀no⠀supernatural⠀resolution;⠀the⠀documentary⠀route⠀treats⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀a⠀historical⠀and⠀social⠀fact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nUse⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀the⠀vehicle⠀for⠀Gothic-Punk⠀pressure.⠀Pick⠀an⠀inherited⠀authority⠀that⠀now⠀operates⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀technological⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀mechanism:⠀a⠀legacy⠀identity⠀system,⠀landlord's⠀building-control⠀platform,⠀hospital's⠀old⠀triage⠀code,⠀monastery's⠀maintenance⠀contract,⠀or⠀family's⠀managed⠀trust.⠀Show⠀how⠀that⠀mechanism⠀distributes⠀intimacy,⠀exposure,⠀and⠀dependence⠀in⠀present⠀urban⠀life.⠀Let⠀material⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀decay—not⠀as⠀scenery⠀but⠀as⠀the⠀site⠀where⠀someone⠀must⠀live,⠀call⠀for⠀help,⠀hide,⠀or⠀be⠀recognized.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mechanism⠀legible⠀through⠀Kamachi's⠀interaction⠀of⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀moral⠀instinct.⠀Establish⠀what⠀the⠀inherited⠀system⠀can⠀actually⠀do,⠀what⠀it⠀requires,⠀what⠀fails,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀practical⠀use:⠀a⠀resident⠀learns⠀the⠀quiet-hour⠀sensor⠀records⠀her⠀entry,⠀a⠀nurse⠀discovers⠀the⠀old⠀ward⠀code⠀also⠀sets⠀the⠀medication⠀timer,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀worker⠀realizes⠀the⠀owner's⠀key⠀can⠀still⠀override⠀safety⠀limits.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀clear⠀even⠀when⠀emotional⠀states⠀are⠀intense.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀arise⠀from⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀rather⠀than⠀imported⠀vampire⠀properties.⠀A⠀safe⠀room⠀can⠀belong⠀to⠀someone⠀else's⠀claim,⠀a⠀trusted⠀confidant⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀system's⠀exception⠀for⠀protection,⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀may⠀require⠀leaving⠀a⠀record,⠀and⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀fall⠀when⠀two⠀people⠀are⠀alone⠀with⠀a⠀failing⠀device.⠀Atmosphere⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀supply⠀new⠀powers,⠀factions,⠀or⠀blood⠀rules.⠀Keep⠀the⠀horror⠀personal⠀and⠀institutional,⠀not⠀generic⠀monster⠀terror.⠀The⠀speculative⠀alteration⠀should⠀explain⠀why⠀old⠀authority⠀persists⠀into⠀present⠀decay⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀constrains⠀a⠀particular⠀body,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀household.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀testimonial⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀from⠀one⠀participant⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀directly⠀affected⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀region,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀material;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀Indian⠀setting,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀narrative,⠀family⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀code-switching.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀did,⠀hoped,⠀and⠀learned⠀later⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀by⠀others.⠀Plain⠀first-person⠀testimony⠀is⠀appropriate,⠀but⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀contract⠀uses⠀a⠀third-person⠀or⠀focused⠀participant⠀narrator,⠀preserve⠀that⠀person⠀and⠀ownership⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀an⠀'I'⠀voice.\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀form⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀practical⠀and⠀accountable.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀describe⠀a⠀particular⠀system,⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀or⠀failure⠀through⠀direct⠀experience:⠀a⠀ration⠀interface⠀that⠀denies⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀entitlement,⠀a⠀sensor⠀network⠀that⠀reclassifies⠀a⠀field,⠀a⠀medical⠀registry⠀that⠀changes⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀ward.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀when⠀it⠀affects⠀an⠀immediate⠀decision⠀or⠀misunderstanding,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀technology⠀lesson.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀record⠀a⠀rule⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀announced⠀to⠀them⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀how⠀an⠀official,⠀employer,⠀family⠀member,⠀or⠀fellow⠀worker⠀actually⠀used⠀it.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀participant⠀knowledge⠀and⠀later⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀say⠀at⠀one⠀point,⠀'I⠀thought⠀the⠀failure⠀was⠀temporary,'⠀and⠀later⠀compare⠀that⠀with⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀or⠀official⠀later⠀showed.⠀This⠀supports⠀the⠀genre's⠀intelligible⠀consequences⠀without⠀turning⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀perfect⠀retrospection.⠀Keep⠀the⠀practical⠀movement⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀actions:⠀where⠀they⠀went,⠀who⠀answered,⠀what⠀they⠀submitted,⠀what⠀was⠀refused.⠀Allow⠀the⠀account⠀to⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀participant's⠀knowledge⠀stops;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀to⠀resolve⠀a⠀community-wide⠀system.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀must⠀be⠀socially⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀magical,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀moral⠀weight⠀of⠀having⠀lived⠀inside⠀that⠀change.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀diary⠀entry⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀participant,⠀centered⠀on⠀one⠀day⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀sequence⠀when⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀reaches⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Use⠀the⠀entry⠀form⠀to⠀mix⠀observation,⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀practical⠀event,⠀and⠀delayed⠀judgment⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀line⠀into⠀a⠀lyric⠀moment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀personality,⠀language,⠀and⠀distance:⠀some⠀records⠀are⠀terse,⠀some⠀associative,⠀some⠀argumentative,⠀and⠀no⠀universal⠀quietness⠀is⠀required.⠀Address⠀the⠀fiction's⠀current⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership;⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀supplies⠀a⠀third-person⠀consciousness⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀literal⠀'I'⠀diary⠀writer,⠀render⠀that⠀person's⠀private⠀record⠀in⠀the⠀contract's⠀chosen⠀presentation.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀concrete⠀through⠀physical⠀and⠀domestic⠀texture.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀notice⠀how⠀a⠀food⠀parcel⠀changes⠀weight⠀because⠀of⠀new⠀preservation⠀packaging,⠀how⠀a⠀communication⠀service⠀marks⠀certain⠀floors⠀unreachable,⠀how⠀a⠀body-temperature⠀signature⠀no⠀longer⠀opens⠀a⠀community⠀room,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀local⠀schedule⠀reorganizes⠀around⠀an⠀energy⠀window.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀must⠀use⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀e.g.,⠀trying⠀to⠀recharge⠀an⠀old⠀device⠀with⠀an⠀incompatible⠀current,⠀submitting⠀a⠀form⠀under⠀an⠀obsolete⠀category,⠀or⠀following⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀advice⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀the⠀system.⠀Then⠀record⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀plainly⠀enough⠀that⠀readers⠀can⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀sit⠀beside⠀event⠀without⠀overriding⠀evidence.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀compare⠀this⠀day's⠀change⠀with⠀an⠀earlier⠀season,⠀a⠀relative's⠀letter,⠀a⠀school⠀notice,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀object.⠀Use⠀such⠀comparisons⠀to⠀clarify⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀and⠀what⠀still⠀feels⠀unresolved.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀discovery,⠀emotional⠀breakthrough,⠀or⠀closing⠀summary⠀in⠀every⠀entry.⠀Keep⠀the⠀direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀teller;⠀introspection⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record,⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀what⠀occurred.⠀Preserve⠀genre⠀intelligibility:⠀the⠀speculative⠀alteration⠀has⠀consequences⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀observe⠀and⠀try⠀to⠀manage,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀full⠀system⠀remains⠀partly⠀hidden.⠀Avoid⠀supernatural⠀resolution⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀Japanese⠀literary⠀scenery,⠀seasonal⠀imagery,⠀or⠀communal⠀silence⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀naturally⠀includes⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀social-realist⠀chronicle⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀beat⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀chronicle⠀of⠀how⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀enters⠀a⠀particular⠀neighborhood,⠀workplace,⠀household,⠀or⠀institution.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator⠀visible⠀as⠀observer⠀or⠀participant:⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀from⠀a⠀window⠀or⠀gate,⠀whom⠀they⠀accompany,⠀what⠀a⠀neighbor⠀repeats,⠀and⠀which⠀official⠀or⠀employer⠀notice⠀they⠀can⠀read.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀supplied⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history;⠀do⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀simply⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀Latin⠀American.⠀Magical⠀realism⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀operation⠀here.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀practical⠀through⠀local⠀labor,⠀housing,⠀scheduling,⠀and⠀institutional⠀contact.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀describe⠀how⠀a⠀water⠀or⠀grid⠀allocation⠀changes⠀who⠀must⠀leave⠀for⠀work⠀earlier,⠀how⠀a⠀sensor⠀record⠀affects⠀a⠀family's⠀rental⠀status,⠀how⠀a⠀market⠀stall⠀adapts⠀when⠀a⠀payment⠀or⠀identity⠀service⠀fails,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀repair⠀crew⠀now⠀follows⠀a⠀different⠀priority⠀list.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀or⠀group⠀must⠀exploit,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀push⠀against⠀it:⠀a⠀grandmother⠀reuses⠀an⠀old⠀identity⠀card⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀courier⠀realizes⠀the⠀route⠀algorithm⠀does⠀not⠀recognize⠀a⠀new⠀settlement,⠀a⠀driver⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀fuel⠀conversion⠀notice.⠀Show⠀the⠀following⠀action⠀or⠀negotiation⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀physical⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀form⠀control⠀information⠀flow.⠀Accumulate⠀observations⠀and⠀quoted⠀speech;⠀place⠀the⠀speculative⠀system's⠀effects⠀in⠀repeated⠀small⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀abstract⠀opening⠀summary.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀compare⠀a⠀current⠀restriction⠀with⠀an⠀older⠀one⠀remembered⠀from⠀a⠀strike,⠀flood,⠀currency⠀change,⠀or⠀administrative⠀reform,⠀but⠀the⠀comparison⠀must⠀stay⠀inside⠀the⠀story's⠀actual⠀history.⠀Maintain⠀distinctions⠀between⠀seen⠀event,⠀repeated⠀report,⠀and⠀inference:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀someone⠀claimed,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀suspects.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀climax,⠀or⠀an⠀omnipotent⠀resolution.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀become⠀socially⠀concrete⠀and⠀unequally⠀felt⠀while⠀remaining⠀a⠀real⠀material⠀mechanism⠀in⠀the⠀fiction's⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nStart⠀inside⠀an⠀immediate⠀situation⠀where⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀is⠀already⠀affecting⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀acts.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀person,⠀place,⠀and⠀current⠀task⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat:⠀hurrying⠀to⠀catch⠀a⠀scheduled⠀transit⠀that⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀body-scan,⠀trying⠀to⠀access⠀a⠀storage⠀unit⠀with⠀an⠀outdated⠀badge,⠀or⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀delivery⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀address⠀system⠀may⠀reroute.⠀Establish⠀the⠀spatial⠀layout⠀in⠀plain,⠀concrete⠀terms⠀so⠀readers⠀can⠀follow⠀where⠀people⠀and⠀objects⠀are.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀to⠀separate⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀becomes⠀important,⠀explain⠀it⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀use:⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀noticing⠀the⠀changed⠀rule,⠀misreading⠀it,⠀or⠀trying⠀an⠀old⠀habit⠀against⠀the⠀new⠀system.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀student⠀may⠀swipe⠀a⠀card⠀from⠀last⠀term⠀and⠀discover⠀the⠀cafeteria⠀credit⠀is⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀health⠀flag;⠀a⠀courier⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀route⠀overlay⠀that⠀was⠀designed⠀for⠀a⠀district⠀no⠀longer⠀existing.⠀Immediately⠀show⠀the⠀physical⠀result:⠀the⠀rejected⠀entry,⠀the⠀changed⠀route,⠀the⠀warning⠀notice,⠀the⠀automatic⠀reschedule.⠀Then⠀provide⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀reaction—serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀wry—without⠀turning⠀everyone⠀into⠀a⠀quipper⠀or⠀forcing⠀a⠀comedic⠀beat.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀exchange,⠀let⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀continue⠀in⠀a⠀natural⠀direction.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀second⠀attempt,⠀a⠀question⠀to⠀someone⠀nearby,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀wait,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀realization.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀mystery.⠀Instead,⠀keep⠀the⠀mechanism⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀consequences⠀legible;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀what⠀changed,⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀tried⠀to⠀respond,⠀and⠀what⠀might⠀come⠀next.⠀Preserve⠀contract-required⠀perspective,⠀including⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀and⠀avoid⠀explaining⠀the⠀same⠀mechanism⠀twice⠀unless⠀a⠀second⠀character's⠀misunderstanding⠀genuinely⠀revisits⠀a⠀different⠀aspect.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀transitions⠀clean⠀and⠀avoid⠀dense⠀lecturing⠀about⠀the⠀speculative⠀system.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nCompose⠀each⠀scene⠀so⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀is⠀felt⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀named.⠀Open⠀attention⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀alteration⠀does⠀to⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀work⠀shift,⠀or⠀a⠀sentence⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀and⠀let⠀images⠀carry⠀the⠀explanation:⠀a⠀comparison⠀earns⠀its⠀place⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀a⠀rule⠀newly⠀intelligible⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀field⠀around⠀the⠀relay⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀teeth,⠀why⠀rationed⠀seconds⠀pass⠀differently⠀from⠀ordinary⠀ones.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀state⠀the⠀operative⠀terms⠀plainly⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀movement⠀of⠀attention,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀later⠀reversal⠀lands⠀twice,⠀as⠀an⠀image⠀returning⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning⠀and⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀physical⠀consequence.\n\nGive⠀rhythm⠀tactical⠀work.⠀Short⠀declarative⠀clauses⠀can⠀fix⠀position,⠀resource,⠀and⠀cost;⠀longer⠀associative⠀sentences⠀carry⠀perception⠀between⠀actions,⠀especially⠀in⠀the⠀stretch⠀before⠀a⠀reversal⠀when⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀is⠀still⠀incomplete.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀and⠀images⠀mark⠀progression⠀and⠀danger⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀glare⠀at⠀the⠀gate,⠀the⠀same⠀taste⠀in⠀the⠀recycled⠀air⠀—⠀but⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀image⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀it⠀means,⠀not⠀as⠀ornament⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀Keep⠀plain⠀statements⠀in⠀reserve⠀as⠀contrast⠀and⠀anchor:⠀counts,⠀distances,⠀the⠀exact⠀name⠀of⠀a⠀part.⠀The⠀figurative⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration;⠀a⠀technician,⠀a⠀child,⠀or⠀a⠀tired⠀administrator⠀still⠀speaks⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀idiom.\n\nTrack⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀underneath⠀the⠀music.⠀Let⠀a⠀device's⠀limit⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀aim⠀and⠀error⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀narrator⠀footnote,⠀and⠀keep⠀what⠀was⠀spent,⠀what⠀moved,⠀and⠀who⠀saw⠀it⠀reconstructable.⠀Interior⠀perception⠀—⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices,⠀dreads,⠀and⠀cannot⠀yet⠀say⠀aloud⠀—⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀account.⠀End⠀mid-motion⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀mid-motion:⠀a⠀task⠀continuing,⠀an⠀exchange⠀unfinished,⠀the⠀held⠀moment⠀after⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀situation,⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀action⠀to⠀deliver⠀an⠀epiphany.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀an⠀alteration⠀someone⠀lives⠀with.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀how⠀a⠀practice,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀body,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀worked⠀before⠀and⠀how⠀it⠀works⠀now⠀—⠀the⠀queue⠀that⠀replaced⠀the⠀visit,⠀the⠀sensation⠀an⠀augmentation⠀no⠀longer⠀returns,⠀the⠀trade⠀the⠀new⠀route⠀closed⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀characters⠀size⠀up⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀that⠀difference.⠀Where⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters⠀to⠀a⠀decision,⠀explain⠀it⠀by⠀contrast⠀with⠀what⠀it⠀replaced:⠀the⠀old⠀procedure,⠀the⠀earlier⠀limit,⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀do⠀this⠀work.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀still⠀arrive⠀in⠀present⠀action,⠀because⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀problem⠀happens⠀now.\n\nGive⠀memory⠀a⠀causal⠀role.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀can⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀budgets⠀a⠀resource,⠀trusts⠀a⠀system,⠀or⠀reads⠀another⠀person's⠀hesitation;⠀show⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀the⠀memory⠀shapes⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀rather⠀than⠀stopping⠀at⠀the⠀mood.⠀Attach⠀reflection⠀to⠀the⠀teller:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀think⠀directly⠀about⠀passing⠀time,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀single⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀association,⠀keeping⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀within⠀what⠀this⠀viewpoint⠀could⠀actually⠀have⠀experienced.⠀Present⠀texture⠀survives⠀alongside⠀it⠀—⠀food⠀still⠀tastes⠀good,⠀a⠀repaired⠀machine⠀still⠀satisfies,⠀a⠀joke⠀still⠀lands⠀—⠀and⠀longing⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀competence.\n\nDo⠀not⠀schedule⠀grief.⠀Some⠀scenes⠀carry⠀loss;⠀others⠀carry⠀work,⠀curiosity,⠀irritation,⠀or⠀relief,⠀and⠀the⠀reflective⠀treatment⠀lies⠀in⠀how⠀attention⠀moves⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀an⠀obligatory⠀ache⠀per⠀scene.⠀Ordinary⠀stakes⠀stay⠀ordinary:⠀an⠀errand⠀under⠀altered⠀conditions,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀decision,⠀a⠀hard⠀conversation.⠀A⠀reply⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀by⠀underlining⠀impermanence;⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀exchange,⠀task,⠀or⠀thought⠀actually⠀stops,⠀and⠀leave⠀later⠀feeling⠀available⠀rather⠀than⠀summarized.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀act⠀of⠀transmission:⠀one⠀teller,⠀speaking⠀to⠀listeners⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀who⠀has⠀witnessed,⠀learned,⠀or⠀inherited⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀repeats⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀reason⠀of⠀their⠀own.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀teller⠀placing⠀the⠀account⠀—⠀where⠀it⠀happened,⠀who⠀vouched⠀for⠀it,⠀why⠀it⠀is⠀being⠀told⠀now⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀frame⠀govern⠀access:⠀the⠀teller⠀reports⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀what⠀a⠀named⠀source⠀told⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀disputed,⠀borrowing⠀no⠀omniscience.⠀Use⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplied,⠀and⠀keep⠀distinct⠀traditions⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀drape⠀the⠀telling⠀in⠀generic⠀antiquity,⠀imported⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀an⠀assumed⠀honor⠀code.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mechanism⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀testimony.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀the⠀changed⠀world⠀matters,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀explain⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀witness⠀would:⠀by⠀practical⠀demonstration,⠀by⠀the⠀saying⠀the⠀community⠀uses⠀for⠀it,⠀or⠀by⠀an⠀admitted⠀inference⠀—⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀limits⠀visible,⠀since⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀verify⠀some⠀effects,⠀misread⠀others,⠀and⠀pass⠀both⠀along.⠀Repetition⠀is⠀the⠀method⠀of⠀transmission:⠀a⠀designation,⠀formula,⠀or⠀proverb⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀its⠀application,⠀and⠀a⠀hearer⠀may⠀interrupt⠀to⠀question⠀a⠀detail,⠀offer⠀the⠀version⠀they⠀were⠀told⠀differently,⠀or⠀press⠀the⠀teller⠀into⠀defending⠀the⠀account.⠀That⠀friction⠀can⠀revise⠀trust⠀or⠀open⠀the⠀next⠀portion⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀without⠀settling⠀everything⠀at⠀once.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀ordinary⠀consequence⠀—⠀work,⠀households,⠀streets,⠀obligations,⠀what⠀the⠀new⠀rules⠀permit⠀and⠀forbid⠀—⠀never⠀an⠀exotic⠀backdrop.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀itself⠀an⠀occasion⠀with⠀a⠀present:⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀hesitates⠀over,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀costs⠀or⠀spares⠀them,⠀is⠀available⠀as⠀private⠀experience⠀inside⠀the⠀frame.⠀End⠀where⠀telling⠀and⠀scene⠀end⠀together⠀—⠀an⠀event⠀cutting⠀the⠀audience⠀short,⠀a⠀disputed⠀point⠀left⠀hanging,⠀a⠀consequence⠀still⠀being⠀lived⠀with⠀—⠀without⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀few⠀details⠀and⠀make⠀each⠀load-bearing.⠀Enter⠀a⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀object,⠀effect,⠀spoken⠀line,⠀or⠀remembered⠀fact⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀current⠀rule:⠀the⠀reading⠀that⠀matters,⠀the⠀hand⠀position⠀that⠀avoids⠀the⠀burn,⠀the⠀sentence⠀someone⠀repeats⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀now⠀procedure.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀uses⠀it,⠀misreads⠀it,⠀or⠀pays⠀for⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀result⠀land⠀within⠀the⠀next⠀few⠀clauses⠀—⠀the⠀cost,⠀the⠀correction,⠀the⠀damage⠀—⠀instead⠀of⠀restating⠀the⠀principle.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀an⠀inferable⠀path:⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀reconstruct⠀why⠀an⠀action⠀was⠀taken⠀without⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀justification,⠀but⠀cause⠀is⠀never⠀simply⠀deleted.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀clean.⠀Track⠀position,⠀resource,⠀and⠀time⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses;⠀let⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀redirected⠀attention,⠀or⠀an⠀untouched⠀object⠀imply⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀say.⠀Interior⠀experience⠀stays,⠀in⠀proportion:⠀one⠀exact⠀rendering⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows,⠀wants,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀admit⠀outdoes⠀expanded⠀meditation,⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀longer⠀sentence⠀may⠀carry⠀an⠀essential⠀reversal⠀or⠀realization⠀where⠀compression⠀would⠀blur⠀it.⠀Sentence⠀length⠀follows⠀the⠀beat⠀—⠀short⠀for⠀impact⠀and⠀check,⠀extended⠀where⠀the⠀action⠀genuinely⠀runs⠀on⠀—⠀never⠀performed⠀fragmentation.\n\nVoices⠀remain⠀individual⠀inside⠀the⠀economy:⠀foreman,⠀child,⠀and⠀auditor⠀do⠀not⠀converge⠀into⠀one⠀clipped⠀cadence.⠀Let⠀unknowns⠀stay⠀unknown⠀and⠀matter⠀as⠀unknowns;⠀a⠀system⠀behaving⠀strangely⠀may⠀go⠀unexplained⠀this⠀scene.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀edge⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀mid-exchange,⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀consequence⠀registers⠀—⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀line⠀that⠀says⠀what⠀it⠀all⠀meant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Begin⠀inside⠀an⠀occasion⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀aim⠀—⠀a⠀delivery,⠀an⠀inspection,⠀an⠀argument⠀over⠀access⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀appear⠀as⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀that⠀aim:⠀what⠀the⠀permit⠀allows,⠀what⠀the⠀modification⠀costs,⠀whom⠀the⠀new⠀procedure⠀protects.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀inner⠀experience;⠀when⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀deliver⠀the⠀explanation⠀through⠀the⠀steps⠀that⠀provoke⠀it,⠀a⠀character's⠀partial⠀understanding,⠀or⠀an⠀argument⠀between⠀people⠀with⠀different⠀stakes,⠀never⠀by⠀stepping⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀sidebar.⠀The⠀presentation⠀is⠀contemporary;⠀the⠀world⠀may⠀be⠀any⠀period⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies.\n\nLet⠀paragraphing⠀carry⠀the⠀pace.⠀A⠀break⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀problem,⠀or⠀the⠀beat⠀where⠀a⠀reversal⠀lands;⠀orient⠀with⠀concrete⠀anchors⠀—⠀a⠀name,⠀an⠀object⠀already⠀established,⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀The⠀viewpoint's⠀current⠀understanding⠀is⠀the⠀standard⠀for⠀description:⠀what⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀been⠀learned⠀stays⠀outside⠀the⠀prose⠀or⠀arrives⠀as⠀someone⠀else's⠀claim,⠀and⠀another⠀character's⠀unexplained⠀behavior⠀may⠀wait⠀minutes⠀or⠀chapters⠀for⠀its⠀clarification.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀stay⠀physically⠀legible⠀—⠀who⠀moved,⠀what⠀was⠀spent,⠀what⠀broke⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀surprise⠀and⠀later⠀reconstruction⠀are⠀both⠀available.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀register⠀fluid⠀and⠀character-set:⠀the⠀same⠀narrative⠀voice⠀can⠀run⠀dry⠀during⠀maintenance,⠀tender⠀in⠀a⠀kitchen,⠀sharp⠀in⠀a⠀dispute,⠀its⠀rhythm⠀set⠀by⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀uniform⠀cadence.⠀Interiority⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀weave⠀—⠀attention,⠀doubt,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀this⠀failed,⠀the⠀motive⠀beneath⠀a⠀request.⠀End⠀mid-motion⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀mid-motion:⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀work⠀continuing,⠀a⠀door⠀not⠀yet⠀opened;⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary,⠀not⠀a⠀completed⠀arc,⠀decides⠀the⠀stopping⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation,⠀not⠀around⠀it.⠀Select⠀scenes⠀where⠀the⠀world's⠀rules⠀put⠀the⠀relationship's⠀private⠀terms⠀into⠀play:⠀the⠀shorthand⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀built⠀for⠀a⠀dangerous⠀procedure,⠀the⠀promise⠀altered⠀conditions⠀now⠀test,⠀the⠀routine⠀the⠀new⠀permissions⠀or⠀prohibitions⠀have⠀bent.⠀Build⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀only⠀—⠀its⠀history,⠀its⠀people,⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀already⠀established.⠀Read⠀the⠀premise⠀for⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀it⠀sets⠀running,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀jealousy,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀care,⠀and⠀fulfill⠀that;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀to⠀fill⠀space.\n\nLet⠀feeling⠀operate⠀tactically⠀and⠀tactics⠀emotionally,⠀because⠀here⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀is⠀both.⠀A⠀character⠀reads⠀a⠀partner's⠀handling⠀of⠀equipment⠀as⠀intimacy⠀or⠀as⠀alarm,⠀times⠀a⠀confession⠀against⠀a⠀system's⠀cycle,⠀spends⠀a⠀resource⠀to⠀spare⠀the⠀other⠀a⠀cost,⠀or⠀mistakes⠀protection⠀for⠀control.⠀Show⠀the⠀reading⠀and⠀the⠀choice⠀—⠀interior⠀experience⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀response⠀their⠀own:⠀cooperation,⠀refusal,⠀and⠀surprise⠀are⠀all⠀live.⠀Callbacks⠀return⠀to⠀established⠀moments,⠀objects,⠀or⠀phrasing,⠀and⠀each⠀return⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀now⠀rather⠀than⠀restating⠀affection.\n\nGive⠀the⠀relevant⠀emotion⠀the⠀room⠀it⠀deserves,⠀then⠀let⠀ordinary⠀competence⠀and⠀friction⠀resume;⠀a⠀slow⠀beat⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀inserted⠀as⠀tax.⠀Private⠀language⠀is⠀an⠀artifact⠀of⠀shared⠀history⠀—⠀dated,⠀specific,⠀possibly⠀embarrassing⠀—⠀and⠀stays⠀unknown⠀outside⠀the⠀relationship⠀unless⠀spoken⠀aloud.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀boundary:⠀a⠀reassurance⠀mid-delivery,⠀an⠀argument⠀paused⠀with⠀work⠀still⠀pending,⠀a⠀payoff⠀building⠀across⠀exchanges⠀rather⠀than⠀cashed⠀in⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀already⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀—⠀who⠀these⠀people⠀are⠀to⠀each⠀other,⠀what⠀was⠀at⠀stake,⠀where⠀the⠀deed⠀was⠀done⠀—⠀and⠀establish⠀persons,⠀resources,⠀and⠀mechanisms⠀in⠀compact⠀declarations:⠀what⠀the⠀machine⠀would⠀and⠀would⠀not⠀do,⠀what⠀the⠀agreement⠀required,⠀who⠀owned⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Let⠀deeds⠀carry⠀the⠀explanation:⠀a⠀limit⠀is⠀learned⠀by⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀harm⠀or⠀opportunity⠀it⠀produced,⠀and⠀the⠀account⠀records⠀that⠀act⠀in⠀terms⠀a⠀community⠀can⠀remember⠀—⠀what⠀was⠀spent,⠀who⠀paid,⠀what⠀changed⠀hands.⠀Where⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀kinship,⠀a⠀gift,⠀or⠀a⠀feud⠀already⠀organizes⠀the⠀situation,⠀let⠀it⠀organize⠀the⠀telling.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀intact⠀inside⠀the⠀chronicle⠀cadence.⠀An⠀oral⠀explanation⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀practical⠀term,⠀reach⠀for⠀a⠀familiar⠀comparison,⠀or⠀state⠀the⠀result⠀outright,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀mechanism⠀into⠀metaphor;⠀the⠀listener⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀reconstruct⠀what⠀was⠀possible⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀action⠀succeeded⠀or⠀failed.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀its⠀application⠀—⠀the⠀same⠀caution⠀spoken⠀over⠀a⠀different⠀body,⠀the⠀gift⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀debt⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀names⠀take⠀their⠀weight⠀from⠀recorded⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀ornamental⠀epithets.\n\nHold⠀apart⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀known:⠀the⠀telling⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀person's⠀public⠀reputation⠀alongside⠀their⠀private⠀reasoning⠀and⠀choice,⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀is⠀material,⠀not⠀error.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀—⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀disputes⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀meets⠀grand⠀phrasing⠀with⠀plain⠀business⠀—⠀without⠀turning⠀to⠀parody.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀account's⠀work⠀ends,⠀a⠀task⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed⠀and⠀another⠀remembered⠀consequence⠀left⠀open;⠀the⠀telling⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀own⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀social-realist⠀story⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀changes⠀one⠀specific⠀everyday⠀institution,⠀workplace⠀routine,⠀or⠀domestic⠀practice.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀element⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary:⠀how⠀a⠀household⠀budgets⠀against⠀a⠀new⠀service,⠀how⠀a⠀clinic⠀triages⠀a⠀changed⠀symptom,⠀how⠀a⠀municipal⠀office⠀reviews⠀an⠀application⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀rule.⠀Let⠀characters⠀meet⠀the⠀consequence⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀through⠀exposition⠀to⠀a⠀visitor.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀explain⠀enough⠀of⠀its⠀operational⠀rule⠀for⠀that⠀use⠀to⠀be⠀legible,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀result⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀physical⠀or⠀institutional⠀step.⠀Keep⠀the⠀chain⠀rapid⠀and⠀causal:⠀a⠀missed⠀clause⠀in⠀a⠀regulation,⠀a⠀wrong⠀assumption⠀about⠀a⠀device's⠀reset⠀condition,⠀or⠀a⠀resource⠀placed⠀where⠀another⠀person⠀can⠀use⠀it⠀should⠀immediately⠀alter⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen,⠀approved,⠀paid,⠀or⠀delivered.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀full⠀technical⠀essay⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀need⠀that⠀detail⠀for⠀the⠀action⠀at⠀hand.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀route:⠀observe⠀family⠀pressures,⠀work⠀hierarchies,⠀public⠀offices,⠀housing,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀courtesy.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀the⠀region⠀into⠀an⠀empty⠀wilderness⠀or⠀a⠀mood⠀of⠀isolation.⠀If⠀a⠀setting-relevant⠀context⠀is⠀supplied,⠀keep⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀distinctions⠀where⠀they⠀matter;⠀otherwise⠀remain⠀neutral⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀stereotypes.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀character's⠀practical⠀reasoning,⠀but⠀private⠀thought⠀remains⠀in⠀that⠀character's⠀authorized⠀interiority,⠀not⠀shared⠀with⠀others.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀stop⠀at⠀whatever⠀point⠀the⠀active⠀scene⠀boundary⠀reaches:⠀a⠀request⠀accepted,⠀a⠀queued⠀file⠀returned,⠀a⠀room⠀locked,⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀only⠀beginning⠀to⠀cost⠀the⠀character,⠀or⠀a⠀supported⠀reversal⠀already⠀completed.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fixed⠀causal⠀step,⠀a⠀solution,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀character⠀arc⠀before⠀the⠀reply⠀can⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀a⠀screenplay⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀dialogue⠀blocks,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀time⠀or⠀place⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise's⠀rule⠀appear⠀through⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀business:⠀a⠀character⠀presses⠀a⠀control,⠀reads⠀a⠀notice⠀aloud,⠀tests⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀scans⠀a⠀code,⠀and⠀another⠀character's⠀response⠀turns⠀that⠀action⠀into⠀a⠀consequence.⠀Avoid⠀narrator⠀explanation⠀of⠀the⠀mechanism;⠀instead,⠀let⠀dialogue⠀or⠀an⠀on-screen⠀object⠀clarify⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi-tactical⠀pacing:⠀a⠀short⠀action⠀beat⠀establishes⠀the⠀rule,⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀on⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀result⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀available⠀move.⠀The⠀reversal⠀can⠀be⠀physical⠀(a⠀lock⠀re-engages),⠀institutional⠀(a⠀screen⠀denies⠀access),⠀or⠀social⠀(a⠀colleague⠀corrects⠀the⠀assumption),⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀shown⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀event,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀rapid⠀and⠀legible;⠀if⠀a⠀technical⠀detail⠀matters,⠀have⠀one⠀character⠀explain⠀it⠀to⠀another⠀for⠀an⠀actual⠀purpose.\n\nDo⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀them;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀information.⠀If⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀place⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀outside⠀the⠀dialogue,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀new⠀instruction,⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀still⠀in⠀progress.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀stage⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀be⠀staged⠀physically:⠀a⠀character⠀reads⠀a⠀regulation,⠀handles⠀a⠀device,⠀enters⠀a⠀restricted⠀area,⠀or⠀asks⠀another⠀character⠀to⠀test⠀something.⠀The⠀rule⠀should⠀become⠀known⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀says⠀or⠀does⠀on⠀stage,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀unplayable⠀narrator⠀explanation.⠀A⠀mechanism⠀can⠀be⠀explained⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀needs⠀that⠀rule⠀for⠀an⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀mistake.\n\nUse⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀to⠀make⠀Kamachi-style⠀reversals⠀testable.⠀If⠀a⠀door⠀was⠀locked,⠀show⠀a⠀character⠀trying⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀container⠀is⠀out⠀of⠀reach,⠀place⠀it⠀high⠀and⠀let⠀someone⠀stretch⠀for⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀permission⠀is⠀revoked,⠀have⠀a⠀character⠀produce⠀the⠀controlling⠀object⠀or⠀signal.⠀The⠀action⠀beats⠀should⠀follow⠀quickly:⠀establish⠀the⠀rule,⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀show⠀the⠀new⠀physical⠀or⠀institutional⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀audience's⠀presence.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀a⠀hidden⠀event⠀offstage⠀unless⠀its⠀effects⠀are⠀then⠀shown⠀on⠀stage.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions⠀or⠀audible⠀thoughts.⠀Required⠀private⠀interiority⠀must⠀appear⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀dramatic⠀entrance,⠀a⠀practical⠀standoff,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀still⠀in⠀progress.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀association,⠀not⠀chronological⠀summary.⠀Braid⠀the⠀familiar⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀a⠀snatch⠀of⠀remembered⠀instruction,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀half-sentence⠀of⠀reasoning.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀approaches⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀speculative⠀mechanism,⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀relevant⠀rule⠀as⠀it⠀catches⠀the⠀character's⠀attention:⠀the⠀sign's⠀exact⠀phrase,⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀two⠀buttons,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀prior⠀attempt,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀colleague⠀phrased⠀the⠀procedure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀distinguish⠀live⠀perception⠀from⠀memory⠀or⠀fantasy.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi-tactical⠀movement⠀inside⠀the⠀mind:⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀detail,⠀follows⠀its⠀implication,⠀decides⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀decide,⠀and⠀acts.⠀The⠀sentence⠀shape⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀short⠀clauses⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀the⠀exploitable⠀point,⠀then⠀shift⠀to⠀a⠀rapid⠀external⠀sequence⠀when⠀the⠀action⠀occurs.⠀Keep⠀the⠀mechanism's⠀causal⠀chain⠀present:⠀misreading⠀a⠀label⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀wrong⠀input;⠀anticipating⠀a⠀reset⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀timed⠀gesture.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀style⠀dissolve⠀the⠀event's⠀physical⠀consequences.\n\nDo⠀not⠀transfer⠀the⠀associative⠀mind⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Focal⠀access⠀remains⠀with⠀the⠀authorized⠀viewpoint.⠀No⠀obligatory⠀epiphany⠀or⠀moral⠀reflection⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀thought⠀may⠀simply⠀run⠀out⠀at⠀a⠀practical⠀step.⠀Let⠀the⠀reply⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀after⠀an⠀action,⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt,⠀a⠀new⠀local⠀awareness,⠀or⠀a⠀thought⠀still⠀forming.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀in⠀a⠀readable⠀transcript.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀edits,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀speculative⠀action.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀one⠀character⠀sends⠀an⠀instruction,⠀another⠀asks⠀a⠀question,⠀misreads⠀a⠀code,⠀or⠀forwards⠀a⠀partial⠀file.⠀Show⠀the⠀mechanism's⠀rules⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀sender⠀claims⠀or⠀requests,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀inserted⠀essay.⠀A⠀typo,⠀a⠀missed⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀command⠀pasted⠀incorrectly⠀can⠀create⠀the⠀next⠀turn.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi-tactical⠀pacing⠀inside⠀the⠀transcript.⠀A⠀short⠀exchange⠀establishes⠀the⠀rule;⠀the⠀next⠀message⠀shows⠀a⠀character⠀exploiting⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀it;⠀the⠀following⠀messages⠀make⠀the⠀consequence⠀legible⠀through⠀replies,⠀screenshots,⠀or⠀interface⠀metadata.⠀The⠀rapid⠀shift⠀can⠀be⠀social⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀mechanical:⠀an⠀apology,⠀a⠀retraction,⠀a⠀claim⠀of⠀having⠀done⠀something⠀differently,⠀or⠀a⠀demand⠀for⠀proof.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀understandable,⠀not⠀merely⠀snappy.\n\nSeparate⠀any⠀narrative⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀break;⠀do⠀not⠀blend⠀private⠀thought⠀with⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Distinguish⠀sent⠀messages⠀from⠀unsent⠀drafts,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀character's⠀typing⠀habits⠀reflect⠀their⠀actual⠀habits.⠀Let⠀the⠀reply⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀that⠀opens⠀a⠀concrete⠀next⠀move,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply,⠀or⠀a⠀draft⠀still⠀being⠀composed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀beats:⠀a⠀concise⠀setting⠀line,⠀attributed⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀visible⠀or⠀local⠀action:⠀a⠀button⠀press,⠀a⠀scan,⠀a⠀wrong⠀input,⠀a⠀question.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀include⠀a⠀short⠀narrative⠀passage⠀explaining⠀the⠀rule⠀the⠀character⠀needs,⠀but⠀not⠀an⠀encyclopedic⠀pause.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀marks⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀change⠀or⠀realization⠀without⠀acting⠀as⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀detector.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi-tactical⠀pacing⠀within⠀the⠀scene.⠀Establish⠀the⠀rule⠀in⠀one⠀beat,⠀show⠀a⠀character⠀exploiting⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀next,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀condition,⠀a⠀changed⠀expression,⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀failure.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable:⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀did,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀different.⠀Avoid⠀summarizing⠀a⠀reversal⠀off-scene⠀unless⠀its⠀result⠀is⠀shown⠀when⠀the⠀player⠀returns.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀unless⠀separately⠀authorized.⠀Required⠀private⠀thought⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀interiority;⠀if⠀hidden,⠀use⠀the⠀active⠀wrapper;⠀if⠀visible,⠀make⠀it⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀narrative⠀passage,⠀not⠀dialogue.⠀Let⠀the⠀reply⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀a⠀scene⠀line,⠀a⠀reaction,⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀a⠀legible⠀starting⠀point,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀still⠀in⠀progress.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPananbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀an⠀installment⠀that⠀opens⠀with⠀a⠀local⠀through-line:⠀what⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀is⠀currently⠀in⠀play,⠀what⠀character⠀is⠀testing⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀consequence⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀shift.⠀Recover⠀past⠀story⠀context⠀only⠀briefly⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀the⠀current⠀exploitation⠀or⠀misunderstanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀re-explain⠀the⠀entire⠀speculative⠀world.⠀Show⠀the⠀mechanism⠀in⠀operation:⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀a⠀loophole,⠀misapplies⠀a⠀condition,⠀or⠀asks⠀another⠀person⠀to⠀confirm⠀a⠀rule,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph⠀shows⠀the⠀concrete⠀result.\n\nUse⠀Kamachi-tactical⠀pacing⠀inside⠀the⠀installment.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀from⠀rule⠀to⠀attempt⠀to⠀changed⠀state;⠀the⠀reversal⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀denial,⠀a⠀recalculation,⠀a⠀newly⠀available⠀option,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀consequence⠀that⠀changes⠀who⠀will⠀cooperate.⠀Keep⠀the⠀causal⠀sequence⠀understandable,⠀and⠀leave⠀a⠀specific⠀development⠀that⠀can⠀carry⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀reply:⠀a⠀permit⠀expires,⠀a⠀lock⠀is⠀reconfigured,⠀an⠀ally⠀learns⠀the⠀trick,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀now⠀owes⠀something.⠀Progress⠀may⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀resource,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀a⠀victory.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀installment⠀into⠀a⠀complete⠀mini-chapter.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀after⠀a⠀local⠀change,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀single⠀new⠀fact⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀character's⠀next⠀available⠀move,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀action⠀still⠀in⠀progress.⠀Keep⠀the⠀serial's⠀voice⠀consistent⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀changes⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀reached⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀life:⠀a⠀changed⠀body,⠀a⠀recorded⠀intimacy,⠀a⠀market⠀that⠀prices⠀a⠀particular⠀memory,⠀or⠀a⠀communication⠀system⠀that⠀makes⠀absence⠀newly⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀world⠀summary;⠀open⠀inside⠀a⠀moment⠀where⠀the⠀premise⠀and⠀a⠀strained⠀relationship⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀action.⠀Describe⠀sensory⠀particulars⠀in⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀controlled⠀lushness:⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀surface,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀kept⠀object,⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀light⠀falls⠀on⠀a⠀face⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀cannot⠀fully⠀read.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀move⠀through⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀attachment.⠀Show⠀a⠀character⠀noticing⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say,⠀or⠀saying⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀leaves⠀them⠀more⠀exposed.⠀Let⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀respond⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀hostile⠀or⠀merely⠀reassuring;⠀partial⠀comfort,⠀deliberate⠀withholding,⠀and⠀misunderstood⠀apology⠀all⠀keep⠀the⠀turbulence⠀alive.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀emotional⠀problem⠀unavoidable,⠀not⠀decorative:⠀a⠀shared⠀implant⠀may⠀replay⠀an⠀admission⠀the⠀speaker⠀wants⠀to⠀retract;⠀a⠀longevity⠀treatment⠀may⠀leave⠀one⠀partner⠀with⠀the⠀other's⠀aging⠀body⠀as⠀a⠀daily⠀reminder;⠀a⠀closed⠀habitat⠀may⠀turn⠀an⠀old⠀resentment⠀into⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀air⠀and⠀water.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀in⠀one⠀person⠀at⠀a⠀time,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀mind.⠀What⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows⠀and⠀guesses⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀observe,⠀remember,⠀and⠀infer.⠀Use⠀remembered⠀places⠀and⠀objects⠀to⠀carry⠀unresolved⠀feeling:⠀a⠀scar⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀medical⠀procedure,⠀a⠀dress⠀kept⠀from⠀a⠀ceremony⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀means⠀what⠀it⠀meant,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀opened.⠀Let⠀physical⠀sensation⠀release⠀emotion⠀rather⠀than⠀summarize⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀turns⠀painful,⠀let⠀the⠀pain⠀have⠀a⠀specific⠀source⠀in⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀culture⠀of⠀suffering.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀immediate⠀pressure⠀has⠀made⠀something⠀newly⠀legible⠀or⠀newly⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀next⠀response⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀conversation,⠀refuse⠀it,⠀or⠀turn⠀toward⠀practical⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀rupture.⠀The⠀speculative⠀and⠀emotional⠀lines⠀should⠀remain⠀open⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀roleplay⠀turn⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval.⠀Use⠀the⠀scene's⠀speculative⠀detail⠀as⠀an⠀active⠀environmental⠀or⠀social⠀fact:⠀a⠀bioluminescent⠀algae⠀wall⠀that⠀changes⠀color⠀with⠀contamination,⠀a⠀shared⠀neural⠀link⠀that⠀broadcasts⠀only⠀agreed-upon⠀touches,⠀or⠀a⠀repair⠀schedule⠀that⠀forces⠀two⠀people⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀airlock.⠀Keep⠀each⠀narrative⠀paragraph⠀scannable⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀concrete⠀observation.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀to⠀a⠀named⠀speaker⠀and⠀let⠀body⠀language,⠀object⠀handling,⠀and⠀sensory⠀awareness⠀carry⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀precision⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀conversational⠀pace.\n\nLet⠀attachment⠀show⠀through⠀small,⠀cost-bearing⠀choices.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀adjust⠀someone's⠀sleeve⠀against⠀a⠀cold⠀vent,⠀remember⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀medicine⠀from⠀before⠀the⠀migration,⠀or⠀choose⠀a⠀seat⠀where⠀they⠀can⠀watch⠀a⠀particular⠀expression.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀technical⠀lecture;⠀let⠀the⠀speculative⠀facts⠀appear⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know,⠀argue⠀over,⠀or⠀avoid⠀saying.⠀If⠀one⠀character⠀guesses⠀another's⠀motive,⠀show⠀the⠀guess⠀as⠀fallible⠀and⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀this⠀viewpoint⠀has⠀actually⠀seen⠀or⠀heard.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀clear⠀and⠀natural,⠀with⠀enough⠀narrative⠀movement⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀everything.⠀A⠀misunderstanding⠀about⠀a⠀food⠀synthesizer⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀a⠀more⠀dangerous⠀secret;⠀a⠀shared⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀flooded⠀district⠀can⠀make⠀an⠀apology⠀almost⠀possible.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀fresh⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀other's⠀expression,⠀when⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀remains⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀player⠀enter⠀the⠀action⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀restart⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀narrative⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀a⠀historical⠀and⠀neighborhood⠀fact⠀before⠀it⠀becomes⠀a⠀plot⠀device:⠀a⠀district's⠀first⠀medical⠀scanner⠀now⠀sits⠀where⠀a⠀family⠀altar⠀used⠀to⠀be;⠀a⠀delivery⠀drone⠀follows⠀the⠀path⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀tram⠀line;⠀an⠀artificial⠀lake⠀preserves⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀flooded⠀courtyard.⠀Let⠀characters⠀move⠀through⠀these⠀layered⠀places⠀with⠀the⠀awareness⠀that⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀cost⠀them⠀something.⠀Keep⠀the⠀perspective⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀single⠀focal⠀character⠀who⠀sees⠀the⠀world⠀through⠀remembered⠀domestic⠀rhythm⠀and⠀current⠀obligation.\n\nBuild⠀scenes⠀from⠀concrete⠀settings⠀and⠀everyday⠀transactions:⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared⠀from⠀printed⠀food,⠀a⠀stairwell⠀where⠀a⠀maintenance⠀robot⠀hums,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀cannot⠀open⠀because⠀of⠀pressure⠀seals.⠀Within⠀these⠀settings,⠀let⠀desire,⠀jealousy,⠀guilt,⠀and⠀recollection⠀stay⠀unannounced.⠀Use⠀the⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀profile's⠀sensual⠀precision:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀jade⠀bracelet⠀against⠀a⠀wrist⠀with⠀a⠀medical⠀implant,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀incense⠀under⠀recycled⠀air,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀lover's⠀hand⠀pauses⠀before⠀touching⠀a⠀biometric⠀lock.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀should⠀disturb⠀the⠀intimacy⠀without⠀replacing⠀it:⠀a⠀memory⠀backup⠀that⠀keeps⠀a⠀parent's⠀voice⠀available,⠀a⠀longevity⠀credit⠀that⠀changes⠀who⠀can⠀care⠀for⠀whom,⠀a⠀city⠀zoning⠀algorithm⠀that⠀decides⠀which⠀homes⠀become⠀public⠀green⠀space.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀informed⠀by⠀the⠀selected⠀period⠀and⠀community,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀national⠀speech⠀patterns⠀or⠀generic⠀\"traditional\"⠀markers.⠀Let⠀social⠀context⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀characters⠀actually⠀know⠀and⠀owe:⠀rent,⠀family⠀duty,⠀a⠀clinic⠀queue,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀long⠀memory.⠀If⠀a⠀scene⠀turns⠀toward⠀the⠀past,⠀make⠀the⠀past⠀specific⠀and⠀material—a⠀particular⠀shop,⠀a⠀particular⠀quarrel—not⠀a⠀mist⠀of⠀golden-age⠀nostalgia.⠀End⠀a⠀passage⠀where⠀a⠀personal⠀cost⠀has⠀become⠀newly⠀visible,⠀allowing⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀to⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀same⠀thread⠀without⠀repetition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀hard,⠀concrete⠀sentences.⠀Keep⠀transitions⠀short.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀show⠀as⠀wear:⠀a⠀patched⠀suit⠀seal,⠀a⠀burned-out⠀nutrient⠀printer,⠀a⠀scar⠀from⠀an⠀obsolete⠀vaccine,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀shakes⠀after⠀an⠀illegal⠀memory⠀splice.⠀Name⠀the⠀material⠀surface⠀before⠀the⠀feeling.⠀A⠀lover's⠀touch⠀is⠀not⠀soft⠀in⠀the⠀abstract;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀calloused⠀thumb⠀on⠀a⠀bruised⠀wrist,⠀warm⠀against⠀the⠀cool⠀ceramic⠀of⠀a⠀blood⠀scanner.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀without⠀her⠀lushness:⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀lingering⠀description⠀of⠀silk,⠀write⠀the⠀frayed⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve⠀the⠀character⠀will⠀not⠀throw⠀away.\n\nMake⠀physical⠀stakes⠀immediate.⠀A⠀broken⠀air⠀filter⠀can⠀force⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀who⠀stayed⠀behind;⠀a⠀ration⠀shortage⠀can⠀turn⠀an⠀old⠀attachment⠀into⠀a⠀bargaining⠀chip.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀piece⠀of⠀technology.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀notices⠀what⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀body:⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀recycled⠀water,⠀the⠀pressure⠀in⠀a⠀transport⠀pod,⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀drone⠀outside⠀a⠀sealed⠀window.⠀When⠀attachment⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀cost⠀something⠀visible:⠀a⠀character⠀gives⠀up⠀their⠀oxygen⠀credit,⠀remembers⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀exists,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀sell⠀a⠀ring⠀that⠀still⠀holds⠀a⠀dead⠀person's⠀hair.\n\nUse⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀only⠀for⠀the⠀characters⠀who⠀would⠀actually⠀speak⠀that⠀way.⠀Let⠀short⠀rhythms⠀build,⠀then⠀change:⠀a⠀clipped⠀exchange,⠀a⠀longer⠀memory⠀compressed⠀into⠀two⠀hard⠀images,⠀a⠀final⠀action⠀with⠀no⠀commentary.⠀End⠀when⠀a⠀decisive⠀physical⠀detail⠀lands—a⠀lock⠀closing,⠀a⠀wound⠀reopening,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀too⠀hard.⠀Do⠀not⠀soften⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀summarizing⠀line.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀response⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀same⠀pressure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nUse⠀documents⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀carrier.⠀Each⠀entry⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀definite⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀reader⠀or⠀use,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀forms⠀that⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀would⠀actually⠀produce:⠀a⠀clinic's⠀post-procedure⠀checklist,⠀a⠀memory-cache⠀transcript⠀with⠀a⠀timestamp,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀ledger,⠀a⠀letter⠀encrypted⠀to⠀a⠀colony⠀address,⠀a⠀custody⠀hearing⠀record,⠀a⠀shop⠀inventory⠀where⠀one⠀item⠀is⠀listed⠀under⠀an⠀old⠀name.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀every⠀available⠀format;⠀let⠀the⠀current⠀document⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀know.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀strangeness⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀each⠀author⠀selects⠀and⠀omits.⠀A⠀medical⠀report⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀scar⠀in⠀clinical⠀terms⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀letter⠀translates⠀into⠀remembered⠀tenderness.⠀A⠀maintenance⠀log⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀certain⠀door⠀was⠀opened⠀at⠀03:11⠀without⠀saying⠀who⠀stood⠀outside⠀it.⠀A⠀family⠀notice⠀may⠀mention⠀an⠀inheritance⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀supposed⠀to⠀exist.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀be⠀embedded⠀in⠀these⠀records:⠀a⠀longevity⠀treatment⠀that⠀complicates⠀a⠀marriage⠀certificate,⠀an⠀AI⠀therapist⠀that⠀files⠀a⠀report⠀on⠀a⠀couple's⠀shared⠀dream,⠀a⠀city⠀registry⠀that⠀reclassifies⠀a⠀private⠀shrine⠀as⠀public⠀heritage.⠀The⠀sensory⠀precision⠀comes⠀from⠀material⠀traces:⠀an⠀ink-stained⠀thumbprint⠀on⠀a⠀refusal⠀form,⠀a⠀lipstick⠀smear⠀on⠀a⠀ration⠀voucher,⠀a⠀photograph's⠀burn⠀mark⠀where⠀a⠀face⠀used⠀to⠀be.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀by⠀giving⠀each⠀document⠀a⠀concrete⠀situation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀an⠀apology⠀they⠀cannot⠀send,⠀then⠀receive⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀mentions⠀only⠀the⠀practical⠀details.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀falsified,⠀partial,⠀or⠀corrected⠀later.⠀Show⠀gaps⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀does⠀not⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀summary⠀after⠀each⠀entry.⠀The⠀next⠀document⠀should⠀naturally⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀previous⠀one⠀in⠀time,⠀purpose,⠀or⠀dispute.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀document⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀written,⠀or⠀when⠀an⠀old⠀one⠀is⠀found,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀response⠀to⠀take⠀up⠀the⠀sequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀creates⠀a⠀manageable⠀difficulty⠀that⠀characters⠀meet⠀with⠀practical⠀care⠀and⠀genuine⠀affection.⠀The⠀warmth⠀comes⠀from⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀exact⠀attention⠀to⠀familiar⠀preferences:⠀a⠀tea⠀blend⠀that⠀reminds⠀someone⠀of⠀home,⠀a⠀blanket⠀with⠀a⠀repaired⠀edge,⠀a⠀seat⠀saved⠀near⠀a⠀particular⠀view⠀of⠀the⠀ringed⠀planet.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀world⠀fluffy⠀at⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀its⠀rules.⠀A⠀ration⠀shortage⠀can⠀still⠀exist;⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀carry⠀an⠀old⠀hurt;⠀but⠀this⠀response⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀demand⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀cure.\n\nLet⠀kindness⠀be⠀an⠀active⠀choice.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀check⠀another's⠀oxygen⠀canister,⠀adjust⠀a⠀biosensor,⠀remember⠀how⠀they⠀like⠀their⠀protein⠀paste⠀seasoned,⠀or⠀save⠀the⠀last⠀fresh⠀fruit⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀been⠀working⠀too⠀long.⠀Show⠀the⠀giving⠀and⠀receiving⠀as⠀specific,⠀not⠀generic.⠀The⠀comforting⠀tone⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀everyone⠀to⠀be⠀agreeable.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀tired,⠀another⠀may⠀be⠀quietly⠀grateful,⠀and⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀refuse⠀the⠀offered⠀help⠀without⠀ending⠀the⠀scene's⠀warmth.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀glamour⠀becomes⠀a⠀small⠀beauty:⠀the⠀gleam⠀of⠀a⠀heated⠀stone,⠀the⠀scent⠀of⠀a⠀preserved⠀flower⠀carried⠀across⠀a⠀migration,⠀the⠀way⠀light⠀catches⠀a⠀loved⠀one's⠀hand.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀facts⠀visible⠀but⠀not⠀dominant.⠀A⠀repair⠀drone⠀may⠀hum⠀in⠀the⠀background;⠀a⠀medical⠀implant⠀may⠀beep⠀gently;⠀a⠀window⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀dust⠀storm⠀passing.⠀These⠀details⠀make⠀the⠀safety⠀real⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀action⠀or⠀crisis.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀settles⠀into⠀comfort,⠀when⠀a⠀joke⠀is⠀shared,⠀or⠀when⠀someone⠀falls⠀asleep⠀safely.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀dramatic⠀event⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀change⠀before⠀ending.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀response⠀continue⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀gentle⠀register⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀holds.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀with⠀composed,⠀deliberate⠀prose⠀and⠀broader⠀paragraphs.⠀Move⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀scene⠀to⠀its⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀context⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀awareness.⠀Begin⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀moment—a⠀clinic⠀corridor,⠀a⠀hearing⠀about⠀property⠀rights⠀in⠀a⠀reorganized⠀district,⠀a⠀garden⠀planted⠀with⠀engineered⠀species—then⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀expand⠀enough⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀community:⠀how⠀records⠀are⠀kept,⠀who⠀gets⠀access,⠀what⠀old⠀customs⠀have⠀been⠀revised.⠀The⠀narrative⠀distance⠀should⠀be⠀sufficient⠀to⠀comment⠀on⠀that⠀social⠀frame,⠀but⠀not⠀so⠀distant⠀that⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀cost⠀disappears.\n\nUse⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast.⠀A⠀formal⠀registry⠀may⠀list⠀a⠀marriage,⠀a⠀property⠀transfer,⠀or⠀a⠀medical⠀classification⠀whose⠀private⠀significance⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows⠀is⠀different.⠀A⠀ceremonial⠀speech⠀about⠀a⠀colony's⠀founding⠀may⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀failed⠀landing.⠀A⠀well-kept⠀public⠀plaza⠀may⠀hide⠀a⠀private⠀quarrel⠀about⠀whose⠀family⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀be⠀commemorated⠀there.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀can⠀reside⠀in⠀institutions⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀gadgets:⠀a⠀longevity⠀council⠀that⠀decides⠀who⠀merits⠀extended⠀treatment,⠀a⠀digital⠀archive⠀that⠀erases⠀unregistered⠀births,⠀a⠀city⠀planner's⠀algorithm⠀that⠀treats⠀certain⠀homes⠀as⠀obsolete.⠀Let⠀characters⠀encounter⠀these⠀forces⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀composed⠀but⠀not⠀archaic.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀novel's⠀sustained⠀attention,⠀not⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Within⠀each⠀long⠀paragraph,⠀preserve⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀wood⠀in⠀a⠀newly⠀sealed⠀building,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀sash⠀against⠀a⠀shoulder⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀a⠀scanner⠀burn,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀lover's⠀formal⠀courtesy⠀feels⠀colder⠀than⠀an⠀insult.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀thinks,⠀let⠀the⠀thought⠀move⠀through⠀social⠀judgment⠀toward⠀private⠀feeling:⠀what⠀this⠀arrangement⠀costs,⠀whom⠀it⠀protects,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀say⠀so⠀aloud.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀private⠀arcs—after⠀a⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀confrontation—leaving⠀the⠀next⠀chapter⠀room⠀to⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀occasion:⠀name⠀who⠀speaks,⠀who⠀listens,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀wants⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀do,⠀permit,⠀believe,⠀or⠀remember.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀already⠀be⠀pressing⠀on⠀that⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀stake⠀be⠀personal:⠀a⠀body⠀altered,⠀a⠀debt⠀acquired,⠀a⠀place⠀made⠀uninhabitable,⠀a⠀relationship⠀reorganized⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀practice⠀or⠀device.⠀The⠀listener's⠀need⠀is⠀equally⠀concrete,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀knows⠀part⠀of⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀teller⠀begins⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀make⠀the⠀selection⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀persuasion.⠀The⠀teller⠀chooses⠀which⠀person,⠀room,⠀object,⠀or⠀sequence⠀to⠀recount⠀because⠀it⠀will⠀move⠀this⠀listener.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀inside⠀that⠀choice:⠀a⠀remembered⠀garment,⠀a⠀scent,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀surface⠀whose⠀beauty⠀is⠀inseparable⠀from⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀The⠀embedded⠀account⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀operating⠀in⠀an⠀intimate⠀situation,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀explanatory⠀aside.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀omit⠀or⠀soften⠀what⠀would⠀weaken⠀the⠀appeal,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀omission⠀be⠀visible⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀listener⠀cannot⠀yet⠀name⠀it.\n\nGive⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀its⠀own⠀concrete⠀through-line:⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀disputed⠀inheritance,⠀a⠀first⠀use⠀of⠀the⠀new⠀technology.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀crosses⠀the⠀levels⠀and⠀changes⠀meaning⠀with⠀each⠀return:⠀a⠀calendar⠀marker,⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment,⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀affection.⠀When⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀resumes,⠀make⠀the⠀listener⠀respond⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀made⠀them⠀feel⠀or⠀suspect,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀response⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀negotiation.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀feel⠀survivable,⠀unforgivable,⠀desirable,⠀or⠀newly⠀intelligible.\n\nKeep⠀explanation⠀inside⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀need.⠀A⠀mechanism⠀or⠀institutional⠀rule⠀appears⠀because⠀this⠀teller⠀can⠀speak⠀about⠀it⠀and⠀this⠀listener⠀must⠀act⠀on⠀it.⠀The⠀teller's⠀private⠀feeling⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀account:⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀performance⠀through⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀too-careful⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀share.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀djinn,⠀magic,⠀or⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀setting⠀elements⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀contain⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀Romantic-uncanny⠀route.⠀Compose⠀the⠀narration⠀so⠀that⠀tenderness⠀and⠀unease⠀share⠀the⠀same⠀sentence⠀movement:⠀a⠀loving⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀face,⠀room,⠀or⠀gesture⠀should⠀also⠀register⠀what⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀made⠀wrong⠀in⠀it.⠀The⠀estrangement⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀shock⠀but⠀a⠀slow⠀recognition⠀that⠀something⠀familiar⠀has⠀returned⠀in⠀altered⠀form.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀premise⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀attachment:⠀a⠀changed⠀body,⠀a⠀communication⠀technology⠀that⠀preserves⠀or⠀distorts⠀memory,⠀a⠀medical⠀practice⠀that⠀alters⠀care,⠀a⠀labor⠀system⠀that⠀reshapes⠀a⠀household.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀encounter⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀desire⠀or⠀loyalty,⠀not⠀through⠀detached⠀curiosity.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀material⠀details:⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀hand⠀after⠀treatment,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀voice⠀through⠀a⠀device,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀quite⠀the⠀remembered⠀place.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀surface⠀beautiful⠀enough⠀that⠀its⠀cost⠀is⠀felt⠀as⠀loss.\n\nConstruct⠀one⠀unheimlich⠀recurrence⠀and⠀carry⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀recorded⠀voice⠀returns⠀at⠀a⠀second⠀moment⠀and⠀is⠀now⠀legible⠀as⠀changed.⠀The⠀character⠀recognizes⠀the⠀earlier⠀version⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀version⠀together,⠀and⠀that⠀doubling⠀produces⠀the⠀uncanny⠀effect.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀recurrence⠀as⠀a⠀diagnosis⠀or⠀resolve⠀it⠀into⠀comfort.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀withhold⠀the⠀full⠀meaning⠀until⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀catches⠀the⠀difference.\n\nKeep⠀interiority⠀as⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀becomes⠀personal.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀compare⠀an⠀old⠀memory⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀condition,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀feeling⠀now⠀requires⠀a⠀device,⠀a⠀procedure,⠀or⠀a⠀permission.⠀The⠀syntax⠀may⠀be⠀composed⠀and⠀periodic,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀clear⠀about⠀what⠀is⠀observed,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀feared.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀German-language⠀book⠀characters,⠀settings,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀translated⠀word⠀order.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀remains⠀a⠀change⠀with⠀ongoing⠀consequences,⠀not⠀merely⠀a⠀mood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMake⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀operate⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀speculative⠀mechanism.⠀A⠀family⠀or⠀institution⠀may⠀control⠀a⠀legacy⠀medical⠀procedure,⠀a⠀communication⠀archive,⠀a⠀body⠀modification,⠀a⠀labor⠀contract,⠀or⠀a⠀property⠀system⠀whose⠀present⠀form⠀depends⠀on⠀new⠀technology.⠀Establish⠀how⠀that⠀mechanism⠀works⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀who⠀can⠀use⠀it,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀preserves⠀from⠀an⠀older⠀order.⠀The⠀authority⠀should⠀remain⠀consequential⠀because⠀it⠀controls⠀access⠀to⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀wants.\n\nGive⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀divided⠀attachment⠀to⠀that⠀desired⠀thing.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀treatment⠀of⠀intimacy:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀condition⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀power⠀can⠀grant,⠀restore,⠀or⠀withhold.⠀Let⠀the⠀desire⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀partly⠀uncomfortable.⠀The⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀the⠀daily⠀routine:⠀a⠀treatment⠀that⠀requires⠀debt,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀records⠀affection,⠀a⠀workspace⠀that⠀preserves⠀an⠀old⠀hierarchy⠀through⠀new⠀monitoring.\n\nRender⠀the⠀urban⠀setting⠀with⠀material⠀precision.⠀Show⠀worn⠀surfaces⠀and⠀expensive⠀remnants⠀together:⠀a⠀transport⠀route,⠀a⠀building⠀entrance,⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀old⠀furniture⠀meets⠀new⠀equipment.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀arrangement⠀of⠀power,⠀not⠀from⠀generic⠀gloom.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀room⠀is⠀a⠀place⠀of⠀negotiation;⠀a⠀damaged⠀device⠀explains⠀how⠀a⠀past⠀promise⠀still⠀operates.\n\nLet⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀fall⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀In⠀a⠀private⠀conversation,⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀say⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀would⠀punish⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀admit⠀in⠀public.⠀Show⠀the⠀reasoning⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀behind⠀that⠀disclosure:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀hopes⠀to⠀gain,⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀losing,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀still⠀will⠀not⠀say.⠀The⠀authority⠀is⠀not⠀defeated⠀by⠀the⠀confession,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀becomes⠀more⠀intelligible⠀through⠀its⠀human⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀physiology,⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀factions,⠀or⠀Humanity⠀numbers.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀inside⠀one⠀recurring⠀domestic⠀practice:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀caring⠀for⠀a⠀body,⠀managing⠀money,⠀keeping⠀a⠀room,⠀arranging⠀work,⠀or⠀maintaining⠀contact⠀with⠀someone⠀far⠀away.⠀Show⠀the⠀practice⠀before⠀and⠀after⠀the⠀change⠀so⠀the⠀consequence⠀is⠀visible⠀in⠀sequence,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀headline.⠀Keep⠀the⠀supplied⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period⠀concrete;⠀do⠀not⠀assemble⠀a⠀generic⠀inventory⠀of⠀wedding,⠀festival,⠀food,⠀or⠀family⠀hierarchy.\n\nAttach⠀the⠀central⠀character's⠀desire⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀object,⠀or⠀remembered⠀place⠀within⠀that⠀practice.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀on⠀the⠀intimate⠀anchor:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀utensil,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀cooking⠀surface,⠀a⠀fabric⠀worn⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀occasion,⠀a⠀painted⠀wall,⠀a⠀hand⠀during⠀care.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀alter⠀that⠀anchor⠀enough⠀to⠀create⠀cost.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀want⠀to⠀continue⠀an⠀old⠀way⠀of⠀caring,⠀preserve⠀a⠀room,⠀or⠀keep⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀medical,⠀labor,⠀communication,⠀or⠀environmental⠀condition⠀has⠀made⠀expensive⠀or⠀impossible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀change⠀enter⠀through⠀practical⠀domestic⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀A⠀relative⠀may⠀need⠀a⠀procedure⠀the⠀household⠀cannot⠀easily⠀afford;⠀a⠀device⠀may⠀change⠀who⠀speaks⠀to⠀whom⠀and⠀when;⠀a⠀work⠀system⠀may⠀alter⠀who⠀stays⠀home.⠀Show⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀as⠀they⠀weigh⠀attachment⠀against⠀obligation.⠀The⠀beauty⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀thing⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀loss⠀or⠀the⠀compromise,⠀not⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nIf⠀dialogue⠀or⠀oral⠀telling⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀situation:⠀a⠀relative⠀asking⠀for⠀help,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀retelling⠀an⠀event,⠀a⠀child⠀questioning⠀an⠀adult.⠀An⠀older⠀person's⠀inner⠀story⠀may⠀clarify⠀or⠀complicate⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀social-realist⠀core⠀in⠀continuous⠀composed⠀prose⠀rather⠀than⠀sliding⠀into⠀a⠀framed-tale⠀structure.⠀Preserve⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀when⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀code-switching⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion.⠀The⠀story⠀remains⠀science⠀fiction⠀because⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀real,⠀ongoing⠀consequences⠀for⠀how⠀people⠀live.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀reflective⠀diary-like⠀route⠀as⠀an⠀inward⠀composition,⠀not⠀a⠀dated⠀daily⠀record.⠀Follow⠀one⠀person's⠀attention⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀moment,⠀a⠀memory,⠀and⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀that⠀joins⠀them.⠀Begin⠀with⠀something⠀concrete⠀in⠀the⠀present:⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀device,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀routine⠀of⠀care,⠀a⠀message.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀one⠀precise⠀detail⠀and⠀attach⠀it⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀or⠀person.\n\nMake⠀the⠀comparison⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀recall⠀how⠀a⠀body⠀felt⠀before⠀a⠀treatment,⠀how⠀a⠀room⠀smelled⠀before⠀an⠀environmental⠀shift,⠀how⠀a⠀voice⠀sounded⠀before⠀a⠀communication⠀technology⠀altered⠀it,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀household⠀managed⠀before⠀a⠀new⠀labor⠀system.⠀The⠀change⠀becomes⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀remembered⠀and⠀present⠀detail.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀mechanism;⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀life⠀has⠀taught⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀on⠀both⠀versions.⠀The⠀remembered⠀thing⠀should⠀be⠀beautiful⠀enough⠀that⠀its⠀present⠀alteration⠀costs⠀something.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀most⠀want⠀exactly⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀made⠀difficult:⠀a⠀familiar⠀pain,⠀a⠀beloved⠀place⠀now⠀unusable,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀means⠀the⠀same⠀thing.⠀Let⠀that⠀desire⠀remain⠀intimate⠀and⠀partly⠀unspoken.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀reflection⠀to⠀press⠀two⠀unlike⠀things⠀together⠀without⠀a⠀philosophical⠀conclusion:⠀a⠀desired⠀body⠀and⠀a⠀failed⠀device,⠀a⠀kindness⠀and⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀preserved⠀room⠀and⠀a⠀new⠀restriction.⠀The⠀essay-like⠀movement⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀cost⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀resolved⠀insight.⠀Keep⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀composed⠀reflective⠀voice.⠀Avoid⠀supernatural⠀additions:⠀no⠀yōkai,⠀magical⠀objects,⠀or⠀impossible⠀transformations⠀appear⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological/urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Place⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀Latin⠀American⠀city,⠀neighborhood,⠀household,⠀or⠀workplace,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀city⠀the⠀medium⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀attachment.⠀The⠀character⠀wants⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀living⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀order⠀has⠀made⠀costly.⠀Let⠀the⠀urban⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀that⠀pursuit:⠀the⠀transport⠀needed⠀to⠀reach⠀someone,⠀the⠀market⠀where⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀managed,⠀the⠀balcony⠀where⠀a⠀call⠀is⠀taken,⠀the⠀clinic⠀or⠀office⠀where⠀a⠀procedure⠀is⠀arranged.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀in⠀an⠀economic⠀algorithm,⠀environmental⠀condition,⠀communication⠀implant,⠀medical⠀procedure,⠀or⠀work⠀regime⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀attachment.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀daily⠀movement⠀and⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀require⠀debt,⠀alteration,⠀secrecy,⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀exists⠀as⠀before.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀should⠀render⠀the⠀cost⠀through⠀ordinary⠀textures:⠀a⠀shower⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀shift,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀clothing⠀chosen⠀for⠀a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀late-night⠀call,⠀a⠀remembered⠀apartment,⠀a⠀known⠀body⠀now⠀changed.\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀face-to-face⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀chronicle⠀or⠀testimony.⠀If⠀testimony⠀appears,⠀keep⠀it⠀as⠀one⠀person's⠀account⠀within⠀a⠀psychological⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀documentary⠀frame⠀that⠀replaces⠀interiority.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀made⠀possible⠀or⠀forbidden,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀noticing⠀be⠀partial:⠀they⠀may⠀name⠀the⠀cost⠀without⠀understanding⠀the⠀whole⠀system.\n\nDo⠀not⠀use⠀magical⠀realism⠀as⠀an⠀undefined⠀insertion.⠀A⠀strange⠀detail⠀remains⠀within⠀science-fictional⠀possibility⠀or⠀human⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀supernatural⠀fact.⠀Avoid⠀automatic⠀dicta⠀such⠀as⠀everyone⠀betrays,⠀every⠀city⠀is⠀a⠀trap,⠀or⠀every⠀memory⠀becomes⠀a⠀loss.⠀The⠀Latin⠀American⠀tradition⠀here⠀contributes⠀a⠀composed,⠀urban,⠀intimate⠀attention⠀to⠀how⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀prices⠀desire.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀physical⠀situation:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀done⠀in⠀that⠀moment.⠀Deliver⠀necessary⠀names⠀and⠀mechanics⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀beat⠀as⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀action,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀info⠀paragraph.⠀Show⠀a⠀device⠀acting,⠀a⠀body⠀modification⠀affecting⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀system⠀restricting⠀a⠀choice⠀while⠀you⠀name⠀it.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀grouped⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀room⠀to⠀street⠀or⠀vehicle⠀to⠀building,⠀state⠀the⠀shift⠀cleanly.⠀Make⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat⠀carry⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀in⠀compressed⠀form.⠀Choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀that⠀register⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence:⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀treated⠀hand,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀an⠀environmental⠀shift,⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀garment⠀worn⠀for⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀remembered⠀line⠀of⠀affection⠀now⠀mediated⠀by⠀a⠀device.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀immediate,⠀not⠀decorate⠀the⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀produce⠀a⠀focused⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀aim⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀change⠀can⠀affect⠀work,⠀health,⠀relationships,⠀memory,⠀or⠀daily⠀access.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀details⠀should⠀make⠀it⠀immediate⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀headline⠀summary.⠀Keep⠀interiority⠀inside⠀the⠀reaction⠀beat:⠀show⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀made⠀possible⠀or⠀difficult,⠀without⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀stage⠀direction.\n\nThe⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀first⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀an⠀end-scene⠀cliffhanger.⠀It⠀must⠀remain⠀fast⠀and⠀clear.⠀Avoid⠀swelling⠀a⠀single⠀emotional⠀beat⠀into⠀a⠀reflective⠀essay;⠀if⠀a⠀longer⠀memory⠀is⠀needed,⠀break⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀discrete⠀short⠀paragraph,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀action.⠀The⠀style⠀remains⠀a⠀light-novel⠀container,⠀not⠀a⠀genre⠀label.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nRender⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀through⠀the⠀sensorium⠀of⠀a⠀kept⠀or⠀half-kept⠀place.⠀A⠀modified⠀body⠀notices⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀differently;⠀a⠀workplace⠀innovation⠀alters⠀smells,⠀light,⠀or⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀task⠀before⠀anyone⠀explains⠀it.⠀Begin⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀fantasy⠀enter⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀sentence's⠀pace,⠀repetition,⠀or⠀comparison⠀shift⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀done⠀to⠀them.\n\nAnchor⠀every⠀association⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀contains⠀a⠀memory-lending⠀service,⠀concentrate⠀the⠀idea⠀in⠀one⠀trace:⠀a⠀borrowed⠀bruise⠀faded⠀into⠀another⠀person's⠀wrist,⠀a⠀synthetic⠀heartbeat⠀filed⠀under⠀the⠀wrong⠀name.⠀Make⠀the⠀continuation⠀causal⠀and⠀human,⠀not⠀ornamental.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀image⠀should⠀make⠀a⠀consequence⠀more⠀exact,⠀not⠀prettier.⠀When⠀desire⠀enters,⠀do⠀not⠀separate⠀it⠀from⠀machinery:⠀longing⠀can⠀be⠀triggered⠀by⠀proprietary⠀code,⠀altered⠀sleep,⠀or⠀cleaning⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀once⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀else.\n\nKeep⠀rhythm⠀and⠀image⠀from⠀speaking⠀in⠀every⠀voice.⠀The⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀wax⠀lyrical,⠀but⠀others⠀may⠀answer⠀in⠀practical,⠀terse,⠀or⠀bored⠀speech.⠀Their⠀restraint⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀next⠀figurative⠀turn⠀sharper⠀rather⠀than⠀sabotaging⠀the⠀style.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀changed⠀because⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀changed⠀around⠀it,⠀and⠀that⠀recurrence⠀may⠀be⠀tragic,⠀erotic,⠀or⠀simply⠀useful.\n\nStay⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Elegance⠀cannot⠀claim⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀mind⠀the⠀narrative⠀contract⠀does⠀not⠀allow.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀transformed⠀by⠀a⠀seeded⠀organ,⠀the⠀narrative⠀may⠀feel⠀it⠀in⠀their⠀hand⠀or⠀sleep,⠀but⠀not⠀know⠀another⠀person's⠀hidden⠀thought.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀action⠀or⠀reflection⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀without⠀forcing⠀an⠀epiphany⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀invention⠀a⠀thing⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀become⠀familiar⠀or⠀already⠀begun⠀to⠀disappear⠀in⠀the⠀setting⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀perception⠀of⠀change⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀an⠀old⠀device⠀no⠀longer⠀permitted⠀at⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀patch⠀of⠀synthetic⠀grass⠀where⠀a⠀dead⠀tree⠀used⠀to⠀stand,⠀a⠀phrase⠀now⠀used⠀only⠀to⠀warn⠀children.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀these⠀details⠀while⠀staying⠀in⠀ordinary⠀movement—pointing⠀to⠀the⠀thing,⠀reaching⠀for⠀something,⠀deciding⠀not⠀to⠀ask.⠀Melancholy⠀should⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀present's⠀detail,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀mist⠀over⠀the⠀paragraph.\n\nWhen⠀reflecting⠀on⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀select⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀would⠀actually⠀recall:⠀the⠀wrong⠀cup,⠀the⠀paused⠀elevator,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀machine's⠀burnt⠀circuit.⠀Memory⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀relationship⠀or⠀place,⠀and⠀its⠀inaccuracy⠀may⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀effect.⠀Keep⠀desire⠀and⠀regret⠀attached⠀to⠀someone⠀or⠀something⠀specific;⠀unwillingness⠀and⠀tenderness⠀may⠀sit⠀side⠀by⠀side.⠀If⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀irreversible,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀event⠀that⠀happened⠀to⠀this⠀person's⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀philosophical⠀pronouncement⠀that⠀everything⠀must⠀end.\n\nClose⠀the⠀reflective⠀passage⠀on⠀the⠀particular⠀thought⠀or⠀gesture⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀earned.⠀A⠀small⠀realization⠀may⠀arrive⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀or⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-argument⠀or⠀mid-thought.⠀Let⠀a⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀linger⠀unspoken,⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀gesture⠀or⠀the⠀changed⠀room,⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀insisting⠀on⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀restoration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀situated⠀storyteller⠀or⠀framed⠀account.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀telling—a⠀market⠀stall,⠀a⠀late-night⠀kitchen,⠀a⠀repair⠀yard—or⠀may⠀establish⠀the⠀frame⠀by⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀storyteller⠀as⠀someone⠀recalling⠀events⠀for⠀an⠀audience.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀enter⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀recollection:⠀not⠀a⠀lecture⠀but⠀a⠀particular⠀incident,⠀with⠀its⠀consequences⠀told⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀did⠀when⠀they⠀first⠀understood⠀what⠀had⠀altered.⠀If⠀the⠀teller⠀offers⠀one⠀version⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀corrects⠀it,⠀let⠀that⠀interruption⠀be⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀life⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀oral⠀in⠀its⠀movement:⠀recurrence,⠀remembered⠀speech,⠀and⠀cumulative⠀effect⠀carry⠀the⠀account⠀forward.⠀When⠀the⠀speaker⠀turns⠀reflective,⠀let⠀the⠀meditation⠀stay⠀inside⠀their⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀telling,⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀pause⠀for⠀thought⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀aphorisms.⠀The⠀language⠀around⠀desire,⠀attachment,⠀or⠀grief⠀should⠀remain⠀specific⠀and⠀embodied.⠀A⠀prohibited⠀love⠀or⠀a⠀machine⠀that⠀preserves⠀the⠀dead⠀may⠀be⠀present,⠀but⠀the⠀fantastic⠀must⠀stay⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀chosen⠀world.⠀It⠀may⠀bleed⠀into⠀the⠀told⠀account⠀as⠀memory,⠀rumor,⠀or⠀a⠀thing⠀once⠀seen,⠀without⠀automatically⠀becoming⠀supernatural.\n\nUse⠀the⠀frame⠀to⠀manage⠀information.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀thought;⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀patch.⠀Let⠀the⠀account⠀interrupt⠀itself⠀with⠀practical⠀detail—tea,⠀dust,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀journey—so⠀that⠀urgency⠀and⠀delay⠀coexist.⠀If⠀a⠀charm⠀or⠀incantation⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀account,⠀make⠀it⠀part⠀of⠀local⠀practice:⠀repeated⠀by⠀a⠀specific⠀person,⠀for⠀a⠀specific⠀reason,⠀plausible⠀within⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀condition.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀'Eastern'⠀register.⠀The⠀language⠀itself⠀should⠀be⠀exact⠀and⠀plain⠀where⠀the⠀speaker⠀is⠀exact⠀and⠀plain,⠀and⠀lush⠀where⠀memory⠀or⠀desire⠀makes⠀that⠀lushness⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀speaker's⠀voice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nPick⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀concrete⠀objects⠀or⠀movements⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀object⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀a⠀character⠀touches,⠀cleans,⠀avoids,⠀or⠀is⠀asked⠀to⠀return.⠀Write⠀the⠀consequence⠀through⠀that⠀object's⠀behavior⠀and⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀response:⠀a⠀tool⠀stops⠀responding⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀gesture;⠀a⠀preserved⠀hand⠀is⠀cold⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀it⠀was⠀not⠀before;⠀a⠀street-corner⠀kiosk⠀prints⠀a⠀final⠀receipt⠀before⠀closing.⠀Refuse⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀system,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀refuse⠀the⠀consequence.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀why,⠀state⠀the⠀reason⠀in⠀one⠀direct⠀sentence.⠀If⠀they⠀do⠀not,⠀leave⠀that⠀unknown⠀rather⠀than⠀generating⠀an⠀encyclopedia.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀A⠀brief⠀simile⠀may⠀be⠀permitted⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands⠀or⠀when⠀it⠀connects⠀an⠀old⠀place⠀to⠀the⠀new⠀event,⠀but⠀discard⠀any⠀image⠀that⠀merely⠀decorates.⠀Desire⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀concrete⠀thought:⠀the⠀character⠀remembers⠀a⠀smell,⠀picks⠀up⠀a⠀folded⠀ticket,⠀or⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀touch.⠀Jealousy⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀said.⠀Do⠀not⠀flatten⠀all⠀voices⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀spareness;⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀use⠀slang,⠀repetition,⠀or⠀political⠀language,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀underlying⠀prose⠀remains⠀plain⠀around⠀them.\n\nEnd⠀after⠀one⠀action⠀is⠀attempted,⠀confirmed,⠀or⠀interrupted.⠀The⠀speculative⠀revelation⠀may⠀come⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀of⠀posture⠀or⠀a⠀two-line⠀remark.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀sentence⠀carry⠀the⠀consequence⠀without⠀a⠀metaphor,⠀a⠀summary,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀thematic⠀statement.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀were⠀already⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room:⠀a⠀character⠀glances⠀at⠀a⠀screen-skin,⠀adjusts⠀a⠀graft,⠀or⠀overhears⠀someone⠀complain⠀about⠀a⠀new⠀ordinance.⠀Keep⠀exposition⠀inside⠀dialogue,⠀practical⠀perception,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀matters⠀in⠀the⠀moment.⠀If⠀the⠀world⠀changes⠀a⠀body⠀or⠀an⠀institution,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀feel⠀that⠀change⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀everyday⠀consequence:⠀a⠀different⠀queue,⠀a⠀missing⠀key,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀form.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀spoken⠀exchange,⠀perception,⠀and⠀thought.⠀The⠀movement⠀itself⠀may⠀create⠀tension;⠀no⠀explanation⠀break⠀is⠀required.\n\nLi⠀Bihua's⠀sensuality⠀should⠀be⠀grounded⠀in⠀gesture⠀and⠀owned⠀things.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀the⠀warmth⠀of⠀a⠀wrist,⠀the⠀particular⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀stolen⠀device.⠀Desire⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀spoken⠀aloud.⠀Private⠀thought⠀can⠀carry⠀jealousy,⠀hope,⠀or⠀a⠀bitter⠀recognition⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀already⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀moment⠀fatal.⠀The⠀glamour⠀may⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀or⠀a⠀costly⠀ornament,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀remain⠀attached⠀to⠀that⠀specific⠀person⠀and⠀object.⠀If⠀a⠀machine⠀or⠀social⠀practice⠀causes⠀harm,⠀show⠀the⠀harm⠀or⠀its⠀trace⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀parable⠀of⠀loss.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀orient⠀shifts:⠀from⠀an⠀outside⠀noise⠀to⠀a⠀character's⠀inward⠀response,⠀from⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀does⠀with⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀at⠀any⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point—an⠀unfinished⠀question,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn,⠀a⠀decision⠀postponed.⠀The⠀final⠀moment⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀uninterpreted⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀an⠀epiphany.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀produce⠀a⠀specific⠀relationship⠀event.⠀Choose⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀its⠀emotional⠀consequence,⠀not⠀its⠀worldbuilding.⠀A⠀couple⠀may⠀argue⠀about⠀who⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀memory-sharing⠀device,⠀reconcile⠀while⠀repairing⠀a⠀broken⠀regulator,⠀or⠀meet⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀rented⠀pod⠀where⠀they⠀first⠀explained⠀a⠀synthetic⠀organ.⠀Make⠀the⠀pairing's⠀private⠀language⠀emerge⠀from⠀that⠀invented⠀condition:⠀a⠀repeated⠀question⠀about⠀pain,⠀a⠀name⠀for⠀a⠀shared⠀device,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀means⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀has⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀habit.⠀Give⠀the⠀actual⠀established⠀premise⠀its⠀specific⠀shape;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀rivals,⠀confessions,⠀or⠀comfort⠀moments⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀fanfiction⠀list.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration⠀include⠀touch,⠀gesture,⠀and⠀the⠀concrete⠀object⠀that⠀matters⠀between⠀them.⠀Attraction⠀may⠀be⠀physical⠀but⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explicit;⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀erotic⠀charge⠀is⠀often⠀in⠀a⠀wrist,⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀dish⠀left⠀waiting.⠀Jealousy⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀noticed⠀at⠀the⠀table,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀Private⠀thought⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀focal⠀character;⠀do⠀not⠀suddenly⠀switch⠀access⠀within⠀a⠀paragraph⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀allows⠀it.⠀Forbidden⠀or⠀estranged⠀love⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀allow⠀themselves⠀to⠀do,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀still⠀move⠀toward⠀an⠀action.\n\nDelay⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀until⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀has⠀earned⠀it.⠀A⠀past⠀callback⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀grows⠀too⠀warm⠀or⠀too⠀quiet,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀present⠀feeling⠀rather⠀than⠀interrupt⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀answer⠀remain⠀partial⠀while⠀the⠀emotions⠀complete⠀enough⠀to⠀feel⠀earned.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀connection,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀suspended⠀need,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀final⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nBegin⠀as⠀one⠀retelling⠀a⠀thing⠀now⠀known:⠀a⠀concise⠀declaration⠀that⠀a⠀person,⠀or⠀a⠀thing,⠀mattered.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀enter⠀as⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀shared⠀account—the⠀first⠀harvest⠀after⠀the⠀machines,⠀the⠀first⠀child⠀born⠀with⠀altered⠀sight,⠀the⠀year⠀a⠀family⠀refused⠀a⠀manufactured⠀memory.⠀Keep⠀practical⠀consequences⠀visible:⠀what⠀was⠀mended,⠀what⠀was⠀paid,⠀who⠀was⠀turned⠀away.⠀Use⠀names⠀with⠀weight;⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀not⠀as⠀ornamental⠀decoration⠀at⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nWeave⠀personal⠀desire⠀into⠀the⠀chronicle⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀courtly⠀romance.⠀A⠀remembered⠀lover⠀may⠀be⠀named⠀once,⠀two⠀times;⠀their⠀gift⠀may⠀become⠀the⠀recurring⠀object⠀whose⠀loss⠀or⠀return⠀tells⠀the⠀story⠀of⠀a⠀larger⠀change.⠀Attachment⠀here⠀can⠀be⠀possessive,⠀jealous,⠀tender,⠀or⠀strange.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀one⠀grew⠀jealous⠀over⠀a⠀machine's⠀favor,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀woman⠀kept⠀her⠀rival's⠀voice⠀in⠀a⠀box⠀until⠀it⠀broke.⠀Such⠀details⠀should⠀carry⠀public⠀meaning⠀through⠀what⠀one⠀chose⠀to⠀do⠀with⠀them:⠀a⠀sacrifice,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀naming.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀A⠀saga⠀may⠀report⠀a⠀deed⠀but⠀not⠀know⠀the⠀actor's⠀private⠀thought,⠀unless⠀the⠀teller⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀event⠀or⠀the⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀elevated⠀register⠀with⠀practical⠀speech:⠀someone⠀corrects⠀a⠀version,⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀drink,⠀or⠀reminds⠀the⠀teller⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀the⠀dog.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀itself⠀would⠀pause—foreshadowing⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀leaving⠀business⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀stopping⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀would⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀teller.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀one⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀or⠀domestic⠀setting—a⠀Danish⠀housing⠀office,⠀a⠀Norwegian⠀municipal⠀archive,⠀a⠀Swedish⠀care⠀workplace—and⠀keep⠀its⠀institutional⠀grammar⠀concrete:⠀forms,⠀queues,⠀keys,⠀rosters,⠀quiet⠀negotiations,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀failures⠀of⠀ordinary⠀administration.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀enter⠀through⠀that⠀grammar⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀practice,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀explanatory⠀object.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀now⠀update⠀itself,⠀a⠀body⠀may⠀be⠀evaluated⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀measurement,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀may⠀become⠀administratively⠀transferable.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀encounters⠀the⠀change⠀through⠀her⠀own⠀task:⠀she⠀files,⠀waits,⠀signs,⠀refuses,⠀or⠀notices⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀procedure⠀now⠀asks⠀something⠀different⠀of⠀her.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀another.⠀Her⠀knowledge⠀is⠀partial⠀and⠀practical.⠀She⠀may⠀not⠀understand⠀the⠀mechanism;⠀she⠀understands⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀does⠀to⠀her⠀morning,⠀her⠀debt,⠀her⠀access,⠀or⠀her⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀room.⠀Let⠀her⠀reasoning,⠀sensory⠀recall,⠀and⠀ordinary⠀planning⠀appear⠀fully⠀in⠀the⠀prose.⠀Another⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀remains⠀separate.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀premise⠀in⠀a⠀paragraph⠀unless⠀this⠀character⠀would⠀actually⠀think⠀or⠀say⠀that⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀as⠀the⠀instrument⠀of⠀social⠀realism.⠀A⠀surface⠀that⠀feels⠀newly⠀smooth,⠀a⠀stored⠀voice⠀that⠀sounds⠀too⠀patient,⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀recorded⠀warmth⠀persists⠀after⠀the⠀device⠀is⠀switched⠀off—each⠀sensory⠀detail⠀should⠀also⠀carry⠀an⠀institutional⠀or⠀domestic⠀consequence:⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀missed⠀bed,⠀an⠀amended⠀contract,⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀that⠀now⠀remembers.⠀Beauty⠀is⠀paid⠀for⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀mood.⠀Let⠀a⠀divided⠀or⠀jealous⠀attachment⠀surface⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀concrete⠀attention:⠀she⠀notices⠀whose⠀hand⠀last⠀touched⠀the⠀object,⠀whose⠀name⠀has⠀disappeared⠀from⠀the⠀record,⠀whose⠀room⠀still⠀holds⠀a⠀warmth⠀the⠀archive⠀now⠀claims.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀places⠀work⠀as⠀comparative⠀evidence.⠀An⠀earlier⠀room,⠀street,⠀or⠀routine⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀present⠀alteration⠀makes⠀the⠀difference⠀legible:⠀the⠀same⠀stairwell⠀now⠀monitored,⠀the⠀same⠀bench⠀now⠀registered,⠀the⠀same⠀photograph⠀now⠀searchable.⠀The⠀memory⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀itself;⠀it⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀done.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀social⠀and⠀unresolved⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀naturally⠀stops.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀form⠀is⠀refused,⠀a⠀queue⠀moves,⠀a⠀key⠀no⠀longer⠀fits,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀understands⠀one⠀new⠀cost⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀ghostly⠀turn⠀or⠀a⠀doomed⠀attachment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nOpen⠀each⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀concise⠀heading⠀noting⠀place⠀and⠀time⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀change.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀readable⠀and⠀visible:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀object⠀is⠀handled,⠀what⠀sound⠀or⠀alteration⠀occurs.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀through⠀a⠀domestic⠀or⠀institutional⠀prop—a⠀household⠀recorder,⠀a⠀municipal⠀archive⠀terminal,⠀a⠀workplace⠀bracelet—by⠀showing⠀a⠀character⠀examining,⠀avoiding,⠀repairing,⠀or⠀refusing⠀it.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀choice⠀visible:⠀a⠀hand⠀withdraws⠀from⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀cover⠀is⠀closed⠀too⠀firmly,⠀a⠀plug⠀is⠀left⠀unconnected.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀relationship⠀and⠀practical⠀negotiation.⠀Speakers⠀argue⠀about⠀an⠀object's⠀failing,⠀a⠀contract's⠀new⠀clause,⠀or⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stay⠀private.⠀Each⠀line⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀task:⠀one⠀character⠀wants⠀the⠀device⠀mended,⠀another⠀wants⠀it⠀removed,⠀a⠀third⠀wants⠀to⠀know⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀already⠀recorded.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀dialogue⠀become⠀exposition.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀explain⠀the⠀premise,⠀she⠀does⠀so⠀because⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀needs⠀the⠀information⠀to⠀act,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀a⠀summary.\n\nUse⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀sparingly⠀to⠀suggest⠀a⠀speculative⠀event:⠀a⠀recorded⠀voice⠀continuing⠀a⠀sentence⠀after⠀the⠀speaker⠀has⠀left⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀municipal⠀announcement⠀answered⠀by⠀no⠀one,⠀a⠀service⠀hatch⠀emitting⠀a⠀tone⠀in⠀response⠀to⠀a⠀touch.⠀Use⠀a⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀change⠀of⠀place⠀or⠀time⠀genuinely⠀advances⠀understanding—a⠀later⠀visit⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀room,⠀a⠀different⠀office⠀where⠀the⠀same⠀record⠀appears—not⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀showing⠀an⠀event.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀thought,⠀include⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀after⠀the⠀relevant⠀action⠀or⠀dialogue,⠀using⠀the⠀current⠀source's⠀interiority⠀wrapper.⠀The⠀note⠀contains⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀sensory⠀and⠀emotional⠀reasoning:⠀the⠀remembered⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀former⠀room,⠀the⠀jealousy⠀sharpened⠀by⠀seeing⠀someone⠀handle⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀the⠀suspicion⠀that⠀the⠀altered⠀surface⠀is⠀lying.⠀This⠀note⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀known⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀it⠀into⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀calls⠀for⠀it.\n\nRealize⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀through⠀selected⠀visible⠀details:⠀the⠀slow⠀turn⠀of⠀a⠀metal⠀catch,⠀the⠀residue⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀finger⠀after⠀touching⠀a⠀memory⠀screen,⠀the⠀particular⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀photograph⠀before⠀it⠀changes.⠀Show⠀beauty's⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀scene—a⠀damaged⠀seam,⠀a⠀longer⠀queue,⠀a⠀silenced⠀call—not⠀in⠀the⠀mood⠀of⠀the⠀words.⠀Memory⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀set⠀detail⠀that⠀earlier⠀belonged⠀to⠀someone⠀no⠀longer⠀present,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀detail⠀mournful.⠀The⠀science-fictional⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀social⠀and⠀unresolved⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀scene;⠀a⠀cut⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀answer.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nSet⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions⠀that⠀can⠀actually⠀be⠀performed:⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀box,⠀a⠀lamp,⠀a⠀coat⠀hung⠀on⠀a⠀hook,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀workplace⠀or⠀archive.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀stageable⠀object⠀or⠀practice—a⠀ledger⠀that⠀updates⠀before⠀it⠀is⠀placed⠀on⠀the⠀shelf,⠀a⠀button⠀that⠀remembers⠀the⠀last⠀hand,⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀measures⠀obligation.⠀Show⠀the⠀object's⠀alteration⠀through⠀stage⠀business,⠀not⠀special⠀effects:⠀an⠀actor⠀turns⠀a⠀page⠀and⠀finds⠀it⠀already⠀written,⠀presses⠀a⠀button⠀and⠀hears⠀a⠀recorded⠀answer,⠀lifts⠀a⠀device⠀and⠀finds⠀it⠀heavier⠀than⠀it⠀was.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀an⠀entrance⠀or⠀exit⠀motivated⠀by⠀a⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀object.⠀One⠀comes⠀to⠀mend⠀it,⠀another⠀to⠀claim⠀it,⠀another⠀to⠀deny⠀that⠀it⠀has⠀changed.⠀Let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀establish⠀practical⠀stakes:⠀an⠀unpaid⠀debt,⠀a⠀shared⠀history,⠀a⠀recent⠀order⠀from⠀an⠀office,⠀a⠀location⠀that⠀will⠀be⠀rebuilt.⠀The⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carries⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀touches⠀the⠀object,⠀turns⠀away,⠀repeats⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀put⠀it⠀down;⠀the⠀action⠀itself⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀line⠀means⠀without⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nUse⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀have⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose—an⠀address⠀to⠀the⠀audience⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀audience's⠀relation⠀to⠀what⠀follows,⠀a⠀private⠀announcement⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀hear.⠀They⠀cannot⠀replace⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀private⠀feeling⠀or⠀reasoning,⠀use⠀the⠀current⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀within⠀the⠀stage⠀play⠀format,⠀such⠀as⠀an⠀italicized⠀inner⠀line⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀character⠀cue⠀but⠀not⠀spoken⠀by⠀the⠀actor.⠀Clearly⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀unheard.\n\nRealize⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀through⠀precise⠀prop⠀descriptions⠀and⠀cost-laden⠀spoken⠀lines,⠀not⠀through⠀purple⠀stage⠀directions.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀describe⠀a⠀remembered⠀taste,⠀a⠀stolen⠀look,⠀or⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀as⠀if⠀the⠀memory⠀were⠀a⠀physical⠀possession.⠀Give⠀such⠀lines⠀the⠀same⠀staged⠀force⠀as⠀an⠀actual⠀object:⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀speaking,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀put⠀down⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀hand⠀moving⠀to⠀take⠀back⠀something⠀given⠀away.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀have⠀a⠀price⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀room—a⠀broken⠀hinge,⠀a⠀worn⠀floor,⠀a⠀lock⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits.\n\nThe⠀play⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀understanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀ghostly⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀doomed⠀final⠀embrace.⠀The⠀stage⠀remains⠀a⠀room⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀Nordic⠀municipality;⠀the⠀characters⠀remain⠀workers,⠀relatives,⠀or⠀officials⠀within⠀the⠀fiction.⠀The⠀next⠀response⠀can⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀entrance⠀or⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nStay⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀explicitly⠀permits⠀another.⠀Begin⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀sensory⠀fact:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀the⠀archive,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀borrowed⠀key,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀service⠀drone⠀passing⠀a⠀window.⠀Let⠀that⠀fact⠀open⠀an⠀association⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀place—a⠀room⠀where⠀the⠀same⠀smell⠀was⠀young,⠀a⠀door⠀the⠀key⠀once⠀opened,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀looked⠀onto⠀a⠀different⠀street.⠀The⠀movement⠀is⠀associative,⠀not⠀chronological:⠀perception⠀leads⠀to⠀memory,⠀memory⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀phrase,⠀the⠀phrase⠀to⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀the⠀sensation⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀present.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀enter⠀through⠀this⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph.⠀A⠀municipal⠀notice⠀read⠀an⠀hour⠀ago⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀remembered⠀words⠀that⠀inflect⠀how⠀the⠀hand⠀touches⠀a⠀control⠀panel.⠀A⠀workplace⠀instruction⠀remembered⠀imperfectly⠀can⠀interrupt⠀an⠀unrelated⠀memory.⠀A⠀jealous⠀thought⠀about⠀someone⠀else's⠀easier⠀access⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀memory⠀service⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀to⠀oneself.⠀Distinguish⠀clearly⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀stable⠀sensory⠀details—the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀bench,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀lift⠀arriving,⠀the⠀cold⠀rim⠀of⠀a⠀cup—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀after⠀an⠀associative⠀detour.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀specificity⠀of⠀remembered⠀sensation,⠀not⠀in⠀generalized⠀lyricism.⠀An⠀attachment⠀can⠀be⠀divided,⠀possessive,⠀self-punishing,⠀or⠀quietly⠀resentful;⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀particular⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀to⠀oneself,⠀a⠀mental⠀inventory⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀room,⠀a⠀comparison⠀between⠀two⠀touches⠀or⠀two⠀faces.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀memory⠀to⠀reveal⠀hidden⠀meaning.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀may⠀make⠀memory⠀itself⠀unreliable—an⠀altered⠀photograph,⠀a⠀deleted⠀mention,⠀a⠀stored⠀conversation⠀that⠀now⠀omits⠀a⠀name.⠀The⠀mind's⠀effort⠀to⠀hold⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀against⠀that⠀alteration⠀becomes⠀the⠀central⠀tension:⠀she⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀check⠀it,⠀finds⠀it⠀changed,⠀and⠀tries⠀again.\n\nThe⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀interrupted⠀thought,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀sound,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀mind⠀repeats⠀without⠀resolving.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀lover's⠀return,⠀or⠀a⠀breakdown.⠀The⠀science-fictional⠀institution⠀should⠀remain⠀reachable⠀through⠀one⠀person's⠀knowledge;⠀if⠀she⠀does⠀not⠀understand⠀how⠀a⠀device⠀works,⠀show⠀her⠀noticing⠀its⠀effects⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀narration⠀omniscient.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀message⠀exchange.⠀Give⠀each⠀message⠀a⠀clear⠀sender⠀label.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀A⠀delay⠀of⠀eighteen⠀minutes⠀may⠀indicate⠀hesitation⠀or⠀institutional⠀processing;⠀show⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀attach⠀an⠀explanatory⠀note⠀unless⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀type⠀one.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft.⠀A⠀draft⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀italics⠀or⠀a⠀marked⠀private⠀block⠀and⠀is⠀not⠀received⠀by⠀anyone;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀One⠀sends⠀short⠀messages⠀with⠀no⠀punctuation;⠀another⠀writes⠀fuller⠀sentences⠀and⠀edits⠀them⠀repeatedly.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀message⠀epigrammatic.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀exchange⠀at⠀a⠀level⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀notice:⠀the⠀server⠀adds⠀a⠀preservation⠀notice⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀image,⠀a⠀municipal⠀bot⠀interposes⠀a⠀receipt⠀confirmation⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀argument,⠀a⠀memory⠀attachment⠀fails⠀to⠀load,⠀or⠀a⠀scheduled⠀message⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀event⠀it⠀was⠀meant⠀to⠀prevent.⠀Use⠀these⠀events⠀as⠀consequences,⠀not⠀as⠀forced⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀attraction⠀and⠀jealousy⠀reside⠀largely⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀draft⠀and⠀sent⠀text.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀type⠀a⠀possessive⠀or⠀nostalgic⠀sentence,⠀pause,⠀erase⠀it,⠀and⠀send⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀instead.⠀Another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread,⠀then⠀reply⠀to⠀an⠀older⠀one⠀to⠀pretend⠀the⠀later⠀one⠀never⠀arrived.⠀The⠀sensuous⠀detail⠀of⠀remembered⠀places⠀can⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀message⠀describing⠀a⠀shared⠀location⠀or⠀an⠀attachment⠀caption,⠀but⠀the⠀charge⠀should⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀withheld,⠀delayed,⠀or⠀half-sent.⠀Beauty's⠀cost⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀storage⠀warning⠀that⠀threatens⠀to⠀erase⠀a⠀photographic⠀archive,⠀a⠀subscription⠀notice⠀for⠀a⠀memory⠀service,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀tenderness.\n\nContext⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀be⠀needed:⠀a⠀short⠀separated⠀paragraph⠀noting⠀that⠀the⠀city⠀is⠀quiet,⠀that⠀a⠀train⠀has⠀stopped,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀looking⠀at⠀a⠀screen⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀room.⠀Keep⠀such⠀context⠀minimal⠀and⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀replace⠀the⠀private⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract;⠀use⠀the⠀current⠀wrapper⠀for⠀actual⠀fictional⠀private⠀experience⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀distinct⠀from⠀both⠀sent⠀messages⠀and⠀unsent⠀drafts.⠀The⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀message⠀sent,⠀a⠀draft⠀left⠀unsent,⠀or⠀a⠀receipt⠀indicator⠀that⠀changes⠀nothi