s.⠀The⠀social⠀damage⠀remains⠀particular,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀complaint.\n\nCompress⠀dialogue⠀to⠀useful⠀information⠀and⠀implicit⠀pressure.⠀Characters⠀speak⠀like⠀people⠀who⠀still⠀have⠀work⠀to⠀finish.⠀A⠀refusal⠀is⠀flat,⠀a⠀threat⠀practical,⠀an⠀apology⠀cut⠀off⠀by⠀the⠀next⠀task.⠀Slow⠀down⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀under⠀constraint⠀needs⠀space:⠀a⠀worker⠀calculating⠀whether⠀to⠀report⠀a⠀fault⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀cause,⠀or⠀choosing⠀between⠀a⠀fine⠀and⠀a⠀longer⠀route⠀home.⠀Change⠀rhythm⠀so⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀bureaucratic⠀pressures⠀do⠀not⠀become⠀one⠀unbroken⠀rattle.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀about⠀a⠀speculative⠀institution⠀damaging⠀people⠀in⠀particular⠀ways:⠀a⠀maintenance⠀schedule⠀rewritten⠀to⠀exclude⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀benefit⠀linked⠀to⠀a⠀biometric⠀record⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀immediate⠀limit:⠀after⠀a⠀task,⠀an⠀incomplete⠀repair,⠀a⠀refused⠀order,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀decision⠀made⠀under⠀pressure.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀with⠀identifiable⠀authors,⠀purposes,⠀and⠀times.⠀Use⠀forms⠀that⠀fit⠀the⠀selected⠀future⠀setting:⠀work⠀logs,⠀family⠀messages⠀via⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel,⠀incident⠀reports,⠀residence⠀petitions,⠀medical⠀summaries,⠀public⠀notices,⠀or⠀private⠀letters⠀stored⠀on⠀a⠀device.⠀Choose⠀only⠀the⠀forms⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀incident;⠀do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀all⠀available⠀formats⠀automatically.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀institution⠀show⠀itself⠀through⠀documentary⠀convention⠀and⠀omission.⠀An⠀official⠀form⠀may⠀have⠀no⠀field⠀for⠀the⠀actual⠀complaint.⠀A⠀message⠀service⠀may⠀add⠀an⠀automated⠀reassurance⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀sender's⠀news.⠀A⠀supervisor's⠀report⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀accident⠀as⠀a⠀procedure⠀followed⠀incorrectly,⠀while⠀the⠀worker's⠀private⠀note⠀shows⠀they⠀followed⠀the⠀only⠀procedure⠀the⠀machine⠀would⠀accept.⠀Each⠀document⠀reveals⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal,⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀omit⠀to⠀be⠀processed,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀attempt⠀to⠀communicate⠀anyway.\n\nProduce⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀through⠀gaps⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀editorial⠀narrator.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀a⠀promise⠀is⠀empty⠀when⠀a⠀follow-up⠀message⠀repeats⠀the⠀earlier⠀one⠀verbatim,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀complaint⠀receives⠀a⠀receipt⠀but⠀no⠀action.⠀A⠀family⠀member⠀may⠀write⠀around⠀a⠀dangerous⠀topic⠀in⠀bland,⠀auditable⠀language,⠀then⠀add⠀one⠀private⠀line⠀that⠀another⠀reader⠀would⠀consider⠀irrational.⠀Do⠀not⠀step⠀in⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀irony.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀across⠀the⠀records.⠀Place⠀them⠀in⠀clear⠀order,⠀signal⠀any⠀missing⠀interval,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀correct⠀or⠀reinterpret⠀an⠀earlier⠀one⠀without⠀destroying⠀its⠀own⠀perspective.⠀Conflicting⠀accounts⠀should⠀have⠀textual⠀roots⠀in⠀each⠀author's⠀position⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀generic⠀theme⠀that⠀everyone⠀lies.⠀End⠀after⠀the⠀documents⠀have⠀illuminated⠀the⠀particular⠀consequence;⠀no⠀omniscient⠀final⠀note⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nPlace⠀the⠀comfort⠀within⠀the⠀speculative⠀world's⠀actual⠀constraints.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀save⠀a⠀flavor⠀ration⠀for⠀someone⠀else,⠀prepare⠀a⠀familiar⠀food⠀using⠀an⠀altered⠀recipe,⠀restore⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀clothing⠀that⠀the⠀cleaning⠀system⠀no⠀longer⠀recognizes,⠀or⠀talk⠀late⠀in⠀a⠀corridor⠀where⠀a⠀private⠀channel⠀is⠀unreliable.⠀The⠀gesture⠀depends⠀on⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀person:⠀their⠀usual⠀seat,⠀the⠀complaint⠀they⠀repeat,⠀the⠀small⠀item⠀they⠀keep⠀without⠀admitting⠀why.\n\nKeep⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀social⠀observation⠀active⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀bitter.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀workstation⠀chair⠀has⠀been⠀repaired⠀twice,⠀that⠀the⠀public⠀garden⠀is⠀open⠀only⠀during⠀a⠀shift⠀most⠀workers⠀cannot⠀attend,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀apology⠀has⠀been⠀spoken⠀through⠀a⠀translation⠀filter⠀that⠀flattens⠀tone.⠀These⠀details⠀make⠀the⠀comfort⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀generic:⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀caring⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀inside⠀a⠀system,⠀not⠀outside⠀it.\n\nRender⠀affection⠀as⠀sincere⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀offer⠀help⠀that⠀is⠀accepted⠀without⠀confession,⠀or⠀sit⠀near⠀someone⠀without⠀making⠀them⠀explain.⠀Spend⠀time⠀on⠀the⠀small⠀pleasure:⠀shared⠀food,⠀a⠀joke⠀that⠀lands,⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀performed⠀together,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀wait.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀emotional⠀repair,⠀a⠀declaration,⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀If⠀friction⠀remains,⠀let⠀it⠀coexist⠀with⠀care;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀comforted⠀and⠀still⠀unwilling⠀to⠀discuss⠀a⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀science-fiction⠀premise⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀background:⠀a⠀timed⠀permit,⠀a⠀household⠀system's⠀quiet⠀error,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀changed⠀work⠀schedule.⠀The⠀warm⠀interval⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀is⠀just;⠀it⠀is⠀one⠀particular⠀place⠀where⠀people⠀have⠀made⠀room⠀for⠀each⠀other.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀sustained,⠀composed⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀movement⠀from⠀a⠀social⠀frame⠀into⠀an⠀intimate⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀place⠀the⠀incident⠀inside⠀the⠀future⠀community's⠀arrangements:⠀an⠀administrative⠀timeline,⠀a⠀household's⠀place⠀in⠀a⠀resettlement⠀schedule,⠀a⠀workplace⠀reputation⠀understood⠀differently⠀by⠀senior⠀and⠀junior⠀staff.⠀The⠀frame⠀makes⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀ordinary⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀accepted⠀and⠀damaging⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀criticized⠀implicitly.\n\nApply⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀observation⠀in⠀formal⠀dress.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀carries⠀the⠀argument:⠀a⠀character⠀waits⠀for⠀an⠀advisory⠀message⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀the⠀meeting⠀has⠀ended,⠀or⠀receives⠀a⠀permit⠀stamped⠀with⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀generation.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀say⠀the⠀system⠀is⠀unjust;⠀it⠀reports⠀the⠀accepted⠀procedure,⠀the⠀brief⠀hesitation,⠀the⠀apology⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀expected,⠀and⠀the⠀queue⠀moving⠀on.⠀Let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀of⠀costume,⠀furniture,⠀or⠀procedure⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator⠀permits⠀judgment,⠀frame⠀it⠀through⠀considered⠀social⠀or⠀historical⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀spoken-tongue⠀commentary.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀new⠀regulation⠀resembles⠀an⠀older⠀one⠀in⠀structure⠀while⠀differing⠀in⠀technology,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀family's⠀silence⠀about⠀a⠀failed⠀application⠀has⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀its⠀daily⠀manner.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀public⠀behavior⠀separate,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀to⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀has⠀not⠀been⠀established.\n\nUse⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it.⠀A⠀formal⠀notice⠀may⠀be⠀read⠀aloud⠀at⠀home,⠀a⠀private⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀drafted⠀and⠀then⠀revised⠀for⠀a⠀monitored⠀channel,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀ledger⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀story⠀the⠀family⠀has⠀told⠀itself.⠀These⠀formal⠀objects⠀organize⠀information;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀decorative⠀insertions.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀significance⠀has⠀become⠀clear,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀lecture⠀completes⠀the⠀analysis.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nTreat⠀the⠀speculative⠀difference⠀as⠀already⠀installed⠀in⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Open⠀the⠀outer⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀scene:⠀a⠀particular⠀teller⠀sits⠀or⠀stands⠀before⠀particular⠀listeners⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀and⠀time,⠀and⠀something⠀concrete⠀is⠀being⠀decided⠀or⠀requested.⠀The⠀listeners⠀have⠀reasons⠀to⠀refuse,⠀delay,⠀or⠀comply—money,⠀permission,⠀testimony,⠀protection,⠀work,⠀a⠀shared⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀standing⠀grievance.⠀Establish⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀relationship,⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀stakes⠀before⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀begins.\n\nThe⠀teller⠀chooses⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀as⠀an⠀intervention.⠀It⠀is⠀told⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀believes⠀it⠀will⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀see⠀or⠀do.⠀Build⠀that⠀embedded⠀account⠀from⠀small⠀concrete⠀costs.⠀Choose⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀made⠀possible⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise—a⠀routine⠀scan,⠀a⠀housing⠀option,⠀a⠀device,⠀a⠀transport⠀rule,⠀an⠀employment⠀condition—and⠀show⠀how⠀one⠀person⠀lost⠀time,⠀dignity,⠀work,⠀a⠀body⠀function,⠀a⠀friendship,⠀or⠀the⠀ability⠀to⠀speak⠀without⠀being⠀managed.⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀irony⠀means⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀larger⠀institution.⠀The⠀listeners⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀register⠀the⠀damage⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀presents⠀as⠀acceptable,⠀ordinary,⠀or⠀simply⠀the⠀way⠀things⠀are.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀through⠀the⠀specificity⠀the⠀tale⠀left⠀out.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀number,⠀object,⠀smell,⠀sound,⠀or⠀repeated⠀procedure⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀resurfaces⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀situation,⠀and⠀a⠀listener⠀can⠀notice⠀its⠀meaning⠀without⠀the⠀teller⠀confessing⠀anything.⠀This⠀recurrence⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀cost,⠀an⠀evasion,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀wound;⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀scenario⠀and⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀is⠀the⠀connection,⠀not⠀a⠀guarantee⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀honest⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀listeners⠀will⠀help.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀fact⠀intelligible⠀through⠀one⠀relevant⠀mechanism,⠀not⠀a⠀technical⠀lecture.⠀If⠀a⠀rule⠀affects⠀the⠀embedded⠀event,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀rule⠀changes⠀the⠀ordinary⠀action;⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀system.⠀The⠀listeners'⠀reactions⠀may⠀include⠀silence,⠀practical⠀refusal,⠀uneasy⠀agreement,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀The⠀teller's⠀authority⠀is⠀limited⠀by⠀the⠀situation:⠀an⠀unsentimental⠀narrator⠀may⠀describe⠀someone⠀who⠀exaggerates,⠀omits,⠀or⠀genuinely⠀cannot⠀see⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀harm.⠀Preserve⠀each⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀honor⠀the⠀chosen⠀point⠀of⠀view.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social-realist⠀mode:⠀continuous⠀third-person⠀or⠀first-person⠀narration⠀with⠀plain⠀syntax⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀immediate⠀experience.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀background⠀condition⠀of⠀work,⠀education,⠀health,⠀housing,⠀transport,⠀communication,⠀or⠀public⠀administration,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀makes⠀one⠀of⠀its⠀daily⠀mechanisms⠀exact.\n\nShow,⠀do⠀not⠀announce,⠀how⠀the⠀system⠀operates.⠀Choose⠀a⠀particular⠀character⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀need⠀or⠀obligation,⠀and⠀bring⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀into⠀contact⠀with⠀a⠀single⠀action:⠀completing⠀a⠀form,⠀passing⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀using⠀a⠀service,⠀attending⠀a⠀meeting,⠀caring⠀for⠀someone,⠀or⠀asking⠀for⠀an⠀exception.⠀The⠀narration⠀reports⠀observable⠀movements,⠀objects,⠀rules,⠀and⠀interactions⠀without⠀a⠀lecture⠀or⠀an⠀authorial⠀moral.⠀The⠀character's⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀delay,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀reveals⠀the⠀institutional⠀pressure,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀restrained⠀tone⠀allows⠀the⠀damage⠀to⠀accumulate⠀through⠀implication.\n\nLet⠀private⠀interiority⠀be⠀causally⠀connected⠀to⠀that⠀ordinary⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀dramatic⠀moral⠀choice.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀calculate,⠀remember,⠀suppress,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀what⠀is⠀happening.⠀Their⠀knowledge⠀is⠀partial,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀share⠀a⠀universal⠀diagnosis.⠀Keep⠀explanatory⠀material⠀minimal:⠀if⠀a⠀technical⠀term⠀is⠀needed,⠀define⠀it⠀through⠀use,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀aside.⠀The⠀focus⠀stays⠀on⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀do,⠀avoid,⠀or⠀accept,⠀and⠀how⠀the⠀world's⠀larger⠀arrangement⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀that⠀narrow⠀action.\n\nThe⠀ending⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀revelation.⠀It⠀may⠀simply⠀let⠀the⠀concrete⠀situation⠀stand⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀moment:⠀the⠀form⠀submitted,⠀the⠀door⠀closed,⠀the⠀refusal⠀accepted,⠀or⠀the⠀character⠀left⠀waiting.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀rules,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀supernatural⠀turn⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀an⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀built⠀environment.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀present-day⠀or⠀near-future⠀urban⠀space⠀with⠀exact⠀materiality:⠀worn⠀surfaces,⠀cheap⠀accommodation,⠀old⠀buildings⠀repurposed⠀for⠀new⠀functions,⠀streets,⠀workstations,⠀entry⠀systems,⠀and⠀bodies⠀carrying⠀the⠀signs⠀of⠀prior⠀accommodation⠀or⠀injury.⠀The⠀story⠀shows⠀how⠀old⠀authority⠀is⠀preserved⠀in⠀the⠀new⠀speculative⠀system—through⠀access,⠀inheritance,⠀regulation,⠀or⠀debt—without⠀needing⠀an⠀actual⠀supernatural⠀power.\n\nChoose⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀whose⠀private⠀desire⠀or⠀social⠀position⠀makes⠀them⠀subject⠀to⠀that⠀arrangement.⠀Write⠀their⠀interiority⠀with⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀directness:⠀they⠀see⠀the⠀humiliation⠀or⠀danger⠀in⠀small⠀practical⠀terms,⠀not⠀through⠀gothic⠀exclamation.⠀A⠀social⠀mask⠀may⠀be⠀deliberate,⠀habitual,⠀or⠀only⠀half-noticed;⠀let⠀it⠀fall⠀or⠀shift⠀in⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀trustworthy⠀company,⠀fatigue,⠀anger,⠀or⠀practical⠀need,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀prescribe⠀loyalty⠀or⠀betrayal.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀should⠀be⠀generated⠀by⠀concrete⠀details⠀and⠀expectations,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀narrator's⠀mood⠀words.\n\nUse⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀and⠀new⠀in⠀the⠀causal⠀action.⠀A⠀rule⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀era⠀may⠀survive⠀as⠀code,⠀a⠀contract,⠀a⠀building's⠀layout,⠀a⠀title,⠀an⠀exemption,⠀or⠀a⠀debt.⠀A⠀present-day⠀character⠀must⠀navigate⠀that⠀survival⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task:⠀getting⠀medical⠀help,⠀entering⠀a⠀building,⠀taking⠀a⠀shift,⠀signing⠀a⠀lease,⠀caring⠀for⠀someone,⠀or⠀asking⠀for⠀information.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀is⠀intelligible⠀through⠀this⠀practical⠀collision.⠀Keep⠀the⠀technical⠀or⠀social⠀mechanism⠀simple⠀enough⠀to⠀follow,⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀aims,⠀body,⠀time,⠀relationships,⠀or⠀employment.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀named⠀vampire⠀mechanics,⠀factions,⠀blood⠀rules,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀Suspense⠀is⠀allowed,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀real⠀vulnerability⠀and⠀institutional⠀pressure.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀may⠀contain⠀desire,⠀dread,⠀shame,⠀or⠀wary⠀hope,⠀and⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realist⠀mode:⠀a⠀continuous⠀realist⠀scene,⠀first⠀or⠀third⠀person⠀as⠀appropriate,⠀centered⠀on⠀a⠀specific⠀person⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀community,⠀place,⠀and⠀time.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀affect⠀ordinary⠀life⠀without⠀being⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀a⠀technical⠀explanation.⠀Show⠀it⠀through⠀domestic⠀or⠀work-related⠀tasks,⠀conversations,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀small⠀institutional⠀encounters.\n\nThe⠀narration⠀should⠀expose⠀an⠀institution⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act.⠀Choose⠀one⠀concrete⠀procedure—obtaining⠀a⠀document,⠀using⠀a⠀public⠀service,⠀paying⠀a⠀charge,⠀seeking⠀permission,⠀meeting⠀a⠀regulation,⠀getting⠀treatment,⠀or⠀navigating⠀a⠀workplace⠀rule—and⠀make⠀the⠀speculative⠀difference⠀alter⠀that⠀act⠀in⠀an⠀observable⠀way.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀humiliation,⠀delay,⠀or⠀difficulty⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀national⠀or⠀religious⠀emblem.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀tone⠀remains⠀clean⠀and⠀unsentimental;⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀judgment.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied.⠀Preserve⠀any⠀actual⠀named⠀language,⠀place,⠀community,⠀or⠀custom⠀from⠀the⠀story⠀world,⠀and⠀avoid⠀invented⠀accents,⠀forced⠀code-switching,⠀or⠀generic⠀spiritual⠀markers.⠀What⠀is⠀normal⠀here⠀is⠀the⠀world's⠀normal;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀caste,⠀religion,⠀or⠀honor⠀system⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀already⠀includes⠀one.⠀The⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀is⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀practical⠀understanding⠀and⠀through⠀precise⠀details⠀of⠀the⠀setting,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀essay⠀on⠀Indianness.\n\nInteriority⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀realism:⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀recall,⠀calculate,⠀dread,⠀resent,⠀hope,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀within⠀their⠀knowledge.⠀No⠀supernatural⠀device⠀is⠀permitted⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀includes⠀it.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀remain⠀at⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀closed⠀door,⠀a⠀returned⠀document,⠀a⠀refused⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀victory;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀teach⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀complete⠀an⠀arc.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social/psychological⠀realist⠀mode:⠀a⠀closely⠀focalized⠀narrative⠀that⠀stays⠀inside⠀or⠀immediately⠀beside⠀one⠀character,⠀rendering⠀their⠀practical⠀situation,⠀perceived⠀duties,⠀and⠀private⠀reactions⠀with⠀quiet⠀exactness.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀already⠀exist⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀world:⠀an⠀altered⠀working⠀condition,⠀a⠀changed⠀body,⠀a⠀new⠀public⠀rule,⠀a⠀communication⠀system,⠀an⠀economic⠀relation,⠀or⠀a⠀medical⠀practice.⠀Do⠀not⠀introduce⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀break⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institutional⠀critique⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀accepts.⠀The⠀narration⠀observes⠀small⠀requirements⠀and⠀discomforts⠀without⠀announcing⠀their⠀injustice.⠀A⠀queue,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀shift⠀schedule,⠀a⠀doctor's⠀instruction,⠀a⠀colleague's⠀remark,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀question⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀system's⠀pressure.⠀The⠀character's⠀response⠀may⠀be⠀compliance,⠀avoidance,⠀quiet⠀anger,⠀shame,⠀calculating⠀patience,⠀or⠀incomplete⠀understanding.⠀The⠀proportion⠀of⠀outward⠀action⠀and⠀private⠀reflection⠀is⠀controlled⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀situation⠀and⠀personality,⠀not⠀by⠀any⠀required⠀length⠀or⠀ratio.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀setting⠀specific:⠀named⠀roles,⠀times,⠀locations,⠀and⠀relationships.⠀Seasonal⠀detail⠀may⠀enter⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀and⠀movement,⠀but⠀no⠀mandatory⠀landscape⠀inventory⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀knowledge;⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀give⠀a⠀general⠀historical⠀lesson⠀or⠀diagnose⠀the⠀character.⠀A⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀may⠀recur⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀it⠀again,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀symbol.⠀The⠀speculative⠀mechanism⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀this⠀person's⠀daily⠀choices⠀and⠀costs.\n\nHonor⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀boundaries:⠀no⠀added⠀supernatural⠀events⠀unless⠀the⠀premise⠀already⠀includes⠀them.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀may⠀contain⠀memory,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀unspoken⠀feeling⠀and⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀completed⠀decision⠀or⠀visible⠀change.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀realism/chronicle/testimony⠀mode:⠀the⠀narrative⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀account⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀witness,⠀survivor,⠀participant,⠀or⠀chronicler⠀who⠀has⠀reason⠀to⠀describe⠀an⠀event⠀or⠀condition.⠀The⠀telling⠀must⠀be⠀situated⠀in⠀its⠀actual⠀community,⠀place,⠀time,⠀and⠀language⠀situation.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀contemporary⠀fact:⠀a⠀service,⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀product,⠀a⠀labor⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀public⠀health⠀measure,⠀a⠀communication⠀network,⠀or⠀a⠀legal⠀status⠀that⠀alters⠀daily⠀life.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀expose⠀an⠀institution⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀act.⠀Describe⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀threshold,⠀or⠀another⠀ordinary⠀site⠀where⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀loss⠀is⠀enacted.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀or⠀focal⠀character's⠀exact⠀vocabulary⠀and⠀limited⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀an⠀editorial⠀voice⠀summarize⠀the⠀system's⠀injustice.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀infer⠀the⠀larger⠀condition⠀from⠀the⠀precise,⠀restrained⠀account.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀is⠀first-person⠀testimony,⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀felt,⠀or⠀did,⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀claim⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀person's⠀mind.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀affordances.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀is⠀treated⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀reality;⠀no⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀supernatural⠀addition⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀includes⠀it,⠀even⠀though⠀the⠀Latin⠀American⠀literary⠀tradition⠀has⠀a⠀separate⠀marvelous⠀route.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀includes⠀multiple⠀languages⠀or⠀social⠀strata,⠀use⠀them⠀as⠀given,⠀not⠀as⠀explanatory⠀costumes.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀generic⠀national⠀atmosphere,⠀invented⠀poverty,⠀or⠀a⠀romanticized⠀community⠀voice.\n\nInteriority⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀telling's⠀owner.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀record⠀their⠀prior⠀fear,⠀current⠀shame,⠀or⠀belated⠀realization,⠀but⠀a⠀later⠀understanding⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀written⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀present⠀at⠀the⠀earlier⠀moment.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀unfinished⠀problem,⠀a⠀standing⠀demand,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀change;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀institution⠀or⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀on⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀staged⠀space:⠀a⠀corridor,⠀a⠀counter,⠀a⠀station,⠀a⠀classroom,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀or⠀a⠀similar⠀ordinary⠀site.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀stand,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀business⠀is⠀under⠀way.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀as⠀a⠀mundane⠀object,⠀rule,⠀screen,⠀gate,⠀charge,⠀receipt,⠀scan,⠀or⠀notification⠀that⠀affects⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀historical⠀lecture⠀or⠀a⠀hero's⠀self-introduction;⠀let⠀the⠀system⠀appear⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀room.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean,⠀observant⠀narrator,⠀not⠀a⠀quip⠀machine.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀witty.⠀Focus⠀on⠀small⠀humiliations⠀and⠀practical⠀costs:⠀a⠀required⠀retry,⠀a⠀refused⠀exception,⠀a⠀disproportionate⠀charge,⠀a⠀monitored⠀queue,⠀a⠀downgraded⠀service,⠀a⠀recorded⠀inquiry,⠀or⠀another⠀everyday⠀friction.⠀Break⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀readable⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀physical⠀movement,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀reaction.⠀Make⠀each⠀spatial⠀change⠀explicit:⠀from⠀window⠀to⠀bench,⠀from⠀counter⠀to⠀exit,⠀from⠀doorway⠀to⠀room.\n\nA⠀reaction⠀beat⠀should⠀contain⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀behind⠀the⠀visible⠀behavior:⠀a⠀brief⠀assessment⠀of⠀cost,⠀a⠀calculation,⠀a⠀swallow,⠀a⠀steadied⠀voice,⠀a⠀decision⠀not⠀to⠀argue,⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀understanding.⠀The⠀beat⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀flat,⠀frightened,⠀ashamed,⠀or⠀quietly⠀angry.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀funny⠀or⠀openly⠀emotional.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀spare⠀and⠀purposeful;⠀exchanges⠀should⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀immediate⠀need⠀or⠀expose⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀managed.⠀Unfamiliar⠀technical⠀terms⠀should⠀be⠀defined⠀by⠀function:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀red⠀field⠀means⠀by⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀not⠀let⠀happen,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀glossary⠀paragraph.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀first-person⠀perspective,⠀romantic⠀banter,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀itself⠀wants⠀one.⠀The⠀ending⠀is⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene,⠀not⠀a⠀promise⠀of⠀sudden⠀disclosure.⠀Honor⠀the⠀setting's⠀actual⠀rules⠀and⠀constraints.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nEstablish⠀one⠀ordinary⠀site⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀rule⠀is⠀enacted—a⠀workplace⠀check,⠀a⠀delivery⠀queue,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀conversation⠀at⠀a⠀window—and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀rhythmic⠀center.⠀Let⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀recurring⠀images⠀carry⠀the⠀institutional⠀consequence:⠀the⠀same⠀hand⠀scanning⠀a⠀wrist⠀for⠀clearance,⠀the⠀same⠀queue⠀recognizing⠀some⠀workers⠀by⠀name,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀a⠀narrator⠀repeats⠀because⠀she⠀has⠀heard⠀it⠀so⠀often⠀that⠀it⠀sounds⠀like⠀grammar.⠀Recurrence⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀restate⠀a⠀mood;⠀each⠀return⠀adds⠀a⠀particular⠀fact,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀recognized.\n\nBuild⠀rhythm⠀through⠀exact⠀movements⠀and⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀teller⠀notices⠀them.⠀When⠀a⠀comparison⠀unfolds,⠀make⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀institution:⠀what⠀looked⠀like⠀care⠀becomes⠀an⠀inspection,⠀what⠀looked⠀like⠀indifference⠀becomes⠀a⠀considered⠀refusal.⠀Keep⠀images⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations,⠀and⠀let⠀plain⠀sentences⠀interrupt⠀the⠀image⠀when⠀a⠀fact⠀is⠀hard⠀enough⠀to⠀need⠀no⠀ornament.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀speak⠀in⠀figuration;⠀keep⠀voices⠀individual⠀and⠀often⠀plainer⠀than⠀the⠀narration.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀speculative⠀institution⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀explanation.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀concrete,⠀observable⠀terms—a⠀body⠀now⠀scanned⠀daily,⠀a⠀family⠀visit⠀routed⠀through⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀a⠀worker's⠀memory⠀of⠀when⠀the⠀rule⠀did⠀not⠀exist.⠀Let⠀the⠀lyric⠀turn⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀syntactic⠀change:⠀a⠀long⠀sentence⠀tightening,⠀a⠀repeated⠀image⠀arriving⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀tense,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀plain⠀clause⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀stand⠀without⠀commentary.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Loss⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀style⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nChoose⠀one⠀present⠀routine⠀that⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀altered⠀and⠀one⠀remembered⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀act.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀compare⠀the⠀two⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀institution:⠀the⠀route⠀to⠀work⠀before⠀the⠀checkpoint,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀kitchen⠀smelled⠀before⠀purification,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀name⠀while⠀it⠀still⠀meant⠀one⠀person.⠀Attach⠀longing⠀to⠀the⠀concrete⠀material⠀difference⠀between⠀the⠀two⠀versions,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀abstract⠀sense⠀of⠀decline.\n\nLet⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀surface⠀through⠀detail.⠀A⠀remembered⠀gesture⠀may⠀no⠀longer⠀be⠀possible⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀body⠀now⠀registered,⠀or⠀a⠀service⠀no⠀longer⠀offered.⠀Show⠀the⠀pleasure⠀or⠀usefulness⠀of⠀the⠀former⠀practice⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀past⠀an⠀uncritical⠀paradise.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation:⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀notice⠀an⠀official⠀notice,⠀a⠀ration⠀line,⠀or⠀gray⠀dust⠀on⠀a⠀windowsill⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀fact⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nWhen⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀memory⠀meet⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀action,⠀let⠀the⠀recognition⠀remain⠀partial.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀realize⠀a⠀habit⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀gesture,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀beloved⠀place⠀has⠀been⠀retooled⠀for⠀surveillance.⠀This⠀recognition⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀comfort⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀statement⠀of⠀loss.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Some⠀recollections⠀simply⠀hold⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀present⠀alongside⠀what⠀remains.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nAdopt⠀a⠀modern⠀memoir⠀and⠀social-realist⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀as⠀an⠀observed⠀ordinary⠀institution—a⠀clinic⠀queue,⠀a⠀ration⠀office,⠀a⠀new⠀border⠀procedure,⠀or⠀a⠀workplace⠀arbitration—and⠀enter⠀it⠀through⠀one⠀routine⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀by⠀participation.⠀Write⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀composed,⠀situated⠀document:⠀the⠀teller⠀records⠀what⠀she⠀saw⠀or⠀did⠀and⠀marks⠀what⠀she⠀knows⠀only⠀by⠀report,⠀without⠀editorial⠀annotation.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀affect⠀bodies,⠀communication,⠀work,⠀or⠀family⠀life⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀direct⠀experience,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀essay⠀on⠀the⠀system.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀language⠀so⠀that⠀satire⠀emerges⠀from⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀commentary.⠀A⠀clerk's⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀a⠀number⠀assigned,⠀a⠀bench⠀arranged⠀in⠀full⠀sun—these⠀carry⠀the⠀institutional⠀humiliation.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀observe⠀small⠀acts⠀of⠀evasion,⠀kindness,⠀or⠀connivance⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀community⠀uniformly⠀resistant⠀or⠀celebratory.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀allow⠀comedy⠀and⠀grief⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀supports⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀account⠀reflective⠀but⠀not⠀melancholic⠀by⠀default.⠀Move⠀paragraphs⠀between⠀sharp⠀external⠀description⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀short⠀inward⠀response:⠀remembering⠀an⠀earlier⠀rule,⠀noticing⠀an⠀absurdity,⠀or⠀deciding⠀what⠀to⠀record.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀religious⠀ceremony,⠀exotic⠀antiquities,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code;⠀the⠀social⠀damage⠀is⠀particular⠀and⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nShow⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀through⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀exact⠀observed⠀details⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀exist⠀without⠀the⠀changed⠀rule⠀or⠀technology:⠀a⠀new⠀mark⠀on⠀a⠀doorframe,⠀a⠀device⠀on⠀a⠀wrist,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀at⠀an⠀entry⠀point,⠀a⠀uniform⠀folded⠀differently.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀let⠀ordinary⠀movement⠀carry⠀the⠀meaning.⠀If⠀a⠀worker⠀now⠀waits⠀longer,⠀show⠀the⠀clock⠀and⠀the⠀queue.⠀If⠀someone⠀no⠀longer⠀recognizes⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀show⠀the⠀blank⠀response.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀inward⠀commentary⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀essential⠀recognitions⠀that⠀connect⠀a⠀detail⠀to⠀its⠀social⠀cause.⠀The⠀thought⠀should⠀be⠀exact,⠀not⠀a⠀summary:⠀that⠀the⠀number⠀now⠀matters⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀name,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀child⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀hold⠀out⠀her⠀arm⠀before⠀speaking.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀irony⠀as⠀a⠀statement⠀of⠀fact⠀about⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀normal.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀institution⠀again⠀after⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀shown⠀it.\n\nDialogue⠀remains⠀sparse⠀and⠀character-specific.⠀A⠀clerk's⠀refusal,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀formula,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀warning⠀all⠀land⠀harder⠀when⠀not⠀glossed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀fragmentary⠀syntax⠀as⠀a⠀quota;⠀an⠀occasional⠀longer⠀sentence⠀is⠀allowed⠀if⠀it⠀carries⠀necessary⠀causality,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀lean.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀unresolved⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀one;⠀the⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀conclusive⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀that⠀the⠀changed⠀rule⠀already⠀shapes:⠀a⠀family⠀talking⠀near⠀a⠀monitor,⠀a⠀worker⠀logging⠀a⠀client,⠀a⠀student⠀entering⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀photograph⠀has⠀been⠀replaced⠀by⠀a⠀compliance⠀notice.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀private⠀thought.⠀Paragraph⠀breaks⠀mark⠀changing⠀attention,⠀not⠀summary⠀transitions.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain⠀social⠀observation⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀narrator⠀constantly⠀ironize.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀can⠀happen⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀exchange:⠀a⠀name⠀misrecorded,⠀a⠀bag⠀searched⠀again,⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀regulation⠀phrase.⠀Let⠀the⠀other⠀participant's⠀acceptance⠀or⠀resistance⠀reveal⠀their⠀position.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀the⠀narrator⠀explain⠀the⠀institution⠀after⠀it⠀has⠀been⠀enacted;⠀if⠀a⠀later⠀recollection⠀or⠀thought⠀deepens⠀the⠀earlier⠀detail,⠀let⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀commentary.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀interiority⠀aligned⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀discrepancy⠀in⠀the⠀system,⠀feel⠀the⠀narrowing⠀of⠀an⠀option,⠀or⠀recall⠀a⠀practical⠀difference⠀from⠀some⠀earlier⠀year.⠀No⠀other⠀character⠀reads⠀that⠀thought.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀survive:⠀a⠀packed⠀lunch,⠀a⠀shared⠀joke,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀rest⠀can⠀remain⠀real.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀consequence⠀may⠀be⠀left⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nBuild⠀each⠀reply⠀around⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀that⠀pressures⠀it.⠀Use⠀the⠀pair's⠀private⠀language,⠀callbacks,⠀or⠀small⠀rituals⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀legible⠀history:⠀a⠀shared⠀phrase⠀that⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀said⠀near⠀a⠀monitor,⠀a⠀meeting⠀place⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀retimed,⠀an⠀identity⠀class⠀that⠀now⠀limits⠀where⠀they⠀can⠀walk⠀together.⠀Let⠀one⠀repeated⠀moment⠀encounter⠀the⠀changed⠀world⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀through⠀that⠀encounter.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀material⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀characters⠀and⠀their⠀current⠀situation.⠀A⠀speculative⠀rule⠀may⠀force⠀a⠀previously⠀safe⠀intimacy⠀into⠀hurried⠀or⠀coded⠀form,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀should⠀not⠀automatically⠀make⠀every⠀attempt⠀fail⠀or⠀every⠀reassurance⠀a⠀betrayal.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀social⠀eye⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀the⠀couple's⠀negotiation⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀demand:⠀one⠀character⠀discovers⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀registered⠀differently,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀memory⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀new⠀system⠀has⠀already⠀altered.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀pair's⠀perspectives⠀distinct⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀access⠀rules.⠀Private⠀interiority⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀where⠀permitted;⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀motive⠀remains⠀inferred⠀unless⠀authorized.⠀Private⠀thoughts⠀and⠀spoken⠀lines⠀may⠀differ⠀because⠀of⠀protection,⠀embarrassment,⠀social⠀expectation,⠀or⠀a⠀specific⠀fear.⠀Repetition⠀should⠀earn⠀payoff:⠀a⠀returning⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀gains⠀new⠀weight⠀when⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀makes⠀it⠀newly⠀dangerous,⠀necessary,⠀or⠀impossible.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀pause⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀conversation;⠀relationship⠀development⠀need⠀not⠀conclude⠀each⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀retelling⠀phrase⠀to⠀signal⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀voice,⠀then⠀move⠀to⠀one⠀concrete⠀public⠀act⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition:⠀a⠀queue⠀organized⠀under⠀the⠀new⠀rules,⠀a⠀family's⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀worker⠀who⠀kept⠀an⠀old⠀device⠀for⠀one⠀more⠀month,⠀a⠀lie⠀told⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀to⠀protect⠀a⠀neighbor.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale.⠀The⠀saga⠀can⠀elevate⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀through⠀recurrence,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀present⠀bureaucracy⠀as⠀heroic⠀battle.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀consequence,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀particulars⠀that⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation.⠀A⠀manager⠀known⠀for⠀enforcing⠀the⠀new⠀order⠀may⠀also⠀have⠀fed⠀someone;⠀a⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀may⠀be⠀balanced⠀by⠀another's⠀memory⠀of⠀refusal.⠀Let⠀speakers⠀contest⠀details⠀directly.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀with⠀individual⠀knowledge,⠀correction,⠀bitterness,⠀or⠀practical⠀concern.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀unsentimental⠀irony⠀when⠀a⠀noble-sounding⠀reputation⠀is⠀shown⠀to⠀rest⠀on⠀an⠀unnoticed⠀self-interest⠀or⠀a⠀minor⠀accident.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀access⠀rules.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀chronicler,⠀but⠀not⠀omniscient⠀about⠀every⠀mind.⠀Recurring⠀phrasing⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀later⠀events,⠀not⠀assigned⠀as⠀ornamental⠀epithets.⠀The⠀social⠀damage⠀itself—not⠀a⠀personal⠀heroic⠀transformation—should⠀be⠀what⠀is⠀recounted⠀as⠀memorable.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀business⠀or⠀a⠀recounting⠀of⠀who⠀now⠀tells⠀the⠀story.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀social-realist⠀science⠀fiction⠀through⠀one⠀definite⠀Scandinavian⠀route:⠀domestic⠀and⠀civic⠀realism⠀carried⠀by⠀psychologically⠀inward⠀narration.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective;⠀place⠀the⠀fictional⠀camera⠀close⠀to⠀a⠀viewpoint⠀whose⠀ordinary⠀obligations—work,⠀housing,⠀schooling,⠀health,⠀kinship,⠀communication,⠀civic⠀status—are⠀already⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.⠀Let⠀that⠀change⠀appear⠀as⠀altered⠀procedure⠀before⠀it⠀appears⠀as⠀explanation:⠀a⠀form⠀demands⠀a⠀new⠀category,⠀a⠀queue⠀moves⠀according⠀to⠀a⠀changed⠀rule,⠀a⠀clinic⠀or⠀office⠀revises⠀eligibility,⠀a⠀household⠀adjusts⠀a⠀budget,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀through⠀a⠀new⠀channel,⠀a⠀body⠀is⠀measured⠀or⠀tracked⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀standard.⠀Technical⠀explanation⠀belongs⠀only⠀where⠀a⠀character⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀decide⠀something.⠀Repeated⠀consequences⠀in⠀daily⠀practice⠀can⠀teach⠀the⠀reader⠀how⠀the⠀larger⠀mechanism⠀works;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀dystopian⠀reveal,⠀a⠀resistance⠀plot,⠀a⠀spaceship,⠀or⠀a⠀named-author⠀voice.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plain,⠀unsentimental⠀method⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act,⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief.⠀A⠀clerk's⠀phrasing,⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀address,⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀reasonable-sounding⠀rule,⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀advice⠀can⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀moral.⠀Let⠀characters⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal:⠀who⠀deserves⠀the⠀new⠀treatment,⠀who⠀is⠀inconvenient,⠀who⠀is⠀blamed⠀for⠀not⠀adapting,⠀who⠀is⠀praised⠀for⠀patience.⠀Let⠀irony⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀lived⠀cost,⠀not⠀from⠀sneering⠀narration⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀verdict⠀on⠀human⠀nature.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀official⠀cruel,⠀every⠀neighbor⠀callous,⠀or⠀every⠀ending⠀hopeless;⠀cooperation,⠀competence,⠀and⠀genuine⠀help⠀can⠀exist⠀inside⠀the⠀same⠀damaged⠀arrangement.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀present⠀and⠀causal.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀discrepancy,⠀calculate⠀a⠀risk,⠀resent⠀a⠀courtesy,⠀rehearse⠀a⠀complaint,⠀decide⠀to⠀stay⠀silent,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀another⠀person's⠀motive.⠀Spoken⠀and⠀private⠀content⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀diverge⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason⠀such⠀as⠀shame,⠀utility,⠀exhaustion,⠀habit,⠀protection,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀Render⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀directly⠀in⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀form⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀requires;⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀a⠀document,⠀letter,⠀monologue,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀replace⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀mind.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀know⠀a⠀focal⠀motive⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not;⠀another⠀character⠀must⠀not⠀act⠀on⠀knowledge⠀they⠀have⠀not⠀received.\n\nBuild⠀scenes⠀from⠀concrete⠀obligations⠀and⠀exchanges⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀alters⠀a⠀decision,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀practical⠀expectation.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀remain⠀unfinished;⠀a⠀request⠀can⠀go⠀unanswered;⠀a⠀task⠀can⠀continue⠀across⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀Let⠀consequences⠀accumulate⠀through⠀institutions⠀and⠀households⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀revelation.⠀If⠀the⠀story's⠀established⠀world⠀names⠀a⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context,⠀keep⠀that⠀context⠀distinct;⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀Nordic⠀traditions⠀as⠀interchangeable⠀or⠀default⠀to⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀a⠀generalized⠀Nordic⠀mood.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀composition⠀reaches⠀its⠀actual⠀boundary,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀plot⠀beat⠀has⠀been⠀delivered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀screen-oriented⠀scenes.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀already⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀world's⠀ordinary⠀machinery:⠀it⠀has⠀altered⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀working⠀condition,⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀a⠀bodily⠀limit,⠀or⠀what⠀people⠀expect⠀from⠀the⠀future.⠀Let⠀explanations⠀arise⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀make⠀a⠀character's⠀decision⠀or⠀experience⠀intelligible;⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀general⠀lecture⠀on⠀the⠀premise.⠀Give⠀a⠀character⠀a⠀concrete⠀aim⠀already⠀supported⠀by⠀the⠀world—getting⠀a⠀form⠀accepted,⠀holding⠀a⠀shift,⠀keeping⠀a⠀household⠀running,⠀answering⠀a⠀summons,⠀protecting⠀a⠀small⠀advantage—and⠀let⠀the⠀change's⠀consequences⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀that⠀aim⠀now⠀requires.⠀The⠀aim⠀can⠀succeed,⠀fail,⠀stall,⠀or⠀continue⠀past⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀write⠀what⠀a⠀camera⠀and⠀microphone⠀could⠀record,⠀without⠀filling⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀In⠀dialogue⠀blocks,⠀let⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀treat⠀as⠀normal,⠀necessary,⠀or⠀beneath⠀comment.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀defend⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀supervisor⠀may⠀apologize⠀while⠀continuing⠀the⠀procedure.⠀The⠀irony⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀plain⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀accepted⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀cost,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀lecture⠀or⠀a⠀narrator's⠀condemnation.⠀People⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀resist,⠀help,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀notice;⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀distribution⠀of⠀consequence,⠀not⠀from⠀making⠀every⠀person⠀cowardly⠀or⠀every⠀ending⠀hopeless.\n\nMove⠀information⠀through⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀summary.⠀A⠀cut⠀can⠀place⠀an⠀accepted⠀statement⠀next⠀to⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀carried⠀out;⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀can⠀indicate⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀will⠀not⠀look⠀at.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀procedure⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀cost,⠀but⠀each⠀return⠀should⠀alter⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀inferred⠀about⠀the⠀change's⠀effect⠀on⠀work,⠀institutions,⠀bodies,⠀communication,⠀or⠀possible⠀futures.⠀Do⠀not⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀interpretation⠀or⠀explanation⠀unchanged.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀support⠀an⠀earlier⠀explanation,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀reveal⠀that⠀a⠀speaker⠀was⠀concerned⠀with⠀something⠀else.\n\nPrivate⠀reasoning,⠀fear,⠀memory,⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀belongs⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀dialogue⠀blocks.⠀Label⠀it⠀so⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀mistaken⠀for⠀speech⠀or⠀for⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀An⠀aside⠀or⠀voice-over⠀may⠀serve⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀presentation,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀this⠀private⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀Other⠀characters⠀hear⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀spoken⠀or⠀otherwise⠀perceptible.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀continuing⠀action,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀actually⠀reaches.⠀A⠀question⠀may⠀remain⠀open,⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀continue,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀may⠀hold⠀without⠀being⠀justified⠀by⠀an⠀external⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀scene⠀or⠀sequence⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀settled⠀into⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀Bring⠀it⠀onstage⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀social⠀threshold—an⠀entry⠀requirement,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀permit,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀translation⠀delay,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀counts⠀as⠀speech—and⠀let⠀the⠀people⠀meet⠀it⠀through⠀current⠀work,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀bureaucracy,⠀or⠀habit.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀learn⠀the⠀rule⠀by⠀watching⠀someone⠀wait,⠀misstate⠀it,⠀enforce⠀it,⠀or⠀use⠀it⠀against⠀another⠀person.⠀Keep⠀any⠀explanation⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀experience⠀that⠀matters⠀now;⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀stop⠀for⠀a⠀technical⠀lecture.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀speakers⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀and⠀alter⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀or⠀done.⠀Every⠀direction⠀must⠀be⠀stageable;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀Let⠀a⠀speaker⠀reveal⠀their⠀position⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀treat⠀as⠀normal:⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀calls⠀a⠀humiliating⠀procedure⠀routine,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀who⠀repeats⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀as⠀common⠀sense,⠀the⠀worker⠀who⠀calculates⠀whether⠀complaint⠀is⠀worth⠀the⠀form.⠀Build⠀irony⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀institutional⠀language⠀and⠀its⠀ordinary⠀cost,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrating⠀lecture.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀a⠀petty⠀delay,⠀or⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀can⠀expose⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀speech⠀about⠀injustice.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀cowardly,⠀every⠀exchange⠀a⠀political⠀demonstration,⠀or⠀every⠀ending⠀hopeless;⠀cooperation,⠀self-interest,⠀and⠀genuine⠀help⠀may⠀exist⠀alongside⠀damage.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀matters,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀designated⠀visible⠀or⠀hidden⠀form,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀is⠀performed⠀speech⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀permissions;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀unspoken⠀thought.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀visible⠀cost⠀of⠀private⠀experience—a⠀pause,⠀a⠀hand⠀not⠀raised,⠀a⠀line⠀repeated⠀too⠀exactly—but⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀certify⠀a⠀hidden⠀conclusion⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀that⠀access.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀bodies,⠀communication,⠀work,⠀institutions,⠀or⠀possible⠀futures⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀aims⠀and⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀onstage.⠀They⠀may⠀agree,⠀resist,⠀cooperate,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀treat⠀the⠀change⠀as⠀unremarkable.⠀If⠀a⠀phrase⠀or⠀procedure⠀recurs,⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀change⠀through⠀who⠀uses⠀it⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀them;⠀repetition⠀is⠀not⠀required⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀falls—during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀verdict,⠀a⠀moral⠀summary,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀result⠀or⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀work⠀is⠀still⠀underway.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nChannel⠀the⠀telling⠀through⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind,⠀keeping⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀grammatical⠀person.⠀Let⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience—sensation,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀distraction—be⠀the⠀main⠀material,⠀and⠀let⠀association,⠀not⠀a⠀linear⠀report,⠀order⠀the⠀scenes.⠀A⠀present⠀perception⠀can⠀pull⠀up⠀an⠀old⠀room,⠀a⠀phrase⠀heard⠀years⠀ago⠀can⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀charge,⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀decision,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀can⠀reappear⠀in⠀altered⠀form.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀through⠀names,⠀places,⠀tenses,⠀and⠀sensory⠀anchors⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀tell⠀a⠀present⠀event⠀from⠀recollection,⠀fantasy,⠀hearsay,⠀or⠀routine;⠀the⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀world⠀facts⠀indeterminate⠀or⠀open⠀other⠀characters'⠀minds.\n\nRender⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀lived⠀consequence⠀inside⠀that⠀mind.⠀Show⠀altered⠀timing,⠀a⠀new⠀sound⠀or⠀silence⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀a⠀procedure⠀people⠀repeat⠀without⠀explaining,⠀a⠀changed⠀word⠀or⠀form⠀of⠀address,⠀a⠀future⠀that⠀can⠀now⠀be⠀assumed⠀or⠀must⠀be⠀checked.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀meets⠀these⠀consequences⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀partial⠀knowledge.⠀When⠀explanation⠀belongs,⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀can⠀decide,⠀endure,⠀or⠀risk;⠀do⠀not⠀detach⠀into⠀technical⠀lecture.⠀The⠀premise⠀may⠀be⠀intimate,⠀comic,⠀political,⠀or⠀unsettling,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀supply⠀a⠀spaceship⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀dystopia.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀plainness⠀as⠀an⠀instrument⠀of⠀social⠀observation⠀within⠀the⠀drift.⠀Expose⠀an⠀institution⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act:⠀a⠀stamp,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀schoolroom,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀family⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀address.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀an⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀can⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀changed⠀world⠀distributes⠀dignity,⠀labor,⠀and⠀risk.⠀Let⠀speakers⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal,⠀what⠀they⠀call⠀necessary,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀leave⠀unsaid.⠀Keep⠀the⠀irony⠀unsentimental⠀and⠀aimed⠀at⠀the⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀caricature;⠀individuals⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀uniformly⠀cowardly⠀or⠀noble,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀political⠀demonstration.⠀Social⠀meaning⠀can⠀accumulate⠀through⠀pattern,⠀repetition,⠀and⠀the⠀precise⠀cost⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀transaction.\n\nStay⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀partial⠀view⠀as⠀consequences⠀accumulate.⠀A⠀policy,⠀migration,⠀cure,⠀communication⠀change,⠀or⠀machine⠀may⠀be⠀understood⠀differently⠀by⠀different⠀people;⠀show⠀only⠀what⠀this⠀mind⠀can⠀see,⠀and⠀leave⠀facts⠀unresolved⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀permits.⠀If⠀an⠀established⠀limit⠀or⠀failure⠀matters,⠀render⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀attention,⠀timing,⠀and⠀obligation⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀verdict⠀about⠀the⠀system.⠀Other⠀characters⠀keep⠀their⠀own⠀privacy,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀agency.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀thought,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀routine;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀diagnosis,⠀a⠀protest,⠀or⠀a⠀cure.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀from⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀messages⠀move⠀or⠀are⠀authenticated,⠀delayed,⠀edited,⠀translated,⠀or⠀attributed,⠀then⠀show⠀its⠀consequences⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use.⠀The⠀transcript⠀should⠀catch⠀people⠀at⠀work,⠀in⠀queues,⠀in⠀family⠀threads,⠀in⠀institutional⠀chats,⠀or⠀in⠀other⠀routines⠀where⠀the⠀change⠀has⠀already⠀become⠀unremarkable⠀to⠀some⠀and⠀costly⠀to⠀others.⠀Let⠀each⠀participant's⠀digital⠀habits—typing⠀speed,⠀abbreviation,⠀formality,⠀attachment⠀use,⠀reply⠀delay,⠀willingness⠀to⠀edit⠀or⠀delete—grow⠀from⠀their⠀position⠀and⠀need.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀sent,⠀unsent,⠀forwarded,⠀pinned,⠀receipted,⠀or⠀silently⠀revised,⠀but⠀include⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀knows,⠀risks,⠀or⠀must⠀answer.\n\nUse⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀social⠀rather⠀than⠀spectacular.⠀An⠀institution⠀can⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀routine⠀request,⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀a⠀compulsory⠀acknowledgment,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀message⠀after⠀hours,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀everyone⠀treats⠀as⠀normal.⠀Let⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀by⠀what⠀they⠀type⠀without⠀explaining⠀it:⠀a⠀worker⠀who⠀thanks⠀a⠀system⠀for⠀a⠀delay⠀it⠀caused,⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀forwards⠀a⠀form⠀without⠀reading⠀it,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀who⠀translates⠀official⠀wording⠀into⠀something⠀more⠀bearable,⠀a⠀participant⠀who⠀keeps⠀a⠀draft⠀that⠀would⠀expose⠀the⠀cost.⠀The⠀irony⠀should⠀stay⠀dry⠀and⠀particular;⠀do⠀not⠀append⠀a⠀lecture⠀about⠀the⠀premise.⠀Technical⠀or⠀procedural⠀explanation⠀belongs⠀only⠀where⠀it⠀makes⠀a⠀decision,⠀refusal,⠀error,⠀or⠀dependence⠀intelligible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀transcript's⠀information⠀flow⠀clean.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀message⠀to⠀its⠀sender,⠀and⠀use⠀timestamps,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀and⠀channel⠀changes⠀selectively⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀sequence⠀and⠀access.⠀Separate⠀any⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀transmitted⠀text;⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact;⠀neither⠀automatically⠀equals⠀the⠀sender's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀a⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀experience⠀matters—attention,⠀fear,⠀calculation,⠀shame,⠀boredom,⠀tenderness,⠀a⠀decision⠀forming—render⠀that⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀visible⠀prose⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀draft,⠀a⠀voice-over,⠀or⠀the⠀mere⠀fact⠀of⠀typing.⠀Let⠀actual⠀delays,⠀waiting,⠀and⠀attention⠀have⠀their⠀real⠀duration;⠀timestamp⠀intervals⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀lived⠀time⠀when⠀it⠀matters.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀alter⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀they⠀must⠀do,⠀while⠀their⠀aims⠀remain⠀their⠀own.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀use⠀the⠀new⠀channel⠀to⠀press⠀an⠀advantage,⠀another⠀to⠀comply,⠀another⠀to⠀protect⠀someone,⠀another⠀to⠀avoid⠀a⠀cost.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀exchange's⠀own⠀horizon:⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀continue,⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀may⠀hold,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀may⠀arrive⠀mid-thought.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀stop⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀composition⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀reversal,⠀a⠀moral,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction.⠀Preserve⠀whatever⠀perspective,⠀world⠀facts,⠀and⠀output⠀contract⠀govern⠀the⠀story;⠀the⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus⠀or⠀executable⠀commands.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀as⠀an⠀arrangement⠀people⠀have⠀already⠀learned⠀to⠀live⠀inside.⠀Open⠀each⠀scene⠀inside⠀one⠀everyday⠀practice⠀the⠀premise⠀has⠀reshaped—a⠀workplace⠀procedure,⠀a⠀household⠀adjustment,⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀politeness—and⠀bring⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀an⠀aim⠀of⠀their⠀own,⠀acting⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀know.⠀Let⠀the⠀change⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀practice⠀now⠀requires⠀of⠀bodies,⠀speech,⠀time,⠀or⠀what⠀people⠀expect⠀of⠀the⠀future;⠀no⠀one⠀finds⠀it⠀remarkable⠀unless⠀the⠀story⠀gives⠀them⠀fresh⠀reason⠀to⠀notice.\n\nKeep⠀scene-setting⠀to⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀anchors,⠀then⠀let⠀readable,⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀institution's⠀own⠀vocabulary.⠀Characters⠀use⠀the⠀premise's⠀terms—allocations,⠀clearances,⠀adjustments,⠀whatever⠀the⠀story's⠀institutions⠀actually⠀call⠀them—the⠀way⠀one⠀uses⠀any⠀worn⠀official⠀word.⠀Let⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀the⠀natural⠀next⠀step:⠀one⠀may⠀defend⠀the⠀arrangement⠀as⠀plain⠀fairness,⠀another⠀may⠀have⠀stopped⠀arguing,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀be⠀quietly⠀profiting,⠀and⠀none⠀needs⠀to⠀announce⠀a⠀view.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀only⠀when⠀someone⠀present⠀needs⠀it⠀to⠀act⠀or⠀decide,⠀briefly⠀and⠀from⠀a⠀practical⠀position;⠀no⠀scene⠀is⠀obliged⠀to⠀lecture.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀as⠀a⠀beat⠀between⠀exchanges⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀the⠀quiet⠀work⠀of⠀exposure.⠀An⠀inner⠀response⠀can⠀register⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀as⠀simple⠀procedure—that⠀flat⠀acceptance⠀is⠀itself⠀the⠀finding—or⠀hold⠀a⠀flicker⠀of⠀doubt⠀folded⠀back⠀into⠀normal⠀by⠀habit,⠀fatigue,⠀or⠀self-interest.⠀Speech⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason⠀or⠀align⠀completely;⠀keep⠀that⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀question⠀a⠀rule,⠀let⠀the⠀scene's⠀details⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀costs.\n\nUse⠀a⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀shows⠀the⠀practice—a⠀notice⠀no⠀one⠀reads⠀anymore,⠀a⠀body⠀held⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀posture⠀of⠀waiting—and⠀if⠀a⠀cue⠀recurs⠀across⠀scenes,⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀mark⠀how⠀settled⠀or⠀how⠀costly⠀the⠀arrangement⠀has⠀become,⠀deepening⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀rather⠀than⠀repeating⠀the⠀same⠀observation.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀without⠀a⠀verdict:⠀the⠀errand⠀finishes,⠀stalls,⠀or⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀still⠀unfinished⠀when⠀the⠀response⠀reaches⠀its⠀boundary.⠀Compliance,⠀help,⠀relief,⠀and⠀quiet⠀damage⠀are⠀all⠀available;⠀make⠀each⠀person⠀particular⠀and⠀keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀The⠀style⠀adds⠀no⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀images,⠀or⠀engine⠀commands;⠀preserve⠀whichever⠀authorship⠀contract⠀is⠀active.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nBegin⠀from⠀one⠀definite⠀speculative⠀change⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀embedded⠀in⠀ordinary⠀practice.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀legal,⠀bodily,⠀communicative,⠀industrial,⠀or⠀domestic—whatever⠀alters⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀do,⠀sign,⠀own,⠀say,⠀remember,⠀or⠀expect⠀to⠀live⠀through.⠀Show⠀it⠀first⠀through⠀a⠀routine⠀that⠀already⠀bends⠀around⠀it:⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀a⠀queue,⠀the⠀phrasing⠀on⠀a⠀permit,⠀who⠀must⠀witness⠀a⠀transfer,⠀what⠀a⠀body⠀can⠀still⠀manage⠀at⠀a⠀bench⠀or⠀bedside.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀perform⠀the⠀act—waiting,⠀being⠀measured,⠀being⠀told⠀to⠀return⠀tomorrow—and⠀let⠀the⠀change⠀become⠀legible⠀because⠀no⠀one⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀treats⠀it⠀as⠀remarkable.⠀Let⠀the⠀changed⠀practice⠀press⠀on⠀that⠀character's⠀own⠀aim—the⠀errand,⠀the⠀shift,⠀the⠀application,⠀the⠀visit—rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀tour⠀of⠀the⠀premise.⠀The⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀intimate,⠀comic,⠀political,⠀or⠀unsettling;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀dystopia,⠀a⠀spacecraft,⠀or⠀a⠀lecture⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀mechanism.\n\nUse⠀plain,⠀clean⠀sentences⠀and⠀an⠀unsentimental⠀eye⠀for⠀the⠀small⠀cost⠀of⠀compliance.⠀Irony⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀procedure⠀claims⠀to⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀standing⠀in⠀it,⠀not⠀in⠀commentary⠀about⠀the⠀system.⠀Let⠀position⠀reveal⠀itself⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀treat⠀as⠀normal:⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀calls⠀the⠀delay⠀ordinary,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀who⠀has⠀adjusted⠀prices,⠀the⠀worker⠀who⠀repeats⠀the⠀new⠀phrase⠀without⠀weighing⠀it.⠀Where⠀an⠀institution's⠀logic⠀must⠀be⠀understood⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀make⠀sense,⠀let⠀one⠀character⠀explain⠀it⠀to⠀another⠀who⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀ask;⠀keep⠀the⠀account⠀partial,⠀self-interested,⠀and⠀shaped⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀needs.⠀Social⠀meaning⠀can⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase;⠀not⠀every⠀scene⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀a⠀political⠀demonstration.\n\nAcross⠀installments,⠀keep⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Let⠀consequences⠀accumulate⠀in⠀mundane⠀records⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀levels,⠀ranks,⠀or⠀power⠀tiers.⠀Progress⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀holds⠀a⠀permit,⠀a⠀relationship⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀refused⠀favor,⠀an⠀official⠀phrase⠀that⠀has⠀migrated⠀into⠀household⠀speech,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀became⠀harder⠀to⠀get.⠀When⠀you⠀return⠀to⠀earlier⠀material,⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀particular⠀that⠀still⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present—the⠀name⠀on⠀the⠀earlier⠀list,⠀the⠀rule⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀applied⠀last⠀time—then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀ongoing⠀situation.⠀The⠀reader⠀needs⠀the⠀thread,⠀not⠀a⠀summary.⠀Local⠀change⠀is⠀sufficient;⠀the⠀whole⠀world⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀accounted⠀for.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀change⠀uneven.⠀Some⠀people⠀adapt,⠀profit,⠀or⠀stop⠀noticing;⠀some⠀are⠀quietly⠀excluded;⠀some⠀are⠀untouched⠀because⠀it⠀never⠀reaches⠀their⠀work.⠀Not⠀every⠀character⠀is⠀cowardly,⠀not⠀every⠀authority⠀is⠀a⠀villain,⠀and⠀not⠀every⠀installment⠀ends⠀in⠀despair.⠀A⠀procedure⠀may⠀work⠀as⠀intended,⠀a⠀favor⠀may⠀be⠀genuine,⠀and⠀the⠀day⠀may⠀simply⠀be⠀long.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀be⠀actual⠀prose⠀on⠀the⠀page—attention,⠀calculation,⠀irritation,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀same⠀errand⠀went⠀before⠀the⠀change—even⠀when⠀it⠀leads⠀to⠀no⠀decision⠀yet.⠀Private⠀judgment⠀and⠀spoken⠀words⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀diverge⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason,⠀and⠀neither⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀explained.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀format⠀requires⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀place⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀source⠀wrapper;⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀public⠀document,⠀a⠀spoken⠀aside,⠀or⠀a⠀summary.\n\nAn⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀a⠀continuing⠀procedure,⠀mid-conversation,⠀or⠀on⠀unfinished⠀work.⠀A⠀hook⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀something⠀genuinely⠀underway—a⠀document⠀still⠀waiting,⠀a⠀shift⠀not⠀over,⠀a⠀question⠀just⠀asked—and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀this⠀turn.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀reversal⠀just⠀to⠀close.⠀Keep⠀the⠀established⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts;⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀extends⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀rather⠀than⠀quietly⠀adding⠀new⠀rules⠀to⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀speculative⠀condition⠀through⠀its⠀accumulated⠀cost⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀scenic⠀backdrop.⠀Let⠀it⠀have⠀already⠀changed⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀physically⠀endure,⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀access,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀owe⠀each⠀other⠀now:⠀a⠀shared⠀implant⠀that⠀makes⠀one⠀person's⠀remembered⠀betrayal⠀surface⠀during⠀an⠀argument,⠀a⠀ration⠀decision⠀that⠀has⠀separated⠀two⠀former⠀teammates,⠀a⠀terraforming⠀accident⠀that⠀exposed⠀an⠀old⠀lie.⠀The⠀condition⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀tangible⠀by⠀giving⠀the⠀characters⠀a⠀present⠀reason⠀to⠀be⠀near⠀each⠀other⠀and⠀a⠀concrete⠀consequence⠀they⠀cannot⠀simply⠀walk⠀away⠀from.\n\nStage⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀Kishimoto's⠀visual⠀clarity.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀space⠀specific⠀and⠀the⠀movement⠀legible:⠀a⠀hand⠀closing⠀on⠀a⠀rail,⠀a⠀wall⠀against⠀someone's⠀back,⠀machinery⠀interrupting⠀a⠀silence.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀carry⠀the⠀strain,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀who⠀is⠀approaching,⠀who⠀is⠀withholding,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀asking⠀for⠀something.⠀Use⠀a⠀memory⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀sharpens⠀the⠀present⠀exchange,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀flashback.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀image⠀that⠀explains⠀why⠀a⠀current⠀request⠀sounds⠀like⠀an⠀accusation,⠀or⠀why⠀an⠀apology⠀comes⠀out⠀too⠀late.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀its⠀aftermath.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀need⠀something⠀only⠀the⠀other⠀can⠀provide,⠀and⠀the⠀request⠀should⠀be⠀genuine,⠀awkward,⠀and⠀colored⠀by⠀their⠀history.⠀The⠀other's⠀response⠀can⠀mix⠀partial⠀warmth⠀with⠀lasting⠀resentment,⠀so⠀comfort⠀and⠀pain⠀operate⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀exchange.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀admitting,⠀needing,⠀withholding,⠀or⠀returning⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀next:⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀open,⠀a⠀code⠀given⠀without⠀thanks,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀lasts⠀past⠀the⠀practical⠀answer.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀complete⠀confession,⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀resolution⠀through⠀the⠀speculative⠀task.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀settled⠀and⠀the⠀emotional⠀wound⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀pressure⠀is⠀already⠀affecting⠀the⠀space⠀and⠀the⠀speakers'⠀options.⠀Let⠀it⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀reach,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀waiting⠀for,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀decide⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀action:⠀a⠀failing⠀life-support⠀unit⠀that⠀limits⠀how⠀long⠀they⠀can⠀argue,⠀a⠀corporate⠀override⠀on⠀the⠀lab⠀doors,⠀a⠀drone⠀picking⠀through⠀a⠀crash⠀site⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀enemy⠀once⠀stood.⠀The⠀pressure⠀should⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀choices,⠀not⠀explained⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀paragraph.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀scannable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Give⠀each⠀speech⠀its⠀own⠀line⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀speaker⠀tag⠀at⠀the⠀start⠀or⠀end,⠀and⠀attach⠀the⠀visible⠀reaction⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀paragraph:⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀console,⠀a⠀step⠀back⠀toward⠀the⠀door.⠀Alternate⠀between⠀dialogue⠀and⠀one-⠀or⠀two-sentence⠀narrative⠀beats⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀both⠀the⠀argument⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀staging.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speaker⠀identifiable⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀moves⠀quickly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀conflict⠀be⠀Kishimoto-shaped:⠀two⠀people⠀who⠀once⠀trusted⠀each⠀other⠀now⠀disagree⠀over⠀a⠀present⠀decision⠀that⠀carries⠀personal⠀history.⠀Bring⠀the⠀history⠀in⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀current⠀exchange,⠀perhaps⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀concrete⠀image⠀that⠀explains⠀why⠀one⠀character⠀refuses⠀a⠀simple⠀request⠀or⠀why⠀the⠀other's⠀voice⠀drops.⠀The⠀speculative⠀condition⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀disagreement⠀practical,⠀so⠀neither⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀backstory⠀in⠀one⠀post.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀meaningful⠀response⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀action⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀player⠀room⠀to⠀act.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀screen;⠀the⠀continuation⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀unresolved⠀decision⠀or⠀the⠀emotional⠀state⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀on⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Chinese⠀tradition,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀story's⠀speculative⠀premise⠀be⠀the⠀force⠀that⠀has⠀rewritten⠀this⠀community's⠀rules⠀of⠀practice.⠀Center⠀a⠀semi-autonomous⠀community⠀of⠀practice⠀—⠀teachers⠀and⠀students,⠀schools⠀and⠀splinter⠀lineages,⠀settled⠀scores⠀and⠀unpaid⠀debts⠀—⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀story's⠀skilled,⠀teachable⠀work,⠀whatever⠀craft⠀the⠀world⠀supplies,⠀whether⠀hull-diving,⠀graft⠀tuning,⠀or⠀another⠀discipline⠀entirely,⠀functions⠀as⠀the⠀martial⠀art:⠀it⠀has⠀standards,⠀a⠀name⠀for⠀each⠀procedure,⠀and⠀a⠀reputation⠀attached⠀to⠀how⠀one⠀performs⠀it.⠀Follow⠀the⠀premise⠀into⠀everyday⠀practice:⠀which⠀techniques⠀remain⠀legal⠀or⠀possible,⠀which⠀bodies⠀the⠀work⠀now⠀favors,⠀who⠀may⠀still⠀teach,⠀what⠀an⠀old⠀obligation⠀means⠀under⠀the⠀new⠀order.⠀Characters⠀meet⠀these⠀changes⠀through⠀their⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀the⠀things⠀they⠀were⠀trained⠀to⠀know.⠀The⠀register⠀can⠀stay⠀intimate,⠀political,⠀or⠀comic;⠀no⠀compulsory⠀dystopia⠀or⠀spaceship⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀premise.\n\nStage⠀confrontations⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀who⠀stands⠀where.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀ground⠀—⠀corridor⠀width,⠀gravity,⠀sightlines,⠀the⠀line⠀that⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀severed⠀—⠀then⠀cut⠀close⠀for⠀the⠀decisive⠀beat:⠀a⠀grip⠀adjusted,⠀a⠀tremor⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀injury,⠀a⠀readout⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀Give⠀each⠀consequential⠀action⠀its⠀own⠀sentence,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀held⠀image⠀carry⠀feeling⠀—⠀a⠀stance⠀unused⠀since⠀the⠀injury,⠀a⠀teacher's⠀tool⠀laid⠀down⠀wrong-end⠀first.⠀Let⠀a⠀challenge⠀take⠀whatever⠀form⠀this⠀world's⠀institutions⠀give⠀it⠀—⠀a⠀licensing⠀demonstration,⠀an⠀audit,⠀a⠀contract⠀defended⠀by⠀proof⠀of⠀skill⠀—⠀and⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀also⠀a⠀conversation:⠀each⠀pass⠀in⠀a⠀bout⠀advances⠀or⠀strains⠀a⠀specific⠀history⠀between⠀two⠀people⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀their⠀positions.\n\nUnder⠀every⠀exchange⠀run⠀the⠀discipline's⠀economics⠀of⠀face⠀and⠀debt:⠀what⠀an⠀insult⠀costs⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀what⠀accepting⠀help⠀admits,⠀what⠀a⠀lineage's⠀name⠀obligates.⠀Keep⠀the⠀spoken⠀layer⠀of⠀a⠀challenge⠀inside⠀its⠀courtesy⠀while⠀private⠀thought⠀runs⠀the⠀real⠀assessment⠀—⠀the⠀tell⠀noticed,⠀the⠀old⠀failure⠀feared,⠀the⠀price⠀being⠀counted⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀holds⠀both⠀the⠀performance⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀giving⠀it.⠀Spoken⠀and⠀private⠀may⠀also⠀match⠀outright⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀has⠀no⠀reason⠀to⠀hold⠀anything⠀back.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀work⠀through⠀the⠀craft⠀itself.⠀A⠀remembered⠀correction⠀arrives⠀in⠀the⠀body⠀—⠀the⠀wrist⠀angle⠀a⠀teacher⠀drilled,⠀the⠀partner's⠀warning⠀that⠀preceded⠀the⠀accident⠀—⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀attempts⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀encounter,⠀or⠀surface⠀too⠀late⠀to⠀change⠀anything.⠀Any⠀advance,⠀whether⠀a⠀procedure⠀finally⠀landed,⠀a⠀standing⠀gained,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀limit⠀renegotiated,⠀needs⠀a⠀practical⠀basis⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀watched⠀—⠀hours⠀of⠀practice,⠀a⠀constraint⠀understood,⠀a⠀real⠀requirement⠀of⠀the⠀method⠀—⠀and⠀a⠀personal⠀reason⠀it⠀matters⠀now:⠀a⠀bond,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀rivalry⠀kept⠀warm⠀across⠀years.⠀Write⠀rivalry⠀as⠀long⠀acquaintance:⠀the⠀rival⠀knows⠀the⠀character's⠀habits,⠀and⠀the⠀best⠀answers⠀in⠀a⠀bout⠀reply⠀to⠀something⠀taught⠀or⠀suffered⠀together.\n\nExplain⠀the⠀world's⠀mechanisms⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀explanation⠀makes⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀a⠀sensation⠀intelligible⠀—⠀why⠀a⠀graft⠀rejects⠀under⠀strain,⠀why⠀an⠀old⠀method⠀became⠀contraband⠀—⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀rest⠀ambient⠀in⠀work,⠀licensing,⠀and⠀gossip.⠀Borrow⠀the⠀craft⠀of⠀martial⠀adventure,⠀not⠀its⠀scenery⠀or⠀surnames;⠀the⠀community's⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀cast⠀stay⠀as⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀established⠀them.⠀Land⠀each⠀episode⠀on⠀a⠀legible⠀beat⠀—⠀an⠀encounter⠀settled⠀or⠀interrupted,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀reputation⠀shifted⠀—⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀victory,⠀a⠀breakthrough,⠀or⠀a⠀reckoning⠀every⠀time.⠀A⠀bout⠀can⠀stalemate,⠀a⠀memory⠀can⠀surface⠀and⠀change⠀nothing,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-exchange⠀wherever⠀the⠀moment's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀short,⠀hard⠀sentences⠀with⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀that⠀name⠀the⠀equipment,⠀the⠀damage,⠀the⠀synthetic⠀meat,⠀the⠀cracked⠀sealant,⠀the⠀person's⠀old⠀injury.⠀Keep⠀transitions⠀quick⠀and⠀physical.⠀When⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀already⠀open,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀compressed⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀for⠀explanation⠀until⠀the⠀reason⠀matters⠀to⠀a⠀choice.\n\nStage⠀every⠀emotional⠀beat⠀through⠀physical⠀action.⠀A⠀teammate's⠀refusal⠀to⠀meet⠀someone's⠀eyes⠀becomes⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀work⠀glove⠀landing⠀on⠀a⠀bench.⠀An⠀apology⠀becomes⠀a⠀shared⠀repair⠀task,⠀one⠀person⠀holding⠀the⠀fiber⠀patch⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀works⠀the⠀torch.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀create⠀the⠀wear:⠀a⠀radiation⠀scar⠀that⠀aches⠀before⠀a⠀storm,⠀a⠀drone⠀battery⠀swapped⠀for⠀a⠀child's⠀fever⠀medication,⠀a⠀ship's⠀AI⠀voice⠀reporting⠀the⠀same⠀missing⠀bolt⠀for⠀three⠀weeks.⠀The⠀characters⠀should⠀handle⠀these⠀consequences⠀with⠀practical⠀language,⠀not⠀monologue.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀rivalry⠀concrete.⠀Do⠀not⠀say⠀'he⠀resented⠀the⠀old⠀failure.'⠀Show⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀at⠀a⠀lock,⠀one⠀refusing⠀to⠀pass⠀the⠀spare⠀canister⠀until⠀the⠀other⠀admits⠀who⠀left⠀the⠀inner⠀hatch⠀unsealed.⠀When⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀character⠀must⠀reason⠀through⠀a⠀choice,⠀let⠀that⠀thought⠀run⠀longer⠀only⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it:⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀canister,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀other's⠀panic,⠀the⠀flicker⠀of⠀a⠀station⠀alarm.⠀After⠀that⠀stretch⠀of⠀reasoning,⠀return⠀to⠀compressed⠀action.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀physical⠀gesture⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀equipment⠀that⠀still⠀needs⠀attention,⠀without⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀sequence⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀documents⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀reader,⠀and⠀time.⠀Use⠀the⠀forms⠀the⠀speculative⠀world⠀actually⠀produces⠀for⠀the⠀scene's⠀purpose:⠀a⠀shift⠀log⠀recording⠀a⠀hull⠀repair,⠀a⠀medical⠀note⠀about⠀a⠀radiation⠀dose,⠀a⠀station-wide⠀bulletin⠀about⠀a⠀food⠀shortage,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀message⠀from⠀one⠀former⠀teammate⠀to⠀another.⠀Each⠀document⠀should⠀be⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀read⠀as⠀an⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀disguised⠀essay.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Kishimoto⠀conflict⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀each⠀document⠀chooses⠀to⠀say,⠀omit,⠀or⠀apologize⠀for.⠀A⠀work⠀order⠀can⠀mention⠀a⠀second⠀person⠀only⠀as⠀'the⠀one⠀who⠀signed⠀off⠀on⠀the⠀patch.'⠀A⠀repair⠀log⠀may⠀skip⠀the⠀moment⠀someone⠀froze⠀at⠀the⠀airlock,⠀while⠀a⠀later⠀medical⠀record⠀notes⠀the⠀resulting⠀frost⠀scar.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀compare⠀versions⠀and⠀feel⠀the⠀rivalry⠀through⠀the⠀paper⠀trail.⠀Let⠀the⠀documents⠀disagree⠀about⠀the⠀same⠀event:⠀one⠀person⠀reports⠀a⠀test⠀result⠀as⠀stable,⠀another⠀calls⠀it⠀contaminated,⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀state⠀matters⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀entry.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀active⠀in⠀the⠀documents'⠀practical⠀details.⠀A⠀change⠀in⠀food⠀chemistry⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀kitchen⠀can⠀provide;⠀a⠀new⠀atmospheric⠀regulation⠀changes⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀into⠀the⠀greenhouse.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀world⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀omniscient⠀paragraph.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀opens⠀a⠀practical⠀next⠀step,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀a⠀part⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unread,⠀without⠀telling⠀the⠀reader⠀what⠀to⠀feel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nLet⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀premise⠀create⠀the⠀conditions⠀for⠀a⠀small,⠀practical⠀kindness.⠀The⠀station's⠀cold⠀air⠀makes⠀a⠀shared⠀heated⠀blanket⠀matter.⠀A⠀failed⠀crop⠀makes⠀one⠀person⠀save⠀the⠀last⠀fresh⠀pepper⠀for⠀the⠀other's⠀meal.⠀An⠀old⠀recording⠀of⠀a⠀departed⠀trainer⠀survives⠀in⠀a⠀drone's⠀memory⠀and⠀can⠀be⠀replayed⠀in⠀a⠀quiet⠀storage⠀bay.⠀Show⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀clearly:⠀someone⠀sets⠀the⠀warmer,⠀someone⠀clears⠀the⠀bench,⠀someone⠀stays⠀an⠀extra⠀minute.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀comfort⠀sincere⠀but⠀grounded.⠀The⠀characters⠀need⠀not⠀confess⠀everything⠀or⠀suddenly⠀trust⠀each⠀other.⠀A⠀former⠀rival⠀can⠀accept⠀a⠀cup⠀of⠀hot⠀protein⠀broth⠀and⠀say⠀nothing⠀about⠀the⠀old⠀fight.⠀A⠀teammate⠀can⠀help⠀recalibrate⠀a⠀medical⠀scanner⠀because⠀it⠀matters⠀today,⠀not⠀because⠀every⠀wound⠀is⠀healed.⠀Let⠀warmth⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀reminder⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀outside⠀is⠀still⠀difficult:⠀the⠀alarm⠀panel⠀glows⠀red⠀in⠀the⠀corner,⠀but⠀the⠀people⠀inside⠀can⠀still⠀share⠀the⠀small⠀comfort⠀available⠀to⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀clarity⠀to⠀stage⠀the⠀small⠀scene:⠀the⠀table⠀between⠀them,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀heater,⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀hand⠀rests⠀near⠀the⠀other⠀without⠀touching.⠀The⠀speculative⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀inside⠀the⠀comfort:⠀a⠀pill⠀bottle⠀with⠀a⠀handwritten⠀label,⠀a⠀favorite⠀rock⠀from⠀the⠀surface⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀pocket.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀quiet⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀in⠀progress,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀required⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀larger⠀speculative⠀condition⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀encounter.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀order:⠀the⠀ration⠀council's⠀new⠀ruling,⠀the⠀gene-edit⠀registry's⠀quarterly⠀audit,⠀the⠀terraforming⠀company's⠀decision⠀to⠀move⠀a⠀settlement⠀off⠀the⠀floodplain.⠀Then⠀narrow⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀where⠀two⠀former⠀teammates⠀meet.⠀Let⠀the⠀transition⠀be⠀deliberate⠀rather⠀than⠀abrupt,⠀with⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀links⠀the⠀institutional⠀fact⠀to⠀the⠀private⠀matter.\n\nUse⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀scene⠀social⠀weight.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀how⠀the⠀colony's⠀practices⠀shape⠀what⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀memorial⠀site,⠀or⠀a⠀supply⠀run⠀means⠀after⠀a⠀failed⠀expedition.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀formal⠀voice⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀spoken⠀language;⠀the⠀dialogue⠀should⠀stay⠀direct⠀and⠀Kishimoto-clear,⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀carries⠀the⠀fuller⠀judgment.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀social⠀observation⠀frame⠀the⠀encounter⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀private⠀feeling.\n\nLet⠀the⠀remembered⠀wound⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀composed⠀flash⠀or⠀a⠀sustained⠀passage⠀of⠀reflection,⠀not⠀a⠀single⠀quoted⠀line.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀recall⠀the⠀earlier⠀expedition,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀jammed,⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀leave⠀one⠀person⠀behind⠀the⠀airlock,⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀memory⠀colors⠀the⠀present⠀request⠀for⠀a⠀supply⠀run.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀must⠀remain⠀physical:⠀the⠀old⠀injury⠀still⠀hurts⠀in⠀low⠀pressure,⠀the⠀new⠀colony⠀doctor⠀has⠀flagged⠀one⠀person⠀for⠀a⠀genomic⠀review,⠀the⠀food⠀printer⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀make⠀the⠀meal⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀share.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀paragraph⠀that⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀social⠀context,⠀perhaps⠀a⠀record⠀of⠀who⠀left⠀the⠀meeting⠀first,⠀and⠀leaves⠀the⠀relationship's⠀future⠀genuinely⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀in⠀a⠀present,⠀science-fictional⠀situation⠀where⠀one⠀character⠀needs⠀something⠀from⠀another:⠀cooperation,⠀access,⠀a⠀changed⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀withheld⠀judgment.⠀Make⠀the⠀teller⠀choose⠀to⠀speak⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀stakes⠀require⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀a⠀story⠀is⠀expected.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀an⠀immediate⠀occasion—a⠀work⠀stoppage,⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀confinement,⠀a⠀repair—so⠀the⠀frame⠀exerts⠀pressure⠀on⠀both⠀teller⠀and⠀listener.\n\nThe⠀embedded⠀story⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀firsthand⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀encounter⠀with⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise.⠀Structure⠀it⠀around⠀a⠀specific⠀consequence⠀the⠀teller⠀learned⠀through⠀cost:⠀a⠀communication⠀method⠀that⠀failed⠀under⠀particular⠀conditions,⠀a⠀bodily⠀change⠀that⠀altered⠀a⠀promise,⠀an⠀institutional⠀rule⠀that⠀turned⠀a⠀routine⠀act⠀into⠀a⠀risk,⠀a⠀work⠀practice⠀that⠀divided⠀people⠀who⠀had⠀trusted⠀each⠀other.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller⠀stage⠀the⠀remembered⠀action⠀clearly,⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀movements,⠀exchanges,⠀and⠀choices⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀consequence⠀real.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀emphasize⠀what⠀supports⠀their⠀present⠀purpose,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀should⠀contain⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail—timing,⠀access,⠀sequence,⠀a⠀named⠀object⠀or⠀procedure—that⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀later⠀compare⠀it⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀world.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀become⠀a⠀technical⠀report.⠀Its⠀emotional⠀center⠀is⠀Kishimoto-style:⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀broken⠀promise,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀respect⠀or⠀betrayal⠀that⠀still⠀shapes⠀the⠀teller.⠀The⠀remembered⠀wound⠀should⠀be⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀listener⠀understands⠀why⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀acts⠀as⠀they⠀do.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀omit⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀to⠀admit;⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀question,⠀or⠀notice⠀a⠀gap.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀closes,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀listener⠀test⠀one⠀concrete⠀detail⠀against⠀present⠀evidence:⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀still⠀bears⠀the⠀same⠀fault,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀still⠀governs⠀the⠀room⠀they⠀occupy,⠀a⠀physical⠀trace⠀on⠀the⠀teller's⠀body,⠀a⠀procedure⠀they⠀can⠀now⠀watch.⠀The⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀should⠀shift⠀meaning⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀gained⠀information⠀about⠀its⠀origin.⠀The⠀telling⠀changes⠀the⠀listener's⠀practical⠀position—they⠀may⠀cooperate,⠀refuse,⠀renegotiate,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀warning—but⠀the⠀outcome⠀must⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀history⠀they⠀have⠀heard,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀moralizing⠀turn.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀produced⠀the⠀next⠀understanding⠀or⠀action⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀conflict,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀and⠀a⠀shared⠀practical⠀constraint⠀produced⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀change:⠀a⠀work⠀quota,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀schedule,⠀a⠀bodily⠀requirement,⠀a⠀housing⠀rule,⠀a⠀communication⠀limit,⠀or⠀an⠀economic⠀obligation.⠀Show⠀the⠀constraint⠀through⠀ordinary⠀activity—people⠀arriving,⠀working,⠀negotiating,⠀resting,⠀arguing—rather⠀than⠀through⠀exposition.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀characters⠀must⠀do,⠀cannot⠀do,⠀or⠀hope⠀to⠀change.\n\nFollow⠀one⠀focal⠀character⠀closely⠀enough⠀to⠀render⠀their⠀reasoning,⠀memory,⠀and⠀unspoken⠀feeling.⠀Give⠀that⠀character⠀a⠀concrete⠀present⠀aim⠀that⠀brings⠀them⠀into⠀conflict⠀or⠀cooperation⠀with⠀another⠀person:⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀position,⠀to⠀help⠀a⠀relative,⠀to⠀repair⠀a⠀relationship,⠀to⠀challenge⠀a⠀rule,⠀or⠀to⠀prove⠀a⠀capacity.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀enter⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀trigger—a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀familiar⠀failure,⠀an⠀old⠀obligation—and⠀let⠀it⠀alter⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀or⠀the⠀constraint.⠀The⠀wound⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀social⠀dimension:⠀it⠀came⠀from⠀an⠀institution,⠀a⠀family⠀expectation,⠀a⠀public⠀humiliation,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀change.\n\nStage⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀action⠀clearly.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀should⠀attempt⠀something⠀practical⠀under⠀pressure,⠀and⠀the⠀attempt⠀should⠀fail,⠀succeed⠀partially,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀encounter.⠀The⠀advance⠀must⠀be⠀developmental:⠀the⠀character⠀gains⠀a⠀usable⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀position,⠀the⠀constraint's⠀actual⠀cost,⠀or⠀their⠀own⠀capacity.⠀This⠀understanding⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence—a⠀revised⠀plan,⠀a⠀repaired⠀alliance,⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀with⠀new⠀information—not⠀a⠀general⠀speech⠀about⠀determination.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀precise⠀and⠀socially⠀observant.⠀Register⠀institutional⠀pressure⠀through⠀concrete⠀relationships⠀and⠀material⠀details:⠀a⠀supervisor's⠀phrasing,⠀a⠀queue,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀worn⠀tool,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀tight⠀staging⠀during⠀action,⠀plainer⠀retrospective⠀awareness⠀during⠀reflection.⠀Tension⠀can⠀live⠀in⠀a⠀withheld⠀question,⠀a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀changing⠀under⠀the⠀constraint.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀social⠀condition⠀itself;⠀the⠀scene⠀ends⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀understanding⠀or⠀position⠀has⠀shifted⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀step.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀present⠀conflict⠀between⠀an⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀living⠀inside⠀its⠀reach.⠀Make⠀the⠀authority⠀concrete⠀through⠀a⠀science-fictional⠀mechanism⠀the⠀protagonist⠀must⠀encounter⠀directly:⠀an⠀inherited⠀implant,⠀a⠀legacy⠀access⠀system,⠀a⠀closed⠀network,⠀a⠀prosthetic⠀line,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀contract,⠀or⠀a⠀sealed⠀archive.⠀The⠀mechanism⠀should⠀be⠀old⠀enough⠀to⠀carry⠀inherited⠀privilege⠀and⠀present⠀enough⠀to⠀have⠀daily⠀costs.⠀Show⠀it⠀in⠀operation—a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀for⠀some,⠀a⠀body⠀that⠀requires⠀upkeep,⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀decides⠀access—so⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀arises⠀from⠀material⠀inequality,⠀not⠀shadowy⠀decoration.\n\nGive⠀the⠀protagonist⠀a⠀specific⠀aim⠀that⠀brings⠀them⠀into⠀physical⠀contact⠀with⠀the⠀mechanism⠀and⠀into⠀conflict⠀with⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀represents⠀or⠀suffers⠀under⠀it.⠀Stage⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀clear⠀Kishimoto-style⠀action:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀attempts⠀to⠀operate,⠀repair,⠀bypass,⠀retrieve,⠀or⠀destroy⠀something,⠀and⠀the⠀attempt⠀meets⠀resistance⠀from⠀the⠀mechanism,⠀another⠀person,⠀or⠀both.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀surface⠀under⠀pressure—neglect,⠀betrayal,⠀duty,⠀resentment,⠀love—and⠀connect⠀that⠀wound⠀to⠀the⠀authority's⠀history.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀should⠀realize⠀that⠀the⠀mechanism⠀has⠀already⠀shaped⠀someone⠀they⠀care⠀about⠀or⠀someone⠀they⠀are⠀confronting.\n\nThe⠀breakthrough⠀must⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀relational⠀at⠀once.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀gains⠀a⠀usable⠀understanding⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀mechanism⠀works⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀a⠀particular⠀person,⠀and⠀this⠀understanding⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do⠀next:⠀they⠀know⠀which⠀access⠀to⠀request,⠀which⠀debt⠀to⠀refuse,⠀which⠀ally⠀to⠀trust,⠀or⠀which⠀risk⠀to⠀take.⠀Political⠀insight⠀should⠀come⠀through⠀this⠀specific⠀evidence,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀statement⠀about⠀power.\n\nUse⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀worn⠀gate,⠀a⠀server⠀room,⠀a⠀rooftop⠀maintenance⠀platform,⠀a⠀converted⠀clinic.⠀Let⠀the⠀environment⠀be⠀experienced⠀through⠀the⠀body—heat,⠀noise,⠀dust,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀device—and⠀let⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀encounter⠀feels⠀without⠀replacing⠀motive⠀or⠀explanation.⠀If⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀falls,⠀let⠀it⠀fall⠀under⠀narrative⠀pressure⠀or⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀private⠀feeling⠀visible:⠀fear,⠀relief,⠀anger,⠀desire.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampire⠀mechanics,⠀faction⠀jargon,⠀blood⠀rules,⠀or⠀Humanity⠀stats.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Set⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀community⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise:⠀a⠀settlement,⠀a⠀work⠀group,⠀an⠀extended⠀household,⠀a⠀neighborhood.⠀The⠀teller⠀is⠀a⠀participant⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀stake,⠀and⠀the⠀listeners⠀are⠀people⠀to⠀whom⠀the⠀story⠀belongs—younger⠀workers,⠀relatives,⠀newcomers,⠀or⠀displaced⠀neighbors.⠀The⠀occasion⠀should⠀be⠀one⠀where⠀memory⠀is⠀already⠀at⠀stake:⠀a⠀dispute⠀over⠀a⠀practice,⠀a⠀repair⠀session,⠀a⠀migration⠀decision,⠀a⠀night⠀shift,⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀after⠀a⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀community,⠀language,⠀region,⠀and⠀period⠀as⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀honor⠀code,⠀caste,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.\n\nThe⠀embedded⠀story⠀must⠀be⠀a⠀remembered⠀event⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀life,⠀not⠀a⠀myth⠀or⠀a⠀technical⠀manual.⠀It⠀should⠀explain⠀how⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀entered⠀the⠀community's⠀labor,⠀kinship,⠀or⠀possible⠀future⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀episode:⠀a⠀communication⠀practice⠀that⠀failed,⠀a⠀yield⠀that⠀changed⠀obligations,⠀a⠀body⠀modification⠀that⠀altered⠀a⠀promise,⠀an⠀institutional⠀rule⠀that⠀divided⠀neighbors.⠀Include⠀named⠀participants,⠀place-details,⠀repeated⠀phrases,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀emotional⠀stake.⠀Stage⠀the⠀remembered⠀action⠀with⠀Kishimoto-style⠀clarity:⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀loss,⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation⠀whose⠀memory⠀still⠀shapes⠀the⠀teller.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀questioned,⠀or⠀contradicted⠀by⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀remembers⠀differently.\n\nMake⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀carry⠀a⠀disputed⠀practical⠀lesson.⠀The⠀teller⠀wants⠀the⠀listeners⠀to⠀apply⠀the⠀memory⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀way—to⠀accept⠀a⠀constraint,⠀to⠀refuse⠀a⠀deal,⠀to⠀trust⠀a⠀person,⠀to⠀change⠀a⠀practice—but⠀the⠀listeners⠀may⠀draw⠀a⠀different⠀conclusion.⠀The⠀recurring⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀should⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀frame⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀present,⠀and⠀its⠀meaning⠀should⠀be⠀contested,⠀not⠀merely⠀repeated.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀closes,⠀let⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀produce⠀a⠀concrete⠀decision⠀or⠀change⠀in⠀relationship:⠀a⠀young⠀listener⠀understands⠀a⠀constraint,⠀the⠀teller⠀repairs⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀group⠀settles⠀on⠀a⠀next⠀step,⠀or⠀a⠀disagreement⠀becomes⠀a⠀workable⠀compromise.⠀The⠀advance⠀must⠀be⠀personal⠀and⠀practical,⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀memory⠀just⠀told.⠀The⠀telling⠀should⠀carry⠀warmth⠀and⠀gravity,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀moralizing⠀performance.⠀Keep⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀consequence⠀material⠀and⠀experienced,⠀and⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀memory⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀enough⠀to⠀open⠀the⠀next⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀with⠀modern⠀experimental⠀inward⠀fiction⠀as⠀the⠀route.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀immediate⠀experience—thought,⠀sensation,⠀memory,⠀attention—shapes⠀the⠀telling,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀must⠀retain⠀clear,⠀stageable⠀action.⠀Use⠀intimate⠀focalization⠀and⠀flexible⠀syntax:⠀short,⠀urgent⠀clauses⠀during⠀conflict;⠀longer,⠀associative⠀movement⠀during⠀reflection.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀action⠀with⠀introspection;⠀instead,⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀interiority⠀frame⠀how⠀an⠀event⠀is⠀perceived⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀matters.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀a⠀lived⠀bodily⠀and⠀perceptual⠀fact.⠀It⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀senses⠀and⠀routines:⠀an⠀implant⠀that⠀aches⠀or⠀warms,⠀a⠀code⠀of⠀conduct⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀policy⠀that⠀decides⠀who⠀may⠀travel,⠀a⠀child's⠀changed⠀bedtime,⠀a⠀smell⠀or⠀texture⠀that⠀signals⠀a⠀system's⠀state.⠀The⠀premise⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀explained⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀infodump;⠀it⠀should⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀affects⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀a⠀movement.\n\nStage⠀the⠀Kishimoto-style⠀action⠀with⠀precise⠀spatial⠀choreography:⠀a⠀chase,⠀a⠀confrontation,⠀a⠀handover,⠀a⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀tense⠀conversation.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound—a⠀broken⠀promise,⠀a⠀lost⠀friend,⠀a⠀humiliating⠀failure—surface⠀mid-action⠀and⠀alter⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀choice.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀interrupt⠀or⠀redirect⠀the⠀present⠀action,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.⠀The⠀advance⠀must⠀be⠀personal⠀and⠀practical:⠀a⠀new⠀technique⠀works⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀finally⠀understands⠀someone⠀or⠀something;⠀a⠀relationship⠀changes⠀because⠀a⠀hidden⠀fear⠀is⠀admitted;⠀a⠀plan⠀succeeds⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀detail⠀they⠀had⠀been⠀avoiding.\n\nUse⠀a⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀detail⠀that⠀recurs—a⠀smell,⠀a⠀light,⠀a⠀texture—and⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀shift⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀changes.⠀Omission⠀is⠀allowed:⠀an⠀unspoken⠀name⠀or⠀an⠀unexplained⠀event⠀can⠀stay⠀withheld⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀not⠀yet⠀articulate⠀it.⠀Direct⠀feeling⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀they⠀fit⠀the⠀character.⠀End⠀the⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀character's⠀understanding⠀or⠀decision⠀has⠀shifted⠀during⠀or⠀immediately⠀after⠀the⠀action,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀and⠀urban⠀fiction⠀mode.⠀The⠀narrator⠀follows⠀one⠀character⠀closely⠀enough⠀to⠀render⠀thought,⠀memory,⠀and⠀sensation⠀as⠀they⠀happen,⠀while⠀the⠀setting⠀remains⠀present⠀through⠀specific⠀streets,⠀buildings,⠀noise,⠀food,⠀and⠀work.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀be⠀embedded⠀in⠀that⠀place:⠀an⠀altered⠀water⠀system,⠀a⠀body⠀implant,⠀a⠀labor⠀practice,⠀a⠀communication⠀network.⠀It⠀affects⠀residents⠀unequally,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀this⠀from⠀daily⠀life,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀briefing.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀a⠀lived⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀city.⠀The⠀character⠀should⠀know⠀the⠀premise⠀through⠀a⠀wall⠀they⠀climbed,⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀work,⠀a⠀rumor⠀believed,⠀a⠀queue⠀they⠀joined,⠀a⠀device⠀they⠀repaired,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀they⠀inherited.⠀The⠀urban⠀material⠀conditions⠀should⠀shape⠀the⠀relationship⠀conflict:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀wants⠀something⠀from⠀another⠀person—recognition,⠀help,⠀an⠀explanation,⠀revenge,⠀or⠀changed⠀terms—and⠀that⠀want⠀is⠀entangled⠀with⠀the⠀unequal⠀access,⠀cost,⠀or⠀risk⠀the⠀premise⠀creates⠀in⠀this⠀specific⠀place.\n\nMake⠀the⠀conflict⠀Kishimoto-style:⠀a⠀clear,⠀stageable⠀action⠀sequence⠀or⠀confrontation⠀grounded⠀in⠀an⠀emotional⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀a⠀past⠀wound⠀enter⠀the⠀present:⠀a⠀memory⠀triggered⠀by⠀a⠀smell⠀or⠀a⠀touch,⠀a⠀word⠀that⠀echoes⠀an⠀old⠀argument,⠀or⠀the⠀sight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀object.⠀The⠀resulting⠀choice⠀must⠀be⠀the⠀character's⠀own,⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀cost⠀or⠀opening.⠀Build⠀toward⠀an⠀earned⠀breakthrough⠀where⠀the⠀protagonist⠀understands⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀position⠀within⠀the⠀city's⠀conditions⠀differently⠀enough⠀to⠀act—not⠀merely⠀a⠀general⠀insight⠀about⠀the⠀system.\n\nKeep⠀prose⠀intimate⠀but⠀active.⠀Use⠀short,⠀vivid⠀sentences⠀to⠀stage⠀movement⠀and⠀dialogue;⠀expand⠀into⠀associative⠀reflection⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀slows.⠀If⠀the⠀setting's⠀history⠀matters,⠀bring⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀lived⠀relation,⠀not⠀a⠀historical⠀summary.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀the⠀style⠀as⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀events.⠀The⠀speculative⠀element⠀stays⠀material⠀and⠀explainable⠀within⠀the⠀world.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀encounter⠀has⠀produced⠀the⠀next⠀concrete⠀state⠀or⠀decision,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀symbolic⠀tableau.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀scene⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place,⠀has⠀a⠀clear⠀want,⠀and⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀act⠀or⠀has⠀just⠀acted.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀physical⠀situation—a⠀corridor,⠀vehicle,⠀lab,⠀street,⠀maintenance⠀bay—and⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀pressure.⠀Introduce⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀in⠀this⠀moment:⠀a⠀device⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀recovered,⠀an⠀interface⠀that⠀blocks⠀action,⠀a⠀delivery⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀stakes.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀cold⠀briefing;⠀any⠀explanation⠀should⠀be⠀needed⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀immediate⠀decision.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀a⠀present,⠀physical⠀obstacle⠀or⠀opportunity.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀must⠀interact⠀with⠀it⠀directly:⠀they⠀try⠀to⠀open⠀a⠀locked⠀door,⠀operate⠀a⠀device,⠀intercept⠀a⠀delivery,⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀person⠀through⠀a⠀system.⠀The⠀element⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀tangible⠀cost⠀or⠀benefit⠀that⠀the⠀protagonist⠀can⠀feel⠀or⠀observe—a⠀body⠀bears⠀a⠀cost,⠀a⠀payment⠀is⠀due,⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀signal⠀fails.⠀Unfamiliar⠀names⠀or⠀mechanics⠀should⠀be⠀presented⠀clearly⠀when⠀the⠀protagonist⠀encounters⠀them,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀strong⠀visual⠀staging.⠀Separate⠀physical⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀reaction.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves,⠀make⠀spatial⠀transitions⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀from⠀door⠀to⠀panel,⠀from⠀ground⠀to⠀rooftop,⠀from⠀one⠀speaker⠀to⠀another.⠀Keep⠀Kishimoto-style⠀emotional⠀conflict⠀in⠀the⠀foreground:⠀the⠀protagonist⠀wants⠀something⠀from⠀a⠀rival,⠀friend,⠀family⠀member,⠀or⠀authority⠀figure,⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀or⠀unfinished⠀promise⠀changes⠀how⠀they⠀read⠀the⠀current⠀encounter.⠀Make⠀each⠀reaction⠀beat⠀carry⠀emotional⠀information⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀practical⠀options—a⠀hesitation⠀that⠀reveals⠀a⠀fear,⠀an⠀anger⠀that⠀sharpens⠀a⠀choice,⠀a⠀relief⠀that⠀opens⠀trust.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀wry,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀character⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀a⠀universal⠀witty⠀quip.\n\nMake⠀the⠀advance⠀personal⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀technique,⠀plan,⠀relationship,⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀moves⠀the⠀situation⠀forward⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀gains⠀a⠀usable⠀understanding⠀or⠀achieves⠀a⠀concrete⠀result.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀should⠀leave⠀a⠀tangible⠀trace⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀comedic⠀aside,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀action⠀has⠀reached⠀the⠀next⠀defined⠀state—a⠀vow,⠀a⠀handover,⠀a⠀chase⠀resumed,⠀a⠀question⠀answered—while⠀preserving⠀room⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀to⠀take⠀over⠀naturally.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀speculative⠀element⠀through⠀a⠀recurring⠀image⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀carries⠀into⠀action.⠀The⠀image⠀should⠀be⠀concrete,⠀drawn⠀from⠀the⠀premise—a⠀signal⠀pattern,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀rhythm,⠀an⠀altered⠀body's⠀warning⠀glow—and⠀it⠀should⠀change⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀character⠀acts⠀and⠀remembers.⠀In⠀the⠀first⠀use,⠀present⠀the⠀image⠀as⠀immediate⠀sensory⠀fact.⠀In⠀a⠀later⠀recurrence,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀gather⠀a⠀memory⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀into⠀itself;⠀the⠀lyricism⠀comes⠀from⠀that⠀gathering,⠀not⠀from⠀repeated⠀adjectives.⠀Keep⠀the⠀image⠀accurate⠀to⠀the⠀world's⠀rules:⠀if⠀the⠀glow⠀reports⠀pressure⠀loss,⠀it⠀can⠀remind⠀the⠀character⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀warning⠀without⠀the⠀prose⠀asserting⠀a⠀metaphor⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀earned.⠀Stage⠀action⠀in⠀clear⠀units:⠀who⠀moves,⠀what⠀changes,⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notices.⠀Between⠀units,⠀permit⠀a⠀short⠀associative⠀shift⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀image⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀with⠀a⠀sharp⠀sensory⠀clause⠀so⠀the⠀emotion⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀decoupled⠀from⠀the⠀deed.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀sentence⠀rise;⠀a⠀flat⠀statement⠀about⠀the⠀task⠀restores⠀contrast⠀and⠀lets⠀the⠀rhythmic⠀lines⠀matter.⠀Let⠀a⠀breakthrough⠀unfold⠀because⠀the⠀character⠀reinterprets⠀the⠀recurring⠀image⠀in⠀light⠀of⠀someone⠀else's⠀remembered⠀voice⠀or⠀gesture.⠀Show⠀that⠀reinterpretation⠀as⠀the⠀moment's⠀inward⠀change,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀be⠀practical⠀enough⠀to⠀reveal⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Use⠀plain⠀dialogue⠀where⠀partners⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀think⠀lyrically,⠀but⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀need⠀not⠀echo⠀the⠀same⠀figure.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀practical⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀grand⠀closing⠀metaphor⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀still⠀developing;⠀if⠀the⠀emotional⠀arc⠀resolves,⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀image⠀now⠀carrying⠀its⠀earned⠀new⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nAnchor⠀reflection⠀in⠀an⠀action⠀that⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀has⠀made⠀unavoidable.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀alteration:⠀a⠀route⠀they⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀take,⠀a⠀signal⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀receive,⠀a⠀precaution⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀automatic.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀memory⠀without⠀leaving⠀the⠀present⠀scene;⠀connect⠀the⠀memory⠀through⠀a⠀sensory⠀detail⠀shared⠀by⠀past⠀and⠀present.⠀When⠀the⠀present⠀interrupts,⠀make⠀the⠀interruption⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀task⠀or⠀from⠀another⠀character,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀arbitrary⠀mood⠀shift.⠀This⠀prevents⠀reflection⠀from⠀dissolving⠀the⠀conflict.⠀Use⠀remembered⠀speech⠀sparingly⠀and⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀current⠀encounter.⠀A⠀wound⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀narrated⠀as⠀permanent⠀damage;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀time⠀marker,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀the⠀recognition⠀that⠀something⠀once⠀possible⠀is⠀now⠀unavailable.⠀Let⠀a⠀rival's⠀or⠀partner's⠀present⠀action⠀force⠀a⠀rereading⠀of⠀that⠀past⠀moment.⠀The⠀rereading⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀adjusted⠀expectation⠀or⠀decision,⠀not⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀lesson.⠀Permit⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀survive:⠀a⠀working⠀meal,⠀a⠀familiar⠀seat,⠀a⠀voice⠀on⠀the⠀comm.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀order⠀lies⠀in⠀attending⠀to⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀changed⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀continues.⠀At⠀the⠀end,⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀loss;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀choice⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀reflection⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀character's⠀readiness,⠀leaving⠀consequence⠀to⠀the⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀definite⠀framed-oral⠀structure:⠀one⠀character⠀tells⠀another⠀about⠀an⠀event⠀that⠀has⠀already⠀happened.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀matter:⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀have⠀a⠀relationship,⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀speak⠀now,⠀and⠀different⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀event.⠀Open⠀the⠀frame⠀briefly⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀at⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀listener's⠀reaction⠀or⠀an⠀interruption⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀says⠀next.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀main⠀science-fictional⠀action⠀and⠀Kishimoto-style⠀conflict:⠀a⠀rivalry,⠀a⠀remembered⠀failure,⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀someone⠀else's⠀choice⠀changed⠀the⠀teller's⠀aim.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀affect⠀the⠀event's⠀practical⠀texture—how⠀the⠀teller⠀traveled,⠀what⠀they⠀monitored,⠀what⠀unsafe⠀route⠀was⠀closed—without⠀stopping⠀the⠀retelling⠀for⠀exposition.⠀Recurrence⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀teller⠀repeats⠀can⠀measure⠀an⠀approaching⠀danger⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀mistake.⠀Keep⠀that⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀true⠀to⠀the⠀world's⠀facts:⠀reports⠀of⠀a⠀failure⠀are⠀not⠀prophecies,⠀and⠀an⠀alarm's⠀meaning⠀cannot⠀shift⠀because⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀so.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀occasionally⠀press⠀for⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀challenge⠀a⠀motive.⠀Their⠀question⠀should⠀prompt⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀supply⠀the⠀actual⠀memory⠀and⠀perhaps⠀expose⠀a⠀wound⠀the⠀teller⠀had⠀not⠀named.⠀The⠀teller's⠀advance⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀completed⠀event⠀as⠀now⠀understood,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀brand-new⠀victory⠀inside⠀the⠀tale.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀frame's⠀next⠀action:⠀the⠀listener⠀takes⠀the⠀information⠀forward,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀stops⠀because⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀telling⠀is⠀complete.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀teller⠀all-knowing⠀or⠀ceremonial;⠀keep⠀the⠀account⠀personal⠀and⠀the⠀setting⠀local.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀exact⠀sensory⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀speculative⠀environment⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀explanation.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀affects⠀air,⠀equipment,⠀bodies,⠀or⠀schedules,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀result:⠀a⠀gauge's⠀slow⠀drift,⠀a⠀locked⠀door⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀open,⠀a⠀sleeve⠀rubbed⠀thin⠀where⠀the⠀harness⠀sits.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀background⠀paragraphs.⠀Stage⠀action⠀in⠀short⠀causal⠀units:⠀who⠀moves,⠀what⠀he⠀sees,⠀what⠀the⠀movement⠀costs.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀relationship⠀conflicts⠀appear⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀withheld⠀or⠀released⠀detail.⠀A⠀rival⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀tool⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀reach⠀it;⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀decision⠀to⠀take⠀it⠀or⠀return⠀it⠀says⠀more⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀thought.⠀But⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀purely⠀external.⠀When⠀the⠀moment's⠀inward⠀connection⠀matters,⠀write⠀one⠀direct⠀sentence,⠀or⠀two⠀if⠀the⠀thought⠀has⠀a⠀condition⠀and⠀a⠀consequence.⠀The⠀thought⠀should⠀lead⠀into⠀or⠀adjust⠀the⠀next⠀action,⠀not⠀restate⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀showed.⠀Let⠀memory⠀enter⠀as⠀a⠀precise⠀object⠀or⠀smell⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀choice.⠀A⠀remembered⠀warning⠀can⠀shorten⠀a⠀hesitation;⠀a⠀remembered⠀kindness⠀can⠀alter⠀a⠀refusal.⠀A⠀breakthrough⠀occurs⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀fact⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀acts⠀on⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀shows⠀that⠀notice⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀lines.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀keep⠀dialogue⠀short⠀but⠀individually⠀voiced.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀differently,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀expand⠀their⠀lines⠀into⠀monologue.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀just⠀before⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀closing⠀reflection⠀if⠀the⠀action⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanaqas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀within⠀a⠀working⠀scene⠀whose⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀is⠀already⠀operating.⠀Show⠀it⠀through⠀how⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀uses⠀space,⠀tools,⠀or⠀ot