ims⠀and⠀knowledge.⠀Technical⠀material⠀can⠀be⠀presented⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀decision:⠀the⠀reason⠀a⠀system⠀works⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀can⠀ask⠀for,⠀repair,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀Sustain⠀memory⠀and⠀reflection⠀where⠀they⠀belong.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀remember⠀earlier⠀urban⠀conditions—housing,⠀water,⠀migration,⠀work—and⠀compare⠀them⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀consequence.⠀This⠀comparison⠀should⠀be⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀experience,⠀not⠀supplied⠀as⠀a⠀standardized⠀regional⠀lament.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀concrete⠀social⠀or⠀domestic⠀moment;⠀the⠀story⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀folklore⠀or⠀withdraw⠀into⠀timelessness.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanasar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nemo⠀/⠀Manuscript⠀Voice⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀few⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀without⠀explanation⠀each⠀time.⠀A⠀changed⠀object,⠀a⠀different⠀time⠀shown⠀on⠀a⠀display,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀door⠀must⠀now⠀be⠀handled—these⠀can⠀make⠀the⠀world⠀alteration⠀concrete.⠀Use⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀a⠀detail⠀once⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀detail⠀changes⠀meaning⠀or⠀becomes⠀relevant⠀to⠀an⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀image⠀that⠀merely⠀repeats⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀already⠀made⠀clear.\n\nKeep⠀explanation⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀decision⠀or⠀experience.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀how⠀a⠀piece⠀works,⠀give⠀only⠀the⠀part⠀that⠀is⠀needed⠀to⠀act⠀or⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀just⠀happened.⠀A⠀longer⠀sentence⠀is⠀acceptable⠀if⠀it⠀holds⠀an⠀essential⠀inward⠀connection;⠀brevity⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀quota⠀measured⠀by⠀chopping⠀causal⠀reasoning.⠀But⠀avoid⠀general⠀commentary⠀about⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀unless⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀actually⠀responding⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Remembering⠀or⠀qualifying⠀a⠀comparison⠀is⠀allowed⠀when⠀the⠀old⠀detail⠀is⠀directly⠀connected⠀to⠀what⠀is⠀present.\n\nOmit⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀leaves⠀an⠀inference⠀available.⠀If⠀a⠀routine⠀has⠀changed,⠀the⠀spared⠀detail⠀might⠀be⠀recoverable⠀from⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀watches⠀or⠀waits.⠀Do⠀not⠀omit⠀necessary⠀causal⠀steps.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀understand⠀the⠀cause⠀be