may⠀make⠀a⠀familiar⠀ritual⠀difficult;⠀a⠀data⠀limit⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀saved⠀message⠀more⠀precious.⠀Describe⠀these⠀elements⠀as⠀the⠀characters⠀experience⠀them—a⠀mug⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀reheated,⠀a⠀drawer⠀that⠀locks⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment—rather⠀than⠀as⠀worldbuilding⠀asides.⠀Let⠀the⠀ending⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀comfortable⠀detail:⠀a⠀shared⠀silence,⠀a⠀successful⠀small⠀repair,⠀a⠀correctly⠀remembered⠀preference,⠀no⠀confession⠀or⠀grand⠀turn⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀connect⠀speech,⠀social⠀observation,⠀and⠀private⠀reasoning.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀frame⠀a⠀contested⠀exchange⠀through⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀institution,⠀or⠀the⠀historical⠀moment:⠀before⠀a⠀phrase⠀is⠀disputed,⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀notes⠀who⠀else⠀can⠀hear⠀it,⠀what⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀kept,⠀and⠀what⠀previous⠀use⠀the⠀word⠀has⠀had⠀in⠀this⠀community.\n\nMake⠀each⠀language⠀contest⠀a⠀full⠀dramatic⠀incident.⠀A⠀character⠀states⠀a⠀definition⠀in⠀careful,⠀official⠀terms;⠀another⠀supplies⠀an⠀etymology⠀or⠀precedent;⠀a⠀third⠀corrects⠀the⠀grammar⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀argument⠀as⠀disagreement⠀about⠀a⠀point.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀turns⠀of⠀speech,⠀even⠀when⠀narration⠀surrounds⠀them⠀with⠀judgment.⠀Let⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀be⠀quoted⠀in⠀full,⠀then⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀correction⠀alters⠀a⠀decision⠀document,⠀an⠀invitation⠀list,⠀or⠀a⠀right⠀of⠀passage.\n\nUse⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀formal⠀inquiry⠀may⠀give⠀one⠀version⠀of⠀an⠀event⠀while⠀a⠀later⠀private⠀conversation⠀shows⠀the⠀same⠀speaker⠀using⠀the⠀word⠀differently⠀with⠀someone⠀they⠀trust.⠀The⠀difference⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀deceit;⠀it⠀may⠀reflect⠀terror,⠀family⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀simply⠀the⠀different⠀costs⠀of⠀speaking⠀in⠀each⠀setting.⠀Keep⠀private⠀reflection⠀available⠀only⠀within⠀the⠀selected⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀and⠀its⠀knowledge.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀science-fictional⠀premise⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀specific⠀institutions⠀and⠀rituals⠀around⠀which⠀such⠀disputes⠀form:⠀a⠀council⠀hearing,⠀a⠀maintenance⠀certification,⠀a⠀