ter⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀world.⠀Its⠀full⠀meaning⠀should⠀arrive⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀later⠀understanding⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀listener's⠀response,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀authorial⠀explanation.⠀Never⠀treat⠀a⠀vividly⠀told⠀tale⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀its⠀own⠀accuracy.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀understood⠀since.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀telling⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀complete⠀investigation.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀supported⠀choice,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀postponed⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀warning⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀science-fiction⠀premise's⠀legibility:⠀each⠀nested⠀level⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀different⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀speculative⠀condition,⠀so⠀the⠀outer⠀participants⠀learn⠀how⠀the⠀change⠀operates⠀from⠀the⠀way⠀accounts⠀about⠀it⠀are⠀worded⠀and⠀contradicted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀a⠀present-tense⠀record⠀or⠀a⠀testimonial⠀comparison⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀narrator⠀moves⠀between⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀remembered⠀condition,⠀and⠀the⠀current⠀situation.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀must⠀appear⠀concretely⠀in⠀the⠀recorded⠀detail:⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀who⠀keeps⠀accounts,⠀how⠀workers⠀are⠀classified,⠀how⠀a⠀body⠀is⠀monitored,⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀record⠀preserves,⠀or⠀some⠀comparable⠀everyday⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀keep⠀explanation⠀in⠀a⠀separate⠀technical⠀paragraph.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀method⠀as⠀an⠀argumentative⠀recorder's⠀habit.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀revisits⠀an⠀earlier⠀wording,⠀have⠀them⠀correct⠀a⠀term⠀or⠀object⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀formulation,⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀correction⠀reveal⠀a⠀social⠀or⠀material⠀change.⠀Let⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀the⠀records⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀objection⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀will⠀state⠀next,⠀so⠀the⠀documentary⠀form⠀becomes⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀reconsideration⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀neutral⠀file.\n\nKeep⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀compare⠀an⠀old⠀account⠀with⠀later⠀information,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀retroactively⠀attribute⠀that⠀knowledge⠀to⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience.⠀Show⠀when⠀a⠀document⠀was⠀written,⠀by⠀whom,⠀and⠀under⠀what⠀institutional⠀pressure.⠀Different⠀sources⠀may⠀use⠀different⠀names⠀for⠀the⠀same⠀speculative⠀practice;⠀let⠀those⠀naming⠀differences⠀accumulate⠀into⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀what⠀has⠀changed.\n\nThe⠀closing⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀comparison.⠀A⠀supported⠀judgment,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀amend⠀a⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀accept⠀a⠀current⠀label⠀is⠀appropriate.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀explanatory⠀conclusion.⠀Let⠀the⠀documentary⠀voice⠀remain⠀complete⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀stops⠀before⠀an⠀open⠀question.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanataj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀old⠀authority⠀meets⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀decaying⠀institutional⠀building,⠀a⠀privatized⠀civic⠀function,⠀an⠀inherited⠀access⠀rule,⠀or⠀another⠀arrangement⠀with⠀visible⠀age⠀and⠀present⠀friction.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀technology⠀be⠀embedded⠀in⠀that⠀authority,⠀not⠀an⠀external⠀gadget.⠀Show⠀its⠀everyday⠀consequence⠀in⠀material⠀detail:⠀who⠀is⠀admitted,⠀what⠀bodies⠀are⠀tagged,⠀which⠀space⠀is⠀maintained,⠀which⠀record⠀must⠀be⠀renewed.\n\nMake⠀the⠀language⠀encounter⠀itself⠀the⠀action.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀rely⠀on⠀a⠀legal⠀definition,⠀a⠀technical⠀classification,⠀or⠀an⠀inherited⠀name.⠀Another⠀may⠀object,⠀demand⠀a⠀clarification,⠀or⠀revise⠀the⠀wording.⠀When⠀the⠀definition⠀changes,⠀the⠀practical⠀relation⠀changes:⠀permission,⠀treatment,⠀recorded⠀status,⠀or⠀obligation⠀shifts.⠀Keep⠀the⠀participants'⠀goals⠀and⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀Let⠀one⠀speaker⠀expose⠀a⠀self-serving⠀account⠀by⠀the⠀way⠀it⠀explains⠀too⠀much,⠀and⠀let⠀another⠀withhold⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀for⠀a⠀private⠀reason.\n\nMaintain⠀Gothic-Punk⠀intimacy⠀without⠀new⠀supernatural⠀rules.⠀Social⠀masks⠀can⠀fall⠀away⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company;⠀a⠀private⠀desire⠀may⠀motivate⠀a⠀correction⠀or⠀an⠀evasion.⠀The⠀narrator⠀can⠀reveal⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀thoughts⠀while⠀other⠀characters⠀remain⠀unaware⠀of⠀them.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀affects⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced:⠀a⠀corridor's⠀wear,⠀a⠀repaired⠀machine,⠀a⠀window⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀boarded⠀for⠀years⠀can⠀all⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀and⠀political⠀pressure.\n\nResolve⠀the⠀encounter⠀through⠀the⠀verbal⠀contest.⠀A⠀new⠀definition⠀may⠀take⠀effect,⠀a⠀protection⠀may⠀fail⠀convincingly,⠀or⠀one⠀party⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀accept⠀the⠀other's⠀terms.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀secret⠀power,⠀faction,⠀or⠀omnipotent⠀institution⠀to⠀close⠀a⠀gap.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀situation,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀broader⠀arrangement⠀remains⠀intact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Narrate⠀as⠀a⠀participant⠀whose⠀present⠀account⠀is⠀addressed⠀to⠀someone⠀and⠀exists⠀because⠀the⠀telling⠀must⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀understands.⠀Position⠀the⠀speculative⠀technology⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀work,⠀household,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀bodily⠀routine.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀exact⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀story;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀family,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀English⠀register.\n\nMake⠀the⠀narrator⠀argue⠀with⠀their⠀own⠀prior⠀wording.⠀When⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀label,⠀or⠀explanation⠀reappears,⠀correct⠀it⠀explicitly.⠀Once⠀they⠀called⠀a⠀job⠀\"secure\";⠀now⠀the⠀word⠀means⠀a⠀monitored⠀contract.⠀Once⠀they⠀described⠀an⠀implant⠀as⠀\"help\";⠀now⠀they⠀say⠀\"obligation.\"⠀Those⠀revisions⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀concrete⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀change:⠀altered⠀employment,⠀communication,⠀care,⠀migration,⠀or⠀expectation.⠀A⠀listener's⠀objection⠀may⠀force⠀the⠀next⠀correction.\n\nDo⠀not⠀write⠀the⠀autobiography⠀as⠀a⠀complete⠀private⠀mind.⠀This⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀testimony,⠀selected⠀and⠀ordered⠀for⠀the⠀occasion.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀withhold⠀something⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀reason,⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀motive⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀recognize⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀remembered⠀knowledge⠀and⠀present⠀understanding:⠀do⠀not⠀place⠀a⠀later⠀realization⠀into⠀the⠀earlier⠀episode.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀account⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀change.⠀The⠀speaker⠀may⠀decide⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀record,⠀warn⠀a⠀sibling,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀refuse⠀a⠀current⠀label.⠀Reuse⠀a⠀concrete⠀item—a⠀passbook,⠀a⠀water⠀roster,⠀a⠀repaired⠀radio,⠀a⠀gate⠀receipt—so⠀its⠀meaning⠀accrues⠀across⠀the⠀account.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀single⠀explanatory⠀conclusion⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀investigation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀short⠀observations,⠀notices,⠀or⠀remembered⠀fragments⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀continuous⠀scene.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀appear⠀inside⠀an⠀ordinary⠀routine:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀checking⠀a⠀notice,⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀station,⠀sorting⠀an⠀inbox,⠀reaching⠀for⠀an⠀object,⠀watching⠀the⠀weather.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequence⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀must⠀now⠀do⠀differently,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀separate⠀explanatory⠀passage.\n\nTreat⠀each⠀observation⠀as⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀verbal⠀reconsideration.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀write,⠀\"Today⠀I⠀called⠀it⠀X⠀again,⠀though⠀that⠀stopped⠀being⠀accurate,\"⠀then⠀supply⠀the⠀corrected⠀term⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀reveals.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object—a⠀chime,⠀a⠀leaf⠀pressing⠀against⠀a⠀screen,⠀a⠀reusable⠀tag,⠀a⠀printout—may⠀recur⠀and⠀shift⠀meaning⠀over⠀the⠀entries.⠀The⠀mood⠀may⠀be⠀direct,⠀uncertain,⠀tender,⠀or⠀faintly⠀comic,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀this⠀narrator's⠀own⠀voice.\n\nKeep⠀memory⠀and⠀later⠀knowledge⠀distinct.⠀When⠀an⠀entry⠀mentions⠀an⠀earlier⠀time,⠀allow⠀the⠀remembered⠀person⠀to⠀have⠀known⠀only⠀what⠀was⠀then⠀possible.⠀The⠀present⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀inconsistency⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀old⠀wording⠀and⠀correct⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀entry;⠀that⠀correction⠀is⠀an⠀active⠀piece⠀of⠀reflection,⠀not⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀condition⠀has⠀been⠀solved.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀an⠀observation⠀or⠀correction⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀present⠀routine.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀decide⠀to⠀stop⠀using⠀an⠀old⠀word,⠀begin⠀a⠀new⠀record,⠀or⠀leave⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀day⠀unmonitored.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀full⠀event⠀plot,⠀confession,⠀or⠀closing⠀judgment.⠀The⠀miscellany⠀should⠀remain⠀complete⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀set⠀of⠀reflections.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀social-realist⠀chronicle-and-testimony⠀route.⠀Write⠀as⠀a⠀narrator⠀recording⠀a⠀present⠀condition⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀community,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀public⠀service⠀after⠀a⠀speculative⠀development⠀has⠀started⠀to⠀alter⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀record⠀grounded⠀in⠀observable⠀practice:⠀changed⠀work⠀shifts,⠀water⠀or⠀power⠀schedules,⠀reclassified⠀tenants,⠀altered⠀messaging⠀habits,⠀new⠀documents⠀at⠀a⠀checkpoint,⠀or⠀a⠀modified⠀public⠀notice.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀setting;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀generic⠀rural⠀or⠀urban⠀Latin⠀American⠀template.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chronicle⠀itself⠀as⠀a⠀contest⠀over⠀wording.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀records⠀an⠀official⠀term,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀description,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀newspaper⠀phrase,⠀have⠀them⠀stop⠀and⠀object⠀or⠀correct⠀it.⠀One⠀speaker⠀may⠀call⠀a⠀monitored⠀water⠀ration⠀\"efficiency\"⠀while⠀another⠀calls⠀it⠀\"debt.\"⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀summary⠀of⠀an⠀event⠀and⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀replacement⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀conclude.⠀Let⠀different⠀voices⠀in⠀the⠀chronicle⠀use⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits:⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀overlegislate,⠀a⠀worker⠀may⠀evade,⠀a⠀younger⠀resident⠀may⠀borrow⠀the⠀new⠀technology's⠀own⠀slogans.\n\nKeep⠀documented⠀report⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀opinion⠀or⠀an⠀uncertainty,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀grant⠀themselves⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀hidden⠀minds⠀of⠀everyone⠀mentioned.⠀Where⠀another⠀person's⠀motive⠀is⠀unknown,⠀say⠀it⠀is⠀unknown⠀or⠀allow⠀a⠀later⠀account⠀to⠀supply⠀it.⠀A⠀composed⠀testimony⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀narrator's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.\n\nConclusion⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀accumulated⠀detail.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀decide⠀to⠀file⠀an⠀objection,⠀correct⠀a⠀public⠀record,⠀join⠀a⠀protest,⠀or⠀simply⠀stop⠀recording⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀day.⠀Reuse⠀a⠀concrete⠀item—a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀roster,⠀a⠀repaired⠀lock,⠀a⠀broadcasting⠀notice—so⠀its⠀meaning⠀grows⠀through⠀the⠀text.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀full⠀narrative⠀resolution⠀or⠀an⠀explanatory⠀ending⠀outside⠀the⠀narrator's⠀knowledge.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀present⠀situation⠀where⠀the⠀speculative⠀technology⠀has⠀an⠀immediate⠀practical⠀stake.⠀Show⠀the⠀space⠀clearly⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀sentences:⠀who⠀is⠀near⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀console,⠀a⠀queue,⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀object,⠀and⠀what⠀direction⠀their⠀attention⠀moves.⠀Make⠀the⠀technology⠀itself⠀concrete⠀enough⠀for⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀reader⠀to⠀follow⠀a⠀relevant⠀rule,⠀label,⠀or⠀display.\n\nDrive⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀verbal⠀contest⠀about⠀a⠀term.⠀One⠀character⠀states⠀a⠀definition,⠀another⠀objects,⠀and⠀the⠀exchange⠀moves⠀from⠀wording⠀to⠀consequence.⠀Each⠀correction⠀should⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀can⠀now⠀do⠀or⠀claim:⠀a⠀permitted⠀action,⠀a⠀recorded⠀status,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀payment,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation⠀changes.⠀Use⠀short⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀the⠀dialogue⠀so⠀physical⠀movements⠀and⠀focused⠀reactions⠀remain⠀scannable.⠀Let⠀different⠀speakers⠀have⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habits⠀rather⠀than⠀all⠀sounding⠀alike.\n\nShow⠀reaction⠀beats⠀as⠀private⠀experience.⠀After⠀a⠀damaging⠀line,⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀reason,⠀feel⠀exposed,⠀notice⠀a⠀changed⠀position,⠀or⠀choose⠀silence.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀private⠀reaction⠀while⠀the⠀interlocutor⠀does⠀not⠀know⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀immediate⠀reply⠀to⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀verbally⠀perfect.⠀Let⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀ordinary⠀missteps⠀occur⠀as⠀needed.\n\nClose⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀shift.⠀The⠀corrected⠀term⠀may⠀take⠀effect,⠀one⠀character⠀may⠀leave⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀plan,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀exchange⠀while⠀it⠀is⠀still⠀continuing.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀completed⠀task.⠀The⠀scene⠀is⠀finished⠀when⠀the⠀verbal⠀contest⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀situation;⠀a⠀later⠀continuation⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀next⠀turn.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀speculative⠀term⠀or⠀practice⠀become⠀an⠀object⠀of⠀lyric⠀attention,⠀with⠀repeated⠀sounds,⠀clause⠀shapes,⠀and⠀unfolding⠀images⠀carrying⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀its⠀definition⠀does⠀to⠀those⠀who⠀live⠀under⠀it.⠀A⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀is⠀an⠀event⠀that⠀can⠀alter⠀bodies,⠀permissions,⠀work,⠀or⠀possible⠀futures,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀register⠀that⠀consequence⠀through⠀rhythm⠀and⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀through⠀debate⠀summary.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀how⠀a⠀speaker⠀reaches⠀for⠀a⠀word,⠀corrects⠀it,⠀or⠀turns⠀it⠀against⠀another.⠀The⠀same⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀after⠀a⠀later⠀fact,⠀and⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀can⠀interrupt⠀a⠀patterned⠀passage⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀changed⠀condition.⠀Keep⠀figurative⠀language⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations;⠀the⠀lyric⠀surface⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise,⠀not⠀decorate⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀style⠀make⠀an⠀errand⠀or⠀ordinary⠀maintenance⠀feel⠀like⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀wider⠀possible⠀future⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀exchange⠀solemn.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀perspective,⠀and⠀world⠀facts⠀while⠀sustaining⠀lyric⠀development.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀follow⠀an⠀associative⠀inward⠀turn⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀it⠀remains⠀causally⠀connected⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀encounter.⠀Length⠀and⠀recurrence⠀serve⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀experience;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀fixed⠀thought-to-dialogue⠀ratio⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀witty⠀reversal⠀at⠀every⠀difficulty.⠀A⠀verbal⠀distinction⠀may⠀be⠀left⠀to⠀change⠀an⠀institution⠀slowly,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀that⠀consequence⠀remains⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nUse⠀reflection⠀to⠀trace⠀how⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀alters⠀what⠀familiar⠀things⠀mean⠀over⠀time,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀force⠀a⠀character⠀to⠀confront⠀that⠀alteration⠀before⠀it⠀settles⠀into⠀memory.⠀The⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀may⠀coexist,⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker's⠀self-correction⠀revealing⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀unavailable⠀or⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀described⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀terms.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀and⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀to⠀remain⠀present⠀beside⠀loss.⠀A⠀recurring⠀detail⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀significance⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀changed⠀premise,⠀not⠀imposed⠀as⠀a⠀symbol⠀of⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀reflective⠀mode⠀can⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change,⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀now⠀carrying⠀a⠀different⠀consequence,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀encounter⠀into⠀an⠀announcement⠀that⠀everything⠀will⠀pass.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀reflection⠀erase⠀the⠀practical⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀world.⠀A⠀remembered⠀definition⠀can⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀now,⠀and⠀a⠀revised⠀wording⠀can⠀open⠀a⠀future⠀rather⠀than⠀only⠀seal⠀a⠀past.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀particular⠀recollection⠀or⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanataq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀situated⠀storyteller,⠀listener,⠀or⠀frame⠀that⠀makes⠀definition⠀and⠀revised⠀wording⠀an⠀audience-aware⠀performance.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀term,⠀object⠀to⠀an⠀account,⠀or⠀turn⠀a⠀phrase⠀back⠀on⠀a⠀listener,⠀and⠀that⠀move⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀while⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀gives⠀the⠀dispute⠀practical⠀consequences⠀in⠀their⠀world.⠀Keep⠀the⠀frame⠀present⠀enough⠀to⠀explain⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀speak⠀and⠀what⠀version⠀is⠀being⠀offered.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀texture⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀change:⠀the⠀altered⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀new⠀constraint⠀on⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀practice⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀current⠀conditions.⠀Reflection⠀may⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀associations,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀framed⠀telling⠀rather⠀than⠀detached⠀lyric⠀meditation.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀unfold⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀revised,⠀or⠀challenged,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀speaker⠀reinterpret⠀an⠀earlier⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀consequence.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀particular⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament,⠀mysticism,⠀or⠀honor⠀code.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀closing,⠀another⠀listener⠀taking⠀up⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀matter⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀should⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀narrated⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀require⠀a⠀separate⠀exposition.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀details⠀and⠀use⠀direct⠀clauses⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀or⠀corrected⠀phrase⠀becomes⠀the⠀event⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀speculative⠀situation.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀adjust⠀one⠀word⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀in⠀a⠀small,⠀exact⠀action:⠀a⠀revised⠀permission,⠀a⠀changed⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀reclassified⠀object.⠀Keep⠀the⠀explanation⠀or⠀inward⠀connection⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀verbal⠀pressure⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀described⠀at⠀length.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀qualification⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀unreliable⠀account,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀important⠀causal⠀change⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀details.⠀Economy⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀deleting⠀causality;⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀must⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀through⠀what⠀speakers⠀accept,⠀reject,⠀or⠀correct.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀be⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀preserve⠀the⠀style⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀An⠀exact⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀crucial⠀revision⠀if⠀it⠀serves⠀the⠀inference.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀business,⠀a⠀resumed⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀plan⠀simply⠀to⠀close⠀the⠀reply;⠀the⠀selected⠀moment⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀the⠀verbal⠀shift⠀has⠀altered⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀character's⠀understanding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀speculative⠀change⠀is⠀encountered⠀through⠀ordinary⠀interaction,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀occur⠀within⠀natural⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀show⠀its⠀consequence⠀for⠀work,⠀bodies,⠀communication,⠀or⠀possible⠀futures⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀separate⠀explanation.⠀Give⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀distinct⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀stake⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀encounter⠀remains⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀character.\n\nMove⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀thought,⠀and⠀memory⠀as⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀requires,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀minor⠀character⠀a⠀hyperverbal⠀philosopher.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀term,⠀reconsider⠀a⠀phrase,⠀or⠀turn⠀an⠀account⠀against⠀another,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀interiority⠀should⠀allow⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀understand⠀what⠀that⠀move⠀costs⠀or⠀opens.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀practical⠀enough⠀to⠀affect⠀the⠀world,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀technical⠀exposition⠀into⠀every⠀exchange.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀should⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀naturally,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀when⠀a⠀scene⠀reaches⠀an⠀appropriate⠀pause⠀rather⠀than⠀when⠀a⠀thematic⠀beat⠀completes.⠀There⠀is⠀no⠀need⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀confession,⠀or⠀final⠀reinterpretation;⠀a⠀phrase⠀left⠀contested⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀consequential⠀as⠀one⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀to⠀create⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀definition,⠀objection,⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀revised⠀wording⠀becomes⠀the⠀specific⠀way⠀these⠀characters⠀show⠀affection,⠀rivalry,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀repair.⠀The⠀speculative⠀change⠀should⠀create⠀a⠀new⠀term,⠀permission,⠀or⠀practice⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀must⠀absorb.⠀Let⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀return⠀with⠀consequences⠀that⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀premise⠀rather⠀than⠀dropping⠀in⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀for⠀their⠀relationship⠀charge.⠀A⠀callback⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀once⠀meant⠀one⠀thing⠀and⠀now⠀means⠀another⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀speculative⠀development.⠀Keep⠀the⠀verbal⠀contests⠀personal:⠀one⠀speaker⠀may⠀correct⠀the⠀other's⠀self-description,⠀reclassify⠀an⠀act,⠀or⠀expose⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀account,⠀and⠀that⠀move⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀to⠀each⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀difficulty⠀a⠀competition⠀or⠀every⠀pause⠀a⠀confession.\n\nKeep⠀access⠀and⠀knowledge⠀distinct;⠀one⠀partner's⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀transfer⠀to⠀the⠀other.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀include⠀both⠀visible⠀and⠀authorized⠀interiority,⠀but⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀perspective.⠀The⠀speculative⠀world⠀remains⠀a⠀real⠀constraint⠀on⠀the⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀backdrop.⠀Let⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀with⠀affection,⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀matter⠀still⠀open⠀if⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀romantic⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nCompose⠀the⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀retelling⠀shaped⠀by⠀compact⠀declarations,⠀recurring⠀phrasing,⠀and⠀the⠀relation⠀of⠀a⠀speculative⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Use⠀deliberate⠀openings⠀to⠀state⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀deed,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀the⠀premise's⠀consequences⠀be⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle:⠀an⠀invention,⠀a⠀changed⠀institution,⠀a⠀public⠀choice,⠀or⠀the⠀record⠀of⠀what⠀a⠀correction⠀made⠀possible.\n\nLet⠀an⠀objection⠀or⠀revised⠀account⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀participant⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀deny⠀a⠀quoted⠀phrase,⠀or⠀reinterpret⠀a⠀familiar⠀declaration,⠀and⠀that⠀move⠀changes⠀the⠀story's⠀meaning⠀for⠀its⠀listeners⠀or⠀reader.⠀The⠀unreliable⠀account⠀may⠀expose⠀itself⠀in⠀the⠀act⠀of⠀explaining,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective;⠀shared⠀reputation⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀private⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀certain⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀deed⠀felt⠀that⠀way.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Keep⠀the⠀particular⠀tradition⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀every⠀epic⠀convention⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀spectacle⠀where⠀the⠀style⠀would⠀carry⠀a⠀compact⠀line.⠀The⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀should⠀remain⠀intelligible⠀through⠀the⠀deeds⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀produce.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀deed⠀concluded⠀or⠀left⠀to⠀be⠀remembered,⠀without⠀pronouncing⠀its⠀final⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀institutional⠀scene.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀everyday⠀civic⠀life:⠀a⠀new⠀category⠀of⠀person,⠀a⠀revised⠀benefit,⠀a⠀redefined⠀obligation,⠀a⠀changed⠀medical⠀or⠀work⠀status.⠀The⠀scene⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀ordinary⠀institution—a⠀municipal⠀office,⠀a⠀housing⠀association,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀clinic,⠀a⠀school,⠀a⠀family⠀meeting⠀about⠀a⠀public⠀entitlement—and⠀the⠀characters⠀encounter⠀the⠀speculative⠀feature⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀language⠀of⠀that⠀institution.⠀Keep⠀the⠀setting,⠀names,⠀and⠀institutional⠀details⠀specific⠀to⠀a⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish⠀context⠀when⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀automatic⠀atmosphere.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀verbal⠀negotiation⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀speculative⠀feature⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀claim,⠀register,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀postpone.⠀One⠀character⠀proposes⠀a⠀definition;⠀another⠀objects⠀that⠀it⠀covers⠀the⠀wrong⠀case;⠀a⠀third⠀corrects⠀a⠀phrase⠀and⠀thereby⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀requested.⠀Let⠀the⠀revision⠀of⠀wording⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀consequence.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀already⠀know⠀what⠀a⠀rule⠀means,⠀and⠀the⠀conflict⠀is⠀over⠀its⠀application,⠀its⠀exceptions,⠀or⠀the⠀words⠀used⠀to⠀describe⠀the⠀present⠀situation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speakers⠀distinct⠀in⠀verbal⠀habit⠀and⠀command⠀of⠀institutional⠀vocabulary.⠀A⠀careful⠀applicant,⠀an⠀impatient⠀official,⠀and⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀trying⠀to⠀frame⠀a⠀request⠀should⠀not⠀sound⠀alike.\n\nUse⠀ordinary⠀interiority⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀speculative⠀feature⠀affects⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀even⠀when⠀they⠀cannot⠀say⠀so⠀directly.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀observe⠀what⠀someone⠀notices⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀what⠀they⠀remember⠀about⠀a⠀similar⠀previous⠀meeting,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀phrase⠀as⠀concern.⠀A⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀correction,⠀or⠀an⠀over-literal⠀reply⠀can⠀expose⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀intent⠀without⠀a⠀public⠀confession.⠀Keep⠀that⠀access⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀ownership;⠀another⠀participant⠀does⠀not⠀learn⠀the⠀private⠀observation⠀unless⠀the⠀speaker⠀or⠀the⠀scene⠀discloses⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀feature⠀operate⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀mystery⠀box.⠀If⠀a⠀rule,⠀device,⠀state,⠀or⠀practice⠀affects⠀bodies,⠀memory,⠀labor,⠀debt,⠀or⠀communication,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀makes⠀this⠀meeting's⠀claims⠀plausible⠀or⠀fragile.⠀A⠀misunderstanding⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀an⠀actual⠀ambiguity⠀in⠀the⠀rule,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀character⠀misunderstanding⠀a⠀trivial⠀word.⠀When⠀an⠀agreement⠀is⠀reached,⠀let⠀it⠀create⠀mundane⠀consequences⠀for⠀the⠀person's⠀next⠀task,⠀journey,⠀or⠀obligation.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀understanding,⠀a⠀preserved⠀disagreement,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀routine⠀that⠀now⠀takes⠀on⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀realism⠀can⠀be⠀comic⠀or⠀dark,⠀but⠀it⠀works⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀speculative⠀social⠀consequence⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀quotidian⠀encounter.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanataw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀screenplay⠀scene⠀with⠀readable⠀action⠀lines,⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀where⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Use⠀only⠀filmable⠀or⠀recordable⠀business:⠀movement,⠀gaze,⠀handling⠀an⠀object,⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀phone⠀display,⠀a⠀public⠀screen,⠀or⠀an⠀audible⠀event.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise,⠀one⠀clear⠀beat⠀or⠀conjunction⠀per⠀block.⠀Do⠀not⠀clutter⠀them⠀with⠀camera⠀commands⠀or⠀directions⠀to⠀cut⠀unless⠀a⠀transition⠀is⠀necessary.⠀A⠀change⠀of⠀location⠀or⠀a⠀meaningful⠀lapse⠀can⠀begin⠀a⠀new⠀scene⠀with⠀a⠀heading⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀necessary⠀spatial⠀or⠀temporal⠀fact.\n\nMake⠀the⠀scene's⠀conflict⠀a⠀verbal⠀contest⠀whose⠀outcome⠀depends⠀on⠀wording.⠀One⠀character⠀proposes⠀a⠀definition;⠀another⠀rejects⠀it⠀by⠀refining⠀the⠀term;⠀a⠀third⠀repeats⠀the⠀original⠀words⠀in⠀a⠀narrower⠀context.⠀The⠀speculative⠀feature⠀is⠀the⠀actual⠀instrument⠀of⠀that⠀contest:⠀a⠀rule⠀about⠀changed⠀memory,⠀a⠀legal⠀status⠀for⠀an⠀artificial⠀person,⠀a⠀permitted⠀mode⠀of⠀communication,⠀a⠀device⠀whose⠀measurements⠀are⠀being⠀contested.⠀The⠀facts⠀do⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀be⠀mysterious;⠀the⠀conflict⠀is⠀over⠀how⠀the⠀rule⠀names⠀the⠀present⠀situation.⠀The⠀actors⠀speak⠀from⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀interests⠀and⠀knowledge,⠀not⠀as⠀interchangeable⠀speakers⠀of⠀theme.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀private⠀material⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀that⠀are⠀not⠀audible⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀notes⠀register⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀intends⠀to⠀avoid⠀saying,⠀which⠀word⠀they⠀nearly⠀used,⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀previous⠀scene⠀led⠀them⠀to⠀believe.⠀Do⠀not⠀put⠀these⠀notes⠀into⠀the⠀dialogue⠀as⠀a⠀whispered⠀aside⠀or⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀supplies⠀a⠀legitimate⠀in-scene⠀audience⠀for⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀notes⠀ordinary⠀prose;⠀they⠀reveal⠀a⠀perspective⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀later⠀dialogue⠀redundant.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀detail⠀filmable⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀relevant.⠀If⠀a⠀display⠀changes⠀a⠀number,⠀the⠀change⠀is⠀an⠀action;⠀if⠀a⠀rule⠀says⠀a⠀person⠀cannot⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀blocking⠀must⠀reflect⠀that⠀rule.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀has⠀visible⠀consequences,⠀write⠀them⠀as⠀observable⠀consequences⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀someone⠀merely⠀claiming⠀them.⠀A⠀dispute⠀can⠀reach⠀a⠀clear⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀term⠀is⠀accepted,⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀refused⠀in⠀its⠀new⠀wording,⠀a⠀document⠀is⠀signed,⠀or⠀someone⠀walks⠀out.⠀Avoid⠀an⠀obligatory⠀admission⠀or⠀an⠀exposition⠀dump.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀hold⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀the⠀image:⠀a⠀closed⠀folder,⠀a⠀repeated⠀question,⠀a⠀permission⠀granted,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀left⠀alone⠀with⠀the⠀revised⠀form.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀or⠀may⠀start⠀after⠀the⠀intervening⠀steps⠀have⠀been⠀compressed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀a⠀director⠀or⠀reader⠀can⠀stage.⠀Make⠀every⠀line⠀speakable⠀and⠀every⠀movement⠀performable.⠀Use⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀establish⠀necessary⠀physical⠀conditions:⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀whom,⠀whether⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀open⠀or⠀closed,⠀whether⠀a⠀chair⠀or⠀a⠀document⠀is⠀on⠀stage.⠀Do⠀not⠀include⠀camera⠀angles⠀or⠀invisible⠀film⠀effects.⠀If⠀a⠀speculative⠀device⠀has⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀operation,⠀keep⠀it⠀within⠀what⠀a⠀stage⠀production⠀can⠀actually⠀show⠀or⠀suggest.\n\nLet⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀alter⠀the⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀producing⠀a⠀lecture.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀newly⠀official⠀term,⠀refuse⠀to⠀use⠀it,⠀define⠀it⠀differently,⠀or⠀correct⠀someone's⠀usage⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀request⠀being⠀made.⠀A⠀definition⠀proposed⠀by⠀one⠀speaker⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀obstacle⠀for⠀the⠀next,⠀and⠀a⠀subtle⠀change⠀in⠀wording⠀can⠀reveal⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀protect.⠀Keep⠀the⠀speech⠀individual.⠀A⠀tired⠀clerk⠀may⠀fall⠀back⠀on⠀memorized⠀forms;⠀an⠀anxious⠀applicant⠀may⠀over-explain;⠀a⠀third⠀person⠀may⠀test⠀the⠀terms⠀to⠀discover⠀whether⠀a⠀benefit⠀actually⠀applies.⠀The⠀characters'⠀differing⠀command⠀of⠀the⠀speculative⠀vocabulary⠀drives⠀the⠀play⠀rather⠀than⠀everyone⠀trading⠀identical⠀polished⠀aphorisms.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀thought⠀off⠀the⠀public⠀stage⠀unless⠀the⠀scene's⠀dramatic⠀technique⠀gives⠀it⠀an⠀audience.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀should⠀be⠀reserved⠀for⠀a⠀clear⠀theatrical⠀purpose,⠀not⠀used⠀as⠀a⠀wrapper⠀for⠀every⠀ordinary⠀thought.⠀Write⠀the⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀separate⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀action,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀if⠀another⠀character⠀could⠀hear⠀it.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀privately⠀suspects⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀a⠀picked-up⠀object,⠀a⠀long⠀pause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀careful⠀restatement,⠀but⠀the⠀audience⠀and⠀other⠀characters⠀must⠀remain⠀within⠀legitimate⠀stage⠀knowledge.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀speculative⠀consequence⠀affects⠀the⠀body⠀or⠀the⠀world,⠀make⠀it⠀stageable⠀and⠀relevant.⠀If⠀a⠀rule⠀says⠀a⠀term⠀is⠀forbidden,⠀a⠀character's⠀decision⠀to⠀pause⠀before⠀using⠀it⠀is⠀an⠀action.⠀If⠀a⠀currency⠀or⠀permit⠀changes⠀value,⠀the⠀object⠀passed⠀across⠀the⠀stage⠀carries⠀the⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀play⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀narrator⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀whole⠀system;⠀let⠀one⠀operational⠀fact⠀be⠀applied.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀an⠀arrangement⠀is⠀made,⠀a⠀definition⠀is⠀rejected,⠀a⠀person⠀exits⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀intention,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀leaves⠀the⠀audience⠀with⠀the⠀new⠀term⠀still⠀hanging⠀in⠀the⠀air.⠀No⠀character⠀is⠀obliged⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀final⠀moral⠀or⠀settle⠀the⠀speculative⠀issue;⠀the⠀clash⠀of⠀wording⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀completed⠀event.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀by⠀association:⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀bodily⠀trace,⠀an⠀item⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀remembered⠀sentence,⠀a⠀speculative⠀rule⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀escaped.⠀Keep⠀the⠀flow⠀close⠀enough⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀place⠀what⠀is⠀happening,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀feared⠀or⠀imagined.⠀When⠀the⠀mind⠀revisits⠀a⠀word,⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀form,⠀or⠀an⠀official⠀phrase,⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀be⠀caused⠀by⠀the⠀current⠀moment⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀a⠀general⠀thematic⠀need.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀every⠀object⠀evoke⠀a⠀long⠀childhood⠀memory;⠀ordinary⠀attention⠀can⠀supply⠀the⠀material.\n\nMake⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀that⠀shifts⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀renames⠀it.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀call⠀a⠀practice⠀by⠀one⠀term,⠀correct⠀it⠀because⠀the⠀correction⠀matters⠀legally⠀or⠀personally,⠀then⠀reject⠀the⠀corrected⠀term⠀because⠀it⠀implies⠀an⠀obligation⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀want.⠀These⠀verbal⠀revisions⠀carry⠀forward⠀the⠀scenario's⠀central⠀social⠀change:⠀a⠀changed⠀status,⠀a⠀new⠀payment,⠀a⠀different⠀right,⠀a⠀memory⠀procedure,⠀a⠀suspended⠀work⠀obligation.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀speaker's⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀rule⠀in⠀their⠀habits⠀of⠀phrasing,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀exposition⠀block.⠀Let⠀the⠀same⠀term⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀emotional⠀weight⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀learns⠀or⠀remembers⠀something⠀within⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀self-correction⠀and⠀unstable⠀self-presentation⠀inside⠀the⠀inner⠀voice.⠀A⠀thought⠀may⠀begin⠀as⠀a⠀sentence⠀addressed⠀to⠀an⠀official,⠀falter⠀into⠀a⠀question,⠀then⠀rewrite⠀itself⠀to⠀avoid⠀an⠀admission.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀catch⠀itself⠀using⠀a⠀word⠀that⠀would⠀reveal⠀too⠀much,⠀and⠀the⠀revision⠀can⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀would⠀prefer⠀not⠀to⠀think⠀about.⠀Keep⠀the⠀self-correction⠀a⠀natural⠀mental⠀movement,⠀not⠀an⠀obligatory⠀tic⠀at⠀every⠀turn.⠀No⠀other⠀character⠀should⠀gain⠀access⠀to⠀this⠀private⠀phrase-repair⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀stream⠀oriented:⠀memories⠀are⠀memories,⠀sensory⠀input⠀is⠀present,⠀and⠀imagined⠀future⠀consequences⠀are⠀not⠀happening.⠀A⠀change⠀from⠀direct⠀perception⠀to⠀recollection⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀without⠀placing⠀a⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀sentence.⠀If⠀the⠀mind⠀drifts,⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀marked⠀by⠀speech,⠀a⠀voice,⠀an⠀object⠀turned⠀over,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀resumed.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀thought⠀is⠀still⠀unfinished,⠀on⠀a⠀revised⠀phrase,⠀on⠀a⠀decision⠀not⠀to⠀speak,⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀small⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀rule⠀now⠀applied⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal;⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding⠀may⠀be⠀quiet.⠀Let⠀the⠀speculative⠀premise⠀remain⠀a⠀social⠀and⠀personal⠀weight⠀carried⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀own⠀language,⠀not⠀an⠀external⠀puzzle⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀solved⠀before⠀the⠀reply⠀can⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanataz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀chat⠀or⠀message⠀transcript.⠀Give⠀each⠀message⠀a⠀clear⠀sender⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀facts⠀that⠀change⠀the⠀interaction:⠀a⠀meaningful⠀delay,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀matters,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀that⠀affects⠀behavior,⠀a⠀channel⠀change,⠀a⠀quoted⠀message,⠀or⠀an⠀attachment.⠀Use⠀timestamps⠀when⠀the⠀timing⠀affects⠀meaning,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration.⠀Keep⠀the⠀transcript⠀readable⠀as⠀lines,⠀but⠀include⠀ordinary⠀typed⠀habits⠀such⠀as⠀abrupt⠀spacing,⠀omitted⠀punctuation,⠀or⠀a⠀sender⠀who⠀writes⠀in⠀full⠀sentences.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀emoji⠀as⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀actual⠀choice.\n\nLet⠀senders⠀speak⠀with⠀different⠀verbal⠀habits⠀and⠀different⠀stakes.⠀The⠀speculative⠀premise⠀shapes⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀negotiating:⠀a⠀documented⠀exemption,⠀a⠀repayment⠀schedule⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀rule,⠀a⠀request⠀to⠀be⠀added⠀to⠀a⠀data-restricted⠀memory,⠀a⠀dispute⠀over⠀whether⠀a⠀service⠀applies⠀to⠀an⠀altered⠀body⠀or⠀residence,⠀a⠀demand⠀to⠀use⠀an⠀official⠀label.⠀The⠀negotiation⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀word-level⠀moves.⠀One⠀person⠀proposes⠀a⠀phrase;⠀another⠀objects⠀that⠀it⠀covers⠀the⠀wrong⠀case;⠀a⠀third⠀revises⠀it⠀to⠀exclude⠀an⠀implication.⠀The⠀transcript⠀should⠀show⠀people⠀who⠀know⠀the⠀institutional⠀terms⠀from⠀jobs⠀or⠀previous⠀experience⠀and⠀people⠀who⠀half-understand⠀them⠀but⠀are⠀careful.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀sender⠀a⠀polished⠀punster.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chat⠀medium⠀to⠀render⠀self-correction⠀and⠀unstable⠀presentation⠀through⠀the⠀mechanics⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀format.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀type⠀a⠀complete⠀demand,⠀then⠀send⠀only⠀the⠀polite⠀version;⠀another⠀may⠀edit⠀a⠀message⠀after⠀a⠀reaction⠀arrives;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀abandon⠀an⠀entire⠀thread⠀and⠀answer⠀a⠀different⠀question.⠀Show⠀unsent⠀drafts⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀presentation⠀explicitly⠀includes⠀them,⠀and⠀keep⠀them⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀Private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀chat⠀line⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀has⠀provided⠀a⠀separate⠀mental⠀channel.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀types⠀and⠀deletes,⠀the⠀deletion⠀is⠀an⠀action;⠀the⠀unwritten⠀words⠀remain⠀unwritten⠀unless⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀later⠀displayed.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀speculative⠀change⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀choices⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀adding⠀a⠀policy⠀caption.⠀A⠀rule⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀delayed⠀reply⠀into⠀evidence⠀of⠀refusal,⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀message⠀legally⠀relevant,⠀or⠀turn⠀a⠀changed⠀word⠀into⠀a⠀new⠀claim.⠀The⠀transcript⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀the⠀relevant⠀words⠀have⠀been⠀sent,⠀after⠀someone⠀leaves⠀the⠀channel,⠀after⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀abandoned,⠀or⠀on⠀a⠀read⠀state⠀with⠀no⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution⠀of⠀the⠀underlying⠀speculative⠀problem;⠀the⠀chat⠀can⠀record⠀one⠀exchange⠀of⠀the⠀ongoing⠀negotiation.⠀A⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point⠀is⠀already⠀present⠀when⠀a⠀decision,⠀request,⠀or⠀refusal⠀has⠀been⠀transmitted⠀and⠀its⠀receipt⠀or⠀dismissal⠀is⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPanatba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Science⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Nisio⠀Isin⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀scene⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀visual⠀novel:⠀a⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀block⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀location⠀and⠀its⠀relevant⠀background⠀elements,⠀then⠀clea